(1, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Caption:**\n\"Get ready to slay this Halloween with Roddies Fashion! Our latest collection is all about embracing your inner tomboy with a touch of glamour. Just like our stunning Barbie doll, who\'s rocking a bold look with a tiara and a stylish handbag. Whether you\'re heading to a spooky party or just running errands, our outfits will make you feel confident and fierce. #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #TomboyChic #GlamourMeetsEdge #FashionTrends #TrendingNow\"\n\n**Image:** \n[Generate an image of a Barbie doll with light golden hair, wearing a tomboy-inspired outfit with a tiara, holding a handbag and iPhone, and standing in front of a sleek, stylish car. The background can be a dark or bold color to give it a Halloween vibe.]\n\n**Additional Tips:**\n\n* Use relevant and trending hashtags to increase the post\'s visibility.\n* Tag relevant fashion influencers or bloggers to collaborate and expand the reach.\n* Consider running a contest or giveaway to encourage engagement and drive sales.\n* Make sure to include a call-to-action, such as \"Shop Now\" or \"Learn More,\" to direct users to the website or online store.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Generate an image of a Barbie doll in a tom boy look, holding a handbag and iPhone, with light golden hair and a tiara. A stylish car is parked in the background, completing the glamorous look.\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Generate an image of a Barbie doll in a tom boy look, holding a handbag and iPhone, with light golden hair and a tiara. A stylish car is parked in the background, completing the glamorous look.', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Generate_an_image_of_a_Barbie_doll_in_a_tom_boy_look%2C_holding_a_handbag_and_iPhone%2C_with_light_golden_hair_and_a_tiara._A_stylish_car_is_parked_in_the_background%2C_completing_the_glamorous_look.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-07 12:17:24', '2025-11-07 12:17:24'),
(2, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Caption:**\n\"Get ready to slay this Halloween with Roddies Fashion! Our Barbie doll is rocking a tomboy chic look, complete with a stylish handbag, iPhone, and a touch of glamour with her tiara. The perfect blend of edgy and elegant, just like our latest collection. Shop with us and make a statement this spooky season! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #TomboyChic #GlamourMeetsEdge #FashionForward #TrendingNow\"\n\n**Image:** \n[Generated image of a Barbie doll in a tomboy look, holding a handbag and iPhone, with light golden hair and a tiara. A stylish car is parked in the background, completing the glamorous look.]\n\nThis post aims to showcase the brand\'s style and aesthetic, while also highlighting the unique blend of edgy and elegant fashion that Roddies Fashion offers. The use of a Barbie doll as a model adds a touch of playfulness and creativity to the post, while the stylish car in the background adds to the overall glamour and sophistication of the image. The hashtags #HalloweenVibes and #TrendingNow help to tie the post to the current season and trends, while #RoddiesFashion and #FashionForward help to establish the brand\'s identity and voice.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Generate an image of a Barbie doll in a tom boy look, holding a handbag and iPhone, with light golden hair and a tiara. A stylish car is parked in the background, completing the glamorous look.\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Generate an image of a Barbie doll in a tom boy look, holding a handbag and iPhone, with light golden hair and a tiara. A stylish car is parked in the background, completing the glamorous look.', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Generate_an_image_of_a_Barbie_doll_in_a_tom_boy_look%2C_holding_a_handbag_and_iPhone%2C_with_light_golden_hair_and_a_tiara._A_stylish_car_is_parked_in_the_background%2C_completing_the_glamorous_look.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-07 12:18:16', '2025-11-07 12:18:16'),
