(8, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a possible post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Caption:** \"Slaying the streets of luxury, even on All Hallows\' Eve! This Halloween, dare to be a vision of glamour and sophistication with Roddies Fashion. Our stunning rose-gold dress, crystal heels, and designer handbag are the perfect combination to make you the belle of the ball. #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenGlam #LuxuryFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForward #GlamourAndSophistication\"\n\n**Image:** A high-quality image of a Barbie girl standing confidently in a luxurious pink-themed city street, wearing a shimmering rose-gold dress with crystal heels, holding a designer handbag and phone, with long wavy platinum-blonde hair flowing in the wind, sparkling blue eyes, and a soft glam makeup look.\n\n**Hashtags:** #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenGlam #LuxuryFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForward #GlamourAndSophistication #HalloweenFashion #BarbieGirl #RoseGold #CrystalHeels #DesignerHandbag #Glamourous #Sophisticated #Fashionista #StyleInspo\n\nThis post aims to showcase the brand\'s luxurious and glamorous aesthetic, while also highlighting the perfect outfit for a sophisticated Halloween look. The use of relevant hashtags will help increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Barbie girl standing confidently in a luxurious pink-themed city street, wearing a shimmering rose-gold dress with crystal heels, holding a designer handbag and phone, long wavy platinum-blonde hair flowing in the wind, sparkling blue eyes, soft glam \nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Barbie girl standing confidently in a luxurious pink-themed city street, wearing a shimmering rose-gold dress with crystal heels, holding a designer handbag and phone, long wavy platinum-blonde hair flowing in the wind, sparkling blue eyes, soft glam ', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Barbie_girl_standing_confidently_in_a_luxurious_pink-themed_city_street%2C_wearing_a_shimmering_rose-gold_dress_with_crystal_heels%2C_holding_a_designer_handbag_and_phone%2C_long_wavy_platinum-blonde_hair_flowing_in_the_wind%2C_sparkling_blue_eyes%2C_soft_glam?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 07:19:52', '2025-11-08 07:19:52'),
(9, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a possible post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Caption:** \"Slaying the streets of luxury this Halloween! Introducing our newest collection, where elegance meets sophistication. Our Barbie girl is rocking a stunning rose-gold dress, complete with crystal heels and a designer handbag. Get ready to turn heads with Roddies Fashion! #HalloweenVibes #LuxuryFashion #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForward #BarbieGirl #RoseGoldGlamour\"\n\n**Image:** A high-quality image of a Barbie girl standing confidently in a luxurious, pink-themed city street, wearing a shimmering rose-gold dress with crystal heels, holding a designer handbag and phone, with long wavy platinum-blonde hair flowing in the wind, and sparkling blue eyes.\n\n**Post Style:** Professional and stylish, with a touch of glamour and sophistication. The tone is confident and fashionable, perfect for a high-end fashion brand like Roddies Fashion.\n\n**Hashtags:** #HalloweenVibes, #LuxuryFashion, #RoddiesFashion, #TrendingNow, #FashionForward, #BarbieGirl, #RoseGoldGlamour. These hashtags will help the post reach a wider audience interested in fashion, luxury, and Halloween.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Barbie girl standing confidently in a luxurious full dressesd pink-themed city street, wearing a shimmering rose-gold dress with crystal heels, holding a designer handbag and phone, long wavy platinum-blonde hair flowing in the wind, sparkling blue eyes,\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Barbie girl standing confidently in a luxurious full dressesd pink-themed city street, wearing a shimmering rose-gold dress with crystal heels, holding a designer handbag and phone, long wavy platinum-blonde hair flowing in the wind, sparkling blue eyes,', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Barbie_girl_standing_confidently_in_a_luxurious_full_dressesd_pink-themed_city_street%2C_wearing_a_shimmering_rose-gold_dress_with_crystal_heels%2C_holding_a_designer_handbag_and_phone%2C_long_wavy_platinum-blonde_hair_flowing_in_the_wind%2C_sparkling_blue_eyes%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 08:26:45', '2025-11-08 08:26:45'),
(10, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Caption:**\n\"Get ready to slay this Halloween with Roddies Fashion! Our luxurious, full-length dresses are perfect for making a statement at any spooky soiree. Channel your inner Barbie girl and own the night with confidence and style. #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #LuxuryFashion #BarbieGirl #ConfidenceIsKey #TrendingNow\"\n\n**Image:** A high-quality image of a Barbie girl standing confidently in a luxurious, full-length dress that covers her from neck to leg. The dress could be in a bold, Halloween-inspired color such as black, red, or purple, and could feature intricate details such as lace, ruffles, or sequins.\n\n**Additional Details:**\nTo make the post more engaging, you could add some additional details such as:\n\n* A call-to-action, such as \"Shop now and get 15% off your Halloween dress!\"\n* A mention of the dress\'s features, such as \"Made from high-quality silk and featuring a dramatic train\"\n* A nod to the brand\'s values, such as \"At Roddies Fashion, we believe that every woman deserves to feel like a Barbie girl on Halloween\"\n\n**Hashtags:**\nTo reach a wider audience, you could use a mix of niche and broad hashtags, such as:\n\n* #HalloweenFashion\n* #LuxuryDresses\n* #BarbieGirlStyle\n* #ConfidenceIsKey\n* #TrendingNow\n* #FashionInspo\n* #HalloweenVibes\n\nNote: The hashtags can be adjusted based on the brand\'s specific target audience and goals.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Barbie girl standing confidently in a luxurious full dressesd from neg to leg\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Barbie girl standing confidently in a luxurious full dressesd from neg to leg', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Barbie_girl_standing_confidently_in_a_luxurious_full_dressesd_from_neg_to_leg?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 08:27:30', '2025-11-08 08:27:30'),
(11, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a possible post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Post:**\n\"Get ready to cast a spell this Halloween with Roddies Fashion!\nIntroducing our enchanting Barbie doll, dressed to impress in a stunning pink gown that\'s sure to turn heads. With sparkling details, soft golden curls, and a silver tiara, this look is nothing short of magical.\nComplete the look with diamond earrings and matching high heels, and you\'ll be the belle of the ball. Whether you\'re attending a spooky soiree or just want to add a touch of glamour to your Halloween celebrations, Roddies Fashion has got you covered.\n#HalloweenFashion #RoddiesFashion #BarbieStyle #PinkGown #TiarasAndTemptation #FashionForHalloween #TrendingNow\"\n\n**Caption:** \"Spooky chic has never looked so good! Roddies Fashion presents a magical Halloween look that\'s sure to enchant #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenInspo\"\n\nThis post aims to showcase the brand\'s creative and elegant take on Halloween fashion, while also highlighting the attention to detail and high-quality style that Roddies Fashion is known for. The use of relevant hashtags such as #HalloweenFashion and #TrendingNow aims to increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: A beautiful Barbie doll standing gracefully, wearing a full elegant pink gown with sparkling details, soft golden hair styled in curls, wearing a silver tiara, diamond earrings, and matching high heels.\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A beautiful Barbie doll standing gracefully, wearing a full elegant pink gown with sparkling details, soft golden hair styled in curls, wearing a silver tiara, diamond earrings, and matching high heels.', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_beautiful_Barbie_doll_standing_gracefully%2C_wearing_a_full_elegant_pink_gown_with_sparkling_details%2C_soft_golden_hair_styled_in_curls%2C_wearing_a_silver_tiara%2C_diamond_earrings%2C_and_matching_high_heels.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 08:32:33', '2025-11-08 08:32:33'),
(12, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Post:**\n\"Get ready for a spook-tacular Halloween with Roddies Fashion! \n\nAs Ben 10 would say, \"It\'s hero time!\" and we\'re here to save the day with our trendy and comfortable clothing. \n\nThis Halloween, dress up in style with our latest collection, featuring bold designs and vibrant colors. From superhero-inspired outfits to creepy-crawly accessories, we\'ve got you covered. \n\nSo, put on your best Ben 10 costume and join us for a howling good time! \n\n**Caption:** \"Unleash your inner hero this Halloween with Roddies Fashion! #HalloweenVibes #RoddiesFashion #Ben10 #TrendingNow #FashionForAll #SpookyStyle\"\n\n**Image:** A Ben 10-themed image with a model wearing a Roddies Fashion outfit, surrounded by Halloween-themed accessories and decorations.\n\n**Hashtags:** #HalloweenVibes #RoddiesFashion #Ben10 #TrendingNow #FashionForAll #SpookyStyle\n\nThis post aims to capture the spirit of Halloween while showcasing Roddies Fashion\'s latest collection. The use of a popular cartoon character like Ben 10 adds a fun and playful touch, while the hashtags help increase the post\'s discoverability on Facebook.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Ben 10 image create\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ben 10 image create', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Ben_10_image_create?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 08:54:12', '2025-11-08 08:54:12'),
(13, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Caption:**\n\"Get ready for a spook-tacular Halloween with Roddies Fashion! Our new collection is out of this world, just like Ben 10! Stay stylish and brave this Halloween with our trendy outfits. #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #TrendingNow #Ben10Style #FashionForAll\"\n\n**Image:** A Ben 10-themed image with a model wearing a Roddies Fashion outfit, standing in front of a Halloween-themed background with spider webs, jack-o-lanterns, and other spooky decorations.\n\n**Post Details:**\n\n* Platform: Facebook\n* Business/Creator: Roddies Fashion\n* Description: Roddies Fashion presents its new collection for Halloween, inspired by the popular cartoon character Ben 10.\n* Hashtags: #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #TrendingNow #Ben10Style #FashionForAll\n* Image Style: Ben 10-themed image with a model wearing a Roddies Fashion outfit.\n* Festival/Event: Halloween\n\nThis post aims to showcase Roddies Fashion\'s new collection in a fun and creative way, while also highlighting the brand\'s professional and trendy voice. The use of relevant hashtags and a eye-catching image will help increase engagement and attract new followers on Facebook.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Ben 10 image create\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ben 10 image create', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Ben_10_image_create?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 09:00:48', '2025-11-08 09:00:48'),
(14, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Caption:**\n\"Get ready for a spook-tacular Halloween with Roddies Fashion! Our latest collection is out of this world, just like Ben 10\'s alien adventures! Stay stylish and brave this Halloween with our trendy outfits. #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #TrendingNow #Ben10Inspired #FashionForAll\"\n\n**Image:** A creative illustration of Ben 10 in a stylish outfit, with a Halloween-themed background, complete with jack-o-lanterns, spider webs, and other spooky elements.\n\n**Post:**\n\"Happy Halloween from Roddies Fashion!\nAs the spooky season approaches, we\'re excited to unveil our latest collection, inspired by the brave and adventurous spirit of Ben 10. From statement pieces to everyday essentials, our outfits are designed to make you feel confident and stylish, whether you\'re trick-or-treating or attending a Halloween party.\nBrowse our collection now and get ready to make a fashion statement this Halloween! #HalloweenFashion #RoddiesFashion #Trending #Ben10\"\n\nThis post aims to showcase Roddies Fashion\'s creative and professional side, while also highlighting the excitement and fun of the Halloween season. The use of relevant hashtags and a catchy image style will help attract attention and engagement on Facebook.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Ben 10 image create\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ben 10 image create', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Ben_10_image_create?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 10:36:50', '2025-11-08 10:36:50'),
(15, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Caption:**\n\"Get ready to slay this Halloween with our stunning red and white ombre formal dress! Our latest collection is perfect for making a statement at any spooky soiree. Shop now and experience the thrill of dressing up in style! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #TrendingNow #FashionForward #RedAndWhiteOmbre #FormalDress #WomenInFashion\"\n\n**Image:** A high-quality image of a woman wearing a red and white ombre formal dress, posing in a dramatic and spooky setting to match the Halloween theme. The dress should be the focal point, with the woman striking a confident and stylish pose.\n\n**Additional Details:**\n\n* Post Type: Photo post\n* Target Audience: Women aged 25-45 interested in fashion and style\n* Call-to-Action (CTA): \"Shop now\" to drive traffic to the Roddies Fashion website or online store\n* Tone: Professional and stylish, with a hint of spooky flair for the Halloween theme\n\nThis post aims to showcase the Roddies Fashion brand as a go-to destination for stylish and trendy clothing, while also incorporating the Halloween theme in a creative and attention-grabbing way. The use of relevant hashtags will help increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Red and whit ombo formal dress women dress and woemn show\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Red and whit ombo formal dress women dress and woemn show', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Red_and_whit_ombo_formal_dress_women_dress_and_woemn_show?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 10:37:29', '2025-11-08 10:37:29'),
(16, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Caption:** \"Blooming into the spooky season with style! This Halloween, let Roddies Fashion help you grow your wardrobe with our latest collection. Just like a flower blooms in its pot, our clothes will make you flourish with confidence and elegance. #HalloweenFashion #RoddiesFashion #FlowerPower #TrendingNow #FashionForward\"\n\n**Image:** A beautiful flower pot with a stunning flower blooming out of it, placed on a table or shelf with a Halloween-themed background, such as a black tablecloth with fake spider webs or a pumpkin. The flower pot and flower can be decorated with subtle Halloween elements, such as a tiny witch\'s hat or a bat-shaped planter.\n\n**Description:** Get ready to make a statement this Halloween with Roddies Fashion\'s latest collection. Our clothes are designed to make you feel confident, elegant, and stylish, just like a beautiful flower blooming in its pot. Whether you\'re attending a party or just want to elevate your everyday look, we\'ve got you covered. Browse our collection now and discover the perfect outfit for the spookiest night of the year!\n\n**Hashtags:** #HalloweenFashion #RoddiesFashion #FlowerPower #TrendingNow #FashionForward #HalloweenStyle #SpookyChic #FashionInspo #StyleGuide\n\nThis post aims to showcase Roddies Fashion\'s professional brand voice while incorporating the required elements, including the flower pot image, Halloween theme, and trending hashtags. The caption and description are designed to be engaging, informative, and stylish, making it perfect for the Facebook platform.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Flower Pot images with flower\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Flower Pot images with flower', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_Pot_images_with_flower?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 10:38:19', '2025-11-08 10:38:19'),
(17, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Caption:** \"Blooming into the spookiest season of the year! As Halloween approaches, we\'re inspired by the beauty of nature and the thrill of the unknown. Just like a delicate flower blooms in the darkest of nights, our latest collection is designed to help you unleash your inner darkness and shine. #HalloweenVibes #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionMeetsNature\"\n\n**Image:** A picturesque flower pot with a mix of dark-colored flowers (such as black roses or dark red tulips) and a few white flowers, set against a dimly lit or spooky background to match the Halloween theme.\n\n**Description:** \"Get ready to make a statement this Halloween with Roddies Fashion\'s latest collection. From dark florals to bold accessories, we\'ve got everything you need to create a look that\'s both spooky and chic. Shop now and let the beauty of the night inspire your wardrobe! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenFashion #Trending\"\n\nThis post combines the brand\'s professional voice with a touch of creativity and playfulness, while incorporating the required elements of flower pot images, Halloween theme, and trending hashtags.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Flower Pot images with flower\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Flower Pot images with flower', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_Pot_images_with_flower?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 11:02:00', '2025-11-08 11:02:00'),
(18, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here are a few post ideas for Roddies Fashion on Facebook for the Halloween season:\n\n**Post 1**\nGet ready to slay this Halloween with our spook-tacular footwear collection!\nImage: A pair of black ankle boots with silver buckles in the shape of bats\nCaption: \"Step into the darkness with our Limited Edition Halloween boots! #HalloweenVibes #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenFashion #FootwearLovers #RoddiesFashion\n\n**Post 2**\nAdd a touch of magic to your Halloween look with our enchanting footwear!\nImage: A pair of purple heeled sandals with glittery straps\nCaption: \"Cast a spell with our bewitching heels! Perfect for a night out with friends or a spooky soiree #HalloweenNight #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenInspo #FootwearMagic #RoddiesFashion\n\n**Post 3**\nStay boo-tiful this Halloween with our comfortable and stylish footwear!\nImage: A pair of black and orange sneakers with a jack-o\'-lantern design\nCaption: \"Trick or treat yourself to a new pair of shoes! Our Halloween collection has got you covered #HalloweenFun #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenSneakers #ComfortableFootwear #RoddiesFashion\n\n**Post 4**\nMake a statement this Halloween with our bold and daring footwear!\nImage: A pair of red knee-high boots with a spider web design\nCaption: \"Unleash your inner vampire with our bold and daring boots! Perfect for a Halloween party or a night out with friends #HalloweenParty #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenFashionStatement #FootwearLovers #RoddiesFashion\n\n**Post 5**\nComplete your Halloween look with our spooky-chic footwear!\nImage: A pair of black heeled sandals with a ghostly design\nCaption: \"Ghostly glamour is just a step away! Get your hands on our Limited Edition Halloween heels #HalloweenChic #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenGlam #FootwearObsessed #RoddiesFashio