(19, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Post:** Get ready to slay this Halloween in style with our spook-tacular footwear collection!\n\n**Image:** A pair of black ankle boots with a spider web design and a pair of statement earrings in the shape of miniature pumpkins.\n\n**Caption:** \"Step into the night with our hauntingly beautiful footwear collection. From eerie ankle boots to wicked wedges, we\'ve got the perfect shoes to complement your Halloween costume. Shop now and make a killer statement! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #FootwearFrenzy #TrendingNow #SpookyStyle\"\n\n**Hashtags:** #HalloweenFashion #FootwearLovers #RoddiesFashion #Trending #SpookySeason\n\nThis post showcases a different image of girls\' footwear, highlighting the brand\'s Halloween-themed collection. The caption is professional and inviting, with a touch of playfulness to match the festive spirit. The hashtags are a mix of trending and niche-specific tags to reach a wider audience.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: girls footwear- post different image in every post.\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'girls footwear- post different image in every post.', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girls_footwear-_post_different_image_in_every_post.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 12:18:45', '2025-11-08 12:18:45'),
(20, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here are a few post ideas for Roddies Fashion on Facebook for Halloween:\n\n**Post 1**\nCaption: \"Step into the spooky season with our bewitching boots! Get ready to cast a spell with our latest collection of girls\' footwear. Perfect for trick-or-treating or a monster mash party! #HalloweenVibes #GirlsFootwear #RoddiesFashion #Trending\"\nImage: A pair of black boots with orange laces and a spider web design on the side.\n\n**Post 2**\nCaption: \"Sole-mates for the spooky season! Our ghostly ghoul shoes are a must-have for any little monster\'s Halloween costume. Shop now and get ready to haunt the night! #HalloweenCostume #GirlsShoes #RoddiesFashion #Trending\"\nImage: A pair of white shoes with glow-in-the-dark ghostly designs and black laces.\n\n**Post 3**\nCaption: \"Pumpkin spice and everything nice! Our autumn-inspired shoes are perfect for the Halloween season. Treat your little one to a pair of our cozy and comfortable footwear. #HalloweenFashion #GirlsFootwear #RoddiesFashion #Trending\"\nImage: A pair of brown shoes with a pumpkin design on the toe and orange laces.\n\n**Post 4**\nCaption: \"Get ready for a howling good time with our wolf-inspired shoes! Our latest collection of girls\' footwear is perfect for the spooky season. Shop now and let the wild side out! #HalloweenShoes #GirlsFootwear #RoddiesFashion #Trending\"\nImage: A pair of gray shoes with a wolf design on the side and black laces.\n\n**Post 5**\nCaption: \"Cast a spell with our magical shoes! Our Halloween collection of girls\' footwear is filled with enchanting designs and comfortable fits. Shop now and make this Halloween one to remember! #HalloweenMagic #GirlsShoes #RoddiesFashion #Trending\"\nImage: A pair of purple shoes with a witch\'s hat design on the toe and black laces.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: girls footwear- post different image in every post.\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'girls footwear- post different image in every post.', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girls_footwear-_post_different_image_in_every_post.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 12:20:04', '2025-11-08 12:20:04'),
(21, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Post 1**\nImage: A pair of black boots with silver buckles, perfect for a Halloween night out.\nCaption: \"Get ready to slay the night away with our spook-tacular footwear collection! This Halloween, step out in style with our black boots featuring silver buckles. #HalloweenVibes #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenFashion #FootwearLovers #RoddiesFashion\n\n**Post 2**\nImage: A pair of orange ankle boots with black lace, adding a pop of color to any Halloween outfit.\nCaption: \"Add a burst of color to your Halloween look with our vibrant orange ankle boots! Featuring black lace details, these boots are sure to make a statement. #HalloweenStyle #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenShoes #FashionForward #RoddiesFashion\n\n**Post 3**\nImage: A pair of purple sneakers with silver studs, perfect for a casual Halloween gathering.\nCaption: \"Get ready to trick-or-treat in style with our purple sneakers featuring silver studs! Comfortable and stylish, these sneakers are perfect for a night out with friends. #HalloweenNight #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenSneakers #SneakerLove #RoddiesFashion\n\n**Post 4**\nImage: A pair of black heels with spider web details, adding a touch of elegance to any Halloween outfit.\nCaption: \"Elevate your Halloween look with our black heels featuring spider web details! Perfect for a night out at a Halloween party, these heels are sure to turn heads. #HalloweenElegance #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenHeels #HighHeels #RoddiesFashion\n\n**Post 5**\nImage: A pair of brown boots with bat-shaped buckles, adding a fun touch to any Halloween outfit.\nCaption: \"Fly into the night with our brown boots featuring bat-shaped buckles! Perfect for a fun and spooky Halloween look, these boots are sure to delight. #HalloweenFun #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFoo