ok\nCaption: \"Make a hauntingly beautiful statement with our ghostly sandals this Halloween! At Roddies Fashion, we\'re all about creating unique and stylish designs that will make you stand out from the crowd. Shop now and get ready to shine! #HalloweenSandals #RoddiesFashion #GhostlyGlamour #TrendingNow\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenGlam #SandalsLovers #FashionInspo', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: girls footwear- Generate post different image in every Generate post.\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'girls footwear- Generate post different image in every Generate post.', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girls_footwear-_Generate_post_different_image_in_every_Generate_post.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-08 12:54:26', '2025-11-08 12:54:26');
