(23, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a social media post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Post 1**\nGet ready to slay this Halloween with our spook-tacular footwear collection!\nImage: A pair of black boots with silver buckles, adorned with fake spider webs and a witch\'s hat in the background.\nCaption: \"Step into the darkness with our bewitching boots! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenFashion #BootLove #SpookyChic\n\n**Post 2**\nAdd a touch of magic to your Halloween look with our enchanting sandals!\nImage: A pair of glittery silver sandals with a pair of fake wings and a wand in the background.\nCaption: \"Cast a spell with our mesmerizing sandals! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenMagic #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenInspo #SandalsLove #FashionableWitch\n\n**Post 3**\nMake a statement this Halloween with our bold and eerie sneakers!\nImage: A pair of black and orange sneakers with a spider design on the side, paired with a fake spider web and a pumpkin in the background.\nCaption: \"Sneak into the night with our spooky sneakers! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenSneaks #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenKicks #SneakerLove #SpookySquad\n\n**Post 4**\nElevate your Halloween style with our hauntingly beautiful heels!\nImage: A pair of black heels with a pair of fake fangs and a vampire cape in the background.\nCaption: \"Sink your teeth into fashion with our vampy heels! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenHeels #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenGlam #HeelLove #VampireVibes\n\n**Post 5**\nComplete your Halloween look with our creepy-cute ankle boots!\nImage: A pair of brown ankle boots with a pair of fake monster eyes and a mummy wrap in the background.\nCaption: \"Wrap up your Halloween style with our adorable ankle boots! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenBoots #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenBooties #AnkleBootLove #MummyChic', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: girls footwear- Generate post different image in every Generate post.\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'girls footwear- Generate post different image in every Generate post.', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girls_footwear-_Generate_post_different_image_in_every_Generate_post.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-10 04:46:11', '2025-11-10 04:46:11'),
(24, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Post 1**\nImage: A pair of black ankle boots with silver buckles, adorned with spider web designs and a pair of fake spiders on the toes.\nCaption: \"Get ready to slay the night with our spook-tacular footwear collection! This Halloween, step out in style with our limited edition boots. #HalloweenVibes #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenFashion #BootsLover #Fashionista\n\n**Post 2**\nImage: A pair of orange and black sneakers with glow-in-the-dark laces and a pair of witch hats on the sides.\nCaption: \"Cast a spell with our enchanting sneakers! Perfect for a night of trick-or-treating or a Halloween party, our sneakers are sure to make you stand out. #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenStyle #Trending #SneakerLove\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenSneakers #GirlsSneakers #FashionTrends\n\n**Post 3**\nImage: A pair of purple and black sandals with a pair of fake bats hanging from the ankle straps.\nCaption: \"Fly into the night with our hauntingly beautiful sandals! Our Halloween collection is here to make your fashion dreams come true. #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenFashion #Trending #SandalsLove\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenSandals #GirlsSandals #FashionMustHaves\n\n**Post 4**\nImage: A pair of black and red knee-high boots with a pair of fake skeletons on the sides.\nCaption: \"Step into the darkness with our bold and daring boots! This Halloween, make a statement with our unique and stylish footwear collection. #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenStyle #Trending #BootsLover\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenBoots #GirlsBoots #FashionTrends\n\n**Post 5**\nImage: A pair of silver and black stilettos with a pair of fake spiders on the heels.\nCaption: \"Add a touch of glamour to your Halloween look with our stunning stilettos! Our collection is designed to make you feel like a queen of the night. #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenFashion #Trending #StilettoLove\"\nHashtags: #HalloweenStilettos #GirlsStilettos #FashionMustHaves', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: girls footwear- Generate post different image in every Generate post.\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'girls footwear- Generate post different image in every Generate post.', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girls_footwear-_Generate_post_different_image_in_every_Generate_post.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-10 05:42:54', '2025-11-10 05:42:54'),
(25, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Title:** Get Ready for a Spooky Chic Halloween with Roddies Fashion!\n\n**Caption:**\n\"Happy Halloween from Roddies Fashion! As the spookiest night of the year approaches, we\'ve got you covered with our latest collection of eerie-chic outfits. From dark romance to bold statements, our designs will make you the belle of the monster mash. Treat yourself to a stylish Halloween with Roddies Fashion! #HalloweenVibes #SpookyChic #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForHalloween\"\n\n**Image:** A model dressed in a dark, elegant outfit with a touch of Halloween-inspired accessories, such as a rose-gold choker with a tiny pumpkin pendant, standing in front of a backdrop of roses with a subtle spider web design.\n\n**Hashtags:** #HalloweenFashion #RoddiesFashion #Trending #SpookyStyle #FashionForAll #RoseGold #HalloweenInspo\n\nThis post aims to showcase Roddies Fashion\'s Halloween collection while maintaining a professional tone and incorporating the required elements, including the rose image style and trending hashtags.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Rose \nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rose ', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Rose?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-10 05:43:23', '2025-11-10 05:43:23'),
(26, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Image:** A beautiful, high-quality image of a model wearing a stunning rose-colored outfit, with a subtle Halloween twist (e.g. a rose-gold witch\'s hat or a black rose choker). The image should be bright, colorful, and eye-catching.\n\n**Caption:**\n\"Get ready to slay this Halloween with Roddies Fashion! Our new collection is blooming with style and sophistication, featuring gorgeous rose-colored pieces that are perfect for the spookiest night of the year. From flowy dresses to statement accessories, we\'ve got you covered. Shop now and make a statement this Halloween! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenStyle #RoseGold #TrendingNow #FashionForward\"\n\n**Hashtags:**\n\n* #RoddiesFashion\n* #HalloweenStyle\n* #RoseGold\n* #TrendingNow\n* #FashionForward\n* #HalloweenFashion\n* #FallFashion\n* #AutumnVibes\n\nThis post aims to showcase Roddies Fashion\'s beautiful and stylish clothing, while also highlighting the brand\'s professional and trendy voice. The use of relevant hashtags will help increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience on Facebook.', '0', 1, 'Title: Roddies fashion\nDetails: Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\nDescription: Give me caption also\nPlatforms: Facebook\nBrand Voice: professional\nHashtags: Trending\nImage Style: Rose \nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rose ', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Rose?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, '2025-11-10 06:27:54', '2025-11-10 06:27:54');
