(16, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\r\n\r\n**Post 1**\r\nImage: A pair of black boots with silver buckles, perfect for a Halloween night out.\r\nCaption: \"Get ready to slay the night away with our spook-tacular footwear collection! This Halloween, step out in style with our black boots featuring silver buckles. #HalloweenVibes #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\r\nHashtags: #HalloweenFashion #FootwearLovers #RoddiesFashion\r\n\r\n**Post 2**\r\nImage: A pair of orange ankle boots with black lace, adding a pop of color to any Halloween outfit.\r\nCaption: \"Add a burst of color to your Halloween look with our vibrant orange ankle boots! Featuring black lace details, these boots are sure to make a statement. #HalloweenStyle #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\r\nHashtags: #HalloweenShoes #FashionForward #RoddiesFashion\r\n\r\n**Post 3**\r\nImage: A pair of purple sneakers with silver studs, perfect for a casual Halloween gathering.\r\nCaption: \"Get ready to trick-or-treat in style with our purple sneakers featuring silver studs! Comfortable and stylish, these sneakers are perfect for a night out with friends. #HalloweenNight #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\r\nHashtags: #HalloweenSneakers #SneakerLove #RoddiesFashion\r\n\r\n**Post 4**\r\nImage: A pair of black heels with spider web details, adding a touch of elegance to any Halloween outfit.\r\nCaption: \"Elevate your Halloween look with our black heels featuring spider web details! Perfect for a night out at a Halloween party, these heels are sure to turn heads. #HalloweenElegance #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\r\nHashtags: #HalloweenHeels #HighHeels #RoddiesFashion\r\n\r\n**Post 5**\r\nImage: A pair of brown boots with bat-shaped buckles, adding a fun touch to any Halloween outfit.\r\nCaption: \"Fly into the night with our brown boots featuring bat-shaped buckles! Perfect for a fun and spooky Halloween look, these boots are sure to delight. #HalloweenFun #RoddiesFashion #Trending #GirlsFootwear\"\r\nHashtags: #HalloweenBoots #BatWingBuckles #RoddiesFashion', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'draft', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Give me caption also\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nImage Style: girls footwear- Generate post different image in every Generate post.\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'girls footwear- Generate post different image in every Generate post.', 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girls_footwear-_Generate_post_different_image_in_every_Generate_post.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', NULL, '2025-11-08 12:53:46', '2025-11-08 12:53:46'),
