(22, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:07', 'Clothes! \n\nThere are so many different types of clothes, from casual wear to formal attire, and everything in between. Here are some categories:\n\n1. **Tops**: Shirts, blouses, sweaters, and jackets.\n2. **Bottoms**: Pants, shorts, skirts, and dresses.\n3. **Dresses**: Formal and informal dresses for women and men.\n4. **Outerwear**: Coats, jackets, and hats to keep you warm and dry.\n5. **Footwear**: Shoes, boots, sandals, and socks.\n6. **Accessories**: Scarves, belts, hats, and jewelry to add a personal touch.\n\nSome popular clothing styles include:\n\n1. **Streetwear**: Casual, comfortable clothing inspired by urban fashion.\n2. **Formal wear**: Suits, ties, and evening gowns for special occasions.\n3. **Activewear**: Clothing designed for sports and fitness activities.\n4. **Vintage**: Classic clothing from past decades, often with a nostalgic flair.\n5. **Sustainable fashion**: Eco-friendly clothing made from recycled or organic materials.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite type of clothing or style?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-10 06:37:00', '2025-11-10 06:37:08', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/black_jeans?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 1, '2025-11-10 06:37:08', '2025-11-10 06:37:08'),
(23, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:16', 'Clothes! \n\nClothes are a fundamental part of our daily lives, serving both functional and aesthetic purposes. They provide comfort, protection, and self-expression, while also reflecting our personal style, cultural background, and social status.\n\nHere are some interesting facts about clothes:\n\n1. **History of clothing**: The earliest known clothing dates back to around 70,000 BCE, with evidence of ancient civilizations using animal hides, furs, and woven fibers to create garments.\n2. **Types of clothing**: There are countless types of clothes, including casual wear, formal wear, activewear, outerwear, and more. Each type serves a specific purpose and is designed for a particular occasion or activity.\n3. **Fashion trends**: Clothing styles and trends change constantly, influenced by factors like season, culture, and celebrity endorsements. Some trends come and go, while others remain timeless and classic.\n4. **Sustainable fashion**: The clothing industry has a significant environmental impact, with fast fashion contributing to waste, pollution, and resource depletion. Sustainable fashion aims to reduce this impact by promoting eco-friendly materials, second-hand shopping, and responsible production practices.\n5. **Cultural significance**: Clothing can hold deep cultural and symbolic meaning, representing identity, status, and values. For example, traditional attire like kimonos, saris, or kilts often carry significant cultural and historical significance.\n\nWhat aspect of clothes would you like to explore further?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-10 06:46:00', '2025-11-10 06:46:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/black_shirt?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 1, '2025-11-10 06:46:10', '2025-11-10 06:46:10'),
(24, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:18', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Post:**\n\"Elevate your style with Roddies Fashion! Our latest collection is now available, featuring the latest trends and must-haves for the season. From statement pieces to wardrobe staples, we\'ve got you covered. Shop now and experience the art of fashion with us!\n\n**Caption:** New Arrivals Alert!\nDiscover the latest fashion trends and shop our newest collection now! #RoddiesFashion #Trending #FashionForward #NewArrivals #StyleInspo\"\n\nThis post aims to showcase the brand\'s professionalism while also highlighting the excitement of new arrivals and trending fashion. The hashtags #Trending, #FashionForward, and #StyleInspo are included to reach a wider audience interested in fashion and stay on top of the latest trends.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-10 06:48:00', '2025-11-10 06:48:01', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Rose?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 1, '2025-11-10 06:48:01', '2025-11-10 06:48:01'),
