(31, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:59', 'Here\'s a post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Post:**\n\"Elevate your style with Roddies Fashion! Our latest collection is now available, featuring sleek and sophisticated designs that will make you stand out from the crowd. From statement pieces to wardrobe staples, we\'ve got you covered. Shop now and experience the perfect blend of fashion and comfort! \n\n**Caption:** New Arrivals Alert!\nDiscover the latest trends and must-haves at Roddies Fashion. Follow us for exclusive updates, behind-the-scenes insights, and style tips!\n\n**Hashtags:** #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForward #StyleInspiration #NewArrivals #MustHaves #Fashionista #ShopNow\"\n\nThis post aims to showcase the brand\'s professional tone while highlighting the latest collection and encouraging customers to shop and follow the brand for updates. The hashtags used are a mix of branded and trending tags to increase visibility and reach a wider audience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-10 07:29:00', '2025-11-10 07:29:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Barbie_doll_wearing_an_elegant_Pink_full-sleeve_with_hair_band%2C_full-length_gown_with_a_sleek_silhouette%2C_soft_curls_in_her_hair%2C_subtle_makeup_with_glossy_lips%2C_standing_gracefully_in_a_modern_studio_background_with_soft_lighting_and_a_hint_of_sparkle.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 2, '2025-11-10 07:29:10', '2025-11-10 07:29:10'),
