(36, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\r\n\r\n**Post:** \"Get ready to catch the style this Halloween! At Roddies Fashion, we\'re celebrating the spookiest night of the year with a dash of Pokémon flair. Just like Pikachu, our new yellow-themed collection is electric and sure to brighten up your wardrobe. From statement pieces to everyday essentials, our designs are inspired by the iconic yellow Pokémon. Follow us for the latest fashion trends and stay ahead of the game! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #PokemonFashion #YellowYouReady #TrendingNow\"\r\n\r\n**Image:** A high-quality image of a model wearing a yellow outfit with Pokémon-inspired accessories, with a Halloween-themed background.\r\n\r\n**Hashtags:** #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenFashion #PokemonStyle #YellowFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForward #HalloweenVibes #StyleInspo #FashionTrends\r\n\r\nThis post aims to showcase Roddies Fashion\'s professional brand voice while incorporating the fun and playful theme of Halloween and Pokémon. The use of relevant hashtags will help increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: yellow pokemon caption\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-11-10 08:30:00', '2025-11-10 08:30:02', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '“A brand new Pokémon creature with a mix of dragon and fox features, glowing blue eyes, energy aura, detailed scales, and floating above a crystal lake, fantasy art style, ultra-detailed, cinematic lighting”.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1762763322/user_2_test-2/v6dfmq9m0jn3tlf1gpgs.jpg', NULL, 'pending', NULL, '2025-11-10 08:28:43', '2025-11-10 08:30:02'),
