(40, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:18', 'Here\'s a possible Facebook post for Roddies Fashion:\n\n**Post:** Brighten up your day with a hint of sunshine! Our new collection is inspired by the vibrant yellow of Pikachu, the beloved Pokémon. From statement pieces to everyday essentials, our designs are sure to electrify your wardrobe. Shop now and stay on-trend with Roddies Fashion! #Trending #PokemonInspired #YellowFashion #RoddiesFashion\n\n**Image:** A high-quality photo of a model wearing a yellow outfit, with a Pikachu plushie or graphic in the background to tie in with the Pokémon theme. The image should be bright, colorful, and eye-catching to grab the attention of Facebook users.\n\n**Call-to-Action (CTA):** Shop now and stay on-trend with Roddies Fashion! (link to the online store or website)\n\nThis post aims to capture the attention of Facebook users with a visually appealing image and a caption that\'s both fun and professional. The use of relevant hashtags like #Trending and #PokemonInspired can help increase the post\'s discoverability and reach a wider audience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-10 08:48:00', '2025-11-10 08:48:04', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 6, '2025-11-10 08:48:04', '2025-11-10 08:48:04'),
