(42, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', 'Here\'s a possible post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n\"Brighten up your wardrobe with a splash of sunshine! Just like the vibrant yellow of Pikachu, our new collection is sure to electrify your style. From statement pieces to everyday essentials, our designs are inspired by the bold and bright colors of the Pokémon world. Stay on-trend with Roddies Fashion and shop our latest collection now! #Trending #PokemonFashion #YellowYouReady #RoddiesFashion\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-10 09:08:00', '2025-11-10 09:08:04', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2025-11-10 09:08:04', '2025-11-10 09:08:04'),
