(47, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a potential post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\r\n\r\n**Post:** \"Get ready to catch the fashion spirit this Halloween! At Roddies Fashion, we\'re celebrating the spookiest night of the year with a burst of yellow Pikachu-inspired style! Our new collection features bright and bold pieces that are sure to make you stand out from the crowd. From statement-making dresses to stylish tops and bottoms, we\'ve got you covered. So, why wait? Shop now and join the fashion frenzy! #RoddiesFashion #HalloweenVibes #YellowPikachu #FashionTrending #SpookyChic\"\r\n\r\n**Image:** A photo of a model wearing a yellow Pikachu-inspired outfit, with a Halloween-themed background.\r\n\r\n**Hashtags:** #HalloweenFashion #PokemonFashion #RoddiesFashion #FashionForHalloween #YellowFashion #PikachuStyle\r\n\r\nThis post aims to capture the essence of Roddies Fashion\'s brand voice, which is professional and trendy. The use of relevant hashtags, such as #FashionTrending and #HalloweenVibes, can help increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience. The image of the model wearing a yellow Pikachu-inspired outfit adds a fun and playful touch to the post, while also showcasing the brand\'s fashion sense.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: yellow pokemon caption\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-11-10 09:32:00', '2025-11-10 09:33:02', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pokemon', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1762767120/user_2_test-2/s5trwmqqmkjlmaimo5zg.jpg', NULL, 'pending', NULL, '2025-11-10 09:32:01', '2025-11-10 09:33:02'),
