(60, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Here\'s a potential social media post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Post:** \n\"Stay ahead of the curve with Roddies Fashion! \nOur latest collection is here, featuring the most stylish and trendy pieces of the season. From statement dresses to sleek accessories, we\'ve got you covered. \nFollow us for the latest fashion updates and get ready to elevate your wardrobe! #Trending #FashionForward #RoddiesFashion\"\n\n**Image:** A high-quality photo of a model wearing a stylish outfit from Roddies Fashion\'s latest collection, with a clean and modern background.\n\n**Call-to-Action:** \"Shop Now\" or \"Learn More\" to drive traffic to the Roddies Fashion website or online store.\n\n**Tone:** Professional and sophisticated, with a touch of excitement and enthusiasm for the latest fashion trends.\n\nThis post aims to showcase Roddies Fashion\'s expertise in the fashion industry, while also encouraging engagement and driving sales. By using relevant hashtags like #Trending, we can increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience. Let me know if you\'d like me to make any changes!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-10 12:00:00', '2025-11-10 12:00:04', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_Pot_with_roses.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2025-11-10 12:00:04', '2025-11-10 12:00:04'),
(61, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'Here\'s a potential social media post for Roddies Fashion:\n\n**Post:** \"Elevate your style with the latest trends from Roddies Fashion! Our new collection is now available on our Facebook page. From statement pieces to wardrobe staples, we\'ve got you covered. Stay ahead of the fashion curve and shop with us today! #Trending #FashionForward #RoddiesFashion\"\n\n**Image:** A high-quality image of a model wearing a outfit from the new collection, with a clean and minimalist background to let the clothing be the focus.\n\n**Call-to-Action:** \"Shop Now\" or \"Learn More\" to drive traffic to the Facebook page or website.\n\n**Tone:** Professional and polished, with a focus on showcasing the brand\'s expertise in fashion.\n\n**Hashtags:** #Trending, #FashionForward, #RoddiesFashion to reach a wider audience and create a consistent brand identity.\n\nThis post aims to create a sense of excitement and urgency around the new collection, while also highlighting the brand\'s expertise and style. By using a professional tone and high-quality visuals, Roddies Fashion can establish itself as a trusted and fashionable brand on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-10 17:45:00', '2025-11-10 17:45:04', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_Pot_with_roses.?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2025-11-10 17:45:04', '2025-11-10 17:45:04'),
(62, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:49', 'Wooden craft, also known as woodcraft or woodworking, is a popular hobby and profession that involves creating decorative and functional items from wood. Here are some aspects of wooden craft:\n\n**Types of Wooden Craft:**\n\n1. **Wood Carving:** Carving decorative designs or figures into wood using hand tools or power tools.\n2. **Wood Turning:** Creating symmetrical objects, such as bowls or vases, using a lathe.\n3. **Woodworking:** Building furniture, cabinets, or other items using various woodworking techniques.\n4. **Wood Burning:** Creating designs or patterns on wood using a wood burning tool.\n5. **Wood Inlay:** Creating intricate designs by inserting small pieces of wood into a larger piece.\n\n**Wooden Craft Techniques:**\n\n1. **Cutting:** Using saws or other tools to cut wood into desired shapes and sizes.\n2. **Shaping:** Using planes, chisels, or other tools to shape wood into desired forms.\n3. **Assembling:** Joining multiple pieces of wood together using glue, nails, or other fasteners.\n4. **Finishing:** Applying stains, varnishes, or other finishes to protect and enhance the wood.\n\n**Wooden Craft Tools:**\n\n1. **Hand saws:** Used for cutting and shaping wood.\n2. **Power tools:** Such as table saws, miter saws, and drill presses, used for various woodworking tasks.\n3. **Chisels:** Used for removing small amounts of wood and creating joints.\n4. **Sandpaper:** Used for smoothing out wood surfaces.\n5. **Clamps:** Used for holding wood pieces together during gluing or joining.\n\n**Wooden Craft Projects:**\n\n1. **Furniture:** Building chairs, tables, beds, or other furniture pieces.\n2. **Decorative items:** Creating wall art, coasters, or other decorative items.\n3. **Toys:** Making wooden toys, such as cars, trains, or puzzles.\n4. **Outdoor items:** Building birdhouses, planters, or other outdoor decorative items.\n5. **Functional items:** Creating cutting boards, spoons, or other functional items for the kitchen or home.\n\n**Benefits of Wooden Craft:**\n\n1. **Relaxation:** Wooden craft can be a calming and meditative activity.\n2. **Creativity:** Wooden craft allows for creativity and self-expression.\n3. **Skill-building:** Wooden craft can help develop problem-solving and fine motor skills.\n4. **Satisfaction:** Creating something with your own hands can be very satisfying.\n5. **Connection to nature:** Working with wood can help you appreciate the natural world and the beauty of wood as a material.\n\nOverall, wooden craft is a rewarding and creative activity that can be enjoyed by people of all ages and skill levels. Whether you\'re a beginner or an experienced woodworker, there\'s always something new to learn and create in the world of wooden craft.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-10 17:49:00', '2025-11-10 17:49:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/wood_spoon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2025-11-10 17:49:18', '2025-11-10 17:49:18'),
