(69, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:36', 'Wood collection, also known as woodworking or wood gathering, involves gathering and processing wood for various purposes, such as:\n\n1. **Firewood**: Collecting wood for heating, cooking, or camping.\n2. **Woodworking**: Gathering wood for crafting, furniture making, or other wood-based projects.\n3. **Forestry**: Managing and harvesting wood from forests for timber, pulp, or other forest products.\n4. **Arboriculture**: Collecting wood from trees that have been pruned or removed, often for landscaping or urban forestry purposes.\n\nTypes of wood collection:\n\n1. **Deadwood collection**: Gathering dead or fallen trees, branches, or other wood debris.\n2. **Live wood collection**: Harvesting wood from living trees, often through sustainable forestry practices.\n3. **Driftwood collection**: Gathering wood that has washed up on beaches or riverbanks.\n\nTools and equipment used in wood collection:\n\n1. **Chainsaws**: For cutting and harvesting wood.\n2. **Axes**: For chopping and splitting wood.\n3. **Saws**: For cutting and pruning wood.\n4. **Gloves**: For protecting hands from splinters and other injuries.\n5. **Safety gear**: Such as hard hats, safety glasses, and ear protection.\n\nTips for wood collection:\n\n1. **Identify the type of wood**: Before collecting, identify the type of wood to ensure it\'s suitable for your intended use.\n2. **Check local regulations**: Familiarize yourself with local laws and regulations regarding wood collection.\n3. **Practice sustainable forestry**: If collecting wood from living trees, follow sustainable forestry practices to minimize environmental impact.\n4. **Use proper safety equipment**: Always wear protective gear when collecting and processing wood.\n5. **Store wood properly**: Keep collected wood dry and protected from the elements to maintain its quality.\n\nSome popular types of wood for collection:\n\n1. **Oak**: A durable and versatile wood, often used for furniture making and firewood.\n2. **Maple**: A hardwood often used for woodworking, flooring, and furniture making.\n3. **Pine**: A softwood commonly used for construction, furniture making, and firewood.\n4. **Cedar**: A rot-resistant wood often used for outdoor construction, decking, and fencing.\n5. **Cherry**: A hardwood prized for its rich color and fine grain, often used for furniture making and woodworking.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-11 14:36:00', '2025-11-11 14:36:02', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/table?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 11, '2025-11-11 14:36:02', '2025-11-11 14:36:02'),
(70, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here are 5 key points that describe the Roddies fashion concept for Barbie doll:\r\n\r\n1. **Elegant Pink Dress**: The Barbie doll is wearing a full-sleeve, elegant pink dress with subtle shimmer, giving it a touch of sophistication and glamour. The dress is designed to accentuate the doll\'s slender figure and create a sense of refinement.\r\n\r\n2. **Soft Golden Locks**: The Barbie doll\'s long, flowing hair is a soft golden color, adding a warm and sunny touch to the overall look. The hair is styled to cascade down the doll\'s back, creating a sense of movement and flow.\r\n\r\n3. **Delicate Tiara**: The doll is wearing a delicate tiara, adding a touch of royalty and whimsy to the overall look. The tiara is designed to complement the dress and hair, creating a sense of cohesion and elegance.\r\n\r\n4. **Dreamy Pastel Background**: The Barbie doll is standing in a dreamy pastel background, complete with sparkles and soft lighting. The background is designed to create a sense of fantasy and romance, drawing the viewer into a world of beauty and enchantment.\r\n\r\n5. **Cinematic Style**: The overall look is inspired by cinematic style, with a focus on creating a sense of drama and glamour. The combination of the elegant dress, soft golden hair, delicate tiara, and dreamy pastel background all come together to create a sense of luxury and sophistication, as if the Barbie doll is a star in a fairy tale or romantic film.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: m\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Flower Pot with roses.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1762857490/user_2_test-2/uvpb5vyol7l0l7pbrsg9.jpg', NULL, 'pending', NULL, '2025-11-11 16:08:11', '2025-11-11 16:08:11'),
(71, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'Here\'s a social media post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Post:**\n\"Stay ahead of the curve with the latest fashion trends at Roddies Fashion! Our new collection is now available, featuring stylish and modern pieces that are perfect for any occasion. From statement dresses to chic accessories, we\'ve got you covered. Shop with us today and experience the art of fashion! #Trending #FashionForward #RoddiesFashion\"\n\n**Image:** A high-quality photo of a model wearing a stylish outfit from the new collection, with a clean and modern background.\n\n**Call-to-Action (CTA):** \"Shop Now\" button that directs customers to the Roddies Fashion website or online store.\n\n**Target Audience:** Fashion-conscious individuals who are interested in staying up-to-date with the latest trends and styles.\n\n**Tone:** Professional and sophisticated, with a touch of excitement and enthusiasm for the new collection.\n\nThis post aims to showcase the brand\'s expertise in fashion and encourage customers to explore the new collection. By using relevant hashtags like #Trending and #FashionForward, we can increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-11-11 16:11:00', '2025-11-11 16:11:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Stories_books?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 12, '2025-11-11 16:11:12', '2025-11-11 16:11:12'),
