(80, 'Roddies fashion', '**Spooky Chic: Elevate Your Halloween Style with Roddies Fashion**\r\n\r\nAs the spookiest night of the year approaches, we\'ve got you covered with the latest Halloween fashion trends. Here\'s how you can stay stylish and scary with Roddies Fashion:\r\n\r\n* **Statement pieces**: Add a touch of eeriness to your outfit with our statement-making accessories, such as bat wing earrings or spider web scarves.\r\n* **Dark hues**: Embrace the darkness with our collection of black, navy, and dark grey clothing items that are perfect for the occasion.\r\n* **Festive prints**: Get into the Halloween spirit with our limited-edition prints, featuring jack-o\'-lanterns, ghosts, and other spooky motifs.\r\n* **Comfortable footwear**: Complete your look with our comfortable and stylish shoes, designed to keep you dancing all night long.\r\n\r\nShop our Halloween collection now and get ready to slay the night in style! #HalloweenFashion #RoddiesFashion #SpookyChic #FashionTrends #TrendingNow #HalloweenVibes #FashionForTheFearless #StyleInspo #HalloweenNight #CostumeGoals #FashionForward', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'scheduled', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-11-22 15:06:00', NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Black Color Tshirt ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1763804000/user_2_test-2/umgqdph2xt8oaz5m5faz.jpg', NULL, 'pending', NULL, '2025-11-22 15:03:21', '2025-11-22 15:29:25'),
