(89, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\r\n\r\n**Get Ready for a Spooky Halloween with Roddies Fashion!**\r\n\r\nAs the spookiest night of the year approaches, we\'ve got you covered with our top picks for a stylish and terrifying Halloween. Here are some key points to consider:\r\n\r\n* **Costume Ideas**: From creepy creatures to iconic characters, our collection has got you covered.\r\n* **Accessories**: Add a touch of eeriness to your outfit with our range of hats, wigs, and masks.\r\n* **Couple\'s Costumes**: Make a statement with our matching couple\'s costumes that are sure to turn heads.\r\n* **Kids\' Costumes**: Let your little ones join in on the fun with our adorable and spooky kids\' costumes.\r\n\r\nShop with us now and get ready to haunt the night in style! \r\n\r\n#HalloweenVibes #SpookySeason #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionMeetsFright #HalloweenCostumeIdeas #CoupleGoals #KidsFashion #HalloweenNight #FashionForAll #RoddiesFashionHalloween', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'scheduled', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Black Color Tshirt ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1764916912/user_2_test-2/dpwxrnshgf0yzfmtjkph.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2025-12-05 12:11:52', '2025-12-05 12:20:17'),
(90, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a possible post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\r\n\r\n**Get Ready for a Spooktacular Halloween with Roddies Fashion!**\r\n\r\nHere are some hauntingly cool reasons to shop with us this Halloween:\r\n* Exclusive discounts on our latest collections\r\n* Spooky-chic outfits to make you stand out from the crowd\r\n* Accessories to die for (pun intended!)\r\n* Fast and reliable shipping to ensure your costume arrives on time\r\n\r\nShop now and make this Halloween one to remember! #HalloweenVibes #SpookyFashion #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForAll #HalloweenCostumeIdeas #StyleInspo #FashionForward\r\n\r\nNote: I\'ve used a professional tone and included relevant hashtags to make the post trending on Facebook. I\'ve also highlighted the benefits of shopping with Roddies Fashion during Halloween, while keeping the caption concise and relatable.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-12-05 14:44:00', '2025-12-05 14:54:00', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Black Color Tshirt ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1764917468/user_2_test-2/omq2bem1duo7fg3y1sdt.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2025-12-05 12:21:09', '2025-12-05 14:54:00'),
(91, 'Roddies fashion', 'It seems like you\'re referring to the concept of a \"Flower.\" A flower is the reproductive structure found in plants that are classified as flowering plants, also known as angiosperms. Flowers are not only aesthetically pleasing but also play a crucial role in the reproduction of these plants. They are typically composed of petals, sepals, stamens, and a pistil.\r\n\r\nHere are some key aspects of flowers:\r\n\r\n1. **Components of a Flower**: \r\n   - **Petals**: These are the colorful parts of the flower that attract pollinators.\r\n   - **Sepals**: These are the green, leaf-like structures that protect the flower bud before it opens.\r\n   - **Stamens**: The male reproductive part of the flower, consisting of a filament and an anther that produces pollen.\r\n   - **Pistil**: The female reproductive part of the flower, consisting of a stigma, style, and ovary. The ovary contains ovules where seeds develop.\r\n\r\n2. **Functions of Flowers**:\r\n   - **Reproduction**: The primary function of a flower is to facilitate the reproduction of the plant. This involves attracting pollinators (like bees, butterflies, and birds) to transfer pollen from the stamen of one flower to the stigma of another, a process known as pollination.\r\n   - **Seed Production**: After successful pollination, the fertilized ovules in the ovary develop into seeds. The flower then typically withers, and the ovary may develop into a fruit that contains the seeds.\r\n   - **Attraction and Defense**: Flowers can attract beneficial insects for pollination and may also have mechanisms to deter herbivores or attract predators of herbivores for defense.\r\n\r\n3. **Types of Flowers**:\r\n   - **Complete Flowers**: These have all four floral parts: sepals, petals, stamens, and pistils.\r\n   - **Incomplete Flowers**: These lack one or more of the floral parts. For example, flowers that lack petals are called apetalous.\r\n   - **Unisexual Flowers**: These are either male (staminate) or female (pistillate) and lack the reproductive parts of the other sex. Examples include corn and squash.\r\n   - **Bisexual Flowers**: These have both stamens and pistils, meaning they are both male and female and can self-pollinate or cross-pollinate.\r\n\r\nFlowers are incredibly diverse, with variations in size, shape, color, and scent. This diversity is a testament to the adaptability and resilience of flowering plants, which have evolved to occupy almost every habitat on Earth.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-12-05 12:36:00', '2025-12-05 12:36:00', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Black Color Tshirt ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1764918277/user_2_test-2/khnxafbqkzrwffqmaftl.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2025-12-05 12:34:38', '2025-12-05 12:36:00'),
