(103, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a possible Facebook post for Roddies Fashion:\r\n\r\n**Get Ready for a Spooktacular Halloween with Roddies Fashion!**\r\n\r\nAs the witching hour approaches, we\'ve got you covered with the most spellbinding outfits to make your Halloween night unforgettable! Here are some highlights from our collection:\r\n\r\n* **Dark Romance**: Embrace the mystery of the night with our bold and dramatic dresses\r\n* **Spooky Chic**: Add a touch of eeriness to your look with our statement accessories\r\n* **Monster Mash**: Unleash your inner creature with our fun and playful costumes\r\n* **Ghostly Glam**: Shine bright like a ghostly apparition with our glittering outfits\r\n\r\nShop our Halloween collection now and get ready to cast a spell on the night! #HalloweenVibes #RoddiesFashion #SpookyStyle #TrendingNow #FashionForHalloween #HalloweenFashion #DarkGlamour #SpookyChic #MonsterMashup #GhostlyGlamour\r\n\r\n**Visit our website or store to explore our full collection and get ready to make this Halloween one to remember!**', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'scheduled', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Black Color Tshirt ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1765020236/user_2_test21/hhsnv6uogzmew5440upf.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2025-12-06 16:53:57', '2025-12-06 16:53:57'),
