(115, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:05', 'A bicycle, also known as a bike, is a human-powered or motor-powered, pedal-driven, single-track vehicle, having two wheels attached to a frame, one behind the other. Bicycles are an environmentally friendly mode of transportation, providing numerous benefits for the rider, including:\n\n1. **Exercise and Physical Fitness**: Bicycles offer a great way to stay physically fit, improving cardiovascular health, strengthening muscles, and boosting flexibility.\n2. **Environmental Benefits**: Bicycles produce zero emissions, reducing air pollution and contributing to a cleaner environment.\n3. **Convenience and Accessibility**: Bicycles are a cost-effective and convenient mode of transportation, allowing riders to navigate through traffic and parking challenges with ease.\n4. **Fun and Recreation**: Bicycles provide an enjoyable way to explore new places, enjoy scenic views, and experience the thrill of riding.\n\nThere are various types of bicycles, including:\n\n1. **Road Bikes**: Designed for speed and efficiency on paved roads.\n2. **Mountain Bikes**: Built for off-road adventures, featuring sturdy frames and suspension systems.\n3. **Hybrid Bikes**: Combining elements of road and mountain bikes, suitable for commuting and casual riding.\n4. **Electric Bikes**: Powered by electric motors, providing assistance for riders who need it.\n5. **BMX Bikes**: Designed for stunt riding, racing, and tricks.\n\nBicycles have a rich history, dating back to the early 19th century. Over the years, they have evolved to become an integral part of modern transportation, recreation, and culture.\n\nWhat would you like to know about bicycles?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-09 12:05:00', '2025-12-09 12:05:03', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Black_Color_Tshirt?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 18, '2025-12-09 12:05:03', '2025-12-09 12:05:03'),
