(117, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:34', 'A ball can refer to many things, such as:\n\n1. A round or spherical object, often made of rubber, plastic, or other materials, used for playing sports like basketball, football, or tennis.\n2. A formal dance or social gathering, like a ballroom dance or a debutante ball.\n3. A unit of measurement, such as a ball of yarn or a ball of twine.\n4. In chemistry, a ball can refer to a small, rounded particle or a ball-and-stick model of a molecule.\n\nWhich definition of a ball are you thinking of, or would you like more information on a specific type of ball?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-09 12:34:00', '2025-12-09 12:34:03', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Black_Color_Tshirt?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 20, '2025-12-09 12:34:03', '2025-12-09 12:34:03'),
(118, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:45', 'Shoes. There are so many types and styles to choose from. Here are a few examples:\n\n1. **Sneakers**: Casual, comfortable shoes for everyday wear, often used for sports and athletic activities.\n2. **Boots**: Ankle-high or higher shoes that can be worn for fashion, work, or outdoor activities like hiking.\n3. **Sandals**: Open-toe shoes for warm weather, often worn in summer or for beach trips.\n4. **Loafers**: Slip-on shoes without laces, commonly worn for formal or business-casual events.\n5. **High heels**: Elevated shoes with a heel, often worn for formal occasions or to add a touch of elegance to an outfit.\n6. **Flats**: Low-to-the-ground shoes with no heel, great for everyday wear or for people who prefer a more relaxed fit.\n7. **Running shoes**: Specialized shoes designed for running and other high-impact activities, often featuring arch support and cushioning.\n8. **Dress shoes**: Formal shoes for men and women, often made from leather or other high-quality materials.\n9. **Hiking shoes**: Sturdy shoes with good traction and ankle support, designed for outdoor adventures.\n10. **Slippers**: Comfortable, indoor shoes for lounging around the house.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite type of shoe?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-09 12:45:00', '2025-12-09 12:45:07', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Shoes?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 21, '2025-12-09 12:45:07', '2025-12-09 12:45:07'),
