(123, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n\"At Roddies Fashion, we understand that staying on top of the latest trends can be overwhelming. Here are a few reasons why we\'re your go-to destination for all things fashion:\n\n* Affordable prices without compromising on quality\n* Wide range of styles to suit every taste and preference\n* New arrivals every week to keep your wardrobe fresh and updated\n* Expert styling advice to help you look and feel your best\n\nStay ahead of the fashion curve with us! #TrendingNow #FashionForward #RoddiesFashion #StyleInspo #AffordableLuxury #FashionMustHaves #NewArrivals #FashionTips #WardrobeEssentials\"\n\nThis caption is professional, relatable, and includes a mix of niche and broad hashtags to reach a wider audience. The points highlighted in the caption showcase the benefits of shopping at Roddies Fashion, making it a compelling post for potential customers.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-10 15:10:00', '2025-12-10 15:10:06', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Black_Color_Tshirt?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2025-12-10 15:10:06', '2025-12-10 15:10:06'),
