(125, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Get Ready to Elevate Your Style with Roddies Fashion!**\n\nHere are a few reasons why you\'ll love shopping with us:\n* **Quality Matters**: We use only the finest materials to ensure our clothes are comfortable, durable, and long-lasting.\n* **Trendy Designs**: Our collections are inspired by the latest fashion trends, so you can stay on top of your style game.\n* **Affordability**: We believe fashion shouldn\'t break the bank, which is why we offer competitive pricing without compromising on quality.\n* **Sustainability**: We\'re committed to reducing our environmental footprint, using eco-friendly practices whenever possible.\n\nJoin the Roddies Fashion community and experience the best of fashion, comfort, and sustainability! #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForward #SustainableFashion #QualityMatters #AffordableLuxury #FashionForAll #StyleInspiration #MustHavePieces #FashionTrends2024 #OnlineShopping #FashionLovers #NewArrivals #FashionBrand #RoddiesStyle', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-10 15:24:00', '2025-12-10 15:24:05', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Black_Color_Tshirt?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2025-12-10 15:24:05', '2025-12-10 15:24:05'),
(126, 'Cat', 'The cat is a small, typically furry, carnivorous mammal. They are often referred to as domestic cats when they are kept as pets, but they can also be found in the wild. Here are some key characteristics and facts about cats:\r\n\r\n**Physical Characteristics:**\r\n- Cats have a short, compact body, with a flexible spine that allows them to twist and turn with ease.\r\n- They have retractable claws, which they use for climbing, hunting, and self-defense.\r\n- Their ears are pointed and can rotate to pinpoint sounds.\r\n- Cats have whiskers, which are highly sensitive and help them navigate in the dark and detect changes in air pressure.\r\n\r\n**Behavior:**\r\n- Cats are known for their independence and can be quite territorial.\r\n- They are primarily nocturnal, but they can adapt to their owner\'s schedule when kept as pets.\r\n- Cats are highly curious creatures and are known for their playful personalities.\r\n- They are also known for their grooming habits, spending a significant amount of time cleaning themselves.\r\n\r\n**Diet:**\r\n- Cats are obligate carnivores, meaning they require a diet high in protein from animal sources.\r\n- In the wild, they hunt small prey such as mice, birds, and insects.\r\n- Domestic cats are often fed commercial cat food, which is formulated to meet their nutritional needs.\r\n\r\n**Reproduction:**\r\n- Cats breed throughout the year, but the peak breeding season is typically in the spring and fall.\r\n- Female cats can have multiple litters per year, with an average of 2-5 kittens per litter.\r\n- The gestation period for cats is approximately 66 days.\r\n\r\n**Health:**\r\n- Cats are generally healthy animals, but they can be prone to certain health issues such as obesity, dental problems, and urinary tract infections.\r\n- Regular veterinary check-ups and a healthy diet can help prevent or manage these issues.\r\n\r\n**Domestication:**\r\n- The domestication of cats is believed to have occurred in the Middle East around 10,000 years ago.\r\n- Cats were initially valued for their ability to hunt rodents and other small pests, but they quickly became popular as pets due to their affectionate and playful personalities.\r\n\r\nOverall, cats are fascinating creatures that make great companions for many people. Their unique personalities, agility, and playful nature have made them one of the most popular pets in the world.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'draft', 1, 'Cat', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cat', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1765430771/user_2_test21/izbs5xfoqy1kaxgxbkky.jpg', NULL, 'pending', NULL, '2025-12-11 10:56:12', '2025-12-11 10:56:12'),
