(148, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\r\n\r\n**Get Ready for a Spooktacular Halloween with Roddies Fashion!**\r\n\r\nAs the witching hour approaches, we\'ve got you covered with the most spellbinding outfits to make your Halloween night unforgettable! Here are some highlights:\r\n\r\n* Unique and exclusive designs to make you stand out from the crowd\r\n* Comfortable and stylish clothing for a night of trick-or-treating or partying with friends\r\n* Affordable prices without compromising on quality\r\n* Perfect for all ages, from kids to adults, we\'ve got something for everyone\r\n\r\nVisit our page to explore our latest collection and get ready to slay the Halloween game!\r\n\r\n#HalloweenVibes #SpookySeason #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForAll #HalloweenCostumes #StyleInspo #FallFashion #HappyHalloween #FashionForward #RoddiesFashionHalloween', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-12-15 16:30:00', '2025-12-15 16:30:02', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Black Color Tshirt ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1765796120/user_2_test21/n1z9j6mm3cpyrbau5ljz.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2025-12-15 16:25:21', '2025-12-15 16:30:02'),
(149, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a possible post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\r\n\r\n**Get Ready for a Spooktacular Halloween with Roddies Fashion!**\r\n\r\nHere are some terrifyingly trendy ideas to make your Halloween unforgettable:\r\n* Dress to impress in our exclusive Halloween collection, featuring spooky-chic outfits and accessories\r\n* Channel your inner vampire, witch, or ghost with our curated selection of costumes and makeup inspiration\r\n* Stay warm and stylish with our cozy autumnal pieces, perfect for a night of trick-or-treating or a haunted house visit\r\n* Don\'t forget to accessorize with our creepy-cute hats, scarves, and jewelry to complete your look\r\n\r\n#HalloweenVibes #SpookySeason #RoddiesFashion #FashionForHalloween #TrendingNow #HalloweenCostumeIdeas #AutumnFashion #FashionInspo #HalloweenNight #TrickOrTreat #HauntedHouse #FashionForward #RoddiesFashionHalloween\r\n\r\nFollow us for more fashion updates, behind-the-scenes peeks, and exclusive promotions! @RoddiesFashion', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'scheduled', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-12-15 16:34:00', NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Black Color Tshirt ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1765796455/user_2_test21/hshffkplln6lp4g0gvwi.jpg', NULL, 'pending', NULL, '2025-12-15 16:30:56', '2025-12-15 16:30:56'),
