(152, 'Roddies fashion', '**Spooky Chic: Elevate Your Halloween Style with Roddies Fashion**\r\n\r\nAs the spookiest night of the year approaches, are you ready to make a statement with your Halloween attire? At Roddies Fashion, we\'ve got you covered! Here\'s how you can elevate your style game this Halloween:\r\n\r\n* **Stay on-trend**: Our latest collection features the hottest Halloween-inspired outfits that are sure to turn heads.\r\n* **Get creative**: Experiment with bold colors, patterns, and accessories to create a unique look that reflects your personality.\r\n* **Invest in quality**: Our high-quality, comfortable clothing ensures that you can focus on having fun, not fussing with your outfit.\r\n* **Accessories matter**: Add a touch of spooky elegance with our statement-making hats, jewelry, and bags.\r\n\r\nJoin the Roddies Fashion community and get ready to slay the Halloween fashion game! \r\n\r\n#HalloweenFashion #RoddiesFashion #SpookyChic #FashionTrends #HalloweenStyle #TrendingNow #FashionForward #HalloweenCostumeIdeas #StyleInspo #RoddiesFashionHalloween #HalloweenNight #Fashionista #HalloweenVibes #SpookySeason', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Black Color Tshirt ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1765804616/user_2_test21/yq3hgbfdjpdw2e8vjbws.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2025-12-15 18:46:57', '2025-12-15 18:46:57'),
(153, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:57', 'A pen is a common writing instrument used to apply ink to a surface, usually paper, to produce written characters, symbols, and drawings. It typically consists of a nib or tip, an ink reservoir, and a handle or casing.\n\nTypes of pens include:\n\n1. Ballpoint pens: These use a small metal ball to dispense ink onto the paper.\n2. Rollerball pens: These use a small metal ball to dispense liquid ink onto the paper, producing a more fluid line.\n3. Fountain pens: These use a nib to deliver ink from an internal reservoir to the paper.\n4. Gel pens: These use a water-based ink that is suspended in a gel-like substance, producing a vibrant and consistent line.\n5. Felt-tip pens: These use a porous tip to absorb and release ink onto the paper.\n\nPens are widely used for various purposes, including:\n\n1. Writing and drawing\n2. Signing documents\n3. Creating art\n4. Taking notes\n5. Everyday communication\n\nSome interesting facts about pens include:\n\n1. The first pen-like writing instrument was the reed pen, used by ancient civilizations around 4000 BC.\n2. The modern ballpoint pen was invented in the 1930s by László Bíró, a Hungarian journalist.\n3. The first fountain pen was patented in 1827 by John Jacob Parker, an Englishman.\n4. Pens can be made from a variety of materials, including plastic, metal, wood, and even 3D-printed materials.\n\nOverall, pens are a ubiquitous and essential tool in modern society, used by people of all ages and professions to create, communicate, and express themselves.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-16 11:57:00', '2025-12-16 11:57:06', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 16, '2025-12-16 11:57:06', '2025-12-16 11:57:06'),
(154, 'Auto Post for instagram at 11:59', 'A \"pen packet\" is a term that might be unfamiliar to some, but it has a specific meaning in certain contexts. \n\nIn the United States, a pen packet is a package or a bundle of documents and information sent to an individual who is about to be incarcerated or is already in prison. The term \"pen\" is short for \"penitentiary.\" This packet usually contains essential details about the prison, its rules and regulations, and what the inmate can expect during their stay.\n\nThe contents of a pen packet may vary depending on the institution, but it often includes:\n\n1. Introduction to the prison and its facilities\n2. Rules and regulations for inmate behavior\n3. Information about daily routines, such as meal times, exercise, and visitation hours\n4. Details about available programs, services, and activities, like education, counseling, or job training\n5. Information about inmate rights and responsibilities\n6. Contact information for loved ones and support services\n\nThe purpose of a pen packet is to help the inmate understand the prison\'s expectations, policies, and procedures, making their transition to incarceration smoother and reducing potential conflicts or misunderstandings.\n\nWhile the term \"pen packet\" might be specific to the United States or certain correctional institutions, the concept of providing information to inmates to facilitate their adaptation to prison life is a common practice in many countries.', '[\"instagram\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-16 11:59:00', '2025-12-16 11:59:07', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen_Packet?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 17, '2025-12-16 11:59:07', '2025-12-16 11:59:07'),
(155, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:59', 'A \"pen packet\" is a term that might be unfamiliar to some, but it has a specific meaning in certain contexts. \n\nIn the United States, a pen packet is a package or a bundle of documents and information sent to an individual who is about to be incarcerated or is already in prison. The term \"pen\" is short for \"penitentiary.\" This packet usually contains essential details about the prison, its rules and regulations, and what the inmate can expect during their stay.\n\nThe contents of a pen packet may vary depending on the institution, but it often includes:\n\n1. Introduction to the prison and its facilities\n2. Rules and regulations for inmate behavior\n3. Information about daily routines, such as meal times, exercise, and visitation hours\n4. Details about available programs, services, and activities, like education, counseling, or job training\n5. Information about inmate rights and responsibilities\n6. Contact information for loved ones and support services\n\nThe purpose of a pen packet is to help the inmate understand the prison\'s expectations, policies, and procedures, making their transition to incarceration smoother and reducing potential conflicts or misunderstandings.\n\nWhile the term \"pen packet\" might be specific to the United States or certain correctional institutions, the concept of providing information to inmates to facilitate their adaptation to prison life is a common practice in many countries.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-16 11:59:00', '2025-12-16 11:59:07', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen_Packet?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 17, '2025-12-16 11:59:07', '2025-12-16 11:59:07'),
(156, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:05', 'A bicycle, also known as a bike, is a human-powered or motor-powered, pedal-driven, single-track vehicle, having two wheels attached to a frame, one behind the other. Bicycles are a popular mode of transportation, recreation, and sport.\n\n**History of Bicycles:**\nThe first bicycle-like vehicle was invented in the early 19th century, with the first two-wheeled, human-powered vehicle being the \"draisine\" or \"dandy horse,\" invented by German Baron Karl von Drais in 1817. Over the years, the design of bicycles has evolved, with the introduction of pedals, cranks, and chains, making them more efficient and practical.\n\n**Types of Bicycles:**\nThere are many types of bicycles, including:\n\n1. **Road Bikes:** Designed for speed and efficiency on paved roads.\n2. **Mountain Bikes:** Designed for off-road riding, with sturdy frames and wide tires.\n3. **Hybrid Bikes:** A combination of road and mountain bikes, suitable for commuting and casual riding.\n4. **Cruiser Bikes:** Designed for comfort and style, often with a relaxed, upright riding position.\n5. **Electric Bikes:** Powered by a battery and electric motor, offering a convenient and environmentally friendly mode of transportation.\n\n**Benefits of Bicycles:**\nBicycles offer many benefits, including:\n\n1. **Environmental Benefits:** Bicycles are a zero-emission mode of transportation, reducing air pollution and carbon footprint.\n2. **Health Benefits:** Cycling is a great way to improve cardiovascular health, build muscle, and increase flexibility.\n3. **Convenience:** Bicycles are a convenient mode of transportation, especially in urban areas with heavy traffic.\n4. **Cost-Effective:** Bicycles are a cost-effective mode of transportation, with minimal maintenance and operating costs.\n\n**Interesting Facts:**\n1. The world\'s first bicycle race was held in 1868 in Paris, France.\n2. The longest recorded bicycle ride was made by Dave Kunst, who rode over 34,000 miles around the world in 1970-1974.\n3. The fastest recorded speed on a bicycle is over 183 miles per hour, achieved by Denise Mueller-Korenek in 2018.\n\nI hope you found this information about bicycles interesting! Do you have a favorite type of bicycle or a memorable cycling experience?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-16 12:05:00', '2025-12-16 12:05:06', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Black_Color_Tshirt?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 18, '2025-12-16 12:05:06', '2025-12-16 12:05:06'),
(157, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:08', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n\"Get ready to upgrade your wardrobe with Roddies Fashion! Here\'s what sets us apart:\n\n* High-quality clothing that\'s both stylish and comfortable\n* Affordable prices without compromising on quality\n* Trendy designs that keep you on top of the latest fashion trends\n* Sustainable fashion practices that reduce our environmental footprint\n* Excellent customer service to ensure you have a seamless shopping experience\n\nFollow us for the latest fashion updates, behind-the-scenes insights, and exclusive promotions! #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForward #SustainableFashion #QualityMatters #ComfortableChic #AffordableLuxury #FacebookFashion #FashionLovers #StyleInspo\"\n\nNote: The hashtags used are a mix of niche-specific (fashion, sustainable fashion) and broader, trending hashtags to increase visibility and reach a wider audience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-16 12:08:00', '2025-12-16 12:08:06', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Black_Color_Tshirt?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 19, '2025-12-16 12:08:06', '2025-12-16 12:08:06'),
(158, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:34', 'A ball can refer to many things, such as a round object used in sports (like a basketball, soccer ball, or tennis ball), a formal dance (like a ballroom dance), or even a spherical shape in general.\n\nWhat kind of ball are you thinking of?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-16 12:34:00', '2025-12-16 12:34:05', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Black_Color_Tshirt?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 20, '2025-12-16 12:34:05', '2025-12-16 12:34:05'),
(159, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:45', 'Shoes are a type of footwear that people wear to protect and comfort their feet. They come in a wide range of styles, designs, and materials, from casual sneakers to formal dress shoes.\n\nHere are some popular types of shoes:\n\n1. **Sneakers**: Also known as trainers or athletic shoes, these are designed for sports and casual wear.\n2. **Boots**: These can be ankle-high, knee-high, or even thigh-high, and are often worn for fashion or to keep feet warm in cold weather.\n3. **Sandals**: Open-toe shoes that are perfect for warm weather and outdoor activities like hiking or beach trips.\n4. **Loafers**: Slip-on shoes that are often worn for formal or business-casual occasions.\n5. **High heels**: Elevated shoes that are typically worn by women for formal events or special occasions.\n6. **Dress shoes**: Formal shoes that are designed to be worn with suits, dresses, or other formal attire.\n7. **Running shoes**: Designed for athletic performance, these shoes are built for speed, comfort, and support.\n8. **Hiking shoes**: Sturdy shoes that are designed for outdoor activities like hiking, backpacking, or trail running.\n\nShoes can be made from a variety of materials, including:\n\n1. **Leather**: A popular choice for dress shoes and boots.\n2. **Synthetic materials**: Such as nylon, polyester, or polyurethane, which are often used for sneakers and casual shoes.\n3. **Mesh**: A breathable material that\'s often used for running shoes and athletic wear.\n4. **Rubber**: Used for outsoles and midsoles, providing traction and cushioning.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite type of shoe?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-16 12:45:00', '2025-12-16 12:45:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Shoes?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 21, '2025-12-16 12:45:13', '2025-12-16 12:45:13'),
