(171, 'Halloween', '**Halloween Social Media Post Ideas with a Touch of Barbie Vibes**\r\n\r\nGet ready to spook and slay this Halloween with our curated social media post ideas, infused with a dash of Barbie vibes. With the help of **Generative AI**, create, schedule, and manage your posts to save time and boost engagement across all platforms.\r\n\r\n**Post 1: Introduction to Halloween**\r\nTheme: \"Pink Halloween\"\r\nImage: A Barbie doll in a pink witch hat, surrounded by pink and black decorations.\r\nCaption: \"Happy Halloween, babes! Get ready for a spook-tacular season with a touch of #BarbieVibes #PinkAesthetic #HalloweenVibes\"\r\n\r\n**Post 2: DIY Costume Ideas**\r\nTheme: \"Soft Girl Halloween\"\r\nImage: A DIY tutorial on how to create a soft, feminine Halloween costume with a pink and black color scheme.\r\nCaption: \"Who says Halloween has to be scary? Create your own soft girl Halloween costume with these easy DIY tips #SoftGirlEra #PrettyInPink #HalloweenCostume\"\r\n\r\n**Post 3: Halloween Makeup Tutorial**\r\nTheme: \"Glow Up for Halloween\"\r\nImage: A step-by-step makeup tutorial on how to achieve a glowing, pink-inspired Halloween look.\r\nCaption: \"Glow up for Halloween with this easy makeup tutorial Get ready to slay the night with a radiant, pink glow #GlowUp #AestheticLife #HalloweenMakeup\"\r\n\r\n**Post 4: Halloween Decor Inspiration**\r\nTheme: \"Barbie Core Decor\"\r\nImage: A collection of pink and black Halloween decorations, including a Barbie doll-themed centerpiece.\r\nCaption: \"Get inspired by these #BarbieCore decor ideas for a Halloween party that\'s both spooky and chic #BarbieVibes #HalloweenDecor #PinkAesthetic\"\r\n\r\n**Post 5: Halloween Treats**\r\nTheme: \"Pink Halloween Treats\"\r\nImage: A selection of pink and black Halloween treats, including cupcakes, cookies, and candy.\r\nCaption: \"Indulge in these sweet and spooky Halloween treats, perfect for a #BarbieVibes themed party #PrettyInPink #HalloweenTreats #DollEnergy\"\r\n\r\n**Schedule Your Posts with Generative AI**\r\nUse the power of **Generative AI** to create, schedule, and manage your social media posts. Save time and boost engagement across all platforms with our AI-powered tools. Happy Halloween!', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'Create, schedule, and manage your social media posts with the power of **Generative AI**. Save time and boost engagement across all platforms.\r\n#BarbieVibes #PinkAesthetic #DollEnergy #SoftGirlEra #PrettyInPink #BarbieCore #GlowUp #AestheticLife', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Create, schedule, and manage your social media posts with the power of **Generative AI**. Save time and boost engagement across all platforms.\r\n#BarbieVibes #PinkAesthetic #DollEnergy #SoftGirlEra #PrettyInPink #BarbieCore #GlowUp #AestheticLifeCreate, schedule, and manage your social media posts with the power of **Generative AI**. Save time and boost engagement across all platforms.\r\n#BarbieVibes #PinkAesthetic #DollEnergy #SoftGirlEra #PrettyInPink #BarbieCore #GlowUp #AestheticLife', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1765956660/user_2_test21/n0tqzbdenbtx9fdfrkp8.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2025-12-17 13:01:01', '2025-12-17 13:01:01'),
