(184, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:41', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and elegant piece of clothing. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a popular color for dresses and frocks, especially during the spring and summer seasons.\n\nIf you\'re looking for a sky blue dress or frock, you can consider the following styles:\n\n1. Flowy maxi dress: A flowy maxi dress in sky blue would be perfect for a casual, everyday look. You can pair it with sandals or sneakers for a relaxed vibe.\n2. A-line frock: An A-line frock in sky blue would be a great option for a more formal occasion. You can pair it with heels or dressy flats for a more polished look.\n3. Bodycon dress: If you want to make a statement, you can opt for a bodycon sky blue dress. This style would be perfect for a night out or a special occasion.\n4. Midi dress: A midi dress in sky blue would be a great option for a work event or a formal gathering. You can pair it with a blazer or a cardigan for a more professional look.\n\nSome popular fabrics for sky blue dresses and frocks include:\n\n1. Cotton: A cotton sky blue dress or frock would be perfect for everyday wear. It\'s breathable, comfortable, and easy to care for.\n2. Chiffon: A chiffon sky blue dress or frock would be great for a more formal occasion. It\'s lightweight, flowy, and adds a touch of elegance to any outfit.\n3. Silk: A silk sky blue dress or frock would be perfect for a special occasion. It\'s luxurious, smooth, and drapes beautifully on the body.\n\nOverall, a sky blue dress or frock is a great addition to any wardrobe. It\'s a versatile piece that can be dressed up or down, and it\'s perfect for a variety of occasions.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-17 18:41:00', '2025-12-17 18:41:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-17 18:41:12', '2025-12-17 18:41:12'),
(185, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:42', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and elegant garment. Sky blue is a calming and serene color that can evoke feelings of happiness and tranquility. It\'s a great choice for a dress or frock, as it can add a touch of sweetness and innocence to the overall look.\n\nHere are a few ideas to consider when it comes to a sky blue dress or frock:\n\n1. **Summer vibes**: A sky blue dress or frock is perfect for warm weather. You can pair it with sandals, sunglasses, and a wide-brimmed hat for a chic and effortless look.\n2. **Floral patterns**: Sky blue looks great with floral patterns, especially with white or yellow flowers. You can opt for a sky blue dress with a floral print for a romantic and feminine look.\n3. **Accessories**: To add some contrast to your sky blue dress or frock, you can pair it with accessories like a yellow belt, a pair of brown sandals, or a statement necklace with blue gemstones.\n4. **Casual or formal**: A sky blue dress or frock can be dressed up or down, depending on the occasion. You can wear it to a casual brunch or a formal event, depending on how you style it.\n5. **Hair and makeup**: To complement your sky blue dress or frock, you can opt for a simple hairstyle like a ponytail or a bun, and keep your makeup natural with a light lip color and subtle eye shadow.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses or frocks include:\n\n* **A-line dresses**: A classic A-line dress in sky blue is a great choice for a casual or formal event.\n* **Maxi dresses**: A maxi dress in sky blue is perfect for warm weather and can be dressed up or down.\n* **Frock-style dresses**: A frock-style dress in sky blue is a great choice for a more feminine and romantic look.\n\nOverall, a sky blue dress or frock is a great addition to any wardrobe, and can be styled in many different ways to suit your personal taste and preferences.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-17 18:42:00', '2025-12-17 18:42:09', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-17 18:42:09', '2025-12-17 18:42:09'),
(186, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:43', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and charming garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a beautiful shade that can evoke the image of a clear, sunny day.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of wearing a sky blue dress or frock, you might consider pairing it with some neutral or complementary colors to really make the outfit pop. Some options could be:\n\n* White or cream-colored accessories, such as a purse or shoes, to add a touch of elegance\n* A pair of brown or beige sandals to bring a warm, earthy feel to the outfit\n* A statement piece of jewelry, like a bold necklace or earrings, to add a pop of color and personality\n* A lightweight cardigan or jacket in a neutral color, like gray or beige, to add a layer of depth and interest to the outfit\n\nOf course, the possibilities are endless, and the right combination will depend on your personal style and the occasion. But overall, a sky blue dress or frock is a great starting point for creating a beautiful and eye-catching outfit.\n\nDo you have a specific occasion in mind for wearing a sky blue dress or frock, or are you just looking for some general fashion advice?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-17 18:43:00', '2025-12-17 18:43:08', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-17 18:43:08', '2025-12-17 18:43:08'),
(187, 'Cakes and Bake', 'A fresh batch of chocolate chip cookies, perfectly risen macaroons, and luscious cinnamon rolls that cloud your baking station in a warm, sweet aroma - the thrill of oven-fresh goodies is quite irresistible, isn’t it? For most of us, baking goes beyond a hobby. Instead, it’s a therapy session - a gooey mug cake to ease a heartbreak, a bubbly lasagna for a much-needed brunch with friends, or a quick one-pan dish when you’re off the clock. Amateur or not, we all love sharing our humble creations on social media to capture the joy of baking and sharing our trade secrets with our loved ones. But with the right baking captions, you can make these posts even sweeter. In this blog, we will cover some inspiring baking quotes so that you can put a fun spin on all your signature items. Let’s dive into it, shall we?\r\n#Bake#Bake$Shake#Acceptcakeorder#Birthday cakes#AnniversaryCake', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 0, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-12-18 12:49:00', '2025-12-18 12:49:03', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1766042223/user_2_test21/ywdpqlrtxof4fcbfgjkn.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2025-12-18 12:47:03', '2025-12-18 12:49:03'),
