(199, 'Induction', 'Stepping into a new chapter, new responsibilities, new energy!\r\nToday marks my official induction, and I’m excited to learn, grow, collaborate, and contribute.\r\nEvery beginning is a chance to rewrite your journey, upgrade your skills, and prove your potential.\r\nGrateful for the opportunity — ready for the hustle, discipline, and success ahead! 🚀\r\nLet’s make it count. 💼💡🔥\r\n\r\n#InductionDay #NewBeginning #ProfessionalJourney #CareerGrowth #CorporateLife #NewOpportunities #LearningAndDevelopment #TeamWork #Onboarding #FutureReady #WorkInProgress #CareerMotivation #SkillUpgrade #ProfessionalGoals #LevelUp #WorkMode #LetsGrowTogether #SuccessMindset #NewJourneyBegins 🙌', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'draft', 0, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-12-18 16:10:00', NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1766054293/user_2_test21/qm6eieohje6ly6sdseox.jpg', NULL, 'pending', NULL, '2025-12-18 16:08:14', '2025-12-18 16:08:14'),
(200, 'Roddies fashion', 'Here\'s a possible post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\r\n\r\n**Get Ready for a Spooktacular Halloween with Roddies Fashion!**\r\n\r\nAs the witching hour approaches, we\'ve got you covered with our spellbinding Halloween collection! Here are the highlights:\r\n\r\n* Exclusive Halloween-themed outfits to make you stand out from the crowd\r\n* Spooky accessories to add a touch of eeriness to your look\r\n* Limited-time discounts on our best-selling items to help you save big\r\n* Free shipping on all orders over $50 to ensure your treats arrive on time\r\n\r\nDon\'t miss out on the fun! Shop our Halloween collection now and get ready to cast a spell on the party!\r\n\r\n#HalloweenFashion #RoddiesFashion #SpookyStyle #TrendingNow #HalloweenCostumeIdeas #FashionForTheFearless #HalloweenNight #StyleInspo #FashionTrends #RoddiesFashionHalloween\r\n\r\nNote: The hashtags used are a mix of popular and trending ones, including #HalloweenFashion, #TrendingNow, and #FashionTrends, to increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'draft', 1, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'pending', NULL, '2025-12-18 16:17:53', '2025-12-18 16:17:53'),
