(206, 'BARBIUE', 'Living life in full pink mode — confidence high, energy bright, dreams bigger than ever!\r\nWhy fit into the world when you were born to stand out like a Barbie in a grey room?\r\nI choose sparkle over doubt, heels over hesitation, and self-love over everything.\r\nThis isn’t just a vibe — it’s a lifestyle of glamour, growth, grace & goals.\r\nBarbie isn’t plastic — she’s iconic. She’s fearless. She builds her own world.\r\nSo here I am — leveling up, glowing up, and showing up for myself every single day!\r\n💋🎀 Pink attitude. Doll energy. Boss mindset.\r\n\r\n#Barbie #BarbieGirl #BarbieLife #BarbieWorld #PinkVibes #PrettyInPink #BarbieEnergy #BossBarbie #GlamLifestyle #GirlPower #ConfidenceQueen #BeIconic #SlayAllDay #HighStandards #GirlyVibes #SparkleOn #BarbieAesthetic #PinkAddict #GlamGoals #LevelUpQueen #GlowAndGrow 💖✨', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 0, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-12-18 16:42:00', '2025-12-18 16:42:02', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1766055904/user_2_test21/zvak3aleuqjyjuhf3fue.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2025-12-18 16:35:05', '2025-12-18 16:42:02');
