(207, 'TUMBLER', 'This tumbler isn’t just a mug — it’s a whole mood.\r\nIt holds my early–morning motivation, my late–night thoughts,\r\nmy silent goals, and every sip of peace I steal from a busy day.\r\n\r\nSome people chase perfection —\r\nI chase a warm drink and a calm mind.\r\nThis mug reminds me to slow down, breathe, reset, and try again.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'scheduled', 0, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', '2025-12-18 16:42:00', NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1766056035/user_2_test21/z8cvfephz9bhaqynpmvf.jpg', NULL, 'rejected', NULL, '2025-12-18 16:37:15', '2025-12-18 16:41:06'),
