(222, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'It seems like you\'re looking for a list of the days of the week, but you\'ve also included \"Good Morning Like\" which seems to be a greeting. Here are the days of the week:\n\n1. Monday\n2. Tuesday\n3. Wednesday\n4. Thursday\n5. Friday\n6. Saturday\n7. Sunday\n\nIf you were looking for a way to greet someone on each day of the week, here are some examples:\n\n- Monday: Good morning, have a great start to the week.\n- Tuesday: Good morning, hope your day is going well.\n- Wednesday: Good morning, halfway through the week.\n- Thursday: Good morning, almost Friday.\n- Friday: Good morning, the weekend is near.\n- Saturday: Good morning, enjoy your weekend.\n- Sunday: Good morning, have a relaxing day.\n\nPlease let me know if I can help with anything else.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-18 18:26:00', '2025-12-18 18:26:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2025-12-18 18:26:23', '2025-12-18 18:26:23'),
(223, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:41', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and charming garment. Sky blue is a beautiful, calming color that evokes feelings of serenity and tranquility. It\'s a popular color for dresses and frocks, especially during the spring and summer months.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of wearing a sky blue dress or frock, here are a few styling tips:\n\n1. **Pair with neutral shoes**: Sky blue looks great with neutral-colored shoes like beige, white, or metallic sandals.\n2. **Add some greenery**: A sky blue dress or frock pairs beautifully with green accessories like a floral crown, a green scarf, or a leafy necklace.\n3. **Go for a natural makeup look**: Keep your makeup natural and effortless to let the dress be the focal point. A light, sun-kissed glow and a soft pink lip color would complement the sky blue dress nicely.\n4. **Try a flowy design**: A flowy, floor-length sky blue dress or frock is perfect for a bohemian or whimsical look. You can also opt for a shorter, more structured design for a more modern and chic look.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses and frocks include:\n\n1. **Maxi dresses**: Floor-length, flowy maxi dresses in sky blue are perfect for summer evenings or outdoor events.\n2. **Shift dresses**: Simple, shift-style dresses in sky blue are great for everyday wear or casual outings.\n3. **Tiered dresses**: Tiered sky blue dresses with layers of fabric are perfect for adding a touch of whimsy and romance to your outfit.\n\nOverall, a sky blue dress or frock is a versatile and beautiful garment that can be styled in many different ways to suit your personal taste and preferences.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-18 18:41:00', '2025-12-18 18:41:09', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-18 18:41:09', '2025-12-18 18:41:09'),
(224, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:42', 'A beautiful topic. \n\nA sky blue dress or frock can be a stunning and elegant choice for any occasion. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a versatile color that can complement various skin tones and hair colors.\n\nHere are a few ideas to style a sky blue dress or frock:\n\n1. **Casual look**: Pair a sky blue sundress with sandals or sneakers for a relaxed, everyday look.\n2. **Dressy look**: Add some heels, statement jewelry, and a clutch to transform the dress into a more formal outfit for a special occasion.\n3. **Boho chic**: Combine the sky blue dress with a floppy hat, layered necklaces, and ankle boots for a bohemian-inspired look.\n4. **Workwear**: Wear a sky blue dress with a blazer and loafers for a professional, office-friendly ensemble.\n\nSome popular fabrics for sky blue dresses include:\n\n1. **Cotton**: A breathable, natural fabric perfect for casual, everyday wear.\n2. **Silk**: A luxurious, smooth fabric ideal for more formal occasions.\n3. **Chiffon**: A lightweight, flowing fabric that creates a beautiful, ethereal effect.\n\nOverall, a sky blue dress or frock is a lovely addition to any wardrobe, offering endless possibilities for styling and creativity.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-18 18:42:00', '2025-12-18 18:42:09', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-18 18:42:09', '2025-12-18 18:42:09'),
(225, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:43', 'A lovely topic. A sky blue dress or frock can be a beautiful and elegant garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and freedom. It\'s a popular choice for dresses and frocks because it complements many skin tones and can be dressed up or down for various occasions.\n\nHere are a few ideas to consider when thinking about a sky blue dress or frock:\n\n1. **Summer outfit**: A sky blue dress is perfect for warm weather. You can pair it with sandals, sunglasses, and a wide-brimmed hat for a chic and effortless look.\n2. **Formal event**: If you want to dress up your sky blue frock, consider adding some elegant accessories like a statement necklace, high heels, and a clutch bag.\n3. **Everyday wear**: A sky blue dress can also be a great addition to your everyday wardrobe. You can wear it to work, school, or just running errands, and pair it with sneakers or boots for a more casual look.\n4. **Patterns and designs**: Sky blue dresses and frocks can feature various patterns and designs, such as florals, stripes, or polka dots. You can choose a style that suits your personality and preferences.\n\nSome popular styles of sky blue dresses and frocks include:\n\n* **A-line dresses**: A classic style that flares out from the waist, creating a flattering silhouette.\n* **Maxi dresses**: A floor-sweeping style that\'s perfect for warm weather and can be dressed up or down.\n* **Shift dresses**: A simple, straight-cut style that\'s easy to wear and versatile.\n\nOverall, a sky blue dress or frock is a great addition to any wardrobe, offering a range of styling options and occasions to wear it.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-18 18:43:00', '2025-12-18 18:43:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-18 18:43:10', '2025-12-18 18:43:10'),
