(338, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A lovely topic. A flower pot is a container used to hold and display plants, typically made of materials such as ceramic, clay, plastic, or wood. Flower pots come in a wide range of shapes, sizes, and designs, from simple and functional to decorative and ornate.\n\nSome common features of flower pots include:\n\n1. Drainage holes: to prevent waterlogged soil and root rot\n2. Handles or grips: for easy lifting and moving\n3. Decorative patterns or designs: to add visual appeal\n4. Water reservoirs: to help retain moisture and reduce watering frequency\n\nFlower pots can be used for a variety of plants, including:\n\n1. Indoor plants: such as succulents, herbs, and houseplants\n2. Outdoor plants: such as flowers, shrubs, and trees\n3. Vegetables: such as tomatoes, peppers, and cucumbers\n4. Herbs: such as basil, rosemary, and thyme\n\nWhen choosing a flower pot, consider factors such as:\n\n1. Size: choose a pot that is large enough to hold the plant\'s roots and soil\n2. Material: select a pot that is durable and suitable for the plant\'s needs\n3. Drainage: ensure the pot has adequate drainage holes to prevent waterlogging\n4. Style: choose a pot that fits your personal style and decor\n\nOverall, flower pots are a great way to add some greenery to your home or garden, and can be a fun and creative way to express your personality and style.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-24 18:07:00', '2025-12-24 18:07:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2025-12-24 18:07:11', '2025-12-24 18:07:11'),
(339, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'Here are the weekday greetings:\n\n1. Monday - Good morning, have a great start to the week.\n2. Tuesday - Good morning, hope your day is as wonderful as you are.\n3. Wednesday - Good morning, halfway to the weekend.\n4. Thursday - Good morning, almost Friday.\n5. Friday - Good morning, the weekend is finally here.\n6. Saturday - Good morning, enjoy your day off.\n7. Sunday - Good morning, a day of rest before the new week begins.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-24 18:26:00', '2025-12-24 18:26:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2025-12-24 18:26:11', '2025-12-24 18:26:11'),
(340, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:41', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and elegant piece of clothing. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a great choice for a dress, as it can evoke a sense of freedom and joy.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of wearing a sky blue dress, you might consider pairing it with some neutral-colored accessories, such as beige or white shoes and a simple necklace, to let the dress be the focal point. Alternatively, you could add some pops of color with a brightly colored scarf or handbag to add some visual interest.\n\nSky blue dresses can be suitable for a variety of occasions, from casual daytime events to more formal evening gatherings. They can also be dressed up or down depending on the style and fabric of the dress.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses include:\n\n* Flowy maxi dresses with empire waists and V-necks\n* Fit-and-flare dresses with full skirts and cap sleeves\n* Shift dresses with simple, clean lines and minimal embellishments\n* Bodycon dresses with sleek, form-fitting silhouettes and high necklines\n\nWhat\'s your favorite style for a sky blue dress? Or do you have a specific occasion in mind for wearing one?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-24 18:41:00', '2025-12-24 18:41:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-24 18:41:11', '2025-12-24 18:41:11'),
(341, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:42', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and elegant garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a versatile color that can be suitable for various occasions, from casual everyday wear to more formal events.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of wearing a sky blue dress or frock, here are a few suggestions:\n\n1. **Pair it with neutral accessories**: Sky blue looks great with neutral colors like white, beige, or pale gray. You can add a pair of neutral-colored sandals, a simple necklace, or a pair of earrings to complement your outfit.\n2. **Add a pop of contrast**: If you want to add some visual interest to your outfit, you can add a pop of contrast with a brighter or bolder color. For example, you can wear a yellow or orange scarf, or add a statement piece of jewelry with a bold color.\n3. **Consider the style**: Sky blue dresses and frocks come in a variety of styles, from flowy and bohemian to structured and formal. Consider the occasion and your personal style when choosing a sky blue dress or frock.\n4. **Play with textures**: You can add depth and interest to your outfit by mixing different textures. For example, you can pair a smooth sky blue dress with a pair of lace sandals or a crocheted bag.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses and frocks include:\n\n* **Maxi dresses**: A flowy maxi dress in sky blue can be a great choice for a casual, everyday look.\n* **A-line dresses**: An A-line dress in sky blue can be a flattering and feminine choice for a more formal occasion.\n* **Frock-style dresses**: A frock-style dress in sky blue can be a great choice for a vintage or bohemian-inspired look.\n\nOverall, a sky blue dress or frock can be a beautiful and versatile addition to your wardrobe. You can style it in many different ways to suit your personal taste and the occasion.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-24 18:42:00', '2025-12-24 18:42:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-24 18:42:11', '2025-12-24 18:42:11'),
(342, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:43', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and vibrant piece of clothing. Sky blue is a calming and serene color that can evoke feelings of happiness and tranquility. It\'s a great color for a dress or frock, as it can add a touch of elegance and sophistication to any outfit.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of wearing a sky blue dress or frock, you might consider pairing it with some neutral-colored accessories, such as beige or white shoes and a matching handbag, to let the dress be the focal point. Alternatively, you could add some bold and bright accessories, like yellow or orange jewelry, to create a fun and playful look.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses and frocks include:\n\n1. Flowy maxi dresses with V-necks and adjustable straps\n2. A-line frocks with fitted waists and full skirts\n3. Shift dresses with simple, straight silhouettes\n4. Tea-length dresses with flared hems and cap sleeves\n\nWhat\'s your favorite style for a sky blue dress or frock?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-24 18:43:00', '2025-12-24 18:43:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-24 18:43:11', '2025-12-24 18:43:11'),
