(352, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is one of contrasts and powerful symbolism, blending the worlds of business and sports to convey a sense of achievement and determination. Let\'s break down the elements and the emotions they evoke:\n\n1. **Professional Businessman in a Suit**: The suit is a symbol of professionalism, success, and authority in the business world. It signifies that the individual is accomplished and serious about their career.\n\n2. **Standing Confidently on a Basketball Court**: The basketball court represents a domain of competition, skill, and strategy. Standing confidently on this court suggests that the businessman is not only adept in his professional field but also has the courage and confidence to step into other challenging arenas. Confidence is key to success in both business and sports.\n\n3. **Ball in Hand**: Holding a basketball can symbolize control, readiness to act, and the ability to make decisive moves. It implies that the individual is prepared to take on challenges and is in a position of power or leadership.\n\n4. **Stadium Lights Behind Him**: The dramatic lighting provided by the stadium lights creates a sense of drama and highlights the figure, making him stand out. This could symbolize being in the spotlight, recognition, or a moment of glory. It also suggests that the individual is comfortable with and perhaps even seeks out the attention and scrutiny that comes with success.\n\n5. **Dramatic Lighting**: The use of dramatic lighting adds a cinematic quality to the image, making it more compelling and evocative. It can enhance the mood, making the scene feel more intense, heroic, or inspirational.\n\n6. **Success Mindset**: The overall posture and setting convey a mindset of success—a belief in one\'s abilities, a willingness to take risks, and the resilience to overcome obstacles. This mindset is crucial for achieving goals in both personal and professional life.\n\n7. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The high-resolution and cinematic style of the image suggest a level of sophistication and a attention to detail. It makes the scene feel more epic, important, and memorable, which aligns with the themes of success and achievement.\n\nIn essence, the image of a businessman standing confidently on a basketball court, bathed in dramatic stadium lighting, encapsulates the idea of a high-achieving individual who is not limited by conventional boundaries. It suggests versatility, confidence, and a relentless pursuit of excellence, making it a powerful and inspiring visual representation of success.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-25 17:45:00', '2025-12-25 17:45:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2025-12-25 17:45:12', '2025-12-25 17:45:12'),
(353, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'The image you\'ve described is one of powerful contrast and compelling narrative. A businessman, typically associated with boardrooms and financial reports, standing confidently on a basketball court, suggests a blend of worlds. The suit, a symbol of professionalism and success in the corporate arena, takes on a new dimension when set against the backdrop of a basketball court, an environment that values physical prowess, strategy, and teamwork.\n\nThe basketball, firmly in his hand, acts as a metaphor for control and readiness to take on challenges. The court, under the dramatic glow of stadium lights, transforms into a stage where this businessman is the protagonist, ready to make his move. The high-resolution cinematic style elevates the scene, imbuing it with a sense of epic importance, as if the very moment captured is pivotal, not just for the individual but for the story unfolding.\n\nThe success mindset is palpable, emanating from the confidence in his stance and the determination in his eyes (though not directly described, it\'s inferred from the context of confidence and dramatic lighting). This image speaks to the idea that success is not confined to one area of life but can be a mindset that transcends different domains. The businessman, adept at navigating the competitive landscape of corporate finance, brings the same drive and ambition to the basketball court, suggesting a holistic approach to achievement.\n\nThe use of dramatic lighting adds depth to the scene, casting shadows that highlight the contours of his face and the folds of his suit, contrasting the sharp, modern attire with the timeless, universal appeal of the basketball court. It\'s a visual representation of how different facets of life can intersect and enrich one another, challenging traditional boundaries and expectations.\n\nIn cinematic terms, this image could be the opening shot of a film that explores themes of ambition, perseverance, and the pursuit of excellence across different fields. It invites the viewer to ponder the backstory of this character: What drives him? How did he come to stand on this court, exuding such confidence? The high-resolution quality of the image promises a story told in vivid detail, with each frame offering a new insight into the character\'s journey towards success.\n\nUltimately, the picture of a suited businessman on a basketball court, bathed in dramatic stadium lighting, is a visually striking metaphor for the modern pursuit of success. It blends traditionally separate worlds, challenges common perceptions, and invites reflection on what it means to be driven, ambitious, and victorious in today\'s multifaceted society.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-25 17:46:00', '2025-12-25 17:46:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2025-12-25 17:46:12', '2025-12-25 17:46:12'),
(354, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:47', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, determination, and success. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the elements that come together to create this compelling visual:\n\n1. **Professional Businessman**: The subject of the image is a professional businessman, immediately identifiable by his suit. The suit is a symbol of professionalism, authority, and success in the corporate world. It suggests that this individual is accomplished and respected in his field.\n\n2. **Wearing a Suit on a Basketball Court**: The contrast between the formal attire and the informal setting of a basketball court is striking. It suggests a blending of two very different worlds—the corporate and the athletic. This juxtaposition can symbolize the individual\'s ability to adapt, to bridge gaps between different areas of life, and to find success in diverse environments.\n\n3. **Standing Confidently**: The businessman\'s confident stance on the court, with a ball in his hand, exudes self-assurance and capability. This posture implies not just physical confidence but also a mental toughness and readiness to take on challenges.\n\n4. **Ball in Hand**: Holding a basketball, the businessman appears ready to engage with the sport, symbolizing his readiness to engage with challenges and opportunities. The ball can also represent the \"ball\" of opportunity, control, or power in both business and personal life.\n\n5. **Stadium Lights Behind Him**: The dramatic lighting provided by the stadium lights adds a layer of grandeur to the scene. It can symbolize the spotlight of success, highlighting the individual\'s achievements and accomplishments. The lights also create a sense of drama and importance, underscoring the significance of the moment or the challenges being faced.\n\n6. **Dramatic Lighting**: The overall lighting of the scene is dramatic, likely with strong shadows and highlights. This type of lighting can add a cinematic quality to the image, making it seem like a moment from a movie. It enhances the emotional impact of the scene, emphasizing the feelings of success, confidence, and determination.\n\n7. **Success Mindset**: The entire setup—the confident pose, the formal attire in an informal setting, the readiness to act (as symbolized by the ball in hand)—conveys a strong mindset of success. This is an individual who is prepared to succeed, who believes in his abilities, and who is not afraid to take on new challenges.\n\n8. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The image is described as being in high resolution with a cinematic style, which suggests a level of detail and clarity that is typically associated with professional photography or film. This style can make the image feel more immersive and engaging, drawing the viewer into the scene and emphasizing the emotional and thematic elements being conveyed.\n\nOverall, the image of a businessman standing confidently on a basketball court, set against the dramatic backdrop of stadium lights, is a powerful visual metaphor for success, adaptability, and a strong, resilient mindset. It suggests a narrative of overcoming obstacles, achieving goals, and standing out as a leader in one\'s field.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-25 17:47:00', '2025-12-25 17:47:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2025-12-25 17:47:12', '2025-12-25 17:47:12'),
(355, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold and display plants, typically made of materials such as ceramic, clay, plastic, or wood. They come in various shapes, sizes, and designs to suit different types of plants and decorative styles.\n\nFlower pots can be used for both indoor and outdoor plants, and they can add a touch of beauty and elegance to any room or garden. Some common features of flower pots include:\n\n1. Drainage holes: to prevent waterlogged soil and root rot\n2. Handles or grips: for easy lifting and moving\n3. Decorative designs: such as patterns, colors, or textures to add visual appeal\n4. Size and shape: to accommodate different types of plants and growth habits\n\nThere are many different types of flower pots, including:\n\n1. Terracotta pots: made from natural clay and often used for outdoor plants\n2. Ceramic pots: made from clay and other materials, often glazed for a decorative finish\n3. Plastic pots: lightweight and durable, often used for indoor plants\n4. Wooden pots: made from natural wood, often used for outdoor plants\n5. Self-watering pots: designed to conserve water and reduce maintenance\n\nFlower pots can be used for a variety of plants, including:\n\n1. Flowers: such as roses, tulips, and daisies\n2. Herbs: such as basil, mint, and rosemary\n3. Succulents: such as aloe, agave, and echeveria\n4. Trees: such as bonsai trees or small ornamental trees\n5. Vegetables: such as tomatoes, peppers, and cucumbers\n\nOverall, flower pots are a versatile and essential component of gardening and plant care, allowing us to grow and display a wide range of plants in a variety of settings.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-25 18:07:00', '2025-12-25 18:07:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2025-12-25 18:07:11', '2025-12-25 18:07:11'),
(356, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'It seems you want me to post \"Good Morning\" along with the days of the week, but excluding the actual \"Good Morning\" phrase for the weekend days, as those are typically considered days off or days of rest. Here\'s the list you requested:\n\n1. Monday - Good Morning\n2. Tuesday - Good Morning\n3. Wednesday - Good Morning\n4. Thursday - Good Morning\n5. Friday - Good Morning\n6. Saturday \n7. Sunday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-25 18:26:00', '2025-12-25 18:26:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2025-12-25 18:26:11', '2025-12-25 18:26:11'),
(357, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:41', 'A sky blue dress or frock is a beautiful and elegant piece of clothing. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a perfect color for a dress that can be worn on various occasions, such as:\n\n1. **Summer outings**: A sky blue dress is ideal for warm weather, as it reflects the sun\'s rays and keeps you cool.\n2. **Beach weddings**: A flowy sky blue frock can be a stunning choice for a beach wedding, capturing the essence of the ocean and the sky.\n3. **Garden parties**: The soft, soothing color of sky blue complements the natural surroundings of a garden, making it a great choice for outdoor gatherings.\n4. **Everyday wear**: A sky blue dress can also be dressed up or down for everyday activities, such as running errands or meeting with friends.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses and frocks include:\n\n1. **Flowy maxi dresses**: Perfect for warm weather, these dresses are loose-fitting and comfortable.\n2. **A-line dresses**: A classic style that suits most body types, A-line dresses are flattering and easy to wear.\n3. **Bodycon dresses**: For a more formal look, a sky blue bodycon dress can be a stunning choice.\n4. **Lace or embroidered dresses**: Adding intricate details like lace or embroidery can give a sky blue dress a touch of elegance and sophistication.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite style or occasion for wearing a sky blue dress or frock?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-25 18:41:00', '2025-12-25 18:41:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-25 18:41:12', '2025-12-25 18:41:12'),
(358, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:42', 'A beautiful topic. \n\nA sky blue dress or frock can be a stunning and elegant piece of clothing. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a versatile color that can be suitable for various occasions, from casual daily wear to more formal events.\n\nHere are a few ideas to style a sky blue dress or frock:\n\n1. **Summer outfit**: Pair the dress with sandals, sunglasses, and a wide-brimmed hat for a perfect summer look.\n2. **Boho chic**: Add a floppy hat, layered necklaces, and ankle boots to give the dress a bohemian touch.\n3. **Formal event**: Wear the dress with heels, a statement necklace, and a clutch for a more elegant and sophisticated look.\n4. **Casual day out**: Team the dress with sneakers, a denim jacket, and a cross-body bag for a relaxed and comfortable outfit.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses or frocks include:\n\n1. **Flowy maxi dress**: A floor-length, flowy dress that\'s perfect for warm weather.\n2. **A-line dress**: A classic style that flares out from the waist, creating a flattering silhouette.\n3. **Bodycon dress**: A fitted, body-hugging dress that\'s ideal for a night out or a special occasion.\n4. **Sundress**: A simple, casual dress with a relaxed fit and a sweetheart neckline.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite way to style a sky blue dress or frock?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-25 18:42:00', '2025-12-25 18:42:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-25 18:42:11', '2025-12-25 18:42:11'),
(359, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:43', 'A lovely topic. \n\nA sky blue dress or frock can be a beautiful and elegant garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. Here are a few ideas related to a sky blue dress:\n\n1. **Summer outfit**: A sky blue dress is perfect for warm weather, as it can keep you cool and comfortable. You can pair it with sandals, sunglasses, and a wide-brimmed hat for a stylish summer look.\n2. **Formal events**: A sky blue dress can also be dressed up for formal events like weddings, parties, or galas. You can add some accessories like jewelry, heels, and a clutch to give it a more elegant look.\n3. **Casual wear**: For a more casual look, you can pair a sky blue dress with sneakers, a denim jacket, and a backpack for a relaxed, everyday outfit.\n4. **Vintage inspiration**: Sky blue dresses were popular in the 1950s and 1960s, so you can draw inspiration from vintage fashion to create a unique and retro-inspired look.\n5. **Accessories**: To complement a sky blue dress, you can add accessories like a statement necklace, a pair of earrings, or a scarf in a contrasting color to add some visual interest.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses include:\n\n* **A-line dresses**: A classic A-line dress with a full skirt and a fitted bodice is a timeless choice.\n* **Bodycon dresses**: A fitted, bodycon sky blue dress can be a great option for a night out or a special occasion.\n* **Maxi dresses**: A flowy, maxi sky blue dress is perfect for a casual, everyday look or a beach vacation.\n\nOverall, a sky blue dress is a versatile and beautiful garment that can be styled in many different ways to suit your personality and preferences.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-25 18:43:00', '2025-12-25 18:43:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-25 18:43:11', '2025-12-25 18:43:11'),
(360, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Introducing Roddies Fashion**\n\nHere are a few key points about our brand:\n\n* **Quality and Comfort**: Our clothing is designed to provide the perfect blend of style, quality, and comfort.\n* **Affordable Prices**: We believe that fashion should be accessible to everyone, which is why we offer competitive pricing without compromising on quality.\n* **Latest Trends**: Our team of expert designers stay up-to-date with the latest fashion trends to bring you the most stylish and modern clothing.\n* **Sustainable Practices**: At Roddies Fashion, we\'re committed to reducing our environmental footprint through sustainable practices and eco-friendly materials.\n\nFollow us for the latest updates, promotions, and style tips! #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForAll #SustainableFashion #QualityMatters #ComfortableClothing #AffordableLuxury #FashionTrends #StyleInspiration #NewArrivals #MustHaves #FashionForward #FacebookFashion', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-26 11:18:00', '2025-12-26 11:18:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2025-12-26 11:18:10', '2025-12-26 11:18:10'),
(361, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:39', 'Here\'s a possible Facebook post for Roddies Fashion:\n\n**Introducing Our Latest Collection**\n\nAt Roddies Fashion, we\'re excited to bring you the latest trends in fashion. Here are some key features of our new collection:\n\n* **Affordable prices**: We believe that fashion shouldn\'t break the bank. Our prices are competitive and budget-friendly.\n* **High-quality materials**: We use only the best materials to ensure that our clothes are comfortable, durable, and long-lasting.\n* **Trendy designs**: Our designs are inspired by the latest fashion trends, so you can stay stylish and on-trend.\n* **Sustainable fashion**: We\'re committed to reducing our environmental impact and promoting sustainable fashion practices.\n\nShop our new collection now and experience the best of Roddies Fashion!\n\n#RoddiesFashion #NewCollection #TrendingNow #FashionForward #SustainableFashion #AffordableLuxury #HighQualityMaterials #LatestTrends #MustHaveItems #FashionLovers #StyleInspiration #FacebookFashion #TrendyClothing #Fashionista #OnlineShopping #FashionBrand #RoddiesFashionCollection', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-26 11:39:00', '2025-12-26 11:39:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 35, '2025-12-26 11:39:12', '2025-12-26 11:39:12'),
(362, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'Party wear for men can vary depending on the type of party, the dress code, and personal style. Here are some popular and stylish options:\n\n**Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Tuxedos**: A classic choice for black-tie events, tuxedos are a must-have for formal parties. Pair with a bow tie, cummerbund, and patent leather shoes.\n2. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit in navy, black, or gray is perfect for formal parties. Choose a slim-fit style and pair with a dress shirt, tie, and dress shoes.\n3. **Dinner Jackets**: A dinner jacket is a versatile option for formal parties. It can be paired with a dress shirt, trousers, and dress shoes.\n\n**Semi-Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer is a great option for semi-formal parties. Pair with a dress shirt, dark jeans, and dress shoes.\n2. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt with a pair of dark jeans and dress shoes is a stylish and comfortable option.\n3. **Chinos**: Chinos are a versatile option for semi-formal parties. Pair with a dress shirt, blazer, and dress shoes.\n\n**Casual Party Wear:**\n\n1. **T-Shirts**: A graphic T-shirt or a plain white T-shirt is a great option for casual parties. Pair with jeans and sneakers.\n2. **Polos**: A polo shirt is a classic choice for casual parties. Pair with jeans and sneakers.\n3. **Jeans**: A pair of dark jeans is a must-have for casual parties. Pair with a T-shirt or a polo shirt and sneakers.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch is a stylish accessory that can add a touch of elegance to any outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks are a great way to add a personal touch to a dress shirt.\n3. **Hats**: A hat can add a stylish touch to any outfit. Choose from fedoras, panama hats, or baseball caps.\n4. **Shoes**: Dress shoes, sneakers, or boots can make or break an outfit. Choose a pair that complements your outfit.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Dress according to the theme**: Make sure to dress according to the party theme to avoid standing out in a bad way.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure your clothes fit well to avoid looking sloppy or uncomfortable.\n3. **Accessories can make or break an outfit**: Choose accessories that complement your outfit and add a personal touch.\n4. **Grooming is key**: Make sure to groom yourself well, including your hair, beard, and nails, to complete your party look.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-26 12:40:00', '2025-12-26 12:40:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2025-12-26 12:40:11', '2025-12-26 12:40:11'),
(363, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn for formal occasions, such as business meetings, weddings, and other special events. Here are some key characteristics of a formal shirt for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic dress shirt with a collar and cuffs, typically made of cotton or a cotton-blend fabric.\n2. **Button-Down Shirt:** A dress shirt with a button-down collar, which is a collar that is fastened to the shirt with buttons.\n3. **Wing-Tip Shirt:** A dress shirt with a wing-tip collar, which is a collar that is pointed and starched to stand up.\n4. **Tuxedo Shirt:** A formal shirt designed to be worn with a tuxedo, typically made of cotton or silk and featuring a wing-tip collar and French cuffs.\n\n**Features of a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Collar Style:** Formal shirts often feature a pointed collar, a spread collar, or a wing-tip collar.\n2. **Cuff Style:** Formal shirts may feature French cuffs, which are cuffs that are fastened with cufflinks, or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric:** Formal shirts are often made of high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit:** Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the chest and sleeves.\n5. **Details:** Formal shirts may feature details such as a breast pocket, a yoke (a piece of fabric that runs across the back of the shirt), and a pleat (a fold in the fabric) at the back of the shirt.\n\n**How to Choose a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the Occasion:** Choose a shirt that is appropriate for the occasion. For example, a tuxedo shirt is best suited for formal events such as black-tie weddings.\n2. **Think About Your Skin Tone:** If you have a cool skin tone, look for shirts with a blue or purple base color. If you have a warm skin tone, look for shirts with a yellow or golden base color.\n3. **Consider Your Body Type:** If you have a larger build, look for shirts with a relaxed fit. If you have a slim build, look for shirts with a slim fit.\n4. **Pay Attention to Details:** Consider the details of the shirt, such as the collar style, cuff style, and fabric.\n\n**Brands that Offer Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Tom Ford:** Known for their high-quality, stylish formal shirts.\n2. **Ralph Lauren:** Offers a range of formal shirts with a classic, preppy style.\n3. **Armani:** Features sleek, modern formal shirts with a focus on luxury fabrics.\n4. **Brooks Brothers:** Offers traditional, high-quality formal shirts with a classic fit.\n5. **Hugo Boss:** Features stylish, modern formal shirts with a focus on comfort and quality.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-26 12:56:00', '2025-12-26 12:56:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2025-12-26 12:56:13', '2025-12-26 12:56:13');
