(384, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', 'Here\'s a relatable caption for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Stay on Top of Your Fashion Game with Roddies!**\n\nHere are a few reasons why you\'ll love shopping with us:\n* Affordable prices without compromising on quality\n* Latest fashion trends to keep you stylish and up-to-date\n* Wide range of collections to suit every taste and preference\n* Excellent customer service to ensure a seamless shopping experience\n\n**Follow us for:**\n* Exclusive promotions and discounts\n* Behind-the-scenes glimpses of our design process\n* Style tips and advice from our fashion experts\n* New arrivals and restocks to keep your wardrobe fresh\n\n#RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForward #StyleInspiration #AffordableLuxury #QualityMatters #CustomerFirst #FashionLovers #ShoppingSpree #NewArrivals #FashionTrends #MustHaves #WardrobeEssentials\n\nNote: The hashtags used are a mix of niche-specific (#RoddiesFashion, #FashionForward) and broader, trending hashtags (#TrendingNow, #FashionLovers) to reach a wider audience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-27 15:24:00', '2025-12-27 15:24:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2025-12-27 15:24:11', '2025-12-27 15:24:11'),
