(424, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of materials such as ceramic, clay, plastic, or wood. Flower pots come in a wide range of shapes, sizes, and designs, from simple and functional to decorative and ornate.\n\nSome common types of flower pots include:\n\n1. Terracotta pots: Made from natural clay, these pots are breathable and suitable for plants that prefer well-draining soil.\n2. Ceramic pots: Made from clay and other minerals, these pots are often glazed and come in a variety of colors and designs.\n3. Plastic pots: Lightweight and inexpensive, plastic pots are often used for indoor plants and are easy to clean.\n4. Wooden pots: Made from natural wood, these pots can add a rustic touch to outdoor spaces.\n5. Self-watering pots: These pots have a built-in water reservoir that allows plants to draw water as needed, reducing the need for frequent watering.\n\nFlower pots can be used for a variety of plants, including:\n\n* Houseplants\n* Herbs\n* Vegetables\n* Flowers\n* Succulents\n\nWhen choosing a flower pot, consider the following factors:\n\n* Size: Choose a pot that is large enough to hold the plant\'s roots and provide enough soil volume.\n* Material: Select a pot that is suitable for the plant\'s needs and the climate.\n* Drainage: Ensure the pot has adequate drainage holes to prevent waterlogged soil.\n* Style: Choose a pot that fits your decorative style and complements the surrounding environment.\n\nOverall, flower pots are a great way to add some greenery to your space, whether indoors or outdoors, and can be a fun and creative way to express your personal style.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-29 18:07:00', '2025-12-29 18:07:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2025-12-29 18:07:11', '2025-12-29 18:07:11'),
(425, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'It seems like you\'re asking for the days of the week, but starting from Monday (a weekday) and including the phrase \"Good Morning Like\" is not entirely clear. However, I can list the days of the week for you, starting from Monday:\n\n1. Monday\n2. Tuesday\n3. Wednesday\n4. Thursday\n5. Friday\n6. Saturday\n7. Sunday\n\nIf you meant something else, please clarify, and I\'ll do my best to help.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-29 18:26:00', '2025-12-29 18:26:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2025-12-29 18:26:11', '2025-12-29 18:26:11'),
(426, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:41', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and charming outfit. Sky blue is a calming and serene color that can evoke feelings of tranquility and happiness. \n\nHere are a few ideas to consider when it comes to a sky blue dress or frock:\n\n1. **Summer outfit**: A sky blue dress is perfect for warm weather. You can wear it to a garden party, a picnic, or a casual day out with friends.\n2. **Floral patterns**: Consider a sky blue dress with white or yellow floral patterns to add a touch of whimsy and romance.\n3. **Accessories**: Pair your sky blue dress with neutral-colored shoes, such as beige or white sandals, and add some simple jewelry like a pair of stud earrings or a delicate necklace.\n4. **Style options**: You can wear a sky blue dress in various styles, such as a flowy maxi dress, a fitted bodycon dress, or a cute sundress with a full skirt.\n5. **Occasion**: A sky blue dress can be suitable for various occasions, including weddings, baby showers, or everyday wear.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite way to style a sky blue dress or frock?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-29 18:41:00', '2025-12-29 18:41:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-29 18:41:11', '2025-12-29 18:41:11'),
(427, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:42', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and elegant garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a versatile color that can be suitable for various occasions, from casual everyday wear to more formal events.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of getting a sky blue dress or frock, here are a few ideas to consider:\n\n1. **Style**: Think about the style of the dress. Do you prefer a flowy, floor-length gown or a shorter, more fitted frock? Perhaps a dress with a flared skirt or a more streamlined silhouette?\n2. **Fabric**: Consider the fabric of the dress. Sky blue looks great in lightweight fabrics like cotton, silk, or chiffon. You could also opt for a dress with a bit of texture, like lace or embroidery.\n3. **Accessories**: Think about how you can accessorize your sky blue dress. A pair of neutral-colored sandals or heels could complement the dress nicely. You could also add a statement piece of jewelry, like a bold necklace or earrings, to add some visual interest.\n4. **Occasion**: What\'s the occasion for the dress? If it\'s for a formal event, you might want to opt for a more elegant, floor-length gown. For a casual gathering, a shorter, more relaxed frock could be a great choice.\n\nSome popular ways to style a sky blue dress or frock include:\n\n* Pairing it with neutral-colored shoes and accessories for a chic, everyday look\n* Adding a pop of color with a bright scarf or belt\n* Wearing it with a denim jacket or cardigan for a more casual, layered look\n* Accessorizing with metallic jewelry, like gold or silver, for a more glamorous touch\n\nOverall, a sky blue dress or frock is a beautiful and versatile garment that can be styled in many different ways.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-29 18:42:00', '2025-12-29 18:42:09', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-29 18:42:09', '2025-12-29 18:42:09'),
(428, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:43', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and charming garment. Sky blue is a calming and serene color that can evoke feelings of happiness and tranquility. \n\nHere are a few ideas that come to mind when thinking about a sky blue dress or frock:\n\n1. **Summer outfit**: A sky blue dress is perfect for warm weather, as it\'s light, airy, and can keep you cool. You could pair it with sandals, sunglasses, and a wide-brimmed hat for a chic and relaxed look.\n2. **Floral patterns**: Sky blue looks great with floral patterns, especially if the flowers are white, yellow, or pale pink. A flowy sky blue dress with floral embroidery or prints could be a beautiful and feminine choice.\n3. **Beachy vibes**: A sky blue frock could be a great beach cover-up or a casual, laid-back dress for a seaside vacation. You could add some nautical-themed accessories, like anchors or ropes, to give it a playful touch.\n4. **Vintage inspiration**: Sky blue was a popular color for dresses in the 1950s and 1960s. If you\'re looking for a vintage-inspired look, you could opt for a sky blue dress with a full skirt, a fitted waist, and a cute pair of heels.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite way to style a sky blue dress or frock? Do you have any specific occasion or theme in mind?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-29 18:43:00', '2025-12-29 18:43:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2025-12-29 18:43:11', '2025-12-29 18:43:11'),
