(430, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:57', 'A pen is a writing instrument used to apply ink to a surface, typically paper, to create written words or drawings. It consists of a nib or tip that dispenses ink onto the paper as the user moves it. There are various types of pens, including:\n\n1. Ballpoint pens: These use a small metal ball to dispense ink onto the paper.\n2. Rollerball pens: Similar to ballpoint pens, but use a water-based ink that flows more smoothly.\n3. Fountain pens: These use a nib to dispense ink from an ink reservoir, often filled with liquid ink.\n4. Felt-tip pens: Also known as markers, these have a porous tip that absorbs and releases ink.\n5. Gel pens: These use a water-based ink that is suspended in a gel-like substance.\n\nPens have been a crucial tool for writing and communication throughout history, and continue to be an essential tool for many people today.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-30 11:57:00', '2025-12-30 11:57:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 16, '2025-12-30 11:57:11', '2025-12-30 11:57:11'),
(431, 'Auto Post for instagram at 11:59', 'A \"pen packet\" is a term used in the context of postal services and mail handling. It refers to a small bundle or packet of mail that is held together with a rubber band or a clip, typically containing letters, bills, or other documents.\n\nIn the past, postal workers would often use pens or pencils to keep track of the number of items in a packet, hence the name \"pen packet.\" The term has since become a standard way to refer to these small bundles of mail.\n\nPen packets are often used by mail sorters and postal workers to keep related items together, making it easier to process and deliver the mail. They can contain a variety of items, such as:\n\n* Letters and bills\n* Statements and invoices\n* Catalogs and brochures\n* Postcards and greeting cards\n\nOverall, the term \"pen packet\" is a convenient way to refer to a small collection of mail items that are bundled together for easy handling and delivery.', '[\"instagram\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-30 11:59:00', '2025-12-30 11:59:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen_Packet?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 17, '2025-12-30 11:59:10', '2025-12-30 11:59:10'),
(432, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:59', 'A \"pen packet\" is a term used in the context of postal services and mail handling. It refers to a small bundle or packet of mail that is held together with a rubber band or a clip, typically containing letters, bills, or other documents.\n\nIn the past, postal workers would often use pens or pencils to keep track of the number of items in a packet, hence the name \"pen packet.\" The term has since become a standard way to refer to these small bundles of mail.\n\nPen packets are often used by mail sorters and postal workers to keep related items together, making it easier to process and deliver the mail. They can contain a variety of items, such as:\n\n* Letters and bills\n* Statements and invoices\n* Catalogs and brochures\n* Postcards and greeting cards\n\nOverall, the term \"pen packet\" is a convenient way to refer to a small collection of mail items that are bundled together for easy handling and delivery.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-30 11:59:00', '2025-12-30 11:59:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen_Packet?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 17, '2025-12-30 11:59:10', '2025-12-30 11:59:10'),
(433, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:05', 'A bicycle, also known as a bike, is a human-powered or motor-powered, pedal-driven, single-track vehicle, having two wheels attached to a frame, one behind the other. Bicycles are a popular mode of transportation, recreation, and sport.\n\nHere are some key aspects of bicycles:\n\n1. **Types of Bicycles**: There are several types of bicycles, including:\n	* Road bikes: designed for speed and efficiency on paved roads.\n	* Mountain bikes: designed for off-road riding, with features like suspension and wide tires.\n	* Hybrid bikes: a combination of road and mountain bikes, suitable for commuting and casual riding.\n	* Commuter bikes: designed for daily commuting, often with features like fenders and luggage racks.\n	* Recumbent bikes: designed for comfort and relaxation, with a reclined seating position.\n2. **Components**: A bicycle typically consists of:\n	* Frame: the main structure of the bike.\n	* Wheels: the round, rotating components that make contact with the ground.\n	* Pedals: the platforms that the rider presses to propel the bike.\n	* Gears: the system that allows the rider to adjust the difficulty of pedaling.\n	* Brakes: the system that allows the rider to slow or stop the bike.\n3. **Benefits**: Bicycles offer numerous benefits, including:\n	* Environmental benefits: bicycles produce no emissions or pollution.\n	* Health benefits: cycling can improve cardiovascular fitness, strengthen muscles, and boost mental health.\n	* Cost-effective: bicycles are a relatively inexpensive mode of transportation.\n	* Fun and recreational: cycling can be an enjoyable and exciting activity.\n4. **Safety**: Bicycle safety is an important consideration, with risks like:\n	* Accidents: collisions with vehicles, pedestrians, or other obstacles.\n	* Injuries: falls, crashes, or other incidents that can cause harm.\n	* Theft: bicycles can be stolen if not properly secured.\n\nOverall, bicycles are a popular and versatile mode of transportation, recreation, and sport, offering numerous benefits and opportunities for fun and adventure.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-30 12:05:00', '2025-12-30 12:05:09', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 18, '2025-12-30 12:05:09', '2025-12-30 12:05:09'),
