(435, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:34', 'A ball can refer to many things, such as:\n\n1. A sphere or round object, often used in sports like basketball, soccer, or tennis.\n2. A formal dance, like a ballroom dance.\n3. A metal ball used in ball bearings.\n4. A ball of yarn or thread.\n\nWhat kind of ball are you thinking of?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-30 12:34:00', '2025-12-30 12:34:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 20, '2025-12-30 12:34:10', '2025-12-30 12:34:10'),
(436, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Party Wear for Men: A Comprehensive Guide**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, there are numerous options to choose from, depending on the occasion, theme, and personal style. Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n### Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Suits**: A classic choice for formal parties, suits can be paired with a dress shirt, tie, and dress shoes.\n2. **Tuxedos**: Perfect for black-tie events, tuxedos are a stylish and sophisticated option.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A crisp, white dress shirt is a versatile option that can be paired with a suit or trousers.\n\n### Semi-Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to a pair of trousers and a dress shirt.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dress pants in neutral colors like black, navy, or gray can be paired with a dress shirt and a blazer.\n3. **Polos**: A polo shirt is a great option for a semi-formal party, and can be paired with dress pants or jeans.\n\n### Casual Party Wear\n\n1. **Jeans**: A pair of dark wash jeans is a versatile option that can be dressed up or down.\n2. **T-Shirts**: A plain or graphic t-shirt is a great option for a casual party.\n3. **Hoodies**: A hoodie can add a touch of casual style to a pair of jeans and a t-shirt.\n\n### Accessories\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch can add a touch of elegance to a party outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of sophistication to a dress shirt.\n3. **Shoes**: Dress shoes, loafers, or boots can complete a party outfit.\n\n### Tips\n\n1. **Dress according to the theme**: Make sure to dress according to the theme of the party to avoid sticking out like a sore thumb.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure your clothes fit well to avoid looking sloppy or uncomfortable.\n3. **Accessories can make or break an outfit**: Choose accessories that complement your outfit and add a touch of personality to your look.\n\n### Popular Party Wear Brands for Men\n\n1. **Armani**: Known for their sleek and sophisticated designs.\n2. **Hugo Boss**: Offers a range of stylish and elegant party wear options.\n3. **Ted Baker**: Provides a unique and quirky take on party wear.\n4. **Zara**: Offers a range of affordable and stylish party wear options.\n5. **Gucci**: Known for their bold and eclectic designs.\n\nRemember, the key to pulling off a great party outfit is to feel confident and comfortable in what you\'re wearing. Experiment with different styles and find what works best for you!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-30 12:40:00', '2025-12-30 12:40:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2025-12-30 12:40:11', '2025-12-30 12:40:11'),
(437, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:45', 'Shoes. There are so many types, styles, and purposes when it comes to shoes. Here are a few examples:\n\n1. **Sneakers**: Designed for athletic activities, sneakers are often made of breathable materials and have cushioning for comfort.\n2. **Boots**: From ankle boots to knee-high boots, this style can be dressed up or down and is suitable for various occasions.\n3. **Sandals**: Perfect for warm weather, sandals can range from casual flip-flops to more elegant designs.\n4. **Loafers**: Slip-on shoes that can be dressed up or down, loafers are often made of leather and are suitable for business or formal events.\n5. **High heels**: Designed to elevate the foot, high heels can add a touch of elegance to any outfit.\n6. **Hiking boots**: Sturdy and waterproof, hiking boots are designed for outdoor adventures and provide support and protection for the feet.\n7. **Dance shoes**: From ballet flats to dance sneakers, these shoes are designed for specific types of dance and provide the necessary support and flexibility.\n8. **Work shoes**: Designed for specific occupations, work shoes can include steel-toed boots, chef shoes, or medical shoes, among others.\n\nWhat type of shoes are you interested in? Or would you like to know more about a specific style?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-30 12:45:00', '2025-12-30 12:45:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Shoes?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 21, '2025-12-30 12:45:13', '2025-12-30 12:45:13'),
(438, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key characteristics of a formal shirt for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic dress shirt with a point or spread collar, French cuffs, and a fitted silhouette.\n2. **Business Shirt:** A more relaxed version of the dress shirt, often with a button-down collar and button cuffs.\n3. **Tuxedo Shirt:** A formal shirt with a wingtip collar and French cuffs, designed to be worn with a tuxedo.\n\n**Features of a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Collar Style:** Point, spread, or wingtip collars are common in formal shirts.\n2. **Cuff Style:** French cuffs or button cuffs are typical in formal shirts.\n3. **Fabric:** High-quality cotton, linen, or silk fabrics are often used for formal shirts.\n4. **Fit:** Formal shirts are designed to fit closely, with a slim silhouette and a fitted waist.\n5. **Buttons:** Mother-of-pearl or plastic buttons are commonly used in formal shirts.\n6. **Pockets:** Formal shirts often have a breast pocket, but may not have any other pockets.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White:** A classic choice for formal shirts, white is a versatile and timeless option.\n2. **Light Blue:** A light blue shirt is a popular alternative to white, and can add a touch of personality to a formal outfit.\n3. **Stripes:** Thin stripes or subtle patterns can add visual interest to a formal shirt.\n4. **Checks:** Small checks or subtle patterns can add texture and depth to a formal shirt.\n\n**Tips for Wearing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Pair with a suit:** A formal shirt is typically worn with a suit and tie for a complete formal look.\n2. **Choose the right collar:** Select a collar style that complements your face shape and personal style.\n3. **Pay attention to fit:** Ensure the shirt fits closely, but not too tightly, to create a streamlined silhouette.\n4. **Accessories:** Add a tie, pocket square, and cufflinks to complete your formal look.\n\n**Popular Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink:** Known for their high-quality, stylish formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet:** A French luxury brand offering exquisite formal shirts.\n3. **Brooks Brothers:** A classic American brand with a wide range of formal shirts.\n4. **Armani:** A stylish and sophisticated brand offering formal shirts with a touch of Italian flair.\n\nRemember, a formal shirt is a timeless piece that can be worn for many occasions, so invest in a high-quality shirt that fits well and makes you feel confident and stylish.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2025-12-30 12:56:00', '2025-12-30 12:56:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2025-12-30 12:56:11', '2025-12-30 12:56:11'),
