(493, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:39', 'Here\'s a sample post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Introducing Our Latest Collection**\n\nAt Roddies Fashion, we\'re committed to providing you with the latest trends and styles. Here are some key features of our new collection:\n\n* Exquisite designs to make you stand out from the crowd\n* High-quality fabrics for maximum comfort and durability\n* Affordable prices without compromising on style\n* Perfect for any occasion, whether it\'s a casual day out or a formal event\n\nStay ahead of the fashion game with Roddies Fashion! #FashionTrends #RoddiesFashion #NewCollection #StyleInspo #TrendingNow #FashionForward #MustHaves #LatestFashion #FashionLovers #RoddiesStyle\n\nNote: The hashtags used are a mix of niche-specific (fashion) and broader, trending hashtags to increase visibility and reach a wider audience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-02 11:39:00', '2026-01-02 11:39:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 35, '2026-01-02 11:39:12', '2026-01-02 11:39:12'),
(494, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'Here are some party wear ideas for men:\n\n**Formal Parties:**\n\n1. **Tuxedos**: A classic choice for formal events, tuxedos are a must-have for black-tie parties.\n2. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit in navy, black, or gray is perfect for formal parties.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: Pair a dress shirt with a suit and tie for a sophisticated look.\n4. **Bow Ties**: Add a touch of elegance with a bow tie.\n\n**Semi-Formal Parties:**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to a casual outfit.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Pair dress pants with a button-down shirt and blazer for a stylish look.\n3. **Polos**: A polo shirt is a great alternative to a dress shirt.\n4. **Loafers**: Slip-on loafers or dress shoes can complete a semi-formal outfit.\n\n**Casual Parties:**\n\n1. **Jeans**: A pair of dark-washed jeans is perfect for a casual party.\n2. **T-Shirts**: A plain or graphic t-shirt is a great option for a casual party.\n3. **Hoodies**: A hoodie can add a relaxed touch to a casual outfit.\n4. **Sneakers**: Sneakers are perfect for a casual party, especially if it\'s a outdoor event.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n1. **Watches**: A leather strap watch can add a touch of sophistication to a formal outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of elegance to a dress shirt.\n3. **Pocket Squares**: A pocket square can add a pop of color to a suit.\n4. **Hats**: A fedora or a panama hat can add a stylish touch to a casual outfit.\n\n**Seasonal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Summer**: Light-colored suits, linen shirts, and sandals are perfect for summer parties.\n2. **Winter**: Thick coats, scarves, and gloves can keep you warm and stylish during winter parties.\n3. **Spring**: Pastel-colored shirts, lightweight suits, and loafers are great for spring parties.\n4. **Fall**: Earthy-toned suits, flannel shirts, and boots are perfect for fall parties.\n\nRemember, the key to dressing well for a party is to be confident and comfortable in what you\'re wearing. Choose an outfit that reflects your personal style and the theme of the party.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-02 12:40:00', '2026-01-02 12:40:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-01-02 12:40:13', '2026-01-02 12:40:13'),
(495, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn for business, formal, or special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts typically have a point collar, spread collar, or a wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or barrel cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are usually made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the chest and waist.\n5. **Button-front**: Formal shirts usually have a button-front closure.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Dress shirt**: A classic formal shirt with a point collar and French cuffs.\n2. **Business shirt**: A formal shirt with a spread collar and barrel cuffs.\n3. **Tuxedo shirt**: A formal shirt with a wingtip collar and French cuffs, designed to be worn with a tuxedo.\n4. **Dinner shirt**: A formal shirt with a starched front and a wingtip collar, designed to be worn for formal dinners.\n5. **Wedding shirt**: A formal shirt with a special design or embroidery, designed to be worn for weddings.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White**: A classic color for formal shirts.\n2. **Light blue**: A popular color for formal shirts.\n3. **Pastel colors**: Soft pastel colors such as pink, lavender, and peach are also popular for formal shirts.\n4. **Stripes**: Thin stripes are a classic pattern for formal shirts.\n5. **Checks**: Small checks are also a popular pattern for formal shirts.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Tom Ford**: Known for their high-quality and stylish formal shirts.\n2. **Armani**: Offers a range of formal shirts with a focus on style and comfort.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: A classic American brand that offers high-quality formal shirts.\n4. **Thomas Pink**: A British brand that offers a range of formal shirts with a focus on quality and style.\n5. **Charvet**: A French brand that offers high-quality formal shirts with a focus on luxury and elegance.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Choose a shirt that fits well**: A well-fitting shirt is essential for a formal look.\n2. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a shirt that is suitable for the occasion, such as a tuxedo shirt for a black-tie event.\n3. **Pay attention to details**: Look for shirts with high-quality details such as mother-of-pearl buttons and precise stitching.\n4. **Iron your shirt**: Make sure to iron your shirt before wearing it to ensure a crisp and smooth look.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-02 12:56:00', '2026-01-02 12:56:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-01-02 12:56:13', '2026-01-02 12:56:13'),
