(497, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', 'Here\'s a post for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n**Introducing Our Latest Collection**\n\nAt Roddies Fashion, we understand that fashion is not just about clothes, but about expressing yourself and feeling confident. Here are some key points about our latest collection:\n\n* **Affordable Luxury**: Our collection offers high-quality, trendy pieces at affordable prices.\n* **Sustainable Fashion**: We use eco-friendly materials and practices to minimize our environmental footprint.\n* **Inclusive Sizing**: Our collection caters to a wide range of sizes, because fashion is for everyone.\n* **Timeless Designs**: Our pieces are designed to be timeless, so you can wear them for years to come.\n\nFollow us for the latest updates, behind-the-scenes insights, and styling tips! #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #SustainableFashion #FashionForAll #LuxuryOnABudget #NewCollection #MustHave #FashionLovers #StyleInspo #FacebookFashion #FashionBrand #OnlineShopping #FashionTrends #LatestFashion #FashionStyle #WomensFashion #MensFashion', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-02 15:10:00', '2026-01-02 15:10:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-01-02 15:10:10', '2026-01-02 15:10:10'),
