(523, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'Here are the weekdays and weekend days in a post \"Good Morning, Like\" format:\n\nGood Morning, Like Monday\nGood Morning, Like Tuesday\nGood Morning, Like Wednesday\nGood Morning, Like Thursday\nGood Morning, Like Friday\nGood Morning, Like Saturday\nGood Morning, Like Sunday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-03 18:26:00', '2026-01-03 18:26:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2026-01-03 18:26:11', '2026-01-03 18:26:11'),
(524, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:41', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and charming garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a versatile color that can be suitable for various occasions, from casual everyday wear to more formal events.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of creating or wearing a sky blue dress or frock, here are a few ideas to consider:\n\n1. **Design and style**: You could opt for a flowy, floor-length dress with a relaxed fit, or a more fitted, knee-length frock with a flirty skirt. The style ultimately depends on your personal preference and the occasion.\n2. **Fabric**: Choose a comfortable, breathable fabric like cotton, linen, or silk. These materials will help keep you cool and comfortable while wearing the dress.\n3. **Accessories**: Add some complementary accessories like white or neutral-colored shoes, a simple necklace, or a pair of earrings to enhance the overall look.\n4. **Occasion**: A sky blue dress or frock can be suitable for various events, such as a summer wedding, a garden party, or a casual day out with friends.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses and frocks include:\n\n* **Boho chic**: A flowy, maxi dress with embroidery or lace details.\n* **Vintage-inspired**: A fitted, knee-length frock with a full skirt and a nostalgic touch.\n* **Modern minimalist**: A simple, shift dress with a clean design and minimal embellishments.\n\nOverall, a sky blue dress or frock can be a beautiful and elegant addition to your wardrobe.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-03 18:41:00', '2026-01-03 18:41:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-03 18:41:11', '2026-01-03 18:41:11'),
(525, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:42', 'A sky blue dress or frock can be a beautiful and charming garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a versatile color that can suit various skin tones and personalities.\n\nHere are a few ideas to style a sky blue dress or frock:\n\n1. **Add white accents**: Pair your sky blue dress with white shoes, a white hat, or a white belt to create a crisp and clean look.\n2. **Embellish with florals**: Sky blue and floral patterns can create a lovely combination. Look for a dress with floral embroidery or add a floral scarf to give your outfit a pop of color.\n3. **Go for a bohemian look**: Sky blue dresses can have a bohemian vibe when paired with sandals, a floppy hat, and layered necklaces.\n4. **Dress it up or down**: A sky blue dress can be dressed up or down depending on the occasion. Add some heels and statement jewelry for a more formal look, or pair it with sneakers and a denim jacket for a casual outing.\n5. **Play with textures**: Mix different textures like cotton, lace, or crochet to add depth and interest to your sky blue dress.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses include:\n\n* **A-line dresses**: A classic A-line dress in sky blue can be a timeless and flattering choice.\n* **Maxi dresses**: A flowy maxi dress in sky blue can be perfect for a summer evening or a beach wedding.\n* **Bodycon dresses**: A fitted sky blue dress can be a great option for a night out or a special occasion.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite way to style a sky blue dress or frock?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-03 18:42:00', '2026-01-03 18:42:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-03 18:42:10', '2026-01-03 18:42:10'),
(526, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:43', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds beautiful and refreshing. Sky blue is a calming and serene color that can evoke feelings of tranquility and happiness. It\'s a great choice for a dress or frock, especially for spring and summer seasons.\n\nIf you\'re looking for ideas on how to style a sky blue dress or frock, here are a few suggestions:\n\n1. Pair it with neutral accessories: Sky blue looks great with neutral colors like white, beige, or brown. You can add a pair of sandals, a straw hat, or a woven basket bag to complete the look.\n2. Add some greenery: Sky blue and green is a great color combination. You can add a green scarf, a floral crown, or a sprig of fresh rosemary to give your outfit a pop of color.\n3. Go for a bohemian look: Sky blue is a great color for a bohemian-inspired outfit. You can pair the dress or frock with a pair of ankle boots, a floppy hat, and a fringe bag for a chic and eclectic look.\n4. Keep it simple: Sometimes, less is more. You can keep the outfit simple by pairing the sky blue dress or frock with a pair of sneakers or ballet flats and a simple necklace or earrings.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite way to style a sky blue dress or frock?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-03 18:43:00', '2026-01-03 18:43:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-03 18:43:12', '2026-01-03 18:43:12'),
