(545, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n**Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-tailored suit in black, navy, or gray is a classic choice for formal parties.\n2. **Tuxedos**: A tuxedo is perfect for black-tie events, with a bow tie and cummerbund.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A crisp, white dress shirt with a slim collar is a must-have for formal parties.\n4. **Dress Pants**: Formal dress pants in black, navy, or gray are a great match for a dress shirt and blazer.\n\n**Semi-Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer in a bold color or pattern can add a stylish touch to a dress shirt and jeans.\n2. **Dress Shoes**: Dress shoes in leather or suede can elevate a casual outfit to semi-formal.\n3. **Chinos**: Chinos in light or dark colors are a versatile choice for semi-formal parties.\n4. **Polo Shirts**: A polo shirt in a bold color or pattern can add a stylish touch to a pair of chinos or jeans.\n\n**Casual Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Graphic T-Shirts**: A graphic t-shirt with a fun design or slogan can be a great conversation starter.\n2. **Jeans**: A pair of dark-washed jeans is a classic choice for casual parties.\n3. **Sneakers**: Sneakers in bold colors or designs can add a stylish touch to a casual outfit.\n4. **Hoodies**: A hoodie in a bold color or design can be a great layering piece for a casual party.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n1. **Watches**: A leather or metal watch can add a touch of sophistication to a formal or semi-formal outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks in a bold design or color can add a stylish touch to a dress shirt.\n3. **Pocket Squares**: A pocket square in a bold color or pattern can add a stylish touch to a blazer or suit.\n4. **Hats**: A fedora or panama hat can add a stylish touch to a semi-formal or casual outfit.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Dress according to the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the party theme and dress code.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Ensure that your clothes fit well and are not too tight or too loose.\n3. **Accessories can make or break an outfit**: Choose accessories that complement your outfit and add a touch of personality.\n4. **Be confident**: Own your look and have fun!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-05 12:40:00', '2026-01-05 12:40:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-01-05 12:40:13', '2026-01-05 12:40:13'),
(546, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key characteristics of a formal shirt for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic dress shirt with a point or spread collar, French cuffs, and a fitted silhouette.\n2. **Business Shirt:** A more relaxed version of the dress shirt, often with a button-down collar and button cuffs.\n3. **Tuxedo Shirt:** A special type of formal shirt designed to be worn with a tuxedo, typically with a wingtip collar and French cuffs.\n\n**Features of a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Collar Style:** Point, spread, or wingtip collars are common in formal shirts.\n2. **Cuff Style:** French cuffs or button cuffs are typical in formal shirts.\n3. **Fabric:** Formal shirts are often made from high-quality cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit:** Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim silhouette.\n5. **Buttons:** Formal shirts often feature mother-of-pearl or plastic buttons.\n6. **Pockets:** Formal shirts usually do not have pockets, or have a small breast pocket.\n\n** Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White:** A classic choice for formal shirts, white is a versatile and timeless option.\n2. **Light Blue:** A popular alternative to white, light blue is a common choice for business and formal events.\n3. **Pastel Colors:** Soft pink, baby blue, and other pastel colors are often used for formal shirts.\n4. **Stripes:** Thin stripes, such as pinstripes or regimental stripes, can add visual interest to a formal shirt.\n5. **Checks:** Small checks, such as gingham or windowpane, can add a touch of personality to a formal shirt.\n\n**Tips for Choosing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion:** Choose a shirt that matches the formality of the event.\n2. **Think about your skin tone:** Select a color that complements your skin tone.\n3. **Pay attention to fit:** Make sure the shirt fits well and is not too tight or too loose.\n4. **Accessories:** Pair your formal shirt with a tie, cufflinks, and other accessories to complete your look.\n\n**Brands and Prices:**\n\n1. **Luxury Brands:** Designer brands like Tom Ford, Ralph Lauren, and Gucci offer high-end formal shirts with prices ranging from $100 to $500.\n2. **Mid-range Brands:** Brands like Brooks Brothers, J.Crew, and Banana Republic offer high-quality formal shirts at prices between $50 to $200.\n3. **Affordable Brands:** Brands like H&M, Uniqlo, and Gap offer more affordable formal shirts with prices starting from $10 to $50.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-05 12:56:00', '2026-01-05 12:56:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-01-05 12:56:13', '2026-01-05 12:56:13'),
