(562, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:57', 'A pen is a common writing instrument used to apply ink to a surface, such as paper, to create written characters, drawings, or other marks. It typically consists of a nib or tip that dispenses ink onto the surface as the user moves it. Pens can be categorized into several types, including:\n\n1. Ballpoint pens: These use a small metal ball to dispense ink onto the paper.\n2. Rollerball pens: Similar to ballpoint pens, but use a water-based ink that flows more smoothly.\n3. Fountain pens: These use a nib to deliver ink to the paper and are often considered more elegant and precise.\n4. Gel pens: These use a water-based ink that is suspended in a gel-like substance, creating a range of line widths and styles.\n5. Fineliners: These are precise pens used for technical drawing, illustration, and other applications where fine lines are required.\n\nPens have been used for centuries and have evolved over time to become an essential tool for writing, art, and communication.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 11:57:00', '2026-01-06 11:57:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 16, '2026-01-06 11:57:11', '2026-01-06 11:57:11'),
(563, 'Auto Post for instagram at 11:59', 'A \"pen packet\" is a term that has been used in various contexts, but its meaning can be somewhat ambiguous without more information. Here are a few possible interpretations:\n\n1. **Package of pens**: In a literal sense, a pen packet could refer to a small package or bundle containing one or more pens, often sold together as a set.\n2. **Correctional facility term**: In some correctional facilities, a \"pen packet\" refers to a package of personal items, such as clothing, toiletries, or writing materials, that an inmate is allowed to receive or purchase.\n3. **Historical context**: In the past, a \"pen packet\" might have referred to a small bundle of letters or correspondence, possibly tied together with a ribbon or string, that was sent to someone through the postal system.\n\nIf you have any more specific information or context about the term \"pen packet,\" I\'d be happy to try and provide a more detailed explanation.', '[\"instagram\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 11:59:00', '2026-01-06 11:59:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen_Packet?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 17, '2026-01-06 11:59:11', '2026-01-06 11:59:11'),
