(567, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:34', 'The word \"ball\" can refer to many things, such as:\n\n1. A round or spherical object, often used in sports like basketball, soccer, or tennis.\n2. A formal dance, like a ballroom dance.\n3. A unit of measurement, as in a ball of yarn or twine.\n\nWhich meaning of \"ball\" were you thinking of, or would you like to know more about a specific type of ball?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 12:34:00', '2026-01-06 12:34:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 20, '2026-01-06 12:34:10', '2026-01-06 12:34:10'),
(568, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'Here are some party wear ideas for men:\n\n**Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Tuxedos**: A classic choice for formal parties, tuxedos are a timeless and sophisticated option.\n2. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit in navy, black, or gray is a versatile and stylish choice for formal parties.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: Pair a dress shirt with a suit or a blazer for a sharp and elegant look.\n4. **Bow Ties**: Add a touch of elegance with a bow tie, perfect for formal events like weddings or black-tie parties.\n\n**Semi-Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to a casual outfit, making it perfect for semi-formal parties.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dress pants in neutral colors like beige, gray, or navy are a great option for semi-formal parties.\n3. **Button-Down Shirts**: A button-down shirt in a bold color or pattern can add a pop of personality to a semi-formal outfit.\n4. **Loafers**: Loafers are a stylish and comfortable option for semi-formal parties.\n\n**Casual Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Jeans**: A pair of dark wash jeans is a versatile and stylish option for casual parties.\n2. **T-Shirts**: A plain or graphic T-shirt can be dressed up or down depending on the occasion.\n3. **Hoodies**: A hoodie can add a casual touch to an outfit, perfect for laid-back parties.\n4. **Sneakers**: Sneakers are a comfortable and stylish option for casual parties.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch can add a touch of sophistication to an outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of elegance to a formal outfit.\n3. **Pocket Squares**: A pocket square can add a pop of color and personality to an outfit.\n4. **Belt**: A belt can help define the waist and add a touch of style to an outfit.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Dress according to the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the theme and formality of the party.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Ensure that your clothes fit well and are comfortable.\n3. **Add a personal touch**: Add a personal touch to your outfit with accessories or a bold piece of clothing.\n4. **Grooming is key**: Make sure to groom yourself well, including your hair, beard, and nails.\n\nRemember, the key to dressing well for a party is to be confident and have fun with your outfit!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 12:40:00', '2026-01-06 12:40:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-01-06 12:40:13', '2026-01-06 12:40:13'),
(569, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:45', 'Shoes are a type of footwear that people wear to protect and comfort their feet. There are many different types of shoes, including:\n\n1. **Sneakers**: casual, athletic shoes for everyday wear or sports.\n2. **Boots**: high-top shoes that cover the ankle and often the calf, for cold weather or fashion.\n3. **Sandals**: open-toe shoes for warm weather, often with straps or a heel.\n4. **Loafers**: slip-on shoes without laces, often dressy or business casual.\n5. **High heels**: shoes with a raised heel, often for dressy or formal occasions.\n6. **Flats**: shoes with a flat sole, often for comfort or casual wear.\n7. **Dress shoes**: formal shoes for special occasions, such as weddings or job interviews.\n8. **Hiking boots**: sturdy shoes for outdoor activities, such as hiking or backpacking.\n9. **Running shoes**: lightweight, cushioned shoes for running or other high-impact activities.\n10. **Dance shoes**: specialized shoes for specific dance styles, such as ballet or ballroom dance.\n\nShoes can be made from various materials, including:\n\n* Leather\n* Synthetic materials (e.g., plastic, nylon)\n* Textiles (e.g., cotton, mesh)\n* Rubber\n* Wood (e.g., wooden clogs)\n\nPeople wear shoes for many reasons, including:\n\n* Protection from rough or sharp surfaces\n* Comfort and support for their feet\n* Fashion and style\n* Athletic performance (e.g., running, basketball)\n* Occupational requirements (e.g., work boots, nurse shoes)\n\nWhat\'s your favorite type of shoe?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 12:45:00', '2026-01-06 12:45:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Shoes?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 21, '2026-01-06 12:45:17', '2026-01-06 12:45:17'),
(570, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, or special occasions. Here are some key characteristics of a formal shirt for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic, collared shirt with a button-front closure, typically made from cotton or a cotton-blend fabric.\n2. **Business Shirt:** A variation of the dress shirt, often with a more relaxed fit and a slightly softer collar.\n3. **Tuxedo Shirt:** A formal shirt specifically designed to be worn with a tuxedo, typically featuring a wingtip collar and French cuffs.\n\n**Features of a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Collar:** A formal shirt typically has a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuffs:** Formal shirts often have French cuffs, which are cuffs that are closed with cufflinks, or button cuffs.\n3. **Front:** The front of a formal shirt typically has a button-front closure, with buttons made from plastic, mother-of-pearl, or other materials.\n4. **Fit:** Formal shirts are designed to fit closely, with a slim fit through the body and sleeves.\n5. **Fabric:** Formal shirts are often made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n\n**Popular Fabrics for Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Cotton:** A popular choice for formal shirts, cotton is breathable, durable, and easy to care for.\n2. **Linen:** A natural fiber that is lightweight, breathable, and absorbent, linen is ideal for warm-weather formal events.\n3. **Silk:** A luxurious fabric that is smooth, lustrous, and elegant, silk is often used for high-end formal shirts.\n\n**Tips for Choosing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion:** Choose a formal shirt that is suitable for the occasion, taking into account the dress code and the level of formality.\n2. **Think about the color:** White, light blue, and pale pink are classic colors for formal shirts, but you can also consider other colors such as lavender or burgundy.\n3. **Pay attention to fit:** Make sure the shirt fits well, with a slim fit through the body and sleeves.\n4. **Accessories:** Don\'t forget to add a tie, cufflinks, and other accessories to complete your formal look.\n\n**Brands for Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink:** A British brand known for its high-quality, stylish formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet:** A French brand that offers luxurious, bespoke formal shirts.\n3. **Brooks Brothers:** An American brand that offers classic, high-quality formal shirts.\n4. **Armani:** An Italian brand that offers stylish, sophisticated formal shirts.\n\nI hope this information helps you choose the perfect formal shirt for your needs!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 12:56:00', '2026-01-06 12:56:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-01-06 12:56:13', '2026-01-06 12:56:13'),
