(579, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'Scheduled post for facebook at 17:46', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 17:46:00', '2026-01-06 17:46:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-01-06 17:46:16', '2026-01-06 17:46:16'),
(580, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:47', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, determination, and success. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**The Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a tailored suit, stands tall and confident on the basketball court. His attire is immaculate, with a crisp white shirt, a slim tie, and a fitted blazer that accentuates his broad shoulders. His hair is styled perfectly, and his eyes gleam with a sense of determination.\n\n**The Setting:**\nThe basketball court is dimly lit, with the only light coming from the stadium lights behind the subject. The lights cast a dramatic glow, creating deep shadows and highlighting the subject\'s features. The court itself is empty, with no other players or spectators in sight, emphasizing the subject\'s solitary focus.\n\n**The Props:**\nThe basketball in the subject\'s hand is a symbol of his competitive spirit and drive to succeed. He holds it firmly, his fingers wrapped around it with a sense of ownership and control. The ball seems to be an extension of himself, a tool that he wields with precision and skill.\n\n**The Mood:**\nThe overall mood of the image is one of confidence and success. The subject exudes a sense of self-assurance, as if he\'s already achieved his goals and is now ready to take on the next challenge. The dramatic lighting and the empty court create a sense of intimacy and focus, drawing the viewer\'s attention to the subject and his unwavering determination.\n\n**The Style:**\nThe image is shot in a high-resolution, cinematic style, with a shallow depth of field that blurs the background and emphasizes the subject\'s features. The lighting is dramatic and moody, with deep shadows and highlights that create a sense of depth and dimensionality. The overall effect is one of luxury and sophistication, as if the image were shot for a high-end advertisement or a Hollywood film.\n\n**The Message:**\nThe image conveys a powerful message about the subject\'s mindset and approach to success. He\'s a man who\'s not afraid to take risks, to step out of his comfort zone, and to push himself to achieve his goals. The basketball court, with its connotations of competition and physical challenge, serves as a metaphor for the subject\'s business career, where he must navigate obstacles and overcome adversity to emerge victorious. The image suggests that with the right mindset and attitude, anything is possible, and that success is within reach for those who dare to dream big.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 17:47:00', '2026-01-06 17:47:31', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-01-06 17:47:31', '2026-01-06 17:47:31'),
(581, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, providing them with the necessary environment to grow. Flower pots can be made from a variety of materials, including:\n\n1. Ceramic: A popular choice for flower pots, ceramic pots are durable, water-resistant, and come in a wide range of styles and designs.\n2. Terracotta: Terracotta pots are made from natural clay and are known for their rustic, earthy look. They are breathable, which can help prevent waterlogged soil.\n3. Plastic: Plastic flower pots are lightweight, affordable, and easy to clean. They are often used for indoor plants and come in a variety of colors and designs.\n4. Wood: Wooden flower pots can add a touch of natural elegance to any room. They are often made from sustainable wood sources and can be stained or painted to match any decor.\n5. Concrete: Concrete flower pots are durable and can be made in a variety of shapes and sizes. They are often used for outdoor plants and can withstand harsh weather conditions.\n\nFlower pots can be used for a wide range of plants, including:\n\n1. Flowers: As the name suggests, flower pots are often used to hold flowering plants, such as roses, daisies, and sunflowers.\n2. Herbs: Flower pots can be used to grow herbs, such as basil, mint, and rosemary, which can be used in cooking and medicine.\n3. Succulents: Succulents are a popular choice for flower pots, as they are low-maintenance and can thrive in small spaces.\n4. Vegetables: Flower pots can be used to grow vegetables, such as tomatoes, peppers, and cucumbers, which can be harvested fresh from the pot.\n\nWhen choosing a flower pot, consider the following factors:\n\n1. Size: Choose a pot that is large enough to hold the plant\'s roots and provide enough space for growth.\n2. Material: Consider the material of the pot and how it will affect the plant\'s growth. For example, terracotta pots can dry out quickly, while plastic pots may retain too much water.\n3. Drainage: Make sure the pot has adequate drainage holes to prevent waterlogged soil.\n4. Style: Choose a pot that fits your personal style and decor.\n\nOverall, flower pots are a versatile and essential tool for any gardener or plant enthusiast. They provide a convenient and attractive way to grow plants, and can add a touch of beauty and elegance to any room or outdoor space.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 18:07:00', '2026-01-06 18:07:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-01-06 18:07:13', '2026-01-06 18:07:13'),
(582, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'Here are the weekdays with a \"Good Morning\" greeting:\n\n1. Good Morning, Monday\n2. Good Morning, Tuesday\n3. Good Morning, Wednesday\n4. Good Morning, Thursday\n5. Good Morning, Friday\n6. (Note: Saturday and Sunday are typically considered weekend days, not weekdays)\n \nIf you\'d like, I can also provide the weekend days with a greeting:\n1. Good Morning, Saturday\n2. Good Morning, Sunday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 18:26:00', '2026-01-06 18:27:03', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?model=flux&width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2026-01-06 18:27:03', '2026-01-06 18:27:03'),
(583, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:41', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and elegant piece of clothing. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a popular color for dresses, especially during the spring and summer seasons.\n\nIf you\'re looking to create or purchase a sky blue dress, here are a few ideas to consider:\n\n1. **Style**: You could opt for a flowy, floor-length dress with a subtle sheen, or a shorter, more playful frock with a flirty skirt.\n2. **Fabric**: Consider using lightweight fabrics like cotton, silk, or chiffon to create a soft, airy texture that drapes beautifully.\n3. **Neckline and sleeves**: A sky blue dress could feature a delicate V-neckline, a sweetheart neckline, or even a halter neck. You could also add short sleeves, cap sleeves, or go for a sleeveless design.\n4. **Embellishments**: To add some visual interest to your dress, consider adding embellishments like white or silver embroidery, subtle sequins, or a delicate belt to cinch at the waist.\n\nSome popular occasions to wear a sky blue dress include:\n\n* Outdoor weddings or garden parties\n* Spring and summer festivals\n* Beach vacations or poolside gatherings\n* Casual daytime events, like brunch or a picnic\n\nDo you have a specific occasion in mind for your sky blue dress, or would you like some more general styling advice?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 18:41:00', '2026-01-06 18:41:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-06 18:41:12', '2026-01-06 18:41:12'),
(584, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:42', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and elegant garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a great choice for a dress, as it can create a bright and uplifting atmosphere.\n\nHere are a few ideas to consider when thinking about a sky blue dress or frock:\n\n1. **Summer outfit**: A sky blue dress is perfect for warm weather, as it can keep you cool and comfortable while looking stylish.\n2. **Floral patterns**: Consider adding some floral patterns or embroidery to your sky blue dress for a more feminine and playful touch.\n3. **Accessories**: You can pair your sky blue dress with neutral-colored accessories, such as beige or white shoes and a simple necklace, to create a chic and effortless look.\n4. **Occasion**: A sky blue dress can be suitable for various occasions, such as a garden party, a casual wedding, or a daytime event.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite style or design for a sky blue dress or frock?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 18:42:00', '2026-01-06 18:42:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-06 18:42:11', '2026-01-06 18:42:11'),
(585, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:43', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and charming garment. Sky blue is a pale and serene color that evokes feelings of calmness and tranquility. It\'s a color often associated with clear skies and sunny days.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of wearing a sky blue dress or frock, you might consider pairing it with neutral or earthy tones to create a natural and effortless look. Some suggestions for accessories or shoes that might complement a sky blue dress include:\n\n* Neutral-colored sandals or wedges\n* A pair of distressed denim jacket or a cardigan for a casual look\n* A statement piece of jewelry, such as a bold necklace or earrings, to add a pop of color\n* A woven basket bag or a straw hat to add a bohemian touch\n\nSky blue is also a versatile color that can be dressed up or down, depending on the occasion. You could wear a sky blue dress to a variety of events, such as:\n\n* A summer wedding or outdoor gathering\n* A casual brunch or lunch date\n* A music festival or outdoor concert\n* A relaxed evening out with friends\n\nDo you have a specific occasion in mind for wearing a sky blue dress, or are you just looking for some general style inspiration?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-06 18:43:00', '2026-01-06 18:43:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-06 18:43:12', '2026-01-06 18:43:12'),
