(600, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n**Formal Parties:**\n\n1. **Tuxedos**: A classic black tuxedo with a bow tie and cummerbund is perfect for formal events like weddings, galas, and award shows.\n2. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit in navy, black, or gray is a versatile option for formal parties. Pair it with a dress shirt, tie, and dress shoes.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt with a slim collar and French cuffs is a great option for formal parties. Choose from a variety of colors and patterns.\n\n**Semi-Formal Parties:**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer with a dress shirt and dark jeans is a stylish option for semi-formal parties.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dress pants in gray, navy, or black can be paired with a dress shirt and a blazer for a semi-formal look.\n3. **Polos**: A polo shirt with dress pants or chinos is a great option for semi-formal parties.\n\n**Casual Parties:**\n\n1. **T-Shirts**: A plain or graphic T-shirt with jeans or chinos is a great option for casual parties.\n2. **Chinos**: Chinos in light or dark colors can be paired with a T-shirt or a casual button-down shirt.\n3. **Hoodies**: A hoodie with jeans or sweatpants is a great option for casual parties.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n1. **Watches**: A leather or metal watch can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of elegance to a dress shirt.\n3. **Shoes**: Dress shoes, loafers, or boots can complete a party outfit.\n\n**Trends:**\n\n1. **Slim Fit**: Slim-fit clothes are a popular trend in men\'s party wear.\n2. **Bold Colors**: Bold colors like red, blue, and yellow are making a statement in men\'s party wear.\n3. **Patterns**: Patterns like stripes, checks, and florals are adding a touch of personality to men\'s party wear.\n\nRemember, the key to dressing well for a party is to be confident and comfortable in what you\'re wearing. Choose an outfit that reflects your personality and style, and don\'t be afraid to experiment with different looks!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-09 12:40:00', '2026-01-09 12:40:29', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-01-09 12:40:29', '2026-01-09 12:40:29'),
(601, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn in formal or business-casual settings. Here are some key characteristics of a formal shirt for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic dress shirt with a collar and cuffs, typically made from cotton or a cotton-blend fabric.\n2. **Business Shirt:** A slightly more relaxed version of the dress shirt, often with a button-down collar and a more casual fit.\n3. **Tuxedo Shirt:** A formal shirt designed to be worn with a tuxedo, typically featuring a wingtip collar and French cuffs.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar Style:** Formal shirts often feature a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff Style:** Formal shirts typically have cuffs, which can be button cuffs or French cuffs.\n3. **Fabric:** Formal shirts are often made from high-quality cotton, linen, or silk fabrics.\n4. **Fit:** Formal shirts are designed to fit closely, with a slim fit through the body and sleeves.\n5. **Button Front:** Formal shirts typically have a button front, with a placket (a strip of fabric that covers the buttons) or a fly front (a hidden button placket).\n\n**Popular Colors:**\n\n1. **White:** A classic choice for formal shirts, white is a versatile and timeless option.\n2. **Light Blue:** A popular alternative to white, light blue formal shirts are perfect for business or formal events.\n3. **Pastel Colors:** Soft pastel colors like pink, lavender, or pale yellow can add a touch of personality to a formal outfit.\n4. **Stripes:** Thin stripes in subtle colors like navy, gray, or burgundy can add visual interest to a formal shirt.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink:** Known for their high-quality, stylish formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet:** A French luxury brand offering exquisite formal shirts with intricate details.\n3. **Brooks Brothers:** A classic American brand offering traditional formal shirts with a preppy twist.\n4. **Ted Baker:** A British brand offering stylish, affordable formal shirts with a focus on detail and quality.\n\n**Tips for Wearing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Pair with a Suit:** A formal shirt is typically worn with a suit and tie for a complete formal outfit.\n2. **Choose the Right Collar:** Select a collar style that complements your face shape and personal style.\n3. **Consider the Occasion:** Choose a formal shirt that fits the dress code and occasion, such as a black-tie event or a business meeting.\n4. **Pay Attention to Fit:** Ensure the shirt fits well, with a slim fit through the body and sleeves, and the cuffs are not too loose or too tight.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-09 12:56:00', '2026-01-09 12:56:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-01-09 12:56:20', '2026-01-09 12:56:20'),
