(634, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'Party wear for men can vary depending on the type of party, the dress code, and personal style. Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n**Formal Parties**\n\n1. **Tuxedos**: A classic choice for formal parties, tuxedos are a must-have for black-tie events.\n2. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit in black, navy, or gray is a versatile option for formal parties.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A crisp, white dress shirt with a wing-tip collar is a timeless choice.\n4. **Bow Ties**: A bow tie can add a touch of elegance to a formal outfit.\n\n**Semi-Formal Parties**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to a semi-formal outfit.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dark-washed dress pants are a versatile option for semi-formal parties.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt with a spread collar is a good choice for semi-formal parties.\n4. **Loafers**: Slip-on loafers or dress shoes can complete a semi-formal outfit.\n\n**Casual Parties**\n\n1. **Jeans**: Dark-washed jeans are a popular choice for casual parties.\n2. **T-Shirts**: A plain or graphic T-shirt is a comfortable option for casual parties.\n3. **Hoodies**: A hoodie can add a touch of casual style to an outfit.\n4. **Sneakers**: Sneakers are a popular choice for casual parties.\n\n**Accessories**\n\n1. **Watches**: A leather strap watch can add a touch of elegance to a formal outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of personality to a dress shirt.\n3. **Pocket Squares**: A pocket square can add a touch of color and texture to a suit.\n4. **Belts**: A leather belt can complete a formal or semi-formal outfit.\n\n**Tips**\n\n1. **Dress according to the dress code**: Make sure to dress according to the specified dress code to avoid feeling out of place.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: A well-fitted outfit can make a big difference in how confident and stylish you look.\n3. **Accessories can make or break an outfit**: Choose accessories that complement your outfit and add a touch of personality.\n4. **Be confident**: Own your look and have fun!\n\nRemember, party wear for men is all about expressing your personal style while considering the occasion and dress code.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-11 12:40:00', '2026-01-11 12:40:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-01-11 12:40:12', '2026-01-11 12:40:12');
