(635, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn in formal or business-casual settings. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts typically have a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or barrel cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are usually made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Weave**: Formal shirts may have a tight weave, such as pinpoint or twill, to give a smooth and crisp appearance.\n5. **Color**: Formal shirts are often white, light blue, or other conservative colors.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Dress shirt**: A classic formal shirt with a point collar and French cuffs.\n2. **Business casual shirt**: A slightly more relaxed version of the dress shirt, often with a spread collar and barrel cuffs.\n3. **Oxford shirt**: A type of formal shirt with a button-down collar and a relaxed fit.\n4. **Tailored fit shirt**: A formal shirt with a slim, tailored fit and a contemporary style.\n5. **Classic fit shirt**: A traditional formal shirt with a looser fit and a classic style.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: Known for their high-quality, stylish formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A luxury brand offering exquisite formal shirts with intricate details.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: A classic American brand offering traditional formal shirts with a preppy twist.\n4. **Ted Baker**: A British brand offering stylish, modern formal shirts with a focus on quality and attention to detail.\n5. **Armani**: A luxury brand offering sleek, sophisticated formal shirts with a contemporary style.\n\n**Tips for choosing a formal shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a shirt that is suitable for the occasion, whether it\'s a job interview, a wedding, or a business meeting.\n2. **Think about your body type**: Select a shirt that flatters your body type, whether you\'re tall and thin or shorter and more muscular.\n3. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure the shirt fits well, with a comfortable sleeve length and a collar that sits comfortably around your neck.\n4. **Choose a high-quality fabric**: Opt for a shirt made from a high-quality fabric that will look and feel great.\n5. **Accessorize wisely**: Add a tie, pocket square, or cufflinks to complete your formal look.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-11 12:56:00', '2026-01-11 12:56:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-01-11 12:56:12', '2026-01-11 12:56:12'),
