(647, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:41', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and charming garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. \n\nSky blue is a pale blue color that resembles the color of a clear sky on a sunny day. It\'s a versatile color that can be suitable for various occasions, from casual everyday wear to more formal events.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of wearing a sky blue dress or frock, you might consider pairing it with neutral-colored accessories, such as beige, white, or pale gray, to create a soft and elegant look. Alternatively, you could add some pops of color with brighter accessories, like yellow or orange, to create a more playful and vibrant outfit.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite way to style a sky blue dress or frock? Do you have a special occasion in mind for wearing one?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-11 18:41:00', '2026-01-11 18:41:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-11 18:41:10', '2026-01-11 18:41:10'),
(648, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:42', 'A sky blue dress or frock can be a beautiful and elegant garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, tranquility, and happiness. It\'s a popular color for dresses, especially during the spring and summer months.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of wearing a sky blue dress or frock, here are some ideas to consider:\n\n1. **Style**: Sky blue dresses can range from casual to formal, depending on the style and fabric. You can opt for a flowy sundress, a bodycon dress, or a more structured A-line frock.\n2. **Accessories**: To complement the sky blue color, you can add white, beige, or neutral-colored accessories like sandals, a hat, or a statement necklace.\n3. **Occasion**: A sky blue dress is perfect for outdoor events like garden parties, picnics, or beach weddings. You can also wear it to a casual brunch or a daytime event.\n4. **Fabric**: Choose a lightweight fabric like cotton, linen, or silk to keep you cool and comfortable in a sky blue dress.\n\nSome popular ways to style a sky blue dress or frock include:\n\n* Pairing it with a pair of neutral-colored sneakers or sandals\n* Adding a denim jacket or a cardigan for a more casual look\n* Wearing it with a wide-brimmed hat and sunglasses for a chic, summery vibe\n* Accessorizing with a statement piece of jewelry, like a bold necklace or earrings\n\nOverall, a sky blue dress or frock is a versatile and stylish choice that can be dressed up or down, depending on the occasion and your personal style.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-11 18:42:00', '2026-01-11 18:42:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-11 18:42:10', '2026-01-11 18:42:10'),
(649, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:43', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a beautiful and elegant garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a versatile color that can be suitable for various occasions, from casual everyday wear to more formal events.\n\nIf you\'re looking for a sky blue dress or frock, you might consider the following styles:\n\n1. **Flowy maxi dress**: A flowy sky blue maxi dress with a relaxed fit and a subtle floral pattern can be perfect for a summer evening or a casual outdoor gathering.\n2. **Bodycon dress**: A fitted sky blue bodycon dress can be great for a night out with friends or a special occasion, such as a birthday party or a wedding.\n3. **A-line frock**: A sky blue A-line frock with a flared skirt and a fitted bodice can be a cute and playful option for a daytime event or a casual date.\n4. **Lace dress**: A sky blue lace dress with intricate details and a delicate pattern can be stunning for a more formal event, such as a wedding or a prom.\n\nYou can also consider adding some accessories to complement your sky blue dress or frock, such as:\n\n* **Neutral-colored shoes**: Pair your sky blue dress with neutral-colored shoes, like beige or white, to create a balanced look.\n* **Statement jewelry**: Add some statement jewelry, like a bold necklace or earrings, to add a pop of color and personality to your outfit.\n* **Light jacket or cardigan**: Throw on a light jacket or cardigan to add a layer of sophistication and warmth to your outfit.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite way to style a sky blue dress or frock?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-11 18:43:00', '2026-01-11 18:43:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-11 18:43:10', '2026-01-11 18:43:10'),
(650, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', 'Here\'s a relatable caption for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n\"Stay on top of your fashion game with Roddies! Here\'s why we\'re the perfect fit for you:\n\n* Affordable prices without compromising on quality\n* Latest trends to keep your wardrobe fresh and stylish\n* Comfortable and durable clothing for everyday wear\n* Wide range of sizes to cater to all body types\n* Excellent customer service to ensure a seamless shopping experience\n\nFollow us for the latest fashion updates and trends! #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForward #StyleInspo #AffordableLuxury #ComfortableChic #SustainableFashion #FashionForAll #MustHave #WardrobeEssentials\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-12 11:18:00', '2026-01-12 11:18:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-01-12 11:18:11', '2026-01-12 11:18:11'),
(651, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'When it comes to party wear for men, there are several options to consider, depending on the occasion, dress code, and personal style. Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n**Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Tuxedos**: A classic choice for formal parties, tuxedos are perfect for black-tie events. Pair a tuxedo jacket with a white dress shirt, black trousers, and a bow tie.\n2. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit in navy, black, or gray is versatile and can be dressed up or down. Add a dress shirt, tie, and dress shoes for a polished look.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt with a slim collar and French cuffs is a great option for formal parties. Pair with a suit or trousers and a blazer.\n\n**Semi-Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to a casual outfit. Pair with a dress shirt, trousers, and dress shoes.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dress pants in neutral colors like beige, gray, or navy are versatile and can be paired with a variety of tops.\n3. **Button-Down Shirts**: A button-down shirt in a bold color or pattern can add a pop of personality to a semi-formal outfit.\n\n**Casual Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Jeans and a Nice Top**: A pair of dark wash jeans with a nice top, such as a button-down shirt or a polo, is a great option for casual parties.\n2. **Polos and Chinos**: A polo shirt with chinos or dress pants is a classic casual outfit.\n3. **Hoodies and Sneakers**: For a more relaxed party, a hoodie and sneakers can be a comfortable and stylish option.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n1. **Watches**: A leather strap watch or a metallic watch can add a touch of sophistication to an outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a personal touch to a dress shirt.\n3. **Pocket Squares**: A pocket square can add a pop of color and texture to a suit or blazer.\n4. **Shoes**: Dress shoes, loafers, or sneakers can complete an outfit and add a touch of personality.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Dress according to the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the party\'s dress code and theme.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure your clothes fit well and are not too tight or too loose.\n3. **Accessories can make or break an outfit**: Add a few accessories to complete your look and add a personal touch.\n4. **Be confident**: Own your look and have fun!\n\nRemember, party wear for men is all about expressing your personal style and having fun. Experiment with different options and find what works best for you!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-12 12:40:00', '2026-01-12 12:40:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-01-12 12:40:12', '2026-01-12 12:40:12'),
(652, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a essential component of a business or formal outfit. Here are some key features and styles to consider:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic style with a point or spread collar, French cuffs, and a fitted silhouette.\n2. **Business Shirt:** A more relaxed version of the dress shirt, with a button-down collar and button cuffs.\n3. **Wingtip Shirt:** A style with a wingtip collar, typically worn with a tuxedo or formal suit.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar Style:** Point, spread, or wingtip collars are common for formal shirts.\n2. **Cuff Style:** French cuffs or button cuffs are typical for formal shirts.\n3. **Fabric:** High-quality cotton, linen, or silk fabrics are often used for formal shirts.\n4. **Fit:** A well-fitted shirt with a slim silhouette is essential for a formal look.\n5. **Button Front:** A button-front placket is standard for formal shirts.\n\n**Popular Formal Shirt Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic White:** A timeless choice, suitable for most formal occasions.\n2. **Light Blue:** A popular alternative to white, perfect for business or formal events.\n3. **Striped or Checked:** Subtle patterns can add visual interest to a formal shirt.\n4. **Contrast Cuffs and Collar:** A stylish option featuring contrasting cuffs and collar.\n\n**Brands and Pricing:**\n\n1. **Luxury Brands:** Tom Ford, Ralph Lauren, and Ermenegildo Zegna offer high-end formal shirts (>$100).\n2. **Premium Brands:** Brooks Brothers, Thomas Pink, and Charles Tyrwhitt offer high-quality formal shirts ($50-$150).\n3. **Affordable Brands:** Uniqlo, Gap, and H&M offer more affordable formal shirts ($20-$50).\n\n**Tips for Choosing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion:** Choose a shirt that suits the formality of the event.\n2. **Think about your suit:** Ensure the shirt complements your suit color and style.\n3. **Pay attention to fit:** A well-fitted shirt is essential for a polished look.\n4. **Accessories matter:** Add a tie, pocket square, or cufflinks to complete your formal look.\n\nRemember, a formal shirt is an investment piece that can elevate your entire wardrobe. Choose a high-quality shirt that fits well and makes you feel confident and stylish.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-12 12:56:00', '2026-01-12 12:56:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-01-12 12:56:12', '2026-01-12 12:56:12'),
