(654, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n\"Get ready to elevate your style with Roddies Fashion! Here\'s what sets us apart:\n\n* **Quality over quantity**: We believe in investing in a few, high-quality pieces that will stand the test of time.\n* **Sustainable fashion**: We\'re committed to reducing our environmental footprint and promoting eco-friendly practices.\n* **Inclusive sizing**: We cater to a wide range of sizes, because fashion is for everyone.\n* **On-trend designs**: Stay ahead of the curve with our latest collections, inspired by the latest fashion trends.\n\nJoin the Roddies Fashion community and experience the best of fashion, without compromising on values! #RoddiesFashion #SustainableFashion #InclusiveSizing #QualityMatters #FashionForAll #TrendingNow #FashionForward #EcoFriendly #StyleInspo\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-12 15:10:00', '2026-01-12 15:10:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-01-12 15:10:11', '2026-01-12 15:10:11'),
