(662, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of materials such as ceramic, clay, plastic, or wood. Flower pots can be used to add a decorative touch to indoor and outdoor spaces, and come in a wide range of shapes, sizes, and styles to suit different tastes and needs.\n\nSome common features of flower pots include:\n\n1. Drainage holes: to prevent waterlogged soil and root rot\n2. Handles or grips: to make it easy to lift and move the pot\n3. Decorative designs: such as patterns, colors, and textures to add visual interest\n4. Size and shape: from small and compact to large and statement-making\n\nFlower pots can be used for a variety of plants, including:\n\n1. Flowers: such as roses, tulips, and daisies\n2. Herbs: such as basil, mint, and rosemary\n3. Succulents: such as aloe, agave, and echeveria\n4. Trees and shrubs: such as bonsai trees and topiaries\n\nWhen choosing a flower pot, consider factors such as:\n\n1. Material: durability, weight, and maintenance requirements\n2. Size: proportion to the plant and the space where it will be placed\n3. Drainage: to prevent waterlogged soil and root rot\n4. Style: to match your home decor and personal taste\n\nDo you have a specific question about flower pots, or would you like some recommendations for choosing the right one?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-12 18:07:00', '2026-01-12 18:07:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-01-12 18:07:12', '2026-01-12 18:07:12'),
(663, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'It seems like you want me to post \"Good Morning\" for the weekdays and the weekend days, excluding the actual phrase \"Good Morning\" for the initial phrase. Here\'s the revised list:\n\nMonday - Like\nTuesday - Like\nWednesday - Like\nThursday - Like\nFriday - Like\nSaturday - Like\nSunday - Like', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-12 18:26:00', '2026-01-12 18:26:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2026-01-12 18:26:10', '2026-01-12 18:26:10'),
(664, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:41', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and charming garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a versatile color that can suit various occasions, from casual everyday wear to more formal events.\n\nIf you\'re thinking of creating or purchasing a sky blue dress, here are a few ideas to consider:\n\n1. **Style**: You could opt for a flowy, floor-length dress with a relaxed fit, or a more fitted, knee-length frock with a flared skirt.\n2. **Fabric**: Choose a comfortable, breathable fabric like cotton, linen, or silk. These materials will help keep you cool and comfortable, especially during warmer months.\n3. **Accessories**: Add some subtle accessories like a pair of sandals, a simple necklace, or a floppy hat to complement the sky blue color.\n4. **Occasion**: A sky blue dress can be suitable for various events, such as a summer wedding, a garden party, or a casual day out with friends.\n\nSome popular styles for sky blue dresses include:\n\n* **Boho chic**: A flowy, eclectic dress with embroidery, lace, or other embellishments.\n* **Vintage-inspired**: A fitted, knee-length dress with a full skirt and a nod to retro designs.\n* **Minimalist**: A simple, sleek dress with a clean design and minimal embellishments.\n\nWhat\'s your vision for a sky blue dress or frock?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-12 18:41:00', '2026-01-12 18:41:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-12 18:41:11', '2026-01-12 18:41:11'),
(665, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:42', 'That sounds like a lovely and vibrant outfit. A sky blue dress or frock can be a beautiful and elegant choice for many occasions. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness.\n\nIf you\'re looking to style a sky blue dress or frock, here are a few suggestions:\n\n1. **Add neutral accessories**: Pair the dress with neutral-colored shoes, such as beige or white, and accessories like a simple necklace or earrings to let the dress be the focal point.\n2. **Play with patterns**: If you want to add some visual interest to the outfit, try pairing the sky blue dress with patterned tights, a scarf, or a statement piece of jewelry.\n3. **Emphasize with earthy tones**: Combine the sky blue dress with earthy tones like brown, olive green, or tan to create a natural and effortless look.\n4. **Go for a bold lip color**: A sky blue dress can be a great canvas for a bold lip color. Try pairing it with a bright coral, pink, or red lip shade to add a pop of color to the outfit.\n\nWhat\'s the occasion for the sky blue dress or frock? Are you looking for styling suggestions or have any specific questions about the outfit?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-12 18:42:00', '2026-01-12 18:42:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-12 18:42:12', '2026-01-12 18:42:12'),
(666, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:43', 'A sky blue dress or frock sounds like a lovely and elegant garment. The color sky blue is often associated with feelings of serenity, calmness, and happiness. It\'s a popular color for dresses and frocks, especially for spring and summer seasons.\n\nHere are a few ideas that come to mind when thinking of a sky blue dress or frock:\n\n1. **Floral patterns**: A sky blue dress with white or yellow floral patterns can create a beautiful and feminine look.\n2. **Summer wedding guest**: A sky blue frock can be a great option for a summer wedding guest outfit, paired with sandals and a statement necklace.\n3. **Beachy vibe**: A flowy sky blue dress can evoke a beachy, carefree vibe, perfect for a day out by the ocean or a lake.\n4. **Bohemian style**: A sky blue dress with embroidery or other bohemian-inspired details can add a unique and eclectic touch to an outfit.\n5. **Everyday wear**: A simple sky blue dress can be a great addition to a everyday wardrobe, perfect for work or casual outings.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite way to style a sky blue dress or frock?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-12 18:43:00', '2026-01-12 18:43:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Sky_blue_dresss_frock?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 32, '2026-01-12 18:43:11', '2026-01-12 18:43:11'),
(667, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for Roddies Fashion on Facebook:\n\n\"Get ready to upgrade your wardrobe with Roddies Fashion! Here\'s why you\'ll love us:\n* Affordable prices without compromising on quality\n* Latest fashion trends to keep you stylish and on-point\n* Wide range of collections to suit every taste and preference\n* Excellent customer service to ensure a seamless shopping experience\n\nFollow us for the latest updates, promotions, and style tips! #RoddiesFashion #TrendingNow #FashionForward #StyleInspo #WardrobeEssentials #AffordableLuxury #FashionForAll #NewArrivals #MustHaves #FashionTrends #OnlineFashion #ShopNow\"\n\nThis caption is professional, relatable, and includes relevant hashtags that are currently trending. The points highlighted are also key selling points for the brand, showcasing the benefits of shopping with Roddies Fashion.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-13 11:18:00', '2026-01-13 11:18:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-01-13 11:18:11', '2026-01-13 11:18:11'),
(668, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:57', 'A pen is a common writing instrument used to apply ink to a surface, usually paper, for the purpose of writing or drawing. It typically consists of a nib or tip, an ink reservoir, and a handle or barrel. Pens can be categorized into different types, including:\n\n1. **Ballpoint pens**: These use a small metal ball to dispense ink onto the paper.\n2. **Rollerball pens**: These use a water-based ink and a small metal ball to create a fluid writing experience.\n3. **Fountain pens**: These use a nib to deliver ink from an internal reservoir to the paper.\n4. **Gel pens**: These use a water-based ink and a rollerball tip to create a vibrant, colorful writing experience.\n5. **Fineliners**: These are precision pens used for technical drawing, illustration, and calligraphy.\n\nPens have been used for centuries, with early examples made from reeds, quills, and other materials. Today, pens are an essential tool for everyday life, used for writing, signing documents, and creating art.\n\nWhat would you like to know about pens?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-13 11:57:00', '2026-01-13 11:57:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 16, '2026-01-13 11:57:22', '2026-01-13 11:57:22'),
(669, 'Auto Post for instagram at 11:59', 'A \"pen packet\" can refer to a small package or container used to hold pens, pencils, or other writing utensils. It\'s often a portable and convenient way to carry your writing essentials. \n\nSome common types of pen packets include:\n\n1. Pencil cases: Small, zippered pouches made of fabric or plastic that can hold pens, pencils, and other stationery items.\n2. Pen pouches: Small, soft cases that can be attached to a backpack, purse, or keychain, providing easy access to your writing utensils.\n3. Desk organizers: Small trays or containers that can hold pens, pencils, and other office supplies, keeping your workspace organized and clutter-free.\n\nPen packets can be made of various materials, such as:\n\n* Fabric (e.g., cotton, nylon)\n* Plastic (e.g., polypropylene, polyethylene)\n* Leather\n* Mesh\n\nThey come in different shapes, sizes, and designs, ranging from simple and functional to decorative and stylish. Some pen packets may also have additional features, such as:\n\n* Compartments or dividers to separate different types of writing utensils\n* Elastic loops or pockets to hold pens and pencils in place\n* Zippers or Velcro closures to keep the contents secure\n* Clips or hooks for attaching the pen packet to a bag or keychain\n\nOverall, a pen packet is a handy accessory that can help keep your writing utensils organized, protected, and within easy reach.', '[\"instagram\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-13 11:59:00', '2026-01-13 11:59:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen_Packet?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 17, '2026-01-13 11:59:18', '2026-01-13 11:59:18'),
