(671, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:05', 'A bicycle, also known as a bike, is a human-powered or motor-powered, pedal-driven, single-track vehicle, having two wheels attached to a frame, one behind the other. Bicycles are a popular mode of transportation, recreation, and exercise.\n\nHere are some interesting facts about bicycles:\n\n1. **History**: The first bicycle was invented in 1817 by German Baron Karl von Drais. It had no pedals and was called a \"dandy horse\" or \"draisine.\"\n2. **Design**: A typical bicycle consists of a frame, wheels, pedals, gears, brakes, and a seat. The frame is usually made of metal, while the wheels are made of metal or carbon fiber.\n3. **Types**: There are many types of bicycles, including road bikes, mountain bikes, hybrid bikes, commuter bikes, and recumbent bikes.\n4. **Benefits**: Cycling is a great way to improve cardiovascular health, build muscle, and boost mental well-being. It\'s also an environmentally friendly mode of transportation.\n5. **Technology**: Modern bicycles often feature advanced technologies, such as gear systems, disc brakes, and suspension systems, which enhance performance and comfort.\n\nSome popular uses of bicycles include:\n\n1. **Commuting**: Many people use bicycles as a mode of transportation to work or school.\n2. **Recreation**: Cycling is a popular recreational activity, with many people enjoying rides in parks, trails, or on roads.\n3. **Racing**: Competitive cycling is a popular sport, with events such as the Tour de France and the Olympic Games.\n4. **Touring**: Long-distance cycling tours are a great way to explore new places and experience different cultures.\n\nOverall, bicycles are an efficient, environmentally friendly, and fun way to get around, and they offer many benefits for our physical and mental health.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-01-13 12:05:00', '2026-01-13 12:05:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 18, '2026-01-13 12:05:10', '2026-01-13 12:05:10'),
