(778, 'hyper gaming', 'Here\'s a potential Facebook post for your ID:\r\n\r\n**Post:**\r\n\"Hyper Gaming Mode Activated!\r\nWho else is still obsessed with GTA 5? I know I am!\r\nCurrently cruising through Los Santos, taking down enemies and living my best life in the virtual world.\r\nWhat\'s your favorite thing to do in GTA 5? Let me know in the comments!\r\n#GTA5 #Gaming #HyperGaming #ConsoleGaming\"\r\n\r\n**Image:** A high-quality image of a man sitting on a couch, holding a console controller and playing GTA 5 on a large screen TV. The image should be bright, colorful, and capture the excitement of gaming.\r\n\r\nFeel free to customize the post to fit your personal style and tone!', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'create a gaming post for my id to post on facebook, the image should be of a man playing GTA 5 o console', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'create a gaming post for my id to post on facebook, the image should be of a man playing GTA 5 o console', 'https://pollinations.ai/p/create_a_gaming_post_for_my_id_to_post_on_facebook%2C_the_image_should_be_of_a_man_playing_GTA_5_o_console', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-02-26 12:02:54', '2026-02-26 12:02:54'),
(779, 'test', '\r\n\r\nTry Codex for free\r\nOpenAI’s coding agent — now in your ChatGPT plan\r\n\r\nTry Codex\r\nCodex is a coding agent that can do real work on your computer. It works alongside you to design, build, and iterate on software projects.\r\n\r\nFor a limited time, Codex is included in your ChatGPT plan at no additional cost.\r\n\r\nUse it to explore new ideas, solve hard problems, and move faster on your most important projects.\r\n\r\nWe can’t wait to see what you build.\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nThe Codex team', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 0, 'Business/Creator: Roddies fashion\r\nDescription: Relatable caption in points also give hastags.\r\nPlatforms: Facebook\r\nBrand Voice: professional\r\nHashtags: Trending\r\nFestival/Event: Halloween', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain, neon reflections on wet street, aesthetic photography, soft bokeh lights, fashionable outfit, cinematic mood, high-detail, girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain, neon reflections on wet street, aesthetic photography, soft bokeh lights, fashionable outfit, cinematic mood, high-detail,', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1772089137/user_2_test21/zhg8gvxwn6mbaqzwy7pm.png', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-02-26 12:28:58', '2026-02-26 12:28:58'),
