(796, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', 'Here\'s a possible post for a soccer sports business on Facebook:\n\n**Get Ready for the Beautiful Game!**\n\nHere are a few things to look forward to this season:\n* Exciting matchups between top teams\n* New player signings and transfers\n* Innovative tactics and strategies on the pitch\n* Unforgettable goals and highlights\n\nStay tuned for the latest updates, analysis, and behind-the-scenes insights from the world of soccer!\n\n#SoccerSeason #FootballFever #SportsNews #SoccerFans #FIFA #UEFA #LaLiga #PremierLeague #Bundesliga #SerieA #MLS #TrendingNow #SportsTrending #FootballTrending\n\nNote: The hashtags used are a mix of popular and trending ones, including specific leagues and organizations to reach a wider audience. The brand voice is professional and informative, making it suitable for a soccer sports business on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-02-28 11:18:00', '2026-02-28 11:18:10', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Ultra-realistic_FIFA_2025_football_game_scene%2C_professional_soccer_player_wearing_a_modern_2025_kit%2C_intense_stadium_atmosphere_at_night%2C_bright_floodlights_illuminating_the_field%2C_detailed_grass_texture%2C_dynamic_action_pose_while_shooting_the_ball%2C_motion_blur_on_the_ball%2C_cinematic_camera_angle%2C_4K_resolution%2C_hyper-detailed%2C_realistic_facial_expression%2C_sweat_particles%2C_depth_of_field%2C_dramatic_lighting%2C_volumetric_light_rays%2C_packed_crowd_in_background%2C_broadcast-style_sports_photography%2C_high_contrast%2C_sharp_focus%2C_Unreal_Engine_5_quality%2C_photorealistic%2C_epic_sports_poster_style', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-02-28 11:18:11', '2026-02-28 11:18:11'),
