(804, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'What a stunning visual description. Let me help you break it down and imagine the scene:\n\n**Main Subject:** A girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain. The umbrella\'s transparency adds a touch of elegance and sophistication to the scene.\n\n**Background:** The wet street is reflecting neon lights, creating a vibrant and colorful atmosphere. The rain is light, which suggests a gentle and peaceful ambiance.\n\n**Photography Style:** Aesthetic photography with a cinematic mood. This implies that the image is highly stylized, with attention to detail and a focus on creating a dreamy, atmospheric quality.\n\n**Lighting:** Soft bokeh lights are used to create a shallow depth of field, blurring the background and emphasizing the girl and her umbrella. This adds to the cinematic feel and creates a sense of intimacy.\n\n**Fashion:** The girl\'s outfit is fashionable, which suggests that she\'s dressed in trendy, high-end clothing. This adds to the overall aesthetic and sophistication of the image.\n\n**Mood:** The cinematic mood implies that the image is not just a candid snapshot, but a carefully crafted scene that tells a story. The combination of the girl, umbrella, and neon reflections creates a sense of mystery and allure.\n\n**High-Detail:** The image is highly detailed, which means that every element, from the girl\'s outfit to the neon reflections, is sharp and well-defined. This level of detail adds to the overall realism and immersion of the scene.\n\nOverall, the description paints a picture of a stunning, high-fashion photograph that captures the essence of a rainy city street at night. The combination of the transparent umbrella, neon reflections, and cinematic mood creates a truly unique and captivating image.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-02-28 16:11:00', '2026-02-28 16:11:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_ligh