e overall feeling of happiness and contentment. The image invites the viewer to join in on the fun and be a part of the group\'s carefree evening.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-05 16:06:00', '2026-03-05 16:06:12', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-03-05 16:06:12', '2026-03-05 16:06:12');
