(855, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:39', 'Here\'s a possible post for a soccer sports business/creator on Facebook:\n\n\"As we head into the new season, here are a few things to keep in mind:\n\n* Our team is dedicated to bringing you the best soccer experience possible\n* We\'re committed to providing top-notch training and coaching to help you improve your skills\n* Our community is built on a foundation of respect, sportsmanship, and a passion for the beautiful game\n* We\'re excited to see what the future holds for our team and our players\n\n#SoccerSeason #NewBeginnings #SoccerLife #SportsmanshipMatters #SoccerCommunity #FootballFever #TrendingNow #SoccerNews #FootballLove\"\n\nThis caption is professional, relatable, and includes a mix of popular and trending hashtags to help increase engagement and reach a wider audience on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-06 11:39:00', '2026-03-06 11:39:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Ultra-realistic_FIFA_2025_football_game_scene%2C_professional_soccer_player_wearing_a_modern_2025_kit%2C_intense_stadium_atmosphere_at_night%2C_bright_floodlights_illuminating_the_field%2C_detailed_grass_texture%2C_dynamic_action_pose_while_shooting_the_ball%2C_motion_blur_on_the_ball%2C_cinematic_camera_angle%2C_4K_resolution%2C_hyper-detailed%2C_realistic_facial_expression%2C_sweat_particles%2C_depth_of_field%2C_dramatic_lighting%2C_volumetric_light_rays%2C_packed_crowd_in_background%2C_broadcast-style_sports_photography%2C_high_contrast%2C_sharp_focus%2C_Unreal_Engine_5_quality%2C_photorealistic%2C_epic_sports_poster_style', NULL, 'pending', 35, '2026-03-06 11:39:20', '2026-03-06 11:39:20');
