(863, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', 'Here\'s a possible post for a soccer sports business/creator on Facebook:\n\n**Get Ready for the Beautiful Game!**\n\nHere are some relatable points about soccer that we can all agree on:\n\n* The thrill of scoring a goal is like no other feeling\n* The agony of missing a penalty is a pain we\'d rather not feel\n* The joy of watching your favorite team win is pure bliss\n* The camaraderie of playing with friends is what makes the game truly special\n\nWhether you\'re a seasoned pro or just starting out, soccer has something to offer everyone. So why not join us and experience it for yourself?\n\n#SoccerLove #FootballFever #SportsUnite #BeautifulGame #TrendingNow #SoccerLife #FootballFans #GameOn\n\nThis caption is professional, relatable, and includes trending hashtags to reach a wider audience on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-06 14:37:00', '2026-03-06 14:37:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-03-06 14:37:19', '2026-03-06 14:37:19'),
(864, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', 'Here\'s a sample Facebook post for a soccer sports business/creator:\n\n**\"Get Ready for Kickoff!**\n\nHere are the top reasons why soccer is the ultimate sport:\n• Improves cardiovascular health and endurance\n• Enhances teamwork and communication skills\n• Boosts mental toughness and discipline\n• Provides a fun and exciting way to stay active\n• Unites people from all over the world with a shared passion\n\nJoin the beautiful game and experience it for yourself! #SoccerLovers #FootballFever #SportsUnite #FitnessMotivation #TeamworkMakesTheDreamWork #SoccerIsLife #KickoffVibes #FootballFans #TrendingNow\"\n\nThis caption is written in a professional tone and includes relatable points that highlight the benefits of soccer. The hashtags are a mix of popular and trending ones to help increase visibility and engagement on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-06 14:38:00', '2026-03-06 14:38:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-03-06 14:38:19', '2026-03-06 14:38:19'),
(865, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', 'Here\'s a relatable caption for a soccer sports business on Facebook:\n\n\"As we head into the new season, we\'re excited to share what drives us to succeed on and off the pitch. Here are a few key points that fuel our passion for the beautiful game:\n\n* **Teamwork**: We believe that together, we can achieve greatness.\n* **Dedication**: Our players and staff are committed to putting in the hard work necessary to excel.\n* **Community**: We\'re proud to be a part of a vibrant and supportive soccer community.\n* **Innovation**: We\'re always looking for new ways to improve and stay ahead of the curve.\n\nJoin us on this journey and let\'s make it a season to remember! #SoccerSeason #NewBeginnings #TeamworkMakesTheDreamWork #SoccerCommunity #InnovationInSports #FootballFever #SportsMarketing #SoccerBusiness #TrendingNow\"\n\nThis caption uses a professional tone and includes a mix of trending and niche-specific hashtags to reach a wider audience on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-06 14:39:00', '2026-03-06 14:39:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-03-06 14:39:22', '2026-03-06 14:39:22'),
