*: Canon EF 50mm f/1.2L USM\n5. **Aperture**: f/2.8\n6. **Shutter speed**: 1/125s\n7. **ISO**: 400\n\nI hope this description gives you a vivid mental image of a man hanging out with friends!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-08 16:06:00', '2026-03-08 16:06:09', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?model=flux&width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-03-08 16:06:09', '2026-03-08 16:06:09'),
