hting, volumetric light rays, packed crowd in background, broadcast-style sports photography, high contrast, sharp focus, Unreal Engine 5 quality, photorealistic, epic sports poster style', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1773037424/user_2_test21/i7urg5bi6l53v6cx8dz6.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-03-09 11:53:45', '2026-03-09 11:53:45'),
