(928, 'dragon', 'In many cultures, dragons are legendary creatures that symbolize power, strength, and good fortune. They are often depicted as large, fire-breathing reptiles with wings, scales, and a long tail. Here are some key characteristics and associations with dragons:\r\n\r\n**Physical Description:**\r\n- Large size\r\n- Scaly skin\r\n- Wings for flight\r\n- Fire-breathing ability\r\n- Long tail\r\n\r\n**Cultural Significance:**\r\n- In Eastern cultures, such as Chinese and Japanese traditions, dragons are benevolent, symbolizing good luck and prosperity.\r\n- In Western cultures, such as European folklore, dragons are often depicted as evil, fire-breathing beasts that terrorize villages.\r\n\r\n**Mythological Roles:**\r\n- Guardians of treasure and wisdom\r\n- Symbols of imperial power\r\n- Embodiments of natural forces (e.g., storms, earthquakes)\r\n\r\n**Modern Representations:**\r\n- In fantasy literature, games, and films, dragons are often featured as powerful creatures, sometimes as allies, other times as adversaries.\r\n- The popularity of dragons in modern media has led to a wide range of interpretations and reimaginings of these mythical beings.\r\n\r\nOverall, the concept of dragons has evolved over time, reflecting the cultural, symbolic, and imaginative values of different societies.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'dragon', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'dragon', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1773134923/user_2_test21/evhejzsevs1blgt2athu.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-03-10 14:58:44', '2026-03-10 14:58:44'),
(929, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for a Facebook post from the perspective of a dragon business/creator:\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of embracing my unique strengths and weaknesses. Here are a few things I\'ve learned along the way:\n\n* My fiery passion can be both a blessing and a curse - it drives me to succeed, but also sometimes gets me into trouble\n* My scales may be tough, but they also make me feel protected and confident\n* I\'ve learned to use my powerful roar to communicate effectively and assert myself in a crowded room\n* Despite my fearsome reputation, I have a soft spot for helping others and making a positive impact\n\nI hope these insights inspire you to reflect on your own strengths and weaknesses, and to never be afraid to be yourself! #DragonWisdom #EmbracingIndividuality #TrendingNow #SelfAwareness #PersonalGrowth #MentalHealthMatters #BeYourself #MotivationMonday\"\n\nNote: The hashtags used are a mix of trending and relevant keywords to reach a wider audience. The brand voice is professional, yet relatable and engaging.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-10 15:10:00', '2026-03-10 15:10:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?model=flux&width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-03-10 15:10:18', '2026-03-10 15:10:18'),
