(931, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', 'Here\'s a relatable caption for a dragon-themed business on Facebook:\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of breathing fire into your passions. Here are a few things I\'ve learned on my journey:\n\n* Setting goals and chasing them with determination is key to success\n* Embracing your unique strengths and weaknesses is essential to growth\n* Surrounding yourself with a supportive community can make all the difference\n* Taking risks and trying new things can lead to incredible opportunities\n\n#DragonMotivation #BusinessTips #EntrepreneurLife #TrendingNow #SuccessStory #FollowYourPassion #MotivationMonday #InspirationalQuotes #DragonSquad #FireYourPassion\"\n\nThis caption uses a professional tone while still being relatable and engaging. The use of hashtags like #TrendingNow and #MotivationMonday can help increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-10 15:24:00', '2026-03-10 15:24:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-03-10 15:24:16', '2026-03-10 15:24:16'),
(932, 'sun', 'The sun is a massive ball of hot, glowing gas and it is the center of our solar system. A sunset is the time of day when the sun disappears below the horizon, typically in the evening. \r\n\r\nHere are some interesting facts about sunsets:\r\n\r\n1. **Causes of Sunset**: The sunset is caused by the Earth\'s rotation, which makes the sun appear to move across the sky from east to west. As the sun sinks lower in the sky, it encounters more of the Earth\'s atmosphere, which scatters the shorter wavelengths of light, such as blue and violet, more than the longer wavelengths, like red and orange.\r\n\r\n2. **Colors of Sunset**: The colors we see during a sunset are a result of this scattering effect. The sky can turn shades of red, orange, pink, and purple, depending on the amount of dust and water vapor in the atmosphere. \r\n\r\n3. **Best Places to Watch Sunset**: Some of the most popular places to watch the sunset include beaches, mountains, and deserts. These locations often offer unobstructed views of the horizon, making the sunset even more breathtaking.\r\n\r\n4. **Cultural Significance**: Sunsets have been a source of inspiration for artists, musicians, and writers throughout history. Many cultures also have spiritual or symbolic meanings associated with sunsets, such as the end of a day or the beginning of a new cycle.\r\n\r\n5. **Photography Tips**: To capture a stunning sunset photo, it\'s essential to have the right equipment, such as a camera with a good lens and a tripod. It\'s also important to arrive early to find a good spot, and to be patient, as the best moments often occur just before the sun dips below the horizon.\r\n\r\nOverall, sunsets are a natural wonder that can evoke feelings of awe, peace, and gratitude. Whether you\'re watching from a beach, a mountain, or your own backyard, a sunset is a reminder of the beauty and complexity of our world.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'sunset', '2026-03-10 15:50:00', '2026-03-10 15:50:03', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'sunset', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1773137766/user_2_test21/dkzp2kg6lapvrzd8ifx4.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-03-10 15:46:07', '2026-03-10 15:50:03'),
