(935, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a text-based AI and do not have the capability to create images. However, I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends:\n\nImage Title: \"Laughter and Good Times\"\n\nImage Description:\nThe image is set in a cozy, outdoor patio area with a natural stone floor and a wooden pergola covered in lush greenery. The sun is shining, casting a warm glow over the scene. A group of friends, all in their mid-twenties to early thirties, are gathered around a large wooden table, laughing and chatting.\n\nThe man at the center of the image is sitting in a comfortable, rustic wooden chair, with a cold beer in one hand and a smile on his face. He\'s wearing a casual, light-blue shirt and a pair of dark jeans, with a pair of sunglasses perched on his forehead. His hair is messy and tousled, and he has a few days\' worth of stubble on his chin.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright smile. She\'s wearing a yellow sundress and has a glass of white wine in her hand. She\'s leaning in, engaged in conversation with the man, and her eyes are sparkling with amusement.\n\nOn the other side of the table is another man, with a rugged, athletic build and a short, buzzed haircut. He\'s wearing a gray t-shirt and a pair of athletic shorts, and he\'s holding a plate of snacks in one hand. He\'s laughing and joking with the group, and his eyes are crinkled at the corners.\n\nIn the background, there\'s a large, stone fireplace with a few logs burning, casting a warm glow over the scene. The sky above is a brilliant blue, with a few puffy white clouds drifting lazily across it.\n\nThe overall atmosphere of the image is one of relaxation and camaraderie, with a sense of joy and contentment that\'s infectious. The friends are all having a great time, and the image captures the essence of a perfect summer afternoon spent with good friends.\n\nImage Specifications:\n- Resolution: 4000 x 3000 pixels\n- Aspect Ratio: 4:3\n- Color Profile: Adobe RGB\n- File Format: JPEG\n- Image Size: 2.5 MB\n\nNote: The image is fictional and not an actual photograph. The description is meant to evoke a sense of what the image might look like, rather than being a literal representation.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-10 16:06:00', '2026-03-10 16:06:17', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-03-10 16:06:17', '2026-03-10 16:06:17'),
(936, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for a dragon-themed business on Facebook:\n\n\"As a symbol of power and strength, we\'re reminded that even the most fearsome creatures have relatable moments. Here are a few:\n\n* Waking up late and still having to breathe fire to get the day started\n* Struggling to find the perfect scale polish to match our mood\n* Having to deal with pesky knights trying to ruin our day\n* Trying to find a parking spot that can fit our wings\n* And finally, enjoying a well-deserved treasure hoard after a long day\n\nWe\'re not just dragons, we\'re relatable creatures too! #DragonsOfFacebook #RelatableMoments #FireBreathingProblems #ScaleSquad #TreasureHoarders #TrendingNow #DragonSquad #MythicalCreatures #FantasyBeings\"\n\nThis caption uses a professional tone while still being relatable and humorous, making it perfect for a dragon-themed business on Facebook. The hashtags used are a mix of trending and niche-specific tags to reach a wider audience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-10 16:11:00', '2026-03-10 16:11:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 12, '2026-03-10 16:11:14', '2026-03-10 16:11:14'),
(937, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'re describing is a visually stunning and atmospheric moment, perfect for aesthetic photography. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that make this scene so captivating:\n\n1. **Girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain**: The transparent umbrella adds a unique touch to the scene, allowing the viewer to see the girl\'s face and outfit while still conveying the rainy atmosphere. The light rain creates a sense of gentle movement and subtlety.\n\n2. **Neon reflections on wet street**: The neon reflections on the wet street are a hallmark of cinematic and aesthetic photography. They add a pop of color and create a sense of depth and dimensionality to the image. The reflections also help to highlight the girl\'s movement and the rain, creating a sense of dynamism.\n\n3. **Aesthetic photography**: The term \"aesthetic photography\" refers to a style that prioritizes visual appeal and artistic expression. In this scene, the photographer is likely using a combination of composition, lighting, and post-processing techniques to create a beautiful and captivating image.\n\n4. **Soft bokeh lights**: The soft bokeh lights in the background add a sense of depth and warmth to the image. Bokeh refers to the out-of-focus areas of the image, and when done correctly, it can create a beautiful, dreamy effect. The soft bokeh lights also help to separate the girl from the background, making her the main focus of the image.\n\n5. **Fashionable outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is an important aspect of the scene, as it adds a sense of style and sophistication. The outfit is likely chosen to complement the overall aesthetic of the image, with colors and textures that work well with the neon reflections and soft bokeh lights.\n\n6. **Cinematic mood**: The cinematic mood of the image is created through a combination of the lighting, composition, and atmosphere. The scene has a sense of drama and tension, as if it\'s a still from a movie. The cinematic mood is enhanced by the neon reflections, soft bokeh lights, and the girl\'s movement.\n\n7. **High-detail**: The high level of detail in the image is likely due to the use of a high-quality camera and lens, as well as careful post-processing techniques. The detail helps to create a sense of realism and immersion, drawing the viewer into the scene.\n\nOverall, the scene you\'re describing is a beautiful and captivating moment, perfect for aesthetic photography. The combination of the transparent umbrella, neon reflections, soft bokeh lights, fashionable outfit, and cinematic mood creates a unique and visually stunning image.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-10 16:11:00', '2026-03-10 16:12:51', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-03-10 16:12:51', '2026-03-10 16:12:51'),
