(954, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord and the founder of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and feared drug cartels in the world. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor but loving family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, with his family struggling to make ends meet. He dropped out of school in the seventh grade and began working on the streets, selling fruit and other goods to support his family.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s entry into the world of organized crime began in the 1970s, when he started smuggling marijuana and cocaine into the United States. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, becoming a key player in the organization and earning the respect of his peers. In 1979, Escobar was arrested and charged with cocaine trafficking, but he was released from prison after bribing officials.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nIn the early 1980s, Escobar and his partners, including his brother Roberto and Carlos Lehder, founded the Medellín cartel. The cartel quickly became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world, with a virtual monopoly on the global cocaine trade. Escobar\'s success was due in part to his ruthless tactics, including the use of violence and intimidation to eliminate competitors and silence rivals.\n\n**Atrocities and Violence**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by numerous atrocities and acts of violence. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including politicians, police officers, judges, and civilians. He also ordered the bombing of Avianca Flight 203, which killed 110 people, and the assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán.\n\n**Pursuit and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. In 1991, Escobar surrendered to authorities and was imprisoned, but he escaped from prison in 1992. A massive manhunt ensued, and on December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police on a rooftop in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. While he was a ruthless and violent individual responsible for countless deaths and suffering, he was also a charismatic and cunning leader who was able to build a vast and powerful organization. His story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a vast estate called Hacienda Napoles.\n* He was a skilled soccer player and was known to have played in local tournaments.\n* Escobar was a devout Catholic and was known to have made large donations to the Catholic Church.\n* He was a skilled politician and was able to build alliances with other cartels and organized crime groups.\n* Escobar\'s net worth at the time of his death was estimated to be around $30 billion, making him one of the richest people in the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-11 10:53:00', '2026-03-11 10:53:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-03-11 10:53:19', '2026-03-11 10:53:19'),
(955, 'dragon', 'The dragon is a majestic and formidable creature, embodying the raw power of fire and fury. With its ability to breathe fire, it can unleash devastating blasts of flame that can reduce anything to ashes. Its scale armor provides protection from its own flames and external attacks, making it a nearly invulnerable opponent.\r\n\r\nThe dragon\'s wings allow it to soar through the skies, spreading its flames and terrorizing its enemies from above. Its sharp claws can dig deep into the earth, giving it a stable foundation from which to launch its attacks. But what makes the dragon truly formidable is its intelligence - it is a cunning and adaptable creature, able to strategize and pursue its goals with ruthless efficiency.\r\n\r\nSome key characteristics of the dragon include:\r\n\r\n1. **Fire-breathing**: The dragon\'s ability to unleash powerful blasts of flame is its most iconic feature.\r\n2. **Scale armor**: The dragon\'s heat-resistant scales provide protection from its own flames and external attacks.\r\n3. **Winged**: The dragon\'s wings allow it to fly and spread its flames, making it a formidable aerial opponent.\r\n4. **Clawed**: The dragon\'s sharp claws can dig deep into the earth, giving it a stable foundation for its attacks.\r\n5. **Intelligent**: The dragon\'s intelligence and cunning make it a ruthless and efficient predator.\r\n\r\nOverall, the dragon is a force of nature, unstoppable and unyielding in its pursuit of power and dominance. Its blazing fury is a sight to behold, and those who dare to oppose it do so at their own peril.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, '**The Blazing Fury of the Dragon**\r\n\r\nAs the magnificent creature unfolded its wings, a wave of heat emanated from its body, signaling the impending inferno. The dragon\'s scales glistened like polished rubies, reflecting the intense flames that danced within its mouth. With a mighty roar, the beast unleashed a torrent of fire, engulfing everything in its path.\r\n\r\nThe flames, a mesmerizing blend of orange, yellow, and red, shot out of the dragon\'s maw like a blazing waterfall. The intense heat distorted the air, creating a shimmering aura that surrounded the creature. As the fire raged on, the dragon\'s eyes gleamed with an inner light, as if fueled by an ancient, primal power.\r\n\r\nThe dragon\'s wings beat the air, creating powerful gusts of wind that fanned the flames, spreading them far and wide. The ground trembled beneath its feet as the creature moved, its claws digging deep into the earth. The air was filled with the acrid smell of smoke and burning embers, a testament to the dragon\'s unbridled fury.\r\n\r\nAs the flames continued to dance and swirl, the dragon\'s body seemed to glow with an inner fire, as if its very essence was being fueled by the inferno. The creature\'s roar grew louder, a deafening cacophony that shook the foundations of the earth. The dragon was a force of nature, unstoppable and unyielding, its power and fury on full display as it unleashed its blazing wrath upon the world.\r\n\r\n**Characteristics:**\r\n\r\n* **Fire-breathing**: The dragon\'s most iconic ability, capable of unleashing powerful blasts of flame that can reduce anything to ashes.\r\n* **Scale armor**: The dragon\'s body is covered in tough, heat-resistant scales that protect it from its own flames and any external attacks.\r\n* **Winged**: The dragon\'s wings allow it to soar through the skies, spreading its flames and terrorizing its enemies from above.\r\n* **Clawed**: The dragon\'s sharp claws can dig deep into the earth, giving it a stable foundation from which to launch its attacks.\r\n* **Intelligent**: The dragon is a cunning and intelligent creature, able to adapt and strategize in its pursuit of dominance.', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '**The Blazing Fury of the Dragon**\r\n\r\nAs the magnificent creature unfolded its wings, a wave of heat emanated from its body, signaling the impending inferno. The drago