(956, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for a dragon business on Facebook:\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of embracing my true self and living life to the fullest. Here are a few things I\'ve learned along the way:\n\n* Being different is what makes me special\n* My fiery personality is an asset, not a weakness\n* I don\'t have to hide my true nature to fit in\n* I can use my talents to make a positive impact on the world\n* Self-acceptance is key to happiness and success\n\n#DragonsOfFacebook #EmbracingIndividuality #SelfAcceptance #MentalHealthMatters #TrendingNow #DragonSquad #FireBreathersUnite #PositiveVibesOnly\"\n\nThis caption is professional, relatable, and includes trending hashtags to increase visibility and engagement on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-11 11:18:00', '2026-03-11 11:18:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-03-11 11:18:16', '2026-03-11 11:18:16'),
