(958, 'dragon', 'The scene you\'ve described is a breathtaking, ultra-detailed cinematic fantasy landscape that captures the peaceful essence of a sunrise in a vast, ancient valley. The combination of natural and fantasy elements creates a serene atmosphere, inviting the viewer to step into this enchanting world.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the valley lies a crystal-clear lake, perfectly reflecting the surrounding landscape like a mirror. The water\'s surface is calm, with only subtle ripples where elegant swans glide across the lake. The surrounding forests are dense and vibrant, with towering ancient trees, emerald green leaves, and flowering trees bursting with soft pink, lavender, and white blossoms.\r\n\r\nA small medieval village rests near the edge of the lake, with warm wooden beams and light stone walls. The rooftops are made of dark clay tiles and aged wood, with some covered in creeping ivy and tiny patches of moss. Thin trails of smoke rise slowly from chimneys, suggesting early morning life as villagers begin their day.\r\n\r\nNear the center of the village stands a beautiful stone bridge, crossing a narrow river that flows from the lake and continues through the forest. The bridge is elegant yet simple, with carved stone railings and faintly glowing lanterns that are slowly fading as daylight grows stronger.\r\n\r\nOn a hill overlooking the village stands a majestic ancient castle, built of pale gray stone, with tall towers rising proudly above the valley. The architecture is a mix of medieval European design and fantasy elements, with tall spires, arched windows, banners flowing in the breeze, and decorative stone carvings depicting mythical creatures such as dragons and phoenixes.\r\n\r\nThe scene is filled with subtle details, from the winding stone road leading up to the castle gates to the small gardens filled with roses, lavender, and herbs. In the distance, waterfalls cascade down the cliffs of the surrounding mountains, creating fine mist clouds that catch sunlight and form faint rainbows.\r\n\r\nThe lighting is soft and cinematic, with long golden sun rays stretching across the valley, illuminating different layers of the landscape and creating a sense of depth and scale. The color palette balances natural greens, earthy browns, cool blues, and warm golden highlights, introducing subtle pastel shades that contrast beautifully with the deeper forest tones.\r\n\r\nThe entire composition is designed to feel peaceful, immersive, and awe-inspiring, like a frame from an epic fantasy film. The environment suggests a living world with history and culture, yet remains calm and serene in the quiet moment of sunrise.\r\n\r\nKey features of this landscape include:\r\n\r\n* Ultra-high resolution and extremely detailed textures\r\n* Volumetric lighting and global illumination\r\n* Soft atmospheric haze and cinematic color grading\r\n* Dynamic range lighting and fantasy realism style\r\n* Highly detailed digital painting mixed with photorealistic rendering\r\n* Masterpiece quality, 8K resolution, and ultra-sharp focus\r\n* Dramatic composition and immersive fantasy world\r\n* Visually stunning landscape artwork\r\n\r\nOverall, this scene is a masterpiece of fantasy landscape art, inviting the viewer to step into a serene and enchanting world, filled with natural beauty, magic, and wonder.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'A breathtaking ultra-detailed cinematic fantasy landscape depicting a vast ancient valley at sunrise, surrounded by towering mountains whose snow-covered peaks glow softly in golden morning light. The scene captures the peaceful transition between night and day, where the sky blends deep violet and indigo tones from the fading night into brilliant gradients of warm orange, soft pink, and pale gold near the horizon. Thin clouds drift slowly across the sky, illuminated by sunlight from behind, creating a dramatic but tranquil atmosphere.\r\n\r\nIn the center of the valley lies an enormous crystal-clear lake that perfectly reflects the sky, mountains, and surrounding forests like a mirror. The water surface is calm with only subtle ripples spreading outward where a few elegant swans glide slowly across the lake. The water near the shore is shallow and transparent, revealing smooth colorful stones beneath the surface, each glistening softly in the early sunlight.\r\n\r\nDense forests stretch across the valley floor surrounding the lake. The forest is composed of a mix of towering ancient trees with thick twisting trunks, emerald green leaves, and scattered flowering trees bursting with soft pink, lavender, and white blossoms. Sunlight filters through the canopy, creating rays of light that pierce the morning mist and illuminate floating particles of pollen and dew in the air. The forest floor is rich with ferns, moss, small wildflowers, and winding natural paths that disappear into the deeper woods.\r\n\r\nA small medieval village rests near the edge of the lake, built from warm wooden beams and light stone walls. The rooftops are made of dark clay tiles and aged wood, some covered in creeping ivy and tiny patches of moss. Thin trails of smoke rise slowly from chimneys, suggesting early morning life as villagers begin their day. Narrow cobblestone streets wind between cozy houses, small bakeries, lantern posts, and market stalls that are just beginning to open.\r\n\r\nNear the center of the village stands a beautiful stone bridge crossing a narrow river that flows from the lake and continues through the forest. The bridge is elegant yet simple, with carved stone railings and faintly glowing lanterns that are slowly fading as daylight grows stronger. The water beneath the bridge flows gently over smooth rocks, producing tiny white splashes and reflections of the golden sky.\r\n\r\nOn a hill overlooking the village stands a majestic ancient castle built of pale gray stone, its tall towers rising proudly above the valley. The architecture is a mixture of medieval European design and fantasy elements, with tall spires, arched windows, banners flowing in the breeze, and decorative stone carvings depicting mythical creatures such as dragons and phoenixes. Warm light shines from some of the castle windows, hinting at life within the massive structure.\r\n\r\nA winding stone road leads from the village up to the castle gates. Along this road, small lantern posts line the path, their lights barely visible in the growing sunlight. The road curves gracefully along the hillside, passing small gardens filled with roses, lavender, and herbs.\r\n\r\nIn the distance, waterfalls cascade down the cliffs of the surrounding mountains. These waterfalls appear like silver ribbons falling from great heights, creating fine mist clouds where they strike the rocks below. The mist catches sunlight, forming faint rainbows that shimmer in the air.\r\n\r\nThe mountains themselves are enormous and dramatic, their rugged slopes covered in dense pine forests at lower elevations and bare rocky cliffs higher up. The tallest peaks are capped with thick snow and ice that reflect bright sunlight. Occasional clouds drift slowly across the peaks, casting moving shadows over the valley below.\r\n\r\nWildlife is subtly present throughout the scene. A small group of deer cautiously walks along the forest edge near the lake. Birds glide gracefully through the sky, their silhouettes crossing the glowing horizon. Butterflies hover among the flowers near the village gardens, adding tiny bursts of color and life to the environment.\r\n\r\nThe lighting of the entire scene is soft, cinematic, and highly atmospheric. Long golden sun rays stretch across the valley, illuminating different layers of the landscape and creating a sense of depth and scale. Light fog gently rolls across the ground near the lake and forest edges, enhancing the dreamlike quality of the scene.\r\n\r\nTextures throughout the environment are extremely detailed. Tree bark appears rough and ancient, stones show signs of weathering and moss growth, rooftops display realistic wear and texture, and the water reflects the environment with near-perfect clarity. Every element of the environment contributes to a sense of realism combined with magical fantasy beauty.\r\n\r\nThe color palette balances natural greens, earthy browns, cool blues, and warm golden highlights. The sky introduces subtle pastel shades that contrast beautifully with the deeper forest tones. The entire composition is designed to feel peaceful, immersive, and awe-inspiring.\r\n\r\nCamera perspective is wide and slightly elevated, as if captured by a cinematic drone or from a scenic overlook on a nearby mountain. This perspective allows the viewer to see the entire valley composition — lake, village, castle, forests, mountains, and sky — all arranged harmoniously in one expansive panoramic view.\r\n\r\nThe scene should feel like a frame from an epic fantasy film, combining realism, artistic beauty, and atmospheric storytelling. The environment suggests a living world with history and culture, yet remains calm and serene in the quiet moment of sunrise.\r\n\r\nUltra-high resolution, extremely detailed textures, volumetric lighting, global illumination, soft atmospheric haze, cinematic color grading, dynamic range lighting, fantasy realism style, epic environmental storytelling, highly detailed digital painting mixed with photorealistic rendering, masterpiece quality, 8K resolution, ultra sharp focus, dramatic composition, immersive fantasy world, visually stunning landscape artwork.', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A breathtaking ultra-detailed cinematic fantasy landscape depicting a vast ancient valley at sunrise, surrounded by towering mountains whose snow-covered peaks glow softly in golden morning light. The scene captures the peaceful transition between night and day, where the sky blends deep violet and indigo tones from the fading night into brilliant gradients of warm orange, soft pink, and p