(972, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', 'Here\'s a potential Facebook post for the dragon business/creator:\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of staying on top of my game. Here are a few things I\'ve learned along the way:\n\n* Setting goals and prioritizing tasks is key to achieving success\n* Taking calculated risks can lead to great rewards\n* Surrounding myself with a supportive community has been instrumental in my growth\n* Continuously learning and adapting to new situations has helped me stay ahead of the curve\n\nBy following these principles, I\'ve been able to build a thriving business and community. I hope you find these tips helpful in your own journey! #DragonSlayingTips #BusinessGoals #SuccessMindset #EntrepreneurLife #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #FacebookForBusiness\"\n\nNote: The hashtags used are a mix of popular and trending ones, as well as some niche-specific ones to reach the target audience. The tone is professional and relatable, with a touch of personality from the dragon creator.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-11 14:38:00', '2026-03-11 14:39:39', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-03-11 14:39:39', '2026-03-11 14:39:39'),
