(976, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', 'Here\'s a sample post:\n\n**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and leadership. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* Believe in yourself and your abilities, just like I believe in my fire-breathing skills\n* Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things - it\'s often the best way to grow and learn\n* Surround yourself with people who support and encourage you, just like my loyal dragon friends\n* Stay focused on your goals and keep working towards them, even when the going gets tough\n* And most importantly, always remember to breathe fire into your passions and pursuits\n\n#DragonWisdom #LeadershipLessons #MotivationMonday #FireUpYourPassions #BelieveInYourself #RiskAndReward #SupportSystem #GoalOriented #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #Inspiration #ProfessionalDevelopment\n\nThis post is professional, relatable, and includes trending hashtags to reach a wider audience on Facebook. The caption is in points, making it easy to read and understand, and the tone is motivational and inspirational.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-11 15:24:00', '2026-03-11 15:24:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-03-11 15:24:17', '2026-03-11 15:24:17'),
