(979, 'dragon', 'The majestic dragon soars through the night sky, its enormous wings spread wide as it unleashes a stream of powerful flames from its mouth. The fire illuminates the dark landscape, casting a warm glow over the surroundings. The dragon\'s glowing red eyes seem to pierce through the darkness, radiating an intense, inner light.\r\n\r\nAs the dragon flies, its huge wings beat the air, creating a whirlwind that stirs up the clouds. The sound of its wings flapping is like thunder, shaking the ground below. The dragon\'s sharp claws extend from its massive paws, gleaming in the firelight like razor-sharp knives.\r\n\r\nThe dragon\'s dark scales glisten in the firelight, reflecting the flames like a black mirror. The scales seem to absorb the light, giving the dragon an otherworldly appearance. The fire dancing across its body casts a hypnotic spell, drawing the viewer\'s eye inexorably towards the dragon\'s majestic form.\r\n\r\nThe cinematic lighting creates a dramatic atmosphere, with deep shadows and highlights that accentuate the dragon\'s powerful physique. The ultra-realistic 4K fantasy art brings the dragon to life, making it seem as though it might swoop down from the sky at any moment, breathing fire and destruction upon the landscape.\r\n\r\nAs the dragon flies, the flames it breathes seem to take on a life of their own, dancing and swirling in the air like living serpents. The fire lights up the night sky, casting a golden glow over the stars and creating an breathtaking spectacle that is both beautiful and terrifying.\r\n\r\nIn this moment, the dragon is the master of the night, its power and majesty unchallenged. It rules the skies, a creature of legend and myth, its dominion over the world unshakeable. The dragon\'s roar echoes through the night, a sound that is both fierce and beautiful, a reminder of the magic and wonder that lies just beyond the edge of reality.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'A massive fantasy dragon flying in the sky, breathing powerful flames from its mouth, glowing red eyes, huge wings spread wide, sharp claws, dark scales, fire lighting up the night sky, cinematic lighting, ultra realistic, 4K fantasy art, dramatic atmosphere', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A massive fantasy dragon flying in the sky, breathing powerful flames from its mouth, glowing red eyes, huge wings spread wide, sharp claws, dark scales, fire lighting up the night sky, cinematic lighting, ultra realistic, 4K fantasy art, dramatic atmosphere', 'https://pollinations.ai/p/A_massive_fantasy_dragon_flying_in_the_sky%2C_breathing_powerful_flames_from_its_mouth%2C_glowing_red_eyes%2C_huge_wings_spread_wide%2C_sharp_claws%2C_dark_scales%2C_fire_lighting_up_the_night_sky%2C_cinematic_lighting%2C_ultra_realistic%2C_4K_fantasy_art%2C_dramatic_atmosphere', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-03-11 16:01:31', '2026-03-11 16:01:31'),
(980, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m not capable of physically creating images, but I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends.\n\nThe image is a vibrant and lively photograph taken on a warm summer evening. The scene is set in a trendy outdoor bar, with a stunning cityscape in the background. The man, in his mid-30s, is standing in the center of the frame, surrounded by a group of friends, all of whom are laughing and smiling.\n\nThe man is wearing a casual yet stylish outfit, consisting of a light-blue button-down shirt, dark jeans, and a pair of brown leather shoes. He has a confident and relaxed demeanor, with his arms around the shoulders of his friends. His hair is messy and perfectly imperfect, and his eyes are bright and sparkling with amusement.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress. She\'s holding a glass of wine and has a joyful expression on her face. Next to her is a tall, lanky man with a beard and a baseball cap, who\'s grinning from ear to ear.\n\nOn the man\'s right is another woman, with short, spiky black hair and a red tank top. She\'s laughing and playfully teasing the man, who\'s pretending to be offended. Behind them, a group of people are milling about, chatting and enjoying the music and the atmosphere.\n\nThe image is captured in a warm, golden light, with the setting sun casting a glow over the entire scene. The colors are rich and vibrant, with deep shadows and highlights that add depth and dimension to the photograph. The overall mood is one of camaraderie and joy, with the man and his friends enjoying each other\'s company and the beautiful summer evening.\n\nIn terms of technical specifications, the image is:\n\n* Resolution: 4000 x 6000 pixels\n* Aspect ratio: 2:3\n* File format: JPEG\n* Color profile: Adobe RGB\n* Exposure: f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 400\n* Camera: Nikon D850 with a 24-70mm f/2.8 lens\n\nThis high-quality image would be perfect for use in a variety of applications, including social media, advertising, and editorial content.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-11 16:06:00', '2026-03-11 16:06:16', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-03-11 16:06:16', '2026-03-11 16:06:16'),
(981, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a quintessential blend of modernity, style, and the subtle allure of rain-kissed urban landscapes. Let\'s break down the elements that make this image so captivating and explore how they contribute to its overall aesthetic and cinematic quality.\n\n1. **Transparent Umbrella**: The use of a transparent umbrella is a clever choice. It not only protects the girl from the rain but also allows the viewer to see her face and outfit clearly, which might not be possible with a traditional opaque umbrella. This adds an element of intimacy and connection to the subject.\n\n2. **Light Rain**: The light rain creates a mystical ambiance, softening the surroundings and highlighting the neon reflections on the wet street. It\'s not heavy enough to obscure the view or dampen the mood but just sufficient to create a sense of freshness and coolness, often associated with rainy days.\n\n3. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: Neon lights reflecting off wet pavement is a classic urban aesthetic. It adds a pop of color and vibrancy to the scene, creating a dynamic interplay of light and shadow. These reflections can also act as leading lines, guiding the viewer\'s eye through the image and adding depth.\n\n4. **Aesthetic Photography**: The term \"aesthetic photography\" refers to the pursuit of creating images that are not just visually appealing but also evoke a certain mood or atmosphere. In this case, the combination of the girl, the umbrella, the rain, and the neon lights all contribute to a distinct aesthetic that\'s both modern and timeless.\n\n5. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: The soft bokeh (out-of-focus areas) of the lights, especially the neon reflections, add a layer of sophistication to the image. Bokeh can create a sense of depth and dimensionality, separating the subject from the background and emphasizing her presence in the scene.\n\n6. **Fashionable Outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is crucial as it adds a layer of personality and style to the image. It could include trendy pieces like a chic coat, stylish boots, or accessories that reflect her character, making her more relatable and interesting to the viewer.\n\n7. **Cinematic Mood**: The overall cinematographic quality of the scene is enhanced by the interplay of light, shadow, and color. The setting resembles a frame from a movie, inviting the viewer to imagine the story behind the image. This could be a moment from a romantic comedy, a drama, or even a sci-fi film, depending on how one interprets the elements presented.\n\n8. **High-Detail**: The high level of detail in the image, from the texture of the umbrella and the girl\'s clothing to the reflections on the street, suggests a high-quality camera and a thoughtful approach to photography. This level of detail can make the image feel more real and engaging, allowing viewers to explore different aspects of the scene.\n\nIn summary, the image of a girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain, set against a backdrop of neon reflections on a wet street, embodies a unique blend of style, atmosphere, and storytelling. It\'s an image that not only captures a moment in time but also invites the viewer to step into its world, filled with the promise of cinematic drama and personal narrative.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-11 16:11:00', '2026-03-11 16:12:09', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-03-11 16:12:09', '2026-03-11 16:12:09'),
(982, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'It looks like you\'re just testing things out. If you have any questions or need help with something, feel free to ask and I\'ll do my best to assist you.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-11 16:33:00', '2026-03-11 16:33:14', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Tester?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 48, '2026-03-11 16:33:14', '2026-03-11 16:33:14'),
(983, 'ai', 'Artificial Intelligence (AI) refers to the development of computer systems that can perform tasks that would typically require human intelligence, such as:\r\n\r\n1. **Learning**: AI systems can learn from data and improve their performance over time.\r\n2. **Problem-solving**: AI systems can analyze problems and develop solutions.\r\n3. **Reasoning**: AI systems can draw inferences and make decisions based on available data.\r\n4. **Perception**: AI systems can interpret and understand data from sensors, such as images, speech, and text.\r\n\r\nAI has many applications, including:\r\n\r\n1. **Virtual assistants**: AI-powered virtual assistants, such as Siri, Alexa, and Google Assistant, can perform tasks like setting reminders, sending messages, and making calls.\r\n2. **Image recognition**: AI-powered image recognition systems can identify objects, people, and patterns in images.\r\n3. **Natural Language Processing (NLP)**: AI-powered NLP systems can understand and generate human language, enabling applications like language translation and text summarization.\r\n4. **Predictive maintenance**: AI-powered predictive maintenance systems can analyze data from sensors to predict when equipment is likely to fail, reducing downtime and increasing efficiency.\r\n\r\nTypes of AI:\r\n\r\n1. **Narrow or Weak AI**: Designed to perform a specific task, such as facial recognition or language translation.\r\n2. **General or Strong AI**: A hypothetical AI system that can perform any intellectual task that a human can.\r\n3. **Superintelligence**: An AI system that is significantly more intelligent than the best human minds.\r\n\r\nBenefits of AI:\r\n\r\n1. **Increased efficiency**: AI can automate repetitive tasks, freeing up human time for more creative and strategic work.\r\n2. **Improved accuracy**: AI can analyze large amounts of data and make predictions or decisions with high accuracy.\r\n3. **Enhanced customer experience**: AI-powered chatbots and virtual assistants can provide 24/7 customer support and personalized recommendations.\r\n\r\nChallenges and limitations of AI:\r\n\r\n1. **Bias and fairness**: AI systems can perpetuate existing biases if they are trained on biased data.\r\n2. **Explainability**: AI systems can be difficult to interpret and understand, making it challenging to trust their decisions.\r\n3. **Job displacement**: AI can automate jobs, potentially displacing human workers.\r\n\r\nOverall, AI has the potential to transform many industries and aspects of our lives, but it also raises important questions about the ethics and responsible development of AI systems.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'ai', '2026-03-11 17:15:00', '2026-03-11 17:15:01', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ai', 'https://pollinations.ai/p/ai', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-03-11 17:12:19', '2026-03-11 17:15:01'),
(984, 'bagpack', 'It seems like you\'re looking for information about backpacks. Here\'s a brief overview:\r\n\r\n**What is a Backpack?**\r\nA backpack, also known as a rucksack, is a bag designed to be carried on one\'s back. It typically has two straps that go over the shoulders and a main compartment to store items.\r\n\r\n**Types of Backpacks**\r\nThere are several types of backpacks, including:\r\n\r\n1. **Daypacks**: Small to medium-sized backpacks for daily use, hiking, or short trips.\r\n2. **Hiking Backpacks**: Larger backpacks designed for multi-day hiking trips, with features like waterproofing and multiple compartments.\r\n3. **Travel Backpacks**: Backpacks designed for travel, often with features like TSA-approved laptop sleeves and multiple pockets for organization.\r\n4. **School Backpacks**: Backpacks designed for students, often with features like padded laptop sleeves and multiple pockets for organization.\r\n\r\n**Features to Consider**\r\nWhen choosing a backpack, consider the following features:\r\n\r\n1. **Size**: Choose a backpack that fits your needs, with enough space for your gear.\r\n2. **Material**: Look for durable, water-resistant materials like nylon or polyester.\r\n3. **Comfort**: Consider a backpack with padded straps and a comfortable back panel.\r\n4. **Organization**: Look for multiple pockets and compartments to keep your gear organized.\r\n5. **Style**: Choose a backpack that fits your personal style, with options like colors, patterns, and designs.\r\n\r\n**Popular Brands**\r\nSome popular backpack brands include:\r\n\r\n1. **The North Face**\r\n2. **Patagonia**\r\n3. **Osprey**\r\n4. **REI Co-op**\r\n5. **Fjallraven**\r\n\r\nI hope this information helps you get started on your backpack search!', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'bagpack', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'bagpack', 'https://pollinations.ai/p/bagpack', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-03-11 17:14:36', '2026-03-11 17:14:36'),
(985, 'harley davidson', 'Harley-Davidson is an iconic American motorcycle manufacturer that has been producing high-quality bikes for over a century. Here are some key facts and details about Harley-Davidson:\r\n\r\n**History:**\r\nHarley-Davidson was founded in 1903 by William S. Harley and Arthur Davidson in Milwaukee, Wisconsin. The company started as a small motorcycle manufacturer and quickly gained popularity for its innovative designs and powerful engines.\r\n\r\n**Models:**\r\nHarley-Davidson offers a wide range of motorcycle models, including:\r\n\r\n1. Electra Glide: A classic touring bike with a large fairing and comfortable seating.\r\n2. Softail: A line of bikes with a hidden rear suspension and a classic, hardtail look.\r\n3. Sportster: A lightweight, sporty bike with a compact design and agile handling.\r\n4. Fat Boy: A iconic bike with a distinctive design and a powerful V-twin engine.\r\n5. Street Glide: A touring bike with a sleek design and advanced technology features.\r\n\r\n**Innovations:**\r\nHarley-Davidson has been at the forefront of motorcycle innovation, introducing features such as:\r\n\r\n1. V-twin engine: A powerful and iconic engine design that has become synonymous with Harley-Davidson.\r\n2. Electric start: A convenient feature that eliminates the need for kickstarting.\r\n3. Anti-lock braking system (ABS): A safety feature that helps prevent wheel lockup during hard braking.\r\n4. Infotainment systems: Advanced technology features that provide navigation, music, and communication capabilities.\r\n\r\n**Culture:**\r\nHarley-Davidson has a unique and dedicated culture, with a strong sense of community among riders. The company has:\r\n\r\n1. Harley Owners Group (HOG): A membership organization that provides benefits, events, and rides for Harley-Davidson enthusiasts.\r\n2. Motorcycle rallies: Harley-Davidson sponsors and participates in numerous motorcycle rallies and events around the world.\r\n3. Brand apparel: Harley-Davidson offers a wide range of branded clothing and accessories, from leather jackets to hats and gloves.\r\n\r\n**Racing and Performance:**\r\nHarley-Davidson has a rich racing heritage, with a strong presence in:\r\n\r\n1. Flat track racing: Harley-Davidson has a long history of competing in flat track racing, with numerous championships and wins.\r\n2. Drag racing: Harley-Davidson has a strong presence in drag racing, with custom-built bikes and skilled riders.\r\n3. Hill climb racing: Harley-Davidson has competed in hill climb events, showcasing the power and agility of its bikes.\r\n\r\n**Global Presence:**\r\nHarley-Davidson has a significant global presence, with:\r\n\r\n1. Manufacturing facilities: Harley-Davidson has manufacturing facilities in the United States, Brazil, and India.\r\n2. Dealerships: Harley-Davidson has a network of dealerships in over 100 countries around the world.\r\n3. Export sales: Harley-Davidson exports bikes to numerous countries, with a strong presence in Europe, Asia, and Latin America.\r\n\r\nOverall, Harley-Davidson is an iconic brand that has become synonymous with American motorcycle culture. With its rich history, innovative designs, and commitment to performance and community, Harley-Davidson continues to be a leader in the motorcycle industry.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'draft', 1, 'harley davidson', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'harley davidson', 'https://pollinations.ai/p/harley_davidson', NULL, 'pending', NULL, '2026-03-11 17:39:09', '2026-03-11 17:39:09'),
(986, 'Harley Davison', 'Here\'s a descriptive image of a man driving a Harley Davidson on a straight highway:\r\n\r\nThe sun is shining brightly overhead, casting a warm glow over the endless stretch of asphalt. The highway stretches out before the rider, a seemingly endless ribbon of blacktop that disappears into the horizon.\r\n\r\nThe man, dressed in a black leather jacket and jeans, sits confidently on the saddle of his Harley Davidson, his feet planted firmly on the footpegs. His helmet, a sleek black lid with a tinted visor, shields his face from the wind and sun. A pair of gloves covers his hands, gripping the handlebars with a firm but relaxed grasp.\r\n\r\nThe Harley Davidson itself is a majestic machine, its chrome accents glinting in the sunlight. The bike\'s iconic V-twin engine rumbles smoothly, its exhaust notes a deep, throaty growl that echoes through the air. The bike\'s suspension absorbs the minor imperfections in the road, providing a smooth ride for the rider.\r\n\r\nAs the man cruises down the highway, the wind whips through his hair, and his jacket flaps slightly in the breeze. He leans forward slightly, his weight shifted onto the tank, as he guides the bike through the gentle curves of the road.\r\n\r\nTo the left and right, the landscape stretches out in a seemingly endless expanse of fields and forests, punctuated by the occasional billboard or roadside diner. The sky above is a brilliant blue, with just a few wispy clouds scattered across the horizon.\r\n\r\nThe man\'s face, obscured by his helmet, is set in a determined expression, his eyes fixed on the road ahead. He\'s lost in the thrill of the ride, the rush of adrenaline and the sense of freedom that comes with cruising down the open highway on his trusty Harley Davidson.\r\n\r\nIn the distance, the horizon stretches out, a perfect line where the sky meets the earth. The man and his bike are a tiny speck on the landscape, but they\'re the center of attention, the focal point of this idyllic scene. The Harley Davidson and its rider are one with the road, a perfect union of man and machine, cruising effortlessly through the heart of America.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'Create an image of a man driving harley davidson in straight highway', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Create an image of a man driving harley davidson in straight highway', 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Create_an_image_of_a_man_driving_harley_davidson_in_straight_highway', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-03-11 17:43:07', '2026-03-11 17:43:07'),
