(997, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of ceramic, plastic, or clay. It provides a space for plants to grow and can be used for both indoor and outdoor gardening.\n\nHere are some interesting facts about flower pots:\n\n1. **History**: The use of flower pots dates back to ancient civilizations, such as the Egyptians, Greeks, and Romans, who used clay pots to grow plants.\n2. **Materials**: Flower pots can be made from a variety of materials, including ceramic, terracotta, plastic, wood, and concrete.\n3. **Designs**: Flower pots come in a wide range of designs, from simple and functional to decorative and ornate.\n4. **Sizes**: Flower pots can range in size from small, mini pots to large, oversized planters.\n5. **Uses**: Flower pots can be used for a variety of plants, including flowers, herbs, succulents, and trees.\n\nSome popular types of flower pots include:\n\n1. **Hanging baskets**: Suspended pots that allow plants to spill over the edges.\n2. **Self-watering pots**: Pots with built-in water reservoirs that help plants stay hydrated.\n3. **Terra cotta pots**: Clay pots that are breathable and allow for healthy root growth.\n4. **Planter boxes**: Large, rectangular pots used for gardening and landscaping.\n\nOverall, flower pots are a versatile and essential tool for gardening and plant care, allowing us to grow and enjoy a wide range of plants in our homes and outdoor spaces.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-11 18:07:00', '2026-03-11 18:08:07', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Flower_pot', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-03-11 18:08:07', '2026-03-11 18:08:07'),
(998, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'Here are the weekday greetings, excluding the weekends:\n\n1. Monday - Good Morning\n2. Tuesday - Good Morning\n3. Wednesday - Good Morning\n4. Thursday - Good Morning\n5. Friday - Good Morning\n\nNote that Saturday and Sunday are typically considered weekend days, so I\'ve excluded them from the list.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-11 18:26:00', '2026-03-11 18:27:06', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2026-03-11 18:27:06', '2026-03-11 18:27:06'),
