(1012, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', 'Here\'s a possible Facebook post:\n\n\"As a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are a few key takeaways:\n\n* Be fearless and take calculated risks to achieve your goals\n* Build a strong team around you and empower them to succeed\n* Stay adaptable and open to new opportunities and challenges\n* Never stop learning and growing, both personally and professionally\n* And most importantly, always keep your fire burning and your passion ignited!\n\n#DragonSlayingBusinessTips #EntrepreneurLife #BusinessSuccess #LeadershipGoals #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #BusinessInspiration #ProfessionalGrowth #FireUpYourPassion\"\n\nThis post uses a professional tone and language, while also incorporating a touch of personality and whimsy with the dragon theme. The hashtags are a mix of popular and trending tags, as well as some niche tags that are relevant to the business and entrepreneurial community.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-12 14:38:00', '2026-03-12 14:39:33', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-03-12 14:39:33', '2026-03-12 14:39:33'),
