(1151, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', 'Here\'s a sample post for a dragon-themed business/creator on Facebook:\n\n**Embracing the Fire Within**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned to harness my inner strength and passion to achieve greatness. Here are a few key takeaways that I\'d like to share with you:\n\n* Believe in yourself and your abilities\n* Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things\n* Surround yourself with people who support and encourage you\n* Keep learning and growing every day\n* Stay true to your values and principles\n\nBy following these principles, you can unlock your full potential and achieve your goals. Remember to always stay focused, motivated, and inspired!\n\n#DragonsDen #MotivationMonday #PositiveVibesOnly #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #SuccessMindset #InspirationalQuotes #FacebookForBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #PersonalGrowth #DragonFire', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-17 10:35:00', '2026-03-17 10:35:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-03-17 10:35:15', '2026-03-17 10:35:15');
