(1162, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n**Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-tailored suit in black, navy, or gray is a classic choice for formal parties.\n2. **Tuxedos**: A tuxedo is perfect for black-tie events and can be paired with a bow tie or a long tie.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt in white or light colors is a must-have for formal parties.\n4. **Dress Pants**: Formal dress pants in black, navy, or gray can be paired with a dress shirt and a blazer.\n\n**Semi-Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer in navy, gray, or beige can add a touch of sophistication to a casual outfit.\n2. **Dress Shoes**: Dress shoes in black, brown, or loafers can elevate a semi-formal outfit.\n3. **Chinos**: Chinos in light colors can be paired with a dress shirt and a blazer for a stylish look.\n4. **Polos**: A polo shirt in a bold color can add a pop of color to a semi-formal outfit.\n\n**Casual Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Jeans**: Dark wash jeans can be paired with a casual shirt and sneakers for a relaxed look.\n2. **Graphic T-Shirts**: Graphic t-shirts can add a fun touch to a casual outfit.\n3. **Hoodies**: Hoodies can be paired with jeans and sneakers for a casual, laid-back look.\n4. **Sneakers**: Sneakers in bold colors can add a stylish touch to a casual outfit.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n1. **Watches**: A leather strap watch or a metallic watch can add a touch of sophistication to a party outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of elegance to a formal outfit.\n3. **Pocket Squares**: A pocket square can add a pop of color to a formal outfit.\n4. **Belt**: A leather belt can add a touch of sophistication to a party outfit.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Dress according to the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the theme and formality of the party.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure your clothes fit well and are not too tight or too loose.\n3. **Accessories can make or break an outfit**: Choose accessories that complement your outfit and add a touch of personality to your look.\n4. **Be confident**: Own your look and have fun!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-17 12:40:00', '2026-03-17 12:41:08', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Party_Wear_for_Mens', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-03-17 12:41:08', '2026-03-17 12:41:08'),
(1163, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:45', 'Shoes are a type of footwear that people wear to protect and comfort their feet. There are many different types of shoes, including:\n\n1. Sneakers: casual, athletic shoes often used for sports or everyday wear.\n2. Boots: high-topped shoes that cover the ankle and often the calf, often worn for fashion or in cold weather.\n3. Sandals: open-toed shoes that expose the foot, often worn in warm weather.\n4. Loafers: slip-on shoes that don\'t have laces or buckles, often worn for business or formal occasions.\n5. High heels: shoes with a raised heel, often worn by women for formal or dressy occasions.\n6. Flats: shoes with a flat heel, often worn for comfort or casual occasions.\n7. Dress shoes: formal shoes worn for special occasions, such as weddings or job interviews.\n8. Hiking boots: sturdy shoes designed for hiking or outdoor activities.\n9. Dance shoes: special shoes designed for specific types of dance, such as ballet or ballroom dance.\n10. Orthopedic shoes: shoes designed to provide support and comfort for people with foot or ankle problems.\n\nShoes can be made from a variety of materials, including leather, synthetic materials, and mesh. They can also have different features, such as arch support, cushioning, and waterproofing.\n\nWhat type of shoes are you interested in learning more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-17 12:45:00', '2026-03-17 12:46:05', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Shoes', NULL, 'pending', 21, '2026-03-17 12:46:05', '2026-03-17 12:46:05'),
(1164, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, or special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts usually have a point collar, spread collar, or a cutaway collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are typically made from high-quality cotton, linen, or silk fabrics.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit snugly, with a slim fit through the body and sleeves.\n5. **Button-front**: Formal shirts usually have a button-front closure.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Dress shirt**: A classic formal shirt with a point collar, French cuffs, and a slim fit.\n2. **Business shirt**: A slightly more relaxed version of the dress shirt, with a spread collar and button cuffs.\n3. **Wing-tip shirt**: A formal shirt with a wing-tip collar and French cuffs, often worn with a tuxedo.\n4. **Polo shirt**: A more casual version of the formal shirt, with a polo collar and short sleeves.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White**: A classic choice for formal shirts, suitable for business and formal events.\n2. **Light blue**: A popular choice for business shirts, adding a touch of color to a formal outfit.\n3. **Stripped**: Thin stripes are a common pattern for formal shirts, adding visual interest to a plain white or light-colored shirt.\n4. **Checks**: Small checks or grids are another popular pattern for formal shirts.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: Known for their high-quality, stylish formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French luxury brand offering exquisite formal shirts with unique designs and fabrics.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: An American brand offering classic, high-quality formal shirts with a preppy twist.\n4. **Ted Baker**: A British brand offering stylish, affordable formal shirts with a focus on detail and quality.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Choose a fit that suits your body type**: Make sure the shirt fits snugly, but not too tightly.\n2. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a shirt that matches the formality of the event.\n3. **Pay attention to details**: Look for high-quality buttons, stitching, and fabric to ensure a durable and stylish shirt.\n4. **Iron your shirt**: Make sure to iron your shirt before wearing it to ensure a crisp, professional look.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-17 12:56:00', '2026-03-17 12:57:05', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Formal_shirt_for_mens', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-03-17 12:57:05', '2026-03-17 12:57:05'),
