(1259, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of dress shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts usually have a point collar, spread collar, or a wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or barrel cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are typically made from high-quality cotton, linen, or a cotton-blend fabric.\n4. **Weave**: Formal shirts often have a tight weave, such as a pinpoint or a twill weave.\n5. **Color**: Formal shirts are usually white, light blue, or other muted colors.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic Fit**: A traditional fit with a relaxed silhouette.\n2. **Slim Fit**: A modern fit with a slim silhouette, often preferred by younger men.\n3. **Tailored Fit**: A fit that is tailored to the individual\'s body, often with a slim silhouette and a nipped-in waist.\n4. **Dress Shirt with Contrast Cuffs and Collar**: A shirt with contrasting cuffs and collar, often in a different color or pattern.\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt**: A classic formal shirt with a collar and cuffs.\n2. **Tuxedo Shirt**: A formal shirt specifically designed to be worn with a tuxedo.\n3. **Business Shirt**: A formal shirt designed for business wear, often with a more relaxed fit.\n4. **Evening Shirt**: A formal shirt designed for evening events, often with a more formal collar style and cuff links.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: A British brand known for its high-quality formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French brand that has been a benchmark for formal shirts since 1838.\n3. **Burberry**: A British brand that offers a range of formal shirts with a classic, timeless design.\n4. **Armani**: An Italian brand that offers a range of formal shirts with a modern, stylish design.\n\n**How to Choose a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a shirt that is suitable for the occasion, such as a business meeting or a formal event.\n2. **Think about your body type**: Choose a fit that flatters your body type, such as a slim fit if you have a slender build.\n3. **Select a high-quality fabric**: Choose a shirt made from a high-quality fabric that will last long and look good.\n4. **Pay attention to details**: Consider the collar style, cuff style, and other details that will affect the overall look of the shirt.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-20 12:56:00', '2026-03-20 12:57:05', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/Formal_shirt_for_mens', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-03-20 12:57:05', '2026-03-20 12:57:05'),
