(1311, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', 'Here\'s a possible Facebook post:\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of embracing our true selves and overcoming challenges. Here are a few relatable points to consider:\n\n* Being a creature of legend can be intimidating, but it\'s also a unique opportunity to make a lasting impact.\n* Just like how I hoard treasure, we all have our own treasures to protect and cherish - whether it\'s our time, energy, or loved ones.\n* Sometimes, we need to breathe fire to clear a path and make way for new opportunities.\n* And, of course, self-care is essential - whether it\'s taking a relaxing flight or enjoying a nice cup of tea in a hidden cave.\n\n#DragonsOfFacebook #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #PersonalGrowth #SelfCare #LegendInTheMaking #FireBreathingInspiration\"\n\nThis post aims to provide a professional tone while still being relatable and engaging, using a mix of trending and niche-specific hashtags to reach a wider audience on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-22 10:35:00', '2026-03-22 10:35:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-03-22 10:35:17', '2026-03-22 10:35:17');
