f warmth and happiness, making the viewer feel like they\'re part of the group, hanging out with friends on a lovely summer evening.\n\nI hope this description helps you visualize a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-22 16:06:00', '2026-03-22 16:06:16', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-03-22 16:06:16', '2026-03-22 16:06:16'),
