ramatic lighting and cinematic style enhance the emotional impact of the scene, creating a lasting impression on the viewer.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-03-22 17:46:00', '2026-03-22 17:47:35', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://pollinations.ai/p/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-03-22 17:47:35', '2026-03-22 17:47:35'),
