(1681, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a large language model, I don\'t have the capability to directly create images. But I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends, and you can use your imagination to visualize it.\n\n**Image Description:**\n\nThe image is a high-quality, well-lit photograph of a group of friends, with a man as the central figure. The scene is set in a trendy outdoor cafe on a warm summer evening. The sun has just begun to set, casting a warm orange glow over the entire scene.\n\nThe man, likely in his mid-twenties, is sitting on a comfortable outdoor couch, surrounded by his friends. He\'s wearing a casual, yet stylish outfit, consisting of a white linen shirt, dark blue jeans, and a pair of sleek, black sunglasses perched on his forehead. His hair is messy and stylishly undone, and he has a relaxed, effortless smile on his face.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress. She\'s laughing and chatting with the man, her eyes sparkling with amusement. On his right is another friend, a tall, lanky guy with a baseball cap and a friendly grin. He\'s holding a cold beer and clinking it against the man\'s glass in a toast.\n\nIn the background, the outdoor cafe is bustling with activity. There are people milling about, chatting and laughing, and the sound of clinking glasses and upbeat music fills the air. The atmosphere is lively and carefree, capturing the joy and camaraderie of a night out with friends.\n\nThe image is shot from a slightly elevated perspective, with the camera looking down on the group. The composition is balanced and visually appealing, with the man and his friends forming a tight, intimate circle. The colors are vibrant and rich, with the warm lighting of the setting sun casting a golden glow over the entire scene.\n\n**Image Specifications:**\n\n* Resolution: 3000 x 2000 pixels\n* Aspect Ratio: 3:2\n* File Format: JPEG\n* Camera: Nikon D850 with a 24-70mm f/2.8 lens\n* Settings: ISO 400, f/4, 1/125s\n\nI hope this description helps you visualize the image!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-02 16:06:00', '2026-04-02 16:06:16', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-04-02 16:06:16', '2026-04-02 16:06:16'),
(1682, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a quintessential blend of fashion, cinematography, and aesthetic photography, set against the backdrop of a lightly raining cityscape. Let\'s break down the elements that make this image so captivating:\n\n1. **Transparent Umbrella**: The use of a transparent umbrella is a clever choice. It not only protects the girl from the rain but also allows the viewer to see her face and outfit clearly, while still conveying the rainy atmosphere. The transparency also adds a layer of elegance and sophistication to the overall scene.\n\n2. **Light Rain**: The light rain creates a misty, mystical ambiance that enhances the cinematic mood of the photograph. It\'s enough to wet the streets and create reflections, but not so heavy that it obscures the details of the scene or the subject.\n\n3. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: The neon lights reflected on the wet street are a hallmark of urban aesthetic photography. These reflections add vibrant colors to the scene, creating a juxtaposition between the gloominess of the rain and the brightness of the neon lights. This contrast is visually appealing and contributes to the cinematic feel of the image.\n\n4. **Aesthetic Photography**: The term \"aesthetic photography\" refers to the creation of images that are not just visually pleasing but also evoke a certain mood or atmosphere. In this case, the combination of the rain, neon reflections, and the outfit of the girl all contribute to an aesthetic that is both futuristic and nostalgic, blending the coldness of urban landscapes with the warmth of human presence.\n\n5. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: The soft bokeh (out-of-focus areas) of the lights in the background add a dreamy quality to the photograph. Bokeh can significantly affect the mood of a picture, and in this scenario, it helps to create a sense of depth and separates the subject from the background, drawing the viewer\'s attention to the girl.\n\n6. **Fashionable Outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is a crucial element of the photograph. It not only reflects her personal style but also complements the overall aesthetic of the scene. The choice of clothing and accessories can make the image feel more contemporary and relevant, adding to its appeal.\n\n7. **Cinematic Mood**: The cinematic mood of the photograph is achieved through the combination of all the aforementioned elements. The use of neon lights, the misty rain, and the fashionable outfit all contribute to a scene that feels like it could be a still from a movie. This mood invites the viewer to imagine a narrative or story behind the image, engaging them on a deeper level.\n\n8. **High-Detail**: The high level of detail in the photograph ensures that every element, from the raindrops on the umbrella to the textures of the girl\'s clothing, is crisp and clear. This level of detail enhances the realism of the scene and allows the viewer to appreciate the intricacies of the image.\n\nIn summary, the image of a girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain, set against a backdrop of neon reflections on a wet street, embodies a perfect blend of aesthetic photography, fashionable styling, and cinematic ambiance. Each element works in harmony to create a visually stunning and deeply engaging photograph that invites the viewer to step into its captivating world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-02 16:11:00', '2026-04-02 16:11:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?model=flux&width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pendi