(1711, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a text-based AI and do not have the capability to create images. However, I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends.\n\nImage Description:\nThe image is a high-resolution photograph of a group of friends having a great time together. The scene is set in a modern, trendy bar with a warm and cozy atmosphere. The walls are adorned with wooden accents and vintage decorations, while the lighting is dim and intimate.\n\nThe man, who appears to be in his mid-30s, is sitting at a wooden table surrounded by his friends. He is wearing a casual outfit, consisting of a light-blue shirt, dark jeans, and a pair of sleek, black boots. His hair is styled in a messy, yet stylish manner, and he has a few days\' worth of stubble on his face.\n\nThe man is laughing and chatting with his friends, who are all smiling and having a great time. There are four friends in total, all of whom are dressed in similar casual attire. They are all holding glasses of craft beer and are engaged in a lively conversation.\n\nIn the background, the bar is bustling with activity. There are people sitting at the bar, playing pool, and enjoying the music. The atmosphere is lively and energetic, with a hint of sophistication.\n\nThe image is shot from a slightly elevated angle, looking down on the group of friends. The camera is positioned to capture the warmth and camaraderie of the moment, with a shallow depth of field to blur the background and emphasize the subjects.\n\nTechnical Details:\n- Image resolution: 4000 x 6000 pixels\n- Aspect ratio: 2:3\n- File format: JPEG\n- Camera settings: f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 400\n- Lighting: Warm and intimate, with a mix of natural and artificial light sources\n\nOverall, the image is a high-quality representation of a man hanging out with friends, capturing the warmth and camaraderie of the moment in a modern and trendy setting.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-03 16:06:00', '20