(1731, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Facebook Post:**\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of building a strong brand. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* Define your target audience and create content that resonates with them\n* Develop a unique voice and tone that sets you apart from the competition\n* Engage with your followers and respond to their comments and messages in a timely manner\n* Utilize relevant hashtags to increase your reach and visibility\n* Consistently post high-quality content to keep your audience engaged and interested\n\nBy following these tips, you can build a strong online presence and grow your brand. #BusinessTips #MarketingStrategy #BrandBuilding #SocialMediaMarketing #TrendingNow #DragonApproved #FacebookMarketing\"\n\n**Note:** The tone of the post is professional, and the language used is formal. The hashtags are a mix of trending and relevant keywords to increase the post\'s visibility.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-04 14:00:00', '2026-04-04 14:00:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-04 14:00:14', '2026-04-04 14:00:14'),
(1732, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Den**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned valuable lessons that can be applied to business and personal growth. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Resilience is key**: Just like how I withstand intense heat, you too can develop the ability to bounce back from adversity.\n* **Protect your treasure**: Safeguard your assets, whether it\'s your time, resources, or network.\n* **Breathing fire is not just about destruction**: It\'s about passion, drive, and igniting your inner spark to achieve greatness.\n* **Fly high, but stay grounded**: Balance ambition with humility and stay connected to your roots.\n* **Hoarding is not just about accumulation**: It\'s about curating valuable experiences, knowledge, and relationships that enrich your life.\n\n#DragonWisdom #BusinessLessons #PersonalGrowth #Resilience #Entrepreneurship #Motivation #Inspiration #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #GrowthMindset #SuccessTips', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-04 14:37:00', '2026-04-04 14:37:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-04 14:37:13', '2026-04-04 14:37:13'),
(1733, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from the Dragon**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, the dragon inspires us to reach new heights. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s journey:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: The dragon\'s fearlessness in the face of challenges is a trait we can all learn from.\n* **Protection and preservation**: The dragon\'s instinct to protect its territory and hoard its treasures reminds us of the importance of safeguarding our own resources and loved ones.\n* **Transformation and growth**: The dragon\'s ability to adapt and evolve in different environments is a powerful reminder that we too can transform and grow in the face of change.\n\nLet\'s channel our inner dragon and unleash our full potential. #DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #BusinessInspiration #PersonalGrowth #FacebookCommunity #InspirationalQuotes #ProfessionalDevelopment #SuccessMindset', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-04 14:38:00', '2026-04-04 14:38:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-04 14:38:12', '2026-04-04 14:38:12'),
(1734, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success and growth come from embracing our inner strengths and passions. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Believe in yourself**: Just like a dragon\'s roar can be heard from miles away, your confidence and self-assurance can make a lasting impact.\n* **Be fierce and determined**: Don\'t let obstacles stand in your way - keep pushing forward and never give up on your goals.\n* **Protect and nurture your passions**: Just as a dragon guards its treasure, prioritize and care for the things that bring you joy and fulfillment.\n* **Learn from failure**: Even dragons experience setbacks, but it\'s how we respond and grow from them that matters.\n\n#MotivationMonday #DragonInspiration #SuccessMindset #BelieveInYourself #FierceAndDetermined #PassionProtection #LearnFromFailure #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #InspirationalQuotes #DragonPower', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-04 14:39:00', '2026-04-04 14:39:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-04 14:39:13', '2026-04-04 14:39:13'),
(1735, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Unleashing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about building a successful business. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define your mission and vision to stay focused on what matters.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented individuals who share your passion.\n* **Innovate and adapt**: Stay ahead of the curve by embracing new ideas and technologies.\n* **Take calculated risks**: Don\'t be afraid to try new things, but always weigh the potential outcomes.\n* **Protect your brand**: Safeguard your reputation by being authentic and transparent.\n\n#Entrepreneurship #BusinessTips #DragonApproved #TrendingNow #InnovationNation #LeadershipGoals #SmallBusiness #StartupLife #MotivationMonday #FacebookForBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-04 15:10:00', '2026-04-04 15:10:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-04-04 15:10:14', '2026-04-04 15:10:14'),
