(1740, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a large language model, I don\'t have the capability to create images. However, I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends.\n\n**Image Description:**\n\nThe image is a high-resolution photograph (4000 x 3000 pixels) with a warm and inviting tone. It\'s a sunny afternoon, and the scene is set in a trendy outdoor café. The man, in his mid-30s, is sitting with a group of five friends, all of whom appear to be in their 20s and 30s.\n\nThe man is wearing a casual, yet stylish outfit, consisting of a light-blue denim shirt, a pair of dark-washed jeans, and a pair of sleek, black sunglasses perched on his forehead. He has a friendly smile on his face and is laughing at something one of his friends is saying.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress. She\'s chatting with another friend, a tall, lanky guy with a shaved head and a black leather jacket. On the man\'s right is a woman with short, spiky blonde hair and a white tank top. She\'s sipping a colorful cocktail and looking relaxed.\n\nIn the background, there\'s a blurred view of the café\'s outdoor seating area, with people chatting and laughing at other tables. The atmosphere is lively and carefree, with a few trees and potted plants adding a touch of greenery to the scene.\n\nThe image is shot from a slightly elevated angle, with the camera looking down on the group. The lighting is natural, with the sun casting a warm glow over the scene. The overall mood is one of friendship, camaraderie, and enjoyment.\n\n**Image Specifications:**\n\n* Resolution: 4000 x 3000 pixels\n* Aspect Ratio: 4:3\n* File Format: JPEG\n* Color Profile: sRGB\n* Compression: High-quality, low-compression JPEG\n\n**Style:**\n\nThe image has a modern, trendy feel to it, with a focus on capturing the relaxed, social atmosphere of the scene. The composition is balanced, with the man and his friends placed in the center of the frame. The use of natural light and a shallow depth of field adds a sense of depth and intimacy to the image.\n\nOverall, the image is a high-quality representation of a man hanging out with friends, conveying a sense of friendship, fun, and relaxation.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-04 16:06:00', '2026-04-04 16:06:17', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-04-04 16:06:17', '2026-04-04 16:06:17'),
(1741, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a quintessential setup for a visually stunning and atmospheric photograph, blending elements of fashion, urban landscape, and cinematic storytelling. Let\'s break down the key components that make this scene so compelling:\n\n1. **Girl Walking with a Transparent Umbrella in Light Rain**: The subject, a girl, is the central figure of the photograph. The use of a transparent umbrella not only protects her from the rain but also adds a layer of elegance and sophistication to her appearance. The light rain creates a misty atmosphere, which can enhance the overall mood of the photo.\n\n2. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: Neon lights reflecting off a wet street is a classic trope in urban photography. It adds a vibrant, dynamic element to the scene, contrasting the gloominess of the rain with the brightness of the neon. These reflections can create a kaleidoscope of colors on the wet pavement, making the scene more engaging and visually appealing.\n\n3. **Aesthetic Photography**: The term \"aesthetic photography\" refers to the pursuit of creating images that are not only visually pleasing but also convey a sense of style or mood. In this context, the photographer is focusing on capturing the beauty of the moment, combining the natural elements of the rain and the urban setting with the fashionable and cinematic aspects of the scene.\n\n4. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: \"Bokeh\" refers to the aesthetic quality of the blur produced in the out-of-focus parts of an image produced by a lens. Soft bokeh lights can add a dreamy, ethereal quality to the photograph, emphasizing the subject and the immediate surroundings while blurring the background into a soft, colorful haze. This technique can enhance the cinematic mood of the image.\n\n5. **Fashionable Outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is a crucial element in this scene, as it adds a layer of narrative and character development to the photograph. The choice of clothing can hint at her personality, lifestyle, or the occasion, making the image more intriguing and inviting the viewer to speculate about her story.\n\n6. **Cinematic Mood**: The overall cinematic mood of the photograph suggests that the image is not just a snapshot but a moment captured from a larger narrative. This could be inspired by film noir, romantic comedies, or any genre that often features scenes of characters navigating urban landscapes under the cover of rain. The cinematic quality elevates the photograph from a mere documentation of a moment to a storytelling device.\n\n7. **High-Detail**: The emphasis on high detail suggests that the photograph is intended to be scrutinized closely, with every element, from the raindrops on the umbrella to the neon reflections, contributing to the overall narrative and aesthetic appeal of the image. High detail can also imply a level of realism, grounding the cinematic and fashionable elements in a tangible, recognizable world.\n\nIn summary, the described scene is a carefully crafted visual narrative that combines the allure of a fashionable, cinematic moment with the timeless appeal of an urban landscape under rain. Each element, from the transparent umbrella to the soft bokeh lights, is chosen to contribute to a cohesive aesthetic that is both hauntingly beautiful and deeply engaging.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-04 16:11:00', '2026-04-04 16:11:33', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-04-04 16:11:33', '20