(1752, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Unleash Your Inner Strength with Dragon**\n\nAs a symbol of power and resilience, we at Dragon are dedicated to helping you achieve your goals. Here are a few relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Believe in yourself**: Just like a dragon\'s unwavering confidence, trust in your abilities to conquer any challenge.\n* **Stay focused**: Keep your eyes on the prize and never lose sight of your objectives.\n* **Embrace your uniqueness**: Celebrate what sets you apart and makes you special, just like a dragon\'s distinctive roar.\n* **Never give up**: Even in the face of adversity, persevere and push forward, just as a dragon would protect its treasure.\n\nJoin the Dragon community today and unleash your inner strength! #DragonPower #MotivationMonday #BelieveInYourself #StayFocused #UnleashYourPotential #TrendingNow #Facebook #Inspiration #InnerStrength', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-05 14:00:00', '2026-04-05 14:00:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-05 14:00:14', '2026-04-05 14:00:14'),
(1753, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing the Dragon Spirit in Business**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'d like to share with you the key points that make my business roar with success:\n\n* **Innovative thinking**: Stay ahead of the curve and breathe fire into your ideas\n* **Resilience**: Withstand challenges and rise from the ashes like a phoenix\n* **Strategic planning**: Plot your course and navigate through obstacles with precision\n* **Teamwork**: Collaborate with your pack and unleash your collective strength\n* **Adaptability**: Evolve and adjust to changing circumstances, just like a dragon adapting to its environment\n\nBy embracing these qualities, you\'ll be unstoppable in your business endeavors. Remember to stay fierce, focused, and always keep your sights on the prize.\n\n#DragonSpirit #BusinessSuccess #Innovation #Resilience #Strategy #Teamwork #Adaptability #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #Entrepreneurship #MotivationMonday #BusinessTips #SuccessStory #DragonFire', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-05 14:37:00', '2026-04-05 14:37:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-05 14:37:13', '2026-04-05 14:37:13'),
(1754, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated humans. Here are some key takeaways from the dragon\'s world that can inspire and motivate you:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness, reminding us to stand up to challenges and never back down.\n* **Protecting what matters**: Dragons fiercely guard their treasure, teaching us the importance of prioritizing and safeguarding our own values and passions.\n* **Embracing transformation**: From egg to mighty dragon, this creature\'s journey shows us that growth and change can be beautiful and empowering.\n* **The power of community**: Many dragons are depicted as living in harmony with their kin, highlighting the value of building strong relationships and supporting one another.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #FireWithin #StrengthAndResilience #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #ProfessionalDevelopment #LessonsFromMythology #BusinessInspiration #PersonalGrowth', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-05 14:38:00', '2026-04-05 14:38:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-05 14:38:14', '2026-04-05 14:38:14');
