(1801, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of ceramic, plastic, or clay. It provides a safe and nourishing environment for plants to grow, while also adding a decorative touch to indoor or outdoor spaces.\n\nSome common features of flower pots include:\n\n1. Drainage holes: To prevent waterlogged soil and root rot.\n2. Handles or grips: For easy lifting and moving.\n3. Decorative designs: Such as patterns, colors, or textures to add visual appeal.\n4. Size and shape: Varying from small and compact to large and ornate.\n\nFlower pots can be used for a wide range of plants, including:\n\n1. Herbs: Such as basil, rosemary, or thyme.\n2. Flowers: Like roses, daisies, or sunflowers.\n3. Succulents: Including aloe, echeveria, or crassula.\n4. Trees: Like bonsai trees or small fruit trees.\n\nWhen choosing a flower pot, consider factors such as:\n\n1. Material: Ceramic, plastic, or clay, each with its own benefits and drawbacks.\n2. Size: Ensure the pot is large enough to accommodate the plant\'s roots and growth.\n3. Drainage: Look for pots with built-in drainage holes or consider adding a layer of gravel or sand.\n4. Style: Choose a pot that fits your personal taste and complements the surrounding decor.\n\nDo you have a specific type of plant or flower pot in mind, or would you like more information on a particular topic?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-06 18:07:00', '2026-04-06 18:07:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-04-06 18:07:15', '2026-04-06 18:07:15'),
(1802, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'Monday - Good morning, have a great start to the week. \nTuesday - Good morning, hope you\'re having a good week so far. \nWednesday - Good morning, halfway to the weekend. \nThursday - Good morning, almost Friday. \nFriday - Good morning, the weekend is finally here. \nSaturday - Good morning, enjoy your weekend. \nSunday - Good morning, last day of the weekend, make it count.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-06 18:26:00', '2026-04-06 18:26:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2026-04-06 18:26:16', '2026-04-06 18:26:16'),
