(1813, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:05', 'A bicycle is a human-powered or motor-powered, pedal-driven, single-track vehicle, having two wheels attached to a frame, one behind the other. Bicycles are a popular mode of transportation, recreation, and sport. They are also an environmentally friendly and cost-effective way to travel.\n\nThere are many types of bicycles, including:\n\n1. **Road bikes**: designed for speed and efficiency on paved roads.\n2. **Mountain bikes**: designed for off-road riding, with sturdy frames and wide tires.\n3. **Hybrid bikes**: a combination of road and mountain bikes, suitable for commuting and casual riding.\n4. **Commuter bikes**: designed for daily commuting, often with features like fenders, lights, and storage.\n5. **Electric bikes** (e-bikes): powered by a battery and motor, providing assistance to the rider.\n6. **BMX bikes**: small, sturdy bikes designed for stunts and tricks.\n7. **Cruiser bikes**: designed for casual, relaxed riding, often with a single speed and a comfortable seat.\n\nBicycles have many benefits, including:\n\n1. **Environmental benefits**: zero emissions, no pollution.\n2. **Health benefits**: regular exercise, improved cardiovascular health.\n3. **Cost-effective**: no fuel costs, low maintenance.\n4. **Convenience**: easy to park, navigate through traffic.\n5. **Fun**: enjoyable way to explore new places, get some exercise, and enjoy the outdoors.\n\nOverall, bicycles are a great way to get around, stay healthy, and have fun, while also being environmentally friendly and cost-effective.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 12:05:00', '2026-04-07 12:05:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 18, '2026-04-07 12:05:13', '2026-04-07 12:05:13'),
(1814, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:08', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about passion, perseverance, and success. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set your goals ablaze**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s a personal or professional goal, give it your all and watch it ignite.\n* **Harness your inner fire**: Identify your strengths and passions, and use them to drive your endeavors. This will help you stay motivated and focused on your objectives.\n* **Learn from failure**: Not every attempt will be successful, but that\'s okay. Use failures as opportunities to learn and grow, and don\'t be afraid to try again.\n* **Surround yourself with a supportive community**: Having a strong network of friends, family, or colleagues can make all the difference in your journey to success.\n* **Stay adaptable and open to change**: The ability to pivot and adjust to new circumstances is crucial in today\'s fast-paced world.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #BusinessLessons #SuccessTips #TrendingNow #FireWithin #GoalSetting #PassionDriven #Resilience #CommunityFirst #AdaptabilityMatters\n\nShare your own stories of overcoming obstacles and achieving success in the comments below!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 12:08:00', '2026-04-07 12:08:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 19, '2026-04-07 12:08:13', '2026-04-07 12:08:13'),
(1815, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:34', 'A ball can refer to many things, including:\n\n1. A spherical object, often used in sports and games, such as a basketball, soccer ball, or tennis ball.\n2. A formal dance or party, such as a ballroom dance or a debutante ball.\n3. A unit of measurement, such as a ball of yarn or a ball of twine.\n4. A term used in physics to describe a spherical shape or a rounded object.\n\nWhich definition of \"ball\" are you thinking of, or would you like to know more about a specific type of ball?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 12:34:00', '2026-04-07 12:34:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 20, '2026-04-07 12:34:14', '2026-04-07 12:34:14'),
(1816, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'When it comes to party wear for men, there are many options to choose from, depending on the type of party, the dress code, and personal style. Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit is a classic choice for formal parties. You can choose from a variety of colors, patterns, and styles, such as black tie, navy, or gray.\n2. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt is a versatile option that can be dressed up or down. You can choose from a range of colors, patterns, and collars, such as wingtip or point collar.\n3. **Tuxedos**: A tuxedo is a sophisticated choice for black-tie events. It typically consists of a black jacket, white dress shirt, and black trousers.\n4. **Blazers**: A blazer is a great option for semi-formal parties. You can pair it with a dress shirt, trousers, and dress shoes for a stylish look.\n5. **Jeans and a Button-Down Shirt**: For more casual parties, a pair of dark wash jeans and a button-down shirt is a great option. You can add a blazer or a leather jacket to dress up the look.\n6. **Cocktail Attire**: For a more formal party, consider a cocktail attire outfit, which typically consists of a dress shirt, dress pants, and a sports coat or blazer.\n7. **Accessories**: Don\'t forget to add some stylish accessories, such as a watch, cufflinks, or a pocket square, to complete your party look.\n\n**Trending Party Wear for Men:**\n\n1. **Slim-Fit Suits**: Slim-fit suits are a popular choice for parties, as they create a streamlined and modern look.\n2. **Patterned Shirts**: Patterned shirts, such as stripes or checks, are a great way to add some visual interest to your outfit.\n3. **Velvet Blazers**: Velvet blazers are a luxurious and stylish option for parties, and can add a touch of sophistication to your outfit.\n4. **Monochromatic Outfits**: Wearing a monochromatic outfit, such as all black or all navy, can create a sleek and stylish look.\n\n**Party Wear for Different Occasions:**\n\n1. **Formal Parties**: Black tie, white tie, or formal suits are suitable for formal parties.\n2. **Semi-Formal Parties**: Blazers, dress shirts, and trousers are suitable for semi-formal parties.\n3. **Casual Parties**: Jeans, t-shirts, and sneakers are suitable for casual parties.\n4. **Themed Parties**: Consider dressing up in costume or wearing themed accessories to match the party theme.\n\nRemember, the key to dressing well for a party is to feel confident and comfortable in what you\'re wearing. Experiment with different styles and find what works best for you!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 12:40:00', '2026-04-07 12:40:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-04-07 12:40:17', '2026-04-07 12:40:17'),
(1817, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:45', 'Shoes are a type of footwear that people wear on their feet. They come in a wide range of styles, sizes, and materials, and are designed for various purposes such as walking, running, hiking, dancing, and more.\n\nSome common types of shoes include:\n\n1. Sneakers: Also known as athletic shoes, these are designed for sports and physical activities.\n2. Boots: These are high-topped shoes that cover the ankle and often extend up to the knee.\n3. Sandals: These are open-toed shoes that expose the foot and are often worn in warm weather.\n4. Loafers: These are slip-on shoes that do not have laces or buckles.\n5. Dress shoes: These are formal shoes that are designed for business or special occasions.\n6. Hiking boots: These are sturdy shoes that are designed for outdoor activities such as hiking and backpacking.\n7. Dance shoes: These are specialized shoes that are designed for specific types of dance, such as ballet or ballroom dance.\n\nShoes can be made from a variety of materials, including:\n\n1. Leather: A popular choice for shoes, leather is durable and can be dressed up or down.\n2. Synthetic materials: Such as nylon, polyester, and PVC, these materials are often used for athletic shoes and other casual footwear.\n3. Rubber: This material is often used for the soles of shoes, as it provides traction and durability.\n4. Fabric: Some shoes, such as sneakers and sandals, may have fabric uppers.\n\nShoes can also have various features, such as:\n\n1. Arch support: This feature provides additional support and comfort for the foot.\n2. Cushioning: This feature helps to absorb shock and reduce impact on the foot.\n3. Waterproofing: This feature helps to keep the foot dry in wet conditions.\n4. Breathability: This feature allows for airflow and helps to keep the foot cool and dry.\n\nOverall, shoes are an essential part of our daily lives, and there are many different types and styles to choose from depending on our needs and preferences.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 12:45:00', '2026-04-07 12:45:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Shoes?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 21, '2026-04-07 12:45:17', '2026-04-07 12:45:17'),
(1818, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn in formal or business-casual settings. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic style of formal shirt, typically made from cotton or a cotton-blend fabric, with a stiff collar and cuffs.\n2. **Business Shirt:** A more relaxed version of the dress shirt, often made from a softer fabric and with a more casual collar style.\n3. **Oxford Shirt:** A type of dress shirt with a button-down collar and a more relaxed fit.\n4. **Tuxedo Shirt:** A formal shirt designed to be worn with a tuxedo, typically made from a luxurious fabric such as silk or cotton, with a wingtip collar and French cuffs.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar Style:** Formal shirts often have a stiff collar, which can be either a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff Style:** Formal shirts often have cuffs, which can be either button cuffs or French cuffs.\n3. **Fabric:** Formal shirts are often made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit:** Formal shirts are designed to fit closely, with a slim fit through the body and sleeves.\n5. **Buttons:** Formal shirts often have mother-of-pearl or plastic buttons, which are durable and elegant.\n\n**Popular Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink:** Known for their high-quality dress shirts with a classic fit.\n2. **Charvet:** A French brand that offers luxurious dress shirts with a focus on quality and craftsmanship.\n3. **Brooks Brothers:** An American brand that offers classic dress shirts with a preppy twist.\n4. **Ted Baker:** A British brand that offers stylish and affordable dress shirts with a focus on detail and quality.\n5. **Armani:** An Italian brand that offers luxurious dress shirts with a focus on style and sophistication.\n\n**Tips for Choosing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion:** Choose a shirt that is suitable for the occasion, such as a dress shirt for a formal event or a business shirt for a business meeting.\n2. **Think about the color:** White, light blue, and pastel colors are popular choices for formal shirts.\n3. **Pay attention to fit:** Make sure the shirt fits closely, but not too tightly, and that the sleeves are the right length.\n4. **Look for quality:** Choose a shirt made from high-quality fabric and with attention to detail, such as stitching and buttons.\n5. **Accessories:** Consider adding a tie, pocket square, or cufflinks to complete the look.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 12:56:00', '2026-04-07 12:56:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-07 12:56:16', '2026-04-07 12:56:16'),
(1819, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', 'As a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned to appreciate the importance of being relatable and authentic. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Embracing my true self**: As a dragon, I\'ve come to realize that my unique strengths and weaknesses are what set me apart and make me successful.\n* **Building strong relationships**: Whether it\'s with my scales or my fire-breathing abilities, I\'ve learned to nurture and care for my assets to achieve long-term growth.\n* **Staying adaptable**: In a rapidly changing world, being able to pivot and adjust to new situations is crucial for survival and success.\n* **Prioritizing self-care**: Taking time to rest, recharge, and prioritize my own well-being is essential for maintaining my physical and mental health.\n* **Continuously learning**: Staying up-to-date with the latest trends and best practices is vital for staying ahead of the curve and achieving my goals.\n\n#TrendingNow #DragonSquad #BusinessTips #RelatableContent #ProfessionalDevelopment #FacebookBusiness #ScalingNewHeights #FireBreathingSuccess #DragonModeActivated', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 13:03:00', '2026-04-07 13:03:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-04-07 13:03:12', '2026-04-07 13:03:12'),
