(1821, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and resilience. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your personal and professional life:\n\n* **Set goals and chase them with fire**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and pursue your aspirations with determination and enthusiasm.\n* **Protect your treasure**: Prioritize your well-being, relationships, and values, and be willing to defend them when necessary.\n* **Soar to new heights**: Continuously challenge yourself to grow, learn, and improve, and don\'t be afraid to take calculated risks.\n* **Breathe fire into your passions**: Pursue your interests and hobbies with passion and dedication, and share your talents with the world.\n* **Build a community of like-minded individuals**: Surround yourself with people who support and inspire you, and work together to achieve common goals.\n\n#DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #GoalSetting #Resilience #Passion #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #TrendingNow #InspirationalQuotes #FacebookMotivation #BusinessTips #SuccessStory #EntrepreneurMindset #LeadershipLessons', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 14:00:00', '2026-04-07 14:00:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-07 14:00:19', '2026-04-07 14:00:19'),
(1822, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:36', 'Wood collection can refer to the act of gathering and accumulating wood for various purposes, such as:\n\n1. **Firewood collection**: Collecting wood for use as fuel for heating, cooking, or camping.\n2. **Woodworking collection**: Accumulating wood for use in woodworking projects, such as furniture making, carpentry, or wood carving.\n3. **Timber collection**: Harvesting wood from trees for use in construction, pulp and paper production, or other industrial applications.\n4. **Driftwood collection**: Gathering wood that has been weathered and shaped by the elements, often used for decorative or artistic purposes.\n\nIf you\'re interested in starting a wood collection, here are some tips:\n\n1. **Identify your purpose**: Determine what you plan to use the wood for, and collect accordingly.\n2. **Choose the right trees**: Select trees that are suitable for your intended use, considering factors like wood density, grain pattern, and moisture content.\n3. **Harvest sustainably**: Ensure that your wood collection methods are environmentally sustainable and do not harm the surrounding ecosystem.\n4. **Store properly**: Keep your collected wood in a dry, well-ventilated area to prevent decay and damage.\n5. **Consider local regulations**: Familiarize yourself with local laws and regulations regarding wood collection, especially if you plan to collect wood from public or private lands.\n\nSome popular types of wood for collection include:\n\n1. **Hardwoods**: Oak, maple, cherry, and walnut are popular for woodworking and furniture making.\n2. **Softwoods**: Pine, spruce, and fir are often used for construction and pulp production.\n3. **Exotic woods**: Woods like ebony, mahogany, and teak are prized for their unique grain patterns and durability.\n\nRemember to always follow safety guidelines and best practices when collecting and handling wood.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 14:36:00', '2026-04-07 14:36:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/table?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 11, '2026-04-07 14:36:16', '2026-04-07 14:36:16'),
(1823, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Den**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and leadership. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set your goals ablaze**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and chase your ambitions with fierce determination.\n* **Shield yourself from negativity**: Surround yourself with positive influences and protect your mental space from toxic thoughts.\n* **Breathe fire into your passions**: Pursue your interests with unrelenting enthusiasm and energy.\n* **Hoarde your time wisely**: Prioritize your tasks and manage your time effectively to achieve maximum productivity.\n* **Soar to new heights**: Continuously challenge yourself to grow and improve, and never be satisfied with mediocrity.\n\n#DragonsDen #MotivationMonday #ProductivityHacks #MentalHealthMatters #GoalSetting #PassionDriven #LeadershipLessons #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalDevelopment #PersonalGrowth', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 14:37:00', '2026-04-07 14:37:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-07 14:37:15', '2026-04-07 14:37:15'),
(1824, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Embracing the Power of Resilience: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of strength and courage, dragons have long been revered for their ability to thrive in the face of adversity. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s approach to resilience:\n\n* **Adaptability is key**: Dragons are known for their ability to navigate diverse environments, from the highest mountains to the deepest oceans. By embracing change and being open to new experiences, we can develop the agility needed to succeed in today\'s fast-paced world.\n* **Protect your inner fire**: A dragon\'s inner flame is the source of its power and strength. Similarly, we must prioritize our own well-being and take care to nurture our passions and interests.\n* **Surround yourself with a supportive community**: Dragons are often depicted as solitary creatures, but they also have a strong sense of loyalty and camaraderie with their kin. Building a network of supportive relationships can help us stay motivated and inspired, even in the face of challenges.\n\n#ResilienceMatters #DragonEnergy #MentalHealthAwareness #MotivationMonday #ProfessionalGrowth #TrendingNow #FacebookCommunity #Inspiration #CourageOverFear #WellnessWednesday #SelfCareSunday #BusinessTips #SuccessStories #LeadershipLessons', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 14:38:00', '2026-04-07 14:38:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-07 14:38:16', '2026-04-07 14:38:16'),
(1825, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Ambitious Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about passion, perseverance, and success. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set your goals ablaze**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Identify your passions and turn them into achievable objectives.\n* **Hoarding wealth is not just about treasure**: It\'s about accumulating knowledge, experience, and network. Invest in yourself and your business to yield long-term returns.\n* **Breathe fire into your marketing strategy**: Be bold, be fearless, and be creative. Stand out from the crowd and make your brand roar.\n* **Scale new heights**: Don\'t be limited by your current circumstances. Continuously challenge yourself and strive for excellence.\n* **Protect your treasure**: Safeguard your business and assets by being proactive and prepared for any challenges that may arise.\n\n#DragonsDen #Entrepreneurship #BusinessTips #SuccessMindset #MarketingStrategy #GoalSetting #WealthCreation #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #DragonFire #AmbitiousEntrepreneurs #BusinessGrowth #Innovation #Leadership', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 14:39:00', '2026-04-07 14:39:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-07 14:39:14', '2026-04-07 14:39:14'),
(1826, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '\"As a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned to breathe fire into my passions and ignite success. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* Setting goals and achieving them is like hoarding treasure - it\'s a great feeling, but it\'s also important to share your wealth with others.\n* Taking risks is like flying into the unknown - it can be scary, but it can also lead to great rewards.\n* Building a strong team is like having a loyal group of dragon riders - together, you can conquer anything.\n* Embracing change is like adapting to a new environment - it can be challenging, but it\'s necessary for growth.\n\n#Trending #DragonSays #BusinessTips #SuccessStory #MotivationMonday #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalGrowth #EntrepreneurLife #InnovationNation\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 15:10:00', '2026-04-07 15:10:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-04-07 15:10:15', '2026-04-07 15:10:15'),
(1827, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Dragon\'s Den: Empowering Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a seasoned business dragon, I\'ve learned what it takes to succeed in the competitive world of entrepreneurship. Here are some key takeaways to help you on your journey:\n\n* **Be passionate about your idea**: Your business should be driven by a genuine passion for solving a problem or meeting a need.\n* **Develop a solid business plan**: A well-researched and structured plan will help you stay focused and on track.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision.\n* **Be adaptable and resilient**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change and stay motivated in the face of challenges.\n* **Continuously learn and improve**: Stay up-to-date with industry trends and best practices to stay ahead of the competition.\n\n#Entrepreneurship #BusinessTips #DragonInvestor #StartupSuccess #TrendingNow #FacebookForBusiness #SmallBusinessMatters #InnovationNation #BusinessGrowth #MotivationMonday #WednesdayWisdom #FridayFeeling #BusinessInspiration #SuccessStory #EntrepreneurLife #NewBusiness #BusinessOwner #LeadershipQuotes #Inspiration #Motivation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 15:14:00', '2026-04-07 15:14:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-04-07 15:14:16', '2026-04-07 15:14:16');
