(1880, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, narco-terrorist, and leader of the Medellín cartel. He is widely considered one of the most notorious and successful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nEscobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, to a middle-class family. He grew up in a poor neighborhood in Medellín, where he became involved in street crime and eventually dropped out of school. In his early 20s, Escobar started working for a local car thief, which led to his involvement in the cocaine trade.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power began in the 1970s, when he started smuggling cocaine from Colombia to the United States. He quickly gained a reputation for being ruthless, intelligent, and charismatic, which helped him build a vast network of loyal associates and connections.\n\nIn the early 1980s, Escobar co-founded the Medellín cartel, which became one of the most powerful and feared drug cartels in the world. He used violence, intimidation, and bribery to eliminate his competitors and expand his operations.\n\n**Cocaine Empire**\n\nAt the height of his power, Escobar\'s cartel controlled up to 80% of the global cocaine market. He made an estimated $30 billion per year, making him one of the richest men in the world. His empire included:\n\n1. **Cocaine production**: Escobar\'s cartel produced massive amounts of cocaine in Colombia, using coca leaves from Peru and Bolivia.\n2. **Smuggling**: He used a network of smugglers, planes, and boats to transport cocaine to the United States, Mexico, and other countries.\n3. **Distribution**: Escobar\'s cartel had a vast network of distributors in major cities, including New York, Los Angeles, and Miami.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s cartel was notorious for its violence and terror tactics. He ordered the killings of:\n\n1. **Rivals**: Escobar eliminated his competitors, including other drug lords and cartel members.\n2. **Law enforcement**: He targeted Colombian police, judges, and politicians who opposed him.\n3. **Journalists**: Escobar silenced journalists and media outlets that reported on his activities.\n\n**Downfall and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. While he was a ruthless and violent individual, he also:\n\n1. **Employed thousands**: Escobar\'s cartel provided jobs and income for many people in Colombia.\n2. **Invested in infrastructure**: He built roads, schools, and hospitals in Medellín, which improved the lives of local residents.\n3. **Became a cultural icon**: Escobar\'s life and legend have inspired numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\nHowever, his violent and destructive actions cannot be ignored. Escobar\'s cartel was responsible for thousands of deaths, and his legacy continues to impact Colombia and the world today.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 10:53:00', '2026-04-09 10:53:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-09 10:53:17', '2026-04-09 10:53:17'),
(1881, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long been a source of fascination and inspiration. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s approach to life:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness and determination, reminding us to stand strong in the face of challenges.\n* **Protection and guardianship**: As fierce protectors of their territories and loved ones, dragons teach us the importance of loyalty and responsibility.\n* **Adaptability and transformation**: With their ability to breathe fire and navigate diverse environments, dragons demonstrate the value of flexibility and evolution.\n* **Hoarding knowledge and wisdom**: Dragons are often depicted as wise and knowledgeable creatures, emphasizing the significance of learning, growth, and self-improvement.\n\nBy embracing these dragon-inspired principles, we can unlock our full potential and achieve greatness. #DragonInspiration #Motivation #PersonalGrowth #Trending #BusinessLessons #ProfessionalDevelopment #Facebook #InspirationalQuotes #SuccessMindset #Leadership #Courage #Resilience #Loyalty #Adaptability #Wisdom #KnowledgeIsPower', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 11:18:00', '2026-04-09 11:18:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-04-09 11:18:16', '2026-04-09 11:18:16'),
(1882, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'When it comes to party wear for men, there are many options to choose from, depending on the type of party, the dress code, and personal style. Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n**Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Suits**: A classic choice for formal parties, suits come in a variety of colors, fabrics, and styles. Black, navy, and gray are popular colors, while peak lapel, notch lapel, and shawl collar are popular styles.\n2. **Tuxedos**: For black-tie events, a tuxedo is the way to go. It typically consists of a black jacket, white shirt, black trousers, and a bow tie.\n3. **Dinner Jackets**: A dinner jacket is a versatile option for formal parties. It can be worn with a dress shirt, trousers, and a tie.\n\n**Semi-Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer is a great option for semi-formal parties. It can be worn with a dress shirt, trousers, and a tie.\n2. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt with a pair of dark-washed jeans or trousers is a stylish and comfortable option.\n3. **Chinos**: Chinos are a popular choice for semi-formal parties. They can be paired with a dress shirt and a blazer.\n\n**Casual Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Graphic T-Shirts**: A graphic t-shirt with a pair of jeans or shorts is a great option for casual parties.\n2. **Polos**: A polo shirt with a pair of chinos or jeans is a stylish and comfortable option.\n3. **Hoodies**: A hoodie with a pair of jeans or shorts is a great option for casual parties.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch is a great accessory for any party outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks add a touch of elegance to a dress shirt.\n3. **Shoes**: Dress shoes, loafers, or boots are popular options for party wear.\n4. **Belts**: A belt can add a pop of color to an outfit.\n5. **Hats**: A hat can add a stylish touch to an outfit.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Dress according to the dress code**: Make sure to dress according to the dress code specified by the party invitation.\n2. **Be mindful of the venue**: Dress according to the venue. For example, a beach party may require more casual attire than a party at a fancy restaurant.\n3. **Accessories can make or break an outfit**: Accessories can add a touch of elegance or style to an outfit.\n4. **Be confident**: Confidence is key to pulling off any outfit.\n\nRemember, the key to party wear is to have fun and express your personal style. Experiment with different options and find what works best for you.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 12:40:00', '2026-04-09 12:40:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-04-09 12:40:16', '2026-04-09 12:40:16'),
(1883, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, or special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts usually have a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are typically made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the chest and waist.\n5. **Button-front**: Formal shirts usually have a button-front closure.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Dress shirt**: A classic formal shirt with a point collar and button cuffs.\n2. **Wingtip shirt**: A formal shirt with a wingtip collar and French cuffs.\n3. **Spread collar shirt**: A formal shirt with a spread collar and button cuffs.\n4. **Cutaway collar shirt**: A formal shirt with a cutaway collar and French cuffs.\n5. **Tuxedo shirt**: A formal shirt with a wingtip collar and studs, designed to be worn with a tuxedo.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White**: A classic choice for formal shirts.\n2. **Light blue**: A popular choice for business and formal events.\n3. **Pastel colors**: Soft pink, baby blue, and pale yellow are popular colors for formal shirts.\n4. **Stripes**: Thin stripes are a classic pattern for formal shirts.\n5. **Checks**: Subtle checks are also a popular pattern for formal shirts.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: A luxury brand known for high-quality formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French brand that offers high-end formal shirts.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: A classic American brand that offers a range of formal shirts.\n4. **Armani**: A luxury brand that offers stylish and sophisticated formal shirts.\n5. **Hugo Boss**: A German brand that offers high-quality formal shirts with a modern twist.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Choose a fit that flatters your body**: Make sure the shirt fits closely to your body, but not too tightly.\n2. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a shirt that is appropriate for the occasion, such as a tuxedo shirt for a black-tie event.\n3. **Pay attention to details**: Make sure the shirt has a high-quality collar, cuffs, and button-front closure.\n4. **Iron your shirt**: Make sure to iron your shirt before wearing it to ensure a crisp and polished look.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 12:56:00', '2026-04-09 12:56:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-09 12:56:14', '2026-04-09 12:56:14'),
(1884, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**Embracing Your Inner Dragon: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to thrive. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define what success means to you and create a roadmap to achieve it.\n* **Be adaptable**: Stay flexible and open to new opportunities and challenges.\n* **Build a strong network**: Surround yourself with people who support and motivate you.\n* **Stay focused**: Prioritize your time and energy on what\'s truly important.\n* **Continuously learn**: Stay up-to-date with industry trends and best practices to stay ahead of the curve.\n\nBy following these principles, you\'ll be well on your way to achieving your goals and unleashing your inner dragon. #DragonSlaying #BusinessSuccess #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #CareerGrowth #Entrepreneurship #LeadershipTips', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 13:03:00', '2026-04-09 13:03:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-04-09 13:03:12', '2026-04-09 13:03:12'),
