(1886, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about embracing my inner fire and driving success. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Passion is key**: Just like a dragon\'s fire, passion is what drives us to achieve our goals and overcome obstacles.\n* **Resilience is crucial**: As a dragon, I\'ve faced my fair share of challenges, but it\'s how we respond to them that matters.\n* **Innovation is essential**: Staying ahead of the curve and innovating is what sets us apart from the rest.\n* **Community is vital**: Surrounding ourselves with like-minded individuals who support and encourage us is crucial for success.\n\n#DragonEnergy #EntrepreneurMindset #BusinessTips #InnovationNation #ResilienceMatters #PassionDriven #SuccessStory #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 14:00:00', '2026-04-09 14:00:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-09 14:00:19', '2026-04-09 14:00:19'),
(1887, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about embracing my true nature and living life to the fullest. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Be fearless**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and face challenges head-on.\n* **Stay fierce**: Believe in yourself and your abilities, and never back down from a fight.\n* **Hoard your passions**: Surround yourself with things that bring you joy and make you feel alive.\n* **Breathe fire**: Don\'t be afraid to speak your mind and stand up for what you believe in.\n* **Soar to new heights**: Always strive to improve and reach new heights, whether personally or professionally.\n\n#DragonInspiration #FearlessMotivation #FierceAndFocused #PassionHoarder #SpeakYourMind #SoarToNewHeights #TrendingNow #MotivationMonday #FireBreather #ProfessionalGrowth #PersonalDevelopment #FacebookInspiration', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 14:37:00', '2026-04-09 14:37:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-09 14:37:13', '2026-04-09 14:37:13'),
(1888, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Empowering Your Business with Dragon\'s Insight**\n\nAs a seasoned entrepreneur and creator, I\'d like to share with you the key takeaways from my journey:\n\n* **Stay adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot your strategy when circumstances change.\n* **Invest in innovation**: Stay ahead of the curve by embracing new technologies and trends.\n* **Foster a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented individuals who share your vision.\n* **Prioritize customer satisfaction**: Deliver exceptional service to build a loyal customer base.\n* **Continuously learn and improve**: Stay updated with industry trends and best practices to stay competitive.\n\n#BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #Teamwork #CustomerSatisfaction #ContinuousLearning #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #DragonApproved #BusinessTips #ProfessionalAdvice', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 14:38:00', '2026-04-09 14:38:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-09 14:38:12', '2026-04-09 14:38:12'),
(1889, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long been a source of fascination for many. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s world that can inspire and motivate you:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness and ability to thrive in challenging environments.\n* **Loyalty and protection**: These majestic creatures are often depicted as fiercely protective of their territories and loved ones.\n* **Growth and transformation**: From humble beginnings to mighty beasts, dragons remind us that growth and transformation are possible with persistence and determination.\n* **Wisdom and knowledge**: With their ancient wisdom, dragons encourage us to seek knowledge, learn from our experiences, and pass on our wisdom to others.\n\nLet\'s draw inspiration from these legendary creatures and strive to embody their qualities in our own lives. \n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #BusinessLessons #PersonalGrowth #Courage #Loyalty #Transformation #Wisdom #Knowledge #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalDevelopment #InspirationalQuotes #LessonsFromNature', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 14:39:00', '2026-04-09 14:39:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-09 14:39:12', '2026-04-09 14:39:12'),
(1890, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, the dragon represents the ultimate entrepreneurial spirit. Here are some key takeaways from the dragon\'s approach to business:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on a treasure hoard, you should aim high and strive for excellence in your industry.\n* **Be fearless and adaptable**: Dragons are known for their bravery and ability to navigate challenging environments, inspiring you to be bold and agile in the face of uncertainty.\n* **Cultivate your unique strengths**: Every dragon has its own distinct characteristics, reminding you to focus on developing your unique skills and talents.\n* **Build a loyal community**: Dragons often inspire loyalty and devotion in those around them, highlighting the importance of building strong relationships with your team, customers, and partners.\n\n#DragonInspiration #EntrepreneurMindset #BusinessLessons #LeadershipGoals #TrendingNow #MotivationMonday #ProfessionalDevelopment #InnovationNation #StartupSuccess\n\nShare your thoughts and experiences in the comments below, and let\'s keep the conversation going!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 15:10:00', '2026-04-09 15:10:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-04-09 15:10:12', '2026-04-09 15:10:12'),
(1891, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Empowering Entrepreneurship: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Den**\n\nAs a dragon and a seasoned entrepreneur, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed in business. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define your vision and mission to stay focused and driven.\n* **Be adaptable**: Pivot when necessary to stay ahead of the curve.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your passion.\n* **Take calculated risks**: Don\'t be afraid to take the leap and try new things.\n* **Stay resilient**: Learn from failures and use them as opportunities for growth.\n\nAt our company, we\'re committed to empowering entrepreneurs and small business owners to achieve their dreams. Join our community to connect with like-minded individuals and stay up-to-date on the latest industry trends.\n\n#Entrepreneurship #SmallBusiness #DragonApproved #BusinessTips #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #FacebookForBusiness #GrowYourBusiness #SuccessStories #InnovationNation #StartupLife #BusinessInspiration #LeadershipLessons #EmpowermentThroughEntrepreneurship', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 15:14:00', '2026-04-09 15:14:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-04-09 15:14:15', '2026-04-09 15:14:15'),
(1892, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Embracing the Fire Within: A Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned to harness my inner strength and passion to achieve greatness. Here are some key takeaways from my journey:\n\n* **Believe in yourself**: Just like a dragon\'s fiery breath, your confidence can ignite a blaze of success.\n* **Take calculated risks**: Don\'t be afraid to spread your wings and soar into the unknown.\n* **Protect your treasure**: Guard your values, goals, and relationships with fierce dedication.\n* **Stay adaptable**: Like a dragon\'s scales, be prepared to shift and adjust to changing circumstances.\n* **Roar with passion**: Let your enthusiasm and excitement drive you to achieve your dreams.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #FireWithin #SuccessTips #BelieveInYourself #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #ProfessionalDevelopment #InnerStrength #PassionDriven #ConfidenceIsKey #RiskAndReward #TreasureYourGoals #AdaptAndThrive #RoarWithPassion', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 15:24:00', '2026-04-09 15:24:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-04-09 15:24:15', '2026-04-09 15:24:15'),
