(1895, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a large language model, I don\'t have the capability to directly create images. But I can describe a high-quality image to you:\n\n**Image Description:**\n\nThe image is a high-resolution photograph of a group of friends, with a focus on one man in particular. The scene is set in a trendy outdoor cafe, with a warm and sunny atmosphere. The man, likely in his mid-twenties, is sitting at a wooden table surrounded by his friends, all of whom are laughing and chatting.\n\nThe man is wearing a casual yet stylish outfit, consisting of a light-blue button-down shirt, dark-washed jeans, and a pair of sleek, black sunglasses perched on his forehead. His hair is messy and textured, and he has a few days\' worth of stubble on his chin. He\'s wearing a warm and genuine smile, and his eyes are crinkled at the corners as he laughs at something one of his friends has said.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress, who is leaning in to whisper something in his ear. On his right is a tall, lanky guy with a shaved head and a thick beard, who is holding a pint of beer and grinning from ear to ear. In the background, there are a few other friends milling about, chatting and enjoying the scenery.\n\nThe image is shot in a shallow depth of field, with the subject (the man) in sharp focus and the background slightly blurred. The lighting is natural and warm, with a few subtle shadows and highlights that add depth and texture to the scene. The overall mood of the image is one of relaxed, effortless camaraderie, capturing the joy and connection of a group of friends hanging out on a sunny day.\n\n**Image Specifications:**\n\n* Resolution: 4000 x 6000 pixels\n* Aspect Ratio: 2:3\n* File Format: JPEG\n* Color Profile: sRGB\n* Camera Settings: f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 100\n\nI hope this description gives you an idea of what the image could look like!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 16:06:00', '2026-04-09 16:06:15', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-04-09 16:06:15', '2026-04-09 16:06:15'),
(1896, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a visually stunning and cinematic moment, perfect for aesthetic photography. Let\'s break down the key elements that make this scene so captivating:\n\n1. **Girl walking with a transparent umbrella**: The transparent umbrella is a great prop as it allows the viewer to see the girl\'s outfit and movements while still conveying the rainy atmosphere. It adds a sense of elegance and sophistication to the scene.\n\n2. **Light rain**: The light rain creates a misty, mystical atmosphere that enhances the overall mood of the photograph. It\'s not heavy enough to obscure the view, but just enough to create beautiful reflections and a sense of movement.\n\n3. **Neon reflections on wet street**: The neon lights reflecting off the wet street add a pop of color and create a sense of depth and dimensionality in the image. The reflections also help to guide the viewer\'s eye through the scene, creating a sense of movement and energy.\n\n4. **Aesthetic photography**: The use of aesthetic photography principles, such as careful composition and attention to detail, elevates the scene from a simple snapshot to a work of art. The photographer has likely considered factors like lighting, color palette, and negative space to create a visually appealing image.\n\n5. **Soft bokeh lights**: The soft bokeh lights in the background add a sense of warmth and depth to the image, while also helping to separate the subject from the background. The bokeh effect creates a beautiful, dreamy quality that enhances the overall cinematic mood.\n\n6. **Fashionable outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is an important element in the scene, as it adds a sense of style and sophistication. The outfit likely complements the colors and mood of the scene, creating a cohesive and visually appealing image.\n\n7. **Cinematic mood**: The overall cinematic mood of the image is enhanced by the combination of the rainy atmosphere, neon lights, and fashionable outfit. The scene has a sense of drama and intrigue, as if it\'s a still from a movie or a music video.\n\n8. **High-detail**: The high level of detail in the image, from the texture of the umbrella to the reflections on the wet street, adds to the overall sense of realism and immersion. The viewer can almost feel the rain and the misty atmosphere, making the image even more engaging and captivating.\n\nTo capture this scene, a photographer would likely use a combination of technical skills and artistic vision. They might use a camera with a wide aperture to create a shallow depth of field, emphasizing the subject and blurring the background. They might also use a tripod and a slow shutter speed to capture the movement of the rain and the girl\'s walk, adding a sense of dynamism to the image. The post-processing would also play a crucial role in enhancing the colors, contrast, and overall mood of the image, creating a truly cinematic and aesthetic photograph.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-09 16:11:00', '2026-04-09 16:11:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-04-09 16:11:16', '2026-04-09 16:11:16'),
