(1906, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about passion, dedication, and perseverance. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define what you want to achieve and create a roadmap to get there.\n* **Stay focused**: Avoid distractions and stay committed to your objectives.\n* **Be adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change.\n* **Learn from failures**: Use setbacks as opportunities to grow and improve.\n* **Surround yourself with positivity**: Build a supportive network of peers and mentors.\n\nBy following these principles, you can unlock your full potential and achieve greatness. Remember to stay fierce, stay driven, and always keep your eyes on the prize.\n\n#Trending #SuccessMindset #Motivation #Inspiration #DragonFire #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #PersonalGrowth #FacebookMotivation #RelatableQuotes #BusinessInspiration #SuccessTips', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 10:35:00', '2026-04-10 10:35:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-04-10 10:35:16', '2026-04-10 10:35:16'),
(1907, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, narcoterrorist, and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious drug cartels in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and influential figures in the history of organized crime.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Escobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, on December 1, 1949. He grew up in a poor family and was raised in the city of Medellín. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he quickly became involved in crime to support himself. He started by selling cigarettes and lottery tickets on the streets, but soon turned to more serious crimes, such as theft and smuggling.\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was rapidly expanding in Colombia. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, becoming a key player in the organization. Escobar\'s success was due in part to his charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness, as well as his ability to build relationships with other cartel leaders and corrupt government officials.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. The cartel\'s main business was the production and distribution of cocaine, which was smuggled into the United States and other countries. Escobar\'s organization was responsible for an estimated 80% of the cocaine entering the United States, and he became one of the richest men in the world, with an estimated net worth of over $30 billion.\n\nThe Medellín cartel was also known for its violence and intimidation tactics, which were used to maintain control and eliminate rivals. Escobar\'s organization was responsible for numerous murders, kidnappings, and bombings, including the assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán in 1989.\n\n**The War on Drugs and Escobar\'s Downfall**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the support of the United States, launched a series of crackdowns on the Medellín cartel. The war on drugs led to a series of battles between Escobar\'s organization and the authorities, resulting in the deaths of many cartel members and the capture of several high-ranking leaders.\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to the Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a specially built prison, known as the \"Catedral,\" which was designed to be escape-proof. However, in 1992, Escobar escaped from the prison and went into hiding.\n\n**Death and Legacy**\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. He was 44 years old at the time of his death. Escobar\'s death marked the end of the Medellín cartel\'s dominance in the cocaine trade, and it had a significant impact on the global war on drugs.\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning leader who was responsible for countless deaths and suffering, but he is also seen as a folk hero by some in Colombia, who view him as a symbol of resistance against the government and the establishment.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s life and legacy have been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos,\" which tells the story of his rise and fall. Despite his notorious reputation, Escobar remains a fascinating and intriguing figure, and his story continues to captivate audiences around the world.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included owning a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a fleet of airplanes.\n* He was a skilled politician and was able to build relationships with many high-ranking government officials, including Colombian presidents.\n* Escobar was a prolific philanthropist, and he built many schools, hospitals, and other infrastructure projects in Medellín and other parts of Colombia.\n* He was a devout Catholic and was known for his religious devotion, despite his involvement in organized crime.\n* Escobar\'s death was seen as a major victory in the war on drugs, but it also had unintended consequences, including the rise of other cartels and the increase in violence and instability in Colombia.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 10:45:00', '2026-04-10 10:45:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-10 10:45:19', '2026-04-10 10:45:19'),
(1908, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and feared criminal organizations in the world. He is often referred to as the \"King of Cocaine\" due to his dominance of the global cocaine trade during the 1980s.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to a middle-class family. His father was a farmer, and his mother was a schoolteacher. Escobar grew up in a poor neighborhood in Medellín, where he became involved in street crime and violence at a young age.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power began in the 1970s, when he started working for a local cocaine smuggler. He quickly proved himself to be a skilled and ruthless operator, and soon became a key figure in the Medellín cartel. In the early 1980s, Escobar and his partners, including Carlos Lehder and Gustavo Gaviria, began to expand their operations, smuggling cocaine into the United States and other countries.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. At its peak, the cartel was responsible for smuggling an estimated 80% of the world\'s cocaine, with revenues of over $20 billion per year. Escobar\'s organization was known for its brutality and ruthlessness, with hundreds of people killed or intimidated in order to maintain control and eliminate rivals.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by violence and terror. He was responsible for the murders of thousands of people, including politicians, judges, police officers, and rival gang members. He also orchestrated bombings, kidnappings, and other terrorist attacks, including the bombing of an Avianca airliner in 1989, which killed 110 people.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned, but he continued to run his empire from behind bars. In 1992, he escaped from prison and went into hiding, sparking a massive manhunt. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín, just one day after his 44th birthday.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who brought terror and violence to thousands of people. However, he is also seen as a symbol of resistance against the Colombian government and the United States, which many Colombians felt were responsible for the country\'s economic and social problems. Today, Escobar\'s story has been immortalized in films, books, and TV shows, including the hit Netflix series \"Narcos,\" which chronicles his rise and fall.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included owning a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a sprawling estate called Hacienda Napoles.\n* He was a fan of soccer and owned a soccer team, the Atlético Nacional.\n* Escobar was elected to the Colombian Congress in 1982, but was later forced to resign due to allegations of corruption.\n* He was known for his generosity to the poor and was often referred to as \"El Patrón\" (The Boss) by his loyal followers.\n* Escobar\'s death was celebrated by many Colombians, but his legacy continues to be felt in the country, with many still regarding him as a folk hero.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 10:50:00', '2026-04-10 10:50:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-10 10:50:18', '2026-04-10 10:50:18'),
(1909, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and the founder of the Medellín Cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious drug trafficking organizations in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals of the 20th century.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to a family of modest means. His father was a farmer, and his mother was a schoolteacher. Escobar grew up in a poor neighborhood in Medellín, where he became involved in crime at a young age, selling stolen cars and other contraband.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power began in the 1970s, when he became involved in the cocaine trade. He started by smuggling small quantities of cocaine into the United States, but soon expanded his operations to become one of the largest cocaine traffickers in the world. He formed the Medellín Cartel, which became a vast and complex organization with thousands of employees, including smugglers, assassins, and money launderers.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nThe Medellín Cartel was a highly organized and efficient operation, with a network of smugglers, distributors, and money launderers that spanned the globe. Escobar\'s organization was responsible for smuggling an estimated 80% of the cocaine that entered the United States in the 1980s, earning him an estimated $30 billion per year.\n\n**Violence and Intimidation**\n\nEscobar was known for his ruthless tactics, including murder, intimidation, and bribery. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including police officers, judges, politicians, and rival gang members. He also used violence and intimidation to maintain control over his organization and to eliminate anyone who stood in his way.\n\n**Pursuit and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. He was finally tracked down and killed on December 1, 1993, in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. He was 44 years old at the time of his death.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people. However, he is also remembered as a charismatic and clever businessman who was able to build a vast and profitable empire through his cocaine trafficking operations.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s life and legacy have been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos,\" which tells the story of his rise and fall.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a vast estate in Medellín.\n* He was a skilled politician and was able to bribe and intimidate many Colombian politicians and officials.\n* Escobar was a devoted family man and was known to be fiercely loyal to his wife and children.\n* He was a fan of soccer and was known to have sponsored several Colombian soccer teams.\n* Escobar\'s death was a major blow to the Medellín Cartel, and the organization was eventually dismantled by the Colombian government.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar was a fascinating and complex figure who left a lasting impact on the world of organized crime and beyond.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 10:53:00', '2026-04-10 10:53:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-10 10:53:16', '2026-04-10 10:53:16'),
(1910, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', 'As a professional dragon, I\'d like to share with you what makes me relatable to my fellow creatures and humans alike. Here are a few points to consider:\n\n* I have a passion for treasure hunting, but I also understand the importance of budgeting and saving for the future.\n* I enjoy taking long flights, but I also value the need for rest and self-care to maintain my physical and mental well-being.\n* I have a strong sense of loyalty and protectiveness towards my loved ones, but I also believe in the importance of setting boundaries and prioritizing my own needs.\n\nAs a dragon, I\'m often seen as a fierce and powerful creature, but I\'m also relatable in many ways. I have the same desires, needs, and emotions as many of you, and I\'m always looking for ways to connect with others and build meaningful relationships.\n\n#DragonsOfFacebook #RelatableCreatures #TreasureHunting #SelfCare #LoyaltyAndProtection #MentalHealthMatters #TrendingNow #FantasyCreatures #MythicalBeings #LegendaryDragons', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 11:18:00', '2026-04-10 11:18:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-04-10 11:18:15', '2026-04-10 11:18:15'),
(1911, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:39', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for a dragon business/creator on Facebook:\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of embracing my true self and living my best life. Here are a few things I\'ve learned along the way:\n\n* Believe in yourself, even when others don\'t\n* Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things\n* Surround yourself with people who support and uplift you\n* Remember that it\'s okay to make mistakes - they\'re an opportunity to learn and grow\n* Always stay true to yourself and your values\n\n#DragonsOfFacebook #MotivationMonday #SelfLoveJourney #MentalHealthMatters #TrendingNow #DragonSquad #FireBreathingInspiration #ScaleNewHeights #MythicalCreatures #FantasyFiction #BusinessOfBeingYou\"\n\nThis caption is professional, relatable, and includes a mix of trending and niche-specific hashtags to reach a wider audience on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 11:39:00', '2026-04-10 11:39:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 35, '2026-04-10 11:39:16', '2026-04-10 11:39:16'),
(1912, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Men\'s Party Wear: A Guide to Styling and Options**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, there are numerous options to choose from, depending on the occasion, theme, and personal style. Here are some popular and stylish options:\n\n### Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Suits**: A classic choice for formal parties, suits can be worn in various colors, patterns, and styles. Pair a suit with a crisp white shirt, a tie or bow tie, and dress shoes.\n2. **Tuxedos**: Perfect for black-tie events, tuxedos exude elegance and sophistication. Opt for a classic black tuxedo or try a bold color for a statement look.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt in a bold color or pattern can add a touch of personality to a formal outfit. Pair with a suit or trousers for a stylish look.\n\n### Semi-Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to a casual outfit. Pair with a dress shirt, jeans, and dress shoes for a stylish look.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dress pants in bold colors or patterns can add a touch of personality to a semi-formal outfit. Pair with a dress shirt and a blazer for a stylish look.\n3. **Polos**: A polo shirt in a bold color or pattern can be a great option for a semi-formal party. Pair with dress pants or jeans for a stylish look.\n\n### Casual Party Wear\n\n1. **T-Shirts**: A graphic t-shirt or a plain white t-shirt can be a great option for a casual party. Pair with jeans or trousers for a relaxed look.\n2. **Jeans**: Jeans are a staple in any man\'s wardrobe and can be dressed up or down. Pair with a t-shirt, a polo, or a button-down shirt for a stylish look.\n3. **Joggers**: Joggers can be a great option for a casual party. Pair with a t-shirt or a hoodie for a relaxed look.\n\n### Accessories\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit. Opt for a leather strap or a metal band for a stylish look.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of personality to a formal outfit. Opt for a bold color or pattern to make a statement.\n3. **Shoes**: Dress shoes, loafers, or boots can complete a party outfit. Opt for a style that complements the occasion and theme.\n\n### Tips and Tricks\n\n1. **Dress according to the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the occasion and theme of the party.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Ensure that your clothes fit well and are not too tight or too loose.\n3. **Accessories matter**: Add a touch of personality to your outfit with accessories like watches, cufflinks, or shoes.\n4. **Grooming is key**: Make sure to groom yourself well, including your hair, beard, and nails.\n\nBy following these tips and options, you\'ll be sure to make a stylish statement at your next party.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 12:40:00', '2026-04-10 12:40:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-04-10 12:40:16', '2026-04-10 12:40:16'),
(1913, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts usually have a point or spread collar, which is suitable for wearing with a tie.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have cufflinks or button cuffs, which add a touch of elegance.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are typically made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are usually slim-fitting and tailored to fit closely to the body.\n5. **Button-front**: Formal shirts usually have a button-front closure, which is more formal than a zip or pullover style.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic fit**: A classic fit formal shirt is a timeless choice, with a relaxed fit through the body and a subtle taper at the waist.\n2. **Slim fit**: A slim fit formal shirt is more modern and streamlined, with a closer fit through the body and a narrower sleeve.\n3. **Dress shirt**: A dress shirt is a type of formal shirt that is specifically designed to be worn with a suit and tie.\n4. **Tuxedo shirt**: A tuxedo shirt is a type of formal shirt that is designed to be worn with a tuxedo, typically with a wingtip collar and a stud-front closure.\n\n**Popular Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: Known for their high-quality, stylish formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French luxury brand that offers exquisite formal shirts with a focus on craftsmanship and attention to detail.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: An American brand that offers classic, high-quality formal shirts with a preppy twist.\n4. **Ted Baker**: A British brand that offers stylish, modern formal shirts with a focus on bold colors and patterns.\n\n**Tips for Choosing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a formal shirt that is suitable for the occasion, such as a business meeting or a formal event.\n2. **Think about the color**: White, light blue, and pale pink are classic colors for formal shirts, but you can also consider bolder colors and patterns for a more modern look.\n3. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure the shirt fits well and is comfortable to wear.\n4. **Accessories**: Consider the type of cufflinks, tie, and pocket square that will complement the shirt and add a touch of personality to your outfit.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 12:56:00', '2026-04-10 12:56:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-10 12:56:17', '2026-04-10 12:56:17'),
(1914, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a powerful and mythical creature, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, strength, and resilience. Here are some key takeaways from my journey:\n\n* **Believe in yourself**: Just like a dragon\'s roar can shake the earth, your confidence can move mountains.\n* **Protect your passions**: Guard your interests and hobbies with the ferocity of a dragon guarding its treasure.\n* **Soar to new heights**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things - the view from the top is breathtaking.\n* **Breathe fire into your goals**: Add passion and energy to your pursuits, and watch them ignite into success.\n* **Never stop learning**: Continuously update your knowledge and skills, just like a dragon\'s scales are constantly being polished and refined.\n\n#Trending #DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #MythicalInspiration #FireWithin #ProfessionalGrowth #ConfidenceIsKey #PassionUnleashed #RiskAndReward #LearnAndGrow #SuccessMindset', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 13:03:00', '2026-04-10 13:03:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-04-10 13:03:12', '2026-04-10 13:03:12'),
