(1916, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Empowering Your Day with Dragon\'s Insights**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success, perseverance, and roaring with confidence. Here are some key takeaways to help you conquer your day:\n\n* Set ambitious goals and chase them with passion\n* Believe in yourself and your abilities\n* Surround yourself with positive influences and supportive networks\n* Take calculated risks and learn from your mistakes\n* Stay focused, adaptable, and always be open to growth and learning\n\n#MotivationMonday #DragonInspiration #SuccessTips #PositiveVibes #ConfidenceIsKey #EmpowermentThroughKnowledge #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #BusinessInspiration #CreatorSpotlight', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 14:00:00', '2026-04-10 14:00:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-10 14:00:20', '2026-04-10 14:00:20'),
(1917, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', 'As a dragon in the business world, I understand the importance of being relatable and connecting with my audience. Here\'s a post for Facebook that highlights my perspective in points, along with some trending hashtags:\n\n\"As a dragon in the corporate world, I\'ve learned to navigate the ups and downs of business with ease. Here are a few things I\'ve learned along the way:\n\n* Embracing my unique strengths and weaknesses has been key to my success\n* Building a strong team around me has been crucial in achieving my goals\n* Staying adaptable and open to change has allowed me to thrive in an ever-evolving industry\n* And, of course, having a fiery passion for what I do has driven me to reach new heights\n\n#DragonSlayingTheGame #BusinessTipsFromADragon #CorporateCulture #Entrepreneurship #LeadershipGoals #TrendingNow #InspirationalQuotes #MotivationMonday #BusinessSuccess\"\n\nBy using a professional tone and incorporating trending hashtags, I aim to connect with my audience and establish myself as a thought leader in my industry.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 14:37:00', '2026-04-10 14:37:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-10 14:37:16', '2026-04-10 14:37:16'),
(1918, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned to harness my inner strength and resilience to overcome challenges. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your personal and professional life:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like I set my sights on a treasure hoard, you should aim high and strive for excellence in your pursuits.\n* **Develop a growth mindset**: Continuously learn and adapt, just as I evolve to navigate changing environments and overcome obstacles.\n* **Cultivate courage and confidence**: Face your fears and believe in yourself, just as I fearlessly soar through the skies.\n* **Build strong relationships**: Foster meaningful connections with others, just as I form bonds with my fellow dragons and allies.\n* **Stay focused and determined**: Concentrate on your goals and persevere through challenges, just as I persist in my quest for treasure and knowledge.\n\n#Trending #Motivation #Inspiration #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #DragonWisdom #FireWithin #Ambition #Resilience #Courage #Confidence #RelationshipBuilding #Focus #Determination', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 14:38:00', '2026-04-10 14:38:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-10 14:38:15', '2026-04-10 14:38:15'),
(1919, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Empowering Your Business with Dragon\'s Expertise**\n\nAs a professional business solution provider, we understand the importance of staying ahead of the curve. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Innovative Strategies**: Stay updated with the latest industry trends to make informed decisions.\n* **Effective Communication**: Clear and concise communication is key to building strong relationships with clients and partners.\n* **Adaptability**: Be prepared to pivot and adjust to changing market conditions.\n* **Continuous Learning**: Invest in ongoing education and training to stay ahead of the competition.\n\nAt Dragon, we are committed to helping you achieve your business goals. Follow us for more insights and updates! #TrendingNow #BusinessGrowth #Innovation #Leadership #Entrepreneurship #SuccessTips #FacebookForBusiness #DragonSolutions', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 14:39:00', '2026-04-10 14:39:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-10 14:39:14', '2026-04-10 14:39:14'),
(1920, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Embracing the Fire Within: 5 Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about unleashing my inner strength and achieving greatness. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on a treasure hoard, you should aim high and strive for excellence in your pursuits.\n* **Develop a strong sense of self**: A dragon\'s scales are its armor, protecting it from the outside world. Similarly, you should focus on building your self-confidence and resilience.\n* **Cultivate your passions**: Dragons are known for their love of treasure, but what drives you? Identify your passions and pursue them with fervor.\n* **Surround yourself with supportive allies**: A dragon\'s lair is often filled with loyal companions. Surround yourself with people who support and encourage you.\n* **Continuously learn and improve**: Dragons are known for their wisdom and adaptability. Stay curious, keep learning, and always look for ways to improve yourself and your craft.\n\n#Trending #DragonEnergy #SuccessTips #Motivation #Inspiration #PersonalGrowth #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #ProfessionalDevelopment #FacebookBusiness #DragonSquad #FireWithin #Ambition #Resilience #Passion #SupportSystem #LifelongLearning', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 15:10:00', '2026-04-10 15:10:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-04-10 15:10:14', '2026-04-10 15:10:14'),
(1921, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Ambitious Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Just like a dragon knows its target, you should have a clear vision of what you want to achieve.\n* **Be fearless**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and face challenges head-on.\n* **Build a strong team**: A dragon\'s lair is only as strong as the creatures that inhabit it. Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals.\n* **Stay adaptable**: The business landscape is constantly changing, so be prepared to pivot and adjust your strategy as needed.\n* **Protect your brand**: A dragon\'s treasure is its most valuable asset. Guard your brand reputation and intellectual property with fierce dedication.\n\n#Trending #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #DragonMode #ProfessionalDevelopment #Leadership #Innovation #SuccessMindset #FacebookBusiness #SmallBusiness #StartupLife #MotivationMonday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 15:14:00', '2026-04-10 15:14:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-04-10 15:14:12', '2026-04-10 15:14:12'),
(1922, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Embracing the Fire Within: 5 Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about harnessing your inner passion and drive. Here are 5 key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on its prey, you must set clear and achievable goals for yourself.\n* **Stay focused**: Avoid distractions and stay focused on your objectives, just like a dragon stays focused on its target.\n* **Be adaptable**: Like a dragon that can fly, swim, and walk, you must be able to adapt to changing circumstances and navigate different environments.\n* **Build strong relationships**: A dragon\'s lair is only as strong as the relationships it has with its allies, so build strong relationships with your colleagues, partners, and customers.\n* **Keep learning**: A dragon\'s fire burns brightest when it\'s fueled by knowledge and experience, so keep learning and growing to stay ahead of the curve.\n\n#Trending #SuccessTips #DragonInspiration #Motivation #BusinessTips #Leadership #PersonalGrowth #GoalSetting #Focus #Adaptability #RelationshipBuilding #LifelongLearning', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 15:24:00', '2026-04-10 15:24:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-04-10 15:24:16', '2026-04-10 15:24:16'),
