(1930, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:47', 'The image is one of unwavering confidence and unrelenting ambition. The businessman, clad in a tailored suit, stands tall on the basketball court, the ball grasped firmly in his hand. The stadium lights behind him cast a dramatic glow, illuminating the scene with an air of grandeur.\n\nThe high-resolution cinematic style brings every detail to life, from the subtle sheen on the basketball to the sharp creases in the businessman\'s suit. The dramatic lighting accentuates the contours of his face, highlighting the determination etched on his features.\n\nAs he stands on the court, the businessman exudes a sense of success and accomplishment. His posture is confident, his eyes fixed intently on some point in the distance, as if sizing up the competition. The ball, held securely in his hand, seems to be an extension of his being, a symbol of his unyielding drive to succeed.\n\nThe contrast between the businessman\'s formal attire and the basketball court setting is striking, yet it only serves to underscore his unwavering commitment to his goals. He is a master of his domain, unafraid to take risks and push beyond the boundaries of what is expected.\n\nThe image is a powerful metaphor for the mindset of a high-achieving individual. It speaks to the idea that success is not just about achieving a goal, but about embracing a mindset that is focused, driven, and unrelenting. The businessman on the basketball court is a testament to the human spirit\'s capacity for greatness, a reminder that with hard work, determination, and a relentless pursuit of excellence, anything is possible.\n\nIn this moment, the businessman is not just a figure on a court; he is a symbol of hope and inspiration, a reminder that we all have the potential to achieve greatness. The image is a call to action, urging us to tap into our own inner strength, to push beyond our limits, and to strive for excellence in all that we do.\n\nAs the lights shine down on the businessman, they illuminate not just his physical presence, but the very essence of his being. They reveal a man who is driven by a fierce passion for success, a man who will stop at nothing to achieve his goals. The image is a testament to the transformative power of the human spirit, a reminder that with courage, determination, and a unwavering commitment to our dreams, we can overcome any obstacle and achieve greatness.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 17:47:00', '2026-04-10 17:47:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-10 17:47:16', '2026-04-10 17:47:16'),
(1931, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:49', 'Wooden craft is a popular and versatile hobby that involves creating decorative and functional items using wood as the primary material. Here are some aspects of wooden craft:\n\n**Types of Wooden Crafts:**\n\n1. **Wood Carving**: Creating intricate designs and patterns on wood using various tools and techniques.\n2. **Wood Turning**: Shaping wood into symmetrical objects, such as bowls, vases, and candlesticks, using a lathe.\n3. **Woodworking**: Building and creating wooden items, such as furniture, cabinets, and decorative boxes.\n4. **Wood Burning**: Creating designs and patterns on wood using a heated tool, also known as pyrography.\n5. **Wood Inlay**: Creating intricate designs by inlaying small pieces of wood into a larger wooden surface.\n\n**Tools and Materials:**\n\n1. **Hand tools**: Chisels, gouges, mallets, and hand saws.\n2. **Power tools**: Table saws, drill presses, sanders, and lathes.\n3. **Wood types**: Various types of wood, such as oak, maple, cherry, and walnut, each with its unique characteristics and uses.\n4. **Adhesives**: Glues, epoxies, and other adhesives used to bond wood pieces together.\n5. **Finishing materials**: Stains, varnishes, and polyurethanes used to protect and enhance the appearance of the finished product.\n\n**Techniques:**\n\n1. **Measuring and marking**: Accurately measuring and marking wood to ensure precise cuts and joints.\n2. **Cutting and shaping**: Using various tools and techniques to cut and shape wood into the desired form.\n3. **Assembling and joining**: Using adhesives and fasteners to assemble and join wood pieces together.\n4. **Sanding and finishing**: Smoothing and finishing the wood surface to achieve a high-quality appearance.\n\n**Projects and Ideas:**\n\n1. **Furniture making**: Building tables, chairs, beds, and other functional items.\n2. **Decorative items**: Creating wall art, sculptures, and other decorative pieces.\n3. **Toys and games**: Making wooden toys, puzzles, and games.\n4. **Home decor**: Creating wooden items, such as coasters, candle holders, and picture frames, to enhance home decor.\n5. **Outdoor projects**: Building wooden planters, birdhouses, and other outdoor items.\n\n**Benefits:**\n\n1. **Creative expression**: Wooden craft allows individuals to express their creativity and bring their ideas to life.\n2. **Relaxation and stress relief**: Working with wood can be a calming and meditative activity.\n3. **Development of skills**: Wooden craft requires the development of various skills, such as measuring, cutting, and shaping.\n4. **Sense of accomplishment**: Completing a wooden craft project can give individuals a sense of pride and accomplishment.\n5. **Connection to nature**: Working with wood can foster a connection to nature and the environment.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-10 17:49:00', '2026-04-10 17:49:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/wood_spoon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2026-04-10 17:49:18', '2026-04-10 17:49:18'),
