(1943, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', 'As a dragon, I\'m excited to share with you what makes me relatable to you. Here are some points to consider:\n\n* I have a fiery passion for life, just like you do for your interests and hobbies.\n* I face challenges and obstacles, such as navigating through treacherous terrain or battling fierce opponents, just like you face your own daily struggles.\n* I have a strong sense of loyalty and protection towards those I care about, whether it\'s my treasure hoard or my loved ones.\n* I\'m constantly learning and adapting to new situations, whether it\'s discovering new lands or mastering new skills.\n* I have a unique perspective on the world, seeing things from a dragon\'s point of view, just like you have your own unique perspective on life.\n\n#DragonsOfFacebook #RelatableMoments #FireBreathingPassion #LoyaltyAndProtection #LearningAndAdapting #UniquePerspectives #TrendingNow #DragonSquad #FantasyCreatures #MythicalBeings #LegendaryLives #FacebookFam #SocialMediaScales', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 10:35:00', '2026-04-11 10:35:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-04-11 10:35:21', '2026-04-11 10:35:21'),
(1944, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, crime boss, and founder of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious drug cartels in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals of all time.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, to a middle-class family. He grew up in Medellín, where he became involved in street crime and eventually joined the city\'s underworld. In the 1970s, Escobar began to build his cocaine empire, initially working as a smuggler and trafficker for other cartels.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nIn the early 1980s, Escobar founded the Medellín cartel, which quickly became one of the largest and most powerful cocaine cartels in the world. He and his associates, including his brother Roberto and Carlos Lehder, established a vast network of cocaine production, smuggling, and distribution operations.\n\nThe cartel\'s success was fueled by Escobar\'s strategic thinking, ruthless tactics, and ability to corrupt and intimidate government officials, law enforcement, and rival cartels. At the height of his power, Escobar\'s cartel controlled over 80% of the global cocaine market, earning an estimated $420 million per week.\n\n**Violence and Intimidation**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power was marked by extreme violence and intimidation. He orchestrated the assassinations of politicians, judges, police officers, and rival cartel members, including the murder of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán in 1989.\n\nThe Medellín cartel was also responsible for numerous bombings, kidnappings, and other terrorist acts, including the 1989 bombing of Avianca Flight 203, which killed 110 people.\n\n**Pursuit and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. The hunt for Escobar became one of the most extensive and complex manhunts in history.\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín, just one day after his 44th birthday. His death marked the end of the Medellín cartel\'s reign of terror and led to the dismantling of the organization.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. While he was a ruthless and brutal crime lord, he was also a charismatic figure who was revered by some in Colombia for his generosity and philanthropy. He built homes, schools, and roads in poor neighborhoods and was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo and a collection of luxury cars.\n\nEscobar\'s story has been immortalized in numerous books, films, and TV series, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His life and death serve as a cautionary tale about the dangers of organized crime and the corrupting influence of power and wealth.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar\'s personal wealth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power.\n* He was known for his love of soccer and was a major sponsor of the Colombian national team.\n* Escobar\'s private zoo, Hacienda Nápoles, was home to over 200 exotic animals, including hippos, giraffes, and elephants.\n* He was a skilled escape artist and escaped from prison twice, once by bribing guards and once by digging a tunnel.\n* Escobar\'s death was followed by a period of relative peace in Medellín, as the city began to rebuild and recover from the violence and trauma of the cartel era.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 10:45:00', '2026-04-11 10:45:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-11 10:45:23', '2026-04-11 10:45:23'),
(1945, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and feared organized crime groups in the world. Here are some key facts about his life and legacy:\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a lower-middle-class family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, which would later shape his worldview and inform his actions.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar began his career in crime as a teenager, selling stolen cars and motorcycles. He eventually turned to smuggling and trafficking, and by the 1970s, he had become a major player in the Colombian cocaine trade. In 1976, Escobar co-founded the Medellín cartel with his cousin, Gustavo Gaviria, and other associates.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organized crime groups in the world. The cartel controlled a significant portion of the global cocaine trade, and Escobar\'s wealth and influence grew exponentially. He was known for his ruthlessness, cunning, and ability to intimidate and bribe his way to the top.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by violence and terror. He ordered the assassination of politicians, judges, police officers, and journalists who stood in his way. He also orchestrated bombings, kidnappings, and massacres, earning him the nickname \"El Patrón\" (The Boss). Escobar\'s violence was not limited to his enemies; he also targeted innocent civilians, including women and children.\n\n**Pursuit and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín. He was 44 years old at the time of his death.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning leader who brought terror and violence to Colombia and beyond. However, he is also remembered as a folk hero by some, who see him as a symbol of resistance against the Colombian government and the United States.\n\n**Pop Culture**\n\nEscobar\'s life and legacy have been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos,\" which tells the story of his rise and fall. His story has also inspired countless documentaries, songs, and other forms of media.\n\n**Controversies**\n\nEscobar\'s legacy is not without controversy. Some argue that he was a product of the failed war on drugs and that his rise to power was facilitated by corruption and incompetence within the Colombian government. Others argue that his violence and terror were a direct result of his own actions and that he was responsible for the suffering and death of countless innocent people.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and legacy are a complex and fascinating topic that continues to captivate people around the world. His story serves as a reminder of the dangers of organized crime, corruption, and violence, and the importance of addressing the root causes of these problems.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 10:50:00', '2026-04-11 10:50:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-11 10:50:16', '2026-04-11 10:50:16'),
(1946, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, smuggler, and leader of the Medellín cartel. He is widely considered one of the most notorious and successful criminals in history.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a middle-class family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, which would later shape his worldview and inform his actions.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar began his career in crime as a teenager, selling stolen cars and smuggling goods. In the 1970s, he became involved in the cocaine trade, which was rapidly expanding in Colombia. Escobar\'s charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness allowed him to quickly rise through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, which he eventually came to lead.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared drug trafficking organizations in the world. The cartel\'s operations spanned the globe, with Escobar\'s network of smugglers, dealers, and money launderers generating an estimated $30 billion in annual revenue.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by extreme violence and terror. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including politicians, police officers, judges, and rival cartel members. Escobar\'s tactics included bombings, assassinations, and kidnappings, which created a climate of fear and intimidation in Colombia.\n\n**The War on Drugs**\n\nIn the 1980s, the Colombian government, with the support of the United States, launched a war on drugs aimed at dismantling the Medellín cartel. Escobar responded with increased violence and intimidation, including the assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán in 1989.\n\n**Downfall and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a specially built facility, which he had designed himself. However, he continued to run his empire from behind bars and eventually escaped in 1992. A massive manhunt ensued, and on December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who brought terror and violence to Colombia and beyond. However, he is also seen as a symbol of the country\'s struggle against poverty, inequality, and corruption. Escobar\'s story has been immortalized in numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included owning a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a mansion with a private airport.\n* He was a prolific builder and invested heavily in infrastructure projects, including roads, bridges, and housing developments.\n* Escobar was a skilled politician and was able to build a network of alliances with other cartel leaders, politicians, and businessmen.\n* He was a devoted family man and was known to be fiercely loyal to his wife, María Victoria Henao, and their children.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and legacy are a testament to the enduring power of crime and corruption, as well as the devastating consequences of the war on drugs.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 10:53:00', '2026-04-11 10:53:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-11 10:53:14', '2026-04-11 10:53:14'),
(1947, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about resilience, adaptability, and passion. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your personal and professional life:\n\n* **Set goals and pursue them with passion**: Just like a dragon guarding its treasure, you should be fiercely dedicated to your objectives.\n* **Be open to learning and growth**: A dragon\'s fire can be both creative and destructive - it\'s essential to learn from your mistakes and use them as opportunities for growth.\n* **Protect and nurture your community**: Dragons are often depicted as guardians of their territory - prioritize building strong relationships and supporting those around you.\n* **Embody courage and confidence**: Unleash your inner dragon and take risks - it\'s the only way to truly achieve greatness.\n\n#DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #FireUpYourPassion #Resilience #GoalSetting #PersonalGrowth #CommunityFirst #ConfidenceIsKey #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalDevelopment #SuccessTips', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 11:18:00', '2026-04-11 11:18:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-04-11 11:18:17', '2026-04-11 11:18:17'),
(1948, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'When it comes to party wear for men, there are many options to choose from depending on the occasion, theme, and personal style. Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-tailored suit is a classic choice for formal parties. You can opt for a black, navy, or gray suit, and pair it with a crisp white shirt and a tie.\n2. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit. You can wear it with a dress shirt, trousers, and dress shoes for a stylish look.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt is a versatile option that can be dressed up or down. You can wear it with a pair of jeans or trousers and add a blazer or a tie for a more formal look.\n4. **Tuxedos**: A tuxedo is a must-have for formal events like black-tie parties or weddings. You can opt for a classic black tuxedo or try a bold color like navy or gray.\n5. **Cocktail Attire**: For a more casual party, you can opt for cocktail attire like a dress shirt, dark jeans, and a pair of loafers or dress boots.\n6. **Leather Jackets**: A leather jacket can add an edgy touch to any outfit. You can wear it with a dress shirt, trousers, and boots for a stylish look.\n7. **Patterned Shirts**: Patterned shirts like stripes, checks, or florals can add a pop of color to any outfit. You can wear them with a pair of jeans or trousers and add a blazer or a tie for a more formal look.\n\n**Accessories**:\n\n1. **Ties**: A tie can add a touch of elegance to any outfit. You can opt for a classic tie or try a bold pattern or color.\n2. **Pocket Squares**: A pocket square can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit. You can opt for a classic white pocket square or try a bold color or pattern.\n3. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of elegance to any outfit. You can opt for classic cufflinks or try a bold design or color.\n4. **Watches**: A watch can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit. You can opt for a classic leather strap or try a bold metal or color.\n5. **Shoes**: Dress shoes like oxfords, loafers, or boots can add a touch of elegance to any outfit. You can opt for classic black or try a bold color or design.\n\n**Tips**:\n\n1. **Dress according to the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the occasion and theme of the party.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure your clothes fit well and are comfortable to wear.\n3. **Accessories matter**: Accessories like ties, pocket squares, and cufflinks can make or break an outfit.\n4. **Be confident**: Confidence is key to pulling off any outfit. Own your look and have fun!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 12:40:00', '2026-04-11 12:40:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-04-11 12:40:13', '2026-04-11 12:40:13'),
(1949, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key characteristics of a formal shirt for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic dress shirt with a collar and cuffs, typically made of cotton or a cotton-blend fabric.\n2. **Business Shirt:** A slightly more relaxed version of the dress shirt, often with a softer collar and less formal cuffs.\n3. **Tuxedo Shirt:** A formal shirt specifically designed to be worn with a tuxedo, typically with a wingtip collar and French cuffs.\n\n**Features of a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Collar:** A formal shirt usually has a stiff, pointed collar that is designed to be worn with a tie.\n2. **Cuffs:** Formal shirts often have cuffs that are linked by buttons or cufflinks.\n3. **Front:** The front of a formal shirt typically has a placket (a panel of fabric that covers the buttons) and a breast pocket.\n4. **Fabric:** Formal shirts are usually made of high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n5. **Fit:** A formal shirt should fit well, with a slim fit through the body and sleeves that are not too loose or too tight.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White:** A classic choice for formal shirts, white is a versatile and timeless option.\n2. **Light Blue:** A light blue shirt is a popular alternative to white, and can add a touch of personality to a formal outfit.\n3. **Stripes:** Thin stripes (such as pencil stripes or regimental stripes) can add visual interest to a formal shirt.\n4. **Checks:** Small checks (such as gingham or windowpane checks) can also be a stylish option for a formal shirt.\n\n**Tips for Wearing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Pair with a tie:** A formal shirt is typically worn with a tie, so choose a tie that complements the color and pattern of the shirt.\n2. **Choose the right pants:** Formal shirts are usually worn with dress pants or a suit, so choose pants that are formal and well-fitted.\n3. **Pay attention to fit:** Make sure the shirt fits well, with a slim fit through the body and sleeves that are not too loose or too tight.\n4. **Accessories:** Add a pocket square, cufflinks, or a watch to complete the formal look.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 12:56:00', '2026-04-11 12:56:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-11 12:56:15', '2026-04-11 12:56:15'),
(1950, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', 'As a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what makes a successful entrepreneur. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Embracing challenges**: Just like how I breathe fire to overcome obstacles, you too can face your fears and push through difficulties to achieve your goals.\n* **Building a strong team**: A dragon\'s lair is only as strong as the dragons that inhabit it. Surround yourself with a team that shares your vision and values.\n* **Innovating and adapting**: In a rapidly changing world, it\'s essential to stay ahead of the curve and be willing to pivot when necessary.\n* **Protecting your assets**: As a dragon, I fiercely guard my treasure. Similarly, you should prioritize protecting your business and intellectual property.\n* **Continuous learning**: There\'s always room for improvement, whether it\'s learning new skills or staying up-to-date with industry trends.\n\n#Entrepreneurship #BusinessTips #DragonWisdom #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #SuccessMindset #InnovationNation #BusinessGrowth #LeadershipLessons', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 13:03:00', '2026-04-11 13:03:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-04-11 13:03:11', '2026-04-11 13:03:11'),
