(1952, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**\"Breathing Fire into Your Business: Key Takeaways\"**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to aim high and chase your dreams, just like I chase my treasure.\n* **Be adaptable**: The business landscape is constantly changing, so be prepared to pivot and adjust your strategy as needed.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision and values.\n* **Stay focused**: Keep your eyes on the prize and avoid distractions that can derail your progress.\n* **Continuously learn and improve**: Stay ahead of the curve by staying up-to-date with the latest trends and best practices.\n\n#BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #SuccessMindset #DragonPower #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalAdvice #BusinessGrowth #Innovation #Leadership', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 14:00:00', '2026-04-11 14:00:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-11 14:00:19', '2026-04-11 14:00:19'),
(1953, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Den**\n\nAs a business, we often find ourselves in the midst of chaos, much like a dragon navigating through fiery flames. Here are a few key takeaways to help you rise above the ashes:\n\n* **Resilience is key**: Just like a dragon\'s scales protect it from the harshest of flames, we must develop a strong armor to shield ourselves from the challenges that come our way.\n* **Innovation is crucial**: A dragon\'s fire-breathing abilities are a testament to its adaptability and innovative nature. We must strive to stay ahead of the curve and find new ways to tackle old problems.\n* **Passion drives success**: A dragon\'s passion for hoarding treasure is unmatched, and we must similarly be driven by our passion for our work to achieve greatness.\n* **Community is everything**: A dragon\'s lair is often surrounded by a loyal community of followers, and we must nurture our own networks to build a strong support system.\n\n#DragonsOfBusiness #ResilienceMatters #InnovationNation #PassionDriven #CommunityFirst #TrendingNow #BusinessLessons #MotivationMonday #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #SuccessTips', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 14:37:00', '2026-04-11 14:37:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-11 14:37:15', '2026-04-11 14:37:15'),
(1954, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', 'As a dragon in the business world, I\'d like to share some relatable points with you. Here\'s my post for Facebook:\n\n\"Breathing fire into the world of entrepreneurship. As a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* Setting goals and chasing them with passion and determination\n* Building a strong team and supporting one another\n* Continuously learning and adapting to new situations\n* Taking calculated risks and facing challenges head-on\n* Embracing failure as an opportunity to grow and improve\n\n#DragonSlayingBusiness #EntrepreneurLife #MotivationMonday #BusinessTips #TrendingNow #SuccessMindset #GoalOriented #TeamWorkMakesTheDreamWork #InnovationNation #RiskAndReward #FailureIsNotTheEnd\"\n\nThis post aims to showcase the professional and relatable side of a dragon in the business world, while also using trending hashtags to increase visibility and engagement on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 14:38:00', '2026-04-11 14:38:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-11 14:38:14', '2026-04-11 14:38:14'),
(1955, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Empowering Your Business with a Roar**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, we understand the importance of staying ahead of the curve. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Innovate and Adapt**: Stay ahead of the competition by embracing new technologies and trends.\n* **Build a Strong Team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision.\n* **Focus on Customer Satisfaction**: Deliver exceptional service and build strong relationships with your clients.\n* **Stay Organized and Efficient**: Streamline your operations and optimize your workflow to maximize productivity.\n\nBy following these principles, you\'ll be well on your way to achieving success and making your mark in the business world. #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #Teamwork #CustomerSatisfaction #ProductivityHacks #TrendingNow #BusinessSuccess #DragonApproved #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalAdvice', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 14:39:00', '2026-04-11 14:39:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-11 14:39:12', '2026-04-11 14:39:12'),
(1956, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and the power of fire. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Courage is key**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and face challenges head-on.\n* **Passion fuels success**: Pursue your passions with dedication and enthusiasm.\n* **Resilience is essential**: Learn to adapt and overcome obstacles in your path.\n* **Community matters**: Surround yourself with people who support and uplift you.\n* **Self-care is crucial**: Take time to prioritize your own well-being and growth.\n\n#MotivationMonday #DragonInspiration #EntrepreneurMindset #TrendingNow #BusinessLessons #PersonalGrowth #FireWithin #SuccessTips #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 15:10:00', '2026-04-11 15:10:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-04-11 15:10:15', '2026-04-11 15:10:15'),
(1957, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to thrive. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define what success means to you and create a roadmap to achieve it.\n* **Stay adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change, just like a dragon adjusts its flight path.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented individuals who share your vision.\n* **Innovate and improve**: Continuously seek out new opportunities and ways to enhance your skills.\n* **Protect your brand**: Safeguard your reputation and maintain a strong online presence.\n\n#DragonInspiration #BusinessSuccessTips #MotivationMonday #EntrepreneurLife #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #LeadershipGoals #InnovationNation #BrandBuilding #SuccessTips #GoalSetting #TeamWorkMakesTheDreamWork', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 15:14:00', '2026-04-11 15:14:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-04-11 15:14:15', '2026-04-11 15:14:15'),
(1958, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Embracing Your Inner Dragon: Lessons for Success**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, the dragon has long been a source of inspiration for many. Here are some key takeaways from the dragon\'s playbook that can be applied to your personal and professional life:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like the dragon\'s fiery spirit, aim high and strive for excellence in all your pursuits.\n* **Cultivate resilience**: Life can be unpredictable, but with the dragon\'s unwavering determination, you can overcome any obstacle.\n* **Protect your passions**: Guard your interests and values with the ferocity of a dragon protecting its treasure.\n* **Embody courage**: Take bold steps and face challenges head-on, just like the fearless dragon.\n* **Soar to new heights**: Spread your wings and explore new opportunities, just as the dragon takes to the skies.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #ProfessionalGrowth #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #BusinessLessons #PersonalDevelopment #RelatableContent #InspirationalQuotes', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 15:24:00', '2026-04-11 15:24:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-04-11 15:24:15', '2026-04-11 15:24:15'),
