(1961, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a large language model, I don\'t have the capability to create images. But I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends:\n\n**Image Description:**\n\nThe image is a high-resolution, vibrant photograph of a group of friends having a great time together. The scene is set in a trendy outdoor cafe on a sunny afternoon. The man, likely in his mid-twenties, is sitting at the center of the group, surrounded by his friends.\n\nHe\'s wearing a casual, yet stylish outfit, consisting of a light-blue shirt, dark jeans, and a pair of sleek, black sunglasses. His hair is messy, and he has a relaxed, effortless smile on his face.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress. She\'s laughing and chatting with the man, her eyes sparkling with amusement. On his right is another friend, a tall, lanky guy with a baseball cap and a friendly grin. He\'s holding a cold beer and clinking it against the man\'s glass in a toast.\n\nIn the background, there\'s a blur of people walking by, chatting, and enjoying the atmosphere of the cafe. The sun is shining down, casting a warm glow over the entire scene. The image is filled with a sense of camaraderie, friendship, and joy.\n\n**Image Specifications:**\n\n* Resolution: 4000 x 3000 pixels\n* Aspect Ratio: 4:3\n* Color Profile: Adobe RGB (1998)\n* File Format: JPEG\n* Compression: Low (to preserve image quality)\n\n**Mood and Atmosphere:**\n\nThe image exudes a carefree, relaxed atmosphere, capturing the essence of a fun day out with friends. The warm sunlight, the vibrant colors, and the joyful expressions on the friends\' faces all contribute to a sense of happiness and togetherness.\n\nIf you\'d like, I can try to create a text-based representation of the image using ASCII art. Please let me know!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 16:06:00', '2026-04-11 16:06:16', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-04-11 16:06:16', '2026-04-11 16:06:16'),
(1962, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a quintessential blend of urban aesthetics, cinematic charm, and high-fashion appeal. Let\'s break down the components that make this image so captivating:\n\n1. **Transparent Umbrella**: The use of a transparent umbrella is a clever choice. It not only protects the girl from the rain but also allows the photographer to capture her facial expressions and outfit without any obstruction. The transparency adds a layer of elegance and sophistication to the overall scene.\n\n2. **Light Rain**: The light rain creates a mystical atmosphere, enhancing the cinematic mood of the image. It\'s not heavy enough to be bothersome but just enough to create beautiful reflections on the wet street and to justify the use of the umbrella.\n\n3. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: Neon lights reflecting off the wet pavement are a staple of urban aesthetic photography. They add vibrant colors to the scene, creating a beautiful interplay of light and shadow. These reflections can turn an ordinary street into a kaleidoscope of colors, making the image highly visually appealing.\n\n4. **Aesthetic Photography**: The term \"aesthetic photography\" refers to the creation of images that are not just visually pleasing but also evoke emotions or convey a particular mood or style. In this case, the combination of the rainy setting, neon lights, and the girl\'s fashionable outfit all contribute to a unique and captivating aesthetic.\n\n5. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: \"Bokeh\" refers to the way a camera lens renders out-of-focus points of light. A soft bokeh effect can add a dreamy, ethereal quality to an image, separating the subject from the background and emphasizing the subject\'s importance. In this scenario, the soft bokeh lights would likely be from the neon reflections or streetlights, further enhancing the cinematic and mystical ambiance.\n\n6. **Fashionable Outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is a key element in this scene. It suggests that she is stylish and aware of current fashion trends, which can add a layer of sophistication and modernity to the image. The outfit could include anything from a chic raincoat to stylish boots, each element carefully chosen to complement the overall aesthetic of the scene.\n\n7. **Cinematic Mood**: The description of a \"cinematic mood\" implies that the image has the quality of a still frame from a movie. This could be due to the combination of the rainy night setting, the use of neon lights, and the fashionable subject, all of which are common elements in film noir or romantic comedies. The cinematic mood elevates the image from a simple photograph to a narrative snippet, inviting the viewer to imagine the story behind the scene.\n\n8. **High-Detail**: The emphasis on \"high-detail\" suggests that the image is not just aesthetically pleasing but also rich in textures, colors, and possibly even a compelling narrative. High detail can draw the viewer into the image, encouraging them to explore every aspect of the scene, from the droplets of rain on the umbrella to the intricate designs of the girl\'s outfit.\n\nIn summary, the scene of a girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain, set against a backdrop of neon reflections on a wet street, embodies a perfect blend of urban chic, cinematic allure, and high-fashion sensibility. Each element, from the umbrella to the neon lights and the girl\'s outfit, contributes to a visually stunning and deeply evocative image that captures the essence of a rainy city night in a way that is both aesthetic and narrative.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-11 16:11:00', '2026-04-11 16:11:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-04-11 16:11:14', '2026-04-11 16:11:14'),
