(1972, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', '**Empowering Your Business with Dragon\'s Fire**\n\nAs a business owner, you\'re likely no stranger to the challenges of entrepreneurship. At Dragon, we understand the importance of staying ahead of the curve and driving growth. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Innovate and Adapt**: Stay ahead of the competition by embracing new technologies and trends.\n* **Build a Strong Team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision.\n* **Focus on Customer Satisfaction**: Deliver exceptional service and build strong relationships with your clients.\n* **Stay Organized and Focused**: Prioritize tasks, set realistic goals, and maintain a healthy work-life balance.\n\nBy following these principles, you can unlock your business\'s full potential and achieve success. Join the conversation and share your own tips for business growth.\n\n#TrendingNow #BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #TeamWork #CustomerFirst #ProductivityHacks #DragonBusinessTips #FacebookForBusiness #GrowYourBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 10:35:00', '2026-04-12 10:35:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-04-12 10:35:17', '2026-04-12 10:35:17'),
(1973, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord, crime boss, and founder of the Medellín Cartel. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and was raised by his mother, Hermilda, after his father abandoned them. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, which would later shape his worldview and drive his ambition.\n\nEscobar\'s entry into the world of organized crime began in the 1970s, when he started selling cocaine and other illicit substances in Medellín. He quickly rose through the ranks of the local crime scene, earning a reputation for his cunning, ruthlessness, and business acumen.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nIn the late 1970s, Escobar co-founded the Medellín Cartel, which would become one of the most powerful and feared drug cartels in the world. The cartel\'s primary business was smuggling cocaine into the United States, where it was sold to distributors and eventually reached consumers.\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín Cartel expanded its operations, establishing a network of smugglers, distributors, and money launderers. The cartel\'s success was fueled by Escobar\'s innovative tactics, including the use of small planes and boats to transport cocaine, as well as his ability to bribe and intimidate law enforcement officials.\n\n**Violence and Intimidation**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power was marked by violence and intimidation. He was known for his brutal tactics, including assassinations, bombings, and kidnappings. His targets included rival drug lords, law enforcement officials, journalists, and politicians who opposed him.\n\nOne of the most notable examples of Escobar\'s violence was the assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán in 1989. Galán had vowed to crack down on organized crime and had gained popularity among Colombians. His murder was a devastating blow to the country and marked a turning point in the government\'s efforts to combat the Medellín Cartel.\n\n**International Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations aimed at capturing or killing Escobar. The manhunt was one of the largest and most complex in history, involving thousands of law enforcement officials, intelligence agents, and military personnel.\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar\'s 44th birthday, he was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín. The operation was the result of a lengthy and meticulous investigation, which involved tracking Escobar\'s movements and gathering intelligence on his inner circle.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. On one hand, he was a ruthless and brutal crime lord who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people. His actions had a devastating impact on Colombia and the world, contributing to the spread of organized crime and the destruction of communities.\n\nOn the other hand, Escobar\'s story has captivated people around the world, inspiring numerous books, films, and TV shows. His rags-to-riches tale, combined with his cunning and charisma, has made him a fascinating figure, albeit a deeply flawed one.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s legacy has been the subject of controversy, with some arguing that he was a product of his environment and a symptom of deeper social and economic problems in Colombia. Others see him as a symbol of the destructive power of organized crime and the importance of combating it.\n\nRegardless of how one views Escobar, his impact on the world is undeniable. His story serves as a reminder of the dangers of organized crime and the importance of addressing the root causes of poverty, inequality, and social injustice.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 10:45:00', '2026-04-12 10:45:27', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-12 10:45:27', '2026-04-12 10:45:27'),
(1974, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, crime boss, and leader of the Medellín cartel. He is widely regarded as one of the most notorious and influential figures in the history of organized crime.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he quickly became involved in street crime and gang activity.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar began working for various crime bosses in Medellín, including Carlos Lehder, who would later become a key associate. Escobar\'s charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness quickly earned him a reputation as a rising star in the Colombian underworld.\n\nIn 1976, Escobar founded the Medellín cartel, which would become one of the most powerful and feared drug trafficking organizations in the world. The cartel\'s main product was cocaine, which was smuggled into the United States and other countries through a network of distributors and dealers.\n\n**The Golden Years**\n\nDuring the 1980s, Escobar\'s empire expanded rapidly, and he became one of the richest men in the world. He invested in real estate, construction, and other legitimate businesses, and he used his wealth to bribe politicians, police, and military officials.\n\nEscobar\'s organization was known for its brutality and efficiency. He used violence and intimidation to eliminate rivals and competitors, and he was feared by law enforcement agencies around the world.\n\n**The Wars on Escobar**\n\nIn the late 1980s, the Colombian government, with the support of the United States, launched a series of military operations against Escobar\'s organization. The wars on Escobar were marked by intense violence and bloodshed, and they ultimately led to the downfall of the Medellín cartel.\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to the Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a specially built facility, known as the \"Cathedral,\" which was designed to be escape-proof. However, Escobar escaped from the prison in 1992 and went into hiding.\n\n**The Final Hunt**\n\nThe Colombian government and the United States launched a massive manhunt for Escobar, who was now a fugitive. The hunt was led by a team of Colombian police officers, known as the \"Search Bloc,\" who were trained and supported by the US Drug Enforcement Administration (DEA).\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar\'s 44th birthday, he was tracked down to a rooftop in Medellín, where he was shot and killed by the Search Bloc. The killing of Escobar marked the end of the Medellín cartel and the beginning of a new era in the war on drugs.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He was a ruthless and cunning crime boss who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including innocent civilians, police officers, and rival gang members.\n\nAt the same time, Escobar was a charismatic and intelligent leader who was able to build a vast and powerful organization from scratch. He was a symbol of the excesses and corruption of the 1980s, and his story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and documentaries.\n\n**Popular Culture**\n\nEscobar\'s life and legacy have been the subject of numerous films, TV shows, and books, including:\n\n* \"Narcos\" (2015-2017), a Netflix series that tells the story of Escobar\'s rise and fall.\n* \"Escobar: Paradise Lost\" (2014), a film that explores the final years of Escobar\'s life.\n* \"The Two Escobars\" (2010), a documentary that examines the relationship between Escobar and Colombian soccer player Andrés Escobar.\n* \"Killing Pablo\" (2001), a book by Mark Bowden that tells the story of the hunt for Escobar.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and legacy are a reminder of the dangers and complexities of the war on drugs, and the enduring fascination with the figure of the crime boss.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 10:50:00', '2026-04-12 10:50:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-12 10:50:16', '2026-04-12 10:50:16'),
(1975, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Escobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, on December 1, 1949, to Abel de Jesús Escobar and Hermilda Gaviria. He grew up in a poor household with several siblings and was raised by his mother, who was a schoolteacher. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, with his family often struggling to make ends meet.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s involvement in organized crime began in the early 1970s, when he started selling cocaine and marijuana in Medellín. He quickly rose through the ranks of the local crime syndicate, earning a reputation for his cunning, ruthlessness, and business acumen. In the late 1970s, Escobar partnered with other Colombian traffickers to form the Medellín cartel, which would become one of the most powerful and feared drug cartels in the world.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel dominated the global cocaine trade, smuggling massive quantities of the drug into the United States, Europe, and other countries. The cartel\'s success was due in part to Escobar\'s innovative tactics, including the use of small planes and boats to transport cocaine, and his ability to bribe and intimidate law enforcement officials.\n\n**Violence and Intimidation**\n\nEscobar was known for his brutal tactics, using violence and intimidation to maintain control over his empire. He was responsible for the deaths of hundreds of people, including rival traffickers, law enforcement officials, and innocent civilians. His most notorious tactic was the use of \"plata o plomo\" (silver or lead), which meant that those who refused to cooperate with him would be killed.\n\n**Pursuit and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the US DEA, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. In 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned, but he escaped in 1992. A massive manhunt ensued, and on December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning drug lord who brought immense wealth and power to himself and his associates. However, his actions also led to the deaths of thousands of people and contributed to the destabilization of Colombia and other countries. Today, Escobar\'s story has been immortalized in films, books, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included owning a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a sprawling estate called Hacienda Napoles.\n* He was a skilled politician and was elected to the Colombian Congress in 1982.\n* Escobar was responsible for the construction of many buildings, roads, and other infrastructure projects in Medellín, which earned him popularity among some locals.\n* His net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power, making him one of the richest people in the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 10:53:00', '2026-04-12 10:53:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-12 10:53:14', '2026-04-12 10:53:14'),
(1976, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing the Fire Within: 5 Key Takeaways for Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Resilience is key**: Just like how I can withstand extreme temperatures, entrepreneurs must be able to adapt to changing market conditions and bounce back from setbacks.\n* **Passion drives success**: My fiery passion for what I do is what sets me apart, and the same is true for entrepreneurs who are driven by a genuine passion for their work.\n* **Innovation is essential**: As a dragon, I\'m always looking for new ways to improve my fire-breathing skills, and entrepreneurs must stay ahead of the curve by innovating and staying up-to-date with industry trends.\n* **Community is crucial**: My dragon community is vital to my success, and entrepreneurs must build strong relationships with their team, customers, and partners to achieve their goals.\n* **Continuous learning is vital**: I\'m always learning new ways to navigate my surroundings and improve my skills, and entrepreneurs must prioritize ongoing education and self-improvement to stay ahead of the competition.\n\n#Trending #Entrepreneurship #BusinessTips #DragonInspiration #Resilience #Passion #Innovation #CommunityFirst #ContinuousLearning #FireUpYourBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 11:18:00', '2026-04-12 11:18:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-04-12 11:18:16', '2026-04-12 11:18:16'),
(1977, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Men\'s Party Wear: A Guide to Styling and Fashion**\n\nWhen it comes to dressing up for a party, men have a wide range of options to choose from. Here are some popular party wear styles for men:\n\n### **Formal Party Wear**\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit in black, navy, or gray is a classic choice for formal parties.\n2. **Tuxedos**: For a more luxurious look, opt for a tuxedo with a bow tie and cummerbund.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: Pair a dress shirt with a suit or tuxedo for a stylish and elegant look.\n4. **Dress Shoes**: Black or brown dress shoes are a must-have for formal parties.\n\n### **Semi-Formal Party Wear**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer with a dress shirt and trousers is a great option for semi-formal parties.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dark-washed dress pants with a dress shirt and blazer are a stylish choice.\n3. **Polos**: A polo shirt with dress pants or trousers is a casual yet stylish option.\n4. **Loafers**: Loafers or dress boots are perfect for semi-formal parties.\n\n### **Casual Party Wear**\n\n1. **Jeans**: Dark-washed jeans with a casual shirt and sneakers are a great option for casual parties.\n2. **T-Shirts**: Graphic T-shirts or plain T-shirts with jeans and sneakers are a stylish choice.\n3. **Hoodies**: For a more relaxed look, opt for a hoodie with jeans and sneakers.\n4. **Sneakers**: Sneakers are a must-have for casual parties.\n\n### **Accessories**\n\n1. **Watches**: A leather strap watch or a metal watch adds a touch of elegance to any outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of sophistication to a dress shirt.\n3. **Belts**: A leather belt or a chain belt can add a stylish touch to any outfit.\n4. **Hats**: A fedora or a panama hat can add a stylish touch to any outfit.\n\n### **Tips and Tricks**\n\n1. **Dress according to the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the party theme and dress code.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Ensure that your clothes fit well and are not too tight or too loose.\n3. **Accessories can make or break an outfit**: Choose accessories that complement your outfit and add a touch of personality.\n4. **Grooming is key**: Make sure to groom yourself well, including your hair, beard, and nails.\n\nBy following these tips and guides, you can create a stylish and fashionable party wear outfit that will make you stand out from the crowd.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 12:40:00', '2026-04-12 12:40:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-04-12 12:40:18', '2026-04-12 12:40:18'),
(1978, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts usually have a point collar, spread collar, or a wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are typically made from high-quality cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the chest and waist.\n5. **Button-front**: Formal shirts usually have a button-front closure.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic fit**: A traditional formal shirt with a relaxed fit through the chest and waist.\n2. **Slim fit**: A modern formal shirt with a slim fit through the chest and waist.\n3. **Tailored fit**: A formal shirt with a tailored fit, designed to fit closely to the body.\n4. **Dress shirt**: A formal shirt designed to be worn with a suit and tie.\n5. **Business casual**: A formal shirt with a more relaxed fit and style, suitable for business casual events.\n\n**Popular Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: Known for their high-quality, classic formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French luxury brand offering high-end formal shirts.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: An American brand offering classic, formal shirts with a preppy twist.\n4. **Ted Baker**: A British brand offering stylish, formal shirts with a modern twist.\n5. **Armani**: An Italian luxury brand offering high-end, formal shirts with a sleek, modern design.\n\n**Tips for Choosing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a formal shirt that is suitable for the occasion, such as a wedding, job interview, or business meeting.\n2. **Think about the color**: White, light blue, and pale pink are classic colors for formal shirts.\n3. **Pay attention to fabric**: Choose a high-quality fabric that is comfortable and durable.\n4. **Get the right fit**: Ensure the shirt fits well through the chest and waist, and the sleeves are the right length.\n5. **Accessories**: Consider adding a tie, pocket square, and cufflinks to complete the formal look.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 12:56:00', '2026-04-12 12:56:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-12 12:56:19', '2026-04-12 12:56:19'),
(1979, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and resilience. Here are some key takeaways that you can apply to your own life:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like I strive to hoard the most treasure, you should aim high and work towards achieving your dreams.\n* **Stay focused**: Don\'t let distractions get in the way of your objectives. Keep your eyes on the prize and stay committed to your goals.\n* **Be adaptable**: The ability to adjust to changing circumstances is crucial in today\'s fast-paced world. Learn to pivot and thrive in the face of uncertainty.\n* **Protect your assets**: Whether it\'s your time, energy, or resources, make sure to prioritize and safeguard what\'s important to you.\n* **Roar with confidence**: Believe in yourself and your abilities. Your self-assurance will inspire others and help you achieve greatness.\n\n#MotivationMonday #DragonInspiration #BusinessLessons #ProfessionalGrowth #TrendingTopics #Resilience #Ambition #Focus #Adaptability #ConfidenceIsKey #FacebookInspiration', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 13:03:00', '2026-04-12 13:03:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-04-12 13:03:14', '2026-04-12 13:03:14'),
(1980, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:51', 'It seems like you may have accidentally typed some random characters. If you\'d like to start a conversation or ask a question, I\'m here to help. What\'s on your mind?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 13:51:00', '2026-04-12 13:51:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/fgfg?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 15, '2026-04-12 13:51:17', '2026-04-12 13:51:17'),
(1981, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**\"Breathing Fire into Your Business: Lessons from a Dragon\"**\n\nAs a mythical creature, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success and perseverance. Here are some key takeaways to help you grow your business:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to aim high and dream big. Whether it\'s expanding your customer base or launching a new product, set your sights on what you want to achieve.\n* **Be adaptable**: The business landscape is constantly changing, and being able to pivot and adjust to new circumstances is crucial for success.\n* **Protect your brand**: As a dragon, I\'m fiercely protective of my territory and my reputation. Make sure you\'re doing the same for your business by maintaining a strong online presence and engaging with your customers.\n* **Invest in your team**: A strong team is the backbone of any successful business. Invest in your employees\' growth and development to help them thrive.\n* **Stay ahead of the curve**: Stay up-to-date with the latest trends and technologies to stay ahead of the competition.\n\n#BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #SuccessStrategies #DragonSizedAmbitions #TrendingNow #FacebookForBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #BusinessGrowth #InnovationNation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 14:00:00', '2026-04-12 14:00:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-12 14:00:20', '2026-04-12 14:00:20');
