(1990, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a text-based AI and do not have the capability to create images. However, I can describe a scene that might fit the image you have in mind.\n\nImagine a high-quality image of a group of friends, all in their mid-twenties to early thirties, gathered around a large wooden table in a cozy outdoor setting. The sun is setting in the background, casting a warm orange glow over the scene.\n\nThe man at the center of the image, likely the main subject, is smiling and laughing with his friends. He\'s wearing a casual outfit, perhaps a pair of dark blue jeans and a light blue button-down shirt, with a few days\' worth of stubble on his face. His hair is messy and styled in a relaxed, effortless way.\n\nTo his left is a friend with a tall glass of beer, clinking it against the main subject\'s glass in a toast. The friend has a big smile on his face and is wearing a baseball cap and a faded band t-shirt.\n\nOn the other side of the main subject is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress. She\'s laughing and playfully teasing the main subject, her eyes sparkling with amusement.\n\nIn the background, there\'s a blurred view of a park or a backyard, with trees and flowers swaying gently in the breeze. The atmosphere is relaxed and convivial, with the group of friends enjoying each other\'s company and the warm summer evening.\n\nThe image is taken from a slightly low angle, with the camera looking up at the group, which creates a sense of intimacy and camaraderie. The lighting is warm and golden, with a shallow depth of field that blurs the background and emphasizes the main subject and his friends.\n\nThe overall mood of the image is one of friendship, relaxation, and joy, capturing the carefree spirit of a summer evening spent with good friends.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 16:06:00', '2026-04-12 16:06:17', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-04-12 16:06:17', '2026-04-12 16:06:17'),
(1991, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a quintessential example of aesthetic photography, blending elements of fashion, cinematography, and the captivating interplay of light and reflections on a wet, neon-lit street. Let\'s break down the key components that make this image so visually appealing and cinematic:\n\n1. **Transparent Umbrella**: The transparent umbrella is a brilliant prop. It allows the viewer to see the girl\'s face and outfit while still conveying the rainy atmosphere. The transparency also creates interesting reflections and plays with light, adding depth to the image.\n\n2. **Light Rain**: The light rain sets a melancholic yet romantic mood, which is often a hallmark of cinematic scenes. It\'s enough to create reflections and a sense of wetness on the street but not so heavy that it obscures the view or drenches the subject.\n\n3. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: Neon lights reflecting off wet pavement are a staple of urban aesthetic photography. These reflections add vibrant colors to the scene, create a sense of movement, and enhance the overall cinematic feel. The neon lights can symbolize the bustling city life, contrasted with the serene, solitary figure of the girl.\n\n4. **Aesthetic Photography**: The term \"aesthetic photography\" refers to the intentional creation of visually pleasing images that often focus on mood, atmosphere, and style. In this scenario, the photographer is likely focusing on capturing the beauty of the moment, the interplay of light and water, and the fashionable subject within a cinematic context.\n\n5. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: Soft bokeh (the aesthetic quality of the blur) in the background, especially from the neon lights, adds to the image\'s dreamy, ethereal quality. This effect helps to separate the subject from the background, focusing the viewer\'s attention on the girl while still hinting at the vibrant city surroundings.\n\n6. **Fashionable Outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is a crucial element, as it contributes to the overall style and mood of the photograph. The choice of clothing and accessories can reveal character, enhance the cinematic feel, and complement the colors and lighting of the scene.\n\n7. **Cinematic Mood**: The combination of the rainy setting, neon lights, and the solitary figure under an umbrella evokes a strong cinematic mood, reminiscent of scenes from movies that use rain and urban landscapes to convey emotion and narrative. This mood can evoke feelings of romance, mystery, or contemplation, depending on the context and the viewer\'s interpretation.\n\n8. **High-Detail**: Capturing the scene in high detail allows for a more immersive experience. The viewer can appreciate the textures of the umbrella, the clothing, the wet street, and the sharpness of the neon reflections, which all contribute to the image\'s realism and aesthetic appeal.\n\nIn summary, the image of a girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain, set against a backdrop of neon reflections on a wet street, embodies a perfect blend of fashion, cinematography, and the captivating effects of light and reflection. It\'s a scene that invites the viewer to step into its cinematic world, filled with mood, style, and the beauty of a rainy, neon-lit night.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-12 16:11:00', '2026-04-12 16:11:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-04-12 16:11:15', '2026-04-12 16:11:15'),
