(2011, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:55', 'As a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Embracing challenges**: Just like how I breathe fire to overcome obstacles, you too can face your fears and push through difficulties to achieve your goals.\n* **Building a strong network**: My scales may be tough, but my connections are even stronger. Surround yourself with people who support and uplift you.\n* **Staying adaptable**: From flying through the skies to navigating through caves, I\'ve learned to be flexible and adjust to new situations. Stay open to change and be willing to pivot when necessary.\n* **Protecting your assets**: My treasure hoard is precious to me, and I take great care to safeguard it. Make sure to prioritize your own assets, whether it\'s your time, energy, or resources.\n\n#BusinessTips #DragonWisdom #EntrepreneurLife #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #SuccessStories #ProfessionalAdvice #FacebookBusiness #RelatableContent', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 13:55:00', '2026-04-13 13:55:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 4, '2026-04-13 13:55:16', '2026-04-13 13:55:16'),
