(2013, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:07', '**Scale New Heights with Dragon Business Solutions**\n\nAs a leading business solutions provider, we understand the importance of staying ahead of the curve. Here are some key points to consider when taking your business to the next level:\n\n* **Innovate and Adapt**: Stay up-to-date with the latest industry trends and technologies to stay competitive.\n* **Build Strong Relationships**: Foster meaningful connections with your customers, partners, and team members to drive growth and success.\n* **Focus on Quality**: Prioritize delivering high-quality products and services to build trust and loyalty with your audience.\n* **Embrace Change**: Be open to new ideas and perspectives to stay agile and responsive in a rapidly changing market.\n\nAt Dragon Business Solutions, we\'re committed to helping you achieve your business goals. Follow us for more insights, tips, and industry news. #BusinessGrowth #Innovation #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #SuccessTips #Trending #BusinessSolutions #DragonBusiness #ScaleNewHeights', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 14:07:00', '2026-04-13 14:07:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 5, '2026-04-13 14:07:13', '2026-04-13 14:07:13'),
(2014, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:18', '**Unlock Your Business Potential with Dragon**\n\nAs a business owner or creator, you understand the importance of staying ahead of the curve. At Dragon, we\'re committed to helping you achieve your goals. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Enhance your online presence**: Establish a strong digital footprint to reach a wider audience.\n* **Develop a unique brand voice**: Stand out from the competition with a professional and consistent tone.\n* **Leverage trending hashtags**: Increase your visibility and engagement on social media platforms like Facebook.\n* **Stay up-to-date with industry trends**: Continuously educate yourself on the latest developments and best practices.\n\nBy following these points, you\'ll be well on your way to unlocking your business potential. Join the conversation and stay ahead of the curve with Dragon.\n\n#TrendingNow #BusinessTips #SocialMediaMarketing #FacebookMarketing #BrandVoice #DigitalMarketing #OnlinePresence #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #SuccessStory #BusinessGrowth #MarketingStrategy #TrendingHashtags #ProfessionalDevelopment #BusinessOwner #CreatorCommunity', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 14:18:00', '2026-04-13 14:18:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 6, '2026-04-13 14:18:12', '2026-04-13 14:18:12'),
(2015, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Unlock the Power of Dragon\'s Wisdom**\n\nAs a renowned dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success and perseverance. Here are some key takeaways to help you soar to new heights:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and chase your passions.\n* **Stay focused and determined**: Overcome obstacles and stay committed to your vision.\n* **Embrace challenges as opportunities**: Learn from your mistakes and use them as stepping stones for growth.\n* **Surround yourself with positivity**: Build a supportive network of like-minded individuals who inspire and motivate you.\n* **Take calculated risks**: Step out of your comfort zone and be bold in your pursuit of excellence.\n\n#DragonsDen #MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #GoalSetting #Focus #Determination #PositiveVibes #RiskAndReward #TrendingNow #Inspiration #BusinessTips #EntrepreneurMindset #DragonWisdom #FacebookExclusive', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 14:37:00', '2026-04-13 14:37:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-13 14:37:14', '2026-04-13 14:37:14'),
(2016, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Den**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about cultivating a passion that drives you forward. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set bold goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s conquering a new market or launching a new product, set your sights on what you want to achieve.\n* **Stay adaptable**: Just like a dragon\'s scales, your business needs to be flexible and able to adjust to changing circumstances.\n* **Protect your treasure**: Your unique value proposition is what sets you apart from the competition. Guard it fiercely and invest in its growth.\n* **Build a loyal hoard**: Surround yourself with a team that shares your vision and is dedicated to helping you achieve your goals.\n* **Keep learning**: Stay up-to-date with the latest trends and technologies to stay ahead of the curve.\n\n#TrendingNow #BusinessLessons #DragonInspiration #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #Motivation #Innovation #SuccessTips #FacebookForBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 14:38:00', '2026-04-13 14:38:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-13 14:38:16', '2026-04-13 14:38:16'),
(2017, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned to harness my inner strength and passion to achieve greatness. Here are a few key takeaways that can be applied to your personal and professional life:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on a treasure hoard, you should strive for excellence in your endeavors.\n* **Stay focused and determined**: A dragon\'s fiery passion and unwavering commitment can help you overcome obstacles and achieve success.\n* **Protect and nurture your assets**: Just as a dragon guards its treasure, you should prioritize and care for your most valuable resources, whether they\'re personal or professional.\n* **Continuously learn and grow**: A dragon\'s wisdom and knowledge are gained through experience and adaptation, so be sure to stay curious and open to new opportunities.\n\n#Trending #Motivation #Inspiration #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #DragonWisdom #Ambition #Focus #Determination #SuccessMindset #TreasureYourAssets #LearnAndGrow #FacebookMotivation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 14:39:00', '2026-04-13 14:39:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-13 14:39:14', '2026-04-13 14:39:14'),
(2018, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**\"Breathing Fire into Your Business: Lessons from a Dragon\"**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success and perseverance. Here are some key takeaways to help you ignite your own entrepreneurial spirit:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s conquering a new market or launching a innovative product, set your sights on the horizon and strive for excellence.\n* **Be fearless and adaptable**: The business landscape is constantly evolving, and it\'s essential to stay agile and responsive to change. Don\'t be afraid to take calculated risks and pivot when necessary.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision and values. Together, you can achieve greatness and overcome even the most daunting challenges.\n* **Stay focused and disciplined**: As a dragon, I know that distractions can be tempting, but it\'s crucial to stay focused on your goals and maintain a disciplined approach to achieve success.\n\n#DragonInspiration #BusinessLessons #Entrepreneurship #Motivation #SuccessTips #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #LeadershipTips #InnovationNation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 15:10:00', '2026-04-13 15:10:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-04-13 15:10:15', '2026-04-13 15:10:15'),
(2019, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated humans. Here are some key takeaways from the dragon\'s realm:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness, reminding us to stand tall in the face of challenges.\n* **Adaptability and evolution**: With their ability to thrive in various environments, dragons teach us to be flexible and adapt to changing circumstances.\n* **Loyalty and protection**: Dragons are fiercely protective of their territories and loved ones, highlighting the importance of loyalty and dedication.\n* **Wisdom and knowledge**: With their ancient wisdom, dragons encourage us to seek knowledge, learn from our experiences, and share our insights with others.\n\n#DragonInspiration #BusinessLessons #Motivation #SuccessTips #TrendingNow #FacebookExclusive #ProfessionalDevelopment #PersonalGrowth #Innovation #Leadership #Entrepreneurship #Resilience #Adaptability #Courage #Loyalty #Wisdom #KnowledgeIsPower', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 15:14:00', '2026-04-13 15:14:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-04-13 15:14:16', '2026-04-13 15:14:16'),
(2020, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', 'As a dragon entrepreneur, I\'d like to share with you what makes my business roar with success. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Innovative Ideas**: Staying ahead of the curve with cutting-edge solutions that cater to the needs of my customers.\n* **Strategic Planning**: Carefully crafting plans that ensure efficient execution and maximum return on investment.\n* **Team Collaboration**: Fostering a positive and inclusive work environment that encourages creativity and growth.\n* **Customer Satisfaction**: Prioritizing the needs of my clients and delivering exceptional service that exceeds their expectations.\n* **Continuous Learning**: Staying up-to-date with the latest industry trends and best practices to maintain a competitive edge.\n\nBy following these principles, my business has been able to achieve remarkable success and I\'m excited to see what the future holds. #BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #Leadership #TeamWork #CustomerFirst #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #DragonApproved #FacebookBusiness #GrowYourBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 15:24:00', '2026-04-13 15:24:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-04-13 15:24:17', '2026-04-13 15:24:17'),
