(2028, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football is a popular sport played by two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nThere are several types of football, including:\n\n1. **Association Football** (or Soccer): This is the most widely played and watched version of football, played with a round ball and emphasizing kicking and heading.\n2. **American Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying and throwing the ball, with a focus on physical tackling.\n3. **Rugby Football**: This version is a full-contact team sport that originated in the UK, played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizing carrying, passing, and tackling.\n4. **Australian Rules Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying, kicking, and tackling, with a focus on speed and agility.\n5. **Gaelic Football**: This version is played with a round ball and emphasizes kicking, carrying, and tackling, with a focus on speed and agility.\n\nSome popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most widely watched and followed international soccer tournament.\n2. **NFL (National Football League)**: The top-level American football league in the United States.\n3. **Premier League**: The top-level association football league in England.\n4. **Super Bowl**: The annual championship game of the NFL.\n5. **Champions League**: The top-level European club soccer competition.\n\nFootball is a popular sport worldwide, with millions of players, fans, and spectators. It\'s a great way to stay active, build teamwork skills, and enjoy the thrill of competition.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 16:33:00', '2026-04-13 16:33:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-04-13 16:33:20', '2026-04-13 16:33:20'),
(2029, 'h2r', 'It seems like you\'re referring to \"H2R\" but haven\'t provided any context. \"H2R\" can stand for several things depending on the field or topic you\'re discussing. Here are a few possibilities:\r\n\r\n1. **Hydrogen**: In chemistry, \"H2\" is the molecular formula for hydrogen gas. \"R\" could stand for a reaction or a specific process involving hydrogen. For example, in the context of fuel cells or hydrogen production, H2R could refer to a hydrogen reaction or a process related to hydrogen.\r\n\r\n2. **Honda H2R**: In the automotive world, the Honda H2R could potentially refer to a model or concept related to Honda that incorporates hydrogen (H2) technology, possibly a hydrogen fuel cell vehicle.\r\n\r\n3. **H2R in Other Contexts**: Without more specific information, \"H2R\" could also refer to a variety of other things, including a code, a model number, a chemical compound, or an acronym specific to a particular industry or technology.\r\n\r\nIf you could provide more context or details about what \"H2R\" refers to in your question, I\'d be able to offer a more precise and helpful response.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, 'h2r', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'h2r', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1776078757/user_2_test21/mhxbsqilnb3nebbj1csq.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-04-13 16:42:38', '2026-04-13 16:42:38'),
(2030, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike.  You\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sport bike produced by Yamaha Motor Co., Ltd. \n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha YZF-R1:\n1. **Engine**: The R1 is powered by a 998 cc, liquid-cooled, inline-four engine, producing around 200 horsepower.\n2. **Transmission**: The bike features a 6-speed constant mesh transmission with a multi-plate slipper clutch.\n3. **Chassis**: The R1 has a lightweight aluminum frame, with a swingarm and a 43mm inverted fork.\n4. **Brakes**: The bike is equipped with dual 320mm hydraulic disc brakes at the front and a 220mm hydraulic disc brake at the rear.\n5. **Electronics**: The R1 features advanced electronics, including traction control, wheelie control, and a quickshifter.\n6. **Design**: The bike has a sleek, aerodynamic design, with a distinctive fairing and a compact tail section.\n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a highly regarded sport bike, known for its exceptional performance, handling, and braking capabilities. It\'s a popular choice among track riders and enthusiasts who demand the highest level of performance from their motorcycle.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 16:42:00', '2026-04-13 16:43:32', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?model=flux&width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-04-13 16:43:32', '2026-04-13 16:43:32'),
(2031, 'dragon', 'The scene unfolds like a high-octane dream, where the Kawasaki Ninja H2R, aptly nicknamed the \"dragon\" for its fierce performance and sleek design, comes to life on a neon-drenched highway under the cover of night. The bike, a marvel of engineering and speed, is captured in a state of hyper-realistic motion, its contours and lines accentuated by the cinematic lighting that bathes the entire scene.\r\n\r\nAs the Ninja H2R speeds down the highway, the motion blur effect kicks in, creating a sense of dynamism and urgency. The bike seems to slice through the night air with ease, its headlights cutting through the darkness like sharp blades, illuminating the wet asphalt ahead. The neon lights of the city skyline reflect beautifully off the damp road, creating a dazzling display of color and light that seems almost otherworldly.\r\n\r\nThe city itself is a character in this scene, its skyline glowing with a vibrant intensity that matches the ferocity of the Ninja H2R. The reflections on the wet asphalt add an extra layer of depth and realism, making the viewer feel as though they are right there on the highway, the wind rushing past them as the bike thunders by.\r\n\r\nThe level of detail in this scene is ultra-detailed, with every element, from the bike\'s instrumentation to the texture of the asphalt, rendered in exquisite clarity. This is a scene that demands to be viewed in the highest possible resolution, preferably in 8K, to truly appreciate the nuances and complexities of the image.\r\n\r\nIn essence, this is not just a depiction of a bike racing down a highway; it\'s an immersive experience that combines speed, technology, and the allure of the night, setting the viewer\'s heart racing and their imagination soaring. The \"dragon\" is alive, and it\'s a sight to behold.', '[\"Facebook\"]', 'published', 1, '“A hyper-realistic Kawasaki Ninja H2R racing on a neon-lit highway at night, motion blur, glowing city skyline, reflections on wet asphalt, cinematic lighting, ultra-detailed, 8K”', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '“A hyper-realistic Kawasaki Ninja H2R racing on a neon-lit highway at night, motion blur, glowing city skyline, reflections on wet asphalt, cinematic lighting, ultra-detailed, 8K”', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/diapmjeoc/image/upload/v1776080168/user_2_test21/virirdj3hwpzcbwg7fqq.jpg', NULL, 'approved', NULL, '2026-04-13 17:06:09', '2026-04-13 17:06:09'),
(2032, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. Created by writer and editor Stan Lee, with the help of artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby, the character first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense\" #39 in March 1963.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nIron Man\'s secret identity is Tony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist who is also the CEO of Stark Industries, a cutting-edge technology company. After being kidnapped and held captive by a group of terrorists, Tony Stark is forced to create a powerful suit of armor to save his life. Using his intelligence and ingenuity, he builds the first Iron Man suit, which becomes the foundation of his superhero alter ego.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit is a highly advanced piece of technology that provides him with a range of powers and abilities, including:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight capability\n* Energy projection (repulsor rays)\n* Advanced sensors and scanning technology\n* Enhanced cognitive abilities (thanks to the suit\'s AI system, JARVIS)\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a complex and charismatic character known for his:\n\n* Intelligence and wit\n* Confidence and arrogance\n* Sarcastic sense of humor\n* Loyalty to his friends and allies\n* Struggles with personal demons and addiction\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been featured in several successful movies, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\nRobert Downey Jr. has played the role of Tony Stark/Iron Man in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) movies, bringing the character to life with his iconic performance.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has become an iconic superhero and cultural phenomenon, inspiring countless fans around the world with his blend of intelligence, humor, and heroism. The character has also spawned numerous comic book series, video games, and other media, cementing his place as one of the most beloved and enduring superheroes of all time.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 17:30:00', '2026-04-13 17:30:26', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-04-13 17:30:26', '2026-04-13 17:30:26'),
(2033, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and captivating visual representation of success, confidence, and determination. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that come together to create this cinematic moment:\n\n**Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a sleek suit, stands tall and confident on the basketball court. The contrast between his formal attire and the athletic setting creates an interesting juxtaposition, suggesting that this individual is not limited by traditional boundaries. He exudes an air of self-assurance, as if he\'s about to take on a new challenge and emerge victorious.\n\n**Setting:**\nThe basketball court, with its polished wooden floor and gleaming hoop, serves as a symbol of competition, skill, and strategy. The stadium lights behind the subject cast a dramatic glow, creating an atmosphere of high stakes and intense focus. The court itself becomes a metaphor for the businessman\'s professional arena, where he must navigate obstacles, make quick decisions, and outmaneuver opponents to achieve success.\n\n**Lighting:**\nThe dramatic lighting, with the stadium lights shining down on the subject, creates a sense of intensity and highlights the businessman\'s features. The shadows cast by the lights add depth and dimension to the image, emphasizing the subject\'s confident pose and resolute expression. The overall effect is one of high contrast, with the subject standing out against the darker background, much like a hero emerging from the shadows.\n\n** Props:**\nThe basketball in the subject\'s hand serves as a symbol of his ability to balance different aspects of his life. He\'s not just a suit-wearing executive; he\'s also a person with a passion for sports and a desire to stay active and competitive. The ball represents his ability to adapt, to think on his feet, and to stay focused under pressure.\n\n**Cinematic Style:**\nThe high-resolution, cinematic quality of the image adds a layer of sophistication and glamour to the scene. The attention to detail, the use of dramatic lighting, and the careful composition all contribute to a sense of grandeur and importance. The image feels like a still from a movie, a moment frozen in time, where the subject is about to embark on a journey of triumph and achievement.\n\n**Success Mindset:**\nThe overall atmosphere of the image conveys a sense of success and determination. The subject\'s confident pose, the dramatic lighting, and the symbolic setting all come together to create a powerful visual representation of a person who is driven to succeed. The image suggests that this individual is not afraid to take risks, to push himself to new heights, and to overcome any obstacles that stand in his way.\n\nIn summary, the image of the businessman on the basketball court, with the stadium lights shining down on him, is a potent symbol of success, confidence, and determination. It\'s a cinematic moment that captures the essence of a driven individual, ready to take on the world and achieve greatness.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-13 17:45:00', '2026-04-13 17:45:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-13 17:45:23', '2026-04-13 17:45:23');
