(2041, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated human imagination. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s world that can inspire and motivate you:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness and bravery, reminding us to stand up for ourselves and face challenges head-on.\n* **Protecting what matters**: Dragons are fiercely protective of their territories and loved ones, teaching us the importance of prioritizing and defending what\'s truly important.\n* **Embracing our true nature**: Dragons are unapologetically themselves, encouraging us to do the same and celebrate our unique strengths and qualities.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #CourageOverFear #ResilienceMatters #BeYourself #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #ProfessionalGrowth #PersonalDevelopment #InspirationalQuotes', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 10:35:00', '2026-04-14 10:35:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-04-14 10:35:19', '2026-04-14 10:35:19'),
(2042, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and the founder of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious drug trafficking organizations in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals of the 20th century.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and was raised by his mother, Hermilda, after his father abandoned the family. Escobar dropped out of school in the seventh grade and began working on the streets, selling stolen cars and other contraband.\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was rapidly expanding in Colombia. He quickly rose through the ranks and formed the Medellín cartel, which would become one of the most powerful and feared drug trafficking organizations in the world.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel dominated the global cocaine trade, smuggling massive quantities of the drug into the United States, Europe, and other countries. The cartel\'s success was fueled by Escobar\'s ruthless tactics, including murder, intimidation, and bribery.\n\nEscobar\'s organization was known for its sophisticated smuggling operations, which included the use of submarines, planes, and other vehicles to transport cocaine. The cartel also invested heavily in legitimate businesses, such as real estate, construction, and finance, to launder its profits.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power was marked by violence and terror. He was responsible for the murders of thousands of people, including politicians, police officers, judges, and journalists. His organization was also responsible for bombings, kidnappings, and other acts of terrorism.\n\nIn 1989, Escobar\'s cartel was responsible for the assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán, who had vowed to crack down on the cartel\'s activities. The murder sparked a wave of violence and retaliation, which would ultimately lead to Escobar\'s downfall.\n\n**Downfall and Death**\n\nIn the early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a massive manhunt for Escobar. The cartel\'s operations were disrupted, and many of its leaders were killed or captured.\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar\'s 44th birthday, he was tracked down by Colombian police and shot to death in a rooftop shootout in Medellín. His death marked the end of an era in the global cocaine trade and had a significant impact on the Colombian economy and society.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people. However, he is also seen as a folk hero by some in Colombia, who view him as a symbol of resistance against the government and the wealthy elite.\n\nEscobar\'s story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and documentaries, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos,\" which chronicles his rise and fall. His legacy continues to fascinate and horrify people around the world, serving as a reminder of the destructive power of organized crime and the importance of combating it.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 10:45:00', '2026-04-14 10:45:28', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-14 10:45:28', '2026-04-14 10:45:28'),
(2043, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and feared organized crime groups in the world. Here\'s a brief overview of his life and rise to infamy:\n\n**Early Life**\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and was raised by his mother, Hermilda, after his father abandoned them. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, which would later shape his worldview and motivations.\n\n**Rise to Power**\nEscobar\'s involvement in organized crime began in the 1970s, when he started smuggling goods and selling contraband. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, which was founded by Carlos Lehder and others. Escobar\'s charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness earned him the respect and fear of his peers, and he eventually became the leader of the cartel.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel dominated the global cocaine trade, smuggling tons of the drug into the United States, Europe, and other countries. The cartel\'s operations were characterized by extreme violence, including murders, kidnappings, and bombings. Escobar\'s organization was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including police officers, judges, politicians, and rival gang members.\n\n**Notorious Crimes**\nSome of Escobar\'s most notorious crimes include:\n\n1. The assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán in 1989.\n2. The bombing of Avianca Flight 203 in 1989, which killed 110 people.\n3. The murder of Colombian police chief Colonel Jaime Ramírez Gómez in 1989.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a luxurious private prison, which he had built himself. However, he escaped in 1992 and went into hiding. A massive manhunt ensued, involving Colombian and American law enforcement agencies. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He was a ruthless and cunning criminal who brought terror and destruction to countless people. However, he was also a charismatic figure who was revered by some in Colombia for his generosity and philanthropy. His story has been immortalized in numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n1. Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a massive hacienda.\n2. He was a prolific builder and invested heavily in infrastructure projects, including roads, schools, and housing developments.\n3. Escobar was a skilled politician and formed alliances with various Colombian politicians and businessmen.\n4. He was a devout Catholic and often sought to justify his actions as a form of revenge against the Colombian government and the wealthy elite.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and legacy serve as a cautionary tale about the dangers of organized crime, corruption, and the destructive power of violence and greed.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 10:50:00', '2026-04-14 10:50:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-14 10:50:21', '2026-04-14 10:50:21'),
(2044, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, crime boss, and founder of the Medellín Cartel. He is widely regarded as one of the most notorious and successful criminals in history.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and was raised by his mother, Hermilda, and his father, Abel. Escobar dropped out of school in the seventh grade and began his life of crime as a teenager, initially selling stolen cars and later becoming involved in the cocaine trade.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar became a key figure in the Colombian cocaine trade, which was then dominated by the Cali Cartel. He formed an alliance with other traffickers, including Carlos Lehder, and began to build his own empire. Escobar\'s rise to power was rapid, and by the early 1980s, he had become one of the most powerful and wealthy men in Colombia.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nEscobar\'s organization, the Medellín Cartel, was a vast and complex network of smugglers, distributors, and money launderers. At its peak, the cartel controlled up to 80% of the global cocaine market, and Escobar\'s personal wealth was estimated to be over $30 billion. The cartel\'s operations were characterized by violence, intimidation, and bribery, and Escobar was known for his ruthlessness and cunning.\n\n**Violence and Terrorism**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by brutal violence and terrorism. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including politicians, police officers, judges, and innocent civilians. The Medellín Cartel was also involved in bombings, kidnappings, and assassinations, and Escobar was known for his use of \"sicarios\" (hitmen) to eliminate his enemies.\n\n**Downfall**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, began to crack down on the Medellín Cartel. Escobar\'s empire began to crumble, and he was forced to go into hiding. In 1991, he surrendered to the authorities and was imprisoned, but he escaped from prison in 1992 and went on the run.\n\n**Death**\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. He was 44 years old. The circumstances of his death are still disputed, with some claiming that he was executed by the police.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who was responsible for untold suffering and violence. However, he is also seen as a symbol of resistance against the Colombian government and the United States, which were perceived as corrupt and oppressive. In recent years, Escobar\'s life has been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a mansion with a private airport.\n* He was a skilled soccer player and was known for his love of the sport.\n* Escobar was a devout Catholic and was known for his charitable donations to the poor.\n* He was a prolific builder and constructed many roads, schools, and hospitals in Medellín.\n* Escobar\'s brother, Roberto, is still alive and has written a book about his brother\'s life.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 10:53:00', '2026-04-14 10:53:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-14 10:53:19', '2026-04-14 10:53:19'),
(2045, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned to harness my inner strength and passion to achieve greatness. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your own life and business:\n\n* **Set bold goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s launching a new product or expanding your business, remember that the sky\'s the limit.\n* **Stay focused and determined**: With a clear vision and unwavering commitment, you can overcome any obstacle and achieve success.\n* **Embrace your unique strengths**: Just like my fiery breath, your unique skills and talents can be a powerful asset in your personal and professional life.\n* **Build a supportive community**: Surround yourself with people who believe in you and your vision, and don\'t be afraid to ask for help when you need it.\n* **Continuously learn and adapt**: Stay ahead of the curve by staying curious and open to new ideas and opportunities.\n\n#DragonsDen #BusinessTips #MotivationMonday #EntrepreneurLife #TrendingNow #InspirationalQuotes #SuccessStory #ProfessionalGrowth #FacebookBusiness #SmallBusinessTips #Entrepreneurship', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 11:18:00', '2026-04-14 11:18:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-04-14 11:18:24', '2026-04-14 11:18:24'),
(2046, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:57', 'A pen is a writing instrument used to apply ink to a surface, such as paper. It is a common tool used for writing, drawing, and signing documents. Pens come in various types, including:\n\n1. Ballpoint pens: These use a small metal ball to dispense ink onto the paper.\n2. Rollerball pens: These use a small metal ball to dispense liquid ink onto the paper.\n3. Fountain pens: These use a nib to deliver ink onto the paper.\n4. Gel pens: These use a water-based ink that is suspended in a gel-like substance.\n5. Fineliners: These are small, precise pens used for drawing and writing.\n\nPens can be made from a variety of materials, such as plastic, metal, or wood. They can also be refillable or disposable.\n\nSome interesting facts about pens include:\n\n* The first pen was made from a reed, with the ink being made from soot and gum.\n* The word \"pen\" comes from the Latin word \"penna,\" meaning feather.\n* The first ballpoint pen was invented in the 1930s by a Hungarian journalist named László Bíró.\n* Pens can be used for a variety of purposes, including writing, drawing, and even as a tool for medical procedures.\n\nOverall, pens are a versatile and essential tool used by people all over the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 11:57:00', '2026-04-14 11:57:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 16, '2026-04-14 11:57:15', '2026-04-14 11:57:15'),
(2047, 'Auto Post for instagram at 11:59', 'A \"pen packet\" is an informal term that refers to a small, usually sealed, package or envelope that contains a pen or a set of pens, often with a specific design or branding. These packets are commonly used for promotional or marketing purposes, such as:\n\n1. Free giveaways: Companies may distribute pen packets as free samples or promotional items at events, conferences, or trade shows.\n2. Product launches: New pen products may be packaged in special packets to create a unique unboxing experience.\n3. Branding: Pen packets can be customized with a company\'s logo, name, or message to promote their brand.\n4. Collectibles: Some pen enthusiasts collect pen packets, especially those with limited-edition designs or unique packaging.\n\nPen packets can be made of various materials, such as paper, plastic, or cardboard, and may include additional items like a pen case, ink refills, or a instruction manual.', '[\"instagram\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 11:59:00', '2026-04-14 11:59:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen_Packet?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 17, '2026-04-14 11:59:17', '2026-04-14 11:59:17'),
(2048, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:59', 'A \"pen packet\" is an informal term that refers to a small, usually sealed, package or envelope that contains a pen or a set of pens, often with a specific design or branding. These packets are commonly used for promotional or marketing purposes, such as:\n\n1. Free giveaways: Companies may distribute pen packets as free samples or promotional items at events, conferences, or trade shows.\n2. Product launches: New pen products may be packaged in special packets to create a unique unboxing experience.\n3. Branding: Pen packets can be customized with a company\'s logo, name, or message to promote their brand.\n4. Collectibles: Some pen enthusiasts collect pen packets, especially those with limited-edition designs or unique packaging.\n\nPen packets can be made of various materials, such as paper, plastic, or cardboard, and may include additional items like a pen case, ink refills, or a instruction manual.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 11:59:00', '2026-04-14 11:59:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen_Packet?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 17, '2026-04-14 11:59:17', '2026-04-14 11:59:17'),
(2049, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:05', 'The bicycle is a popular mode of transportation and recreation that has been around for over two centuries. It\'s a two-wheeled, human-powered vehicle that offers numerous benefits, including:\n\n1. **Environmental benefits**: Bicycles are an eco-friendly way to travel, producing no emissions or pollution.\n2. **Health benefits**: Cycling is a great way to improve cardiovascular health, build muscle, and boost mental well-being.\n3. **Cost-effective**: Bicycles are a relatively inexpensive mode of transportation, with minimal maintenance and no fuel costs.\n4. **Convenience**: Bicycles can be easily stored and transported, making them a great option for short trips and commutes.\n5. **Fun and recreation**: Cycling can be a fun and enjoyable activity, whether you\'re riding on trails, roads, or just cruising around your neighborhood.\n\nThere are many types of bicycles, including:\n\n1. **Road bikes**: Designed for speed and efficiency on paved roads.\n2. **Mountain bikes**: Built for off-road adventures, with sturdy frames and suspension systems.\n3. **Hybrid bikes**: A combination of road and mountain bikes, offering a comfortable ride on various terrain.\n4. **Commuter bikes**: Practical and versatile, designed for daily commutes and urban riding.\n5. **Electric bikes**: Powered by electric motors, offering an easier and more convenient ride.\n\nWhether you\'re a seasoned cyclist or just starting out, there\'s a bicycle out there for you. So why not give cycling a try and experience the many benefits it has to offer?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 12:05:00', '2026-04-14 12:05:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 18, '2026-04-14 12:05:15', '2026-04-14 12:05:15'),
(2050, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:08', '**Welcome to Dragon\'s Den**\n\nAs a business owner and creator, I\'d like to share with you what makes my brand unique and relatable. Here are a few key points:\n\n* **Quality over quantity**: We prioritize quality in every aspect of our business, from product development to customer service.\n* **Innovative solutions**: Our team is dedicated to finding innovative solutions to real-world problems, making our products and services stand out from the competition.\n* **Customer-centric approach**: We put our customers at the forefront of everything we do, ensuring that their needs and concerns are always addressed.\n* **Sustainability**: We\'re committed to reducing our environmental footprint and promoting sustainable practices throughout our operations.\n* **Community engagement**: We believe in giving back to our community and supporting local initiatives that make a positive impact.\n\nJoin the conversation and stay up-to-date with our latest news and updates. #Trending #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #Sustainability #CustomerFirst #CommunitySupport #DragonDen #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalServices', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 12:08:00', '2026-04-14 12:08:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 19, '2026-04-14 12:08:18', '2026-04-14 12:08:18'),
(2051, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:34', 'A ball can refer to many things, such as:\n\n1. A round or spherical object, often used in sports like basketball, soccer, or tennis.\n2. A formal dance or gathering, like a ballroom dance.\n3. A unit of measurement, as in a ball of yarn or twine.\n\nWhich type of ball are you thinking of, or would you like more information on a specific topic related to balls?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 12:34:00', '2026-04-14 12:34:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 20, '2026-04-14 12:34:12', '2026-04-14 12:34:12'),
(2052, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'When it comes to party wear for men, there are many options to choose from, depending on the occasion, personal style, and dress code. Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-tailored suit is a classic choice for formal parties. You can opt for a black, navy, or gray suit, and pair it with a crisp white shirt, a patterned tie, and dress shoes.\n2. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to a party outfit. You can wear it with a dress shirt, trousers, and dress shoes for a stylish look.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt is a versatile option for parties. You can wear it with trousers, jeans, or even shorts, depending on the occasion.\n4. **Tuxedos**: A tuxedo is a great option for formal parties, such as black-tie events or weddings. It typically consists of a black jacket, trousers, and a white dress shirt.\n5. **Cocktail Attire**: For less formal parties, you can opt for cocktail attire, which includes a dress shirt, trousers, and a blazer or sports coat.\n6. **Jeans and a Nice Top**: For more casual parties, you can wear a pair of dark wash jeans with a nice top, such as a dress shirt or a polo shirt.\n7. **Accessories**: Don\'t forget to add some accessories to complete your party look. These can include a watch, a pocket square, a tie bar, or a pair of cufflinks.\n\nSome popular party wear styles for men include:\n\n1. **Minimalist Chic**: A simple, elegant look that features a plain white shirt, black trousers, and a black blazer.\n2. **Vintage Glam**: A stylish look that features a patterned shirt, trousers, and a blazer, with a touch of vintage flair.\n3. **Streetwear**: A casual, edgy look that features a graphic t-shirt, jeans, and sneakers.\n4. **Luxury**: A high-end look that features a designer suit, a crisp white shirt, and a pair of luxury shoes.\n\nSome popular party wear colors for men include:\n\n1. **Black**: A classic choice for formal parties.\n2. **Navy**: A versatile color that works well for both formal and casual parties.\n3. **Gray**: A stylish color that can add a touch of sophistication to a party outfit.\n4. **White**: A crisp, clean color that works well for summer parties or outdoor events.\n5. **Burgundy**: A rich, elegant color that can add a touch of luxury to a party outfit.\n\nSome popular party wear fabrics for men include:\n\n1. **Wool**: A classic choice for formal parties, wool is a warm, durable fabric that works well for suits and blazers.\n2. **Cotton**: A breathable, versatile fabric that works well for dress shirts, trousers, and casual party wear.\n3. **Linen**: A lightweight, stylish fabric that works well for summer parties or outdoor events.\n4. **Silk**: A luxurious fabric that can add a touch of elegance to a party outfit.\n5. **Velvet**: A rich, textured fabric that can add a touch of sophistication to a party outfit.\n\nRemember, the key to pulling off a great party look is to feel confident and comfortable in what you\'re wearing. Experiment with different styles, colors, and fabrics to find what works best for you.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 12:40:00', '2026-04-14 12:40:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-04-14 12:40:21', '2026-04-14 12:40:21'),
(2053, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:45', 'Shoes.  There are many types of shoes, including:\n\n1. **Sneakers**: casual, athletic shoes for everyday wear or sports.\n2. **Boots**: ankle-high or higher shoes, often worn for fashion or in cold weather.\n3. **Sandals**: open-toe shoes for warm weather.\n4. **Loafers**: slip-on shoes, often worn for business or formal events.\n5. **High heels**: shoes with elevated heels, often worn for formal events or special occasions.\n6. **Flats**: shoes with little to no heel, often worn for comfort or casual events.\n7. **Dress shoes**: formal shoes, often worn with suits or dresses.\n8. **Hiking boots**: sturdy shoes for outdoor activities like hiking or backpacking.\n9. **Running shoes**: specialized shoes for running or other high-impact activities.\n10. **Dance shoes**: shoes designed for specific dance styles, such as ballet or ballroom dance.\n\nShoes can be made from a variety of materials, including:\n\n* Leather\n* Synthetic materials (e.g., polyester, nylon)\n* Rubber\n* Fabric (e.g., canvas, mesh)\n\nSome popular shoe brands include:\n\n* Nike\n* Adidas\n* Converse\n* Vans\n* Reebok\n* New Balance\n\nWhat\'s your favorite type of shoe or brand?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 12:45:00', '2026-04-14 12:45:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Shoes?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 21, '2026-04-14 12:45:20', '2026-04-14 12:45:20'),
(2054, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn for formal occasions, such as business meetings, job interviews, weddings, and other special events. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts typically have a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are usually made from high-quality cotton, linen, or silk fabrics.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely, with a slim fit through the body and sleeves.\n5. **Buttons**: Formal shirts often have mother-of-pearl or plastic buttons.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic Fit**: A traditional fit with a relaxed silhouette.\n2. **Slim Fit**: A modern fit with a slimmer silhouette.\n3. **Tailored Fit**: A fitted silhouette with a tapered waist.\n4. **Dress Shirt**: A formal shirt with a point collar and French cuffs.\n5. **Business Shirt**: A formal shirt with a spread collar and button cuffs.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White**: A classic choice for formal shirts.\n2. **Light Blue**: A popular choice for business and formal events.\n3. **Pastel Colors**: Soft pink, baby blue, and other pastel colors are suitable for formal events.\n4. **Stripes**: Thin stripes are a classic pattern for formal shirts.\n5. **Checks**: Small checks are suitable for formal events.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Tommy Hilfiger**: Known for their classic American style.\n2. **Calvin Klein**: Offers a range of modern and stylish formal shirts.\n3. **Armani**: Luxury Italian brand offering high-quality formal shirts.\n4. **Hugo Boss**: German brand offering stylish and sophisticated formal shirts.\n5. ** Brooks Brothers**: Classic American brand offering traditional formal shirts.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Choose a fit that suits your body type**.\n2. **Select a color and pattern that complements your suit and tie**.\n3. **Consider the occasion and dress code**.\n4. **Pay attention to the quality of the fabric and construction**.\n5. **Iron your shirt before wearing to ensure a crisp and polished look**.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 12:56:00', '2026-04-14 12:56:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-14 12:56:18', '2026-04-14 12:56:18'),
(2055, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**Embracing Our Inner Fire: 5 Key Takeaways**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned to harness my passion and energy to drive success. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define your objectives and prioritize your tasks to achieve them.\n* **Stay focused**: Minimize distractions and maintain a laser-like focus on your targets.\n* **Be adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change, and stay flexible in the face of uncertainty.\n* **Cultivate resilience**: Develop a growth mindset and learn from your setbacks to emerge stronger.\n* **Embrace your uniqueness**: Celebrate what sets you apart and use it to your advantage.\n\n#DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #ProductivityHacks #GoalSetting #Focus #Adaptability #Resilience #SelfImprovement #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #EntrepreneurMindset #SuccessStory #InspirationalQuotes #FacebookMotivation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 13:03:00', '2026-04-14 13:03:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-04-14 13:03:13', '2026-04-14 13:03:13'),
(2056, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:51', 'It seems like you may have entered a sequence of random characters. Could you please provide more context or clarify what you are trying to communicate? I\'ll do my best to help.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 13:51:00', '2026-04-14 13:51:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/fgfg?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 15, '2026-04-14 13:51:16', '2026-04-14 13:51:16'),
(2057, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Unleashing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Ambitious Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define your vision and objectives to stay focused on what you want to achieve.\n* **Be adaptable**: Stay flexible and open to change, just like a dragon navigating through different landscapes.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your passion and vision.\n* **Take calculated risks**: Weigh the pros and cons, and be willing to take bold steps to achieve your goals.\n* **Continuously learn and improve**: Stay ahead of the curve by learning from your mistakes and seeking knowledge and expertise.\n\n#Entrepreneurship #BusinessTips #DragonMentality #SuccessMindset #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalAdvice #MotivationMonday #BusinessInspiration #DragonFire', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 14:00:00', '2026-04-14 14:00:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-14 14:00:22', '2026-04-14 14:00:22'),
(2058, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:36', 'Wood collection can refer to several things, including:\n\n1. **Firewood collection**: Gathering firewood for use as fuel for heating, cooking, or other purposes.\n2. **Woodworking collection**: A collection of wood pieces, such as lumber, veneer, or turned wood objects, used for woodworking projects.\n3. **Art collection**: A collection of wooden art pieces, such as sculptures, carvings, or woodblock prints.\n4. **Furniture collection**: A collection of wooden furniture pieces, such as chairs, tables, or cabinets.\n5. **Wood specimen collection**: A collection of wood samples, often used for educational or research purposes, to showcase different types of wood and their characteristics.\n\nIf you\'re interested in starting a wood collection, here are some tips:\n\n1. **Identify your purpose**: Determine what you want to use your wood collection for, whether it\'s for crafting, furniture making, or simply for decorative purposes.\n2. **Choose the right woods**: Select woods that are suitable for your intended use, considering factors such as durability, workability, and aesthetics.\n3. **Store your collection properly**: Keep your wood collection in a dry, well-ventilated area, protected from pests and moisture.\n4. **Organize your collection**: Use a system to categorize and label your wood pieces, making it easier to find what you need when you need it.\n5. **Consider sustainability**: When collecting wood, consider the environmental impact and opt for sustainably sourced woods whenever possible.\n\nSome popular types of wood for collection include:\n\n1. **Hardwoods**: Oak, maple, cherry, and walnut are popular choices for furniture making and woodworking.\n2. **Softwoods**: Pine, spruce, and fir are often used for construction and crafting.\n3. **Exotic woods**: Woods like ebony, rosewood, and mahogany are prized for their unique beauty and durability.\n4. **Reclaimed woods**: Salvaged woods from old buildings or trees can add character and history to your collection.\n\nRemember to always follow local regulations and best practices when collecting wood, and to respect the environment and the trees that provide this valuable resource.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 14:36:00', '2026-04-14 14:36:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/table?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 11, '2026-04-14 14:36:15', '2026-04-14 14:36:15'),
(2059, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and resilience. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your own life and business:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on a treasure hoard, you should define your objectives and work towards achieving them.\n* **Stay focused**: A dragon\'s attention is unwavering, and yours should be too. Minimize distractions and stay committed to your vision.\n* **Be adaptable**: Dragons are known for their ability to navigate through treacherous terrain. Be prepared to pivot and adjust your strategy as needed.\n* **Protect your assets**: A dragon guards its treasure with fierce dedication. Safeguard your resources, whether they\'re financial, emotional, or physical.\n* **Roar with confidence**: A dragon\'s roar is a powerful expression of self-assurance. Believe in yourself and your abilities, and don\'t be afraid to showcase them.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #BusinessLessons #Trending #Entrepreneurship #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #Facebook #DragonPower #FireWithin #GoalSetting #Focus #Adaptability #AssetProtection #ConfidenceIsKey', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 14:37:00', '2026-04-14 14:37:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-14 14:37:15', '2026-04-14 14:37:15');
