(2060, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**\"Breathing Fire into Your Business: Lessons from a Dragon\"**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success and growth. Here are some key takeaways to help you scale your business:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s expanding your customer base or launching a new product, set your sights on the top.\n* **Be adaptable**: The business landscape is constantly changing, so be prepared to pivot and adjust your strategy as needed.\n* **Invest in your team**: A strong team is the backbone of any successful business. Invest in their development and provide them with the tools they need to succeed.\n* **Stay focused**: With so many distractions and competing priorities, it\'s easy to lose sight of your goals. Stay laser-focused on what matters most and avoid getting sidetracked.\n* **Continuously learn and improve**: The moment you stop learning is the moment you start falling behind. Stay up-to-date with the latest trends and best practices in your industry.\n\n#BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #SuccessMindset #Leadership #Innovation #GrowthHacking #Trending #FacebookForBusiness #SmallBusinessOwner #StartupLife #MotivationMonday #ProductivityHacks #BusinessGrowth #CareerDevelopment #ProfessionalDevelopment #DragonApproved', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 14:38:00', '2026-04-14 14:38:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-14 14:38:18', '2026-04-14 14:38:18'),
(2061, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', 'As a dragon, I\'d like to share some relatable points about being a mythical creature in today\'s world. Here\'s a post for Facebook:\n\n\"Being a dragon in the modern age can be challenging, but also incredibly rewarding. Here are a few things I\'ve learned along the way:\n\n* Embracing my true nature and not being afraid to show my scales\n* Finding creative ways to store my treasure hoard without taking up too much space\n* Learning to control my fire-breathing skills to avoid any accidental damage\n* Making friends with other mythical creatures who understand my unique perspective\n* Staying up-to-date with the latest dragon fashion trends ( scales, wings, and claws, oh my!)\n\n#DragonsOfFacebook #MythicalCreaturesUnite #ScaleSquad #FireBreathingFashionista #TreasureHoarder #DragonLife #TrendingNow #MythicalMonday #FantasyFrenzy #LegendaryCreatures\"\n\nNote: The hashtags used are a mix of popular and trending ones, as well as some niche-specific tags to reach the target audience of dragon enthusiasts and fans of mythical creatures.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 14:39:00', '2026-04-14 14:39:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-14 14:39:12', '2026-04-14 14:39:12'),
(2062, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about resilience, adaptability, and passion. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your personal and professional life:\n\n* **Set boundaries**: Just like I protect my treasure, you should prioritize your time and energy to focus on what\'s truly important.\n* **Be fearless**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things - it\'s often the best way to learn and grow.\n* **Stay curious**: Continuously seek out new knowledge and experiences to stay ahead of the curve.\n* **Prioritize self-care**: Take care of your physical and mental health, just like I take care of my scales and wings.\n\n#DragonWisdom #MotivationMonday #ProductivityHacks #MentalHealthMatters #SelfCareSunday #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #PersonalGrowth #Inspiration', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 15:10:00', '2026-04-14 15:10:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-04-14 15:10:14', '2026-04-14 15:10:14'),
(2063, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', 'As a dragon entrepreneur, I\'d like to share with you what makes my business roar with success. Here are the key points:\n\n* **Innovative Ideas**: We breathe fire into our projects, bringing unique solutions to the market.\n* **Teamwork**: Our scales shine brighter when we work together, fostering a collaborative environment.\n* **Adaptability**: Like a dragon navigating through caves, we\'re agile and responsive to changing circumstances.\n* **Customer Focus**: Our treasure is our customers\' satisfaction, and we strive to deliver exceptional service.\n\nJoin the conversation and let\'s soar to new heights together. #DragonsInBusiness #InnovationNation #TeamworkMakesTheDreamWork #AdaptAndThrive #CustomerFirst #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #EntrepreneurLife #BusinessSuccess #DragonSizedAmbitions', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 15:14:00', '2026-04-14 15:14:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-04-14 15:14:21', '2026-04-14 15:14:21'),
(2064, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Empowering Your Business with Dragon\'s Insights**\n\nAs a business owner, staying ahead of the curve is crucial. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Innovate and Adapt**: Stay up-to-date with the latest trends and technologies to stay competitive.\n* **Build a Strong Team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision.\n* **Focus on Customer Satisfaction**: Prioritize your customers\' needs and strive to exceed their expectations.\n* **Continuously Learn and Improve**: Stay informed and educated on the latest industry developments and best practices.\n\nBy following these guidelines, you\'ll be well on your way to achieving success and growth in your business.\n\n#BusinessGrowth #Innovation #Teamwork #CustomerSatisfaction #ContinuousLearning #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #SuccessTips #TrendingNow #BusinessInspiration #MotivationMonday #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #SmallBusinessOwner #StartupLife #BusinessOwner #EntrepreneurLife #TrendingTopics #BusinessTrends #IndustryInsights #ProfessionalGrowth #CareerDevelopment #BusinessSuccess #FacebookForBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 15:24:00', '2026-04-14 15:24:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-04-14 15:24:19', '2026-04-14 15:24:19'),
(2065, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a large language model, I don\'t have the capability to directly create images. But I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends, and you can use your imagination to visualize it.\n\n**Image Description:**\n\nThe image is a high-resolution photograph taken in a warm and cozy outdoor setting. The scene is set in a lush green park on a sunny afternoon, with a few trees providing shade and a gentle breeze rustling the leaves.\n\nIn the center of the image, a man in his mid-30s is sitting on a wooden bench, surrounded by his friends. He\'s wearing a casual outfit, consisting of a light blue shirt, dark blue jeans, and a pair of brown sneakers. His hair is messy and styled in a relaxed manner, and he has a friendly smile on his face.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress. She\'s laughing and chatting with the man, and her eyes are sparkling with amusement. On his right is another man, who\'s wearing a black t-shirt and sunglasses. He\'s holding a guitar and strumming a few chords, adding to the relaxed atmosphere of the scene.\n\nIn the background, there are a few people walking or jogging in the park, but they\'re not the focus of the image. The attention is on the group of friends, who are enjoying each other\'s company and having a great time.\n\nThe image is captured in a warm and natural light, with the sun casting a gentle glow over the scene. The colors are vivid and rich, with the green grass and trees providing a beautiful contrast to the blues and yellows of the clothing.\n\nThe overall mood of the image is one of relaxation and camaraderie, capturing the joy and simplicity of spending time with friends on a beautiful day.\n\n**Technical Details:**\n\n* Image resolution: 4000 x 3000 pixels\n* Aspect ratio: 4:3\n* Color profile: Adobe RGB\n* Camera settings: f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 100\n* Lens: 50mm f/1.4\n\nI hope this description helps you visualize