(2066, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'re describing is a visually stunning and atmospheric depiction of a girl walking in the rain, surrounded by the vibrant glow of neon lights. The details you\'ve provided paint a picture of a cinematic and fashionable moment, captured through the lens of aesthetic photography. Let\'s break down the elements that make this scene so captivating:\n\n1. **Transparent Umbrella**: The use of a transparent umbrella is a clever choice, as it allows the viewer to see the girl\'s face and outfit while still conveying the idea that she\'s walking in the rain. The transparency also adds a sense of fragility and elegance to the scene.\n\n2. **Light Rain**: The light rain creates a misty atmosphere, which is perfect for capturing soft, blurred lights and reflections on the wet street. This weather condition adds a layer of depth and mood to the photograph.\n\n3. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: The neon reflections on the wet street are a key element in creating the aesthetic and cinematic mood of the photograph. The vibrant colors and soft, blurred quality of the reflections add a sense of dynamism and energy to the scene.\n\n4. **Aesthetic Photography**: The choice of aesthetic photography as the style for this scene is well-suited, as it emphasizes the visual appeal and mood of the moment. Aesthetic photography often focuses on creating a visually pleasing image, which in this case, is achieved through the combination of the girl\'s fashionable outfit, the transparent umbrella, and the neon reflections.\n\n5. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: The soft bokeh lights in the background add a sense of depth and dimension to the photograph. Bokeh, which refers to the aesthetic quality of the blur produced in the out-of-focus parts of an image, can create a dreamy or romantic atmosphere, fitting well with the cinematic mood of the scene.\n\n6. **Fashionable Outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is a crucial element in creating a stylish and modern look. The choice of clothing and accessories can reveal character and add to the overall aesthetic of the photograph, making the scene feel more polished and refined.\n\n7. **Cinematic Mood**: The cinematic mood of the photograph is achieved through the combination of the atmospheric lighting, the fashionable outfit, and the dramatic setting of walking in the rain. This mood evokes a sense of drama and romance, suggesting that the moment captured is significant or pivotal in some way.\n\n8. **High-Detail**: The emphasis on high-detail in the photograph suggests that the image is sharply focused and rich in texture and color. This level of detail allows the viewer to appreciate the intricate elements of the scene, from the girl\'s outfit to the reflections on the street, enhancing the overall immersive quality of the image.\n\nIn summary, the scene of a girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain, surrounded by neon reflections on a wet street, is a masterpiece of aesthetic photography. It combines elements of fashion, cinematography, and atmospheric lighting to create a visually stunning and highly detailed image that evokes a strong cinematic mood.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 16:11:00', '2026-04-14 16:11:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-04-14 16:11:18', '2026-04-14 16:11:18'),
(2067, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football is a popular sport played by two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal. It is also known as soccer in some countries, particularly in the United States and Canada, to distinguish it from other sports with similar names, such as American football.\n\nThere are several key aspects of football:\n\n1. **The Pitch**: The game is played on a rectangular field with goals at each end. The pitch is typically made of grass or artificial turf.\n2. **The Ball**: The ball used in football is made of leather or synthetic materials and is spherical in shape.\n3. **The Players**: Each team has 11 players, including a goalkeeper, defenders, midfielders, and forwards.\n4. **The Objective**: The objective of the game is to score more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n5. **Gameplay**: The game is divided into two 45-minute halves, with a 15-minute break in between. Players can use any part of their body except their hands and arms to control and move the ball.\n\nSome common positions in football include:\n\n1. **Goalkeeper (GK)**: The player responsible for preventing the ball from entering the goal.\n2. **Defenders (DF)**: The players who help the goalkeeper by defending the goal and blocking opponents\' attacks.\n3. **Midfielders (MF)**: The players who support both the defense and the attack by maintaining possession of the ball and creating scoring opportunities.\n4. **Forwards (FW)**: The players who score goals by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nSome popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most widely viewed and followed sporting event in the world, held every four years.\n2. **UEFA Champions League**: An annual club competition featuring the best teams from Europe.\n3. **English Premier League**: A professional league in England, considered one of the most competitive and popular leagues in the world.\n\nFootball is a global sport, played and enjoyed by millions of people around the world. It has a rich history, with various forms of the game being played for centuries. Today, it is a multi-billion dollar industry, with top players and teams generating significant revenue from sponsorships, advertising, and merchandise sales.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 16:33:00', '2026-04-14 16:33:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-04-14 16:33:17', '2026-04-14 16:33:17'),
(2068, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'It looks like you\'re just testing. Is there something I can help you with or would you like to start a conversation?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 16:33:00', '2026-04-14 16:33:18', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Tester?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 48, '2026-04-14 16:33:18', '2026-04-14 16:33:18'),
(2069, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The Yamaha R1 bike. The Yamaha YZF-R1 is a super sport motorcycle manufactured by Yamaha Motor Company since 1998. It is powered by a 998cc inline-four engine, producing 200 horsepower. The R1 is known for its exceptional handling, braking, and acceleration, making it a popular choice among motorcycle enthusiasts and professional racers.\n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha R1:\n\n* Engine: 998cc inline-four\n* Power: 200 horsepower\n* Torque: 82.6 lb-ft\n* Transmission: 6-speed\n* Dry weight: 425 pounds\n* Seat height: 32.3 inches\n* Fuel capacity: 4.5 gallons\n\nThe Yamaha R1 has undergone several updates and redesigns over the years, with the latest models featuring advanced technology such as:\n\n* Traction control\n* ABS brakes\n* Electronic throttle control\n* Quickshifter\n* Ride-by-wire throttle\n\nThe R1 is widely used in various forms of motorcycle racing, including the Superbike World Championship and the MotoAmerica series. It\'s also a popular choice among track day enthusiasts and street riders who value its exceptional performance and handling.\n\nDo you have any specific questions about the Yamaha R1 or would you like to know more about its features and capabilities?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 16:42:00', '2026-04-14 16:42:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-04-14 16:42:17', '2026-04-14 16:42:17'),
(2070, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:15', '**Unlocking the Power of Dragon\'s Breath: 5 Key Takeaways**\n\nAs a symbol of strength and resilience, the dragon has long been a source of inspiration for businesses and individuals alike. Here are 5 key points to consider when harnessing the power of the dragon:\n\n* **Embracing Change**: Just like the dragon\'s ability to adapt to new environments, businesses must be willing to evolve and innovate to stay ahead of the curve.\n* **Building Resilience**: The dragon\'s scales represent protection and resilience - essential qualities for any business looking to withstand challenges and thrive in a competitive market.\n* **Fostering Creativity**: The dragon\'s fiery breath can be seen as a symbol of creativity and passion - essential elements for driving innovation and growth.\n* **Cultivating Courage**: The dragon\'s fearless nature is a reminder that businesses must be willing to take calculated risks to achieve success.\n* **Embodying Wisdom**: The dragon\'s ancient wisdom can be applied to business decision-making, emphasizing the importance of experience, intuition, and strategic thinking.\n\n#DragonInspiration #BusinessMotivation #TrendingNow #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #Resilience #Creativity #Courage #WisdomInBusiness #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #BusinessGrowth #SuccessTips #MotivationalQuotes #InspirationForBusiness #DragonBreath #FireUpYourBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 17:15:00', '2026-04-14 17:15:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 6, '2026-04-14 17:15:16', '2026-04-14 17:15:16'),
(2071, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby. He first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense #39\" in March 1963.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is the alter ego of Iron Man. After being kidnapped and held captive by a group of terrorists, Stark is forced to create a powerful suit of armor to save his life. Using his genius-level intellect and resources, he builds the first Iron Man suit, which becomes the foundation for his future superhero endeavors.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit provides him with a range of powers and abilities, including:\n\n1. **Superhuman Strength**: The suit\'s advanced technology and robotics give Iron Man enhanced strength, allowing him to lift and manipulate heavy objects.\n2. **Flight**: The suit is equipped with repulsor technology, which enables Iron Man to fly and propel himself at high speeds.\n3. **Energy Projection**: The suit can project energy blasts from its palms, which can be used to attack enemies or blast through obstacles.\n4. **Advanced Sensors and Tracking**: The suit is equipped with advanced sensors and tracking systems, allowing Iron Man to detect and track targets.\n5. **Genius-Level Intellect**: Tony Stark\'s intelligence and strategic thinking make him a formidable opponent, both in and out of the suit.\n\n**Movies and TV Shows:**\nIron Man has been featured in numerous movies and TV shows, including:\n\n1. **Iron Man (2008)**: The first movie in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man.\n2. **The Avengers (2012)**: Iron Man joins a team of superheroes to save the world from an alien invasion.\n3. **Iron Man 3 (2013)**: The third solo Iron Man movie, which explores Tony Stark\'s personal struggles and the rise of the Mandarin.\n4. **Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)**: Iron Man and the Avengers face off against the artificial intelligence Ultron.\n5. **Captain America: Civil War (2016)**: Iron Man and Captain America clash over the Sokovia Accords, leading to a rift in the Avengers team.\n6. **Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)**: Iron Man serves as a mentor to Peter Parker/Spider-Man.\n7. **Avengers: Infinity War (2018)**: Iron Man and the Avengers face off against Thanos and his minions.\n8. **Avengers: Endgame (2019)**: The final movie in the MCU\'s Infinity Saga, which sees Iron Man make the ultimate sacrifice to save the world.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has become an iconic character in popular culture, inspiring countless fans around the world. His legacy extends beyond the comic books and movies, with Tony Stark\'s entrepreneurial spirit and innovative ideas inspiring real-world technological advancements.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 17:30:00', '2026-04-14 17:30:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-04-14 17:30:17', '2026-04-14 17:30:17'),
(2072, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**The Businessman:** The subject of the image is a professional businessman, dressed in a sleek, tailored suit that exudes confidence and authority. His attire is immaculate, with a crisp white shirt, a slim tie, and a fitted blazer that accentuates his broad shoulders. His hair is styled perfectly, and his eyes gleam with a sense of ambition and drive.\n\n**The Basketball Court:** The setting for this image is a basketball court, with the businessman standing confidently at its center. The court is empty, except for the solitary figure of the businessman, who seems to be savoring the moment. The hardwood floor stretches out behind him, a vast expanse of polished wood that seems to glow in the light of the stadium.\n\n**The Ball:** The businessman holds a basketball in his hand, its leather surface glowing with a soft, golden light. The ball seems to be an extension of his body, a symbol of his power and control. His fingers wrap around it tightly, as if he\'s about to launch it into a powerful shot.\n\n**The Stadium Lights:** The stadium lights behind the businessman cast a dramatic glow, illuminating the scene with a sense of high-stakes drama. The lights are intense and focused, casting deep shadows across the court and accentuating the businessman\'s features. The overall effect is one of high-energy tension, as if the businessman is about to take on the world.\n\n**Dramatic Lighting:** The lighting in the image is highly dramatic, with deep shadows and bold highlights that create a sense of depth and dimensionality. The businessman\'s face is illuminated by a soft, golden light, while the shadows cast by the stadium lights add a sense of mystery and intrigue to the scene.\n\n**Success Mindset:** The overall mood of the image is one of unbridled confidence and success. The businessman exudes a sense of self-assurance, as if he\'s already achieved his goals and is now ready to take on the next challenge. His posture is relaxed yet assertive, conveying a sense of quiet power and authority.\n\n**High-Resolution Cinematic Style:** The image is rendered in a high-resolution, cinematic style, with crisp lines, vibrant colors, and a sense of depth and dimensionality that draws the viewer in. The overall effect is one of high-end production values, as if the image has been crafted by a team of expert cinematographers and visual effects artists.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. It\'s an image that would be perfect for a business or motivational context, inspiring viewers to strive for greatness and achieve their goals.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-14 17:45:00', '2026-04-14 17:45:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-14 17:45:19', '2026-04-14 17:45:19'),
(2073, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'The image you\'ve described is one of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that come together to create this powerful visual:\n\n1. **The Professional Businessman**: Dressed in a crisp, well-fitted suit, the businessman exudes an air of sophistication and authority. The suit is a symbol of professionalism, power, and respect, immediately conveying that this individual is a high-achiever.\n\n2. **Standing Confidently on a Basketball Court**: The basketball court, often associated with competition, strategy, and teamwork, serves as an unconventional yet intriguing backdrop for a businessman. The confidence with which he stands on the court suggests that he is not out of place, even in an environment typically dominated by athletes. This juxtaposition implies that his success mindset and confidence are not limited to the boardroom but can be applied to any challenge.\n\n3. **With a Ball in His Hand**: Holding a basketball, the businessman takes on a symbolic role that transcends his professional attire. The ball represents control, skill, and the ability to navigate complex situations. It\'s a metaphor for the challenges and opportunities he faces in the business world, suggesting that he is ready to take on and conquer them with the same focus and determination an athlete would approach a game.\n\n4. **Stadium Lights Behind Him**: The dramatic lighting provided by the stadium lights elevates the scene, casting a heroic glow around the businessman. This lighting choice is reminiscent of major sports events, implying that the stakes are high and the moment is significant. It adds an layer of drama and importance to the image, highlighting the businessman\'s stature and the gravity of his endeavors.\n\n5. **Dramatic Lighting**: The overall dramatic lighting of the scene amplifies the emotional impact of the image. It creates deep shadows and highlights, which can symbolize the highs and low