(2103, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike.  You\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sports motorcycle produced by Yamaha Motor Company. \n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a supersport bike that has been in production since 1998. It\'s known for its powerful inline-four engine, agile handling, and aerodynamic design. Over the years, the R1 has undergone several updates, with improvements to its engine, chassis, and electronics.\n\nSome key features of the Yamaha YZF-R1 include:\n\n1. **Engine**: A 998cc, liquid-cooled, inline-four cylinder engine producing around 200 horsepower.\n2. **Transmission**: A 6-speed transmission with a quickshifter and an assist-and-slipper clutch.\n3. **Chassis**: A lightweight, aluminum frame with a swingarm and a fully adjustable suspension system.\n4. **Brakes**: Dual 320mm discs with 4-piston calipers up front and a 220mm disc with a single-piston caliper at the rear.\n5. **Electronics**: Advanced rider aids, including traction control, slide control, and a quickshifter.\n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a popular choice among track enthusiasts and street riders alike, offering a thrilling riding experience and exceptional performance. However, it\'s worth noting that the R1 is a high-performance bike that requires a high level of riding skill and experience.\n\nAre you an R1 owner or enthusiast, or would you like to know more about this amazing bike?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-15 16:42:00', '2026-04-15 16:42:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-04-15 16:42:19', '2026-04-15 16:42:19'),
(2104, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a iconic superhero from the Marvel Comics universe. Created by Stan Lee, Larry Lieber, and Don Heck, Iron Man first appeared in comic books in 1963.\n\n**The Character:**\nIron Man\'s secret identity is Tony Stark, a billionaire inventor and entrepreneur who is also the founder and CEO of Stark Industries, a cutting-edge technology company. After being kidnapped and forced to build a powerful suit of armor, Tony Stark uses the technology to create a suit that allows him to escape and later becomes the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**The Suits:**\nIron Man\'s suits are a key part of his character. Over the years, Tony Stark has created numerous versions of the suit, each with advanced technologies and capabilities. The suits are powered by a high-energy source, known as the Arc Reactor, which is also the power source for Tony\'s heart.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nAs Iron Man, Tony Stark has a range of powers and abilities, including:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight capabilities\n* Energy projection and repulsor technology\n* Advanced sensors and scanning technology\n* Genius-level intellect and strategic thinking\n\n**The Movies:**\nIron Man has been featured in numerous movies, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\n**The Actor:**\nRobert Downey Jr. has played the role of Tony Stark/Iron Man in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) movies, bringing the character to life with his charismatic performance and wit.\n\n**Impact and Legacy:**\nIron Man has become an iconic character in popular culture, inspiring numerous fans around the world. The character\'s impact extends beyond the comic book and movie universes, with the concept of Iron Man influencing fields such as technology, engineering, and design.\n\nWhat would you like to know about Iron Man?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-15 17:30:00', '2026-04-15 17:30:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-04-15 17:30:17', '2026-04-15 17:30:17'),
(2105, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and captivating visual representation of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the elements that contribute to this cinematic scene:\n\n**Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a sleek, tailored suit, stands tall and confident on the basketball court. His attire, typically associated with corporate boardrooms, contrasts starkly with the athletic environment, suggesting that he\'s a high-achiever who can thrive in multiple domains. His posture, facial expression, and body language exude self-assurance and a winning mentality.\n\n**Setting:**\nThe basketball court, with its polished wooden floor and gleaming hoops, provides a dynamic and energetic backdrop for the scene. The stadium lights, shining brightly behind the subject, create a sense of drama and emphasis, as if the spotlight is on him. The court\'s empty seats and lack of other players add to the sense of isolation, focusing attention on the individual and his moment of triumph.\n\n**Lighting:**\nThe dramatic lighting, with strong shadows and highlights, enhances the cinematic quality of the image. The stadium lights cast a warm, golden glow on the subject, while the surrounding environment is bathed in a cooler, more muted tone. This contrast creates a sense of depth and dimensionality, drawing the viewer\'s eye to the subject.\n\n**Composition:**\nThe composition of the image is carefully balanced to convey a sense of power and confidence. The subject is placed centrally, with the basketball held firmly in his hand, symbolizing control and mastery. The court\'s lines and shapes lead the viewer\'s eye to the subject, creating a sense of movement and energy.\n\n**Color palette:**\nThe color scheme is predominantly dark and muted, with the subject\'s suit and the court\'s floor providing a somber, professional backdrop. The stadium lights, however, introduce a warm, golden tone, which adds a sense of excitement and triumph to the scene. The overall effect is a striking contrast between the cool, corporate tones and the warm, dynamic lighting.\n\n**Mood and atmosphere:**\nThe image exudes a sense of success, confidence, and determination. The subject\'s posture, facial expression, and body language all convey a sense of self-assurance and a winning mentality. The dramatic lighting, cinematic composition, and high-contrast color palette combine to create a powerful, motivational atmosphere, inspiring the viewer to strive for similar achievements.\n\n**High-resolution cinematic style:**\nThe image is rendered in a high-resolution, cinematic style, with precise details and textures that create a sense of realism and immersion. The overall effect is a visually stunning representation of success and confidence, perfect for inspiring motivation and ambition in those who view it.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-15 17:45:00', '2026-04-15 17:45:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-15 17:45:20', '2026-04-15 17:45:20'),
(2106, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, suggesting a fusion of two distinct worlds: the corporate boardroom and the basketball court. This juxtaposition can convey several themes, including resilience, adaptability, and the transferable skills between different fields of endeavor. Let\'s break down the elements of this image and explore the narrative it tells:\n\n1. **The Professional Businessman**: The figure of a businessman in a suit immediately evokes notions of professionalism, strategy, and success. The suit, a staple of corporate attire, signifies authority, discipline, and a deep understanding of the business world.\n\n2. **Standing Confidently on a Basketball Court**: The basketball court is a domain of athleticism, teamwork, and competitive spirit. By standing confidently in this environment, the businessman suggests that he is not limited to the boardroom. He embodies the idea that success in one field does not preclude success in another, entirely different domain. This confidence can imply a broad range of skills and the ability to adapt to new challenges.\n\n3. **With a Ball in His Hand**: Holding a basketball, the businessman connects with the sport, symbolizing engagement and participation rather than mere observation. This could represent his willingness to get involved, to take action, and to lead by example, whether in business or in sports.\n\n4. **Stadium Lights Behind Him, Dramatic Lighting**: The use of dramatic lighting, with stadium lights as the backdrop, amplifies the sense of drama and importance of the moment. It\'s akin to being under the spotlight, where actions are scrutinized, and performance matters. This lighting can symbolize the high stakes of both business and sports, where strategy, skill, and mental toughness are crucial.\n\n5. **Success Mindset**: The overall posture and setting convey a mindset of success. The businessman is not just a spectator; he is a participant, ready to play the game at its highest level. This mindset translates beyond the court, suggesting an approach to challenges that is proactive, optimistic, and geared towards achieving victory.\n\n6. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The description in high-resolution cinematic style elevates the scene to a level of epic storytelling. It\'s not just a snapshot; it\'s a moment captured with the depth and clarity that invites the viewer to step into the narrative. This style suggests a heroic quality, turning the businessman into a character of a story where overcoming obstacles and achieving triumph are central themes.\n\nIn summary, the image of a professional businessman standing confidently on a basketball court, with all the described elements, tells a story of versatility, confidence, and a winning mentality. It suggests that success is not confined to one area of life but can be achieved in multiple domains with the right attitude and skills. This narrative can inspire viewers to embrace challenges, believe in their potential, and strive for excellence in all their pursuits.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-15 17:46:00', '2026-04-15 17:46:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-15 17:46:18', '2026-04-15 17:46:18'),
(2107, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:47', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, blending the worlds of business and sports to convey a sense of success, confidence, and achievement. Here\'s a more detailed and cinematic description of the scene:\n\nThe businessman stands tall on the basketball court, the polished wood floor gleaming under the bright stadium lights. His tailored suit is immaculate, the fabric seeming to shimmer in the light, and his tie is knotted perfectly, a symbol of his professionalism and attention to detail. The basketball, held firmly in his hand, seems almost like an extension of himself, a tool that he wields with confidence and authority.\n\nThe stadium lights behind him cast a dramatic glow, illuminating the court and creating deep shadows that accentuate the businessman\'s features. His face is set in a determined expression, his eyes gleaming with a fierce inner light that suggests a strong will and an unshakeable commitment to success. The overall effect is one of dynamic energy and purpose, as if the businessman is poised on the threshold of a great achievement, ready to seize the moment and make his move.\n\nThe high-resolution cinematic style of the image adds a layer of depth and texture, making the scene feel almost three-dimensional. The colors are rich and vivid, with the deep blues and blacks of the suit and the court providing a striking contrast to the warm, golden tones of the stadium lights. The overall effect is one of high drama and tension, as if the outcome of the game – or the business deal – hangs in the balance, and the businessman is ready to do whatever it takes to emerge victorious.\n\nIn the background, the stadium seats rise up like a dark, shadowy presence, a reminder of the audience that is watching and waiting for the businessman to make his move. The air is thick with anticipation, and the sense of expectation is palpable. Will the businessman sink the shot, or will he falter under the