(2117, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', 'As a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what makes a successful entrepreneur. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* Embracing your unique strengths and weaknesses is key to success\n* Surrounding yourself with a supportive team can make all the difference\n* Taking calculated risks can lead to major rewards\n* Staying adaptable in a changing market is crucial\n* Continuously learning and growing is essential for long-term success\n\n#DragonSlayingBusinessTips #EntrepreneurLife #BusinessSuccess #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #RelatableMoments #BusinessInspiration #MotivationMonday #SuccessStory', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-16 10:35:00', '2026-04-16 10:35:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-04-16 10:35:17', '2026-04-16 10:35:17'),
(2118, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and feared criminal organizations in the world. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and dropped out of school in the seventh grade. Escobar\'s early involvement in crime was as a car thief and smuggler, but he soon turned to the more lucrative business of cocaine trafficking.\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar began working for the Medellín cartel, which was founded by Carlos Lehder and others. He quickly rose through the ranks, becoming a key player in the organization and eventually taking control of the cartel in the early 1980s.\n\n**Cocaine Empire**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. He expanded the cartel\'s operations, establishing a vast network of cocaine production and distribution that spanned the globe.\n\nEscobar\'s empire was built on violence, intimidation, and corruption. He and his associates used brutal tactics to eliminate competitors, law enforcement officials, and anyone who stood in their way. He also bribed and corrupted government officials, judges, and police officers to ensure the cartel\'s operations went unchecked.\n\nAt the height of his power, Escobar was estimated to be worth over $30 billion, making him one of the richest men in the world. He lived a lavish lifestyle, building a sprawling estate, Hacienda Nápoles, which featured a private zoo, a lake, and a collection of exotic cars.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by violence and terror. He and his associates were responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including:\n\n* Over 500 police officers and judges\n* Hundreds of rival cartel members and competitors\n* Dozens of journalists and media personalities\n* Numerous civilians caught in the crossfire\n\nEscobar\'s most notorious act of violence was the assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán in 1989. He also orchestrated the bombing of Avianca Flight 203 in 1989, which killed 110 people.\n\n**Downfall and Death**\n\nIn the early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, began to crack down on the Medellín cartel. Escobar\'s empire began to crumble, and he was forced to go into hiding.\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar\'s 44th birthday, he was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. He had been on the run for over a year, and his death marked the end of an era for the Medellín cartel.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. While he was a ruthless and brutal individual responsible for countless deaths and destruction, he was also a cunning and charismatic leader who built a vast and powerful empire.\n\nHis story has been immortalized in numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" Despite his notorious reputation, Escobar remains a fascinating and intriguing figure, and his impact on the world of organized crime and international relations continues to be felt today.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-16 10:45:00', '2026-04-16 10:45:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-16 10:45:16', '2026-04-16 10:45:16'),
(2119, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord and the founder of the Medellín Cartel, one of the most powerful and feared criminal organizations in the world. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and dropped out of school in the seventh grade. Escobar began his criminal career in the 1970s, initially as a small-time thief and smuggler. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Colombian underworld, building a reputation for ruthlessness and cunning.\n\nIn the late 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was then a relatively new and lucrative market. He partnered with other Colombian traffickers, including Carlos Lehder and Gustavo Gaviria, to form the Medellín Cartel. The cartel\'s success was fueled by Escobar\'s innovative tactics, including the use of small planes to transport cocaine from Colombia to the United States.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín Cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. The cartel\'s operations were characterized by brutality, violence, and corruption. Escobar and his associates used intimidation, murder, and bribery to maintain control over the cocaine trade and eliminate rivals.\n\nThe Medellín Cartel\'s profits soared in the 1980s, with estimates suggesting that the organization was generating over $20 billion per year. Escobar became one of the richest men in the world, with a net worth estimated to be over $30 billion.\n\n**The War on Drugs and Escobar\'s Downfall**\n\nIn the late 1980s, the Colombian government, with the support of the United States, launched a crackdown on the Medellín Cartel. The war on drugs led to a series of violent confrontations between Escobar\'s forces and the Colombian military.\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was sentenced to prison. However, he continued to run the cartel from behind bars, using his wealth and influence to maintain control. In 1992, Escobar escaped from prison and went into hiding.\n\nThe Colombian government, with the assistance of the United States, launched a massive manhunt for Escobar. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. His death marked the end of the Medellín Cartel\'s reign of terror and had a significant impact on the global cocaine trade.\n\n**Legacy and Cultural Impact**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people. However, he is also seen as a folk hero by some in Colombia, who view him as a symbol of resistance against the government and the United States.\n\nEscobar\'s life and career have been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His story has captivated audiences around the world, and his name has become synonymous with the cocaine trade and the war on drugs.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a collection of luxury cars, private jets, and mansions.\n* He was a skilled politician and was elected to the Colombian Congress in 1982.\n* Escobar was responsible for the construction of many public works projects in Medellín, including roads, schools, and hospitals.\n* He was a fan of soccer and owned a team, Atlético Nacional, which won several championships during his ownership.\n* Escobar\'s brother, Roberto Escobar, wrote a book about his life and career, which was published in 2009.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-16 10:50:00', '2026-04-16 10:50:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-16 10:50:19', '2026-04-16 10:50:19'),
(2120, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord, smuggler, and leader of the Medellín cartel. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals in history. Here\'s a brief overview of his life:\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, which would later shape his worldview and influence his actions.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar began his career in crime at a young age, selling stolen cars and involvement in other petty crimes. In the 1970s, he became involved in the cocaine trade, which was rapidly expanding in Colombia. Escobar\'s charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness helped him quickly rise through the ranks of the Medellín cartel.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. Escobar\'s strategy was to use violence and intimidation to eliminate his competitors and expand his empire. He also invested heavily in bribery and corruption, paying off government officials and law enforcement to turn a blind eye to his activities.\n\n**Cocaine Kingpin**\n\nAt the height of his power, Escobar was estimated to be earning over $420 million per week, making him one of the richest men in the world. He was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a massive mansion called Hacienda Napoles.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by extreme violence and terror. He was responsible for the murder of thousands of people, including law enforcement officers, judges, politicians, and civilians. He also orchestrated bombings, kidnappings, and other attacks on his enemies.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a luxurious private prison, which he had built himself. However, he escaped in 1992 and went into hiding. A massive manhunt ensued, involving Colombian and American authorities. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and brutal leader who brought terror and violence to Colombia. However, he is also seen as a folk hero by some, who view him as a champion of the poor and a symbol of resistance against government corruption and inequality. His life has been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his love of soccer and even owned a soccer team, Atlético Nacional.\n* He was a skilled businessman and invested in various legitimate enterprises, including real estate and construction.\n* Escobar was a devout Catholic and had a strong sense of family and loyalty.\n* He was responsible for the construction of many social projects, including hospitals, schools, and roads, which earned him popularity among some segments of Colombian society.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life was marked by extremes of violence, power, and wealth. His legacy continues to fascinate and horrify people around the world, serving as a cautionary tale about the dangers of unchecked ambition and the corrupting influence of power.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-16 10:53:00', '2026-04-16 10:53:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-16 10:53:18', '2026-04-16 10:53:18'),
(2121, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**\"Breathing Fire into Your Day\"**\n\nAs a dragon, I understand the importance of staying motivated and focused. Here are some relatable points to help you conquer your day:\n\n* Set clear goals and priorities to tackle challenging tasks\n* Stay organized and manage your time effectively to increase productivity\n* Take breaks and practice self-care to avoid burnout\n* Surround yourself with positive and supportive people who encourage you to grow\n* Continuously learn and improve your skills to stay ahead of the game\n\n#MotivationMonday #ProductivityHacks #SelfCare #GoalSetting #DragonInspiration #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #BusinessTips #EntrepreneurLife #SuccessMindset', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-16 11:18:00', '2026-04-16 11:18:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-04-16 11:18:18', '2026-04-16 11:18:18'),
(2122, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Party Wear for Men: A Guide to Dressing to Impress**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, there are many options to choose from, depending on the occasion, theme, and personal style. Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit is a classic choice for formal parties. You can opt for a black, navy, or gray suit, paired with a crisp white shirt, a patterned tie, and black dress shoes.\n2. **Blazers**: A blazer is a versatile and stylish option for semi-formal parties. You can wear it with a dress shirt, jeans, and dress shoes for a chic look.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt is a must-have for any party. You can choose from a variety of colors, patterns, and styles, such as slim-fit, regular-fit, or relaxed-fit.\n4. **Trousers**: Trousers are a great alternative to jeans for parties. You can opt for formal trousers, such as black or navy, or go for more casual options like chinos or cotton trousers.\n5. **Jeans**: Dark-washed jeans are a popular choice for casual parties. You can pair them with a dress shirt, a blazer, and dress shoes for a stylish look.\n6. **Accessories**: Accessories can make or break an outfit. Add a touch of elegance with a watch, a pocket square, or a bow tie.\n\n**Party Wear Themes for Men**\n\n1. **Formal**: Black tie, white tie, or formal suits are perfect for formal parties like weddings, galas, or award shows.\n2. **Semi-Formal**: Blazers, dress shirts, and trousers are suitable for semi-formal parties like cocktail parties or networking events.\n3. **Casual**: Jeans, t-shirts, and sneakers are great for casual parties like birthday parties or game nights.\n4. **Themed**: If the party has a specific theme, such as a Halloween party or a masquerade ball, you can dress accordingly.\n\n**Tips for Choosing the Right Party Wear**\n\n1. **Know the dress code**: Always check the dress code for the party to ensure you dress accordingly.\n2. **Consider the occasion**: Dress according to the occasion, such as a formal suit for a wedding or a casual outfit for a birthday party.\n3. **Be mindful of the venue**: Dress according to the venue, such as a more formal outfit for a fancy restaurant or a casual outfit for a backyard party.\n4. **Express your personal style**: Add your personal touch to your outfit with accessories, colors, or patterns.\n\n**Popular Party Wear Brands for Men**\n\n1. **Armani**: Known for their stylish and elegant suits.\n2. **Hugo Boss**: Offers a range of formal and semi-formal wear options.\n3. **Calvin Klein**: Popular for their stylish and modern clothing.\n4. **Tom Ford**: Offers high-end, sophisticated clothing options.\n5. **Zara**: Provides affordable and fashionable clothing options.\n\nRemember, the key to dressing well for a party is to feel confident and comfortable in what you\'re wearing. Choose an outfit that reflects your personal style and the occasion, and don\'t forget to add a touch of elegance with accessories.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-16 12:40:00', '2026-04-16 12:40:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-04-16 12:40:16', '2026-04-16 12:40:16'),
(2123, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts usually have a point or spread collar, which is designed to be worn with a tie.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs, also known as double cuffs, which require cufflinks to secure them.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are typically made from high-quality cotton or cotton-blend fabrics, such as Oxford cloth or pinpoint cotton.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the chest and waist.\n5. **Button-front**: Formal shirts usually have a button-front closure, with buttons made from mother-of-pearl or other high-quality materials.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Dress shirt**: A classic formal shirt with a point or spread collar, French cuffs, and a button-front closure.\n2. **Wingtip collar shirt**: A formal shirt with a wingtip collar, which is designed to be worn with a bow tie.\n3. **Cutaway collar shirt**: A formal shirt with a cutaway collar, which is designed to be worn with a tie.\n4. **Mandarin collar shirt**: A formal shirt with a Mandarin collar, which is a type of collar that is designed to be worn without a tie.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White**: A classic choice for formal shirts, white is a timeless and versatile color.\n2. **Light blue**: A light blue formal shirt is a popular choice for business and formal events.\n3. **Pastel colors**: Pastel colors such as pink, yellow, and lavender are popular for formal shirts, especially in the spring and summer.\n4. **Stripes and checks**: Formal shirts with stripes or checks are a great way to add some visual interest to a outfit.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: A British brand known for its high-quality formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French brand that has been producing high-quality formal shirts for over 180 years.\n3. ** Turnbull & Asser**: A British brand that has been producing high-quality formal shirts for over 130 years.\n4. **Brooks Brothers**: An American brand that has been producing high-quality formal shirts for over 200 years.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Make sure it fits**: A formal shirt should fit closely to the body, so make sure to try it on before buying.\n2. **Choose the right fabric**: Choose a fabric that is comfortable and suitable for the occasion.\n3. **Pay attention to details**: Pay attention to details such as the collar style, cuff style, and button quality.\n4. **Iron it properly**: Make sure to iron your formal shirt properly to avoid wrinkles and creases.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-16 12:56:00', '2026-04-16 12:56:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-16 12:56:19', '2026-04-16 12:56:19'),
(2124, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**Embracing Your Inner Dragon: 5 Key Takeaways**\n\nAs a symbol of strength, courage, and resilience, the dragon represents the ultimate entrepreneurial spirit. Here are a few points to consider:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like a dragon soaring to great heights, set your sights on achieving the impossible.\n* **Be fearless in the face of challenges**: Dragons are known for their bravery, so don\'t be afraid to take calculated risks and face your fears head-on.\n* **Protect your passions**: A dragon guards its treasure with its life, so prioritize and protect what matters most to you.\n* **Continuously learn and adapt**: Dragons are mythical creatures, but they can teach us a thing or two about being open to new experiences and learning from our mistakes.\n* **Unleash your creativity**: Let your imagination run wild and tap into your inner dragon\'s creative potential.\n\n#DragonInspiration #EntrepreneurMindset #BusinessMotivation #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalGrowth #ResilienceMatters #AmbitiousGoals #FearlessLeadership #PassionProtection #ContinuousLearning #CreativeUnleashed #MythicalMotivation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-16 13:03:00', '2026-04-16 13:03:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-04-16 13:03:16', '2026-04-16 13:03:16'),
