(2156, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of dress shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts usually have a point collar, spread collar, or a wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are typically made from high-quality cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Weave**: Formal shirts often have a tight weave, such as Oxford or pinpoint weave.\n5. **Color**: Formal shirts are usually white, light blue, or other muted colors.\n6. **Pattern**: Formal shirts may have subtle patterns, such as stripes or checks.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic fit**: A traditional fit with a relaxed silhouette.\n2. **Slim fit**: A more modern fit with a slimmer silhouette.\n3. **Tailored fit**: A fit that is tailored to the individual\'s body, often with a more fitted silhouette.\n4. **Dress shirt**: A formal shirt with a stiff collar and cuffs, often worn with a suit and tie.\n5. **Business casual**: A less formal shirt with a softer collar and cuffs, often worn with dress pants and a blazer.\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress shirt**: A formal shirt with a stiff collar and cuffs, often worn with a suit and tie.\n2. **Button-down shirt**: A shirt with a button-down collar, often worn with a blazer and dress pants.\n3. **Oxford shirt**: A shirt with a button-down collar and a relaxed fit, often worn with dress pants and a blazer.\n4. **Tuxedo shirt**: A formal shirt with a wingtip collar and French cuffs, often worn with a tuxedo.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: Known for their high-quality, traditional formal shirts.\n2. **Brooks Brothers**: Offers a range of formal shirts with a classic, American style.\n3. **Charvet**: A French brand that offers high-end, bespoke formal shirts.\n4. ** Turnbull & Asser**: A British brand that offers high-quality, traditional formal shirts.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Choose a shirt that fits well**: Make sure the shirt is not too tight or too loose.\n2. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a shirt that is suitable for the occasion, such as a white shirt for a formal event.\n3. **Pay attention to details**: Look for high-quality buttons, stitching, and fabric.\n4. **Iron your shirt**: Make sure to iron your shirt before wearing it to ensure a crisp, smooth finish.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-17 12:56:00', '2026-04-17 12:56:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-17 12:56:20', '2026-04-17 12:56:20'),
