of power and control. The image becomes a visual representation of the idea that, with the right mindset and skills, one can transcend boundaries and achieve greatness in multiple fields.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-18 17:46:00', '2026-04-18 17:46:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-18 17:46:24', '2026-04-18 17:46:24');
