(2214, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', '**Unlock Your Business Potential with Dragon**\n\nAs a business owner or creator, are you looking to elevate your brand and reach new heights? Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Develop a strong brand identity**: Establish a unique and recognizable brand voice, tone, and visual aesthetic to stand out in a crowded market.\n* **Create engaging content**: Produce high-quality, relevant, and consistent content that resonates with your target audience and sets you apart from the competition.\n* **Leverage social media**: Utilize platforms like Facebook to build a community, share your story, and connect with your audience in a meaningful way.\n* **Stay up-to-date with industry trends**: Continuously educate yourself on the latest developments and best practices in your field to stay ahead of the curve.\n* **Collaborate and network**: Build relationships with other professionals, influencers, and potential partners to expand your reach and opportunities.\n\nBy following these tips, you can unlock your business potential and achieve success. #Trending #BusinessGrowth #Entrepreneurship #SocialMediaMarketing #BrandBuilding #Innovation #SuccessTips #FacebookMarketing #SmallBusinessOwner #CreatorLife #ProfessionalDevelopment #IndustryTrends #Networking #Collaboration #GrowthMindset', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 10:35:00', '2026-04-19 10:35:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-04-19 10:35:17', '2026-04-19 10:35:17'),
(2215, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, founder of the Medellín cartel, and one of the most notorious criminals of the 20th century. He was born in Rionegro, Colombia, and rose to prominence in the 1970s and 1980s as a major player in the global cocaine trade.\n\n**Early Life and Career**\n\nEscobar grew up in a poor family and was involved in crime from an early age. He started by selling stolen cars and then moved on to smuggling cocaine. In the 1970s, he became a key figure in the Colombian cocaine trade, working with other traffickers to smuggle large quantities of the drug into the United States.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nIn the early 1980s, Escobar founded the Medellín cartel, which quickly became one of the most powerful and feared drug cartels in the world. The cartel\'s success was due in part to Escobar\'s innovative tactics, including the use of small planes to transport cocaine and the creation of a network of distributors and money launderers.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power was swift and brutal. He eliminated his rivals, often using violence and intimidation to consolidate his control over the cocaine trade. He also cultivated relationships with corrupt government officials and law enforcement officers, who helped him to evade detection and prosecution.\n\n**The \"King of Cocaine\"**\n\nAt the height of his power, Escobar was known as the \"King of Cocaine.\" He was estimated to be worth over $30 billion, making him one of the richest men in the world. He lived in a lavish mansion in Medellín, surrounded by bodyguards and luxury cars.\n\n**Violence and Intimidation**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by violence and intimidation. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including rival traffickers, police officers, and innocent civilians. He also ordered the assassination of politicians, judges, and journalists who opposed him.\n\n**The Hunt for Escobar**\n\nIn the late 1980s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a major effort to capture or kill Escobar. The hunt was led by a special task force, known as the Search Bloc, which was trained and equipped by the US military.\n\n**Death**\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. He was 44 years old. The shooting occurred after a lengthy manhunt, during which Escobar had been living in hiding.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who brought violence and destruction to Colombia and beyond. However, he is also seen by some as a folk hero, who rose from poverty to become one of the most powerful men in the world.\n\n**Popular Culture**\n\nEscobar\'s life and career have been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His story has captivated audiences around the world, and his legend continues to fascinate and horrify people to this day.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a mansion with a private airport.\n* He was a skilled politician and was elected to the Colombian Congress in 1982.\n* Escobar was a fan of soccer and owned a team, Atlético Nacional, which won the Colombian championship in 1987.\n* He was known for his charitable donations to poor communities in Medellín, which helped to build his reputation as a folk hero.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 10:45:00', '2026-04-19 10:45:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-19 10:45:20', '2026-04-19 10:45:20'),
(2216, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and the founder of the Medellín Cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious organized crime groups in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful drug traffickers of all time.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a middle-class family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he was exposed to the harsh realities of Colombian street life from a young age.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s involvement in organized crime began in the 1970s, when he started working as a small-time smuggler and thief. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín Cartel, which was founded by his mentor, Carlos Lehder. In the early 1980s, Escobar became one of the cartel\'s top leaders, and his charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness helped him to consolidate power and expand the organization\'s operations.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín Cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. The cartel\'s main business was cocaine trafficking, and Escobar\'s network of smugglers, distributors, and money launderers spanned the globe. At its peak, the cartel was estimated to be earning over $20 billion per year, making it one of the largest and most profitable organized crime groups in history.\n\n**Violence and Intimidation**\n\nEscobar was known for his brutal tactics and his willingness to use violence to achieve his goals. He was responsible for the murders of thousands of people, including politicians, police officers, judges, and rival gang members. His organization was also responsible for numerous bombings, kidnappings, and assassinations.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned, but he escaped from prison in 1992. A massive manhunt was launched, and Escobar was eventually tracked down and killed in a shootout with Colombian police on December 1, 1993, in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is widely regarded as one of the most notorious and successful drug traffickers in history, and his organization\'s violence and intimidation tactics had a profound impact on Colombian society. However, he is also remembered as a charismatic and cunning leader who was able to build a vast and powerful organization from scratch.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s life and legacy have been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His story has captivated audiences around the world, and he remains one of the most fascinating and infamous figures in modern history.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his love of luxury and extravagance, and he owned numerous mansions, cars, and private planes.\n* He was a skilled politician and was able to build alliances with other organized crime groups and corrupt government officials.\n* Escobar was a prolific builder and invested heavily in infrastructure projects, including roads, bridges, and housing developments.\n* He was a devoted family man and was known for his love of his wife, María Victoria Henao, and his two children.\n* Escobar\'s death was seen as a major victory for the Colombian government and marked the beginning of the end of the Medellín Cartel\'s reign of terror.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 10:50:00', '2026-04-19 10:50:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-19 10:50:18', '2026-04-19 10:50:18'),
(2217, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and the founder of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious drug trafficking organizations in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals of the 20th century.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to Abel de Jesús Dari Escobar and Hermilda Gaviria. He was the third of seven children in a lower-middle-class family. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he dropped out of school in the seventh grade to work on the streets.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar began his career in crime by selling counterfeit lottery tickets and stealing cars. He eventually turned to cocaine trafficking, which became a lucrative business in the 1970s and 1980s. Escobar\'s organization, the Medellín cartel, dominated the cocaine trade, and he became one of the richest and most powerful men in Colombia.\n\n**Cocaine Empire**\n\nAt the height of his power, Escobar\'s organization was responsible for smuggling an estimated 80% of the world\'s cocaine into the United States. He built a vast network of traffickers, smugglers, and distributors, and his organization became notorious for its brutality and ruthlessness.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by violence and terror. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including police officers, judges, politicians, and rival gang members. He also ordered the bombing of a commercial airliner, Avianca Flight 203, which killed 110 people.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a specially built facility, known as La Catedral. However, he escaped in 1992 and went into hiding. A massive manhunt ensued, and on December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who brought terror and violence to Colombia and beyond. However, he is also seen as a Robin Hood figure by some, who believe that he helped the poor and marginalized in his community. His story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Fun Facts**\n\n* Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power.\n* He was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a sprawling estate called Hacienda Napoles.\n* Escobar was a skilled soccer player and was known to have played in local tournaments.\n* He was a devout Catholic and had a strong sense of family loyalty, which motivated many of his actions.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and legacy are a fascinating and complex topic, full of intrigue, violence, and drama. His story continues to captivate audiences around the world, and his impact on Colombian history and culture is still felt today.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 10:53:00', '2026-04-19 10:53:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-19 10:53:15', '2026-04-19 10:53:15'),
(2218, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Empowering Your Business with Dragon\'s Fire**\n\nAs a business owner, you\'re likely no stranger to the challenges of staying ahead of the curve. At Dragon, we understand the importance of adaptability, innovation, and community. Here are a few key takeaways to help you navigate the ever-changing business landscape:\n\n* **Stay agile**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change, and always keep your eyes on the horizon.\n* **Foster a strong community**: Build relationships with your customers, partners, and peers to create a supportive network that drives growth.\n* **Invest in innovation**: Stay up-to-date with the latest trends and technologies to stay ahead of the competition.\n* **Lead with passion**: Let your enthusiasm and dedication shine through in everything you do, and inspire others to do the same.\n\n#BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #InnovationNation #CommunityFirst #LeadershipMatters #TrendingNow #BusinessGrowth #SuccessStories #DragonInspires', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 11:18:00', '2026-04-19 11:18:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-04-19 11:18:17', '2026-04-19 11:18:17'),
(2219, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Men\'s Party Wear: A Guide to Dressing to Impress**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, the options can be overwhelming. However, with a few simple guidelines, you can create a stylish and memorable look for any occasion. Here are some tips and ideas for men\'s party wear:\n\n**Formal Party Wear**\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit is a classic choice for formal parties. Choose from a range of colors, including black, navy, and gray.\n2. **Dress Shirts**: Pair your suit with a dress shirt in a bold color or pattern to add some personality to your outfit.\n3. **Ties and Bow Ties**: Add a tie or bow tie to complete your formal look.\n4. **Dress Shoes**: Black or brown dress shoes are a must-have for formal parties.\n\n**Semi-Formal Party Wear**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to a casual outfit.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Pair your blazer with dress pants in a neutral color.\n3. **Button-Down Shirts**: A button-down shirt is a great alternative to a dress shirt.\n4. **Loafers or Boots**: Loafers or boots can add a stylish touch to your semi-formal outfit.\n\n**Casual Party Wear**\n\n1. **Jeans**: A pair of dark wash jeans is a versatile choice for casual parties.\n2. **T-Shirts or Polo Shirts**: Pair your jeans with a T-shirt or polo shirt in a bold color or pattern.\n3. **Jackets or Hoodies**: Add a jacket or hoodie to complete your casual look.\n4. **Sneakers**: Sneakers are a great choice for casual parties.\n\n**Accessories**\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch can add a touch of elegance to your outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a personal touch to your dress shirt.\n3. **Pocket Squares**: A pocket square can add a pop of color to your suit or blazer.\n4. **Hats**: A hat can add a stylish touch to your outfit.\n\n**Trends**\n\n1. **Slim-Fit Clothing**: Slim-fit clothing is a popular trend in men\'s party wear.\n2. **Bold Colors and Patterns**: Bold colors and patterns are a great way to add some personality to your outfit.\n3. **Statement Accessories**: Statement accessories, such as bold watches or cufflinks, can add a touch of elegance to your outfit.\n\n**Tips**\n\n1. **Dress for the Occasion**: Make sure to dress for the specific party or occasion.\n2. **Be Comfortable**: Choose clothing that is comfortable and allows you to move freely.\n3. **Accessories can Make or Break an Outfit**: Don\'t forget to add accessories to complete your look.\n4. **Confidence is Key**: Own your outfit and walk into the party with confidence.\n\nBy following these tips and guidelines, you can create a stylish and memorable look for any party or occasion. Remember to have fun and express your personal style through your clothing choices.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 12:40:00', '2026-04-19 12:40:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-04-19 12:40:20', '2026-04-19 12:40:20'),
(2220, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn for formal occasions, such as business meetings, weddings, and other special events. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts typically have a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or barrel cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are usually made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the torso and sleeves.\n5. **Button-front closure**: Formal shirts typically have a button-front closure, with buttons made from materials such as mother-of-pearl or plastic.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic formal shirt**: A traditional formal shirt with a point collar, French cuffs, and a slim fit.\n2. **Dress shirt**: A formal shirt with a spread collar, barrel cuffs, and a slightly looser fit.\n3. **Tuxedo shirt**: A formal shirt designed to be worn with a tuxedo, typically with a wingtip collar and French cuffs.\n4. **Business shirt**: A formal shirt designed for business wear, often with a point collar and barrel cuffs.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White**: A classic choice for formal shirts, white is a versatile and timeless option.\n2. **Light blue**: A popular choice for formal shirts, light blue is a calming and professional color.\n3. **Pastel colors**: Soft pastel colors such as pale pink, baby blue, and mint green can add a touch of elegance to a formal shirt.\n4. **Stripes and checks**: Subtle stripes and checks can add texture and interest to a formal shirt.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Tom Ford**: Known for their high-quality and stylish formal shirts.\n2. **Armani**: Offers a range of formal shirts with a focus on luxury and sophistication.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: A classic American brand that offers traditional formal shirts with a preppy twist.\n4. **Thomas Pink**: A British brand that specializes in high-quality formal shirts with a focus on color and pattern.\n\n**Tips for Wearing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Pair with a suit**: A formal shirt is typically worn with a suit and tie for a complete formal look.\n2. **Choose the right collar style**: Select a collar style that complements your face shape and the occasion.\n3. **Pay attention to fit**: Ensure the shirt fits closely to the body, with sleeves that are not too long or too short.\n4. **Accessorize with a tie or pocket square**: Add a touch of personality to your formal shirt with a tie or pocket square.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 12:56:00', '2026-04-19 12:56:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-19 12:56:19', '2026-04-19 12:56:19'),
