(2224, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing Your Inner Fire: Lessons from a Dragon**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long been a source of fascination and inspiration. Here are a few key takeaways from the world of dragons that can be applied to our personal and professional lives:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness and ability to thrive in challenging environments.\n* **Adaptability and resilience**: With their ability to fly, swim, and thrive in various landscapes, dragons demonstrate the importance of being adaptable and resilient.\n* **Protecting and preserving what matters**: Dragons are often depicted as guardians of treasure and precious resources, highlighting the importance of protecting and preserving what is valuable to us.\n* **Embracing our unique strengths and talents**: Just as dragons have unique abilities and characteristics, we too can leverage our individual strengths and talents to achieve success and make a lasting impact.\n\n#DragonInspiration #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #Resilience #Adaptability #Courage #Motivation #TrendingNow #InspirationalQuotes #FacebookMotivation #BusinessLessons #SuccessTips', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 14:37:00', '2026-04-19 14:37:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-19 14:37:17', '2026-04-19 14:37:17'),
(2225, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', 'As a dragon in the business world, I\'d like to share some relatable points with you. Here\'s my post for Facebook:\n\n\"Being a dragon in the corporate world can be challenging, but someone\'s gotta do it. Here are a few things I\'ve learned along the way:\n\n* Fire-breathing is not an acceptable way to handle stress in the office\n* Scales are not a substitute for a suit and tie\n* Hoarding treasure is not a viable business strategy\n* Flying to meetings can be convenient, but it\'s not always practical\n* Having a fiery personality can be an asset, but it\'s not always easy to control\n\nDespite the challenges, I\'m proud to be a dragon in the business world. I\'m fierce, determined, and always up for a challenge. #DragonInTheBoardroom #FireBreathingCEO #ScalesOfSuccess #TreasuredExperiences #FlyingHighInBusiness #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #CorporateLife #DragonPower\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 14:38:00', '2026-04-19 14:38:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-19 14:38:12', '2026-04-19 14:38:12'),
