(2232, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a large language model, I don\'t have the capability to physically create images. However, I can provide you with a detailed description of a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends.\n\n**Image Description:**\n\nThe image is a high-resolution, vibrant photograph of a group of friends having a great time together. The scene is set in a trendy outdoor café on a warm, sunny day. The atmosphere is relaxed and casual, with a sense of camaraderie and friendship.\n\nIn the center of the image is the main subject, a man in his mid-30s with a friendly smile and a carefree attitude. He\'s wearing a pair of trendy sunglasses, a white linen shirt, and a pair of distressed denim jeans. His hair is messy and stylishly undone, and he has a few days\' worth of stubble on his chin.\n\nThe man is surrounded by his friends, a diverse group of people from different backgrounds and ages. There\'s a woman with a bright pink haircut and a fun, eclectic outfit, a tall, lanky guy with a baseball cap and a big grin, and an older man with a kind face and a warm smile.\n\nThe group is seated at a wooden table, surrounded by lush greenery and colorful flowers. There are glasses of cold beer, wine, and soda on the table, along with a few plates of delicious-looking food. The atmosphere is lively and convivial, with everyone laughing and chatting as they enjoy each other\'s company.\n\nIn the background, you can see the blurred outlines of other café patrons, adding to the sense of movement and energy in the scene. The overall mood of the image is one of joy, friendship, and relaxation, capturing the essence of a perfect day out with friends.\n\n**Image Specifications:**\n\n* Resolution: 4000 x 6000 pixels\n* Aspect Ratio: 2:3\n* File Format: JPEG\n* Color Profile: Adobe RGB\n* Camera Settings: f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 100\n\nI hope this description gives you a vivid idea of the image I have in mind!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 16:06:00', '2026-04-19 16:06:22', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-04-19 16:06:22', '2026-04-19 16:06:22');
