(2235, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as American football in some countries, is a contact team sport played between two teams of eleven players using an oval-shaped ball with pointed ends. It is a popular sport in the United States and is also played in other countries around the world.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **Objective**: The objective of the game is to score more points than the opposing team by carrying or throwing the ball into the end zone of the opponent\'s field.\n2. **Gameplay**: The game is divided into four quarters, each lasting 15 minutes. The team with possession of the ball (the offense) tries to score by advancing the ball down the field, while the opposing team (the defense) tries to stop them.\n3. **Positions**: Each team has 11 players on the field at a time, with different positions including:\n	* Quarterback (QB): The player who usually throws the ball and leads the offense.\n	* Running back (RB): The player who carries the ball on running plays.\n	* Wide receiver (WR): The player who catches passes from the quarterback.\n	* Linemen (OL/DL): The players who line up on the line of scrimmage and try to block or tackle the opponent.\n4. **Scoring**: Points can be scored in several ways, including:\n	* Touchdown (6 points): When a player carries or catches the ball into the end zone.\n	* Field goal (3 points): When a team kicks the ball through the opponent\'s goalposts.\n	* Extra point (1 or 2 points): When a team kicks the ball through the opponent\'s goalposts after a touchdown (1 point) or completes a two-point conversion (2 points).\n5. **Penalties**: If a player breaks a rule, a penalty is called, and the opposing team is awarded a certain number of yards or a first down.\n\nSome popular football leagues and competitions include:\n\n1. **National Football League (NFL)**: The top-level professional league in the United States.\n2. **College football**: The level of football played by universities and colleges in the United States.\n3. **High school football**: The level of football played by high schools in the United States.\n4. **Super Bowl**: The championship game of the NFL, played between the winners of the American Football Conference (AFC) and National Football Conference (NFC).\n\nFootball is a physically demanding and strategically complex sport that requires a combination of strength, speed, agility, and teamwork.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 16:33:00', '2026-04-19 16:33:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-04-19 16:33:19', '2026-04-19 16:33:19'),
(2236, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike.  You\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sport bike produced by Yamaha Motor Company. \n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a popular choice among motorcycle enthusiasts, known for its exceptional handling, powerful engine, and sleek design. Here are some key features of the R1 bike:\n\n* **Engine**: 998cc, liquid-cooled, 4-stroke, DOHC, 16-valve, in-line four-cylinder engine\n* **Power**: 200 horsepower (147.9 kW) @ 13,500 rpm\n* **Torque**: 82.6 lb-ft (112 Nm) @ 11,500 rpm\n* **Transmission**: 6-speed, multi-plate slipper clutch\n* **Suspension**: 43mm fork, fully adjustable; monoshock, fully adjustable\n* **Brakes**: Dual 320mm discs, 4-piston calipers (front); 220mm disc, single-piston caliper (rear)\n* **Seat Height**: 32.7 inches (831mm)\n* **Weight**: 448 pounds (203 kg) wet\n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 has undergone several updates and revisions since its introduction in 1998. The current model features advanced technologies such as:\n\n* **Traction Control**: A six-axis inertial measurement unit (IMU) that helps maintain traction and stability\n* **Slide Control**: A system that helps control slides and wheelies\n* **Lift Control**: A system that helps reduce wheelies and loss of traction\n* **Quick Shift**: A system that allows for clutchless upshifts and downshifts\n\nOverall, the Yamaha YZF-R1 is a high-performance sport bike that is designed for experienced riders who demand exceptional handling, power, and technology.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 16:42:00', '2026-04-19 16:42:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-04-19 16:42:18', '2026-04-19 16:42:18'),
(2237, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby, and first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense #39\" in March 1963.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is kidnapped by a terrorist group while demonstrating his latest missile technology in Afghanistan. Stark is forced to build a powerful suit of armor to save his life, using a combination of his intelligence, resources, and ingenuity. He escapes from captivity and returns to the United States, where he perfects the Iron Man suit and becomes a superhero, using his technology to fight crime and protect the world.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit gives him a range of superhuman abilities, including:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight capability\n* Energy projection and repulsor technology\n* Advanced sensors and tracking systems\n* Enhanced intelligence and strategic thinking\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a complex and charismatic character, known for his:\n\n* Intelligence and wit\n* Confidence and arrogance\n* Charisma and charm\n* Sense of responsibility and duty\n* Flawed and vulnerable personality\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been featured in several movies, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* The Incredible Hulk (2008) - cameo appearance\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) - cameo appearance\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\n**Actor:**\nThe character of Tony Stark/Iron Man has been portrayed by actor Robert Downey Jr. in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) movies.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has become an iconic and beloved character in popular culture, inspiring numerous adaptations, spin-offs, and merchandise. The character\'s legacy continues to evolve and grow, with new stories, movies, and TV shows being developed.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 17:30:00', '2026-04-19 17:30:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-04-19 17:30:19', '2026-04-19 17:30:19'),
(2238, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and captivating visual representation of confidence, success, and the blending of professional and personal achievement. Let\'s break down the elements that make this scene so compelling:\n\n1. **Professional Businessman in a Suit**: The suit is a symbol of professionalism, success, and authority. It signifies that the individual is accomplished in their field and commands respect. The contrast between the formal attire and the casual setting of a basketball court adds an interesting layer of depth to the image, suggesting that this person brings a high level of professionalism and dedication to all aspects of their life.\n\n2. **Standing Confidently on a Basketball Court**: The basketball court is a place of competition, skill, and strategy. Standing confidently here implies that the businessman is not only successful in his professional life but also possesses athletic prowess or at least a strong competitive spirit. It suggests a well-rounded individual who can navigate different environments with ease and confidence.\n\n3. **With a Ball in His Hand**: Holding the basketball signifies control, readiness to act, and perhaps a moment of contemplation before making a move. It could symbolize the businessman\'s ability to handle challenges, make strategic decisions, and lead his team (whether in business or on the court) towards victory.\n\n4. **Stadium Lights Behind Him**: The dramatic lighting provided by the stadium lights creates a heroic silhouette, elevating the figure to a status of importance and glory. It\'s reminiscent of moments of triumph in sports and suggests that the businessman is basking in the glory of his achievements. The lights also serve to emphasize the dramatic and cinematic quality of the image.\n\n5. **Dramatic Lighting**: The use of dramatic lighting enhances the emotional impact of the image, creating deep shadows and highlighting the businessman\'s figure. This lighting technique is often used in cinema to emphasize key moments or characters, which aligns with the high-resolution cinematic style you\'ve described.\n\n6. **Success Mindset**: The overall composition of the image embodies a mindset of success. It portrays someone who is not limited by conventional boundaries, who can excel in multiple arenas, and who carries an air of confidence and authority. This mindset is inspiring and motivational, suggesting that with the right attitude and dedication, one can achieve greatness in various aspects of life.\n\n7. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The description of the image as being in a high-resolution cinematic style suggests a level of clarity and detail that is typically associated with professional film productions. This enhances the dramatic effect of the scene, making the viewer feel as though they are observing a pivotal moment in a movie or a significant event. The cinematic style also implies a certain level of epicness or grandeur, fitting for a portrayal of success and achievement.\n\nIn summary, the image of a professional businessman standing confidently on a basketball court, set against the dramatic backdrop of stadium lights, embodies a powerful narrative of success, confidence, and the pursuit of excellence in all endeavors.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-19 17:45:00', '2026-04-19 17:45:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-19 17:45:18', '2026-04-19 17:45:18'),
