(2255, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:55', '**Breathing Fire into Your Business: Lessons from a Dragon**\n\nAs a successful business owner and a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to thrive in a competitive market. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on its prey, you need to define what you want to achieve and create a plan to get there.\n* **Be adaptable**: The business landscape is constantly changing, and you need to be able to pivot quickly to stay ahead of the curve.\n* **Invest in your team**: A dragon\'s hoard is only as strong as the team that guards it. Invest in your employees and they will help you build a treasure trove of success.\n* **Stay focused**: Don\'t get distracted by shiny objects or side quests. Keep your eyes on the prize and stay committed to your goals.\n\n#BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #DragonWisdom #SuccessStrategies #LeadershipLessons #Trending #FacebookBusiness #BusinessOwner #SmallBusiness #StartupLife #MotivationMonday #Inspiration', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-20 13:55:00', '2026-04-20 13:55:13', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 4, '2026-04-20 13:55:13', '2026-04-20 13:55:13'),
(2256, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and resilience. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your own life and business:\n\n* **Set bold goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s scaling a mountain or launching a new product, remember that the greatest rewards often lie just beyond your comfort zone.\n* **Stay adaptable**: The ability to pivot and adjust to changing circumstances is crucial in today\'s fast-paced world. Stay agile, stay nimble, and always be ready to evolve.\n* **Protect your fire**: Your passion and creativity are the spark that drives you forward. Nurture them, protect them, and never let them fade.\n* **Build a strong community**: Surround yourself with people who support and believe in you. Together, you can achieve greatness and overcome even the most daunting challenges.\n* **Keep learning**: The moment you stop learning is the moment you stop growing. Stay curious, stay hungry, and always be open to new ideas and experiences.\n\n#DragonInspiration #BusinessLessons #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #EntrepreneurLife #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #FacebookBusiness #InnovationNation #SuccessTips #LeadershipLessons #FireWithin #PassionDriven #CommunityFirst #LearnAndGrow #DragonFire', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-20 14:00:00', '2026-04-20 14:00:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-20 14:00:17', '2026-04-20 14:00:17'),
(2257, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:07', 'As a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what makes a successful entrepreneur. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Embracing risk**: Just like how I take to the skies, you need to be willing to take calculated risks to achieve your goals.\n* **Building a strong foundation**: A sturdy hoard is essential for any dragon, and the same applies to your business - a solid foundation is crucial for long-term success.\n* **Adapting to change**: The fire-breathing landscape is constantly evolving, and you need to be able to adapt quickly to stay ahead of the curve.\n* **Protecting your assets**: Your treasure is your most valuable resource, and you need to take steps to protect it from potential threats.\n* **Networking and collaboration**: Even dragons need allies - building strong relationships with others in your industry can help you achieve your goals.\n\n#DragonTips #BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #RiskAndReward #FoundationForSuccess #AdaptabilityIsKey #AssetProtection #NetworkingMatters #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #DragonSizedAmbitions', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-20 14:07:00', '2026-04-20 14:07:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 5, '2026-04-20 14:07:15', '2026-04-20 14:07:15'),
(2258, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:18', '**\"Breathing Fire into Your Business: Key Takeaways\"**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on its next treasure hoard, you should have a clear idea of what you want to achieve in your business.\n* **Be adaptable**: As a dragon, I\'ve learned to navigate through changing landscapes and unexpected challenges. Your business should be able to do the same.\n* **Invest in your people**: A dragon\'s treasure is only as valuable as the people who help protect it. Invest in your team and they will help your business thrive.\n* **Stay ahead of the curve**: Keep an eye on industry trends and stay ahead of the competition. A dragon\'s fiery breath can only be matched by its sharp instincts.\n\n#BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #DragonApproved #TrendingNow #BusinessSuccess #LeadershipGoals #InnovationNation #FacebookForBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #BusinessGrowth #StrategyTips', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-20 14:18:00', '2026-04-20 14:18:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 6, '2026-04-20 14:18:15', '2026-04-20 14:18:15'),
(2259, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing Your Inner Strength: Lessons from a Dragon**\n\nAs a symbol of power and resilience, dragons have long been a source of inspiration for many. Here are some key takeaways from these majestic creatures:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness, reminding us to stand up for ourselves and face challenges head-on.\n* **Protecting what matters**: Dragons are fiercely protective of their territories and loved ones, teaching us the importance of prioritizing and safeguarding what\'s truly important.\n* **Embracing our unique strengths**: Each dragon has its own distinct abilities and characteristics, encouraging us to celebrate and leverage our individual talents and strengths.\n\nLet\'s draw inspiration from these legendary creatures and unleash our inner dragons!\n\n#DragonInspiration #InnerStrength #Resilience #Courage #Protection #SelfLove #Trending #Motivation #Inspiration #Facebook #BusinessMindset #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #LessonsFromNature', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-20 14:37:00', '2026-04-20 14:37:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-20 14:37:16', '2026-04-20 14:37:16'),
(2260, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Empowering Your Business with Dragon\'s Expertise**\n\nAs a seasoned entrepreneur and business leader, I\'m excited to share my insights on how to take your business to the next level. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Establish a clear vision and mission statement to guide your business decisions.\n* **Develop a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your passion and values.\n* **Stay adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot and adjust your strategy as market conditions and customer needs evolve.\n* **Foster a positive company culture**: Encourage open communication, collaboration, and innovation to drive growth and success.\n* **Continuously learn and improve**: Stay up-to-date with industry trends and best practices to stay ahead of the competition.\n\nBy following these principles, you\'ll be well on your way to building a thriving and sustainable business. #BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #Trending #FacebookBusiness #DragonApproved #BusinessGrowth #Innovation #Strategy #TeamWork #CompanyCulture #ContinuousLearning #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-20 14:38:00', '2026-04-20 14:38:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-20 14:38:12', '2026-04-20 14:38:12'),
