(2271, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nThere are several types of football, including:\n\n1. **Association Football (Soccer)**: The most widely played version of football, played with a round ball and emphasizing kicking and heading.\n2. **American Football**: A contact team sport played with an oval-shaped ball, popular in the United States and Canada.\n3. **Rugby Football**: A full-contact team sport played with an oval-shaped ball, popular in the UK, Australia, and New Zealand.\n4. **Australian Rules Football**: A contact team sport played with an oval-shaped ball, popular in Australia.\n5. **Gaelic Football**: A contact team sport played with a round ball, popular in Ireland.\n\nSome of the most popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: An international soccer tournament held every four years.\n2. **UEFA Champions League**: A European club soccer competition.\n3. **NFL (National Football League)**: A professional American football league in the United States.\n4. **English Premier League**: A professional soccer league in England.\n5. **Super Bowl**: The annual championship game of the NFL.\n\nFootball has a massive global following, with millions of fans attending matches, watching on TV, and playing the sport at various levels.\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-20 16:33:00', '2026-04-20 16:33:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-04-20 16:33:14', '2026-04-20 16:33:14'),
(2272, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. You\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sports motorcycle produced by Yamaha Motor Company. Here are some key features and facts about the Yamaha R1:\n\n**History:** The Yamaha YZF-R1 was first introduced in 1998 and has since become one of the most popular and successful sports motorcycles in the world.\n\n**Engine:** The R1 is powered by a 998cc, liquid-cooled, inline-four cylinder engine that produces around 200 horsepower and 82 lb-ft of torque.\n\n**Performance:** The Yamaha R1 is known for its exceptional acceleration, handling, and braking performance. It can reach speeds of over 180 mph and accelerate from 0-60 mph in just 3 seconds.\n\n**Features:** The R1 features a range of advanced technologies, including:\n\n* Yamaha Chip Controlled Throttle (YCC-T) for smooth and precise throttle control\n* Yamaha Chip Controlled Intake (YCC-I) for optimized engine performance\n* Traction control system (TCS) for improved stability and control\n* ABS (Anti-lock Braking System) for enhanced braking performance\n* Suspension system with adjustable forks and shock absorber\n\n**Design:** The Yamaha R1 has a sleek and aerodynamic design, with a distinctive fairing and seat cowl. The bike features a compact and lightweight chassis, with a low seat height and an aggressive riding position.\n\n**Rivals:** The Yamaha R1 competes with other high-performance sports motorcycles, such as the Kawasaki Ninja ZX-6R, Honda CBR1000RR-R, and Suzuki GSX-R1000.\n\nOverall, the Yamaha R1 is a highly regarded and highly sought-after motorcycle that is known for its exceptional performance, handling, and features.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-20 16:42:00', '2026-04-20 16:42:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-04-20 16:42:17', '2026-04-20 16:42:17'),
(2273, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a iconic superhero from the Marvel Comics universe. Created by Stan Lee, Larry Lieber, and Don Heck, Iron Man first appeared in comic books in 1963.\n\n**The Character:**\nIron Man\'s secret identity is Tony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist who owns Stark Industries, a cutting-edge technology company. After being kidnapped and forced to build a powerful suit of armor, Tony Stark creates the Iron Man suit to escape and later uses it to fight crime and protect the world.\n\n**The Suits:**\nOver the years, Tony Stark has created numerous versions of the Iron Man suit, each with advanced features and capabilities. Some notable suits include:\n\n1. Mark I: The first Iron Man suit, built from scrap metal and used to escape captivity.\n2. Mark III: A more advanced suit with repulsor technology and a gold-titanium alloy.\n3. Mark VII: A suit with a more streamlined design and advanced AI capabilities.\n4. Mark XLV: A suit with a focus on stealth and agility.\n5. Mark LXXXV: A suit with advanced nanotechnology and AI capabilities.\n\n**The Movies:**\nIron Man has been featured in numerous movies, including:\n\n1. Iron Man (2008) - The first movie in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man.\n2. Iron Man 2 (2010) - The sequel to the first movie, with Tony Stark facing government pressure to share his technology.\n3. Iron Man 3 (2013) - The third movie in the Iron Man series, with Tony Stark facing a personal crisis and a terrorist threat.\n4. Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015) - Iron Man joins the Avengers to fight against the artificial intelligence Ultron.\n5. Captain America: Civil War (2016) - Iron Man clashes with Captain America over the Sokovia Accords.\n6. Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) - Iron Man mentors Peter Parker, aka Spider-Man.\n7. Avengers: Infinity War (2018) - Iron Man plays a key role in the battle against Thanos.\n8. Avengers: Endgame (2019) - Iron Man\'s final appearance in the MCU, with a poignant conclusion to his story.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has become an iconic character in popular culture, symbolizing innovation, intelligence, and heroism. The character has inspired numerous adaptations, including TV shows, video games, and merchandise. Robert Downey Jr.\'s portrayal of Tony Stark/Iron Man is widely regarded as one of the greatest superhero performances of all time.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-20 17:30:00', '2026-04-20 17:30:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-04-20 17:30:16', '2026-04-20 17:30:16'),
