(2331, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '\"Empowering Your Business with a Roaring Strategy\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned that success requires a combination of fierce passion and calculated risk-taking. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* Set clear goals and priorities to drive your business forward\n* Foster a culture of innovation and creativity to stay ahead of the competition\n* Develop a strong online presence to reach new customers and build your brand\n* Continuously monitor and adapt to changes in the market to stay ahead of the curve\n* Build a team of dedicated and passionate individuals who share your vision\n\nBy following these principles, you can unleash your inner dragon and achieve greatness in your business endeavors.\n\n#BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #MarketingStrategy #DragonPower #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #OnlinePresence #BrandBuilding\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 13:03:00', '2026-04-22 13:03:12', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-04-22 13:03:12', '2026-04-22 13:03:12'),
