(2333, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Introducing Dragon Enterprises**\n\nAs a leading business in the industry, we understand the importance of connecting with our audience. Here are a few relatable points about our brand:\n\n* We strive for excellence in everything we do\n* Our team is dedicated to providing top-notch services\n* We believe in building strong relationships with our clients\n* Our goal is to make a positive impact on the community\n\n#DragonEnterprises #BusinessExcellence #CommunityFirst #InnovationMatters #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalServices #RelatableContent', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 14:00:00', '2026-04-22 14:00:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-22 14:00:18', '2026-04-22 14:00:18'),
(2334, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Empowering Entrepreneurs: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Den**\n\nAs a dragon and a seasoned entrepreneur, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed in business. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Be fearless**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things. It\'s often the biggest risks that lead to the greatest rewards.\n* **Stay adaptable**: The business landscape is constantly changing, so it\'s essential to be able to pivot and adjust your strategy as needed.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision and are passionate about your mission.\n* **Focus on innovation**: Stay ahead of the curve by continuously innovating and improving your products or services.\n* **Learn from failure**: Don\'t be discouraged by setbacks or failures. Instead, use them as opportunities to learn and grow.\n\n#Entrepreneurship #BusinessTips #DragonApproved #InnovationNation #RiskAndReward #TeamWorkMakesTheDreamWork #FailureIsNotTheEnd #TrendingNow #BusinessSuccess #MotivationMonday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 14:37:00', '2026-04-22 14:37:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-22 14:37:17', '2026-04-22 14:37:17'),
(2335, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', 'Here\'s a sample Facebook post for a business/creator with the brand name \"Dragon\" and a professional tone:\n\n**Post:** \n\"Monday Motivation from Dragon \nHere are some key takeaways to kick-start your week:\n* Set clear goals and prioritize them\n* Break down large tasks into smaller, manageable chunks\n* Stay focused and avoid distractions\n* Take breaks to recharge and refuel\n* Celebrate your accomplishments, no matter how small\n\nAt Dragon, we believe in empowering you to achieve your full potential. Share your goals and motivations with us in the comments below!\n\n#MondayMotivation #ProductivityHacks #GoalSetting #Focus #MotivationMonday #Dragon #Trending #BusinessTips #SuccessMindset\"\n\nThis post aims to provide value to the audience, while also promoting the Dragon brand and its values. The use of hashtags, including trending ones, can help increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 14:38:00', '2026-04-22 14:38:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-22 14:38:15', '2026-04-22 14:38:15'),
(2336, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**\"Breathing Fire into Your Day\"**\n\nAs a dragon, I understand the importance of staying motivated and focused. Here are some relatable points to help you tackle your day:\n\n* Set goals that ignite your passion, just like my fiery breath ignites the flames\n* Prioritize tasks that fuel your growth, just as I prioritize my treasure hoard\n* Take breaks to recharge, just as I take a moment to soar through the skies\n* Surround yourself with people who support and encourage you, just as my dragon friends have my back\n* Remember to stay adaptable and open to new opportunities, just as I adapt to changing environments\n\n#MotivationMonday #DragonInspiration #ProductivityTips #GoalSetting #SelfCare #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #DragonSquad #FireUpYourDay', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 14:39:00', '2026-04-22 14:39:11', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-22 14:39:11', '2026-04-22 14:39:11'),
(2337, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Journey**\n\nAs we navigate the complexities of our personal and professional lives, it\'s essential to draw inspiration from the most unlikely of creatures - the dragon. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s journey that can help us grow and thrive:\n\n* **Resilience is key**: Dragons are known for their ability to withstand intense heat and adversity, reminding us to stay strong in the face of challenges.\n* **Protection and preservation**: Dragons are fiercely protective of their territories and the people they care about, teaching us the importance of safeguarding our own well-being and the well-being of those around us.\n* **Growth and transformation**: As dragons shed their skin and evolve, they remind us that growth and change are essential to our own personal and professional development.\n* **Passion and drive**: The fiery passion of the dragon inspires us to pursue our goals and dreams with unwavering dedication and enthusiasm.\n\n#DragonInspiration #ResilienceMatters #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #LessonsFromMythology #GrowthMindset #SuccessTips', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 15:10:00', '2026-04-22 15:10:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-04-22 15:10:18', '2026-04-22 15:10:18'),
(2338, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and leadership. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define your objectives and prioritize your tasks to achieve success\n* **Stay focused**: Avoid distractions and maintain your concentration to reach your targets\n* **Be adaptable**: Be prepared to adjust your strategy as circumstances change\n* **Lead with confidence**: Inspire others with your vision and guidance\n* **Continuously learn**: Stay updated with the latest trends and best practices to stay ahead of the curve\n\n#DragonMindset #LeadershipGoals #SuccessTips #MotivationMonday #ProductivityHacks #BusinessInspiration #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #GoalSetting #Focus #Adaptability #ConfidenceIsKey #LifelongLearning', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 15:14:00', '2026-04-22 15:14:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-04-22 15:14:16', '2026-04-22 15:14:16'),
(2339, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', 'As a dragon, I understand the importance of staying connected with my fiery followers. Here\'s a relatable caption for my Facebook post:\n\n\"As a dragon, I can relate to:\n* Feeling like I\'m on fire (literally)\n* Needing a treasure hoard to feel secure\n* Having a burning passion for adventure\n* Being misunderstood by those who don\'t know me\n* Having a roar that can be heard for miles\n\nLet\'s connect and share our fiery experiences! #DragonsOfFacebook #FireBreathingFrenzy #TreasureHuntersUnite #ScalesAndTales #MythicalCreatures #LegendaryBeings #FantasyFiction #DragonSquad #FireAndIce #TrendingNow\"\n\nThis caption is professional, relatable, and includes trending hashtags to reach a wider audience on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 15:24:00', '2026-04-22 15:24:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-04-22 15:24:16', '2026-04-22 15:24:16'),
