(2342, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a large language model, I don\'t have the capability to directly create images. But I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends, and you can use your imagination to visualize it.\n\n**Image Description:**\n\nThe image is a high-resolution, 4K-quality photo taken with a professional camera. It\'s a bright and sunny day, and the scene is set in a trendy outdoor cafe or rooftop bar.\n\nThe man, likely in his mid-twenties to early thirties, is sitting on a comfortable couch or armchair, surrounded by his friends. He\'s wearing a stylish outfit, including a white or light-colored shirt, dark jeans, and sleek sneakers. His hair is well-groomed, and he has a friendly, approachable smile on his face.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress. She\'s laughing and chatting with the man, and her eyes are sparkling with amusement. On his right is another friend, a tall and lanky guy with a messy beard and a baseball cap. He\'s holding a cold beer and grinning from ear to ear.\n\nIn the background, there\'s a stunning cityscape with sleek skyscrapers, bustling streets, and a few trees or plants adding a touch of greenery to the scene. The atmosphere is lively and vibrant, with a few other people milling about in the distance.\n\nThe photo is taken from a slightly elevated angle, looking down on the group of friends. The lighting is natural and warm, with a few subtle shadows adding depth and texture to the image. The overall mood is one of relaxation, camaraderie, and joy.\n\n**Image Specifications:**\n\n* Resolution: 3840 x 2160 pixels (4K)\n* Aspect Ratio: 16:9\n* File Format: JPEG or PNG\n* Color Profile: sRGB or Adobe RGB\n* Image Size: Approximately 2-3 MB\n\nI hope this description helps you visualize the image! Let me know if you have any further requests or questions.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 16:06:00', '2026-04-22 16:06:17', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-04-22 16:06:17', '2026-04-22 16:06:17'),
(2343, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a visually stunning and cinematic moment, perfect for aesthetic photography. Let\'s break down the elements that make this image so captivating:\n\n1. **Girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain**: The transparent umbrella adds a unique twist to the traditional rain scene. It allows the viewer to see the girl\'s face and outfit while still conveying the rainy atmosphere. The light rain creates a sense of gentle movement and tranquility.\n\n2. **Neon reflections on wet street**: The neon lights reflecting off the wet street create a kaleidoscope of colors, adding a futuristic and urban feel to the image. This element also enhances the overall cinematic mood, reminiscent of scenes from movies like \"Blade Runner\" or \"Ghost in the Shell.\"\n\n3. **Aesthetic photography**: The focus on aesthetics in this scene means that every element, from the girl\'s outfit to the neon reflections, is carefully considered to create a visually pleasing image. This style of photography often emphasizes beauty, form, and the emotional impact of the scene.\n\n4. **Soft bokeh lights**: The use of soft bokeh (out-of-focus areas) for the lights creates a dreamy, ethereal quality. This technique blurs the harsh edges of the neon lights, turning them into soft, glowing orbs that add to the overall ambiance of the scene.\n\n5. **Fashionable outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is a key element in this scene, as it adds a layer of storytelling and character development. The choice of clothing can tell us about the girl\'s personality, style, and background, making her more than just a subject in a photograph.\n\n6. **Cinematic mood**: The combination of the rainy night, neon lights, and the girl\'s solitary walk creates a cinematic mood that is both melancholic and beautiful. This atmosphere is reminiscent of movie scenes where characters are lost in thought, reflecting on their lives or relationships.\n\n7. **High-detail**: The emphasis on high detail means that the image is rich in texture and visual information. From the droplets of rain on the umbrella to the intricate patterns of the girl\'s clothing, every element is captured with clarity, inviting the viewer to explore the scene more closely.\n\nIn summary, the scene of a girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain, set against a backdrop of neon reflections on a wet street, is a masterpiece of aesthetic photography. It combines elements of fashion, cinematography, and atmospheric lighting to create an image that is both visually stunning and emotionally engaging.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 16:11:00', '2026-04-22 16:11:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-04-22 16:11:15', '2026-04-22 16:11:15'),
(2344, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'It seems like you\'re just testing the waters. If you have a question or need help with something, feel free to ask, and I\'ll do my best to assist you.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 16:33:00', '2026-04-22 16:33:17', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Tester?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 48, '2026-04-22 16:33:17', '2026-04-22 16:33:17'),
(2345, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **Objective**: The objective of football is to score more goals than the opposing team within the 90-minute playing time.\n2. **Players**: Each team has 11 players, including a goalkeeper, defenders, midfielders, and forwards.\n3. **Equipment**: The game is played with a round ball, and players can use any part of their body except their hands and arms to control and move the ball.\n4. **Rules**: The game is governed by a set of rules, including offside, fouls, and free kicks.\n5. **Tactics**: Teams employ various tactics, such as formations, strategies, and player positions, to outmaneuver their opponents.\n\nSome popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most widely viewed and followed sporting event in the world, held every four years.\n2. **UEFA Champions League**: A annual club competition featuring top European teams.\n3. **English Premier League**: A professional league in England, considered one of the most competitive and popular leagues in the world.\n\nFootball has a massive global following, with millions of fans attending matches, watching on TV, and playing the game at various levels, from amateur to professional.\n\nAre you a football fan? Do you have a favorite team or player?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 16:33:00', '2026-04-22 16:33:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-04-22 16:33:17', '2026-04-22 16:33:17'),
(2346, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. You\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sport bike produced by Yamaha. Here are some key features and specs:\n\n**Overview:**\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a 998cc liquid-cooled, inline-four cylinder engine motorcycle designed for speed and agility. It\'s known for its exceptional handling, braking, and acceleration.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Engine:** 998cc, liquid-cooled, inline-four cylinder engine producing 200 horsepower @ 13,500 rpm.\n2. **Transmission:** 6-speed manual transmission with a multi-plate slipper clutch.\n3. **Suspension:** Upside-down fork (front) and monoshock (rear) with adjustable damping and spring preload.\n4. **Brakes:** Dual 320mm discs (front) with radial-mounted calipers and a 220mm disc (rear).\n5. **Electronics:** Advanced electronics package, including traction control, slide control, and launch control.\n\n**Specifications:**\n\n* Seat Height: 32.7 inches (830mm)\n* Wheelbase: 55.3 inches (1,405mm)\n* Fuel Capacity: 4.5 gallons (17 liters)\n* Dry Weight: 439 pounds (199 kg)\n* Wet Weight: 467 pounds (212 kg)\n\n**Riding Experience:**\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is designed for experienced riders who demand high-performance capabilities. It\'s a track-focused bike that\'s also suitable for street riding, offering exceptional handling and agility.\n\nPlease note that the specifications and features may vary depending on the model year and region. If you have any specific questions or would like more information, feel free to ask.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 16:42:00', '2026-04-22 16:42:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-04-22 16:42:19', '2026-04-22 16:42:19'),
(2347, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. Created by writer and editor Stan Lee, with the help of artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby, the character first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense\" #39 in March 1963.\n\nThe alter ego of Iron Man is Tony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist who created a powered exoskeleton suit to save his life after being kidnapped and injured. The suit, which has undergone numerous upgrades and redesigns over the years, provides Tony with superhuman strength, flight, and a range of other abilities.\n\nSome of the key features of Iron Man\'s suit include:\n\n1. **Repulsor technology**: A high-energy propulsion system that allows Iron Man to fly and project energy blasts.\n2. **Advanced sensors and AI**: The suit is equipped with advanced sensors and an artificial intelligence system, known as JARVIS (later renamed FRIDAY), which helps Tony navigate and control the suit.\n3. **Superhuman strength**: The suit\'s exoskeleton provides Tony with enhanced strength, allowing him to lift and move heavy objects.\n4. **Energy shielding**: The suit can generate a protective energy shield to deflect attacks and protect Tony from harm.\n\nIron Man has been a member of several superhero teams, including the Avengers and the Illuminati. He has also been the subject of numerous comic book series, animated TV shows, and live-action movies, including the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) films starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man.\n\nSome notable Iron Man storylines and arcs include:\n\n1. **The Iron Man armor**: The evolution of the Iron Man suit, from its initial Mark I design to the latest advanced models.\n2. **The Avengers**: Iron Man\'s role as a founding member of the Avengers and his relationships with other team members, such as Captain America and Thor.\n3. **The Civil War**: A storyline in which Iron Man and Captain America clash over the registration of superheroes, leading to a divided Avengers team.\n4. **The Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU)**: The Iron Man movies, including \"Iron Man\" (2008), \"Iron Man 2\" (2010), and \"Iron Man 3\" (2013), as well as his appearances in other MCU films, such as \"The Avengers\" (2012) and \"Avengers: Endgame\" (2019).\n\nOverall, Iron Man is a beloved and iconic superhero character, known for his intelligence, wit, and innovative technology.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 17:30:00', '2026-04-22 17:30:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-04-22 17:30:20', '2026-04-22 17:30:20'),
