emes or emotions that this image could evoke include:\n\n* Confidence and self-assurance\n* Success and achievement\n* Determination and perseverance\n* Taking risks and stepping out of one\'s comfort zone\n* Being a leader or a game-changer\n\nOverall, the image of a professional businessman standing confidently on a basketball court with a ball in his hand, stadium lights behind him, and dramatic lighting is a powerful and compelling one. It conveys a sense of success, confidence, and determination, and is sure to inspire and motivate anyone who sees it.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-22 17:45:00', '2026-04-22 17:45:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-22 17:45:18', '2026-04-22 17:45:18'),
