(2370, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon**\n\nAs a symbol of strength and resilience, I, a dragon, have learned valuable lessons that can be applied to our personal and professional lives. Here are a few key takeaways:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Just like how I brave the fiercest of storms, we too can face our challenges head-on with confidence and determination.\n* **Passion and drive**: My fiery spirit is a reminder to pursue our passions with unwavering dedication and enthusiasm.\n* **Protection and care**: As a guardian of my territory, I prioritize the well-being and safety of those around me, demonstrating the importance of responsibility and compassion.\n* **Growth and evolution**: Through my ability to adapt and transform, I show that we can always learn, grow, and become better versions of ourselves.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #LessonsFromMythology #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #CourageOverFear #PassionDriven #ResilienceMatters #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #DragonSquad #MythicalMotivation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-23 14:37:00', '2026-04-23 14:37:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-23 14:37:14', '2026-04-23 14:37:14'),
(2371, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Dragon\'s Den: Empowering Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a symbol of power and resilience, we\'re excited to share our latest insights on what it takes to succeed in the business world. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Innovate and adapt**: Stay ahead of the curve by embracing new technologies and trends.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision.\n* **Take calculated risks**: Don\'t be afraid to step out of your comfort zone and try new things.\n* **Learn from failure**: Use setbacks as opportunities to grow and improve.\n* **Stay focused and motivated**: Keep your eyes on the prize and remind yourself why you started in the first place.\n\nJoin the conversation and share your own entrepreneurial journey with us! #Entrepreneurship #BusinessTips #Motivation #Innovation #SuccessStory #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #DragonInspiration #Leadership #GrowthMindset #CareerAdvice', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-23 14:38:00', '2026-04-23 14:38:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-23 14:38:24', '2026-04-23 14:38:24'),
(2372, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and drive. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* Set your goals ablaze: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and chase your aspirations with unrelenting passion.\n* Build a fortress of resilience: Life can be tough, but with a strong foundation, you can weather any storm.\n* Breathe fire into your creativity: Don\'t be afraid to think outside the box and innovate.\n* Hoard your time wisely: Prioritize what\'s truly important and make the most of every moment.\n* Soar to new heights: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and push beyond your limits.\n\n#MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #DragonInspiration #FireWithin #GoalSetting #Resilience #CreativityUnleashed #TimeManagement #RiskTakers #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #InspirationalQuotes #ProfessionalGrowth #BusinessTips #DragonBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-23 14:39:00', '2026-04-23 14:39:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-23 14:39:18', '2026-04-23 14:39:18'),
(2373, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, we\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and leadership. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set goals and chase them with fire**: Don\'t let obstacles hold you back from achieving your dreams.\n* **Protect and nurture your tribe**: Surround yourself with people who support and uplift you.\n* **Innovate and adapt**: Stay ahead of the curve by embracing new ideas and technologies.\n* **Roar with confidence**: Believe in yourself and your abilities, and don\'t be afraid to show it.\n\n#DragonsDen #EntrepreneurMindset #LeadershipLessons #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #BusinessInspiration #ProfessionalGrowth #FacebookBusiness #DragonSlayingGoals #FireUpYourPassion', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-23 15:10:00', '2026-04-23 15:10:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-04-23 15:10:19', '2026-04-23 15:10:19'),
(2374, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about passion, perseverance, and strategy. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on its next treasure, you should define your objectives and prioritize them.\n* **Be adaptable**: Dragons are known for their ability to navigate through changing environments, and you should be prepared to pivot when circumstances shift.\n* **Build a strong community**: A dragon\'s lair is often filled with loyal companions, and you should surround yourself with people who support and motivate you.\n* **Continuously learn and improve**: Dragons are always refining their skills, whether it\'s mastering fire-breathing or navigating complex caverns, and you should strive to stay up-to-date with the latest trends and best practices.\n\nBy embracing these principles, you can unlock your full potential and achieve greatness. Remember to stay focused, stay fierce, and always keep your eyes on the prize!\n\n#DragonsDen #BusinessTips #MotivationMonday #Entrepreneurship #SuccessStory #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #CareerGrowth #InspirationalQuotes #LeadershipLessons #PersonalGrowth #GoalSetting #ProductivityHacks #InnovationNation #BusinessInspiration #MotivationalMonday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-23 15:14:00', '2026-04-23 15:14:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-04-23 15:14:21', '2026-04-23 15:14:21'),
(2375, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about passion, dedication, and strategy. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define your vision and objectives, and make sure they align with your values and mission.\n* **Develop a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and motivated individuals who share your passion and vision.\n* **Innovate and adapt**: Stay ahead of the curve by embracing new technologies and trends, and be willing to pivot when necessary.\n* **Build strong relationships**: Foster meaningful connections with your customers, partners, and community to build trust and loyalty.\n* **Stay focused and disciplined**: Maintain a strong work ethic and stay committed to your goals, even in the face of challenges and setbacks.\n\nBy following these principles, you can unlock your full potential and achieve greatness. Remember to stay true to yourself and your values, and always keep your eyes on the prize.\n\n#Trending #BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #Motivation #Innovation #Teamwork #GoalSetting #Focus #Discipline #Passion #Dedication #Strategy #DragonFire #BusinessTips #SuccessTips #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #CareerGrowth #PersonalGrowth #Inspiration #MotivationalQuotes #BusinessQuotes #LeadershipQuotes', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-23 15:24:00', '2026-04-23 15:24:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-04-23 15:24:18', '2026-04-23 15:24:18'),
