(2440, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**\"Breathing Fire into Your Business: 5 Key Takeaways\"**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like I set my sights on a treasure hoard, you should aim high and strive for excellence in your industry.\n* **Develop a strong brand identity**: My scales shine like gold, and your brand should have a unique and recognizable presence in the market.\n* **Build a loyal community**: My fiery breath may be intimidating, but it also protects and serves my loyal followers - just like how you should nurture and engage with your customers.\n* **Stay adaptable and resilient**: In a changing business landscape, you must be able to pivot and adjust your strategy, just like how I navigate through treacherous terrain.\n* **Continuously learn and improve**: Even a dragon like me must stay up-to-date with the latest trends and best practices to stay ahead of the curve.\n\n#BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #DragonWisdom #MarketingStrategy #BrandBuilding #CommunityFirst #Resilience #ContinuousLearning #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #SmallBusinessTips #BusinessGrowth #SuccessMindset', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-25 15:24:00', '2026-04-25 15:24:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-04-25 15:24:16', '2026-04-25 15:24:16'),
