(2459, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord, smuggler, and leader of the Medellín cartel. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals of the 20th century.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and was raised by his mother, Hermilda, after his father abandoned the family. Escobar became involved in crime at a young age, starting with small-time thefts and eventually moving on to more serious offenses like kidnapping and murder.\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar began to build his cocaine empire, initially working as a smuggler for other cartels. He quickly rose through the ranks and formed his own organization, the Medellín cartel, which became one of the most powerful and feared cartels in the world.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel dominated the global cocaine trade, smuggling massive quantities of the drug into the United States, Europe, and other countries. The cartel\'s operations were marked by violence, intimidation, and corruption, with Escobar using his wealth and influence to bribe officials, silence opponents, and eliminate rivals.\n\nAt the height of his power, Escobar was estimated to be worth over $30 billion, making him one of the richest men in the world. He lived a lavish lifestyle, owning multiple mansions, luxury cars, and private planes.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by brutal violence and terror. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including police officers, politicians, judges, and ordinary citizens. His cartel was known for its use of car bombs, assassinations, and other forms of violence to intimidate and eliminate opponents.\n\nOne of the most notorious incidents attributed to Escobar was the bombing of Avianca Flight 203, which killed 110 people in 1989. The bombing was intended to kill a Colombian presidential candidate, César Gaviria, who was not on the plane.\n\n**Pursuit and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a massive manhunt for Escobar. The hunt was led by the Colombian police, with the support of the US DEA and other international agencies.\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar\'s 44th birthday, he was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín. His death marked the end of an era for the Medellín cartel, and his legacy continues to fascinate and horrify people around the world.\n\n**Legacy and Cultural Impact**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s life and death have been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His story has captivated audiences worldwide, and his name has become synonymous with crime, violence, and excess.\n\nDespite his notorious reputation, Escobar remains a complex and fascinating figure, with many Colombians still viewing him as a folk hero or a symbol of resistance against government corruption and inequality.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his love of animals and had a private zoo at his Hacienda Napoles estate, which included elephants, lions, and other exotic animals.\n* He was a skilled soccer player and even built a soccer field at his estate, where he would play with his friends and family.\n* Escobar was a devout Catholic and had a chapel built at his estate, where he would often pray and seek spiritual guidance.\n* He was estimated to have earned over $420 million per week at the height of his power, making him one of the richest people in the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 10:50:00', '2026-04-26 10:50:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-26 10:50:22', '2026-04-26 10:50:22'),
(2460, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord, smuggler, and leader of the Medellín cartel. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and powerful criminals of the 20th century.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a middle-class family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, which would later shape his worldview and drive his actions.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s involvement in organized crime began in the 1970s, when he started smuggling cocaine into the United States. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, which was founded by Carlos Lehder and later led by Escobar. The cartel\'s success was fueled by the growing demand for cocaine in the United States, and Escobar\'s cunning and ruthlessness helped him consolidate power and eliminate his rivals.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. The cartel\'s operations spanned the globe, with tentacles in Colombia, the United States, Mexico, and other countries. Escobar\'s network of smugglers, assassins, and corrupt officials allowed him to evade law enforcement and expand his empire.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by brutal violence and terror. He ordered the assassination of politicians, judges, police officers, and journalists who opposed him or threatened his interests. The cartel was responsible for numerous bombings, kidnappings, and massacres, including the 1989 bombing of Avianca Flight 203, which killed 110 people.\n\n**The Hunt for Escobar**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. The hunt for Escobar became a national obsession, with the media and the public eager for news of his whereabouts.\n\n**Death**\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín. He was 44 years old at the time of his death. The circumstances of his death are still disputed, with some claiming that he was executed by the police or that he took his own life to avoid capture.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning leader who built a vast empire through violence and intimidation. However, he is also seen as a product of Colombia\'s troubled history and a symbol of the country\'s struggle with poverty, inequality, and corruption.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s life and legacy have been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His story continues to fascinate and horrify people around the world, serving as a cautionary tale about the dangers of organized crime and the corrupting influence of power.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a sprawling estate called Hacienda Napoles.\n* He was a skilled manipulator who used his charisma and wealth to build a network of loyal followers and corrupt officials.\n* Escobar was responsible for the construction of many social projects, including housing, roads, and schools, which earned him a degree of popularity among some Colombians.\n* He was a prolific killer, with estimates suggesting that he was responsible for the deaths of over 4,000 people during his reign.\n* Escobar\'s net worth at the time of his death was estimated to be around $30 billion, making him one of the richest people in the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 10:53:00', '2026-04-26 10:53:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-26 10:53:20', '2026-04-26 10:53:20'),
(2461, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing Your Inner Strength**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about staying focused and driven. Here are some key takeaways to help you unleash your inner power:\n\n* Set clear goals and priorities to achieve success\n* Stay adaptable and open to new opportunities\n* Surround yourself with a supportive community that encourages growth\n* Continuously learn and improve to stay ahead of the curve\n* Believe in yourself and your abilities to overcome any obstacle\n\n#MotivationMonday #BusinessTips #EntrepreneurLife #SuccessStory #DragonInspiration #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalGrowth #InnerStrength #GoalOriented #NewBeginnings #InnovationNation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 11:18:00', '2026-04-26 11:18:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-04-26 11:18:20', '2026-04-26 11:18:20'),
(2462, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Men\'s Party Wear: A Guide to Dressing to Impress**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, the options are endless. From formal suits to stylish casual wear, there\'s something for every occasion and personal style. Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n### **Formal Party Wear**\n\n1. **Suits**: A classic choice for formal parties, suits come in a variety of colors and styles, including black tie, white tie, and business attire.\n2. **Tuxedos**: Perfect for black-tie events, tuxedos are a timeless and elegant choice.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A crisp, white dress shirt is a staple for formal parties.\n4. **Dress Pants**: Formal dress pants, such as wool or cotton, are a must-have for formal parties.\n5. **Blazers**: A navy or charcoal blazer can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit.\n\n### **Casual Party Wear**\n\n1. **Dress Jeans**: A pair of dark wash dress jeans is a versatile and stylish choice for casual parties.\n2. **Button-Down Shirts**: A button-down shirt in a bold color or pattern can add a pop of personality to an outfit.\n3. **Polo Shirts**: A classic polo shirt is a great choice for casual parties.\n4. **Leather Jackets**: A leather jacket can add an edgy touch to any outfit.\n5. **Chinos**: Chinos are a great alternative to dress pants and can be dressed up or down.\n\n### **Accessories**\n\n1. **Watches**: A sleek watch can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of personality to a dress shirt.\n3. **Belt**: A leather belt can add a touch of elegance to any outfit.\n4. **Shoes**: Dress shoes, such as oxfords or loafers, are a must-have for formal parties.\n5. **Sunglasses**: A pair of stylish sunglasses can add a cool touch to any outfit.\n\n### **Tips and Tricks**\n\n1. **Dress for the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the party\'s dress code and theme.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure your clothes fit well and are comfortable.\n3. **Accessories can make or break an outfit**: Choose accessories that complement your outfit and add a touch of personality.\n4. **Grooming is key**: Make sure to groom yourself well, including trimming your nails and shaving.\n5. **Confidence is key**: Own your outfit and have fun!\n\nSome popular party wear styles for men include:\n\n* **Slim fit**: A slim fit suit or dress pants can create a sleek and modern look.\n* **Classic fit**: A classic fit suit or dress pants can create a timeless and elegant look.\n* **Streetwear**: A streetwear-inspired outfit, including sneakers and a hoodie, can create a cool and casual look.\n\nUltimately, the key to pulling off a great party wear outfit is to feel confident and comfortable in what you\'re wearing. Experiment with different styles and find what works best for you!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 12:40:00', '2026-04-26 12:40:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-04-26 12:40:18', '2026-04-26 12:40:18'),
(2463, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn on formal occasions, such as business meetings, job interviews, weddings, and other special events. Here are some key features of a formal shirt for men:\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: A formal shirt typically has a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts usually have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are often made from high-quality cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Weave**: The weave of a formal shirt is usually tight and smooth, such as broadcloth or pinpoint.\n5. **Color**: Formal shirts are often white, light blue, or other muted colors.\n6. **Fit**: A formal shirt should fit well, with a fitted sleeve and a tailored body.\n\n**Types of formal shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress shirt**: A classic formal shirt with a point collar and French cuffs.\n2. **Business shirt**: A slightly less formal shirt with a spread collar and button cuffs.\n3. **Evening shirt**: A formal shirt with a wingtip collar and French cuffs, designed for black-tie events.\n4. **Tuxedo shirt**: A formal shirt with a wingtip collar and stud buttons, designed to be worn with a tuxedo.\n\n**Tips for choosing a formal shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a shirt that is appropriate for the occasion.\n2. **Think about the color**: White and light blue are classic choices, but you can also consider other muted colors.\n3. **Pay attention to the fabric**: Look for high-quality fabrics that will breathe well and feel comfortable.\n4. **Make sure it fits**: A well-fitting shirt is essential for a formal look.\n5. **Accessories**: Consider the accessories you will be wearing with the shirt, such as a tie, cufflinks, and a watch.\n\n**Popular brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: Known for their high-quality dress shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French brand that offers luxurious and elegant formal shirts.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: An American brand that offers classic and stylish formal shirts.\n4. **Hugo Boss**: A German brand that offers modern and sophisticated formal shirts.\n5. **Armani**: An Italian brand that offers stylish and elegant formal shirts.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 12:56:00', '2026-04-26 12:56:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-26 12:56:19', '2026-04-26 12:56:19'),
(2464, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**\"Unleashing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Den\"**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success, perseverance, and fiery passion. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s hoarding treasure or conquering new territories, set your sights on what you want to achieve.\n* **Stay focused and determined**: With great power comes great responsibility. Stay committed to your goals and don\'t let obstacles get in your way.\n* **Surround yourself with a supportive team**: Whether it\'s a loyal group of dragon friends or a trusted advisor, having a strong support system can make all the difference.\n* **Continuously learn and adapt**: The world is constantly changing, and as a dragon, you need to stay ahead of the curve. Keep learning, growing, and evolving to stay on top.\n\n#DragonSquad #BusinessTips #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #SuccessStories #FireBreathing #EntrepreneurLife #LeadershipLessons #GoalOriented #Determination #TeamWorkMakesTheDreamWork #StayFocused #LearnAndAdapt #GrowAndEvolve #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 13:03:00', '2026-04-26 13:03:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-04-26 13:03:16', '2026-04-26 13:03:16'),
