(2467, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Empowering Entrepreneurs: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Lair**\n\nAs a seasoned business leader, I\'ve learned valuable lessons from my journey as a dragon. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Risk management**: Don\'t be afraid to take calculated risks to achieve your goals.\n* **Adaptability**: Stay agile and adapt to changing market conditions to stay ahead of the competition.\n* **Strategic planning**: Develop a clear vision and strategy to achieve success.\n* **Resilience**: Bounce back from setbacks and failures, and use them as opportunities to learn and grow.\n* **Innovation**: Stay ahead of the curve by embracing new technologies and innovative ideas.\n\nJoin me on this journey to success and let\'s soar to new heights together! #Trending #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #DragonInspiration #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #InnovationNation #RiskAndReward #AdaptAndThrive', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 14:37:00', '2026-04-26 14:37:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-26 14:37:15', '2026-04-26 14:37:15'),
