(2478, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **Objective**: The objective of football is to score more goals than the opposing team within the 90-minute playing time.\n2. **Players**: Each team has 11 players, including a goalkeeper, defenders, midfielders, and forwards.\n3. **Equipment**: The game is played with a round ball, and players wear shoes with studs, shin guards, and other protective gear.\n4. **Rules**: The game is governed by a set of rules, including offside, fouls, and penalty kicks.\n5. **Popular leagues**: Some of the most popular football leagues include the English Premier League, Spanish La Liga, German Bundesliga, Italian Serie A, and the UEFA Champions League.\n\nSome of the most famous football tournaments include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most widely viewed and followed sporting event in the world, held every four years.\n2. **UEFA European Championship**: A tournament held every four years, featuring national teams from Europe.\n3. **Copa America**: A tournament held every four years, featuring national teams from South America.\n\nSome of the most successful football clubs include:\n\n1. **Manchester United**: An English club with a record 20 league titles.\n2. **Real Madrid**: A Spanish club with a record 13 European Cup/Champions League titles.\n3. **Barcelona**: A Spanish club with a record 26 league titles and 5 European Cup/Champions League titles.\n\nSome of the most famous football players include:\n\n1. **Lionel Messi**: An Argentine forward widely regarded as one of the greatest players of all time.\n2. **Cristiano Ronaldo**: A Portuguese forward who has won numerous titles and individual awards.\n3. **Diego Maradona**: An Argentine midfielder who led his country to World Cup victory in 1986.\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 16:33:00', '2026-04-26 16:33:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-04-26 16:33:21', '2026-04-26 16:33:21'),
(2479, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. You\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a popular sport bike manufactured by Yamaha Motor Company. \n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha YZF-R1:\n\n1. **Engine**: 998cc, liquid-cooled, 4-stroke, DOHC, 16-valve, in-line four-cylinder engine.\n2. **Power**: Produces 200 horsepower at 13,500 rpm and 82.9 lb-ft of torque at 11,500 rpm.\n3. **Transmission**: 6-speed manual transmission with a multi-plate slipper clutch.\n4. **Chassis**: Aluminum Deltabox frame with a swingarm and a rear shock absorber.\n5. **Brakes**: Dual 320mm hydraulic disc brakes in the front and a 220mm hydraulic disc brake in the rear.\n6. **Suspension**: 43mm inverted fork in the front and a rear shock absorber with a linkage.\n7. **Electronics**: Features advanced electronics, including traction control, slide control, lift control, and a quickshifter.\n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is known for its exceptional performance, handling, and braking capabilities, making it a favorite among sport bike enthusiasts and track riders.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 16:42:00', '2026-04-26 16:42:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-04-26 16:42:16', '2026-04-26 16:42:16'),
(2480, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby. He first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense #39\" in March 1963.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nIron Man\'s secret identity is Tony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist who is the CEO of Stark Industries, a cutting-edge technology company. After being kidnapped by a group of terrorists, Tony Stark is forced to create a powerful suit of armor to save his life. He uses this suit to escape and later perfects it, becoming the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s powers come from his advanced suit of armor, which is equipped with a range of technologies, including:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight capabilities\n* Energy projection (repulsor beams)\n* Advanced sensors and scanning technology\n* Artificial intelligence (JARVIS, later FRIDAY)\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a complex character with a combination of traits, including:\n\n* Genius-level intellect and inventor\n* Charismatic and confident\n* Self-centered and arrogant\n* Witty and sarcastic\n* Loyal and protective of those he cares about\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been featured in several movies, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\n**Actor:**\nThe character of Tony Stark/Iron Man has been played by Robert Downey Jr. in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) movies.\n\n**Impact:**\nIron Man has had a significant impact on popular culture, inspiring countless fans around the world with his intelligence, wit, and bravery. The character has also spawned numerous merchandise, including toys, video games, and clothing.\n\nWhat would you like to know about Iron Man?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 17:30:00', '2026-04-26 17:30:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-04-26 17:30:17', '2026-04-26 17:30:17'),
(2481, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and captivating visual representation of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that contribute to this cinematic-style portrait:\n\n**Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a tailored suit, exudes confidence and authority. The fact that he\'s standing on a basketball court, a domain typically associated with athletes, suggests that he\'s a high-achiever who can thrive in multiple environments. His confident stance, with the ball in hand, implies that he\'s ready to take on any challenge.\n\n**Lighting:**\nThe dramatic lighting, with stadium lights behind him, creates a sense of depth and adds to the overall cinematic feel. The lighting is likely a combination of warm and cool tones, with the stadium lights casting a bright, cool glow, while the subject\'s face and suit are illuminated by a warmer, more golden light. This contrast creates a visually appealing and dynamic image.\n\n**Composition:**\nThe composition of the image is likely carefully considered to convey a sense of power and success. The subject is placed in the center of the frame, with the basketball court and stadium lights receding into the background. This creates a sense of depth and emphasizes the subject\'s importance. The ball in his hand serves as a symbol of his ability to take control and achieve his goals.\n\n**Color Palette:**\nThe color palette is likely a mix of dark and light tones, with the subject\'s suit and the basketball court providing a dark, muted background. The stadium lights, on the other hand, add a burst of bright, vibrant color, creating a sense of energy and excitement. The overall color scheme is likely a combination of blues, grays, and whites, with accents of warm color to add depth and interest.\n\n**High-Resolution Cinematic Style:**\nThe image is likely shot in high-resolution, with a high-end camera and lens, to capture every detail of the subject and the environment. The cinematic style is achieved through a combination of factors, including the use of dramatic lighting, a carefully considered composition, and a muted color palette. The overall effect is a visually stunning image that draws the viewer in and conveys a sense of success and determination.\n\n**Success Mindset:**\nThe image embodies a success mindset, suggesting that the subject is a high-achiever who is confident, determined, and focused on his goals. The fact that he\'s standing on a basketball court, a domain that requires skill, strategy, and teamwork, implies that he\'s a well-rounded individual who can adapt to different environments and challenges. The image inspires the viewer to adopt a similar mindset, embracing challenges and striving for success.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful representation of confidence, success, and determination, conveyed through a combination of dramatic lighting, careful composition, and a muted color palette. The high-resolution cinematic style adds to the overall visual impact, creating an image that is both captivating and inspiring.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 17:45:00', '2026-04-26 17:45:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-26 17:45:19', '2026-04-26 17:45:19'),
(2482, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**The Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a tailored suit, stands tall and confident on the basketball court. His attire, typically associated with the corporate world, seems out of place in the athletic setting, yet he wears it with an air of authority and self-assurance. The contrast between his formal wear and the casual, athletic environment of the basketball court creates an intriguing visual dynamic.\n\n**The Setting:**\nThe basketball court, with its polished wooden floor and gleaming hoops, provides a sleek and modern backdrop for the scene. The stadium lights, shining down from above, cast a dramatic glow on the subject, accentuating his features and emphasizing his confident demeanor. The overall atmosphere is one of high energy and competition, with the businessman seeming to own the space.\n\n**The Props:**\nThe basketball, held firmly in the subject\'s hand, serves as a symbol of his ability to navigate and succeed in multiple realms. The ball, often associated with teamwork and athleticism, is now an extension of the businessman\'s personal brand, representing his adaptability and strategic thinking.\n\n**The Lighting:**\nThe dramatic lighting, with its deep shadows and highlights, adds a cinematic quality to the image. The stadium lights, shining down from above, create a sense of depth and dimensionality, while the shadows accentuate the subject\'s facial features and the textures of his suit. The overall effect is one of high contrast, with the subject emerging from the shadows as a powerful and dominant figure.\n\n**The Mood:**\nThe mood of the image is one of unbridled confidence and success. The businessman exudes a sense of self-assurance, as if he has conquered not only the corporate world but also the athletic realm. The dramatic lighting and cinematic style amplify this sense of triumph, creating an image that is both inspiring and intimidating.\n\n**The Style:**\nThe high-resolution cinematic style of the image is reminiscent of a Hollywood blockbuster or a high-end commercial. The level of detail, the vibrant colors, and the dramatic lighting all contribute to a sense of luxury and sophistication. The image seems to be saying that this businessman is a winner, a champion who has transcended the ordinary and achieved greatness.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful and compelling one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. The contrast between the formal wear and the athletic setting, combined with the dramatic lighting and cinematic style, creates a truly unforgettable visual experience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-26 17:46:00', '2026-04-26 17:46:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-26 17:46:21', '2026-04-26 17:46:21');
