(2488, 'Auto Post for facebook at 03:29', 'It seems like you didn\'t provide a prompt. Please go ahead and give me something to work with, and I\'ll do my best to assist you. You could ask a question, provide a topic to discuss, or ask for information on a specific subject. I\'m here to help.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 03:29:00', '2026-04-27 03:29:14', 76, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/prompt?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 49, '2026-04-27 03:29:14', '2026-04-27 03:29:14'),
(2489, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', '\"As a dragon in the business world, I understand the importance of being relatable and connecting with my audience. Here are a few points that I believe make me more relatable:\n\n* I have a passion for innovation and growth, just like many of my fellow entrepreneurs\n* I face challenges and obstacles, but I always find a way to overcome them\n* I value honesty, integrity, and transparency in all of my business dealings\n* I believe in the importance of giving back to the community and making a positive impact\n\n#DragonBusinessTips #RelatableLeader #InnovationNation #EntrepreneurLife #BusinessWithAPurpose #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDragon\"\n\nThis caption is designed to be professional and relatable, while also highlighting the unique aspect of being a dragon in the business world. The hashtags are a mix of trending and niche-specific tags to help increase visibility and reach a wider audience on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 10:35:00', '2026-04-27 10:35:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-04-27 10:35:17', '2026-04-27 10:35:17'),
(2490, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, smuggler, and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious cartels in the world. He is widely regarded as one of the most successful and infamous criminals in history.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Escobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, on December 1, 1949. He grew up in a poor family and was raised by his mother, Hermilda, after his father abandoned them. Escobar began his career in crime at a young age, selling stolen cars and participating in other small-time hustles.\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was rapidly growing in Colombia. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, becoming a key player in the organization. Escobar\'s charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness helped him build a vast network of associates and allies, and he eventually became the leader of the cartel.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. The cartel controlled a significant portion of the global cocaine trade, smuggling tons of the drug into the United States, Europe, and other countries.\n\nEscobar\'s operation was highly organized and efficient, with a network of smugglers, distributors, and money launderers. He used his wealth and influence to bribe officials, intimidate rivals, and eliminate anyone who stood in his way.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by brutal violence and terror. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including rival gang members, police officers, judges, and politicians. His organization was known for its use of bombings, assassinations, and massacres to eliminate opponents and maintain control.\n\nOne of the most infamous incidents attributed to Escobar was the assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán in 1989. Escobar\'s organization also carried out a series of bombings and attacks in Colombia, including the bombing of an Avianca airliner in 1989, which killed 110 people.\n\n**The Hunt for Escobar**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a massive manhunt for Escobar. The operation, known as \"Search Bloc,\" was led by Colonel Hugo Martínez and involved a team of elite police officers and military personnel.\n\nThe hunt for Escobar was intense and dramatic, with the cartel leader using his wealth and influence to evade capture. Escobar went into hiding, using a network of safe houses and loyal associates to stay one step ahead of his pursuers.\n\n**Death and Legacy**\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar\'s 44th birthday, he was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín. The operation was carried out by the Search Bloc team, which had tracked Escobar to a safe house in the city.\n\nEscobar\'s death marked the end of an era in the world of organized crime. His legacy is complex and multifaceted, with some viewing him as a ruthless and brutal criminal, while others see him as a folk hero and a symbol of resistance against the Colombian government.\n\nToday, Escobar\'s story continues to fascinate and captivate audiences around the world. His life and exploits have been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a sprawling estate called Hacienda Nápoles.\n* He was a skilled businessman and investor, with interests in real estate, construction, and other legitimate industries.\n* Escobar was a devout Catholic and often used his wealth and influence to support charitable causes and build churches and other community facilities.\n* His cartel was estimated to be worth over $30 billion at the height of its power, making it one of the wealthiest and most powerful organizations in the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 10:45:00', '2026-04-27 10:45:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-27 10:45:22', '2026-04-27 10:45:22'),
(2491, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, smuggler, and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and feared criminal organizations in the world. He is widely considered one of the most notorious and influential figures in the history of organized crime.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a middle-class family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he quickly became involved in crime to support his family. He began by selling stolen cars and later moved on to smuggling goods, including cigarettes and whiskey.\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was rapidly expanding in Colombia. He formed alliances with other smugglers and eventually took control of the Medellín cartel, which became one of the most powerful and feared cartels in the world.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel dominated the global cocaine trade, smuggling hundreds of tons of cocaine into the United States, Europe, and other countries. The cartel\'s operations were highly organized and sophisticated, with a network of smugglers, distributors, and money launderers.\n\nEscobar\'s success was due in part to his ruthless tactics, including the use of violence and intimidation to eliminate competitors and silence informants. He was also known for his generosity and charisma, which earned him a degree of loyalty and admiration from his followers.\n\n**The Hunt for Escobar**\n\nIn the 1980s, the Colombian government, with the support of the United States, launched a campaign to capture or kill Escobar. The hunt for Escobar was one of the most extensive and expensive manhunts in history, involving thousands of police and military personnel, as well as intelligence agencies from around the world.\n\nEscobar was eventually killed on December 1, 1993, during a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. He was 44 years old at the time of his death.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. On one hand, he was a ruthless and brutal criminal who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including innocent civilians, police officers, and rival gang members. His actions also contributed to the destabilization of Colombia and the spread of violence and corruption throughout the country.\n\nOn the other hand, Escobar was also a charismatic and cunning leader who was able to build a vast and powerful organization from scratch. He was a master of manipulation and was able to use his charm and intelligence to evade capture and maintain his power for many years.\n\nToday, Escobar\'s legacy continues to fascinate and horrify people around the world. His story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos,\" which tells the story of his rise and fall.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known as \"El Patrón\" (The Boss) or \"El Señor\" (The Lord) by his followers.\n* He was estimated to have earned over $30 billion during his career, making him one of the richest people in the world at the time.\n* Escobar was a fan of soccer and owned a team called Atlético Nacional, which won several championships during his ownership.\n* He was also a philanthropist and built several schools, hospitals, and other infrastructure projects in Medellín, which earned him a degree of popularity and admiration from the local population.\n* Escobar\'s death was a major blow to the Medellín cartel, and the organization was eventually dismantled by the Colombian authorities.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 10:50:00', '2026-04-27 10:50:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-27 10:50:22', '2026-04-27 10:50:22'),
(2492, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, crime boss, and founder of the Medellín cartel. He is widely regarded as one of the most notorious and powerful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born in Rionegro, Colombia, on December 1, 1949. He grew up in a poor family and was raised by his mother, Hermilda, after his father abandoned them. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, which would later shape his worldview and actions.\n\nEscobar\'s involvement in crime began at a young age, when he sold stolen cars and contraband. He eventually turned to cocaine trafficking, which would become his main source of income and power. In the 1970s, Escobar partnered with other Colombian traffickers to form the Medellín cartel, which would become one of the largest and most powerful drug cartels in the world.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel and Cocaine Empire**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel dominated the global cocaine trade, smuggling tons of cocaine into the United States, Europe, and other countries. Escobar\'s organization was known for its brutality, using violence and intimidation to maintain control and eliminate rival cartels.\n\nAt the height of his power, Escobar was estimated to be worth over $30 billion, making him one of the richest men in the world. He invested his wealth in real estate, businesses, and politicians, using his influence to corrupt Colombian officials and maintain his empire.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by violence and terror. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including rival traffickers, police officers, judges, and innocent civilians. His organization used car bombs, assassinations, and other forms of violence to maintain control and intimidate opponents.\n\nIn 1989, Escobar\'s cartel was responsible for the assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán, who had vowed to crack down on the cartel. The killing led to a massive manhunt for Escobar, who went into hiding.\n\n**Capture and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a specially built facility, known as La Catedral. However, he continued to run his empire from behind bars, using his connections to maintain control.\n\nIn 1992, Escobar escaped from prison and went into hiding. A massive manhunt was launched, involving Colombian and American authorities. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police in Medellín, on the rooftop of a safe house.\n\n**Legacy and Impact**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who brought terror and violence to Colombia and beyond. However, he is also seen as a product of Colombia\'s troubled history and a symbol of the country\'s struggles with poverty, corruption, and inequality.\n\nEscobar\'s story has been immortalized in films, books, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His life and death have also sparked debates about the war on drugs, the role of corruption in politics, and the impact of violence on society.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life was marked by extremes of wealth, power, and violence, leaving a lasting impact on Colombia and the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 10:53:00', '2026-04-27 10:53:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-04-27 10:53:19', '2026-04-27 10:53:19'),
(2493, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned to harness my inner strength and passion to achieve greatness. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your personal and professional life:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like I soar to great heights, aim high and strive for excellence in all that you do.\n* **Cultivate resilience**: Life can be unpredictable, but with determination and perseverance, you can overcome any obstacle.\n* **Embrace your uniqueness**: Just as my scales shine with a unique beauty, celebrate what sets you apart and makes you special.\n* **Learn from failure**: Even dragons experience setbacks, but it\'s how we respond that matters. Use failures as opportunities to grow and learn.\n* **Surround yourself with positivity**: The company you keep can either fuel or extinguish your inner fire. Choose wisely.\n\n#MotivationMonday #DragonInspiration #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #Resilience #GoalSetting #SelfImprovement #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #PositiveVibesOnly', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 11:18:00', '2026-04-27 11:18:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-04-27 11:18:16', '2026-04-27 11:18:16'),
(2494, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Party Wear for Men: Tips and Ideas**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, the key is to look stylish, confident, and put-together. Here are some tips and ideas to help you dress to impress:\n\n**Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Suits:** A well-fitted suit in black, navy, or gray is a classic choice for formal parties. Pair it with a crisp white shirt, a slim tie, and dress shoes.\n2. **Tuxedos:** For black-tie events, a tuxedo is the way to go. Opt for a classic black tuxedo with a white shirt, black bow tie, and patent leather shoes.\n3. **Dress Shirts:** Choose a dress shirt that complements your suit or tuxedo. Opt for a slim-fit shirt with a wing-tip collar.\n\n**Semi-Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Blazers:** A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit. Pair it with a dress shirt, dark jeans, and dress shoes.\n2. **Dress Pants:** Dress pants in dark colors like black, navy, or gray are versatile and can be paired with a variety of tops.\n3. **Polo Shirts:** A polo shirt is a great alternative to a dress shirt. Look for one in a bold color or pattern to add some personality to your outfit.\n\n**Casual Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Jeans:** A pair of dark wash jeans is a staple for casual parties. Pair them with a graphic tee, a leather jacket, and sneakers.\n2. **Graphic Tees:** Graphic tees are a great way to add some personality to your outfit. Look for one with a fun design or slogan.\n3. **Hoodies:** A hoodie can add a relaxed touch to your outfit. Pair it with jeans and sneakers for a casual look.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n1. **Watches:** A watch can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit. Opt for a leather strap or a metal band.\n2. **Cufflinks:** Cufflinks can add a touch of personality to your outfit. Look for ones with a fun design or pattern.\n3. **Pocket Squares:** A pocket square can add a pop of color to your outfit. Look for one in a bold color or pattern.\n\n**Grooming Tips:**\n\n1. **Hair:** Make sure your hair is styled neatly and cleanly.\n2. **Beard:** If you have a beard, make sure it\'s trimmed and well-groomed.\n3. **Nails:** Make sure your nails are clean and trimmed.\n\n**Shoes:**\n\n1. **Dress Shoes:** Dress shoes are a must for formal and semi-formal parties. Opt for black or brown leather shoes.\n2. **Boots:** Boots can add a touch of edge to your outfit. Look for ones in black or brown leather.\n3. **Sneakers:** Sneakers are a great option for casual parties. Look for ones in bold colors or patterns.\n\nRemember, the key to party wear for men is to look confident and put-together. Experiment with different styles and find what works best for you.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 12:40:00', '2026-04-27 12:40:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-04-27 12:40:20', '2026-04-27 12:40:20'),
(2495, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn for formal occasions, such as business meetings, weddings, and job interviews. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts typically have a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are usually made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the chest and sleeves.\n5. **Button-front**: Formal shirts typically have a button-front closure, with buttons made from high-quality materials such as mother-of-pearl or plastic.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic fit**: A classic fit formal shirt is a timeless style that is suitable for most formal occasions.\n2. **Slim fit**: A slim fit formal shirt is a more modern style that is designed to fit closely to the body.\n3. **Tailored fit**: A tailored fit formal shirt is a customized style that is designed to fit the individual\'s body perfectly.\n4. **Dress shirt**: A dress shirt is a type of formal shirt that is designed to be worn with a suit and tie.\n5. **Business casual**: A business casual formal shirt is a style that is designed to be worn in a more relaxed formal setting, such as a business meeting or a networking event.\n\n**Popular Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: Known for their high-quality, classic fit formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French brand that offers a range of stylish and elegant formal shirts.\n3. **Burberry**: A British brand that offers a range of classic and modern formal shirts.\n4. **Armani**: An Italian brand that offers a range of stylish and sophisticated formal shirts.\n5. **Hugo Boss**: A German brand that offers a range of high-quality, modern formal shirts.\n\n**Tips for Wearing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Pair with a suit**: A formal shirt is typically worn with a suit and tie.\n2. **Choose the right color**: White, light blue, and pale pink are popular colors for formal shirts.\n3. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure the shirt fits well and is not too tight or too loose.\n4. **Iron the shirt**: A well-ironed shirt can make a big difference in terms of appearance.\n5. **Add a tie or pocket square**: A tie or pocket square can add a touch of elegance to a formal shirt.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 12:56:00', '2026-04-27 12:56:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-04-27 12:56:17', '2026-04-27 12:56:17'),
(2496, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**Unleashing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to thrive. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s expanding your business or launching a new product, set your sights on success.\n* **Stay adaptable**: The ability to pivot and adjust to changing circumstances is crucial in today\'s fast-paced business landscape.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision and are passionate about achieving it.\n* **Innovate and evolve**: Stay ahead of the curve by embracing new technologies, trends, and ideas.\n* **Prioritize resilience**: Develop a growth mindset and learn to bounce back from setbacks and failures.\n\nBy following these principles, you\'ll be well on your way to achieving success and unleashing your inner fire. #Trending #BusinessTips #SuccessMindset #Entrepreneurship #DragonFire #Innovation #Resilience #Motivation #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 13:03:00', '2026-04-27 13:03:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-04-27 13:03:15', '2026-04-27 13:03:15'),
