(2498, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:55', 'As a dragon entrepreneur, I\'d like to share some relatable points about running a business. Here\'s a post for Facebook:\n\n**Being a Dragon in Business: Relatable Moments**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that running a business can be a wild ride. Here are some relatable points:\n\n* **Scaly obstacles**: Every business faces challenges, but as a dragon, I\'ve learned to breathe fire and tackle them head-on.\n* **Hoarding success**: It\'s not just about accumulating wealth, but also about sharing knowledge and helping others grow.\n* **Fire-breathing passion**: When you\'re passionate about what you do, it shows in your work and inspires others to do the same.\n* **Winged vision**: Having a clear vision for your business is crucial, and as a dragon, I\'ve learned to soar to new heights.\n\n#DragonsInBusiness #EntrepreneurLife #RelatableMoments #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #SuccessStories #PassionDriven #VisionaryLeaders #FireBreathingEntrepreneurs #ScalySolutions #HoardingSuccess #WingedVision #FacebookBusiness #BusinessInspiration', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 13:55:00', '2026-04-27 13:55:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 4, '2026-04-27 13:55:18', '2026-04-27 13:55:18'),
(2499, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated human imagination. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s world that can be applied to our daily lives:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their bravery and fearlessness, reminding us to stand up for what we believe in and face challenges head-on.\n* **Protection and guardianship**: As fierce guardians of their territories, dragons teach us the importance of safeguarding our own values, relationships, and communities.\n* **Transformation and growth**: From egg to mighty dragon, this mythical creature\'s journey is a powerful metaphor for personal growth, self-improvement, and transformation.\n* **Wisdom and knowledge**: With their ancient, wise eyes, dragons embody the value of seeking knowledge, learning from experience, and sharing wisdom with others.\n\nAs we navigate our own paths, let us draw inspiration from the dragon\'s example and strive to become the best versions of ourselves.\n\n#DragonInspiration #CourageOverFear #PersonalGrowth #WisdomAndKnowledge #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #BusinessLessons #MythicalMotivation #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-27 14:00:00', '2026-04-27 14:00:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-04-27 14:00:24', '2026-04-27 14:00:24'),
