(2530, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:57', 'A pen is a writing instrument used to apply ink to a surface, typically paper, in order to write or draw. It consists of a nib or tip that dispenses ink onto the surface as it is moved. Pens have been in use for thousands of years, with early versions using reeds or brushes to apply ink.\n\nThere are many different types of pens, including:\n\n1. Ballpoint pens: These use a small metal ball to dispense ink onto the paper.\n2. Rollerball pens: These use a small metal ball to dispense liquid ink onto the paper.\n3. Fountain pens: These use a nib to dispense ink from an internal reservoir.\n4. Gel pens: These use a water-based ink that is suspended in a gel-like substance.\n5. Felt-tip pens: These use a porous tip to absorb and release ink onto the paper.\n\nPens are used for a wide range of activities, including writing, drawing, and signing documents. They are an essential tool for many people, and are often used on a daily basis.\n\nSome interesting facts about pens include:\n\n* The first pen-like writing instrument was the reed pen, which was used by the ancient Egyptians around 4000 BCE.\n* The modern ballpoint pen was invented in the 1930s by a Hungarian journalist named László Bíró.\n* The world\'s most expensive pen is the Aurora Diamante, which is made from solid gold and diamonds and costs over $1 million.\n* The average person uses around 4-6 pens per year.\n\nOverall, pens are a simple yet essential tool that have been used for thousands of years to create written communication.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-28 11:57:00', '2026-04-28 11:57:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 16, '2026-04-28 11:57:17', '2026-04-28 11:57:17'),
(2531, 'Auto Post for instagram at 11:59', 'A pen packet, also known as a pen pack, is a small package containing a set of pens, often with a variety of ink colors or tip sizes. Pen packets are commonly used for:\n\n1. **Office supplies**: Pen packets are frequently included in office supply kits or purchased separately for use in workplaces, schools, or homes.\n2. **Art and design**: Artists, designers, and crafters often use pen packets to access a range of colors and line widths for their creative projects.\n3. **Travel**: Pen packets are convenient for travel, as they are compact and lightweight, making them easy to carry in a bag or pocket.\n4. **Promotional items**: Companies may use pen packets as promotional items, filling them with branded pens to give away at events or conferences.\n\nPen packets usually contain a set of pens with similar characteristics, such as:\n\n* **Fine tips**: 0.3mm, 0.5mm, or 0.7mm tips for detailed work or everyday writing.\n* **Color variety**: Assorted colors like black, blue, red, green, and yellow.\n* **Ink types**: Ballpoint, rollerball, or gel ink pens.\n\nWhen purchasing a pen packet, consider the intended use, the number of pens included, and the quality of the pens themselves.', '[\"instagram\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-28 11:59:00', '2026-04-28 11:59:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pen_Packet?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 17, '2026-04-28 11:59:14', '2026-04-28 11:59:14'),
