(2544, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Empowering Entrepreneurs: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Den**\n\nAs a symbol of strength and resilience, dragons have long been a source of inspiration for business leaders and creators. Here are some key takeaways from the dragon\'s perspective:\n\n* **Innovate and Adapt**: Stay ahead of the curve by continuously innovating and adapting to changing market trends.\n* **Build a Strong Team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision.\n* **Take Calculated Risks**: Don\'t be afraid to take bold steps, but always weigh the potential risks and rewards.\n* **Protect Your Brand**: Safeguard your intellectual property and reputation with fierce determination.\n* **Empower Your Community**: Give back to your community and support fellow entrepreneurs to create a thriving ecosystem.\n\n#Entrepreneurship #BusinessTips #DragonInspiration #InnovationNation #LeadershipLessons #TrendingNow #FacebookForBusiness #SmallBusinessSupport #StartupSuccess', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-28 14:38:00', '2026-04-28 14:38:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-04-28 14:38:15', '2026-04-28 14:38:15'),
