(2621, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a large language model, I don\'t have the capability to physically create images. But I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends.\n\n**Image Description:**\n\nThe image is a high-resolution, color photograph of a group of friends, with a man at the center, enjoying each other\'s company in a relaxed and casual setting. The scene is set in a cozy outdoor environment, with lush greenery and warm sunlight casting a gentle glow over the group.\n\nThe man, likely in his mid-twenties to early thirties, is sitting on a worn, wooden bench, with his friends gathered around him. He has a friendly and approachable smile on his face, with his eyes crinkled at the corners, suggesting that he\'s laughing or sharing a joke with his friends.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress, who is leaning in to whisper something in his ear. Her eyes are sparkling with amusement, and her lips are curled into a playful smile.\n\nOn his right is a tall, lanky man with a messy mop of blond hair, who is grinning from ear to ear. He\'s holding a cold beer in his hand, and his eyes are shining with friendship and camaraderie.\n\nIn the background, there\'s a blurred image of a park or a garden, with vibrant flowers and trees swaying gently in the breeze. The atmosphere is carefree and joyful, with a sense of warmth and connection among the group.\n\n**Image Specifications:**\n\n* Resolution: 4000 x 3000 pixels\n* Aspect Ratio: 4:3\n* Color Profile: Adobe RGB (1998)\n* File Format: JPEG\n* Image Size: 2.5 MB\n\n**Style:**\n\nThe image is shot in a natural, candid style, with a shallow depth of field to blur the background and emphasize the group of friends. The lighting is soft and warm, with a mix of natural and artificial light sources to create a cozy and inviting atmosphere. The overall mood is relaxed and friendly, with a sense of joy and connection among the group.\n\nI hope this description gives you a vivid idea of the image!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 16:06:00', '2026-04-30 16:06:19', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-04-30 16:06:19', '2026-04-30 16:06:19'),
(2622, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a perfect blend of modern, urban aesthetics with the timeless charm of rainy days. Let\'s break down the elements that make this scene so captivating:\n\n1. **Girl Walking with a Transparent Umbrella**: The use of a transparent umbrella is a great choice for aesthetic photography. It allows the viewer to see the subject (the girl) clearly while also showcasing the raindrops on the umbrella, creating a sense of movement and interaction with the environment.\n\n2. **Light Rain**: Light rain adds a mystical, serene quality to the scene. It\'s enough to create reflections and make the environment wet and shiny but not so heavy that it obscures the view or makes the scene gloomy.\n\n3. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: Neon reflections are a hallmark of urban, rainy night scenes in photography and film. They add a vibrant, colorful glow to the otherwise dark and wet environment, creating a beautiful contrast that\'s visually stunning. These reflections can turn a mundane street into a kaleidoscope of colors, reflecting the urban landscape\'s energy and vibrancy.\n\n4. **Aesthetic Photography**: The term suggests that the photography is not just about capturing the scene but doing so in a way that is pleasing to the eye, with attention to composition, lighting, and detail. Aesthetic photography often aims to evoke emotions or create a specific mood, in this case, a cinematic and fashionable one.\n\n5. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: Bokeh refers to the aesthetic quality of the blur produced in the out-of-focus parts of an image produced by a lens. Soft bokeh lights, especially in a rainy, neon-lit scene, can add a dreamy quality to the photograph. The blur can help separate the subject from the background, drawing attention to the girl and her fashionable outfit.\n\n6. **Fashionable Outfit**: The girl\'s outfit is a key element in creating a fashionable and cinematic mood. The choice of clothing and accessories can significantly influence the overall aesthetic of the photo, adding to the narrative or atmosphere the photographer wants to convey. A fashionable outfit can make the subject stand out, even in a busy, neon-lit environment.\n\n7. **Cinematic Mood**: The combination of neon lights, soft bokeh, and the setting of a rainy night evokes a cinematic quality, reminiscent of scenes from movies. This mood is often associated with drama, mystery, or romance, adding depth and narrative potential to the photograph.\n\n8. **High-Detail**: Capturing the scene in high detail allows for a more immersive experience. It means that the textures of the umbrella, the raindrops on the street, the neon lights, and the intricate details of the girl\'s outfit are all clearly visible, inviting the viewer to explore the image closely.\n\nIn summary, the scene you\'ve described is a masterful blend of visual and atmospheric elements, designed to evoke a specific mood and aesthetic. It combines the serenity of rain with the vibrancy of urban life, captured through the lens of aesthetic photography, to create a truly captivating image.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 16:11:00', '2026-04-30 16:11:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-04-30 16:11:14', '2026-04-30 16:11:14'),
(2623, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football is a popular sport played by two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nThere are several types of football, including:\n\n1. **Association Football** (or soccer): This is the most widely played version of football, played with a round ball and emphasizing kicking and heading.\n2. **American Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying and throwing the ball.\n3. **Rugby Football**: This version is a full-contact sport played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying and passing the ball.\n4. **Australian Rules Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying, kicking, and running with the ball.\n\nSome of the key aspects of football include:\n\n* **Tactics and Strategy**: Teams must work together to outmaneuver their opponents and create scoring opportunities.\n* **Physical Fitness**: Football players require a high level of endurance, strength, and agility to play the game effectively.\n* **Teamwork**: Football is a team sport that requires coordination and communication between players to achieve success.\n* **Fans and Culture**: Football has a massive global following, with many fans passionately supporting their favorite teams and players.\n\nSome of the most popular football competitions include:\n\n* **FIFA World Cup**: The most widely viewed and followed sporting event in the world, held every four years.\n* **UEFA Champions League**: The premier international club competition in European football.\n* **NFL (National Football League)**: The top-level professional American football league in the United States.\n* **English Premier League**: One of the most popular and competitive domestic football leagues in the world.\n\nWho\'s your favorite football team or player?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 16:33:00', '2026-04-30 16:33:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-04-30 16:33:17', '2026-04-30 16:33:17'),
(2624, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'It seems like you\'re testing something. Is there anything specific I can help you with or would you like to start a conversation?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 16:33:00', '2026-04-30 16:33:18', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Tester?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 48, '2026-04-30 16:33:18', '2026-04-30 16:33:18'),
(2625, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The Yamaha R1 is a popular sports bike known for its exceptional performance and handling. Here are some key features and specs:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Engine:** 998cc, liquid-cooled, 4-stroke, DOHC, 16-valve, inline-four cylinder engine\n2. **Power:** 200 horsepower (147.9 kW) @ 13,500 rpm\n3. **Torque:** 82.6 lb-ft (112 Nm) @ 11,500 rpm\n4. **Transmission:** 6-speed, constant mesh\n5. **Brakes:** Dual 320mm discs with 4-piston calipers (front), 220mm disc with single-piston caliper (rear)\n6. **Suspension:** 43mm inverted fork (front), monoshock with piggyback reservoir (rear)\n7. **Weight:** 448 pounds (203 kg) wet\n8. **Seat Height:** 32.3 inches (820 mm)\n\n**Riding Modes:**\n\n1. **Track Mode:** Optimized for track riding, with reduced traction control and more aggressive engine mapping\n2. **Street Mode:** Suitable for everyday riding, with more conservative engine mapping and traction control\n3. **Mode 1:** A customizable mode that allows riders to adjust engine mapping, traction control, and other settings to their preference\n\n**Safety Features:**\n\n1. **Traction Control:** Yamaha\'s proprietary traction control system, which helps prevent wheelspin and loss of traction\n2. **ABS:** Anti-lock braking system, which helps prevent wheel lockup during hard braking\n3. **Lift Control:** A system that helps prevent wheelies and loss of traction during acceleration\n\n**Other Notable Features:**\n\n1. **Aerodynamics:** The R1 features a sleek and aerodynamic bodywork, with a claimed top speed of over 186 mph (300 km/h)\n2. **Ergonomics:** The bike has a sporty riding position, with a low seat height and adjustable handlebars\n3. **Instrumentation:** A digital instrument cluster with a range of displays, including speed, gear position, and traction control settings\n\nOverall, the Yamaha R1 is a high-performance sports bike that\'s designed for experienced riders who demand exceptional power, handling, and technology.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 16:42:00', '2026-04-30 16:42:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-04-30 16:42:18', '2026-04-30 16:42:18'),
(2626, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a iconic superhero from the Marvel Comics universe. Created by Stan Lee, Larry Lieber, and Don Heck, Iron Man first appeared in comic books in 1963.\n\n**The Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a brilliant inventor and billionaire, is kidnapped by a group of terrorists who demand that he build a powerful missile system for them. Instead, Stark uses his genius to create a suit of armor that he uses to escape. He later perfects the suit, adding advanced technologies such as repulsor rays, jet propulsion, and a sophisticated AI system.\n\n**The Comic Book Series:**\nThe Iron Man comic book series follows Tony Stark\'s adventures as he fights crime and injustice, both as a solo hero and as a member of the Avengers. Over the years, the series has explored themes such as technological innovation, corporate responsibility, and the ethics of advanced warfare.\n\n**The Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU):**\nIn 2008, the Iron Man franchise was rebooted with a live-action film starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man. The film was a critical and commercial success, and it launched the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), a series of interconnected films that have become a cultural phenomenon.\n\n**The MCU Films:**\nThe Iron Man character has appeared in numerous MCU films, including:\n\n1. Iron Man (2008)\n2. The Avengers (2012)\n3. Iron Man 3 (2013)\n4. Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n5. Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n6. Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n7. Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n8. Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has become an iconic character in popular culture, symbolizing innovation, intelligence, and courage. The character has inspired countless fans around the world, and his legacy continues to shape the Marvel Universe and beyond.\n\nWhat aspect of Iron Man would you like to know more about? The comics, the MCU films, or something else?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 17:30:00', '2026-04-30 17:30:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-04-30 17:30:17', '2026-04-30 17:30:17'),
(2627, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is one of power, confidence, and achievement, blending the worlds of business and sports in a visually striking way. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that make this scene so compelling:\n\n1. **Professional Businessman in a Suit**: The suit, typically associated with corporate environments, signifies professionalism, authority, and success. In a basketball court setting, it adds an unexpected layer, suggesting that this individual brings the same level of professionalism and seriousness to the game as he would to a boardroom.\n\n2. **Standing Confidently**: The posture and stance of the businessman convey a sense of self-assurance and control. This confidence is not just about the game; it\'s about the mindset and approach to challenges. It suggests that he is as comfortable on the court as he is in a business meeting, exuding an aura of capability and leadership.\n\n3. **Ball in Hand**: Holding the basketball, the businessman is not just a spectator; he\'s a participant, ready to engage with the game. This positions him as proactive and engaged, not just in the sport, but by extension, in any challenge or opportunity that comes his way.\n\n4. **Stadium Lights Behind Him**: The dramatic lighting provided by the stadium lights creates a heroic silhouette, emphasizing the figure against a backdrop of high-energy activity. Stadium lights are often associated with significant events and achievements, implying that this moment, too, is noteworthy.\n\n5. **Dramatic Lighting**: The use of dramatic lighting enhances the cinematic quality of the image, creating shadows and highlights that accentuate the subject\'s features and the texture of his suit. It adds an element of drama and importance, making the scene feel like a pivotal moment in a larger narrative.\n\n6. **Success Mindset**: The overall composition of the image embodies a mindset of success. It\'s not just about winning a game; it\'s about the attitude and approach one takes to challenges. The businessman\'s stance and the setting suggest a blend of discipline, strategy, and determination, all of which are key components of a success mindset.\n\n7. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The high-resolution quality of the image provides clarity and depth, allowing the viewer to appreciate the textures, from the suit fabric to the basketball\'s leather. The cinematic style elevates the scene from a simple photograph to a frame that could be part of a larger story, perhaps a biographical drama or an inspirational tale of overcoming odds.\n\nIn summary, this image is a powerful visual representation of confidence, success, and the ability to thrive in diverse environments. It suggests that the skills and mindset that lead to success in business can also be applied to other areas of life, such as sports, and vice versa. The cinematic quality turns this moment into a symbolic expression of aspiration and achievement.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 17:45:00', '2026-04-30 17:45:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-30 17:45:20', '2026-04-30 17:45:20'),
(2628, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, capturing the essence of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**The Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a tailored suit, exudes an air of confidence and authority. His attire, typically associated with the corporate world, is juxtaposed with the basketball court, creating an intriguing contrast. The suit is immaculately pressed, with a crisp white shirt and a tie that adds a pop of color to the overall ensemble.\n\n**The Setting:**\nThe basketball court, with its polished wooden floor and gleaming hoops, provides a dynamic backdrop for the scene. The stadium lights, shining brightly behind the subject, cast a dramatic glow, emphasizing the sense of importance and grandeur. The court itself appears empty, with no other players or spectators in sight, allowing the focus to remain solely on the businessman.\n\n**The Props:**\nThe basketball, held firmly in the subject\'s hand, serves as a symbol of his confidence and control. The ball seems to be an extension of his body, as if he\'s about to take a shot or make a decisive move. The fact that he\'s holding the ball, rather than just standing on the court, implies a sense of agency and purpose.\n\n**The Lighting:**\nThe dramatic lighting, courtesy of the stadium lights, creates a cinematic atmosphere, elevating the scene to a level of high-stakes drama. The shadows cast by the lights add depth and dimension to the image, while the highlights accentuate the subject\'s features, making him appear strong and determined.\n\n**The Mood:**\nThe overall mood of the image is one of success and accomplishment. The subject\'s confident stance, combined with the dramatic lighting, creates a sense of excitement and anticipation. The scene seems to be frozen in time, as if the subject is about to take a crucial shot or make a game-changing decision.\n\n**The Style:**\nThe high-resolution cinematic style of the image adds to its overall impact, making it feel like a still from a movie or a high-end commercial. The level of detail, from the texture of the suit to the sheen on the basketball, is exceptional, drawing the viewer\'s eye and refusing to let go.\n\nIn summary, the image of the businessman on the basketball court, with the ball in his hand and the stadium lights shining behind him, is a masterful representation of confidence, success, and determination. The dramatic lighting, combined with the subject\'s authoritative presence, creates a truly cinematic experience that inspires and motivates.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 17:46:00', '2026-04-30 17:46:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-30 17:46:19', '2026-04-30 17:46:19'),
(2629, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:47', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that make this scene so compelling:\n\n**The Businessman**: The fact that the subject is a professional businessman wearing a suit immediately conveys a sense of authority, power, and sophistication. The suit is a symbol of professionalism and success, and it\'s interesting to see it juxtaposed with the more casual, athletic setting of a basketball court.\n\n**The Basketball Court**: The basketball court provides a unique backdrop for the businessman, suggesting that he\'s a multifaceted individual with interests and talents beyond the boardroom. The court\'s polished surface and bold lines create a sense of dynamism and energy, which complements the businessman\'s confident demeanor.\n\n**The Ball in Hand**: The basketball in the businessman\'s hand serves as a symbol of control, focus, and determination. It implies that he\'s a person who can balance multiple aspects of his life, from business to sports, and that he\'s always ready to take on new challenges.\n\n**Stadium Lights**: The stadium lights behind the businessman create a dramatic and cinematic atmosphere, casting a sense of grandeur and importance over the scene. The lights also serve to highlight the subject\'s features, making him stand out even more against the darkened background.\n\n**Dramatic Lighting**: The dramatic lighting in the scene adds to the overall sense of tension and excitement. The shadows and highlights created by the lighting help to accentuate the businessman\'s facial features, making him appear more confident and determined.\n\n**Success Mindset**: The overall attitude and demeanor of the businessman convey a strong sense of success and achievement. His confident stance, direct gaze, and firm grip on the ball all suggest that he\'s a person who is used to winning and achieving his goals.\n\n**High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The high-resolution cinematic style of the image adds to its overall sense of drama and sophistication. The level of detail and texture in the image creates a sense of realism, making the scene feel more immersive and engaging.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful and compelling one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. It\'s an image that would be perfect for a business or motivational context, inspiring viewers to strive for their own goals and aspirations.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 17:47:00', '2026-04-30 17:47:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-04-30 17:47:17', '2026-04-30 17:47:17'),
(2630, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:49', 'Wooden crafts are a popular and creative hobby that involves working with wood to create various items, such as furniture, decorations, and other objects. Here are some ideas and techniques for wooden crafts:\n\n**Types of Wooden Crafts:**\n\n1. **Wood Carving:** Carving wooden figures, ornaments, or decorative items using hand tools or power tools.\n2. **Wood Turning:** Creating symmetrical objects, such as bowls, cups, or vases, using a lathe.\n3. **Wood Burning:** Using a pyrography pen to burn designs or patterns onto wooden surfaces.\n4. **Woodworking:** Building furniture, cabinets, or other items using various woodworking techniques, such as joinery, sanding, and finishing.\n5. **Wood Inlay:** Creating intricate designs by inlaying small pieces of wood into a larger wooden surface.\n\n**Basic Techniques:**\n\n1. **Measuring and Marking:** Accurately measuring and marking wood to ensure precise cuts and joints.\n2. **Cutting:** Using hand saws, power saws, or other tools to cut wood into desired shapes and sizes.\n3. **Sanding:** Smoothing wood surfaces using various grits of sandpaper to achieve a smooth finish.\n4. **Joinery:** Using various techniques, such as mortise and tenon, dovetail, or dado joints, to connect wooden pieces.\n5. **Finishing:** Applying stains, varnishes, or other finishes to protect and enhance the wood.\n\n**Wooden Craft Projects:**\n\n1. **Birdhouses:** Building birdhouses using wooden planks and a simple design.\n2. **Picture Frames:** Creating custom picture frames using wooden molding and glass.\n3. **Coat Racks:** Building coat racks using wooden dowels and a simple frame.\n4. **Wooden Signs:** Creating custom wooden signs using wooden planks and a pyrography pen.\n5. **Furniture:** Building custom furniture, such as tables, chairs, or shelves, using various woodworking techniques.\n\n**Safety Tips:**\n\n1. **Wear Protective Gear:** Wear safety glasses, a dust mask, and ear protection when working with power tools.\n2. **Use Proper Techniques:** Use proper techniques when cutting, sanding, or joining wood to avoid accidents.\n3. **Keep Work Area Clean:** Keep the work area clean and well-ventilated to avoid dust and debris buildup.\n4. **Follow Instructions:** Follow instructions and guidelines when using power tools or working with wood.\n5. **Practice Patience:** Practice patience and take your time when working on wooden crafts to ensure accuracy and quality.\n\n**Getting Started:**\n\n1. **Gather Tools and Materials:** Gather basic tools, such as a hammer, saw, and sandpaper, and materials, such as wood planks and glue.\n2. **Choose a Project:** Choose a simple project, such as a birdhouse or picture frame, to start with.\n3. **Follow Instructions:** Follow instructions and guidelines to complete the project.\n4. **Practice and Experiment:** Practice and experiment with different techniques and projects to improve your skills.\n5. **Join a Community:** Join a woodworking community or online forum to connect with other woodworkers and learn from their experiences.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 17:49:00', '2026-04-30 17:49:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/wood_spoon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2026-04-30 17:49:15', '2026-04-30 17:49:15'),
(2631, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of ceramic, plastic, wood, or other materials. Flower pots come in a wide range of shapes, sizes, and designs, and can be used to add a decorative touch to indoor or outdoor spaces.\n\nSome common types of flower pots include:\n\n1. Terracotta pots: Made from natural clay, these pots are breathable and allow for good drainage.\n2. Ceramic pots: Made from clay and other minerals, these pots are durable and often feature decorative glazes.\n3. Plastic pots: Lightweight and inexpensive, these pots are often used for outdoor plants.\n4. Wooden pots: Made from natural wood, these pots can add a rustic touch to outdoor spaces.\n5. Self-watering pots: These pots have a built-in water reservoir that allows plants to draw water as needed.\n\nFlower pots can be used to grow a wide variety of plants, including:\n\n1. Flowers: Annuals and perennials, such as roses, daisies, and petunias.\n2. Herbs: Basil, mint, and rosemary are popular choices for container gardens.\n3. Vegetables: Tomatoes, peppers, and cucumbers can thrive in large flower pots.\n4. Succulents: These low-maintenance plants are perfect for small pots and indoor spaces.\n\nWhen choosing a flower pot, consider the following factors:\n\n1. Size: Choose a pot that is large enough to hold the plant\'s roots and provide adequate drainage.\n2. Material: Consider the durability and breathability of the pot, as well as its aesthetic appeal.\n3. Drainage: Make sure the pot has holes in the bottom to prevent waterlogged soil.\n4. Style: Choose a pot that fits with your decor and personal style.\n\nOverall, flower pots are a versatile and practical way to add some greenery to your space, and can be used to create beautiful and thriving container gardens.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 18:07:00', '2026-04-30 18:07:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-04-30 18:07:17', '2026-04-30 18:07:17'),
(2632, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, and Friday are considered weekdays, while Saturday and Sunday are considered weekends. \n\nSo, the weekdays are: \n1. Monday\n2. Tuesday\n3. Wednesday\n4. Thursday\n5. Friday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-04-30 18:26:00', '2026-04-30 18:26:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2026-04-30 18:26:20', '2026-04-30 18:26:20'),
