(2649, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated human imagination. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s perspective:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness, and we can learn from their example by facing our challenges head-on.\n* **Protecting what matters**: Dragons are fiercely protective of their territory and loved ones, reminding us of the importance of prioritizing our own values and relationships.\n* **Embracing our unique strengths**: Just as dragons have their own distinct abilities, we too can leverage our individual talents and skills to achieve greatness.\n\nJoin the conversation and share your thoughts on what it means to embody the spirit of a dragon! #DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #BusinessInspiration #ProfessionalGrowth #FacebookCommunity #LessonsFromMythology #PersonalDevelopment #CourageOverFear', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-01 15:10:00', '2026-05-01 15:10:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-05-01 15:10:16', '2026-05-01 15:10:16'),
(2650, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of strength, courage, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated humans. Here are some key takeaways from the dragon\'s world that can inspire your personal and professional growth:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on a treasure hoard, you should aim high and strive for excellence in your endeavors.\n* **Protect your passions**: A dragon fiercely guards its territory and treasure; similarly, you should prioritize and safeguard your values, interests, and priorities.\n* **Embody adaptability**: Dragons are known for their ability to thrive in diverse environments; be open to learning, growing, and evolving in an ever-changing world.\n* **Cultivate inner fire**: A dragon\'s fiery spirit is a powerful force; tap into your inner drive, motivation, and creativity to overcome obstacles and achieve success.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #TrendingNow #FacebookCommunity #BusinessLessons #SuccessTips #Inspiration #Courage #Resilience #Ambition #Passion #Adaptability #InnerFire', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-01 15:14:00', '2026-05-01 15:14:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-05-01 15:14:20', '2026-05-01 15:14:20'),
(2651, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Unlocking the Power of Dragons in Business**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'d like to share some relatable points on what it takes to succeed:\n\n* **Embracing challenges**: Just like a dragon faces fierce battles, we must be brave and resilient in the face of adversity.\n* **Protecting our treasures**: Our time, resources, and networks are precious, and we must guard them wisely.\n* **Breathing fire**: We must be passionate and driven to achieve our goals, and not be afraid to take calculated risks.\n* **Soaring to new heights**: With determination and hard work, we can reach new levels of success and achievement.\n* **Building a loyal community**: Just like a dragon\'s hoard, we must nurture and protect our relationships with customers, partners, and colleagues.\n\n#DragonMode #BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #Motivation #Inspiration #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #SmallBusiness #StartupLife #BusinessTips #CareerAdvice #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-01 15:24:00', '2026-05-01 15:24:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-05-01 15:24:18', '2026-05-01 15:24:18'),
