(2657, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nThere are several types of football, including:\n\n1. **Association Football** (or Soccer): This is the most widely played and watched version of football, played with a round ball and emphasizing kicking and heading.\n2. **American Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying and throwing the ball, with a focus on physical contact and tackling.\n3. **Rugby Football**: This version is similar to American football but with a few key differences, including the use of a round ball and a greater emphasis on kicking and passing.\n4. **Australian Rules Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes running, kicking, and tackling.\n\nSome popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most widely watched and followed international football tournament, held every four years.\n2. **English Premier League**: One of the top professional football leagues in the world, featuring teams from England.\n3. **UEFA Champions League**: An annual club football tournament featuring top teams from Europe.\n4. **NFL (National Football League)**: The top professional American football league in the United States.\n\nFootball is a popular sport around the world, with millions of players and fans. It\'s a great way to stay active, build teamwork and social skills, and enjoy the thrill of competition.\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-01 16:33:00', '2026-05-01 16:33:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-01 16:33:19', '2026-05-01 16:33:19'),
(2658, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. You\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sport bike produced by Yamaha Motor Company. \n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha YZF-R1:\n\n1. **Engine**: 998cc, inline-four cylinder, liquid-cooled engine producing around 200 horsepower.\n2. **Transmission**: 6-speed manual transmission with a multi-plate slipper clutch.\n3. **Chassis**: Aluminum frame with a swingarm and a rear shock absorber.\n4. **Brakes**: Dual 320mm front disc brakes with 6-piston calipers and a 220mm rear disc brake with a single-piston caliper.\n5. **Suspension**: 43mm inverted front fork and a rear shock absorber with adjustable preload, compression, and rebound damping.\n6. **Electronics**: Advanced electronics package, including traction control, slide control, and launch control.\n7. **Weight**: Around 448 pounds (203 kg) with a full tank of fuel.\n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is known for its exceptional handling, powerful engine, and advanced electronics. It\'s a popular choice among sport bike enthusiasts and track riders.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-01 16:42:00', '2026-05-01 16:42:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-01 16:42:19', '2026-05-01 16:42:19'),
(2659, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is kidnapped by a terrorist group while demonstrating his company\'s new missile technology. To escape, Stark creates a powered exoskeleton suit, which becomes the first Iron Man armor. After his rescue, Stark perfects the suit and uses it to fight crime and protect the world as the superhero Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit provides him with:\n\n1. **Superhuman Strength**: The suit\'s advanced propulsion system and powerful muscles allow Iron Man to lift and throw objects with incredible force.\n2. **Flight**: The suit\'s repulsor technology enables Iron Man to fly at high speeds.\n3. **Energy Projection**: The suit can project energy blasts from its hands, known as repulsor beams.\n4. **Advanced Sensors**: The suit is equipped with advanced sensors, including radar, infrared, and X-ray vision.\n5. **Artificial Intelligence**: The suit\'s AI system, JARVIS (later replaced by FRIDAY), assists Iron Man in various tasks and provides strategic support.\n\n**Movies and TV Shows:**\nIron Man has appeared in numerous movies and TV shows, including:\n\n1. **Iron Man (2008)**: The first movie in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man.\n2. **The Avengers (2012)**: Iron Man joins the Avengers team to save the world from an alien invasion.\n3. **Iron Man 3 (2013)**: Tony Stark faces a personal crisis and a terrorist threat from the Mandarin.\n4. **Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)**: Iron Man helps the Avengers stop the artificial intelligence Ultron.\n5. **Captain America: Civil War (2016)**: Iron Man leads a team of Avengers against Captain America\'s team in a conflict over government regulation.\n6. **Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)**: Iron Man mentors Peter Parker, a young superhero.\n7. **Avengers: Infinity War (2018)**: Iron Man plays a key role in the battle against Thanos.\n8. **Avengers: Endgame (2019)**: Iron Man makes the ultimate sacrifice to save the world from Thanos.\n\n**Video Games:**\nIron Man has appeared in various video games, including:\n\n1. **Iron Man (2008)**: A tie-in game for the first movie.\n2. **Iron Man 2 (2010)**: A game based on the second movie.\n3. **Lego Marvel Super Heroes (2013)**: A Lego game featuring Iron Man and other Marvel characters.\n4. **Marvel\'s Avengers (2020)**: An action-adventure game with Iron Man as a playable character.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has become an iconic superhero, inspiring countless fans around the world. His legacy extends beyond the comics, with the character\'s influence visible in movies, TV shows, and other forms of media. The character\'s themes of innovation, perseverance, and selflessness continue to inspire new generations of fans.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-01 17:30:00', '2026-05-01 17:30:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-01 17:30:18', '2026-05-01 17:30:18'),
(2660, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image is one of stark contrast, yet perfect harmony. A suited businessman, typically found in the confines of a boardroom or office, stands confidently on a basketball court, surrounded by the trappings of athletic competition. The stadium lights behind him cast a dramatic glow, illuminating the scene with an air of high-stakes tension.\n\nThe businessman\'s suit is immaculately tailored, with every crease and fold in place, exuding an aura of professionalism and sophistication. Yet, as he stands on the court, he appears entirely at ease, his confidence and poise unwavering. The basketball in his hand seems almost an extension of himself, a symbol of his ability to adapt and thrive in any environment.\n\nThe dramatic lighting casts long shadows across the court, accentuating the businessman\'s powerful stance. His eyes seem to gleam with a fierce inner light, a burning intensity that suggests a deep-seated drive for success. The overall effect is one of mesmerizing energy, as if the very air around him is charged with an electric sense of possibility.\n\nThe high-resolution cinematic style of the image only adds to the sense of drama and tension, with every detail rendered in crystal-clear clarity. The textures of the suit, the grain of the basketball, and the sheen of the court all seem to leap out of the image, drawing the viewer in with an irresistible sense of depth and dimensionality.\n\nAs the eye explores the image, it becomes clear that this is more than just a photograph – it\'s a statement of intent. The businessman is not just a suit-wearing executive; he\'s a warrior, a champion, a master of his domain. The basketball court is not just a place of athletic competition; it\'s a metaphor for the cutthroat world of business, where only the strongest and most determined survive.\n\nThe image is a powerful reminder that success is not just about achieving a goal – it\'s about embracing a mindset. It\'s about being fearless, adaptable, and relentlessly driven. As the businessman stands tall on the court, his eyes blazing with determination, it\'s clear that he embodies this mindset, and that nothing can stand in his way.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-01 17:45:00', '2026-05-01 17:45:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-01 17:45:20', '2026-05-01 17:45:20');
