(2677, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', 'Here\'s a possible Facebook post for a dragon-themed business/creator:\n\n**Post:** \n\"Breathing fire into your day with some relatable dragon facts:\n• As a dragon, I\'m always on the go, but even I need a break to recharge my flames\n• My hoard is my happy place - who else loves collecting shiny treasures?\n• Don\'t mess with a dragon\'s morning coffee - it\'s a fire-breathing must-have\n• When in doubt, just roar loud and proud - it\'s a dragon\'s way of life\n\n#DragonsOfFacebook #RelatableDragon #FireBreathingFun #DragonHoard #MorningMotivation #TrendingNow #FantasyCreatures #MythicalBeings #DragonLove\"\n\nThis post aims to showcase the brand\'s professional voice while still being relatable and engaging. The use of trending hashtags like #TrendingNow can help increase the post\'s visibility, while #DragonsOfFacebook and #RelatableDragon can attract fans of dragon-themed content.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-02 14:00:00', '2026-05-02 14:00:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-05-02 14:00:20', '2026-05-02 14:00:20'),
(2678, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', 'Here\'s a possible Facebook post for a dragon-themed business/creator:\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of embracing our true nature and living our best lives. Here are a few relatable points to consider:\n\n* Being fierce and fearless is not just about breathing fire, but about facing our fears and pushing beyond our limits.\n* Hoarding treasure is not just about accumulating wealth, but about valuing the things that truly matter to us.\n* Taking time to rest and recharge is crucial, whether that means curling up in a cave or soaring through the skies.\n* Surrounding ourselves with a supportive community is essential, whether that\'s a flock of dragons or a group of like-minded individuals.\n\nLet\'s spread our wings and take on the day with confidence and courage! #DragonMode #FearlessLiving #TreasuredMoments #SelfCareSunday #CommunityFirst #TrendingNow #DragonSquad #FireBreathingFierce #MythicalCreatures #LegendaryLiving\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-02 14:37:00', '2026-05-02 14:37:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-02 14:37:20', '2026-05-02 14:37:20'),
(2679, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', 'Here\'s a sample Facebook post for a business/creator with the description \"Relatable caption in points\" and a brand voice that\'s professional:\n\n**Post:**\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of staying on top of our game. Here are a few relatable points to consider:\n* Staying focused on our goals, even when the going gets tough\n* Prioritizing self-care to maintain our physical and mental well-being\n* Continuously learning and improving to stay ahead of the curve\n* Building strong relationships with our community and network\n\nBy following these points, we can ensure that we\'re always flying high and achieving our full potential.\n\n#DragonLife #ProductivityHacks #MentalHealthMatters #SelfCareSunday #BusinessTips #EntrepreneurLife #TrendingNow #MotivationMonday\"\n\n**Note:** I\'ve used a mix of popular and trending hashtags to increase the post\'s visibility, while also keeping the brand voice professional and relatable.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-02 14:38:00', '2026-05-02 14:38:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-02 14:38:14', '2026-05-02 14:38:14'),
(2680, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about passion, dedication, and perseverance. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on its treasure, you should set clear and achievable goals for yourself.\n* **Stay focused**: Avoid distractions and stay focused on what\'s important. A dragon\'s gaze is unwavering, and so should yours be.\n* **Be adaptable**: Like a dragon adapting to its environment, you should be willing to pivot and adjust to changing circumstances.\n* **Protect your assets**: A dragon guards its treasure fiercely, and you should do the same with your time, energy, and resources.\n* **Keep learning**: A dragon\'s wisdom is legendary, and you should strive to continuously learn and improve.\n\n#Trending #Motivation #SuccessTips #DragonWisdom #BusinessTips #PersonalGrowth #Facebook #Inspiration #GoalSetting #Focus #Adaptability #Productivity', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-02 14:39:00', '2026-05-02 14:39:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-02 14:39:14', '2026-05-02 14:39:14'),
(2681, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have captivated human imagination for centuries. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s world that can inspire and motivate you:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness, and we can learn from their example by facing our challenges head-on.\n* **Resilience and adaptability**: With their ability to thrive in diverse environments, dragons teach us the importance of being flexible and adjusting to changing circumstances.\n* **Protecting and preserving what\'s valuable**: Dragons are often depicted as guardians of treasure, reminding us to prioritize and safeguard what truly matters in our lives.\n* **Embracing our unique strengths**: Just as dragons have distinct characteristics that set them apart, we can celebrate our individuality and leverage our unique talents to achieve success.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #LessonsFromMythology #PersonalGrowth #ResilienceMatters #CourageOverFear #AdaptAndThrive #TreasureYourValues #EmbraceYourUniqueness #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalMotivation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-02 15:10:00', '2026-05-02 15:10:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-05-02 15:10:18', '2026-05-02 15:10:18'),
(2682, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '\"Breathing fire into the world of entrepreneurship. Here are a few things I\'ve learned on my journey as a dragon in business:\n\n* **Embracing my strengths**: As a dragon, I have a natural ability to inspire fear and respect. I\'ve learned to channel this energy into my business, making me a formidable competitor in the market.\n* **Building a hoard of knowledge**: I\'ve spent years accumulating knowledge and experience in my field, and I continue to learn and grow every day.\n* **Protecting my treasure**: As a dragon, I\'m fiercely protective of my business and my team. I\'ll stop at nothing to ensure our success and well-being.\n* **Spreading my wings**: I\'m always looking for new opportunities and ways to expand my business, whether it\'s through partnerships, new markets, or innovative products.\n\n#DragonCEO #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #Innovation #Trending #BusinessInspiration #Motivation #SuccessStory\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-02 15:14:00', '2026-05-02 15:14:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-05-02 15:14:17', '2026-05-02 15:14:17'),
(2683, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Journey**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned valuable lessons that can be applied to our personal and professional lives. Here are a few key takeaways:\n\n* **Resilience is key**: Just like a dragon\'s scales protect it from harm, we must develop our own resilience to navigate life\'s challenges.\n* **Passion drives success**: A dragon\'s fiery passion is what fuels its pursuits, and we can learn from this by chasing our own passions and interests.\n* **Community is essential**: Dragons often live in groups, and we can benefit from building strong relationships and networks in our own lives.\n* **Continuous learning is vital**: As a dragon grows and evolves, it must adapt to new situations and learn from its experiences, and we can do the same by prioritizing lifelong learning.\n\n#DragonsOfFacebook #LessonsFromADragon #MotivationMonday #ResilienceMatters #PassionDriven #CommunityFirst #LifelongLearning #TrendingNow #Inspiration #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-02 15:24:00', '2026-05-02 15:24:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-05-02 15:24:20', '2026-05-02 15:24:20'),
