(2690, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. \n\nYou\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sport bike manufactured by Yamaha Motor Company. The R1 is known for its impressive speed, handling, and power. Here are some key features:\n\n**Key Specifications:**\n\n* Engine: 998cc, liquid-cooled, 4-stroke, DOHC, 16-valve, inline-four cylinder\n* Power: 200 horsepower (147.9 kW) @ 13,500 rpm\n* Torque: 82.6 lb-ft (112 Nm) @ 11,500 rpm\n* Transmission: 6-speed, constant mesh\n* Drive: Chain drive\n* Seat Height: 32.7 inches (831 mm)\n* Weight: 448 pounds (203 kg)\n* Top Speed: Electronically limited to 186 mph (300 km/h)\n\n**Features:**\n\n* Advanced aerodynamics and bodywork\n* Upside-down fork and monoshock rear suspension\n* Dual 320mm front disc brakes with 6-piston calipers\n* 220mm rear disc brake with single-piston caliper\n* Traction control and ABS\n* Ride-by-wire throttle\n* Multiple ride modes (e.g., Sport, Standard, Rain)\n\nThe Yamaha R1 is a popular choice among motorcycle enthusiasts and professional racers alike, offering exceptional performance, handling, and style.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-02 16:42:00', '2026-05-02 16:42:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-02 16:42:21', '2026-05-02 16:42:21'),
(2691, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a iconic superhero from the Marvel Comics universe. Created by Stan Lee, Larry Lieber, and Don Heck, Iron Man first appeared in comic books in 1963.\n\n**The Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a brilliant inventor and billionaire, is kidnapped by a group of terrorists who demand that he build a powerful weapon for them. Instead, Tony uses his intellect and resources to create a suit of armor, which he uses to escape and later becomes the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**The Iron Man Suit:**\nThe Iron Man suit is a advanced technology exoskeleton that provides Tony with superhuman strength, speed, and agility. The suit is equipped with a range of advanced features, including:\n\n* Repulsor technology, which allows Iron Man to fly and project energy blasts\n* Super-strength, thanks to the suit\'s advanced hydraulic system\n* Advanced sensors and tracking systems, which allow Iron Man to detect and respond to threats\n* A sophisticated AI system, known as JARVIS (later replaced by FRIDAY), which assists Tony in controlling the suit and managing his various enterprises\n\n**The Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU):**\nIn the MCU, Iron Man is played by Robert Downey Jr. and has appeared in numerous films, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* The Incredible Hulk (2008) - cameo appearance\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) - cameo appearance\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\n**Impact and Legacy:**\nIron Man has become a cultural icon, inspiring countless fans around the world with his intelligence, wit, and bravery. The character has also spawned numerous adaptations, including animated TV series, video games, and merchandise.\n\nWhat aspect of Iron Man would you like to know more about? The comics, the movies, or something else?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-02 17:30:00', '2026-05-02 17:30:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-02 17:30:18', '2026-05-02 17:30:18'),
(2692, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and captivating visual representation of success, confidence, and determination. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that contribute to this dramatic and cinematic scene:\n\n1. **The Businessman**: The subject, a professional businessman, is dressed in a sleek, well-fitted suit, exuding an air of sophistication and authority. This attire suggests a high level of success and accomplishment in his field.\n2. **The Basketball Court**: The setting of a basketball court is an unexpected yet intriguing choice. It implies that the businessman is not limited to the boardroom, but is also capable of navigating and thriving in other environments. The court\'s lines and markings create a sense of structure and discipline.\n3. **The Ball in Hand**: The businessman holding a basketball adds a sense of dynamism and action to the scene. It suggests that he is a person who can balance multiple aspects of his life, from business to sports, and is always ready to take on new challenges.\n4. **Stadium Lights**: The stadium lights behind the businessman create a dramatic and intense atmosphere. The bright, shining lights symbolize the spotlight of success, highlighting the subject\'s achievements and accomplishments.\n5. **Dramatic Lighting**: The use of dramatic lighting, with deep shadows and highlights, adds a sense of depth and dimension to the image. This type of lighting creates a cinematic feel, as if the scene is from a movie or a high-end commercial.\n6. **Success Mindset**: The overall mood of the image conveys a sense of confidence, determination, and success. The businessman\'s posture, facial expression, and body language all suggest that he is a person who has achieved great things and is ready for even more.\n\nIn terms of high-resolution cinematic style, the image would likely feature:\n\n* **High contrast**: The use of deep shadows and bright highlights would create a sense of drama and depth.\n* **Vivid colors**: The colors would be rich and saturated, with a focus on blues and whites to convey a sense of professionalism and sophistication.\n* **Sharp focus**: The image would be sharply focused, with a shallow depth of field to emphasize the subject and blur the background.\n* **Cinematic composition**: The composition would be carefully considered, with the subject placed off-center and the stadium lights creating a sense of symmetry and balance.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful representation of success, confidence, and determination, with a dramatic and cinematic style that draws the viewer in and inspires them to strive for greatness.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-02 17:45:00', '2026-05-02 17:45:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-02 17:45:21', '2026-05-02 17:45:21'),
