(2741, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:55', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a mythical creature, I\'ve learned a thing or two about resilience, adaptability, and passion. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and face challenges head-on.\n* **Embracing change**: Be open to new experiences and perspectives, and be willing to adapt to changing circumstances.\n* **Passion and drive**: Let your passions guide you and fuel your pursuits.\n* **Community and connection**: Surround yourself with people who support and uplift you.\n* **Self-care and balance**: Take care of your physical, emotional, and mental well-being to maintain your inner fire.\n\n#DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #PersonalGrowth #MythicalMondays #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalDevelopment #ResilienceMatters #PassionDriven #CommunityFirst #SelfCareSundayVibes #BalanceIsKey', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 13:55:00', '2026-05-04 13:55:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 4, '2026-05-04 13:55:18', '2026-05-04 13:55:18'),
(2742, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for a dragon business/creator on Facebook:\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of embracing our true selves and living our best lives. Here are a few things I\'ve learned along the way:\n\n* Self-care is key: taking time to breathe fire and relax is essential for a happy and healthy life\n* Don\'t be afraid to roar: speaking up and expressing yourself is crucial for building strong relationships and achieving your goals\n* Treasure your friendships: surrounding yourself with supportive and loving people (or dragons) can make all the difference\n* Always keep learning: whether it\'s mastering a new skill or discovering a new hoard, there\'s always room for growth and improvement\n\n#DragonsOfFacebook #FireBreathingTips #SelfCareSunday #RoarWithConfidence #TreasuredFriendships #LearningIsKey #TrendingNow #DragonLife #ProfessionalDragons #FacebookFamous #BusinessOfBeingADragon\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 14:00:00', '2026-05-04 14:00:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-05-04 14:00:23', '2026-05-04 14:00:23'),
