(2745, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Empowering Your Business with Dragon\'s Insight**\n\nAs a business owner, you\'re likely facing numerous challenges in today\'s competitive market. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* Staying ahead of the competition requires continuous innovation and adaptation.\n* Building a strong brand identity is crucial for customer loyalty and retention.\n* Effective marketing strategies can make or break your business.\n* Collaborating with the right partners can help you achieve your goals.\n* Embracing new technologies can streamline your operations and increase efficiency.\n\nAt Dragon, we understand the importance of these factors and are committed to helping you succeed. Follow us for more business insights and tips!\n\n#BusinessGrowth #MarketingStrategies #BrandIdentity #Innovation #PartnershipGoals #TechnologySolutions #Entrepreneurship #SmallBusiness #FacebookForBusiness #BusinessTips #TrendingNow #BusinessSuccess #DragonBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 14:37:00', '2026-05-04 14:37:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-04 14:37:18', '2026-05-04 14:37:18'),
