(2747, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated humans. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s approach to life:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on a treasure hoard, you should aim high and strive for excellence in your endeavors.\n* **Protect your passions**: A dragon fiercely guards its territory and treasures; similarly, you should prioritize and defend your values and interests.\n* **Embody courage and resilience**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness and ability to withstand challenges; you can draw inspiration from their bravery and perseverance.\n* **Continuously learn and grow**: As a mythical creature, a dragon\'s wisdom and knowledge are vast; you should also seek out new experiences and opportunities for personal and professional development.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #BusinessLessons #PersonalGrowth #Resilience #Courage #Ambition #TrendingNow #Facebook #InspirationalQuotes #ProfessionalDevelopment #GoalSetting #PassionProtection', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 14:39:00', '2026-05-04 14:39:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-04 14:39:15', '2026-05-04 14:39:15'),
(2748, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', 'Here\'s a relatable caption for a dragon-themed business on Facebook:\n\n\"As a powerful and majestic creature, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* Believe in yourself and your abilities\n* Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things\n* Surround yourself with people who support and encourage you\n* Stay focused and motivated, even when the going gets tough\n* Keep learning and growing, and never stop exploring new opportunities\n\n#DragonPower #MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #BusinessInspiration #EntrepreneurLife #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #DragonSlayingGoals\"\n\nThis caption is professional, relatable, and includes trending hashtags to reach a wider audience on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 15:10:00', '2026-05-04 15:10:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-05-04 15:10:20', '2026-05-04 15:10:20'),
(2749, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Empowering Your Business with a Roar**\n\nAs a business owner, you strive for excellence and want to make a lasting impact. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define your mission and vision to guide your business decisions\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your passion\n* **Innovate and adapt**: Stay ahead of the curve by embracing new technologies and trends\n* **Foster a positive culture**: Create a work environment that promotes collaboration, creativity, and growth\n* **Engage with your audience**: Listen to your customers\' needs and provide exceptional service to build loyalty and trust\n\nBy following these principles, you can unleash your business\'s full potential and achieve success. Remember to stay focused, work hard, and always keep your goals in sight.\n\n#BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #Teamwork #CustomerFirst #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #MotivationMonday #FacebookBusiness #GrowYourBusiness #DragonApproved', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 15:14:00', '2026-05-04 15:14:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-05-04 15:14:21', '2026-05-04 15:14:21'),
(2750, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Leadership Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to be a successful leader. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and face challenges head-on.\n* **Passion and drive**: Let your passion fuel your decisions and motivate your team.\n* **Strategic thinking**: Take a step back and assess the situation before making a move.\n* **Loyalty and protection**: Prioritize the well-being and safety of your team.\n* **Continuous learning**: Stay adaptable and open to new ideas and perspectives.\n\n#LeadershipLessons #DragonWisdom #BusinessTips #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #SuccessStories #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #Strategy #LeadershipGoals #Inspiration', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 15:24:00', '2026-05-04 15:24:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-05-04 15:24:20', '2026-05-04 15:24:20'),
