(2753, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a large language model, I don\'t have the capability to create images. But I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends:\n\n**Image Description:**\n\nThe image is a high-resolution, vibrant photo of a group of friends having a great time together. The main subject, a man in his mid-30s, is sitting on a couch, surrounded by his friends in a cozy living room. The room is well-lit, with warm, golden lighting that creates a welcoming atmosphere.\n\nThe man is wearing a casual, yet stylish outfit, consisting of a light-blue shirt, dark jeans, and a pair of sleek, black boots. He has a big smile on his face, and his eyes are sparkling with laughter as he engages in a conversation with his friends.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress. She\'s holding a glass of wine and gazing at the man with a warm, friendly smile. On his right is a tall, lanky guy with a messy mop of blond hair and a faded band t-shirt. He\'s gesturing animatedly with his hands as he talks, adding to the lively atmosphere of the scene.\n\nIn the background, there\'s a large, flat-screen TV mounted on the wall, displaying a sports game. The room is decorated with modern, minimalist furniture, and there are a few potted plants scattered around, adding a touch of greenery to the space.\n\nThe overall mood of the image is one of camaraderie, friendship, and relaxation. The photo is shot from a slightly low angle, which makes the subjects appear more dynamic and engaging. The colors are rich and vibrant, with a slight warm tone that adds to the cozy, inviting atmosphere of the scene.\n\n**Image Specifications:**\n\n* Resolution: 4000 x 3000 pixels\n* Aspect Ratio: 4:3\n* File Format: JPEG\n* Color Profile: sRGB\n* Camera Settings: f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 400\n\nNote that this is just a descriptive text, and not an actual image. If you need a high-quality image, I recommend searching for stock photos or hiring a photographer to capture the scene you have in mind.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 16:06:00', '2026-05-04 16:06:22', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-05-04 16:06:22', '2026-05-04 16:06:22'),
(2754, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is quintessentially cinematic and evocative, blending elements of fashion, photography, and atmospheric conditions to create a visually stunning image. Let\'s break down the key components that contribute to its aesthetic appeal:\n\n1. **Girl Walking with a Transparent Umbrella**: The use of a transparent umbrella is a clever choice. It allows the subject to be protected from the rain while still being fully visible, creating a sense of vulnerability and intimacy. The transparency also adds a layer of elegance and sophistication to the scene.\n\n2. **Light Rain**: The light rain sets a melancholic yet romantic mood. It\'s enough to create reflections and add depth to the image without overpowering the subject. The rain also serves as a natural diffuser, softening the light and reducing harsh shadows.\n\n3. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: Neon lights reflecting off wet pavement are a staple of cinematic and photographic aesthetics. They add a pop of color and vibrancy to the scene, contrasting beautifully with the more muted tones of the rain and the subject\'s outfit. These reflections can also symbolize the urban, modern setting, juxtaposing nature (rain) with human-made structures (neon lights).\n\n4. **Aesthetic Photography**: The term \"aesthetic photography\" refers to the careful consideration of the visual elements in the frame to create a pleasing, often stylized image. In this context, it involves the thoughtful placement of the subject, the use of lighting (both natural and artificial), and the selection of a palette that complements the mood and theme of the photograph.\n\n5. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: Bokeh refers to the aesthetic quality of the blur produced in the out-of-focus parts of an image produced by a lens. Soft bokeh lights, especially from neon signs or streetlights, can add a dreamy, ethereal quality to the photograph. They blur the background, drawing more attention to the subject while maintaining the context of the environment.\n\n6. **Fashionable Outfit**: The subject\'s fashionable outfit is crucial as it adds a layer of storytelling to the image. It can reveal character traits, such as style, confidence, or perhaps a sense of playfulness, depending on the clothing choices. In a cinematic context, clothing is often used to convey personality, status, or the era in which the story is set.\n\n7. **Cinematic Mood**: The overall cinematic mood is achieved through the combination of all these elements. It suggests a narrative beyond the static image, inviting the viewer to ponder the story of the subject, her destination, her thoughts, and her emotions. This mood is enhanced by the use of lighting, color palette, and the subject\'s interaction with her environment.\n\n8. **High-Detail**: The emphasis on high detail suggests that the image is meant to be closely examined. Every element, from the raindrops on the umbrella to the reflections on the street, is crisp and clear, inviting the viewer to explore the scene thoroughly. This level of detail also speaks to the photographer\'s skill in capturing such a moment with clarity and precision.\n\nIn summary, the scene you\'ve described is a masterful blend of atmospheric conditions, stylish elements, and technical photographic skills, all coming together to create an image that is not just visually appealing but also evocative and narrative-rich.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 16:11:00', '2026-05-04 16:11:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-05-04 16:11:24', '2026-05-04 16:11:24'),
(2755, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a quintessential blend of style, atmosphere, and technical photography skills, evoking a sense of cinematic wonder. Let\'s break down the elements that make this scene so captivating:\n\n1. **Girl Walking with a Transparent Umbrella in Light Rain**: The use of a transparent umbrella is a great prop for this scene. It allows the viewer to see the girl\'s face and outfit clearly while still conveying the rainy atmosphere. The light rain adds a sense of delicacy and romance to the scene.\n\n2. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: Neon lights reflecting off wet pavement is a classic aesthetic in urban photography. It adds a vibrant, futuristic feel to the image, contrasting beautifully with the natural element of rain. These reflections can also serve as leading lines, guiding the viewer\'s eye towards the subject.\n\n3. **Aesthetic Photography**: The term \"aesthetic photography\" refers to the creation of images that are visually pleasing and evoke a certain mood or atmosphere. In this case, the combination of the girl, the umbrella, the rain, and the neon lights creates a highly stylized and appealing scene that could fit into various narratives or themes, from romance to mystery.\n\n4. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: Bokeh refers to the aesthetic quality of the blur produced in the out-of-focus parts of an image produced by a lens. Soft bokeh lights, especially from neon signs or streetlights, can add a magical quality to the photograph. It creates depth and separates the subject from the background, drawing more attention to the girl.\n\n5. **Fashionable Outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is a crucial element in this scene, as it contributes to the overall aesthetic and mood. It could range from stylish, waterproof clothing to something more avant-garde, depending on the intended narrative or theme. The outfit should complement the rainy, neon-lit environment, possibly incorporating reflective or water-resistant materials to enhance the visual appeal.\n\n6. **Cinematic Mood**: The description of the scene as having a \"cinematic mood\" suggests that it\'s reminiscent of scenes from movies. This could be due to the dramatic lighting, the stylized setting, or the narrative potential of the image. Cinematic photography often aims to tell a story or evoke a certain emotional response from the viewer, and this scene, with its carefully chosen elements, does just that.\n\n7. **High-Detail**: The emphasis on high detail suggests that the photograph is not just about capturing a moment but also about showcasing the textures, colors, and intricacies of the scene. From the droplets of water on the umbrella and the girl\'s clothing to the neon reflections and the bokeh of the lights, every element is sharply defined, inviting the viewer to explore the image closely.\n\nIn summary, the scene of a girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain, set against a backdrop of neon reflections on a wet street, embodies a perfect blend of style, atmosphere, and technical skill. It\'s an image that could inspire narratives, evoke emotions, and stand as a testament to the beauty of aesthetic photography.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 16:11:00', '2026-05-04 16:11:32', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-05-04 16:11:32', '2026-05-04 16:11:32'),
(2756, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'It looks like you\'re just testing. Is there something I can help you with or would you like to start a conversation?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 16:33:00', '2026-05-04 16:33:19', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Tester?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 48, '2026-05-04 16:33:19', '2026-05-04 16:33:19'),
(2757, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football is a widely popular sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nThere are several types of football, including:\n\n1. **Association Football** (or Soccer): This is the most widely played and watched version of football, played with a round ball and emphasizing kicking, heading, and ball control.\n2. **American Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying or throwing the ball, with a focus on physical contact and tackling.\n3. **Rugby Football**: This version is similar to American Football but with a few key differences, such as the shape of the ball and the rules of the game.\n4. **Australian Rules Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes running, kicking, and tackling.\n\nThe sport has a massive global following, with top leagues like the English Premier League, La Liga, and the NFL (National Football League) in the United States. The FIFA World Cup, held every four years, is one of the most widely watched and followed sporting events in the world.\n\nSome of the most famous football players include:\n\n* Lionel Messi\n* Cristiano Ronaldo\n* Diego Maradona\n* Pele\n* Tom Brady\n* Aaron Rodgers\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 16:33:00', '2026-05-04 16:33:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-04 16:33:20', '2026-05-04 16:33:20'),
(2758, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The Yamaha R1 is a high-performance sport bike produced by Yamaha Motor Company. Here are some key features and specs:\n\n**Model Overview:**\nThe Yamaha R1 is a flagship model in Yamaha\'s supersport lineup, known for its exceptional handling, powerful engine, and advanced technology features.\n\n**Engine:**\nThe R1 is powered by a 998cc, inline-four cylinder engine that produces 200 horsepower and 82.9 lb-ft of torque. The engine features a number of advanced technologies, including Yamaha\'s Crossplane Crankshaft Concept, which helps to reduce vibration and improve power delivery.\n\n**Transmission:**\nThe R1 has a 6-speed transmission with a quickshifter, allowing for fast and seamless shifting.\n\n**Brakes:**\nThe R1 features dual 320mm brake discs with 4-piston calipers in the front, and a 220mm brake disc with a 2-piston caliper in the rear.\n\n**Suspension:**\nThe R1 has a 43mm inverted fork with 4.7 inches of travel in the front, and a monoshock with 4.7 inches of travel in the rear.\n\n**Electronics:**\nThe R1 features a range of advanced electronic rider aids, including traction control, slide control, and wheelie control. The bike also has a number of ride modes, including a track mode and a street mode.\n\n**Other Features:**\nThe R1 has a number of other notable features, including:\n\n* LED headlights and taillights\n* A full-color TFT instrument panel\n* A USB port and 12V power outlet\n* A lightweight aluminum frame and swingarm\n\n**Specifications:**\n\n* Engine: 998cc, inline-four cylinder\n* Power: 200 horsepower\n* Torque: 82.9 lb-ft\n* Transmission: 6-speed with quickshifter\n* Brakes: Dual 320mm discs with 4-piston calipers (front), 220mm disc with 2-piston caliper (rear)\n* Suspension: 43mm inverted fork (front), monoshock (rear)\n* Seat Height: 32.5 inches\n* Wheelbase: 55.3 inches\n* Fuel Capacity: 4.5 gallons\n* Wet Weight: 448 pounds\n\nOverall, the Yamaha R1 is a highly capable and highly sought-after sport bike that is well-suited for both track and street riding.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 16:42:00', '2026-05-04 16:42:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-04 16:42:24', '2026-05-04 16:42:24'),
(2759, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby. He first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense\" #39 in March 1963.\n\nIron Man\'s secret identity is Tony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist who created a powered exoskeleton suit to save his life after being kidnapped and injured. The suit, which is made of iron and titanium, provides superhuman strength, flight, and a range of other abilities.\n\nOver the years, Iron Man has become one of the most popular and iconic superheroes in the Marvel Universe, with numerous comic book series, animated TV shows, and live-action movies. The character has been portrayed by Robert Downey Jr. in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) movies, including:\n\n1. Iron Man (2008)\n2. The Incredible Hulk (2008) - cameo appearance\n3. Iron Man 2 (2010)\n4. The Avengers (2012)\n5. Iron Man 3 (2013)\n6. Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n7. Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n8. Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) - cameo appearance\n9. Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n10. Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\nIron Man\'s character has undergone significant development over the years, from a self-centered billionaire to a selfless hero who is willing to sacrifice himself for the greater good. His relationships with other characters, such as Pepper Potts, James Rhodes, and the other Avengers, have also been explored in depth.\n\nSome of Iron Man\'s notable abilities and features include:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight\n* Repulsor technology, which allows him to project energy blasts and propel himself\n* Advanced computer systems and artificial intelligence, including JARVIS and FRIDAY\n* A range of suits, each with its own unique features and abilities\n* A genius-level intellect and expertise in engineering and physics\n\nOverall, Iron Man is a beloved and complex character who has become an integral part of popular culture.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 17:30:00', '2026-05-04 17:30:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-04 17:30:18', '2026-05-04 17:30:18');
