(2763, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:49', 'Wooden crafts are a popular and creative hobby that involves working with wood to create various items, such as furniture, decorations, and other objects. Here are some popular types of wooden crafts:\n\n1. **Wood Carving**: This involves carving and shaping wood to create intricate designs, patterns, and figures.\n2. **Woodworking**: This involves using various tools and techniques to create wooden objects, such as furniture, cabinets, and other items.\n3. **Wood Burning**: This involves using a heated tool to burn designs and patterns onto wooden surfaces.\n4. **Wood Turning**: This involves using a lathe to shape and create symmetrical objects, such as bowls, cups, and vases.\n5. **Wood Inlay**: This involves creating intricate designs and patterns by inlaying small pieces of wood into a larger wooden surface.\n6. **Wood Marquetry**: This involves creating intricate designs and patterns by inlaying small pieces of wood into a larger wooden surface, similar to wood inlay.\n7. **Pyrography**: This involves using a heated tool to burn designs and patterns onto wooden surfaces, similar to wood burning.\n8. **Intarsia**: This involves creating intricate designs and patterns by inlaying small pieces of wood into a larger wooden surface, similar to wood inlay and wood marquetry.\n\nSome popular wooden craft projects include:\n\n1. **Birdhouses**: Building wooden birdhouses to attract birds to your yard.\n2. **Picture Frames**: Creating wooden picture frames to display your favorite photos.\n3. **Coat Racks**: Building wooden coat racks to hang your coats and hats.\n4. **Shelves**: Creating wooden shelves to store books, decorations, and other items.\n5. **Ornaments**: Carving and shaping wood to create decorative ornaments, such as Christmas ornaments.\n6. **Toys**: Building wooden toys, such as wooden cars, trains, and puzzles.\n7. **Furniture**: Creating wooden furniture, such as chairs, tables, and beds.\n8. **Decorations**: Creating wooden decorations, such as wooden signs, wall art, and centerpieces.\n\nWooden crafts can be a fun and rewarding hobby, allowing you to create unique and personalized items for your home and loved ones.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 17:49:00', '2026-05-04 17:49:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/wood_spoon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2026-05-04 17:49:17', '2026-05-04 17:49:17'),
(2764, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of materials such as ceramic, plastic, wood, or clay. Flower pots come in a wide range of sizes, shapes, and designs, and can be used to add a decorative touch to indoor or outdoor spaces.\n\nSome common features of flower pots include:\n\n1. Drainage holes: These allow excess water to escape, preventing waterlogged soil and root rot.\n2. Handles or grips: These make it easier to lift and move the pot.\n3. Decorative designs: Many flower pots feature intricate patterns, colors, and shapes, making them a decorative element in their own right.\n4. Size and depth: Flower pots can range from small, shallow containers to large, deep ones, depending on the type of plant being grown.\n\nFlower pots can be used for a variety of purposes, including:\n\n1. Indoor plants: Flower pots can be used to bring some greenery into your home or office.\n2. Outdoor plants: They can be used to add color and texture to patios, decks, and gardens.\n3. Herb gardens: Flower pots can be used to grow herbs such as basil, rosemary, and thyme.\n4. Succulent gardens: They can be used to create beautiful and low-maintenance succulent arrangements.\n\nSome popular types of flower pots include:\n\n1. Terracotta pots: Made from natural clay, these pots are breathable and can help regulate soil moisture.\n2. Ceramic pots: These pots are made from clay and other minerals, and can be glazed or unglazed.\n3. Self-watering pots: These pots have a built-in water reservoir that allows plants to draw water as needed.\n4. Hanging pots: These pots are designed to be suspended from a hook or chain, adding a decorative element to walls or ceilings.\n\nOverall, flower pots are a versatile and essential tool for gardeners and plant enthusiasts, allowing us to grow and display a wide range of beautiful plants.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-04 18:07:00', '2026-05-04 18:07:14', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-05-04 18:07:14', '2026-05-04 18:07:14'),
