(2797, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football is a popular sport played by two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal. There are several types of football, including:\n\n1. **Association Football** (or Soccer): This is the most widely played and watched version of football, played with a round ball and emphasizing kicking and heading.\n2. **American Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying and throwing the ball, with a focus on physical tackling.\n3. **Rugby Football**: This version is similar to American Football but with a round ball and a focus on tackling and physicality.\n4. **Australian Rules Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes running, kicking, and carrying the ball.\n5. **Gaelic Football**: This version is played with a round ball and emphasizes kicking, running, and physicality.\n\nSome of the most popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most widely watched and followed international soccer tournament.\n2. **NFL (National Football League)**: The top-level American Football league in the United States.\n3. **English Premier League**: One of the top-level soccer leagues in the world, featuring teams from England.\n4. **Super Bowl**: The championship game of the NFL, one of the most-watched television events in the world.\n\nFootball has a massive global following, with millions of fans attending matches, watching on television, and playing the sport at various levels. The sport has a significant impact on culture, economy, and society, with many countries and communities passionate about their local and national teams.\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-05 16:33:00', '2026-05-05 16:33:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-05 16:33:19', '2026-05-05 16:33:19'),
(2798, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. \n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a super sport bike manufactured by Yamaha Motor Company. It was first introduced in 1998 and has since become one of the most popular and highly-regarded sport bikes in the world.\n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha R1:\n\n1. **Engine**: The R1 is powered by a 998cc, liquid-cooled, inline-four cylinder engine that produces around 200 horsepower.\n2. **Transmission**: The bike features a 6-speed manual transmission with a multi-plate clutch.\n3. **Chassis**: The R1 has a lightweight aluminum frame with a swingarm and a rear shock absorber.\n4. **Brakes**: The bike is equipped with dual 320mm front brake discs and a 220mm rear brake disc, both with ABS.\n5. **Suspension**: The R1 features a 43mm inverted front fork and a rear shock absorber with adjustable damping and spring preload.\n6. **Electronics**: The bike is equipped with advanced electronics, including traction control, slide control, and a quickshifter.\n7. **Design**: The R1 has a sleek and aerodynamic design, with a distinctive front fairing and a rear seat cowl.\n\nThe Yamaha R1 is known for its exceptional performance, handling, and braking capabilities, making it a favorite among sport bike enthusiasts and track riders. It\'s also a popular choice for racing and has won numerous championships in various racing series.\n\nDo you have any specific questions about the Yamaha R1 or would you like to know more about its features and capabilities?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-05 16:42:00', '2026-05-05 16:42:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-05 16:42:21', '2026-05-05 16:42:21'),
(2799, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:15', '**Scaling New Heights: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a mythical creature, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, adaptability, and innovation. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your business and personal life:\n\n* **Embracing Change**: Just like how I adapt to new environments, you too can learn to pivot and thrive in an ever-changing world.\n* **Resilience**: Withstanding challenges and setbacks is crucial for success - remember, I\'ve been through fire and flames!\n* **Strategic Vision**: My keen eyesight allows me to spot opportunities from afar, helping me stay ahead of the curve.\n* **Community Building**: I may be a solo creature, but I understand the importance of building strong relationships and nurturing a loyal community.\n\nTake these lessons to heart and watch your business soar to new heights! #DragonInspiration #BusinessLessons #TrendingNow #InnovationNation #ResilienceMatters #AdaptAndThrive #CommunityFirst #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalTips #MythicalMentor', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-05 17:15:00', '2026-05-05 17:15:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 6, '2026-05-05 17:15:19', '2026-05-05 17:15:19'),
(2800, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby. He first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense #39\" in March 1963.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is the founder of Stark Industries, a cutting-edge technology company. While on a business trip to demonstrate his company\'s new missile technology, Tony is kidnapped by a group of terrorists who demand that he build a missile system for them. Instead, Tony uses the resources available to him to create a powered exoskeleton suit, which he uses to escape from captivity. He later refines the suit and becomes the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit is a high-tech, powered exoskeleton that provides him with superhuman strength, speed, and agility. The suit is equipped with a range of advanced technologies, including:\n\n* Repulsor technology, which allows him to fly and project energy blasts\n* Advanced sensors and scanners, which allow him to detect and track targets\n* Superhuman strength, thanks to the suit\'s powered limbs\n* Enhanced durability, thanks to the suit\'s advanced materials and construction\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a complex and multifaceted character. He is:\n\n* Highly intelligent and resourceful, with a genius-level intellect\n* Confident and charismatic, with a strong sense of humor\n* Arrogant and self-centered, with a tendency to put himself first\n* Haunted by his past mistakes and personal demons\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man movie franchise, which is part of the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), has been incredibly successful. The franchise includes:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\nThe movies have been critically acclaimed and commercially successful, with Robert Downey Jr. bringing the character to life in a iconic performance.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has had a significant impact on popular culture, inspiring countless fans around the world. The character has also spawned numerous spin-offs, including video games, animated series, and merchandise.\n\nWhat would you like to know about Iron Man?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-05 17:30:00', '2026-05-05 17:30:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-05 17:30:21', '2026-05-05 17:30:21'),
(2801, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and captivating visual representation of success, confidence, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the elements that come together to create this cinematic scene:\n\n1. **Professional Businessman**: The subject of the image is a well-dressed businessman, likely in his 30s or 40s, wearing a tailored suit that exudes professionalism and sophistication. His attire suggests a high level of success and authority in his field.\n\n2. **Confident Stance**: He stands confidently on the basketball court, with his feet shoulder-width apart, conveying a sense of stability and control. His posture is upright, and his head is held high, indicating self-assurance and a success mindset.\n\n3. **Basketball in Hand**: The businessman holds a basketball in one hand, which adds an interesting dynamic to the image. The ball represents a symbol of challenge, competition, and achievement. By holding it, he may be implying that he\'s ready to take on new challenges or that he\'s a team player who can adapt to different situations.\n\n4. **Basketball Court**: The setting of the image is a basketball court, which is often associated with competition, teamwork, and personal growth. The court\'s lines and markings create a sense of geometric harmony, adding to the overall visual appeal of the image.\n\n5. **Stadium Lights**: The stadium lights behind the businessman create a dramatic and intense atmosphere. The harsh lighting casts deep shadows, accentuating the subject\'s features and emphasizing his confident expression. The lights also create a sense of depth and dimensionality, drawing the viewer\'s eye into the image.\n\n6. **Dramatic Lighting**: The lighting in the image is deliberately dramatic, with strong contrasts between light and dark. This creates a sense of tension and energy, underscoring the businessman\'s confident and determined attitude. The dramatic lighting also adds a touch of cinematic flair, making the image feel like a still from a movie or a commercial.\n\n7. **Success Mindset**: The overall mood of the image is one of success and achievement. The businessman\'s confident stance, the basketball in his hand, and the dramatic lighting all contribute to a sense of triumph and accomplishment. The image suggests that the subject has overcome obstacles and achieved his goals, and is now ready for the next challenge.\n\n8. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The image is rendered in high resolution, with crisp lines, vivid colors, and precise details. The cinematic style of the image, with its dramatic lighting and composed framing, creates a sense of grandeur and importance. The high-resolution quality makes the image feel immersive and engaging, drawing the viewer into the world of the businessman.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful and captivating visual representation of success, confidence, and determination. The combination of the businessman\'s confident stance, the basketball, the stadium lights, and the dramatic lighting creates a compelling narrative that suggests achievement, triumph, and a strong success mindset.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-05 17:45:00', '2026-05-05 17:45:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-05 17:45:21', '2026-05-05 17:45:21'),
(2802, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'The image you\'ve described is one of confidence, success, and the blending of two worlds: the corporate and the athletic. Here\'s a detailed breakdown of how this scene could be visually represented in a high-resolution, cinematic style:\n\n1. **Subject (The Businessman):**\n   - **Attire:** He\'s wearing a tailored, sleek business suit that accentuates his physique, suggesting a blend of professionalism and athleticism. The suit could be a dark color to contrast with the bright lights of the stadium, emphasizing his figure against the backdrop.\n   - **Posture and Expression:** Standing tall with his shoulders back, exuding confidence and a sense of victory. His facial expression is one of determination and success, possibly with a hint of a smile to suggest satisfaction and pride in his accomplishments.\n   - **The Ball:** He\'s holding a basketball, which could be positioned in a way that suggests he\'s about to make a powerful move, whether that\'s to shoot, pass, or dribble. The ball could be slightly illuminated, catching the light and drawing the viewer\'s eye to his hands.\n\n2. **Setting (The Basketball Court):**\n   - **Lighting:** The stadium lights are the primary source of illumination, casting dramatic shadows across the court. The lighting could be adjusted to highlight the subject from behind, creating a silhouette effect that emphasizes his form against the brightness of the lights. This backlighting could also create a halo effect around him, symbolizing success and achievement.\n   - **Court Details:** The basketball court could be slightly out of focus in the foreground and background, with the subject being the clear point of focus. However, enough detail should be preserved to establish the setting clearly as a basketball court, such as the free throw line, the hoop, or the court\'s pattern.\n\n3. **Color Palette:**\n   - **Dominant Colors:** The dominant colors could be the deep, rich tones of the suit and the vibrant, yet slightly muted, colors of the basketball court. The stadium lights could add a bright, almost golden glow, enhancing the dramatic effect of the scene.\n   - **Contrast:** The contrast between the cool tones of the suit and the warm tones of the stadium lights could add depth and visual interest to the image, highlighting the subject against the backdrop.\n\n4. **Cinematic Elements:**\n   - **Depth of Field:** A shallow depth of field could be used to blur the background (the court and the stadium beyond) slightly, keeping the focus sharply on the businessman. This would help in isolating the subject and emphasizing his central role in the scene.\n   - **Composition:** The composition could follow cinematic principles, such as the rule of thirds, to place the subject in a dynamic position within the frame. The lines of the court could lead the viewer\'s eye to the subject, creating a sense of movement and energy.\n\n5. **Mood and Message:**\n   - The overall mood of the image is one of success, confidence, and the achievement of goals. It suggests that the subject is not limited to one domain (business or sports) but excels in multiple areas, embodying a versatile and dynamic personality.\n   - The message could be about the intersection of different passions and professions, showing how success in one area (like business) can translate to confidence and prowess in another (like sports), and vice versa.\n\nThis visual representation would be a powerful statement about ambition, versatility, and the pursuit of excellence across different fields of endeavor.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-05 17:46:00', '2026-05-05 17:46:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-05 17:46:17', '2026-05-05 17:46:17'),
(2803, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:47', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the elements that come together to create this striking scene:\n\n1. **The Subject: A Professional Businessman** - The central figure is a businessman, identifiable by his suit, which immediately conveys a sense of professionalism and authority. The fact that he\'s standing on a basketball court, an environment not typically associated with business attire, suggests a blending of worlds or a metaphor for applying business strategies to other challenges.\n\n2. **Confident Stance** - The businessman is described as standing confidently. His posture, likely with feet shoulder-width apart and head held high, exudes self-assurance and control. This confident stance on a basketball court, a space where physical prowess and competitive spirit are paramount, implies that he\'s a man who can adapt and thrive in any environment.\n\n3. **The Basketball** - The ball in his hand serves as a prop that links him to the court. It could symbolize his ability to \"play the game\" in multiple arenas—be it business, sports, or life in general. Holding the ball might also signify that he\'s about to take action, make a move, or seize an opportunity, much like a player on the court.\n\n4. **Stadium Lights and Dramatic Lighting** - The setting is illuminated by stadium lights, which typically cast a bright, somewhat harsh glow. This dramatic lighting creates sharp shadows and highlights the subject\'s features, emphasizing his confident expression and the texture of his suit. The lighting also contributes to the cinematic feel of the image, drawing the viewer\'s eye to the central figure and creating a sense of drama or anticipation.\n\n5. **Success Mindset** - The overall composition of the image, with its dramatic lighting, confident pose, and juxtaposition of a businessman on a basketball court, conveys a mindset focused on success. It suggests a philosophy of embracing challenges, being adaptable, and maintaining confidence in the face of uncertainty or adversity.\n\n6. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style** - The description of the image as being in \"high-resolution cinematic style\" implies a level of clarity and detail that\'s akin to what one might see in a film. This style likely enhances the dramatic effect of the lighting, the textures of the suit and the basketball, and the overall atmosphere of the scene. It makes the image feel more like a frame from a movie, where every element is carefully considered to convey a specific mood or message.\n\nIn summary, the image of a businessman standing confidently on a basketball court, illuminated by dramatic stadium lights and holding a ball, is a potent symbol of adaptability, confidence, and a mindset geared towards success. It\'s an image that could inspire, motivate, or simply serve as a striking visual commentary on the intersection of different aspects of life and the qualities needed to excel in them.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-05 17:47:00', '2026-05-05 17:47:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-05 17:47:20', '2026-05-05 17:47:20'),
(2804, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:49', 'Wooden crafts are a popular and creative way to work with wood, creating beautiful and functional items for the home, garden, or as gifts. Here are some ideas and techniques for wooden crafts:\n\n**Types of Wooden Crafts:**\n\n1. **Wood Carving:** Carving wooden figures, decorative items, or functional items like spoons and bowls.\n2. **Wood Turning:** Creating symmetrical items like bowls, cups, and vases using a lathe.\n3. **Wood Burning:** Using a pyrography tool to burn designs and patterns into wood.\n4. **Wood Inlay:** Creating intricate designs by inlaying different types of wood into a main wooden piece.\n5. **Woodworking:** Building furniture, cabinets, and other wooden items using various techniques like joinery and finishing.\n\n**Popular Wooden Craft Projects:**\n\n1. **Birdhouses:** Building wooden birdhouses to attract birds to your garden.\n2. **Picture Frames:** Creating custom picture frames using different types of wood and designs.\n3. **Coat Racks:** Building wooden coat racks with hooks and shelves.\n4. **Custom Signs:** Creating personalized wooden signs with names, quotes, or messages.\n5. **Ornaments:** Making wooden ornaments for Christmas trees or other decorative purposes.\n\n**Techniques and Tools:**\n\n1. **Sanding:** Smoothing out wooden surfaces using sandpaper or a sanding block.\n2. **Staining:** Applying stain to enhance the color and texture of the wood.\n3. **Varnishing:** Applying a clear coat to protect the wood and give it a glossy finish.\n4. **Drilling:** Using a drill press or hand drill to make holes for screws or other hardware.\n5. **Jigsaw:** Using a jigsaw to cut curved or irregular shapes in wood.\n\n**Safety Tips:**\n\n1. **Wear protective gear:** Wear safety glasses, a dust mask, and gloves when working with wood.\n2. **Use proper techniques:** Follow proper techniques for cutting, drilling, and sanding to avoid accidents.\n3. **Keep work area clean:** Keep your work area clean and free of clutter to avoid tripping hazards.\n4. **Use sharp tools:** Use sharp tools to avoid accidents and ensure precise cuts.\n5. **Follow instructions:** Follow instructions carefully when working with power tools or new techniques.\n\n**Getting Started:**\n\n1. **Take a class:** Take a class or workshop to learn the basics of wooden crafts.\n2. **Watch tutorials:** Watch online tutorials or videos to learn new techniques and projects.\n3. **Start small:** Start with small projects like birdhouses or picture frames to build your skills and confidence.\n4. **Invest in tools:** Invest in basic tools like a drill, sandpaper, and a jigsaw to get started.\n5. **Practice:** Practice regularly to improve your skills and develop your own style.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-05 17:49:00', '2026-05-05 17:49:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/wood_spoon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2026-05-05 17:49:18', '2026-05-05 17:49:18'),
(2805, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of materials such as ceramic, plastic, or clay. Flower pots come in a wide range of shapes, sizes, and styles, and can be used to add a decorative touch to indoor or outdoor spaces.\n\nSome common features of flower pots include:\n\n1. Drainage holes: These allow excess water to escape, preventing waterlogged soil and root rot.\n2. Handles or grips: These make it easier to lift and move the pot.\n3. Decorative designs: Many flower pots feature intricate designs, patterns, or colors to add visual appeal.\n4. Size and shape: Flower pots can range from small, delicate containers to large, statement pieces.\n\nFlower pots can be used for a variety of plants, including:\n\n1. Flowers: Annuals and perennials, such as roses, daisies, and sunflowers.\n2. Herbs: Basil, mint, and rosemary are popular choices for container gardens.\n3. Succulents: These low-maintenance plants thrive in well-draining pots.\n4. Trees and shrubs: Dwarf varieties of trees and shrubs can be grown in large flower pots.\n\nWhen choosing a flower pot, consider factors such as:\n\n1. Material: Ceramic, plastic, and clay pots have different benefits and drawbacks.\n2. Size: Choose a pot that is large enough to accommodate the mature size of the plant.\n3. Drainage: Ensure the pot has adequate drainage holes to prevent waterlogged soil.\n4. Style: Select a pot that fits with your desired aesthetic, whether modern, traditional, or rustic.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-05 18:07:00', '2026-05-05 18:07:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-05-05 18:07:18', '2026-05-05 18:07:18'),
(2806, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'Here are the weekdays with a \"Good Morning\" greeting:\n\n1. Good Morning, Monday\n2. Good Morning, Tuesday\n3. Good Morning, Wednesday\n4. Good Morning, Thursday\n5. Good Morning, Friday\n\nNote: Saturday and Sunday are typically considered weekend days, not weekdays. If you\'d like, I can add those as well:\n\n6. Good Morning, Saturday\n7. Good Morning, Sunday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-05 18:26:00', '2026-05-05 18:26:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2026-05-05 18:26:16', '2026-05-05 18:26:16'),
