(2856, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Dragon\'s Den: Empowering Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a seasoned business dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what makes a successful venture. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Innovation is key**: Stay ahead of the curve by constantly innovating and improving your products or services.\n* **Risk management is crucial**: Don\'t be afraid to take calculated risks, but always have a plan in place to mitigate potential downsides.\n* **Teamwork makes the dream work**: Surround yourself with a talented and dedicated team that shares your vision.\n* **Adaptability is essential**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change, and stay agile in a rapidly evolving market.\n* **Passion drives success**: Pursue your passions and stay committed to your goals, even in the face of adversity.\n\n#Entrepreneurship #BusinessTips #Innovation #RiskManagement #Teamwork #Adaptability #Passion #SuccessMindset #DragonApproved #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #BusinessInspiration #MotivationMonday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 14:37:00', '2026-05-07 14:37:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-07 14:37:16', '2026-05-07 14:37:16'),
(2857, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Embracing Your Inner Strength: Lessons from a Dragon**\n\nAs a symbol of power and resilience, dragons have long fascinated humans. Here are a few key takeaways from these mythical creatures:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness, reminding us to stand up for ourselves and face challenges head-on.\n* **Protection and guardianship**: As fiercely protective creatures, dragons teach us the importance of safeguarding our loved ones and our passions.\n* **Adaptability and evolution**: With their ability to thrive in various environments, dragons show us that growth and transformation are essential for success.\n* **Inner fire and passion**: The dragon\'s fiery spirit inspires us to tap into our own inner spark and pursue our goals with determination and enthusiasm.\n\nLet\'s embody the strength and wisdom of the dragon, and unleash our full potential!\n\n#DragonInspiration #InnerStrength #CourageOverFear #ResilienceMatters #PersonalGrowth #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalDevelopment #BusinessMotivation #SuccessTips', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 14:38:00', '2026-05-07 14:38:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-07 14:38:19', '2026-05-07 14:38:19'),
