(2859, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Dragon\'s Den: Empowering Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a symbol of power and resilience, we\'re excited to share our vision with you. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Innovation**: We strive to stay ahead of the curve, embracing new ideas and technologies to drive growth and success.\n* **Community**: Our goal is to build a supportive network of like-minded individuals who share our passion for entrepreneurship and innovation.\n* **Growth**: We believe in continuous learning and improvement, always looking for ways to expand our knowledge and expertise.\n* **Collaboration**: By working together, we can achieve great things and create a lasting impact.\n\nJoin us on this exciting journey and let\'s soar to new heights! #DragonsDen #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #CommunityFirst #GrowthMindset #CollaborationOverCompetition #TrendingNow #BusinessSuccess #NewBeginnings #EmpowermentThroughEntrepreneurship', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 15:10:00', '2026-05-07 15:10:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-05-07 15:10:20', '2026-05-07 15:10:20'),
(2860, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Empowering Your Business with Dragon\'s Fire**\n\nAs a business owner, you\'re likely no stranger to the challenges of staying ahead in a competitive market. At Dragon, we understand the importance of adaptability, innovation, and community engagement. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Stay agile**: Be prepared to pivot your strategy in response to changing market trends and consumer needs.\n* **Invest in innovation**: Continuously update your products, services, and processes to stay ahead of the curve.\n* **Build a strong community**: Foster relationships with your customers, partners, and industry peers to drive growth and loyalty.\n* **Monitor and adjust**: Keep a close eye on your performance metrics and make data-driven decisions to optimize your business.\n\nBy following these principles, you can unlock your business\'s full potential and achieve long-term success. Join the conversation and share your own tips for business growth!\n\n#BusinessGrowth #Innovation #CommunityFirst #AdaptabilityMatters #TrendingNow #Entrepreneurship #SmallBusiness #DragonBusinessTips #FacebookForBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 15:14:00', '2026-05-07 15:14:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-05-07 15:14:24', '2026-05-07 15:14:24'),
(2861, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about passion, resilience, and strategy. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define what you want to achieve and create a plan to get there.\n* **Stay focused**: Avoid distractions and stay committed to your objectives.\n* **Be adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change.\n* **Learn from failures**: Use setbacks as opportunities to grow and improve.\n* **Surround yourself with support**: Build a network of people who believe in you and your vision.\n\n#MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #DragonInspiration #EntrepreneurMindset #BusinessGoals #ProductivityHacks #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #LeadershipTips #GoalSetting #ResilienceMatters', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 15:24:00', '2026-05-07 15:24:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-05-07 15:24:19', '2026-05-07 15:24:19'),
