(2865, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a visually stunning and atmospheric depiction, perfect for aesthetic photography. Let\'s break down the elements to understand what makes this image so captivating:\n\n1. **Girl walking with a transparent umbrella**: The use of a transparent umbrella is a clever choice. It not only protects the girl from the rain but also allows the viewer to see her outfit and movements clearly. The transparency adds a layer of elegance and sophistication to the image.\n\n2. **Light rain**: Light rain creates a romantic and melancholic atmosphere, which is perfect for a cinematic mood. It also serves as a beautiful backdrop for the neon reflections, making them more pronounced and vibrant.\n\n3. **Neon reflections on wet street**: Neon reflections on a wet street are a hallmark of urban aesthetic photography. The reflections add a pop of color and create a sense of depth and dimensionality in the image. They also highlight the wetness of the street, which can create interesting patterns and textures.\n\n4. **Aesthetic photography**: Aesthetic photography is all about capturing the beauty and essence of a scene. In this case, the photographer has carefully composed the shot to highlight the girl, the umbrella, and the neon reflections, creating a visually appealing image.\n\n5. **Soft bokeh lights**: Soft bokeh lights refer to the blurred, out-of-focus lights in the background. This effect creates a sense of depth and separates the subject from the background, making her stand out. Soft bokeh lights also add a touch of warmth and coziness to the image.\n\n6. **Fashionable outfit**: The girl\'s fashionable outfit is an essential element in this image. It adds a touch of style and sophistication, making the scene more interesting and dynamic. The outfit could be anything from a chic dress to a stylish coat and accessories, depending on the photographer\'s vision.\n\n7. **Cinematic mood**: The cinematic mood is achieved through the combination of the light rain, neon reflections, and soft bokeh lights. This mood creates a sense of drama and atmosphere, making the image feel like a still from a movie.\n\n8. **High-detail**: High-detail photography refers to the level of sharpness and clarity in the image. In this case, the photographer has likely used a high-quality camera and lens to capture the intricate details of the scene, from the girl\'s outfit to the neon reflections on the wet street.\n\nTo capture this image, a photographer would need to consider the following:\n\n* **Camera settings**: A camera with manual controls would be ideal, allowing the photographer to adjust the aperture, shutter speed, and ISO to achieve the desired effect.\n* **Lens choice**: A lens with a wide aperture (such as f/1.4 or f/2.8) would be suitable for creating a shallow depth of field and soft bokeh lights.\n* **Lighting**: The light rain and neon reflections would provide most of the lighting, but the photographer might need to adjust the camera settings to balance the exposure.\n* **Composition**: The photographer would need to carefully compose the shot, considering the placement of the girl, the umbrella, and the neon reflections to create a visually appealing image.\n* **Post-processing**: Finally, the photographer might need to edit the image in post-processing software to enhance the colors, contrast, and details, ensuring that the final image meets their artistic vision.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 16:11:00', '2026-05-07 16:11:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-05-07 16:11:22', '2026-05-07 16:11:22'),
(2866, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'It looks like you\'re testing something. Is there something I can help you with or would you like to start a conversation?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 16:33:00', '2026-05-07 16:33:16', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Tester?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 48, '2026-05-07 16:33:16', '2026-05-07 16:33:16'),
(2867, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nThere are several types of football, including:\n\n1. **Association Football (Soccer)**: This is the most widely played and watched version of football, played with a round ball and emphasizing kicking and heading.\n2. **American Football**: A contact team sport played with an oval-shaped ball, emphasizing carrying and throwing the ball.\n3. **Rugby Football**: A full-contact team sport played with an oval-shaped ball, emphasizing carrying, passing, and tackling.\n4. **Australian Rules Football**: A contact team sport played with an oval-shaped ball, emphasizing carrying, kicking, and tackling.\n\nSome of the most popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most widely watched and followed international soccer tournament.\n2. **UEFA Champions League**: A premier European club soccer competition.\n3. **NFL (National Football League)**: The top-level American football league in the United States.\n4. **English Premier League**: A top-level English soccer league.\n\nFootball has a massive global following, with millions of fans attending matches, watching on TV, and playing the sport at various levels. It\'s a sport that requires skill, strategy, and physical fitness, and its popularity continues to grow and evolve.\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 16:33:00', '2026-05-07 16:33:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-07 16:33:17', '2026-05-07 16:33:17'),
(2868, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. You\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sport bike manufactured by Yamaha. \n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha YZF-R1:\n\n1. **Engine**: 998cc, liquid-cooled, 4-stroke, DOHC, 16-valve, in-line four-cylinder engine.\n2. **Power**: Produces 200 horsepower at 13,500 rpm.\n3. **Transmission**: 6-speed constant mesh transmission.\n4. **Chassis**: Aluminum Deltabox frame with a swingarm.\n5. **Suspension**: 43mm inverted fork (front) and monoshock (rear).\n6. **Brakes**: Dual 320mm discs (front) and single 220mm disc (rear).\n7. **Electronics**: Features advanced electronics, including traction control, slide control, and wheel lift control.\n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a popular choice among sport bike enthusiasts, known for its exceptional handling, braking, and acceleration. It\'s a track-focused bike that\'s also suitable for street riding.\n\nAre you a fan of the R1, or do you have any specific questions about the bike?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 16:42:00', '2026-05-07 16:42:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-07 16:42:18', '2026-05-07 16:42:18'),
(2869, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, developed by scripter Larry Lieber, and designed by artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is the founder of Stark Industries, a cutting-edge technology company. While demonstrating his company\'s latest missile technology in Afghanistan, Tony is kidnapped by a terrorist group called the Ten Rings. Held captive, Tony is forced to build a powerful missile system for the group. Instead, he uses the resources provided to him to create a powered exoskeleton suit, which he uses to escape.\n\nUpon his return to the United States, Tony perfects the suit, adding advanced technologies such as repulsor technology, a propulsion system, and a sophisticated AI system, JARVIS (Just A Rather Very Intelligent System). Donning the suit, Tony becomes the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit provides him with a range of abilities, including:\n\n1. **Superhuman Strength**: The suit\'s advanced propulsion system and repulsor technology grant Tony superhuman strength.\n2. **Flight**: The suit\'s propulsion system allows Tony to fly.\n3. **Energy Projection**: The suit\'s repulsor technology enables Tony to project energy blasts from his hands.\n4. **Advanced Sensors**: The suit\'s advanced sensors provide Tony with real-time data on his surroundings.\n5. **Artificial Intelligence**: JARVIS, the suit\'s AI system, assists Tony in various tasks, including strategic planning and tactical analysis.\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a charismatic and confident billionaire playboy. He is highly intelligent and resourceful, often relying on his wit and cunning to outmaneuver his enemies. Tony\'s ego and arrogance can sometimes lead to conflicts with his fellow superheroes, but he is ultimately driven by a desire to protect the world from threats both human and superhuman.\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been featured in numerous movies, including:\n\n1. **Iron Man (2008)**: The first movie in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man.\n2. **Iron Man 2 (2010)**: The sequel to the first movie, with Robert Downey Jr. reprising his role as Tony Stark/Iron Man.\n3. **The Avengers (2012)**: Iron Man joins forces with other superheroes, including Captain America, Thor, and the Hulk, to save the world from an alien invasion.\n4. **Iron Man 3 (2013)**: Tony Stark faces a personal crisis and a new enemy, the Mandarin, in the third installment of the Iron Man series.\n5. **Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)**: Iron Man and the Avengers face a new threat, the artificial intelligence Ultron.\n6. **Captain America: Civil War (2016)**: Iron Man and Captain America clash over the Sokovia Accords, a UN treaty that regulates the Avengers\' activities.\n7. **Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)**: Tony Stark mentors Peter Parker, aka Spider-Man, in this Marvel Cinematic Universe movie.\n8. **Avengers: Infinity War (2018)**: Iron Man and the Avengers face their greatest challenge yet, as they battle Thanos and his army of Chitauri.\n9. **Avengers: Endgame (2019)**: The final movie in the Infinity Saga, in which Iron Man makes the ultimate sacrifice to save the world from Thanos.\n\nThe Iron Man character has become an iconic figure in popular culture, symbolizing innovation, intelligence, and courage.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 17:30:00', '2026-05-07 17:30:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-07 17:30:17', '2026-05-07 17:30:17'),
(2870, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, combining elements of business acumen, athletic prowess, and a strong sense of confidence and success. Here\'s a breakdown of the key components and how they contribute to the overall impact of the scene:\n\n1. **Professional Businessman in a Suit**: The suit immediately conveys a sense of professionalism, maturity, and success in the business world. It\'s a uniform that commands respect and suggests a high level of competence in corporate or financial matters.\n\n2. **Standing Confidently on a Basketball Court**: The basketball court is an unexpected backdrop for someone dressed in business attire, which adds an interesting layer of complexity to the image. The confidence with which the businessman stands on the court suggests he is not out of place, even in an environment typically associated with sports rather than business. This juxtaposition can imply that the individual is multifaceted, capable of navigating different worlds with ease.\n\n3. **Ball in Hand**: Holding a basketball adds a dynamic element to the scene, suggesting engagement and readiness to act. It could symbolize the businessman\'s ability to \'play the game\' in both business and sports, highlighting versatility and strategic thinking.\n\n4. **Stadium Lights Behind Him**: The dramatic lighting provided by the stadium lights elevates the scene, giving it a cinematic quality. It creates a sense of drama and highlights the figure, making him the central focus of the image. The lighting can also symbolize the spotlight, suggesting that the businessman is under scrutiny or is a key player in his field.\n\n5. **Dramatic Lighting**: The use of dramatic lighting enhances the cinematic feel of the image, contributing to its high-resolution, cinematic style. It adds depth, creates shadows, and can evoke emotions, making the scene more engaging and impactful.\n\n6. **Success Mindset**: The overall composition of the image, including the confident stance, the juxtaposition of the suit with the basketball court, and the dramatic lighting, conveys a strong success mindset. It suggests that the individual is not only successful but also believes in his ability to succeed in various challenges he might face.\n\n7. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The high-resolution aspect of the image ensures that every detail, from the texture of the suit to the shine of the basketball, is crisp and clear. The cinematic style gives the image a movie-like quality, which can inspire a sense of aspiration or admiration in the viewer.\n\nIn summary, the image of a businessman standing confidently on a basketball court, dressed in a suit and holding a ball, set against the backdrop of dramatic stadium lighting, is a powerful symbol of success, versatility, and a strong mindset. It suggests that the individual is capable of achieving greatness in multiple arenas, and it does so in a visually striking and memorable way.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 17:45:00', '2026-05-07 17:45:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-07 17:45:24', '2026-05-07 17:45:24'),
(2871, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and striking visual representation of success, confidence, and determination. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that come together to create this captivating scene:\n\n**The Professional Businessman:**\nThe subject, a well-dressed businessman in a suit, exudes an air of confidence and authority. His attire suggests a high level of professionalism and success in his field. The fact that he\'s standing on a basketball court, rather than in a traditional business setting, adds an element of unexpectedness and intrigue.\n\n**The Basketball Court:**\nThe basketball court provides a unique and dynamic backdrop for the scene. The polished wooden floor, the hoops, and the stadium lights all contribute to a sense of energy and competition. The court represents a space where individuals can test their skills, push their limits, and strive for excellence – all qualities that are highly valued in the business world.\n\n**The Ball in His Hand:**\nThe basketball in the businessman\'s hand serves as a symbol of control, focus, and determination. It suggests that he\'s ready to take action, to make a move, and to seize opportunities. The ball also represents a connection to the court and the game, implying that the businessman is not just a spectator, but an active participant.\n\n**Stadium Lights Behind Him:**\nThe stadium lights casting a dramatic glow behind the businessman create a sense of drama and emphasis. The lights represent the spotlight, highlighting the subject\'s achievements and accomplishments. The harsh shadows and highlights produced by the lights add depth and dimension to the image, making it more engaging and cinematic.\n\n**Dramatic Lighting:**\nThe dramatic lighting in the scene is a key element in creating a sense of tension and anticipation. The strong contrasts between light and dark areas of the image draw the viewer\'s eye to the subject, emphasizing his presence and importance. The lighting also helps to create a sense of atmosphere, setting the tone for a high-stakes, high-reward situation.\n\n**Success Mindset:**\nThe overall mood and attitude conveyed by the image are those of success, confidence, and a winning mentality. The businessman\'s stance, facial expression, and body language all suggest that he\'s a high achiever, someone who\'s accustomed to overcoming challenges and reaching his goals.\n\n**High-Resolution Cinematic Style:**\nThe image is rendered in a high-resolution, cinematic style, which adds to its overall sense of drama and spectacle. The level of detail, the color palette, and the composition all contribute to a visually stunning representation of the scene. The cinematic style also implies a sense of storytelling, inviting the viewer to imagine the narrative behind the image – what challenges has the businessman overcome, and what successes has he achieved?\n\nIn summary, the image of the businessman standing confidently on a basketball court, with a ball in his hand and stadium lights behind him, is a powerful representation of success, determination, and a winning mindset. The combination of elements, including the dramatic lighting, cinematic style, and symbolic props, creates a captivating visual narrative that draws the viewer in and inspires them to strive for greatness.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 17:46:00', '2026-05-07 17:46:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-07 17:46:19', '2026-05-07 17:46:19'),
(2872, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:47', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, blending elements of business acumen, athletic prowess, and cinematic flair. Let\'s break down the components that make this scene so compelling:\n\n1. **Professional Businessman**: The subject of the image is a businessman, immediately conveying a sense of professionalism, discipline, and success. The fact that he\'s wearing a suit suggests a high level of sophistication and elegance, which contrasts interestingly with the athletic setting.\n\n2. **Standing Confidently on a Basketball Court**: The basketball court is an unexpected backdrop for a businessman, which makes the image intriguing. The confidence with which he stands suggests he\'s not out of place; he owns this space as much as he would a boardroom. This juxtaposition of environments adds a layer of complexity to the character, implying he\'s multifaceted and capable of navigating different worlds with ease.\n\n3. **With a Ball in His Hand**: Holding a basketball, the businessman is not just a spectator; he\'s a participant. This could symbolize his hands-on approach to challenges, whether in business or other areas of life. The ball also serves as a metaphor for the challenges and opportunities he faces, which he\'s ready to grasp and act upon.\n\n4. **Stadium Lights Behind Him**: The dramatic lighting provided by the stadium lights creates a heroic silhouette, elevating the businessman to a stature of greatness. It\'s as if he\'s basking in the glory of his achievements, with the light symbolizing success, knowledge, and enlightenment.\n\n5. **Dramatic Lighting**: The use of dramatic lighting enhances the cinematic feel of the image, adding depth and emotion. It can create shadows that add mystery and highlight the subject\'s facial expressions and body language, drawing the viewer\'s eye to the essence of the scene.\n\n6. **Success Mindset**: The overall composition of the image exudes a success mindset—confidence, readiness, and a sense of victory. The businessman is not just standing on a basketball court; he\'s standing at the pinnacle of success, with the world at his feet.\n\n7. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The high-resolution cinematic style gives the image a luxurious, premium feel, fitting for a portrayal of success and achievement. The clarity and detail invite the viewer to step into the scene, to feel the texture of the suit, the grain of the basketball, and the brightness of the stadium lights.\n\nThis image, with its blend of business sophistication and athletic dynamism, set against the dramatic backdrop of a basketball court, embodies the essence of modern success. It\'s a visual representation of the idea that success is not confined to one area of life but is a holistic achievement that combines different facets of personality and skill. The cinematic quality turns this moment into a timeless, iconic representation of ambition and triumph.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 17:47:00', '2026-05-07 17:47:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-07 17:47:23', '2026-05-07 17:47:23'),
(2873, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:49', 'Wooden crafts are a popular and rewarding hobby that can be both creative and relaxing. Here are some ideas and techniques to get you started:\n\n**Types of Wooden Crafts:**\n\n1. **Wood Carving:** Carving decorative items, such as figurines, ornaments, or sculptures, from wood.\n2. **Wood Burning:** Using a pyrography tool to burn designs or patterns onto wood.\n3. **Woodworking:** Creating functional items, such as furniture, boxes, or cutting boards, using various woodworking techniques.\n4. **Intarsia:** Creating intricate designs or patterns by fitting together small pieces of wood.\n5. **Marquetry:** Creating designs or patterns by inlaying small pieces of wood into a larger piece.\n\n**Basic Tools and Materials:**\n\n1. **Wood:** Various types of wood, such as pine, oak, maple, or cherry, can be used for wooden crafts.\n2. **Chisels:** Hand tools used for carving and shaping wood.\n3. **Gouges:** Curved chisels used for removing small amounts of wood.\n4. **Saws:** Hand saws or power saws used for cutting wood.\n5. **Sandpaper:** Used for smoothing and finishing wood surfaces.\n6. **Pyrography tool:** A heated tool used for wood burning.\n7. **Adhesives:** Glues, such as wood glue or epoxy, used for bonding wood pieces together.\n\n**Techniques:**\n\n1. **Measuring and marking:** Accurately measuring and marking wood pieces to ensure precise cuts and joints.\n2. **Cutting:** Using saws or other tools to cut wood into desired shapes and sizes.\n3. **Shaping:** Using chisels, gouges, or other tools to shape and smooth wood surfaces.\n4. **Assembling:** Using adhesives and other techniques to assemble multiple wood pieces into a single item.\n5. **Finishing:** Applying finishes, such as stains, varnishes, or polyurethane, to protect and enhance the wood.\n\n**Tips and Safety Precautions:**\n\n1. **Wear protective gear:** Safety glasses, gloves, and a dust mask can help prevent injuries and exposure to wood dust.\n2. **Use proper techniques:** Follow established techniques and guidelines to avoid accidents and ensure successful outcomes.\n3. **Work in a well-ventilated area:** Woodworking and wood burning can generate dust and fumes, so it\'s essential to work in a well-ventilated area.\n4. **Start with simple projects:** Begin with simple projects, such as making a birdhouse or picture frame, to build skills and confidence.\n5. **Practice and patience:** Wooden crafts require patience and practice to develop skills and achieve desired results.\n\n**Inspiration and Resources:**\n\n1. **Online tutorials:** Websites, such as YouTube and Pinterest, offer a wealth of tutorials and inspiration for wooden crafts.\n2. **Books and magazines:** Books and magazines, such as Woodworking Magazine, provide detailed instructions and project ideas.\n3. **Classes and workshops:** Local classes and workshops can provide hands-on instruction and guidance.\n4. **Woodworking communities:** Joining online forums or local woodworking clubs can connect you with other enthusiasts and provide opportunities for learning and sharing ideas.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 17:49:00', '2026-05-07 17:49:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/wood_spoon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2026-05-07 17:49:19', '2026-05-07 17:49:19'),
(2874, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of ceramic, plastic, or clay. It provides a space for roots to grow and helps to retain moisture, making it an essential item for gardening and plant care.\n\nTypes of flower pots include:\n\n1. Terracotta pots: Made from natural clay, these pots are breathable and allow for good air circulation.\n2. Ceramic pots: Often glazed, these pots are durable and come in a variety of colors and designs.\n3. Plastic pots: Lightweight and inexpensive, plastic pots are a popular choice for indoor and outdoor plants.\n4. Wooden pots: Made from natural wood, these pots add a rustic touch to gardens and patios.\n5. Self-watering pots: Designed with a built-in water reservoir, these pots help to reduce watering frequency.\n\nFlower pots come in various shapes, sizes, and styles, making it easy to find one that suits your plants and decor. They can be used to add a decorative touch to gardens, balconies, and indoor spaces, and can help to bring a sense of nature and serenity to any environment.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-07 18:07:00', '2026-05-07 18:07:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-05-07 18:07:16', '2026-05-07 18:07:16'),
