(2885, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of dress shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key features and considerations for formal shirts for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic, traditional formal shirt with a collar, cuffs, and a button-front placket.\n2. **Tuxedo Shirt:** A formal shirt specifically designed to be worn with a tuxedo, typically with a wingtip collar and French cuffs.\n3. **Business Shirt:** A more relaxed, yet still formal, shirt with a point collar and button cuffs.\n\n**Fabrics:**\n\n1. **Cotton:** A popular choice for formal shirts, cotton is breathable, durable, and easy to care for.\n2. **Linen:** A natural, textured fabric that is perfect for warm weather formal events.\n3. **Silk:** A luxurious fabric that adds a touch of elegance to any formal shirt.\n\n**Collar Styles:**\n\n1. **Point Collar:** A classic collar style that is suitable for most formal occasions.\n2. **Wingtip Collar:** A more formal collar style that is typically worn with a tuxedo.\n3. **Spread Collar:** A modern collar style that is perfect for business and formal events.\n\n**Cuff Styles:**\n\n1. **Button Cuffs:** A classic cuff style that is easy to use and suitable for most formal occasions.\n2. **French Cuffs:** A more formal cuff style that requires cufflinks to secure.\n3. **Barrel Cuffs:** A modern cuff style that is perfect for business and formal events.\n\n**Other Features:**\n\n1. **Pocket:** A small pocket on the chest, usually on the left side, that can be used to store small items like a pen or business cards.\n2. **Button-Down Collar:** A collar style that has buttons to secure the collar in place.\n3. **Contrast Cuffs and Collar:** A feature that adds a touch of elegance to the shirt, with a different color or fabric used for the cuffs and collar.\n\n**How to Choose a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion:** Choose a shirt that is suitable for the occasion, taking into account the level of formality and the dress code.\n2. **Think about your body type:** Choose a shirt that fits well and flatters your body type.\n3. **Select a fabric:** Choose a fabric that is comfortable, breathable, and suitable for the occasion.\n4. **Pay attention to details:** Consider the collar style, cuff style, and other features that will affect the overall look and feel of the shirt.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink:** A luxury brand that offers high-quality, formal shirts with a focus on traditional British style.\n2. **Charvet:** A French brand that is known for its high-end, bespoke formal shirts.\n3. **Brooks Brothers:** An American brand that offers classic, formal shirts with a focus on quality and tradition.\n\n**Price Range:**\n\n1. **Entry-level:** $20-$50\n2. **Mid-range:** $50-$100\n3. **Luxury:** $100-$500\n4. **Bespoke:** $500-$1,000+\n\nI hope this helps you find the perfect formal shirt for your needs!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-08 12:56:00', '2026-05-08 12:56:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-05-08 12:56:19', '2026-05-08 12:56:19'),
