(2890, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', 'Here\'s a relatable caption in points for a dragon-themed business on Facebook:\n\n\"As a powerful and majestic creature, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Embracing your inner fire**: Don\'t be afraid to let your passion shine through in everything you do.\n* **Soaring to new heights**: Set ambitious goals and work tirelessly to achieve them.\n* **Protecting your treasure**: Prioritize your well-being and take care of your physical and mental health.\n* **Breathing fire into your community**: Use your talents and resources to make a positive impact on those around you.\n\n#DragonSquad #BusinessTips #MentalHealthMatters #GoalSetting #CommunityFirst #TrendingNow #MotivationMonday #FireBreathingSuccess\"\n\nThis caption is written in a professional tone and includes a mix of popular and niche hashtags to reach a wide audience on Facebook. The use of points makes the caption easy to read and understand, and the hashtags can help increase the post\'s visibility and engagement.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-08 14:38:00', '2026-05-08 14:38:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-08 14:38:15', '2026-05-08 14:38:15'),
(2891, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about passion, dedication, and perseverance. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define what you want to achieve and create a plan to get there.\n* **Stay focused**: Avoid distractions and stay committed to your objectives.\n* **Be adaptable**: Be prepared to adjust your approach as circumstances change.\n* **Learn from failures**: Use setbacks as opportunities to learn and grow.\n* **Surround yourself with positivity**: Build a supportive network of people who believe in you.\n\nBy following these principles, you can unlock your full potential and achieve greatness. Remember to stay true to yourself and never give up on your dreams.\n\n#MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #DragonWisdom #GoalSetting #Focus #Adaptability #Resilience #PositiveVibes #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #BusinessTips #EntrepreneurMindset', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-08 14:39:00', '2026-05-08 14:39:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-08 14:39:15', '2026-05-08 14:39:15'),
