(2900, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as American football in some countries, is a contact team sport played between two teams of eleven players using an oval-shaped ball with pointed ends. It is one of the most popular sports in the United States and has gained popularity globally.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **Objective**: The objective of the game is to score more points than the opposing team by carrying or throwing the ball into the end zone of the opponent\'s field.\n2. **Gameplay**: The game is divided into four quarters, each lasting 15 minutes. The team with possession of the ball (offense) tries to score, while the opposing team (defense) tries to stop them.\n3. **Downs**: The offense has four chances (called downs) to advance the ball 10 yards. If they succeed, they get four new downs. If they fail, the ball is turned over to the other team.\n4. **Scoring**: Points can be scored through touchdowns (6 points), field goals (3 points), or extra points (1 or 2 points).\n5. **Positions**: Some common positions in football include:\n	* Quarterback (QB): leads the offense and usually throws the ball.\n	* Running back (RB): carries the ball on running plays.\n	* Wide receiver (WR): catches passes from the quarterback.\n	* Linemen (OL/DL): block or tackle opponents on the line of scrimmage.\n6. **Tactics**: Teams use various strategies, such as passing, running, and play-action, to outmaneuver their opponents.\n7. **League**: The National Football League (NFL) is the top professional league in the United States, while college football is also extremely popular.\n\nSome popular football teams include:\n\n* New England Patriots\n* Dallas Cowboys\n* Green Bay Packers\n* Pittsburgh Steelers\n* New York Giants\n\nSome notable football players include:\n\n* Tom Brady\n* Aaron Rodgers\n* Patrick Mahomes\n* Odell Beckham Jr.\n* Saquon Barkley\n\nDo you have a favorite football team or player?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-08 16:33:00', '2026-05-08 16:33:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-08 16:33:18', '2026-05-08 16:33:18'),
(2901, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. \n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a high-performance sport bike manufactured by Yamaha Motor Company. It was first introduced in 1998 and has since become one of the most popular and iconic motorcycles in the world.\n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha R1:\n\n1. **Engine:** The R1 is powered by a 998cc, liquid-cooled, inline-four cylinder engine that produces over 200 horsepower.\n2. **Transmission:** The bike features a 6-speed transmission with a multi-plate clutch.\n3. **Chassis:** The R1 has a lightweight aluminum frame and swingarm, which provides excellent handling and stability.\n4. **Brakes:** The bike is equipped with dual 320mm disc brakes at the front and a 220mm disc brake at the rear, with ABS (Anti-lock Braking System) as standard.\n5. **Suspension:** The R1 features a 43mm inverted fork at the front and a monoshock at the rear, both of which are adjustable for preload, compression, and rebound damping.\n6. **Electronics:** The bike is equipped with advanced electronics, including traction control, slide control, and a quickshifter.\n7. **Weight:** The R1 has a wet weight of around 439 pounds (199 kg), making it one of the lightest bikes in its class.\n\nThe Yamaha R1 is known for its exceptional performance, handling, and styling, making it a favorite among motorcycle enthusiasts and track riders. It\'s a true superbike that\'s designed to deliver an exhilarating riding experience on both the street and the track.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-08 16:42:00', '2026-05-08 16:42:30', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-08 16:42:30', '2026-05-08 16:42:30'),
(2902, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and designed by artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is the alter ego of Iron Man. After being kidnapped and forced to build a powerful suit of armor, Stark uses the technology to escape and later perfects the suit to become the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit is equipped with advanced technology, including:\n\n1. **Superhuman Strength**: The suit amplifies Stark\'s physical strength, allowing him to lift and throw objects with ease.\n2. **Flight**: The suit\'s repulsor technology enables Iron Man to fly.\n3. **Energy Projection**: The suit can project energy blasts from its hands, known as repulsor rays.\n4. **Advanced Sensors**: The suit\'s advanced sensors and scanners allow Iron Man to detect and analyze his surroundings.\n5. **Artificial Intelligence**: The suit\'s AI system, known as JARVIS (later FRIDAY), assists Iron Man in various tasks and provides strategic support.\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a complex character with a mix of traits:\n\n1. **Genius Intellect**: Stark is a brilliant inventor and engineer.\n2. **Confident and Charismatic**: Stark is a self-assured and charismatic individual.\n3. **Sarcastic and Witty**: Stark often uses humor to deflect or annoy his enemies.\n4. **Selfless and Heroic**: Despite his flaws, Stark is willing to risk his life to protect others and fight for justice.\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been featured in several movies within the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), including:\n\n1. **Iron Man (2008)**: The first film in the franchise, starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man.\n2. **Iron Man 2 (2010)**: The sequel to the first film, with Downey Jr. reprising his role.\n3. **Iron Man 3 (2013)**: The third installment in the franchise, with Downey Jr. again playing the lead role.\n4. **The Avengers (2012)**: Iron Man joins the Avengers team in this superhero ensemble film.\n5. **Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)**: Iron Man plays a key role in the sequel to The Avengers.\n6. **Captain America: Civil War (2016)**: Iron Man clashes with Captain America in this Marvel movie.\n7. **Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)**: Iron Man appears as a mentor to Spider-Man in this film.\n8. **Avengers: Infinity War (2018)**: Iron Man joins the Avengers and other heroes to battle Thanos.\n9. **Avengers: Endgame (2019)**: The final film in the MCU\'s Infinity Saga, in which Iron Man plays a pivotal role.\n\nThe Iron Man character has become an iconic figure in popular culture, symbolizing innovation, courage, and selflessness.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-08 17:30:00', '2026-05-08 17:30:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-08 17:30:20', '2026-05-08 17:30:20'),
(2903, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and captivating visual representation of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that make this scene so compelling:\n\n**The Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a suit, exudes an air of confidence and authority. His attire suggests a high level of professionalism and success in his field. The fact that he\'s standing on a basketball court, holding a ball, implies that he\'s a multifaceted individual who can navigate different environments with ease.\n\n**The Setting:**\nThe basketball court, with its polished floor and towering hoops, provides a sense of grandeur and competition. The stadium lights in the background create a dramatic atmosphere, casting a warm glow over the scene. This setting suggests that the businessman is not afraid to take risks and step out of his comfort zone.\n\n**The Lighting:**\nThe dramatic lighting, with its strong shadows and highlights, adds a sense of depth and dimension to the image. The stadium lights create a sense of drama, making the businessman stand out as a central figure. The lighting also helps to accentuate the textures and details of the scene, from the creases in the businessman\'s suit to the grain of the basketball.\n\n**The Mindset:**\nThe overall mood of the image conveys a sense of success and determination. The businessman\'s confident stance, with the ball in hand, suggests that he\'s ready to take on any challenge that comes his way. His facial expression, though not explicitly described, is likely one of focus and intensity, implying a strong will to succeed.\n\n**The Cinematic Style:**\nThe high-resolution, cinematic style of the image adds a sense of sophistication and luxury. The use of high-end camera equipment and post-production techniques creates a polished, refined look that\'s reminiscent of a Hollywood blockbuster. This style elevates the image, making it feel like a