(2911, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', 'Here\'s a relatable caption for a dragon-themed business on Facebook:\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of embracing my true self and spreading my wings to achieve greatness. Here are a few things I\'ve learned along the way:\n\n* Believe in yourself and your abilities, just like I believe in my fire-breathing skills\n* Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things, like exploring new caves and territories\n* Surround yourself with people who support and encourage you, just like my dragon friends do\n* Stay true to your values and passions, and never give up on your dreams\n\n#DragonSquad #FireBreathing #MotivationMonday #SelfCare #MentalHealthMatters #TrendingNow #DragonInspiration #BusinessTips #EntrepreneurLife #SuccessStory\"\n\nThis caption is professional, relatable, and includes trending hashtags to reach a wider audience on Facebook.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 10:35:00', '2026-05-09 10:35:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-05-09 10:35:18', '2026-05-09 10:35:18');
