(2912, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and the founder of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious drug trafficking organizations in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals of the 20th century.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Escobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, on December 1, 1949. He grew up in a poor family and was raised by his mother, Hermilda Gaviria, after his father abandoned the family. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he quickly became involved in petty crime and street gangs.\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar began to build a reputation as a skilled smuggler and trafficker, initially working with other cartel leaders. He quickly rose to prominence and became one of the most powerful and feared men in Colombia.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nIn the early 1980s, Escobar founded the Medellín cartel, which would become one of the most powerful and profitable drug trafficking organizations in the world. The cartel\'s main product was cocaine, which was produced in Colombia and smuggled into the United States and other countries.\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel expanded rapidly, and its operations became increasingly sophisticated. The cartel used a network of smugglers, money launderers, and assassins to protect its interests and eliminate its enemies.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar was known for his ruthlessness and brutality, and his cartel was responsible for thousands of murders, kidnappings, and bombings. He ordered the assassination of politicians, judges, and police officers who opposed him, as well as the killing of rival cartel members and innocent civilians.\n\nOne of the most notorious examples of Escobar\'s violence was the bombing of Avianca Flight 203, which was blown up in mid-air in 1989, killing all 107 people on board. The bombing was intended to kill a Colombian presidential candidate who was on the flight, but he had changed his plans at the last minute.\n\n**Pursuit and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. The pursuit was led by the Colombian police and the US Drug Enforcement Administration (DEA).\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. He was 44 years old at the time of his death.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He was a ruthless and brutal criminal who was responsible for thousands of deaths and untold suffering. However, he was also a charismatic and cunning leader who was able to build a vast and powerful organization that dominated the global cocaine trade for many years.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s life and legacy have been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" Despite his notorious reputation, Escobar remains a fascinating and intriguing figure, and his story continues to captivate audiences around the world.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a vast estate in Medellín.\n* He was a fan of soccer and owned a team in Medellín, which he used to launder money and promote his image.\n* Escobar was a skilled politician and was able to build alliances with other cartel leaders and politicians in Colombia.\n* He was known for his generosity to the poor and was often referred to as \"El Patrón\" (The Boss) by the people of Medellín.\n* Escobar\'s death was a major blow to the Medellín cartel, and the organization was eventually dismantled by the Colombian government and the DEA.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 10:45:00', '2026-05-09 10:45:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-09 10:45:20', '2026-05-09 10:45:20'),
(2913, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and the founder of the Medellín Cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious crime organizations in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful drug traffickers of all time.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he was exposed to crime and violence from a young age.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar began his career in crime as a teenager, selling stolen cars and smuggled goods. In the 1970s, he became involved in the cocaine trade, which was then a relatively new and lucrative market. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín Cartel, which was founded by Carlos Lehder and other Colombian traffickers.\n\nIn the early 1980s, Escobar became the dominant figure in the cartel, using his charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness to eliminate his rivals and consolidate power. He established a vast network of cocaine production and distribution, using Colombia\'s coca leaf fields, laboratories, and smuggling routes to supply the growing demand for cocaine in the United States and other countries.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín Cartel became one of the most powerful and feared crime organizations in the world. At its peak, the cartel was estimated to be earning over $20 billion per year, making it one of the largest and most profitable criminal enterprises in history.\n\nThe cartel\'s operations were marked by violence, intimidation, and corruption. Escobar and his associates used murder, torture, and bribery to eliminate their rivals, silence their critics, and influence government officials and law enforcement.\n\n**Notorious Crimes**\n\nEscobar was responsible for numerous notorious crimes, including:\n\n1. The assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán in 1989.\n2. The bombing of Avianca Flight 203 in 1989, which killed 110 people.\n3. The murder of hundreds of police officers, judges, and journalists who opposed the cartel.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a specially built prison, known as La Catedral. However, he escaped from prison in 1992 and went into hiding.\n\nA massive manhunt was launched by Colombian and American authorities, and Escobar was finally tracked down and killed in a shootout with Colombian police on December 1, 1993, in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning crime lord who brought terror and violence to Colombia and beyond. However, he is also seen as a symbol of the failures of the war on drugs and the corrupting influence of power and wealth.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s life and legacy have been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His story continues to fascinate and horrify people around the world, serving as a reminder of the dangers of organized crime and the importance of justice and accountability.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 10:50:00', '2026-05-09 10:50:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-09 10:50:20', '2026-05-09 10:50:20'),
(2914, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and narcoterrorist who was the founder and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious drug cartels in the world. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals in history.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to a poor farming family. He grew up in a neighborhood in Medellín, where he became involved in street crime and gang activity at a young age. Escobar\'s early life was marked by violence and crime, and he quickly rose through the ranks of the local underworld.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar began to build his cocaine empire, initially working as a middleman for other traffickers. He quickly expanded his operations, using his charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness to build a vast network of smugglers, distributors, and money launderers. By the mid-1980s, Escobar had become one of the most powerful and wealthy men in Colombia, with an estimated net worth of over $30 billion.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nThe Medellín cartel, led by Escobar, dominated the global cocaine trade in the 1980s and early 1990s. The cartel\'s operations were characterized by brutal violence, intimidation, and corruption. Escobar and his associates were responsible for the murders of thousands of people, including politicians, police officers, judges, and rival gang members.\n\n**Notorious Crimes**\n\nSome of Escobar\'s most notorious crimes include:\n\n1. The assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán in 1989.\n2. The bombing of Avianca Flight 203 in 1989, which killed 110 people.\n3. The murder of Colombian police chief Colonel Jaime Ramírez Gómez in 1989.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a luxurious private prison, which he had built himself. However, he escaped from prison in 1992 and went into hiding. A massive manhunt was launched, and Escobar was eventually tracked down and killed in a shootout with Colombian police on December 1, 1993, in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. While he was a ruthless and violent criminal, he was also a charismatic and cunning leader who built a vast and powerful empire. His story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" Despite his notorious crimes, Escobar remains a fascinating and intriguing figure, and his impact on the world of organized crime and international politics continues to be felt today.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n1. Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a vast array of properties and assets.\n2. He was a skilled politician and was elected to the Colombian Congress in 1982.\n3. Escobar was a devoted family man and was particularly close to his mother, Hermilda Gaviria.\n4. He was a fan of soccer and owned a team, the Atlético Nacional, which won several championships during his ownership.\n5. Escobar\'s death was a major blow to the Medellín cartel, and the organization was eventually dismantled by Colombian authorities.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 10:53:00', '2026-05-09 10:53:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-09 10:53:16', '2026-05-09 10:53:16'),
(2915, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned to harness my inner strength and resilience to overcome challenges. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your personal and professional life:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on a treasure hoard, you should aim high and strive for excellence in your pursuits.\n* **Develop a growth mindset**: Continuously learn and adapt to new situations, just as a dragon evolves to overcome obstacles and protect its territory.\n* **Cultivate fierce loyalty**: Surround yourself with people who support and believe in you, just as a dragon fiercely defends its allies and territory.\n* **Embody courage and determination**: Face your fears and push through challenges with the bravery and perseverance of a dragon.\n\n#DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #ProfessionalGrowth #Resilience #Ambition #GrowthMindset #Loyalty #Courage #Determination #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #BusinessLessons #PersonalDevelopment #DragonSquad #FireWithin', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 11:18:00', '2026-05-09 11:18:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-05-09 11:18:18', '2026-05-09 11:18:18'),
(2916, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', 'Here are some popular party wear options for men:\n\n**Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-tailored suit in black, navy, or gray is a classic choice for formal parties.\n2. **Dress Shirts**: A crisp, white dress shirt with a slim collar is a timeless option.\n3. **Tuxedos**: For black-tie events, a tuxedo is a must-have.\n4. **Bow Ties**: Add a touch of elegance with a bow tie in a bold color or pattern.\n5. **Cufflinks**: Complete the look with stylish cufflinks.\n\n**Semi-Formal Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A navy or gray blazer with a dress shirt and dark jeans is a stylish option.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dark-washed dress pants with a button-down shirt and a blazer are perfect for semi-formal parties.\n3. **Polo Shirts**: A high-quality polo shirt in a bold color or pattern can add a touch of sophistication.\n4. **Chinos**: Light-washed chinos with a dress shirt and a blazer are a great alternative to dress pants.\n5. **Loafers**: Slip-on loafers or dress shoes can complete the look.\n\n**Casual Party Wear:**\n\n1. **Graphic T-Shirts**: A fun, graphic tee with dark jeans and sneakers is perfect for casual parties.\n2. **Hoodies**: A stylish hoodie with distressed denim and sneakers is a great option for relaxed gatherings.\n3. **Jeans**: Dark-washed jeans with a button-down shirt and sneakers are a classic casual look.\n4. **Sneakers**: Statement sneakers can add a pop of color and personality to an outfit.\n5. **Leather Jackets**: A leather jacket can add an edgy touch to a casual outfit.\n\n**Accessories:**\n\n1. **Watches**: A stylish watch can add a touch of sophistication to an outfit.\n2. **Hats**: A fedora or a baseball cap can add a stylish touch to a casual outfit.\n3. **Scarves**: A patterned scarf can add a pop of color and texture to an outfit.\n4. **Belts**: A high-quality belt can complete the look and add a touch of elegance.\n5. **Cufflinks**: Statement cufflinks can add a touch of personality to a formal outfit.\n\nRemember, the key to dressing well for a party is to feel confident and comfortable in what you\'re wearing. Experiment with different styles and find what works best for you!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 12:40:00', '2026-05-09 12:40:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-05-09 12:40:24', '2026-05-09 12:40:24'),
(2917, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of dress shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts often have a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts typically have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are often made from high-quality cotton, linen, or silk fabrics.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the chest and waist.\n5. **Button-front**: Formal shirts usually have a button-front closure.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic fit**: A traditional fit with a relaxed silhouette.\n2. **Slim fit**: A modern fit with a narrower silhouette.\n3. **Tailored fit**: A fit that is tailored to the individual\'s body, with a focus on comfort and style.\n4. **Dress shirt with contrast cuffs and collar**: A style that features contrasting cuffs and collar for a pop of color.\n5. **Tuxedo shirt**: A formal shirt specifically designed to be worn with a tuxedo.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White**: A classic choice for formal shirts.\n2. **Light blue**: A popular choice for business and formal events.\n3. **Pastel colors**: Soft pink, baby blue, and mint green are popular choices for spring and summer.\n4. **Stripes**: Thin stripes are a classic pattern for formal shirts.\n5. **Checks**: Small checks are a subtle pattern for formal shirts.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: A luxury brand known for high-quality formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French brand that offers exquisite formal shirts with a focus on quality and craftsmanship.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: An American brand that offers classic formal shirts with a preppy twist.\n4. **Armani**: An Italian brand that offers stylish and sophisticated formal shirts.\n5. **Ted Baker**: A British brand that offers fashionable and affordable formal shirts.\n\n**Occasions:**\n\n1. **Business meetings**: Formal shirts are a staple for business meetings and conferences.\n2. **Weddings**: Formal shirts are often worn for weddings, especially for the groom and groomsmen.\n3. **Black-tie events**: Tuxedo shirts are specifically designed for black-tie events.\n4. **Formal galas**: Formal shirts are often worn for formal galas and charity events.\n5. **Job interviews**: Formal shirts can make a great impression for job interviews.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 12:56:00', '2026-05-09 12:56:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-05-09 12:56:22', '2026-05-09 12:56:22'),
(2918, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', 'Here\'s a sample Facebook post for the Dragon business/creator:\n\n\"As a symbol of power and strength, I\'d like to share with you some key takeaways on how to unleash your inner dragon:\n* Believe in yourself and your abilities\n* Set goals and work towards achieving them\n* Surround yourself with positive and supportive people\n* Continuously learn and improve to stay ahead of the game\n* Take calculated risks and face your fears\n\nBy following these tips, you\'ll be well on your way to unleashing your inner dragon and achieving greatness. #DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #PersonalGrowth #TrendingNow #Inspiration #GoalOriented #PositiveVibesOnly\"\n\nNote: The hashtags used are a mix of trending and niche-specific hashtags to increase the post\'s visibility and reach a wider audience. The tone of the post is professional and relatable, making it suitable for a Facebook audience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 13:03:00', '2026-05-09 13:03:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-05-09 13:03:15', '2026-05-09 13:03:15'),
