(2932, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **Objective**: The objective of football is to score more goals than the opposing team within the 90-minute game duration.\n2. **Gameplay**: Players can use any part of their body except their hands and arms to control and move the ball. Only the goalkeeper is allowed to use their hands and arms to touch the ball.\n3. **Positions**: Each team has 11 players with different positions, including:\n	* Goalkeeper (GK)\n	* Defenders (DF)\n	* Midfielders (MF)\n	* Forwards (FW)\n4. **Rules**: The game is governed by a set of rules, including:\n	* Offside rule\n	* Fouls (e.g., tripping, pushing)\n	* Yellow and red cards (warnings and ejections)\n5. **Tactics**: Teams employ various tactics, such as:\n	* Formations (e.g., 4-4-2, 4-3-3)\n	* Strategies (e.g., possession-based, counter-attacking)\n6. **Competitions**: Football has numerous international and domestic competitions, including:\n	* FIFA World Cup\n	* UEFA Champions League\n	* English Premier League\n	* La Liga\n	* Bundesliga\n7. **Popularity**: Football is one of the most popular sports in the world, with an estimated 3.5 billion fans globally.\n\nSome of the most famous football players include:\n\n1. Lionel Messi\n2. Cristiano Ronaldo\n3. Kylian Mbappé\n4. Robert Lewandowski\n5. Zlatan Ibrahimović\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 16:33:00', '2026-05-09 16:33:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-09 16:33:18', '2026-05-09 16:33:18'),
(2933, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. You\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a popular sports motorcycle produced by Yamaha. Here are some key features and specs:\n\n**Overview**\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a high-performance sports bike that was first introduced in 1998. It\'s known for its powerful engine, agile handling, and sleek design.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n* 998cc inline-four engine\n* 200 horsepower (147 kW) at 13,500 rpm\n* 82.9 lb-ft (112.4 Nm) of torque at 11,500 rpm\n* 6-speed transmission with a multi-plate slipper clutch\n* Aluminum frame with a swingarm and rear shock\n* Dual 320mm front disc brakes with 6-piston calipers\n* 220mm rear disc brake with a single-piston caliper\n* 17-inch alloy wheels with 120/70-ZR17 front tire and 190/55-ZR17 rear tire\n\n**Riding Modes**\nThe R1 features multiple riding modes, including:\n\n* Sport mode: optimized for track riding and high-performance street riding\n* Standard mode: suitable for everyday street riding\n* A mode: similar to Sport mode but with more aggressive throttle response\n* B mode: similar to Standard mode but with less aggressive throttle response\n\n**Safety Features**\nThe R1 is equipped with various safety features, including:\n\n* Traction control system (TCS)\n* Slide control system (SCS)\n* Lift control system (LIF)\n* ABS (anti-lock braking system)\n\n**Design and Ergonomics**\nThe R1 has a sleek and aerodynamic design, with a low seat height and a comfortable riding position. The bike features a digital instrument cluster, a rear seat cowl, and a range of optional accessories.\n\nOverall, the Yamaha YZF-R1 is a high-performance sports bike that\'s designed for experienced riders who demand exceptional power, handling, and features.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 16:42:00', '2026-05-09 16:42:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-09 16:42:21', '2026-05-09 16:42:21'),
(2934, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, developed by scripter Larry Lieber, and designed by artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby.\n\n**Origins:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is the alter ego of Iron Man. After being kidnapped and forced to build a powerful suit of armor, Stark uses the technology to escape and later perfects the design to become the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s powers come from his advanced suit of armor, which provides:\n\n1. **Superhuman Strength**: The suit amplifies Tony\'s physical strength, allowing him to lift and throw objects that would be impossible for a human.\n2. **Flight**: The suit\'s repulsor technology enables Iron Man to fly.\n3. **Energy Projection**: The suit can project energy blasts from its hands, known as repulsor beams.\n4. **Advanced Sensors**: The suit is equipped with advanced sensors, including radar, infrared, and X-ray vision.\n5. **Artificial Intelligence**: The suit\'s AI, known as JARVIS (later replaced by FRIDAY), assists Tony in various tasks and provides strategic support.\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a complex character with a mix of traits:\n\n1. **Genius Intellect**: Tony is an incredibly intelligent and resourceful inventor.\n2. **Confident and Charismatic**: Iron Man is a self-assured and charismatic hero.\n3. **Sarcastic and Witty**: Tony often uses humor to deflect or annoy his enemies.\n4. **Flawed and Vulnerable**: Despite his confidence, Tony struggles with personal demons, including his ego and a sense of responsibility for the consequences of his actions.\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man movie franchise, starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man, has been incredibly successful, with multiple films, including:\n\n1. **Iron Man (2008)**\n2. **Iron Man 2 (2010)**\n3. **Iron Man 3 (2013)**\n4. **The Avengers (2012)**\n5. **Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)**\n6. **Captain America: Civil War (2016)**\n7. **Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)**\n8. **Avengers: Infinity War (2018)**\n9. **Avengers: Endgame (2019)**\n\nThe franchise has grossed billions of dollars worldwide and has cemented Iron Man\'s status as a cultural icon.\n\nWhat aspect of Iron Man would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 17:30:00', '2026-05-09 17:30:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-09 17:30:17', '2026-05-09 17:30:17'),
(2935, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**The Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a tailored suit, stands tall and confident on the basketball court. His attire, typically associated with the boardroom, seems out of place in the sports arena, yet he wears it with an air of authority and self-assurance. The suit is immaculately tailored, with a crisp white shirt, a slim tie, and a pair of polished dress shoes that seem to glow in the dramatic lighting.\n\n**The Basketball Court:**\nThe court itself is a backdrop of sleek, polished wood, with vibrant colors and crisp lines. The hoops stand tall at each end, their nets swishing gently in the quiet of the moment. The court is empty, except for the businessman, who appears to be savoring the solitude and the sense of ownership that comes with it.\n\n**The Lighting:**\nThe stadium lights cast a dramatic glow over the scene, with deep shadows and rich highlights that accentuate the textures and contours of the subject and his surroundings. The light is intense, with a slight warm undertone that suggests a sense of excitement and energy. The shadows are deep and mysterious, adding a sense of depth and dimensionality to the image.\n\n**The Ball:**\nThe basketball, held firmly in the businessman\'s hand, seems to be an extension of his being. His fingers are wrapped tightly around it, with a sense of control and mastery. The ball itself is a deep, rich brown, with a subtle sheen that catches the light and adds to the overall sense of drama and tension.\n\n**The Mindset:**\nThe businessman\'s mindset is one of success and determination. He exudes an air of confidence and self-assurance, as if he\'s conquered the challenges of the boardroom and is now ready to take on the court. His eyes are focused, his jaw is set, and his posture is tall and proud. He\'s a man on a mission, and nothing is going to stand in his way.\n\n**The Cinematic Style:**\nThe image is shot in a high-resolution, cinematic style, with a shallow depth of field that blurs the background and emphasizes the subject. The camera angle is slightly low, looking up at the businessman, which adds to the sense of power and authority. The overall effect is one of drama and intensity, as if the scene is about to unfold into a larger narrative.\n\nOverall, the image is a powerful and evocative one, capturing the essence of a successful businessman who\'s ready to take on new challenges and conquer the world. The combination of the suit, the basketball court, and the dramatic lighting creates a unique and compelling visual narrative that\'s both captivating and inspiring.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-09 17:45:00', '2026-05-09 17:45:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-09 17:45:20', '2026-05-09 17:45:20');
