(2964, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\n**Types of Football:**\n\n1. **Association Football (Soccer):** The most widely played and watched version of football, played with a round ball and minimal use of hands.\n2. **American Football:** A contact team sport played with an oval-shaped ball, popular in the United States and Canada.\n3. **Rugby Football:** A full-contact team sport that originated in the UK, played with an oval-shaped ball.\n4. **Australian Rules Football:** A contact team sport played with an oval-shaped ball, popular in Australia.\n\n**Popular Football Competitions:**\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup:** The most widely viewed and followed international football tournament, held every four years.\n2. **UEFA Champions League:** An annual club football tournament, featuring top European teams.\n3. **English Premier League:** A professional football league in England, one of the most watched and competitive leagues in the world.\n4. **NFL (National Football League):** The top-level professional American football league in the United States.\n\n**Football Players:**\n\n1. **Lionel Messi:** Regarded by many as one of the greatest football players of all time, known for his exceptional dribbling skills and goal-scoring ability.\n2. **Cristiano Ronaldo:** A highly skilled and successful football player, known for his speed, power, and goal-scoring ability.\n3. **Kylian Mbappé:** A young and talented French football player, known for his speed, skill, and goal-scoring ability.\n\n**Football Benefits:**\n\n1. **Improves Physical Fitness:** Football is a physically demanding sport that can improve cardiovascular health, increase strength and endurance, and boost flexibility.\n2. **Develops Teamwork and Communication Skills:** Football is a team sport that requires coordination, communication, and strategy to succeed.\n3. **Enhances Mental Health:** Playing football can reduce stress, improve mood, and boost self-esteem.\n\nDo you have a favorite football team or player?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-10 16:33:00', '2026-05-10 16:33:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-10 16:33:20', '2026-05-10 16:33:20'),
(2965, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. You\'re likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sport motorcycle produced by Yamaha Motor Company. \n\nHere are some key features and specs of the Yamaha YZF-R1:\n\n**Engine:**\n- 998cc, liquid-cooled, inline-four engine\n- 4-stroke, DOHC, 16-valve\n- Produces around 200 horsepower\n\n**Transmission:**\n- 6-speed manual transmission\n- Multi-plate slipper clutch\n\n**Chassis and Suspension:**\n- Aluminum Deltabox frame\n- Upside-down telescopic fork (front suspension)\n- Swingarm (rear suspension) with mono-shock\n\n**Brakes:**\n- Dual 320mm hydraulic disc brakes (front)\n- 220mm hydraulic disc brake (rear)\n- ABS (Anti-lock Braking System) as standard\n\n**Electronics:**\n- 6-axis Inertial Measurement Unit (IMU)\n- Traction control system\n- Slide control system\n- Lift control system\n- Quickshifter (up and down)\n\n**Other Features:**\n- LED headlights and taillights\n- Digital instrument cluster\n- Ride-by-wire throttle\n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is known for its exceptional handling, braking, and acceleration, making it a popular choice among sport bike enthusiasts and track riders. However, please note that the specifications may vary depending on the model year and region.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-10 16:42:00', '2026-05-10 16:42:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-10 16:42:22', '2026-05-10 16:42:22'),
(2966, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a iconic superhero from the Marvel Comics universe. Created by Stan Lee, Larry Lieber, and Don Heck, Iron Man first appeared in comic books in 1963.\n\n**The Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is kidnapped by a group of terrorists who demand that he build a powerful weapon for them. Instead, Stark uses his genius-level intellect to create a suit of armor that allows him to escape. He later refines the design and becomes the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**The Suit:**\nIron Man\'s suit is a advanced exoskeleton made of a unique alloy of metals, including titanium and silver. The suit is powered by a high-energy arc reactor, which provides the power needed to operate the suit\'s various systems. The suit is equipped with a range of advanced technologies, including:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight capabilities\n* Energy projection (repulsor rays)\n* Advanced sensors and scanning technology\n* Artificial intelligence (JARVIS)\n\n**The Movies:**\nIron Man has been featured in several movies, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008) - starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\n**The Actor:**\nRobert Downey Jr.\'s portrayal of Tony Stark/Iron Man is widely regarded as one of the most iconic and influential performances in superhero movie history. Downey Jr.\'s charisma, wit, and depth brought the character to life in a way that resonated with audiences worldwide.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man\'s impact on popular culture extends far beyond the comics and movies. The character has inspired countless fans around the world, and his legacy continues to grow with each new generation. The Iron Man suit has become an iconic symbol of innovation, technology, and heroism, and the character\'s story has been adapted and reinterpreted in countless ways, from video games to theme park attractions.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-10 17:30:00', '2026-05-10 17:30:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-10 17:30:22', '2026-05-10 17:30:22'),
(2967, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\nThe businessman, dressed in a tailored suit, stands tall and proud on the basketball court. The suit is a deep, rich color, perhaps navy or charcoal, and is immaculately tailored to accentuate the man\'s physique. A crisp white shirt and a tie in a subtle pattern add a touch of sophistication to the overall look.\n\nThe basketball court stretches out behind him, the polished wood floor gleaming in the dramatic lighting. The stadium lights above cast long shadows across the court, adding a sense of depth and dimension to the scene. The lights themselves are a deep, golden yellow, casting a warm glow over the entire scene.\n\nThe businessman\'s pose is confident and assertive, with his feet shoulder-width apart and his weight evenly distributed between both legs. He holds the basketball in one hand, his fingers wrapped tightly around it as if he\'s ready to take a shot at any moment. His eyes are fixed intently on some point in the distance, his gaze burning with a fierce determination.\n\nThe overall mood of the image is one of success and achievement, as if the businessman has just sunk a game-winning shot and is basking in the glory of his triumph. The dramatic lighting and cinematic style of the image add a sense of drama and tension to the scene, as if the stakes are high and the outcome is far from certain.\n\nIn terms of cinematography, the image could be shot using a combination of wide-angle and close-up shots to emphasize the businessman\'s confident pose and the dramatic lighting. A low-angle shot could be used to make the businessman appear even more powerful and dominant, while a high-angle shot could be used to convey a sense of vulnerability and uncertainty.\n\nThe color palette of the image could be a mix of cool and warm tones, with the deep blues and grays of the suit and the court contrasting with the warm, golden light of the stadium lights. The overall effect would be a visually striking image that conveys a sense of confidence, success, and determination.\n\nSome possible camera angles and movements that could be used to capture this image include:\n\n* A low-angle shot of the businessman, looking up at him from a 45-degree angle to emphasize his confident pose and powerful physique.\n* A wide-angle shot of the basketball court, capturing the entire scene and emphasizing the sense of space and depth.\n* A close-up shot of the businessman\'s face, capturing his intense gaze and determined expression.\n* A slow-motion shot of the businessman moving across the court, capturing his fluid movements and confident stride.\n* A dramatic, sweeping shot of the stadium lights, capturing their warm glow and emphasizing the sense of drama and tension in the scene.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. By using a combination of dramatic lighting, cinematic style, and careful camera work, it\'s possible to create an image that\'s both visually striking and emotionally resonant.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-10 17:45:00', '2026-05-10 17:45:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-10 17:45:18', '2026-05-10 17:45:18'),
