inematic style also adds a sense of drama and storytelling to the image, inviting the viewer to imagine the subject\'s backstory and the events that have led him to this moment.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful and inspiring one, capturing the essence of confidence, success, and determination. It\'s an image that motivates and energizes, encouraging the viewer to tap into their own inner strength and strive for greatness.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-11 17:45:00', '2026-05-11 17:45:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-11 17:45:20', '2026-05-11 17:45:20'),
