(3043, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby. He first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense\" #39 in March 1963.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is kidnapped by a group of terrorists who demand that he build a powerful weapon for them. Instead, Stark uses his intelligence and resources to create a suit of armor that allows him to escape. He later perfects the suit and becomes the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit gives him a range of powers, including:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight\n* Energy projection (repulsor beams)\n* Enhanced cognitive abilities (thanks to the suit\'s advanced computer system)\n* A range of sensors and scanners\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a complex and charismatic character. He is a genius inventor and businessman, but also a self-centered and arrogant person who often struggles with his own ego. However, he is also fiercely loyal to his friends and will go to great lengths to protect them.\n\n**Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU):**\nIron Man has been featured in several movies in the Marvel Cinematic Universe, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* The Incredible Hulk (2008) - cameo appearance\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) - cameo appearance\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\nRobert Downey Jr. played the role of Tony Stark/Iron Man in the MCU, and his performance is widely credited with helping to launch the franchise.\n\n**Other Media:**\nIron Man has also appeared in various other media, including:\n\n* Animated TV shows (e.g. \"Iron Man: Armored Adventures\")\n* Video games (e.g. \"Iron Man\" and \"Marvel\'s Avengers\")\n* Comic books (e.g. \"The Invincible Iron Man\")\n\nOverall, Iron Man is a beloved and iconic superhero character who has captured the imaginations of fans around the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-12 17:30:00', '2026-05-12 17:30:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-12 17:30:20', '2026-05-12 17:30:20'),
