ouch of warm yellow or orange to the image. The overall effect is a sense of sophistication and elegance, balanced by the energy and excitement of the basketball court.\n\n**Cinematic Style:**\nThe high-resolution, cinematic style of the image adds to the sense of drama and excitement. The use of dramatic lighting, deep shadows, and a sense of depth and dimension creates a visually stunning image that draws the viewer in. The style may be reminiscent of a Hollywood movie or a high-end commercial, with a focus on creating a sense of awe and inspiration.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful and compelling one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. The combination of a professional businessman, a basketball court, and dramatic lighting creates a unique and captivating visual that\'s sure to inspire and motivate.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-12 17:45:00', '2026-05-12 17:45:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-12 17:45:22', '2026-05-12 17:45:22'),
