as a metaphor for the challenges he\'s overcome to reach his goals.\n\n7. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The image is likely shot in a high-resolution format, with a cinematic aspect ratio and a shallow depth of field. This style adds a sense of luxury and sophistication to the scene, emphasizing the businessman\'s success and status. The cinematic style also creates a sense of storytelling, inviting the viewer to imagine the narrative behind the image.\n\nIn summary, the image of a businessman standing confidently on a basketball court with a ball in his hand, set against the backdrop of stadium lights and dramatic lighting, is a powerful representation of success and determination. The high-resolution cinematic style adds a sense of luxury and sophistication, making the image a compelling visual statement.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-13 17:47:00', '2026-05-13 17:47:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-13 17:47:18', '2026-05-13 17:47:18'),
(3080, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:49', 'Wooden craft, also known as woodcraft or wood working, refers to the art of creating decorative or functional items from wood. It involves various techniques, tools, and materials to shape, carve, and assemble wood into beautiful and useful objects.\n\nTypes of Wooden Crafts:\n\n1. **Wood Carving**: involves carving and shaping wood to create intricate designs, patterns, and figures.\n2. **Wood Turning**: involves using a lathe to shape and create symmetrical objects like bowls, cups, and vases.\n3. **Woodworking**: involves using various tools and techniques to create furniture, cabinets, and other wood products.\n4. **Wood Burning**: involves using a heated tool to burn designs and patterns onto wood.\n5. **Pyrography**: involves using a heated tool to burn designs and patterns onto wood, similar to wood burning.\n6. **Marquetry**: involves creating intricate designs and patterns by inlaying small pieces of wood into a larger piece.\n7. **Intarsia**: involves creating intricate designs and patterns by inlaying small pieces of wood into a larger piece, similar to marquetry.\n\nTechniques Used in Wooden Crafts:\n\n1. **Cutting**: involves using various tools like saws, knives, and chisels to cut wood into desired shapes and sizes.\n2. **Shaping**: involves using various tools like planes, sanders, and scrapers to shape and smooth wood.\n3. **Assembling**: involves using various techniques like gluing, nailing, and screwing to assemble wood pieces into a finished product.\n4. **Finishing**: involves applying various finishes like stains, paints, and varnishes to protect and enhance the appearance of wood.\n\nTools Used in Wooden Crafts:\n\n1. **Hand tools**: like chisels, gouges, and mallets.\n2. **Power tools**: like saws, drills, and sanders.\n3. **Machine tools**: like lathes, planers, and jointers.\n4. **Specialized tools**: like wood burning tools, pyrography tools, and marquetry tools.\n\nMaterials Used in Wooden Crafts:\n\n1. **Various types of wood**: like oak, maple, cherry, and pine.\n2. **Wood veneers**: thin layers of wood used for marquetry and intarsia.\n3. **Wood glue**: used to bond wood pieces together.\n4. **Finishing materials**: like stains, paints, and varnishes.\n\nApplications of Wooden Crafts:\n\n1. **Furniture making**: creating functional and decorative furniture pieces.\n2. **Decorative items**: creating decorative items like vases, bowls, and wall art.\n3. **Gift items**: creating personalized gift items like wooden boxes and picture frames.\n4. **Restoration**: restoring and preserving antique furniture and wooden objects.\n\nOverall, wooden craft is a versatile and creative field that offers a wide range of possibilities for artists, craftsmen, and hobbyists to express themselves and create beautiful and functional objects from wood.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-13 17:49:00', '2026-05-13 17:49:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/wood_spoon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2026-05-13 17:49:20', '2026-05-13 17:49:20'),
