(3121, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and resilience. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set your goals ablaze**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and chase your aspirations with fierce determination.\n* **Protect your treasure**: Prioritize your well-being, relationships, and values - they\'re the treasure that truly matters.\n* **Soar to new heights**: Don\'t be limited by your current circumstances - spread your wings and explore new opportunities.\n* **Breathe fire into your passions**: Pursue your interests with passion and energy, and watch them flourish.\n* **Roar with confidence**: Believe in yourself and your abilities, and don\'t be afraid to make your voice heard.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #FireWithin #PassionAndPurpose #ResilienceMatters #GoalOriented #WellnessWednesday #MentalHealthMatters #SuccessTips #PersonalGrowth #InspirationalQuotes #FacebookMotivation #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 10:35:00', '2026-05-15 10:35:26', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-05-15 10:35:26', '2026-05-15 10:35:26'),
(3122, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel, which was one of the most powerful and feared criminal organizations in the world during the 1980s and early 1990s. Here are some key facts about his life and career:\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to a poor farming family. He grew up in a rough neighborhood in Medellín, where he became involved in street crime at a young age.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power began in the 1970s, when he started smuggling marijuana and cocaine into the United States. He quickly built a network of associates and established himself as a major player in the Colombian drug trade. In 1976, he co-founded the Medellín cartel with his partners, including Carlos Lehder and Gustavo Gaviria.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nThe Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared criminal organizations in the world, with Escobar as its leader. The cartel\'s main business was cocaine trafficking, and it was estimated that they controlled up to 80% of the global cocaine market. Escobar\'s organization was known for its brutality and ruthlessness, and he was feared by his enemies and rivals.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by violence and terror. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including police officers, judges, politicians, and rival gang members. He also ordered the bombing of a commercial airliner, Avianca Flight 203, which killed 110 people.\n\n**Pursuit and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a specially built prison, known as La Catedral. However, he escaped from prison in 1992 and went into hiding. A joint task force of Colombian and American law enforcement agencies, known as Search Bloc, was formed to hunt him down. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He was a ruthless and brutal criminal who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people. However, he was also a charismatic and cunning leader who was able to build a vast and powerful organization. His story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included owning a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a massive estate, Hacienda Nápoles.\n* He was a skilled manipulator and was able to bribe and intimidate many politicians and law enforcement officials.\n* Escobar was a prolific killer, and it\'s estimated that he was responsible for the deaths of over 4,000 people.\n* He was a devout Catholic and often attended church services, despite his violent and criminal lifestyle.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar was a larger-than-life figure who left a lasting impact on the world of organized crime and international politics. His story is a fascinating and complex one, full of twists and turns, and continues to captivate audiences around the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 10:45:00', '2026-05-15 10:45:26', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-15 10:45:26', '2026-05-15 10:45:26'),
(3123, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious drug trafficking organizations in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals of the 20th century.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, and grew up in a poor family. He began his criminal career in the 1970s, initially involved in small-time smuggling and theft. However, he quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, which was founded by his uncle, Roberto Escobar.\n\nIn the early 1980s, Escobar became a key player in the cartel, using his charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness to build a vast network of cocaine producers, traffickers, and distributors. He formed alliances with other cartels and organized crime groups, and his organization became one of the most powerful and feared in the world.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel dominated the global cocaine trade, producing and distributing hundreds of tons of cocaine every year. The cartel\'s operations were highly organized and sophisticated, with a network of smugglers, money launderers, and enforcers.\n\nEscobar\'s organization was known for its brutality and violence, and he was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including police officers, judges, politicians, and rival cartel members. He was also known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included owning luxurious homes, cars, and airplanes.\n\n**The Hunt for Escobar**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. The hunt for Escobar became a major international effort, with the DEA, CIA, and other agencies involved.\n\nEscobar went into hiding in 1991, and a massive manhunt was launched to find him. He was eventually tracked down to a rooftop in Medellín, where he was shot and killed by Colombian police on December 1, 1993.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who was responsible for immense suffering and violence. However, he is also seen as a folk hero by some in Colombia, who view him as a symbol of resistance against the government and the wealthy elite.\n\nEscobar\'s story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos,\" which tells the story of his rise and fall. His life and legacy continue to fascinate and horrify people around the world, and his impact on the global drug trade and organized crime is still felt today.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his love of soccer, and he even built a soccer stadium in his hometown of Medellín.\n* He was a prolific builder, and his organization constructed many roads, schools, and hospitals in Colombia.\n* Escobar was a skilled politician, and he was elected to the Colombian Congress in 1982.\n* He was known for his generosity, and he gave away millions of dollars to poor people in Colombia.\n* Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power, making him one of the richest people in the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 10:50:00', '2026-05-15 10:50:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-15 10:50:22', '2026-05-15 10:50:22'),
(3124, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious organized crime groups in history. He was known for his ruthless tactics, extravagant lifestyle, and ability to evade capture for many years.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a modest home with his parents and siblings. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he became involved in crime at a young age. He dropped out of school in the seventh grade and began working as a car thief and smuggler.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was rapidly expanding in Colombia. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, becoming a key player in the organization. Escobar\'s success was due in part to his ability to establish relationships with other cartels and his willingness to use violence to eliminate competitors.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. The cartel controlled a significant portion of the global cocaine trade, and Escobar\'s wealth and influence grew exponentially. He became known as \"El Patrón\" (The Boss) and was feared by his enemies and admired by his followers.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by extreme violence and terror. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including politicians, police officers, and rival cartel members. He also orchestrated bombings, kidnappings, and assassinations. Escobar\'s most notorious act of violence was the bombing of Avianca Flight 203, which killed 110 people.\n\n**Extravagant Lifestyle**\n\nDespite his notorious reputation, Escobar lived an extravagant lifestyle. He owned numerous properties, including a vast estate called Hacienda Nápoles, which featured a private zoo, a lake, and a collection of exotic cars. He also owned a private jet and a yacht.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a luxury prison he had built for himself. However, he escaped in 1992 and went into hiding. A massive manhunt ensued, with Colombian and American authorities working together to capture him. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who brought terror and violence to Colombia and beyond. However, he is also seen as a symbol of the failure of the war on drugs and the corrupting influence of power and wealth. His story has been immortalized in numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power.\n* He was known for his love of soccer and owned a team called Atlético Nacional.\n* Escobar\'s Hacienda Nápoles estate was seized by the Colombian government and is now a theme park and zoo.\n* He was a skilled manipulator and used his charm and charisma to build relationships with politicians and other influential figures.\n* Escobar\'s death was seen as a major victory for the Colombian government and marked the beginning of the end of the Medellín cartel\'s reign of terror.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 10:53:00', '2026-05-15 10:53:26', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-15 10:53:26', '2026-05-15 10:53:26'),
(3125, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', 'Here\'s a possible Facebook post:\n\n\"As a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Whether you\'re breathing fire or closing deals, it\'s essential to have a clear vision of what you want to achieve.\n* **Build a strong team**: Surround yourself with people who complement your strengths and weaknesses, just like a dragon\'s loyal hoard of treasure guardians.\n* **Stay adaptable**: The business landscape is constantly changing, so be prepared to pivot and adjust your strategy as needed.\n* **Protect your brand**: Just as a dragon guards its treasure, you should fiercely defend your brand and reputation.\n\n#DragonSlayingBusinessTips #BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #Motivation #InspirationalQuotes #TrendingNow #BusinessTrends #CareerAdvice\"\n\nThis post uses a professional tone and includes relatable points, hashtags, and a touch of dragon-themed humor to make it engaging and memorable.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 11:18:00', '2026-05-15 11:18:31', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-05-15 11:18:31', '2026-05-15 11:18:31'),
(3126, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about passion, perseverance, and success. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set your goals ablaze**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and chase your aspirations with fierce determination.\n* **Protect your treasure**: Prioritize your values and guard them fiercely, just as I protect my hoard.\n* **Soar to new heights**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things - it\'s often the best way to grow and learn.\n* **Breathe fire into your passions**: Pursue your interests with passion and energy, and watch them ignite into something amazing.\n\n#DragonsDen #MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #GoalSetting #PassionPursuit #RiskTakers #GrowthMindset #FireWithin #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalAdvice #BusinessLessons #CreatorTips', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 11:39:00', '2026-05-15 11:39:26', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 35, '2026-05-15 11:39:26', '2026-05-15 11:39:26'),
(3127, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Men\'s Party Wear: A Guide to Dressing to Impress**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, there are many options to choose from, depending on the occasion, theme, and personal style. Here are some popular and stylish options:\n\n### Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-tailored suit in black, navy, or gray is a classic choice for formal parties. Pair it with a crisp white shirt, a slim tie, and dress shoes.\n2. **Tuxedos**: For a black-tie event, a tuxedo is the way to go. Opt for a peak lapel or shawl collar style, and don\'t forget a bow tie and cummerbund.\n3. **Dinner Jackets**: A dinner jacket in a bold color or pattern can add a touch of sophistication to your outfit. Pair it with a white shirt, black trousers, and dress shoes.\n\n### Semi-Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer in a light color or bold pattern can add a stylish touch to your outfit. Pair it with a dress shirt, dark jeans, and dress shoes.\n2. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt in a bold color or pattern can be paired with dark jeans and dress shoes for a stylish and semi-formal look.\n3. **Chinos**: Chinos in a light color can be paired with a dress shirt and dress shoes for a smart and stylish outfit.\n\n### Casual Party Wear\n\n1. **Graphic T-Shirts**: A graphic t-shirt can be paired with dark jeans and sneakers for a casual and stylish outfit.\n2. **Polos**: A polo shirt in a bold color can be paired with light-colored pants and sneakers for a preppy and stylish look.\n3. **Jeans and a Leather Jacket**: A pair of dark jeans and a leather jacket can be paired with a t-shirt and sneakers for a cool and edgy outfit.\n\n### Accessories\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch can add a touch of sophistication to your outfit. Opt for a leather strap or a metal band.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of elegance to your shirt. Opt for simple and elegant designs.\n3. **Shoes**: Dress shoes, loafers, or boots can complete your outfit. Make sure they are polished and in good condition.\n\n### Grooming Tips\n\n1. **Hair**: Style your hair with a pomade or a hair wax for a sleek and stylish look.\n2. **Beard**: Trim your beard to keep it neat and tidy.\n3. **Nails**: Make sure your nails are clean and trimmed.\n\nBy following these tips, you\'ll be sure to make a stylish and impressive appearance at your next party. Remember to dress according to the occasion and theme, and don\'t forget to have fun and be confident!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 12:40:00', '2026-05-15 12:40:29', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-05-15 12:40:29', '2026-05-15 12:40:29'),
(3128, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn for formal occasions, such as business meetings, job interviews, weddings, and other special events. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts typically have a pointed or spread collar, which is designed to complement a tie.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts usually have French cuffs, which are also known as double cuffs. These cuffs are designed to be fastened with cufflinks.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are typically made from high-quality fabrics, such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely, with a slim fit through the body and sleeves.\n5. **Button-front**: Formal shirts usually have a button-front closure, with a placket that is stitched in place.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic fit**: A classic fit formal shirt is a timeless style that is designed to fit comfortably, with a slightly relaxed fit through the body and sleeves.\n2. **Slim fit**: A slim fit formal shirt is designed to fit closely, with a modern and streamlined silhouette.\n3. **Tailored fit**: A tailored fit formal shirt is designed to fit closely, with a focus on accentuating the wearer\'s physique.\n4. **Dress shirt**: A dress shirt is a type of formal shirt that is designed to be worn with a suit and tie.\n5. **Business casual**: A business casual formal shirt is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn in a more relaxed office environment.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White**: A white formal shirt is a classic choice that is suitable for most formal occasions.\n2. **Light blue**: A light blue formal shirt is a popular choice that is suitable for business meetings and other formal events.\n3. **Pastel colors**: Pastel colors, such as pale pink and baby blue, are popular choices for formal shirts.\n4. **Stripes**: Striped formal shirts are a classic choice that can add visual interest to an outfit.\n5. **Checks**: Checked formal shirts are a popular choice that can add a touch of personality to an outfit.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: Thomas Pink is a luxury brand that is known for its high-quality formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: Charvet is a French brand that is known for its exquisite formal shirts.\n3. **Burberry**: Burberry is a British brand that is known for its classic formal shirts.\n4. **Armani**: Armani is an Italian brand that is known for its stylish and sophisticated formal shirts.\n5. **Hugo Boss**: Hugo Boss is a German brand that is known for its high-quality formal shirts.\n\nOverall, a formal shirt for men is a versatile and essential item that can be worn for a variety of formal occasions. By choosing a high-quality shirt from a reputable brand, men can ensure that they look and feel their best.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 12:56:00', '2026-05-15 12:56:25', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-05-15 12:56:25', '2026-05-15 12:56:25'),
