(3132, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Unlock Your Potential with Dragon**\n\nAs a business, we understand the importance of staying ahead of the curve. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Innovative Solutions**: We provide cutting-edge solutions to help you tackle complex challenges and achieve your goals.\n* **Expert Guidance**: Our team of professionals is dedicated to providing you with the support and guidance you need to succeed.\n* **Community Building**: We believe in building strong relationships with our clients and partners to foster a sense of community and collaboration.\n\nAt Dragon, we are committed to helping you achieve your full potential. Join us on this journey and discover the power of innovation and expertise.\n\n#InnovationMatters #BusinessSuccess #CommunityFirst #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #DragonSolutions #ProfessionalExcellence #StayAheadOfTheCurve', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 14:37:00', '2026-05-15 14:37:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-15 14:37:15', '2026-05-15 14:37:15'),
(3133, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Breathing Fire into Your Business: Key Takeaways**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on a treasure hoard, you need to define what you want to achieve in your business.\n* **Be fearless**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and face challenges head-on. After all, a dragon isn\'t afraid of a little fire.\n* **Build a strong team**: A dragon\'s lair is only as strong as the creatures that inhabit it. Surround yourself with talented and dedicated individuals who share your vision.\n* **Stay adaptable**: The business landscape is constantly changing, just like the winds that buffet a dragon\'s wings. Be prepared to pivot and adjust your strategy as needed.\n* **Protect your brand**: A dragon guards its treasure with its life. Similarly, you should be vigilant in defending your brand\'s reputation and intellectual property.\n\n#BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #DragonInspiration #TrendingNow #SmallBusiness #MarketingStrategy #Leadership #ProfessionalDevelopment #FacebookBusiness #BusinessGrowth #Innovation #SuccessMindset', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 14:38:00', '2026-05-15 14:38:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-15 14:38:17', '2026-05-15 14:38:17'),
