(3135, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Embracing Your Inner Strength**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about being fierce in the pursuit of your passions. Here are a few key takeaways to help you unleash your inner dragon:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s starting a new business or pursuing a new hobby, remember that the sky\'s the limit.\n* **Stay focused and determined**: Overcome obstacles and stay committed to your vision. Every great achievement requires perseverance and hard work.\n* **Surround yourself with positive influences**: The people you surround yourself with can either fuel your fire or extinguish it. Choose wisely and build a supportive network of friends and mentors.\n* **Continuously learn and grow**: Stay curious and keep learning. Whether it\'s reading books, attending seminars, or seeking out new experiences, remember that knowledge is power.\n\n#MotivationMonday #DragonEnergy #InnerStrength #SuccessTips #BusinessInspiration #PersonalGrowth #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #GoalSetting #Determination #PositiveVibesOnly', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 15:10:00', '2026-05-15 15:10:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-05-15 15:10:21', '2026-05-15 15:10:21'),
(3136, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Journey**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and embracing my true self. Here are a few key takeaways from my journey:\n\n* **Believe in yourself**: No matter how impossible your dreams may seem, remember that you have the power to achieve them.\n* **Don\'t be afraid to take risks**: Sometimes, you need to take a leap of faith to discover new opportunities and growth.\n* **Protect your passion**: Just like I guard my treasure, you should safeguard your passions and interests.\n* **Learn from failure**: Every setback is an opportunity to learn and come back stronger.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #BelieveInYourself #TakeRisks #PassionProtection #LearnFromFailure #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #DragonSays #FireWithin #ProfessionalTips #BusinessLessons #CreatorVibes', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 15:14:00', '2026-05-15 15:14:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-05-15 15:14:21', '2026-05-15 15:14:21'),
(3137, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned to harness my inner strength and passion to achieve greatness. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your personal and professional life:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like I set my sights on conquering new skies, you should aim high and strive for excellence in your endeavors.\n* **Stay focused and determined**: With a clear vision and unwavering commitment, you can overcome any obstacle and achieve success.\n* **Embrace your uniqueness**: As a dragon, I celebrate my individuality and the qualities that set me apart. You should do the same and let your authentic self shine.\n* **Continuously learn and grow**: Whether it\'s mastering new skills or exploring uncharted territories, always be open to new experiences and knowledge.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #BusinessTips #PersonalGrowth #TrendingNow #SuccessMindset #Entrepreneurship #LeadershipLessons #Innovation #CreativityUnleashed #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #InspirationForTheDay', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 15:24:00', '2026-05-15 15:24:25', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-05-15 15:24:25', '2026-05-15 15:24:25'),
