(3143, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nThere are several types of football, including:\n\n1. **Association Football (Soccer)**: This is the most widely played version of football, played with a round ball and emphasizing kicking and heading.\n2. **American Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying and throwing the ball, with a focus on physical contact and tackles.\n3. **Rugby Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying and passing the ball, with a focus on physical contact and tackles.\n4. **Australian Rules Football**: This version is played with an oval-shaped ball and emphasizes carrying and kicking the ball, with a focus on speed and agility.\n\nSome of the most popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: An international soccer tournament held every four years, featuring national teams from around the world.\n2. **UEFA Champions League**: A European club soccer tournament, featuring top teams from the continent.\n3. **NFL (National Football League)**: A professional American football league in the United States, featuring 32 teams.\n4. **English Premier League**: A professional soccer league in England, featuring 20 teams.\n\nFootball has a massive global following, with millions of fans attending matches, watching on TV, and playing the game at various levels, from recreational to professional.\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 16:33:00', '2026-05-15 16:33:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-15 16:33:22', '2026-05-15 16:33:22'),
(3144, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The Yamaha R1 is a popular sport bike manufactured by Yamaha. It\'s known for its impressive performance, agile handling, and sleek design. Here are some key features of the Yamaha R1:\n\n**Engine:**\n- 998cc, liquid-cooled, 4-stroke, DOHC, 4-cylinder engine\n- Produces 200 horsepower at 13,500 rpm\n- 82.9 lb-ft of torque at 11,500 rpm\n\n**Transmission:**\n- 6-speed manual transmission\n- Quick Shift System (QSS) for seamless upshifts and downshifts\n\n**Brakes:**\n- Dual 320mm hydraulic disc brakes at the front\n- 220mm hydraulic disc brake at the rear\n- ABS (Anti-lock Braking System) for improved safety\n\n**Suspension:**\n- 43mm inverted fork at the front\n- Monoshock suspension at the rear\n\n**Electronics:**\n- 6-axis Inertial Measurement Unit (IMU) for advanced traction control and cornering ABS\n- Ride-by-wire throttle for precise control\n- Multiple riding modes, including Sport, Standard, and Rain\n\n**Design:**\n- Aerodynamic bodywork with a distinctive M1-inspired design\n- LED headlights and taillights for improved visibility\n\n**Weight and Dimensions:**\n- Wet weight: 439 pounds (199 kg)\n- Seat height: 32.5 inches (825 mm)\n- Wheelbase: 55.3 inches (1,405 mm)\n\nThe Yamaha R1 is a high-performance sport bike that\'s designed for experienced riders who demand exceptional power, handling, and technology. If you\'re interested in learning more or test-riding an R1, I recommend visiting a local Yamaha dealership or speaking with a certified sales representative.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 16:42:00', '2026-05-15 16:42:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-15 16:42:20', '2026-05-15 16:42:20'),
(3145, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. He is one of the most iconic and popular characters in the Marvel Universe.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nIron Man\'s secret identity is Tony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist. After being kidnapped and held captive by a group of terrorists, Tony Stark was forced to create a powerful suit of armor to escape. He used his intelligence and resourcefulness to build the first Iron Man suit, which he later refined and improved to become a superhero.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit is a advanced exoskeleton that provides him with a range of powers and abilities, including:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight capabilities\n* Energy projection and repulsor technology\n* Advanced sensors and scanning technology\n* Enhanced cognitive abilities and artificial intelligence\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a confident and charismatic character. He is a genius inventor and entrepreneur who is not afraid to take risks. He is also a bit of a narcissist and can come across as arrogant, but he is ultimately driven by a desire to protect the world and make it a better place.\n\n**Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU):**\nIron Man has been a central character in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), with Robert Downey Jr. playing the role in multiple films, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* The Incredible Hulk (2008)\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has become an iconic character in popular culture, symbolizing innovation, intelligence, and heroism. He has inspired countless fans around the world and has been featured in various forms of media, including comic books, movies, TV shows, and video games.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 17:30:00', '2026-05-15 17:30:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-15 17:30:22', '2026-05-15 17:30:22'),
(3146, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**The Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a tailored suit, stands tall and confident on the basketball court. His attire is immaculate, with a crisp white shirt, a slim tie, and a fitted blazer that accentuates his broad shoulders. His shoes, polished to a high shine, seem almost out of place on the court, but he wears them with an air of authority.\n\n**The Setting:**\nThe basketball court, with its polished wooden floor and gleaming hoops, provides a striking backdrop for the businessman. The stadium lights, casting a dramatic glow, create long shadows that stretch across the court, adding depth and dimension to the scene. The atmosphere is electric, as if the court is waiting for the next big game to begin.\n\n**The Lighting:**\nThe lighting is high-contrast, with the stadium lights casting a golden glow on the subject. The shadows are deep and rich, adding a sense of drama and tension to the image. The overall effect is cinematic, with a sense of high-stakes drama and anticipation.\n\n**The Props:**\nThe basketball, held casually in the businessman\'s hand, serves as a symbol of his confidence and skills. It\'s as if he\'s about to make a slam dunk, or perhaps he\'s just finished a game-winning shot. The ball seems to be an extension of his body, a natural part of his being.\n\n**The Mood:**\nThe mood of the image is one of success and determination. The businessman exudes an aura of confidence, as if he\'s conquered the court and is ready to take on the world. His expression is focused, his eyes fixed on some point in the distance, as if he\'s visualizing his next move.\n\n**The Style:**\nThe image is shot in a high-resolution, cinematic style, with a shallow depth of field that blurs the background and emphasizes the subject. The colors are rich and vibrant, with a slightly desaturated tone that adds to the dramatic effect. The overall style is reminiscent of a Hollywood blockbuster, with a sense of epic scope and grandeur.\n\n**The Message:**\nThe image conveys a powerful message about success and determination. The businessman, dressed in his suit and standing on the basketball court, represents the idea that success is not limited to one domain or field. He\'s a master of multiple worlds, able to navigate the boardroom and the basketball court with equal ease. The image inspires the viewer to push beyond their limits, to strive for greatness, and to never give up on their dreams.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-15 17:45:00', '2026-05-15 17:45:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-15 17:45:23', '2026-05-15 17:45:23'),
