(3175, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players each. The objective is to score more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **The Pitch**: The game is played on a rectangular field with goals at each end. The pitch is typically made of grass or artificial turf.\n2. **The Ball**: The ball used in football is round and made of leather or synthetic materials.\n3. **Players**: Each team has 11 players, including a goalkeeper, defenders, midfielders, and forwards.\n4. **Gameplay**: The game starts with a kickoff, where one team kicks the ball to the other team. Players can use any part of their body except their hands and arms to control and move the ball.\n5. **Scoring**: A goal is scored when a player kicks or heads the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n6. **Fouls**: If a player breaks the rules, a foul is committed, and the opposing team is awarded a free kick or penalty kick.\n7. **Referee**: A referee oversees the game and enforces the rules.\n\nSome popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most prestigious international football tournament, held every four years.\n2. **UEFA Champions League**: A club competition featuring top teams from Europe.\n3. **English Premier League**: A professional league in England, considered one of the best in the world.\n4. **La Liga**: A professional league in Spain, featuring top teams like Barcelona and Real Madrid.\n\nFootball is a beloved sport worldwide, with millions of fans and players. Its simplicity, excitement, and teamwork make it a thrilling game to play and watch.\n\nAre you a football fan? Do you have a favorite team or player?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-16 16:33:00', '2026-05-16 16:33:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-16 16:33:19', '2026-05-16 16:33:19'),
(3176, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The Yamaha R1 is a popular sport bike manufactured by Yamaha. It\'s known for its high-performance capabilities and aggressive design. Here are some key features of the Yamaha R1:\n\n**Key Specifications:**\n\n* Engine: 998cc, liquid-cooled, 4-stroke, DOHC, 16-valve, inline-4 cylinder\n* Power: 200 horsepower (147.9 kW) @ 13,500 rpm\n* Torque: 82.6 lb-ft (112 Nm) @ 11,500 rpm\n* Transmission: 6-speed, constant mesh\n* Dry Weight: 439 pounds (199 kg)\n* Seat Height: 32.5 inches (826 mm)\n* Fuel Capacity: 4.5 gallons (17 liters)\n\n**Features:**\n\n* Advanced electronics, including traction control, slide control, and wheelie control\n* 6-axis inertial measurement unit (IMU) for precise cornering and braking\n* Ride-by-wire throttle with multiple ride modes\n* LED headlights and taillights\n* Aluminum frame and swingarm for reduced weight and increased strength\n\n**Riding Experience:**\n\n* The R1 is known for its exceptional handling and agility, making it a favorite among track riders and canyon carvers.\n* The bike\'s powerful engine and advanced electronics make it capable of delivering impressive acceleration and braking performance.\n* The R1\'s ergonomics are designed for aggressive riding, with a low handlebar and high footpegs that put the rider in a sporty, forward-leaning position.\n\n**Target Audience:**\n\n* Experienced sport bike riders who demand high-performance capabilities and advanced technology.\n* Track riders and enthusiasts who want a bike that can handle the demands of high-speed riding.\n* Anyone who wants a bike that can deliver an exhilarating riding experience on twisty roads or at the track.\n\nOverall, the Yamaha R1 is a highly capable and technologically advanced sport bike that\'s designed for experienced riders who demand the best.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-16 16:42:00', '2026-05-16 16:42:26', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-16 16:42:26', '2026-05-16 16:42:26'),
(3177, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. Created by writer and editor Stan Lee, playwright and scripter Larry Lieber, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby, the character first appeared in Tales of Suspense #39 (March 1963).\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is kidnapped by a group of terrorists who demand that he build a powerful missile system for them. Instead, Stark uses the resources available to him to create a powered exoskeleton, which he uses to escape captivity. Upon his return to the United States, Stark perfects the design and creates a more advanced suit, becoming the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s powers come from his advanced suit, which provides:\n\n1. **Superhuman Strength**: The suit amplifies Stark\'s physical strength, allowing him to lift and throw objects that would be impossible for a human to handle.\n2. **Flight**: The suit has repulsor technology that allows Iron Man to fly.\n3. **Energy Projection**: The suit can project energy blasts from its hands, known as repulsor rays.\n4. **Advanced Sensors**: The suit has advanced sensors that provide Iron Man with real-time data on his surroundings, including radar, infrared, and other forms of detection.\n5. **Artificial Intelligence**: The suit has an advanced AI system, known as JARVIS (Just A Rather Very Intelligent System), which assists Iron Man in various tasks and provides strategic support.\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a complex character with a mix of traits:\n\n1. **Genius Intellect**: Stark is an incredibly intelligent and resourceful individual, able to design and build advanced technologies.\n2. **Confidence and Arrogance**: Stark is confident in his abilities and can come across as arrogant, but he is also fiercely determined to protect the world from threats.\n3. **Wit and Humor**: Iron Man is known for his quick wit and sense of humor, often using humor to defuse tense situations.\n4. **Vulnerability**: Despite his tough exterior, Stark has a vulnerable side, particularly when it comes to his personal relationships and the weight of his responsibilities as a superhero.\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been featured in numerous movies, including:\n\n1. **Iron Man (2008)**: The first movie in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man.\n2. **Iron Man 2 (2010)**: The sequel to the first movie, with Downey Jr. reprising his role.\n3. **The Avengers (2012)**: Iron Man joins a team of superheroes, including Captain America, Thor, and the Hulk, to save the world from an alien invasion.\n4. **Iron Man 3 (2013)**: The third solo Iron Man movie, with Downey Jr. facing off against the villainous Mandarin.\n5. **Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)**: Iron Man and the Avengers face a new threat in the form of the artificial intelligence Ultron.\n6. **Captain America: Civil War (2016)**: Iron Man and Captain America clash over the Sokovia Accords, a UN treaty that regulates the actions of superheroes.\n7. **Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)**: Iron Man mentors Peter Parker, aka Spider-Man, in his early days as a superhero.\n8. **Avengers: Infinity War (2018)**: Iron Man and the Avengers face their greatest challenge yet as they battle Thanos and his army.\n9. **Avengers: Endgame (2019)**: The final movie in the MCU\'s Infinity Saga, with Iron Man playing a key role in the battle against Thanos.\n\nOverall, Iron Man is a beloved and iconic superhero character, known for his intelligence, wit, and bravery in the face of danger.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-16 17:30:00', '2026-05-16 17:30:25', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-16 17:30:25', '2026-05-16 17:30:25'),
