(3195, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Unlock the Power of Dragons in Business**\n\nAs a professional dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what makes a successful entrepreneur. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Embracing challenges**: Just like how dragons face fierce battles, entrepreneurs must be prepared to overcome obstacles and come out stronger.\n* **Innovative thinking**: Dragons are known for their intelligence and cunning, traits that are essential for staying ahead of the competition.\n* **Building strong relationships**: A dragon\'s hoard is not just about treasure, but also about the people and connections that help them grow.\n* **Adapting to change**: In a rapidly changing business landscape, being able to pivot and adjust is crucial for survival.\n\n#DragonInspired #BusinessTips #EntrepreneurMindset #InnovationNation #TrendingNow #FacebookForBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #SuccessStories #MotivationMonday #BusinessGrowth #LeadershipLessons', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-17 14:00:00', '2026-05-17 14:00:25', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-05-17 14:00:25', '2026-05-17 14:00:25'),
(3196, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated humans. Here are some key takeaways from the dragon\'s world that can inspire and motivate you:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness and bravery, reminding us to stand up for what we believe in and face challenges head-on.\n* **Passion and drive**: The fire that burns within a dragon is a metaphor for the passion and drive that fuels our own pursuits, reminding us to stay motivated and focused on our goals.\n* **Loyalty and protection**: Dragons are fiercely loyal and protective of their territories and loved ones, teaching us the importance of commitment and dedication to those who matter most.\n* **Adaptability and growth**: Despite their intimidating reputation, dragons are also known for their intelligence and ability to adapt, reminding us to stay open to new experiences and learning opportunities.\n\n#DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #Inspiration #TrendingNow #PersonalGrowth #CourageOverFear #PassionDriven #LoyaltyMatters #AdaptAndThrive #FacebookMotivation #ProfessionalDevelopment #BusinessInspiration #CreatorTips #RelatableContent #LessonsFromNature #MythicalCreatures #Symbolism #FireWithin #InnerStrength #Resilience', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-17 14:37:00', '2026-05-17 14:37:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-17 14:37:15', '2026-05-17 14:37:15'),
(3197, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', 'As a dragon, I understand the importance of connecting with my audience on Facebook. Here\'s a relatable caption in points that showcases my professional brand voice:\n\n\"Breathing fire into your day with these key takeaways:\n* Embracing challenges head-on, just like I face fierce battles\n* Prioritizing self-care, because even dragons need a break from hoarding treasure\n* Surrounding myself with a supportive community, like my loyal dragon squad\n* Continuously learning and growing, whether it\'s mastering new fire-breathing techniques or exploring new caves\n\n#DragonsOfFacebook #FireBreathingMotivation #RelatableDragonMoments #TrendingNow #ProfessionalDragon #FacebookFaves #DragonSquadGoals #SelfCareForDragons #GrowthMindset\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-17 14:38:00', '2026-05-17 14:38:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-17 14:38:15', '2026-05-17 14:38:15'),
(3198, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Unleashing the Power of Business: Lessons from a Dragon**\n\nAs a business owner, you may be wondering what it takes to succeed in today\'s competitive market. Here are some key takeaways to help you soar to new heights:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define your mission and vision to guide your business decisions\n* **Be adaptable**: Stay agile and responsive to changes in the market and industry\n* **Invest in your team**: Foster a positive and supportive work environment to drive growth and innovation\n* **Take calculated risks**: Weigh the pros and cons of each decision to minimize risk and maximize returns\n* **Stay focused on customer needs**: Deliver exceptional customer experiences to build loyalty and drive revenue\n\nAt Dragon Enterprises, we\'re committed to helping businesses thrive. Follow us for more tips, insights, and industry news! #BusinessSuccess #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #Leadership #MarketingStrategy #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #SmallBusiness #StartupLife #BusinessGrowth #DragonEnterprises', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-17 14:39:00', '2026-05-17 14:39:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-17 14:39:23', '2026-05-17 14:39:23'),
