(3207, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **Objective**: The main objective of football is to score more goals than the opposing team within the 90-minute game duration.\n2. **Gameplay**: Players can use any part of their body except their hands and arms to control and move the ball. Only the goalkeeper is allowed to use their hands and arms to touch the ball.\n3. **Positions**: Each team has 11 players with different positions, including:\n	* Goalkeeper (GK)\n	* Defenders (DF)\n	* Midfielders (MF)\n	* Forwards (FW)\n4. **Rules**: The game is governed by a set of rules, including:\n	* Offside: A player is considered offside if they are closer to the opponent\'s goal line than both the ball and the second-to-last opponent when the ball is played forward.\n	* Fouls: Physical contact between players can result in fouls, which can lead to free kicks or penalties.\n	* Yellow and red cards: Players can receive yellow or red cards for misconduct, with yellow cards serving as a warning and red cards resulting in ejection from the game.\n5. **Competitions**: Football is played at various levels, including:\n	* Professional leagues (e.g., English Premier League, La Liga, Bundesliga)\n	* International competitions (e.g., FIFA World Cup, UEFA European Championship)\n	* Club competitions (e.g., UEFA Champions League, Copa Libertadores)\n\nSome of the most popular football leagues and competitions include:\n\n* English Premier League (EPL)\n* La Liga (Spain)\n* Bundesliga (Germany)\n* Serie A (Italy)\n* UEFA Champions League\n* FIFA World Cup\n\nFootball is a widely popular sport, with millions of fans worldwide and a significant impact on culture, economy, and society.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-17 16:33:00', '2026-05-17 16:33:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-17 16:33:23', '2026-05-17 16:33:23'),
(3208, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike, I\'m assuming you\'re referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1. \n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a super bike or a sports bike made by Yamaha. It was first introduced in 1998 and has been a popular choice among motorcycle enthusiasts ever since. Here are some key features of the Yamaha YZF-R1:\n\n* Engine: The R1 is powered by a 998cc, inline-four cylinder engine that produces around 200 horsepower.\n* Transmission: It has a 6-speed transmission with a multi-plate slipper clutch.\n* Suspension: The bike features a 43mm inverted fork at the front and a monoshock at the rear.\n* Brakes: The R1 is equipped with dual 320mm discs at the front and a single 220mm disc at the rear.\n* Electronics: The bike comes with advanced electronic features such as traction control, ABS, and rider modes.\n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is known for its exceptional performance, handling, and braking capabilities, making it a favorite among track riders and street riders alike. However, please note that the specifications may vary depending on the model year and region.\n\nIf you\'re interested in learning more about the Yamaha YZF-R1 or have specific questions, feel free to ask.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-17 16:42:00', '2026-05-17 16:42:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-17 16:42:22', '2026-05-17 16:42:22'),
(3209, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby, and first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense\" #39 in March 1963.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is kidnapped by a group of terrorists who want him to build a powerful missile system for them. Instead, Stark uses his knowledge and resources to create a powered exoskeleton, which he uses to escape from his captors. He later refines the design and creates a more advanced suit, which he uses to fight crime and protect the world as the superhero Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s powers come from his advanced suit, which is equipped with a range of technologies, including:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight capabilities\n* Energy projection (repulsor beams)\n* Advanced computer systems and artificial intelligence\n* Various sensors and tracking devices\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a brilliant and confident inventor, but also a self-centered and arrogant billionaire. He is a natural leader, but his ego and pride often get in the way of his relationships with others. Despite this, he is deeply committed to using his wealth and technology to make the world a better place.\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been adapted into a successful movie franchise, with Robert Downey Jr. playing the role of Tony Stark/Iron Man in multiple films, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* The Incredible Hulk (2008) - cameo appearance\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) - cameo appearance\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\nThe movies have been incredibly successful, both critically and commercially, and have helped to establish Iron Man as one of the most iconic and beloved superheroes of all time.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-17 17:30:00', '2026-05-17 17:30:25', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-17 17:30:25', '2026-05-17 17:30:25'),
(3210, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, determination, and success. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that make this image so compelling:\n\n**The Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a crisp suit, exudes an air of confidence and authority. The fact that he\'s standing on a basketball court, a domain typically associated with athletes, suggests that he\'s a high-achiever who can adapt to any environment. The suit, a symbol of corporate success, adds a layer of sophistication and professionalism to the image.\n\n**The Prop:**\nThe basketball in his hand serves as a prop that adds a dynamic element to the image. It implies that the businessman is not just a suit-wearing executive, but also a person with a competitive streak and a passion for sports. The ball also creates a sense of tension, as if he\'s about to take a shot or make a move, which adds to the overall drama of the image.\n\n**The Setting:**\nThe basketball court, with its polished wooden floor and gleaming stadium lights, provides a sleek and modern backdrop for the subject. The dramatic lighting, with deep shadows and highlights, adds a sense of depth and dimensionality to the image. The stadium lights, shining brightly behind the subject, create a sense of grandeur and importance, as if the businessman is about to take center stage.\n\n**The Mood:**\nThe overall mood of the image is one of confidence, determination, and success. The businessman\'s stance, with his feet shoulder-width apart and his head held high, conveys a sense of self-assurance and authority. The dramatic lighting and the presence of the basketball court add to the sense of drama and tension, implying that the subject is a high-achiever who is always striving to succeed.\n\n**The Style:**\nThe high-resolution cinematic style of the image adds a layer of sophistication and polish to the overall look. The use of dramatic lighting, deep shadows, and vibrant colors creates a sense of depth and dimensionality, drawing the viewer\'s eye to the subject. The image has a cinematic quality, as if it\'s a still frame from a movie or a commercial, which adds to its overall impact and memorability.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful and compelling one, conveying a sense of confidence, determination, and success. The combination of the subject, prop, setting, mood, and style creates a visually striking image that is sure to grab the viewer\'s attention and leave a lasting impression.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-17 17:45:00', '2026-05-17 17:45:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-17 17:45:18', '2026-05-17 17:45:18'),
