alize the image! If you need any further assistance, feel free to ask.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-18 16:06:00', '2026-05-18 16:06:19', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-05-18 16:06:19', '2026-05-18 16:06:19');
