by his sides.\n\n**The High-Resolution Cinematic Style:**\nThe image is captured in a high-resolution cinematic style, with a shallow depth of field that blurs the background and emphasizes the subject. The colors are rich and vibrant, with a warm, golden tone that adds to the sense of drama and tension. The image is highly detailed, with every aspect of the subject and the court rendered in sharp, crisp focus.\n\nOverall, the image is a powerful representation of confidence, success, and determination. The subject\'s confident pose, combined with the dramatic lighting and the cinematic style, creates a sense of drama and tension that draws the viewer in and refuses to let go.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-18 17:46:00', '2026-05-18 17:46:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-18 17:46:22', '2026-05-18 17:46:22'),
