hotographer to capture a similar scene.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-19 16:06:00', '2026-05-19 16:06:18', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-05-19 16:06:18', '2026-05-19 16:06:18'),
(3281, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a perfect blend of modern aesthetic photography and cinematic mood, capturing the essence of a rainy day in a bustling, neon-lit city. Let\'s break down the key elements that make this image so captivating:\n\n1. **Girl Walking with a Transparent Umbrella**: The subject, a girl, is the focal point of the image. She\'s walking under a transparent umbrella, which not only protects her from the rain but also adds a unique element to the photograph. The transparency of the umbrella allows the viewer to see her outfit and the surroundings without obstruction, blending her seamlessly into the background.\n\n2. **Light Rain**: The light rain creates a misty atmosphere, which, combined with the neon lights, adds to the cinematic mood of the image. The rain also helps to bring out the reflections on the wet street, enhancing the visual appeal of the scene.\n\n3. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: The neon lights from the city\'s advertisements, signs, and streetlights are reflected on the wet street, creating a colorful, mirrored effect. This not only adds vibrancy to the image but also gives it a dynamic, urban feel. The reflections can make the street look like a river of colors, further emphasizing the beauty of the rainy, neon-lit night.\n\n4. **Aesthetic Photography**: The term \"aesthetic\" refers to the appreciation of beauty. In photography, it means capturing images that are pleasing to the eye, often with a focus on composition, color palette, and the emotional response they evoke. The combination of a fashionable girl, a unique umbrella, and the vibrant neon reflections against the soft, rainy backdrop creates a highly aesthetic photograph.\n\n5. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: Bokeh refers to the aesthetic quality of the blur produced in the out-of-focus parts of an image produced by a lens. Soft bokeh lights, in this context, would be the blurred, neon lights in the background that are out of focus, creating a dreamy, ethereal effect. This softness contrasts with the sharpness of the subject and the street reflections, drawing the viewer\'s eye to the girl while still appreciating the ambient lighting.\n\n6. **Fashionable Outfit**: The girl\'s outfit is another crucial element, as it contributes to the overall aesthetic and mood of the photograph. A fashionable outfit can make the image feel more contemporary and stylish, possibly including elements like waterproof gear, trendy accessories, and clothes that reflect the neon colors of the surroundings, thereby integrating her seamlessly into the scene.\n\n7. **Cinematic Mood**: The description evokes a cinematic mood, suggesting that the image could be a still from a movie. This is due to the dramatic lighting, the misty rain, the vibrant neon colors, and the solitary figure of the girl, all of which can evoke a sense of narrative or story, making the viewer wonder about her journey, destination, or thoughts.\n\n8. **High-Detail**: The high level of detail in the image, from the girl\'s outfit to the reflections on the street, suggests that the photograph is of high quality, possibly taken with professional equipment. This level of detail allows the viewer to appreciate the textures, colors, and nuances of the scene, making the image more engaging and realistic.\n\nIn summary, the image of a girl walking with a transparent umbrella in light rain, set against a backdrop of neon reflections on a wet street, embodies a perfect fusion of aesthetic photography, fashionable appeal, and cinematic storytelling, making for a highly captivating and detailed visual experience.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-19 16:11:00', '2026-05-19 16:11:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-05-19 16:11:22', '2026-05-19 16:11:22'),
(3282, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'It looks like you\'re just testing. Is there something I can help you with or would you like to start a conversation?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-19 16:33:00', '2026-05-19 16:33:20', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Tester?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 48, '2026-05-19 16:33:20', '2026-05-19 16:33:20'),
(3283, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **The Game**: The game is divided into two 45-minute halves, with a 15-minute break in between. The team with the most goals at the end of the two halves wins the game.\n2. **The Players**: Each team has 11 players on the field, including a goalkeeper. The other 10 players are divided into defenders, midfielders, and forwards.\n3. **The Objective**: The objective of the game is to score more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n4. **The Rules**: Some of the key rules of football include:\n	* The ball must be kicked or headed, not carried or thrown.\n	* Players can use any part of their body except their hands and arms to control the ball.\n	* Only the goalkeeper is allowed to use their hands and arms to touch the ball.\n	* Fouls, such as tripping or pushing an opponent, are penalized with a free kick or penalty kick.\n5. **Tournaments and Competitions**: Football is played at various levels, including professional leagues, international tournaments, and local competitions. Some of the most popular tournaments include the World Cup, the European Championship, and the Champions League.\n6. **Popularity**: Football is one of the most popular sports in the world, with an estimated 3.5 billion fans globally.\n\nSome of the most famous football players include:\n\n* Cristiano Ronaldo\n* Lionel Messi\n* Kylian Mbappé\n* Robert Lewandowski\n* Neymar Jr.\n\nSome of the most successful football teams include:\n\n* Barcelona\n* Real Madrid\n* Manchester United\n* Liverpool\n* Bayern Munich\n\nDo you have a favorite football team or player?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-19 16:33:00', '2026-05-19 16:33:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-19 16:33:22', '2026-05-19 16:33:22'),
(3284, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The Yamaha R1 is a high-performance sport bike produced by Yamaha Motor Company. Here are some key features of the Yamaha R1:\n\n**Engine:**\n- 998cc, inline-4 cylinder engine\n- Liquid-cooled, 4-stroke, DOHC (dual overhead camshaft)\n- 4 valves per cylinder\n- Fuel injection system\n\n**Performance:**\n- Maximum power output: around 200 horsepower (147.9 kW)\n- Maximum torque: around 82.6 lb-ft (112 Nm)\n- Top speed: electronically limited to around 186 mph (300 km/h)\n\n**Transmission and Drive:**\n- 6-speed manual transmission\n- Chain drive\n\n**Brakes:**\n- Dual 320mm discs with 4-piston calipers (front)\n- 220mm disc with single-piston caliper (rear)\n- ABS (anti-lock braking system) standard\n\n**Suspension:**\n- 43mm inverted telescopic fork (front)\n- Monoshock with linkage-type suspension (rear)\n\n**Electronics:**\n- Yamaha Ride Control (YRC) system with multiple ride modes\n- Traction control\n- Cornering ABS\n- Launch control\n\n**Design and Chassis:**\n- Aluminum Deltabox frame\n- Swingarm: aluminum\n- Seat height: around 32.7 inches (831 mm)\n- Wet weight: around 448 pounds (203 kg)\n\nThe Yamaha R1 is known for its exceptional handling, powerful engine, and advanced electronics package, making it a popular choice among sport bike enthusiasts and track riders.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-19 16:42:00', '2026-05-19 16:42:31', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-19 16:42:31', '2026-05-19 16:42:31'),
(3285, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:15', '**Unlocking the Power of Creativity: A Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Innovation is key**: Stay ahead of the curve by continuously innovating and improving your products or services.\n* **Resilience is crucial**: Learn to adapt to changing circumstances and bounce back from setbacks.\n* **Collaboration is essential**: Build strong relationships with your team, partners, and customers to achieve common goals.\n* **Risk-taking is necessary**: Don\'t be afraid to take calculated risks to achieve greatness.\n* **Passion drives success**: Pursue your passions and stay motivated to achieve your goals.\n\n#DragonsInBusiness #CreativityUnleashed #InnovationNation #ResilienceMatters #CollaborationOverCompetition #RiskAndReward #PassionDriven #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #SuccessMindset #MotivationMonday #FacebookBusiness #DragonPower', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-19 17:15:00', '2026-05-19 17:15:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 6, '2026-05-19 17:15:16', '2026-05-19 17:15:16'),
(3286, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby. He first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense\" #39 in March 1963.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is the alter ego of Iron Man. After being kidnapped and held captive by a group of terrorists, Stark is forced to build a powerful suit of armor to escape. He uses the suit to fight against evil and protect the world from various threats.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit is equipped with advanced technology, including:\n\n1. Superhuman strength and durability\n2. Flight capabilities\n3. Repulsor technology, which allows him to project energy blasts and fly\n4. Advanced sensors and scanners\n5. Artificial intelligence, known as JARVIS (Just A Rather Very Intelligent System)\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been featured in several movies, including:\n\n1. Iron Man (2008) - starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man\n2. Iron Man 2 (2010)\n3. The Avengers (2012)\n4. Iron Man 3 (2013)\n5. Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n6. Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n7. Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n8. Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n9. Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has become an iconic superhero, known for his intelligence, wit, and bravery. The character has inspired countless fans around the world, and has been featured in various forms of media, including comic books, movies, TV shows, and video games.\n\nWhat\'s your favorite Iron Man moment or quote?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-19 17:30:00', '2026-05-19 17:30:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-19 17:30:18', '2026-05-19 17:30:18'),
