(3367, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and one of the most notorious criminals of the 20th century. He was the founder and leader of the Medellín cartel, which became one of the largest and most powerful cocaine trafficking organizations in the world.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to a middle-class family. His father was a farmer, and his mother was a schoolteacher. Escobar grew up in a poor neighborhood in Medellín, where he became involved in street crime at a young age. He dropped out of school in the seventh grade and began working as a car thief and a smuggler.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was becoming increasingly lucrative in Colombia. He started by smuggling small amounts of cocaine into the United States, but soon expanded his operations to become one of the largest cocaine traffickers in the country. Escobar\'s success was due in part to his ruthless tactics, including murder, intimidation, and bribery.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nIn the early 1980s, Escobar founded the Medellín cartel, which quickly became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. The cartel\'s main business was cocaine trafficking, but it also engaged in other illicit activities, such as money laundering, extortion, and murder. Escobar\'s organization was known for its brutality, and he was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including police officers, politicians, and rival gang members.\n\n**Personal Life**\n\nEscobar was known for his flamboyant lifestyle, which included owning a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a mansion in Medellín. He was also a family man, married to María Victoria Henao, with whom he had two children. Despite his notorious reputation, Escobar was seen as a folk hero by some in Colombia, who viewed him as a symbol of resistance against the government and the wealthy elite.\n\n**Downfall and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, Escobar\'s empire began to crumble. The Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of attacks against the Medellín cartel, including raids on Escobar\'s hideouts and the arrest of many of his top lieutenants. In 1991, Escobar surrendered to the authorities and was imprisoned, but he escaped from prison in 1992.\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. He was 44 years old at the time of his death.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He was a ruthless and brutal criminal who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, but he was also a charismatic figure who was seen as a symbol of resistance against the government and the wealthy elite. His story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\nToday, Escobar\'s legacy continues to be felt in Colombia, where his name is still whispered in awe and reverence by some. However, his impact on the country\'s history and culture is also widely recognized as a negative one, and many Colombians view him as a symbol of the country\'s violent and troubled past.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 10:53:00', '2026-05-22 10:53:30', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-22 10:53:30', '2026-05-22 10:53:30'),
(3368, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, resilience, and passion. Here are some key takeaways that can help you unleash your inner fire:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and strive for greatness. Whether it\'s building a successful business or creating something new, aim high and work towards your objectives.\n* **Stay focused and determined**: Overcome obstacles and stay committed to your goals, even when the going gets tough.\n* **Embrace your unique strengths**: Celebrate what sets you apart and use your talents to make a positive impact.\n* **Learn from failure**: Use setbacks as opportunities to learn and grow, and don\'t be afraid to try again.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #BusinessTips #CreativityUnleashed #TrendingNow #SuccessMindset #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #PassionDriven #FireWithin #RelatableMoments #FacebookInspiration', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 11:18:00', '2026-05-22 11:18:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-05-22 11:18:22', '2026-05-22 11:18:22'),
(3369, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of strength, courage, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated humans. Here are some key takeaways from the dragon\'s world that can inspire and motivate you:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like a dragon\'s fiery passion drives it to soar to great heights, set your sights on achieving remarkable things.\n* **Protect and nurture**: Dragons are known to fiercely guard their treasures and loved ones, reminding us to prioritize and care for what truly matters.\n* **Evolve and adapt**: With their ability to transform and grow, dragons teach us the importance of embracing change and continuous learning.\n* **Unleash your creativity**: The majestic beauty of dragons sparks imagination and creativity, encouraging us to think outside the box and innovate.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #FireWithin #Resilience #Courage #Ambition #GoalSetting #PersonalGrowth #CreativityUnleashed #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #InspirationalQuotes #DragonFire #StrengthAndCourage #MotivationalMonday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 11:39:00', '2026-05-22 11:39:27', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 35, '2026-05-22 11:39:27', '2026-05-22 11:39:27'),
(3370, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Men\'s Party Wear: A Guide to Dressing to Impress**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, the options are endless. From formal suits to stylish casual wear, there\'s something for every occasion and personal style. Here are some popular men\'s party wear options:\n\n### Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Suits**: A classic choice for formal parties, suits are available in a range of colors and styles. Choose from slim-fit, tailored, or classic fits to suit your body type.\n2. **Tuxedos**: For black-tie events, a tuxedo is the way to go. Pair it with a bow tie, cummerbund, and patent leather shoes for a dashing look.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A crisp, white dress shirt is a versatile option that can be paired with a suit or worn on its own with dress pants.\n\n### Semi-Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit. Pair it with a dress shirt, jeans, and boots for a stylish look.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dress pants in neutral colors like black, navy, or gray can be paired with a variety of tops and shoes.\n3. **Polo Shirts**: A polo shirt is a great option for a semi-formal party. Look for one in a bold color or pattern to add some personality to your outfit.\n\n### Casual Party Wear\n\n1. **Jeans**: A pair of dark wash jeans is a versatile option that can be dressed up or down.\n2. **Graphic T-Shirts**: A graphic t-shirt can add a fun touch to your outfit. Pair it with jeans and sneakers for a casual look.\n3. **Hoodies**: A hoodie can be a great option for a casual party. Look for one in a bold color or with a fun design.\n\n### Accessories\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of personality to a dress shirt.\n3. **Shoes**: Dress shoes, boots, or sneakers can all be great options depending on the occasion and your personal style.\n\n### Tips\n\n1. **Dress for the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the party\'s theme and dress code.\n2. **Be confident**: Own your look and have fun with it.\n3. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure your clothes fit well to avoid looking sloppy or uncomfortable.\n\nBy following these tips and choosing the right outfit, you\'ll be sure to make a statement at your next party.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 12:40:00', '2026-05-22 12:40:25', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-05-22 12:40:25', '2026-05-22 12:40:25'),
(3371, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key characteristics of a formal shirt for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic, collared shirt with a button-front closure and a formal fit.\n2. **Business Shirt:** A slightly more relaxed version of the dress shirt, often with a point or spread collar.\n3. **Tuxedo Shirt:** A formal shirt with a wingtip collar, designed to be worn with a tuxedo or dinner jacket.\n4. **Dress Oxford Shirt:** A type of dress shirt with a button-down collar and a more casual, relaxed fit.\n\n**Features of a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Collar Style:** Point, spread, or wingtip collars are common on formal shirts.\n2. **Cuff Style:** French cuffs or barrel cuffs are typical on formal shirts.\n3. **Fabric:** High-quality cotton, linen, or silk are common fabrics used for formal shirts.\n4. **Button Front:** A button-front closure is typical on formal shirts.\n5. **Pockets:** Some formal shirts may have a breast pocket or no pockets at all.\n6. **Fit:** Formal shirts are typically slim-fitting, with a tailored fit through the body and sleeves.\n\n**Popular Brands for Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**\n2. **Charvet**\n3. **Brooks Brothers**\n4. **Ralph Lauren**\n5. **Armani**\n6. **Hugo Boss**\n7. **Ted Baker**\n8. **Charles Tyrwhitt**\n\n**How to Choose a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion:** Choose a shirt that matches the formality of the event.\n2. **Think about your body type:** Select a shirt that flatters your body shape and size.\n3. **Choose a color:** White, light blue, and pastel shades are classic choices for formal shirts.\n4. **Check the fabric:** Opt for high-quality fabrics that will hold up well to wear and tear.\n5. **Pay attention to details:** Look for shirts with attention to detail, such as stitching and button quality.\n\n**Tips for Wearing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Pair with a suit:** A formal shirt is typically worn with a suit and tie.\n2. **Choose a tie:** Select a tie that complements the color and pattern of your shirt.\n3. **Add a pocket square:** A pocket square can add a touch of elegance to your outfit.\n4. **Make sure it fits:** Ensure the shirt fits well and is not too tight or too loose.\n5. **Pay attention to grooming:** Make sure your shirt is clean and pressed, and your grooming is impeccable.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 12:56:00', '2026-05-22 12:56:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-05-22 12:56:24', '2026-05-22 12:56:24'),
(3372, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to thrive. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define what you want to achieve and create a plan to get there\n* **Stay focused**: Avoid distractions and stay committed to your objectives\n* **Be adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change\n* **Lead with passion**: Let your enthusiasm and energy drive your decision-making\n* **Protect your assets**: Safeguard your resources and investments to ensure long-term success\n\n#DragonFire #BusinessSuccess #GoalSetting #Focus #Adaptability #PassionateLeadership #AssetProtection #TrendingNow #Entrepreneurship #Motivation #Inspiration #FacebookBusiness #DragonSquad #BusinessTips #SuccessMindset #LeadershipGoals', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 13:03:00', '2026-05-22 13:03:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-05-22 13:03:15', '2026-05-22 13:03:15'),
