(3386, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **Objective**: The main objective of football is to score more goals than the opposing team within the 90-minute playing time.\n2. **Gameplay**: Players can use any part of their body except their hands and arms to control and move the ball. Only the goalkeeper is allowed to use their hands and arms to touch the ball.\n3. **Positions**: Each team has 11 players with different positions, including:\n	* Goalkeeper (GK)\n	* Defenders (DF)\n	* Midfielders (MF)\n	* Forwards (FW)\n4. **Rules**: Some common rules in football include:\n	* Offside: A player is considered offside if they are closer to the opponent\'s goal line than both the ball and the second-to-last opponent when the ball is played forward.\n	* Fouls: Physical contact between players can result in free kicks or penalty kicks.\n	* Yellow and red cards: Yellow cards are given for minor infractions, while red cards result in the player being ejected from the game.\n5. **Competitions**: Football has various competitions, including:\n	* World Cup\n	* European Championship (Euro)\n	* Champions League\n	* Premier League\n	* La Liga\n	* Bundesliga\n6. **Popularity**: Football is one of the most popular sports in the world, with an estimated 3.5 billion fans globally.\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 16:33:00', '2026-05-22 16:33:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-22 16:33:22', '2026-05-22 16:33:22'),
(3387, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike. \n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is a legendary sport bike that has been in production since 1998. It\'s known for its exceptional performance, handling, and styling. Here are some key features and specs:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Engine:** 998cc, liquid-cooled, 4-stroke, DOHC, 16-valve, in-line four-cylinder engine.\n2. **Power:** 200 horsepower (147.9 kW) at 13,500 rpm.\n3. **Torque:** 82.6 lb-ft (112 Nm) at 11,500 rpm.\n4. **Transmission:** 6-speed, constant mesh.\n5. **Brakes:** Dual 320mm discs with 4-piston calipers (front), 220mm disc with single-piston caliper (rear).\n6. **Suspension:** 43mm inverted fork (front), monoshock with piggyback reservoir (rear).\n7. **Weight:** 439 pounds (199 kg) wet.\n8. **Seat Height:** 32.7 inches (831 mm).\n\n**Riding Modes:**\n\n1. **Mode 1:** Standard mode for everyday riding.\n2. **Mode 2:** Sport mode for more aggressive riding.\n3. **Mode 3:** Track mode for high-performance riding.\n4. **Mode 4:** Custom mode for personalized settings.\n\n**Electronic Features:**\n\n1. **Traction Control:** Yamaha\'s TCS (Traction Control System) helps prevent wheelspin and loss of traction.\n2. **ABS:** Anti-lock braking system for improved braking performance.\n3. **Ride-by-Wire:** Electronic throttle control for smoother, more precise throttle response.\n4. **Quick Shift:** Allows for clutchless upshifts and downshifts.\n\nThe Yamaha R1 is a highly regarded sport bike that\'s popular among track enthusiasts and street riders alike. Its powerful engine, agile handling, and advanced electronic features make it a formidable competitor in the sport bike market.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 16:42:00', '2026-05-22 16:42:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-22 16:42:17', '2026-05-22 16:42:17'),
(3388, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, developed by scripter Larry Lieber, and designed by artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is the alter ego of Iron Man. After being kidnapped and forced to build a powerful weapon, Stark uses his intelligence and resources to create a suit of armor to escape. He later refines the suit and uses it to fight crime and protect the world as Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit provides him with a range of powers and abilities, including:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight\n* Energy projection (repulsor beams)\n* Advanced sensors and tracking systems\n* Artificial intelligence (JARVIS, later replaced by FRIDAY)\n\n**Comic Book Series:**\nIron Man has appeared in numerous comic book series over the years, including:\n\n* Tales of Suspense (1963-1968)\n* Iron Man (1968-1996)\n* The Invincible Iron Man (2005-2012)\n* Iron Man (2012-2014)\n* Superior Iron Man (2014-2015)\n* International Iron Man (2016)\n* Infamous Iron Man (2016-2017)\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been featured in several movies, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* The Incredible Hulk (2008) - cameo appearance\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) - cameo appearance\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\n**Actor:**\nRobert Downey Jr. has played the role of Tony Stark/Iron Man in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) movies.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has become a cultural icon and a symbol of innovation and technological advancement. The character\'s legacy extends beyond the comic book pages and movies, inspiring real-world innovations and technological advancements.\n\nWhat would you like to know about Iron Man?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 17:30:00', '2026-05-22 17:30:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-22 17:30:21', '2026-05-22 17:30:21'),
(3389, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is one of power, confidence, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**The Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a crisp, tailored suit, stands tall on the basketball court. His attire is immaculate, with a fitted jacket, a crisp white shirt, and a tie that adds a pop of color to the overall ensemble. His shoes, polished to a high shine, seem almost out of place on the court, yet they add to the air of sophistication that surrounds him.\n\n**The Setting:**\nThe basketball court, bathed in the warm glow of stadium lights, provides a dramatic backdrop for the scene. The lights cast long shadows across the floor, emphasizing the subject\'s confident stance. The court itself is empty, with no other players or spectators in sight, which adds to the sense of solitude and focus.\n\n**The Ball:**\nThe basketball, held firmly in the subject\'s hand, seems to be an extension of his being. His grip is confident, yet relaxed, as if he\'s ready to take on any challenge that comes his way. The ball appears to be a symbol of his success, a reminder of the hard work and dedication that has brought him to this point.\n\n**The Lighting:**\nThe dramatic lighting, courtesy of the stadium lights, adds a cinematic quality to the scene. The shadows and highlights work together to create a sense of depth and dimensionality, drawing the viewer\'s eye to the subject. The light is intense, yet controlled, with a subtle warmth that suggests a sense of achievement and satisfaction.\n\n**The Mindset:**\nThe subject\'s success mindset is palpable, radiating from every aspect of his being. His posture, his expression, and his overall demeanor all convey a sense of confidence and determination. He\'s a man who\'s used to achieving his goals, and he\'s not afraid to take on new challenges. The basketball court, with its connotations of competition and perseverance, serves as the perfect backdrop for his success story.\n\n**The Cinematic Style:**\nThe high-resolution, cinematic style of the image adds a layer of sophistication and glamour to the scene. The level of detail is stunning, with every aspect of the subject and the setting rendered in crisp, vivid clarity. The overall effect is one of luxury and high-end quality, as if the image could be a still from a Hollywood movie or a high-end commercial.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is one of power, confidence, and success. The subject, surrounded by the trappings of his achievements, exudes a sense of determination and focus, as if he\'s ready to take on the world. The dramatic lighting, cinematic style, and attention to detail all work together to create a truly unforgettable image.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 17:45:00', '2026-05-22 17:45:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-22 17:45:23', '2026-05-22 17:45:23'),
