(3393, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of ceramic, clay, plastic, or other materials. Flower pots come in various shapes, sizes, and designs, and can be used for both indoor and outdoor plants.\n\nSome common types of flower pots include:\n\n1. Terracotta pots: Made from natural clay, these pots are breathable and can help regulate soil moisture.\n2. Ceramic pots: Made from clay and other minerals, these pots are often glazed and can be decorative.\n3. Plastic pots: Lightweight and inexpensive, plastic pots are often used for seedlings and young plants.\n4. Wooden pots: Made from natural wood, these pots can add a rustic touch to gardens and indoor spaces.\n5. Self-watering pots: These pots have a built-in water reservoir that allows plants to draw water as needed.\n\nFlower pots can be used for a variety of plants, including:\n\n1. Herbs: Basil, rosemary, and thyme are popular herbs that can be grown in small pots.\n2. Succulents: These low-maintenance plants thrive in small pots with good drainage.\n3. Flowers: Petunias, geraniums, and begonias are popular flowering plants that can be grown in pots.\n4. Vegetables: Tomatoes, peppers, and cucumbers can be grown in large pots with good soil and sunlight.\n\nWhen choosing a flower pot, consider the following factors:\n\n1. Size: Choose a pot that is large enough to hold the plant\'s roots and provide adequate drainage.\n2. Material: Consider the durability and breathability of the pot material.\n3. Drainage: Make sure the pot has holes in the bottom to prevent waterlogged soil.\n4. Style: Choose a pot that fits your personal style and complements your garden or indoor decor.\n\nOverall, flower pots are a versatile and essential tool for gardening and plant care.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 18:07:00', '2026-05-22 18:07:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-05-22 18:07:18', '2026-05-22 18:07:18'),
(3394, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:26', 'It seems like you\'re asking for a list of weekdays with a greeting. Here\'s the list:\n\nGood Morning, \n1. Monday\n2. Tuesday\n3. Wednesday\n4. Thursday\n5. Friday\n\nIf you\'d like to include the weekend, I can add those as well:\n\nGood Morning, \n1. Monday\n2. Tuesday\n3. Wednesday\n4. Thursday\n5. Friday\n6. Saturday\n7. Sunday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-22 18:26:00', '2026-05-22 18:26:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Week_days_post-Good_Morning_Like_(Monday%2CTuesday%2CWednesday%2CThursday%2CFriday%2CSaturday%2CSunday).?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 34, '2026-05-22 18:26:17', '2026-05-22 18:26:17'),
