(3397, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', '**Empowering Your Business with Dragon\'s Insight**\n\nAs a business owner, staying ahead of the curve is crucial. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Stay adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot your strategy in response to changing market conditions.\n* **Invest in innovation**: Stay up-to-date with the latest trends and technologies to stay competitive.\n* **Foster a strong team**: Surround yourself with talented and motivated individuals who share your vision.\n* **Focus on customer satisfaction**: Prioritize building strong relationships with your customers to drive loyalty and growth.\n\n#BusinessGrowth #InnovationNation #TeamWorkMakesTheDreamWork #CustomerFirst #Entrepreneurship #Leadership #MarketingStrategy #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #SuccessMindset #DragonApproved', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-23 10:35:00', '2026-05-23 10:35:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-05-23 10:35:17', '2026-05-23 10:35:17'),
(3398, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord and one of the most infamous criminals of the 20th century. He was the founder and leader of the Medellín Cartel, a powerful and ruthless organization that controlled a significant portion of the global cocaine trade.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Escobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, on December 1, 1949. He grew up in a poor family and was raised by his mother, Hermilda Gaviria, after his father abandoned the family. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he quickly became involved in crime to support himself and his family.\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar began working for various Colombian crime lords, including Carlos Lehder, who would later become a key figure in the Medellín Cartel. Escobar\'s charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness quickly made him a rising star in the Colombian underworld.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nIn the late 1970s, Escobar formed the Medellín Cartel, which would become one of the most powerful and feared crime organizations in the world. The cartel\'s main business was cocaine production and trafficking, and Escobar\'s organization quickly became the dominant player in the global market.\n\nAt the height of its power, the Medellín Cartel was estimated to be worth over $30 billion, with Escobar\'s personal wealth estimated to be over $3 billion. The cartel\'s operations were characterized by extreme violence, including assassinations, bombings, and kidnappings.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by brutal violence and terror. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including police officers, judges, politicians, and rival gang members. The Medellín Cartel was also known for its use of car bombs, which were often used to target Escobar\'s enemies.\n\nIn 1989, Escobar\'s organization was responsible for the bombing of Avianca Flight 203, which killed 110 people. The bombing was intended to kill a presidential candidate, César Gaviria, who was not on the flight.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a specially built prison, known as La Catedral. However, Escobar continued to run his empire from behind bars, and he eventually escaped from prison in 1992.\n\nA massive manhunt was launched, and Escobar was finally tracked down by Colombian police on December 1, 1993. He was shot and killed in a rooftop shootout in Medellín, Colombia.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He was a ruthless and violent criminal who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people. However, he was also a charismatic and cunning leader who was able to build a massive and powerful organization.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s life has been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" Despite his notorious reputation, Escobar remains a fascinating and intriguing figure, and his story continues to captivate audiences around the world.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his love of luxury and extravagance. He owned several mansions, including a sprawling estate known as Hacienda Napoles, which featured a private zoo and a collection of exotic cars.\n* Escobar was a skilled politician and was able to build alliances with various Colombian politicians and businessmen.\n* Escobar\'s organization was responsible for the construction of several public works projects in Medellín, including roads, schools, and hospitals.\n* Escobar\'s death was a major blow to the Medellín Cartel, and the organization was eventually dismantled by Colombian authorities.\n* Escobar\'s son, Juan Pablo Escobar, has spoken publicly about his father\'s legacy and has called for an end to the violence and corruption that characterized his father\'s reign.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-23 10:45:00', '2026-05-23 10:45:30', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-23 10:45:30', '2026-05-23 10:45:30'),
(3399, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and the founder of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious organized crime groups in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals of the 20th century.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, which would later shape his worldview and inform his decision to become involved in organized crime.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar began his career in crime as a small-time smuggler and thief, but he quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, which was founded by his cousin, Gustavo Gaviria. In the 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was rapidly expanding in Colombia. He quickly established himself as a ruthless and cunning leader, using violence and intimidation to eliminate his competitors and expand his operations.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and profitable organized crime groups in the world. The cartel\'s main business was the production and distribution of cocaine, which was smuggled into the United States and other countries. Escobar\'s organization was known for its brutality and efficiency, using tactics such as murder, extortion, and bribery to maintain control and eliminate rivals.\n\n**Notorious Crimes**\n\nEscobar was responsible for numerous notorious crimes, including:\n\n1. **The assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán**: In 1989, Escobar ordered the assassination of Galán, who was a leading candidate in the Colombian presidential election.\n2. **The bombing of Avianca Flight 203**: In 1989, Escobar\'s organization planted a bomb on an Avianca airliner, which exploded mid-air, killing 110 people.\n3. **The murder of Colombian police officers**: Escobar\'s organization was responsible for the murder of hundreds of Colombian police officers, who were seen as a threat to his operations.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was sentenced to prison, but he continued to run his organization from behind bars. In 1992, he escaped from prison and went into hiding. A massive manhunt was launched, involving Colombian and American authorities. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning leader who was responsible for countless deaths and destruction. However, he is also remembered as a charismatic figure who was able to build a massive organization and accumulate vast wealth. His story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n1. **Wealth**: At the height of his power, Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion, making him one of the richest people in the world.\n2. **Hacienda Napoles**: Escobar built a massive estate, known as Hacienda Napoles, which featured a private zoo, a lake, and a collection of exotic animals.\n3. **Private army**: Escobar had a private army of loyal bodyguards and hitmen, who were responsible for carrying out his orders and protecting him from rivals.\n4. **Corruption**: Escobar was known to have bribed and corrupted numerous government officials, including politicians, police officers, and judges.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-23 10:50:00', '2026-05-23 10:50:27', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-23 10:50:27', '2026-05-23 10:50:27'),
(3400, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a notorious Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and feared criminal organizations in the world. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor household with his parents, Abel de Jesús Escobar and Hermilda Gaviria, and his siblings. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, which would later shape his worldview and inform his actions.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s involvement in organized crime began in the 1970s, when he started smuggling marijuana and cocaine into the United States. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, which was founded by Carlos Lehder and later led by Escobar. The cartel\'s success was fueled by Escobar\'s innovative strategies, including the use of small planes to transport cocaine and the establishment of a network of distributors and smugglers.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. The cartel\'s operations were characterized by violence, intimidation, and corruption. Escobar and his associates used bribery, extortion, and murder to maintain control over the cocaine trade and eliminate rivals.\n\n**Personal Life**\n\nEscobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a collection of luxury cars, private planes, and a sprawling estate called Hacienda Napoles. He was also known for his love of family and his devotion to his wife, María Victoria Henao, and their children. Despite his notorious reputation, Escobar was a charismatic figure who was admired by some in Colombia for his generosity and philanthropy.\n\n**Downfall and Death**\n\nEscobar\'s reign as the leader of the Medellín cartel came to an end in 1993, when he was killed in a shootout with Colombian police. The police had been tracking Escobar for months, and on December 1, 1993, they finally cornered him in a middle-class neighborhood in Medellín. Escobar was shot and killed, and his body was later identified by his family.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including law enforcement officials, rival gang members, and innocent civilians. At the same time, he is also remembered as a charismatic figure who was able to build a vast and powerful organization through his intelligence, strategic thinking, and leadership abilities.\n\n**Popular Culture**\n\nEscobar\'s life and career have been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the Netflix series \"Narcos,\" which chronicles the rise and fall of the Medellín cartel. His story has also inspired countless documentaries, podcasts, and articles, cementing his place in popular culture as one of the most infamous figures of the 20th century.\n\n**Impact on Colombia**\n\nEscobar\'s activities had a profound impact on Colombia, contributing to a period of violence and instability that lasted for decades. The Medellín cartel\'s operations fueled a wave of violence and corruption that affected every level of Colombian society, from the streets of Medellín to the highest echelons of government. The cartel\'s legacy continues to be felt in Colombia today, with many communities still struggling to recover from the devastating effects of the cocaine trade.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and career are a testament to the power and complexity of the human spirit. His story is a cautionary tale about the dangers of ambition, greed, and violence, and a reminder of the devastating consequences of the cocaine trade.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-23 10:53:00', '2026-05-23 10:53:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-23 10:53:22', '2026-05-23 10:53:22'),
(3401, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing Our Inner Strength: Lessons from the Dragon**\n\nAs we navigate the complexities of our personal and professional lives, it\'s essential to draw inspiration from mythical creatures like the dragon. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Resilience**: Just like the dragon\'s ability to withstand challenges, we too can develop the strength to overcome obstacles and emerge stronger.\n* **Courage**: The dragon\'s fearless nature reminds us to be bold and take calculated risks to achieve our goals.\n* **Loyalty**: The dragon\'s commitment to its territory and loved ones teaches us the importance of dedication and loyalty in our relationships and pursuits.\n* **Growth**: The dragon\'s ability to adapt and evolve in different environments inspires us to be open to new experiences and continuous learning.\n\nLet\'s embody the qualities of the dragon and unleash our inner strength! #DragonInspiration #InnerStrength #Resilience #Courage #Loyalty #Growth #Motivation #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #MythicalCreatures #LessonsFromNature #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #InspirationForAll', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-23 11:18:00', '2026-05-23 11:18:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-05-23 11:18:21', '2026-05-23 11:18:21'),
(3402, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Party Wear for Men: A Guide to Styling and Fashion**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, there are numerous options to choose from, depending on the occasion, theme, and personal style. Here are some popular and stylish party wear options for men:\n\n### Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-tailored suit is a classic choice for formal parties. Pair it with a dress shirt, tie, and dress shoes for a sophisticated look.\n2. **Tuxedos**: For black-tie events, a tuxedo is a must-have. Choose a classic black tuxedo with a white shirt, black bow tie, and black patent leather shoes.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt with a slim fit and a subtle pattern can add a touch of elegance to any formal outfit.\n\n### Semi-Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can instantly elevate a casual outfit. Pair it with a dress shirt, dark jeans, and dress shoes for a stylish look.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dress pants in neutral colors like black, navy, or gray can be paired with a variety of tops, from dress shirts to sweaters.\n3. **Polos**: A polo shirt is a versatile option that can be dressed up or down. Choose a slim-fit polo with a subtle pattern for a stylish look.\n\n### Casual Party Wear\n\n1. **T-Shirts**: A graphic t-shirt or a plain white t-shirt can be a great option for casual parties. Pair it with jeans or shorts and sneakers for a relaxed look.\n2. **Jeans**: Dark wash jeans are a versatile option that can be dressed up or down. Pair them with a dress shirt, blazer, or a simple t-shirt.\n3. **Sneakers**: Sneakers are a great option for casual parties. Choose a pair that complements your outfit, such as white sneakers with a black t-shirt and jeans.\n\n### Accessories\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch can add a touch of sophistication to any outfit. Choose a leather strap or a metal band that complements your outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of elegance to a dress shirt. Choose a pair that complements your shirt and tie.\n3. **Belt**: A belt can help define your waist and add a touch of style to your outfit. Choose a leather belt that complements your shoes and pants.\n\n### Grooming Tips\n\n1. **Hair**: Style your hair with a bit of texture and volume for a stylish look.\n2. **Beard**: Trim your beard to define your jawline and add a touch of sophistication to your look.\n3. **Fragrance**: Choose a fragrance that complements your outfit and personality.\n\nBy following these tips, you\'ll be well on your way to creating a stylish and memorable party wear outfit that\'s sure to turn heads. Remember to have fun and experiment with different styles and combinations to find what works best for you!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-23 12:40:00', '2026-05-23 12:40:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-05-23 12:40:19', '2026-05-23 12:40:19'),
(3403, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key characteristics of a formal shirt for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic dress shirt with a collar and cuffs, typically made of cotton or a cotton-blend fabric.\n2. **Button-Down Shirt:** A dress shirt with a button-down collar, which is a collar that is fastened to the shirt with buttons.\n3. **Wing-Tip Shirt:** A dress shirt with a wing-tip collar, which is a collar that is pointed and has a small wing-shaped piece of fabric at the tip.\n\n**Features of a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Collar Style:** Formal shirts typically have a pointed collar or a spread collar.\n2. **Cuff Style:** Formal shirts typically have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric:** Formal shirts are typically made of high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit:** Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the torso and sleeves.\n5. **Buttons:** Formal shirts typically have buttons made of mother-of-pearl, plastic, or metal.\n\n**Occasions to Wear a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Business Meetings:** A formal shirt is a staple for business meetings and presentations.\n2. **Weddings:** A formal shirt is a common choice for wedding attire, especially for the groom and groomsmen.\n3. **Formal Events:** A formal shirt is suitable for formal events such as black-tie events, galas, and award shows.\n4. **Job Interviews:** A formal shirt is a good choice for job interviews, as it presents a professional and polished image.\n\n**Tips for Wearing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Choose a fitted shirt:** Make sure the shirt fits closely to the body, with a slim fit through the torso and sleeves.\n2. **Pay attention to collar style:** Choose a collar style that complements your face shape and personal style.\n3. **Accessorize with a tie:** A tie can add a pop of color and personality to a formal shirt.\n4. **Consider the occasion:** Choose a formal shirt that is suitable for the occasion, taking into account the dress code and level of formality.\n\n**Popular Brands for Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink:** Known for their high-quality dress shirts with a classic fit.\n2. **Charvet:** A French brand that offers luxurious dress shirts with a focus on quality and craftsmanship.\n3. **Brooks Brothers:** An American brand that offers classic dress shirts with a focus on quality and tradition.\n4. **Ted Baker:** A British brand that offers stylish and affordable dress shirts with a focus on fashion and quality.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-23 12:56:00', '2026-05-23 12:56:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-05-23 12:56:23', '2026-05-23 12:56:23'),
