(3420, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby. He first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense\" #39 in March 1963.\n\nIron Man\'s secret identity is Tony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist who created a powered exoskeleton suit to save his life after being kidnapped and injured. The suit, which has undergone numerous upgrades over the years, provides Tony with superhuman strength, flight, and a range of advanced technologies, including repulsor technology, AI, and advanced sensors.\n\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, has become one of the most iconic and beloved superheroes in the Marvel Universe, known for his intelligence, wit, and bravery. He is a founding member of the Avengers and has played a key role in many Marvel storylines, including the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) movies.\n\nSome of the key characteristics and traits of Iron Man include:\n\n* Genius-level intellect: Tony Stark is a brilliant inventor and engineer, able to create advanced technologies and solve complex problems.\n* Powered exoskeleton suit: The Iron Man suit provides Tony with superhuman strength, flight, and a range of advanced technologies.\n* Billionaire philanthropist: Tony Stark is a wealthy and influential businessman, using his resources to fund his superhero activities and support various charitable causes.\n* Ego and confidence: Tony Stark is known for his confident and sometimes arrogant personality, which can be both an asset and a liability.\n\nThe Iron Man character has been portrayed by Robert Downey Jr. in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) movies, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* The Incredible Hulk (2008) - cameo appearance\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) - cameo appearance\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\nThe MCU movies have helped to cement Iron Man\'s status as a cultural icon, and the character continues to be a central figure in the Marvel Universe.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-23 17:30:00', '2026-05-23 17:30:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-23 17:30:24', '2026-05-23 17:30:24'),
(3421, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, determination, and success. Here\'s a breakdown of the elements that make this scene so compelling:\n\n**The Businessman:** The fact that the subject is a professional businessman wearing a suit immediately conveys a sense of authority, sophistication, and success. The suit is a symbol of professionalism and power, and it\'s interesting to see it juxtaposed with the athletic environment of a basketball court.\n\n**The Basketball Court:** The basketball court provides a unique and dynamic backdrop for the scene. The court\'s lines, hoops, and surrounding stadium seating create a sense of energy and excitement, which contrasts with the more formal, corporate atmosphere typically associated with a businessman.\n\n**The Ball in Hand:** The basketball in the subject\'s hand serves as a symbol of control, focus, and determination. It implies that the businessman is not just a spectator, but an active participant, ready to take on challenges and make his move.\n\n**Stadium Lights:** The dramatic lighting provided by the stadium lights adds a sense of drama and intensity to the scene. The lights create deep shadows and highlights, which accentuate the subject\'s features and create a sense of depth and dimensionality.\n\n**Dramatic Lighting:** The overall lighting scheme is cinematic and high-contrast, with strong shadows and highlights. This type of lighting is often used in film and photography to create a sense of drama, tension, and emotional depth. It adds a layer of sophistication and glamour to the image, making it feel more like a movie still than a straightforward portrait.\n\n**Success Mindset:** The overall attitude and demeanor of the subject convey a strong sense of confidence and success. The businessman\'s posture, facial expression, and body language all suggest that he is a high-achiever, someone who is used to succeeding and overcoming obstacles.\n\n**High-Resolution Cinematic Style:** The image is described as being in a high-resolution cinematic style, which implies a level of technical quality and attention to detail. The use of high-end camera equipment and post-production techniques would result in a highly detailed, crisp, and polished image that draws the viewer in and refuses to let go.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful and compelling one, conveying a sense of confidence, determination, and success. It\'s an image that would be perfect for a business or athletic context, where the subject\'s competitive spirit and winning mindset are on full display.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-23 17:45:00', '2026-05-23 17:45:31', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-23 17:45:31', '2026-05-23 17:45:31'),
(3422, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, capturing the essence of success, confidence, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a crisp, tailored suit, stands tall and confident on the basketball court. His attire is immaculate, with a fitted jacket, a crisp white shirt, and a tie that adds a pop of color to the overall ensemble. The suit is a symbol of his professional success, and the fact that he\'s wearing it on a basketball court suggests that he\'s a man who can thrive in multiple environments.\n\n**Setting:**\nThe basketball court is dimly lit, with the only light coming from the stadium lights behind the subject. This creates a dramatic, high-contrast effect, with the subject\'s face and body illuminated against a dark, shadowy background. The court itself is empty, with no other players or spectators in sight, which adds to the sense of solitude and focus.\n\n**Lighting:**\nThe stadium lights cast a warm, golden glow on the subject, accentuating his features and creating deep shadows on his face. The light is soft and diffused, with a slight gradient effect that adds depth and dimension to the image. The overall effect is cinematic, with a sense of drama and tension that draws the viewer\'s eye to the subject.\n\n**Composition:**\nThe subject is positioned in the center of the frame, with the basketball court stretching out behind him. The camera is placed at a slight angle, looking up at the subject, which creates a sense of power and authority. The subject\'s body language is confident and relaxed, with his weight shifted onto one leg and the ball held casually in his hand.\n\n**Mood and Atmosphere:**\nThe overall mood of the image is one of success and determination. The subject exudes confidence and self-assurance, as if he\'s about to take on the world. The dramatic lighting and empty court create a sense of