(3429, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about passion, perseverance, and success. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set your goals ablaze**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and chase your aspirations with fierce determination.\n* **Protect your treasure**: Prioritize your values and guard them closely, just as I protect my hoard.\n* **Soar to new heights**: Don\'t be limited by your current circumstances - spread your wings and reach for the sky.\n* **Breathe fire into your passions**: Pursue your interests with passion and energy, and don\'t let anyone dull your spark.\n* **Rise from the ashes**: When faced with setbacks, use them as an opportunity to learn and grow, just as I emerge stronger from the flames.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #FireYourPassion #SuccessTips #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #BusinessLessons #PersonalGrowth #DragonWisdom #InspirationalQuotes #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 10:35:00', '2026-05-24 10:35:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-05-24 10:35:23', '2026-05-24 10:35:23'),
(3430, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, crime boss, and founder of the Medellín Cartel. He is widely regarded as one of the most notorious and successful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to a middle-class family. His father was a farmer, and his mother was a schoolteacher. Escobar grew up in a poor neighborhood in Medellín, where he became involved in street crime and smuggling at a young age.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar began working for a local smuggler, Alfredo Gómez, who introduced him to the cocaine trade. Escobar quickly rose through the ranks, becoming a key player in the Medellín Cartel. He formed alliances with other smugglers and established a network of distributors in the United States, Mexico, and other countries.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín Cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. The cartel controlled a significant portion of the global cocaine market, and Escobar\'s wealth and influence grew exponentially. He was known for his ruthlessness, cunning, and ability to corrupt or intimidate law enforcement officials.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by violence and terror. He ordered the murders of thousands of people, including politicians, judges, police officers, and rival gang members. The Medellín Cartel was responsible for bombings, kidnappings, and assassinations, and Escobar became notorious for his ability to evade capture and manipulate the justice system.\n\n**Pursuit and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations to capture Escobar. He was finally tracked down and killed on December 1, 1993, in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. Escobar was 44 years old at the time of his death.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning crime lord, but also as a charismatic and calculating leader who was able to build a vast and powerful organization. His story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power.\n* He was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a massive estate called Hacienda Napoles.\n* Escobar was a skilled politician and strategist, and he was able to manipulate the Colombian government and justice system to his advantage.\n* He was a devoted family man and was known to be fiercely loyal to his loved ones.\n* Escobar\'s death was a significant blow to the Medellín Cartel, and the organization was eventually dismantled by law enforcement.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and legacy are a fascinating and complex topic, and his story continues to captivate people around the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 10:45:00', '2026-05-24 10:45:26', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-24 10:45:26', '2026-05-24 10:45:26'),
(3431, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and the leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious organized crime groups in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most successful and ruthless drug traffickers of all time.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to a middle-class family. His father was a farmer, and his mother was a schoolteacher. Escobar grew up in a modest home with his parents and two siblings. He dropped out of school in the seventh grade and began working as a car thief and a smuggler.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar began working for the Medellín cartel, which was founded by Carlos Lehder. He quickly rose through the ranks and became a key player in the organization. Escobar\'s charisma, intelligence, and ruthlessness made him a natural leader, and he eventually took over the cartel.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organized crime groups in the world. The cartel controlled a vast network of cocaine production and distribution, with tentacles in Colombia, the United States, and other countries. Escobar\'s organization was responsible for smuggling an estimated 80% of the cocaine entering the United States.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by extreme violence and terror. He ordered the killings of thousands of people, including politicians, police officers, judges, and rival gang members. His organization was responsible for bombings, kidnappings, and assassinations. Escobar\'s most notorious act was the bombing of Avianca Flight 203, which killed 110 people.\n\n**Personal Life**\n\nDespite his brutal reputation, Escobar was known to be a devoted family man. He was married to María Victoria Henao, and they had two children together. Escobar was also a generous philanthropist, donating to charities and building infrastructure in his hometown of Medellín.\n\n**Downfall and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a special facility, known as La Catedral, which he had built himself. However, he escaped from prison in 1992 and went into hiding. A massive manhunt ensued, and on December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. He was 44 years old at the time of his death.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning crime lord, but also as a charismatic leader who brought economic prosperity to his community. His life has been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" Despite his notorious reputation, Escobar remains a fascinating figure, and his story continues to captivate audiences around the world.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power.\n* He was known to have a collection of exotic animals, including hippos, elephants, and lions, which he kept on his estate, Hacienda Napoles.\n* Escobar was a skilled soccer player and was known to have played in local tournaments.\n* He was a fan of the Colombian soccer team and was known to have bribed referees and players to influence the outcome of matches.\n* Escobar\'s death was mourned by many in Medellín, who saw him as a folk hero and a symbol of resistance against the Colombian government.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 10:50:00', '2026-05-24 10:50:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-24 10:50:21', '2026-05-24 10:50:21'),
(3432, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, crime boss, and founder of the Medellín Cartel. He is widely considered one of the most notorious and successful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nEscobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, to a poor farming family. He grew up in a humble environment and dropped out of school in the seventh grade. Escobar\'s early life was marked by petty crime, and he eventually became involved in the cocaine trade in the 1970s.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power began in the late 1970s, when he started working for the Medellín Cartel, a powerful cocaine trafficking organization. He quickly became a key player in the cartel, earning the respect and admiration of his peers. In 1979, Escobar was arrested for cocaine trafficking, but he managed to bribe his way out of prison and continued to build his empire.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín Cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organizations in the world. The cartel controlled a significant portion of the global cocaine trade, and Escobar\'s wealth and influence grew exponentially. He became known as \"El Patrón\" (The Boss) and was feared by his enemies and admired by his followers.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by violence and terror. He ordered the murders of thousands of people, including rival cartel members, police officers, judges, and politicians. He also orchestrated bombings, kidnappings, and other acts of terrorism. Escobar\'s most notorious act was the assassination of Colombian presidential candidate Luis Carlos Galán in 1989.\n\n**Downfall and Death**\n\nIn the early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a campaign to capture Escobar. In 1991, Escobar surrendered to the authorities and was imprisoned, but he escaped in 1992. A massive manhunt ensued, and on December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning crime lord who brought terror and violence to Colombia and the world. However, he is also remembered as a charismatic and cunning businessman who built a massive empire and became one of the wealthiest men in the world. Escobar\'s story has been immortalized in numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power.\n* He owned a private zoo, a collection of exotic cars, and a massive estate called Hacienda Napoles.\n* Escobar was known for his generosity and philanthropy, and he built roads, schools, and hospitals in his hometown of Medellín.\n* He was a fan of soccer and owned a soccer team called Atlético Nacional.\n* Escobar\'s death was met with widespread celebration in Colombia, and his grave has become a tourist attraction.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 10:53:00', '2026-05-24 10:53:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-24 10:53:23', '2026-05-24 10:53:23'),
(3433, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**\"Breathing Fire into Your Day: Lessons from a Dragon\"**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success, perseverance, and passion. Here are some key takeaways to help you conquer your own challenges:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s soaring to new heights or hoarding a treasure trove of knowledge, set your sights on what you want to achieve.\n* **Stay fierce and focused**: Life can be unpredictable, but with determination and grit, you can overcome any obstacle. Keep your eyes on the prize and never give up.\n* **Protect your treasure**: Whether it\'s your time, energy, or resources, be mindful of how you allocate them. Prioritize what\'s truly important and guard it with your life.\n* **Roar with confidence**: Believe in yourself and your abilities. Your unique voice and perspective are what set you apart, so don\'t be afraid to let them shine.\n\n#DragonSlayingTips #MotivationMonday #SuccessStrategies #GoalSetting #Focus #ProductivityHacks #ConfidenceIsKey #TrendingNow #Inspiration #ProfessionalDevelopment #PersonalGrowth #FacebookMotivation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 11:18:00', '2026-05-24 11:18:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-05-24 11:18:17', '2026-05-24 11:18:17'),
(3434, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Party Wear for Men: A Guide to Dressing Up**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, there are many styles and options to choose from. Here are some popular and stylish ideas:\n\n### Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit is a classic choice for formal parties. Choose from a variety of colors, including black, navy, gray, and beige.\n2. **Dress Shirts**: Pair your suit with a dress shirt in a complementary color. White, light blue, and pastel shades are popular choices.\n3. **Ties and Bow Ties**: Add a touch of elegance with a tie or bow tie. Patterned and textured ties can add visual interest to your outfit.\n4. **Dress Shoes**: Black or brown dress shoes are essential for formal parties. Make sure they are polished and in good condition.\n\n### Semi-Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to a casual outfit. Pair it with a dress shirt and jeans or trousers.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dress pants in neutral colors like black, gray, or beige can be dressed up or down.\n3. **Button-Down Shirts**: A button-down shirt in a bold color or pattern can add a pop of personality to your outfit.\n4. **Loafers or Boots**: Loafers or boots can add a stylish touch to a semi-formal outfit.\n\n### Casual Party Wear\n\n1. **T-Shirts and Jeans**: A classic combination that\'s perfect for casual parties. Choose a bold or graphic T-shirt to make a statement.\n2. **Hoodies and Sweatpants**: For a more relaxed party, consider a hoodie and sweatpants. Add a pair of sneakers to complete the look.\n3. **Flannel Shirts**: A flannel shirt can add a touch of warmth and style to a casual outfit.\n4. **Sneakers**: Sneakers are a great choice for casual parties. Choose from a variety of colors and styles to match your outfit.\n\n### Accessories\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch can add a touch of sophistication to your outfit. Choose from a variety of styles, including leather, metal, or digital.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks can add a touch of elegance to a formal outfit.\n3. **Hats and Caps**: A hat or cap can add a stylish touch to a casual outfit.\n4. **Pocket Squares**: A pocket square can add a pop of color and personality to a formal outfit.\n\n### Tips and Tricks\n\n1. **Dress for the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the party\'s theme and dress code.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Ensure that your clothes fit well and are comfortable.\n3. **Accessories matter**: Add a few accessories to complete your outfit and add a touch of personality.\n4. **Confidence is key**: Own your look and have fun!\n\nBy following these guidelines, you\'ll be sure to make a stylish impression at your next party. Remember to have fun and express yourself through your clothing choices!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 12:40:00', '2026-05-24 12:40:28', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-05-24 12:40:28', '2026-05-24 12:40:28'),
(3435, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn for formal occasions, such as business meetings, weddings, and other special events. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts typically have a point collar, a spread collar, or a wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are usually made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the chest and waist.\n5. **Buttons**: Formal shirts often have mother-of-pearl or plastic buttons.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic fit**: A traditional formal shirt with a relaxed fit through the chest and waist.\n2. **Slim fit**: A modern formal shirt with a slim fit through the chest and waist.\n3. **Tailored fit**: A formal shirt with a tailored fit, designed to fit closely to the body.\n4. **Dress shirt**: A formal shirt with a point collar and French cuffs, designed to be worn with a suit and tie.\n5. **Business shirt**: A formal shirt with a spread collar and button cuffs, designed to be worn for business meetings and other professional occasions.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White**: A classic choice for formal shirts, white is a versatile color that can be worn with any suit and tie.\n2. **Light blue**: A popular choice for formal shirts, light blue is a calming color that can add a touch of elegance to any outfit.\n3. **Pastel colors**: Soft pastel colors such as pink, lavender, and mint green can add a touch of personality to a formal shirt.\n4. **Stripes**: Thin stripes or subtle patterns can add visual interest to a formal shirt.\n5. **Checks**: Small checks or subtle patterns can add a touch of texture to a formal shirt.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: A luxury brand known for its high-quality formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French brand that offers a range of formal shirts with a focus on quality and craftsmanship.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: An American brand that offers a range of formal shirts with a classic, traditional style.\n4. **Hugo Boss**: A German brand that offers a range of formal shirts with a modern, sleek style.\n5. **Armani**: An Italian brand that offers a range of formal shirts with a focus on luxury and sophistication.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Choose a shirt that fits well**: A well-fitting shirt is essential for a formal occasion.\n2. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a shirt that is suitable for the occasion, such as a white shirt for a wedding or a light blue shirt for a business meeting.\n3. **Pay attention to details**: Make sure the shirt has a high-quality collar, cuffs, and buttons.\n4. **Iron the shirt**: Make sure the shirt is ironed and crisp before wearing it.\n5. **Pair with a suit and tie**: A formal shirt is best paired with a suit and tie for a complete, polished look.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 12:56:00', '2026-05-24 12:56:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-05-24 12:56:22', '2026-05-24 12:56:22'),
(3436, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned valuable lessons that can be applied to our personal and professional lives. Here are a few key takeaways:\n\n* **Resilience is key**: Just like how I rise from the ashes, we too can overcome obstacles and emerge stronger.\n* **Passion drives success**: My fiery passion for what I do is what sets me apart, and it\'s essential to find what drives you to achieve your goals.\n* **Community is everything**: As a dragon, I\'ve learned to appreciate the value of building strong relationships and nurturing a supportive community.\n* **Innovation is crucial**: With the ever-changing world, it\'s essential to stay adaptable and innovative to stay ahead of the curve.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #ResilienceMatters #PassionDriven #CommunityFirst #InnovationNation #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #BusinessLessons #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 13:03:00', '2026-05-24 13:03:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-05-24 13:03:17', '2026-05-24 13:03:17'),
