(3450, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **Objective**: The main objective of football is to score more goals than the opposing team within the 90-minute game duration.\n2. **Players**: Each team consists of 11 players, including a goalkeeper and 10 outfield players.\n3. **Equipment**: The game is played with a round ball, and players can use any part of their body except their hands and arms to control and move the ball.\n4. **Scoring**: A goal is scored when the ball passes completely over the goal line between the goal posts and under the crossbar.\n5. **Game duration**: A standard football match consists of two 45-minute halves, with a 15-minute halftime break in between.\n\nSome popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most prestigious international football tournament, held every four years.\n2. **UEFA Champions League**: A yearly club competition featuring top teams from Europe.\n3. **English Premier League**: A professional league in England, considered one of the most competitive and popular leagues in the world.\n4. **La Liga**: A professional league in Spain, featuring top teams like Barcelona and Real Madrid.\n5. **Copa America**: A South American international football tournament, held every two years.\n\nFootball has a massive global following, with millions of fans attending matches, watching on TV, and playing the game at various levels, from amateur to professional.\n\nAre you a football fan? Do you have a favorite team or player?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 16:33:00', '2026-05-24 16:33:25', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-24 16:33:25', '2026-05-24 16:33:25'),
(3451, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike is likely referring to the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sport motorcycle produced by Yamaha. \n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha YZF-R1:\n\n1. **Engine**: 998cc, liquid-cooled, 16-valve, DOHC, inline-four engine producing around 200 horsepower.\n2. **Transmission**: 6-speed manual transmission with a multi-plate slipper clutch.\n3. **Chassis**: Aluminum Deltabox frame with a swingarm and a rear shock absorber.\n4. **Brakes**: Dual 320mm front discs with 4-piston calipers and a 220mm rear disc with a single-piston caliper.\n5. **Suspension**: 43mm inverted front forks and a rear shock absorber with adjustable preload, compression, and rebound damping.\n6. **Electronics**: Advanced electronics package including traction control, slide control, lift control, and a quickshifter.\n7. **Weight**: Around 443 pounds (201 kg) wet weight.\n8. **Seat Height**: 32.7 inches (830 mm).\n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is known for its exceptional performance, handling, and braking capabilities, making it a popular choice among sport bike enthusiasts and track riders.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 16:42:00', '2026-05-24 16:42:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-24 16:42:23', '2026-05-24 16:42:23'),
(3452, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character was created by writer and editor Stan Lee, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is kidnapped by a terrorist group while demonstrating his company\'s new missile technology. To escape, Stark builds a powered exoskeleton suit, which becomes the first Iron Man armor. After his escape, Stark perfects the suit and uses it to fight crime and injustice as the superhero Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit provides him with a range of powers, including:\n\n* Superhuman strength and durability\n* Flight capability\n* Energy projection (repulsor rays)\n* Enhanced intelligence and strategic thinking\n* Advanced sensors and scanning technology\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a confident, charismatic, and sometimes arrogant character. He is a self-proclaimed genius and billionaire playboy, but also has a strong sense of responsibility and a desire to use his wealth and technology to make the world a better place.\n\n**Comic Book Series:**\nIron Man has appeared in numerous comic book series over the years, including:\n\n* Tales of Suspense (1963-1968)\n* Iron Man (1968-1996)\n* Iron Man (1998-2004)\n* The Invincible Iron Man (2005-2012)\n* Iron Man (2012-2014)\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nIron Man has been featured in several movies, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\nRobert Downey Jr. played the role of Tony Stark/Iron Man in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) movies.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man is one of the most iconic and influential superheroes in the Marvel Universe. He has inspired countless fans around the world and has become a cultural phenomenon. The character\'s legacy extends beyond the comic book pages and movies, with Iron Man-themed merchandise, video games, and theme park attractions.\n\nWhat would you like to know about Iron Man?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 17:30:00', '2026-05-24 17:30:29', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-24 17:30:29', '2026-05-24 17:30:29'),
(3453, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image is one of stark contrast, blending the worlds of corporate finance and athletic competition. The businessman, clad in a tailored suit, exudes an air of confidence as he stands on the basketball court, the ball grasped firmly in his hand. The stadium lights behind him cast a dramatic glow, illuminating the scene with an intensity that matches the subject\'s unyielding determination.\n\nThe high-resolution, cinematic quality of the image renders every detail with crystal clarity, from the subtle creases on the businessman\'s face to the intricate stitching on the basketball. The lighting is carefully crafted to create a sense of depth and dimensionality, with the subject positioned at the forefront of the composition.\n\nThe overall effect is one of dynamic tension, as if the businessman is poised on the cusp of a major breakthrough. His stance is assertive, his eyes fixed intently on some point in the distance, his mind focused on the challenges ahead. The basketball, often a symbol of competition and teamwork, serves as a potent metaphor for the cutthroat world of business, where only the strongest and most determined individuals succeed.\n\nThe use of a basketball court as the backdrop adds a layer of complexity to the image, inviting the viewer to ponder the parallels between the worlds of sports and finance. Just as a successful athlete must possess a combination of skill, strategy, and mental toughness, a thriving businessman must navigate the complexities of the market with a similar blend of cunning, adaptability, and resilience.\n\nAs the businessman stands tall, the stadium lights casting an aura of glory around him, the image conveys a sense of triumph and achievement. This is a person who has mastered the art of success, who has transcended the boundaries of his profession to become a true champion. The dramatic lighting and cinematic style serve to amplify this impression, imbuing the scene with a sense of drama and spectacle that is nothing short of captivating.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 17:45:00', '2026-05-24 17:45:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-24 17:45:24', '2026-05-24 17:45:24'),
(3454, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, capturing the essence of confidence, success, and the blending of two seemingly disparate worlds: the boardroom and the basketball court. Let\'s break down the elements that make this scene so compelling:\n\n1. **Professional Businessman in a Suit**: The businessman, dressed in a crisp, tailored suit, exudes an air of professionalism and success. The suit is a symbol of his achievements in the business world, representing power, sophistication, and a high level of expertise in his field.\n\n2. **Standing Confidently on a Basketball Court**: By placing this figure on a basketball court, there\'s an immediate contrast and intrigue. The basketball court is a realm of physical prowess, teamwork, and strategy—a far cry from the corporate offices and meeting rooms where suits are more commonly found. This juxtaposition suggests that the individual is not confined to traditional roles or environments. He is adaptable, confident in his abilities, and unafraid to step out of his comfort zone.\n\n3. **Ball in Hand**: The basketball in his hand serves as a symbol of control and readiness. It implies that he is not just a spectator but an active participant, prepared to engage with the challenges and opportunities that the basketball court represents. This could metaphorically represent his approach to business and life, always being prepared to take action and lead.\n\n4. **Stadium Lights Behind Him**: The dramatic lighting provided by the stadium lights creates a heroic backdrop, elevating the figure to a stature of importance and glory. It\'s reminiscent of moments of triumph in sports, where athletes are celebrated under similar lighting conditions. This lighting choice adds to the overall sense of achievement and drama, suggesting that the businessman is basking in the glow of success.\n\n5. **Dramatic Lighting**: The use of dramatic lighting enhances the cinematic quality of the image, adding depth, shadows, and highlights that draw the viewer\'s eye to the subject. It creates a sense of drama and emphasizes the emotional impact of the scene, making it more engaging and memorable.\n\n6. **Success Mindset**: The overall composition of the image embodies a success mindset—confidence, adaptability, readiness, and a blend of physical and mental prowess. It suggests that success is not limited to one domain but can be achieved across various aspects of life, provided one approaches challenges with the right mindset and skills.\n\n7. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: Capturing this image in high resolution with a cinematic style elevates it to a level of premium quality, akin to what one might see in a movie or high-end advertising. This style choice adds a layer of sophistication and importance to the image, making it stand out and commanding the viewer\'s attention.\n\nIn summary, the image of a businessman standing confidently on a basketball court, with all the described elements, is a potent symbol of modern success. It blends traditional markers of professional achievement with the dynamism and competitive spirit of sports, set against a backdrop that is both dramatic and inspiring. This visual narrative encourages the viewer to think about success in a holistic way, embracing challenges, being adaptable, and always ready to perform at a high level.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 17:46:00', '2026-05-24 17:46:33', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-24 17:46:33', '2026-05-24 17:46:33'),
(3455, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:47', 'The image you\'ve described evokes a powerful and dynamic scene, blending the worlds of business and sports to convey a message of success, confidence, and achievement. Here\'s a detailed breakdown of how this scene might be visually represented in a high-resolution, cinematic style:\n\n### Setting: The Basketball Court\n- **Background:** The basketball court stretches out, its polished surface reflecting the dramatic lighting of the stadium. The lines and markings of the court are crisp and vibrant, contrasting with the darker, out-of-focus seating areas of the stadium.\n- **Stadium Lights:** The overhead lights cast a strong, dramatic glow over the scene, highlighting the figure of the businessman and the basketball in his hand. The lights are slightly softened to avoid harsh shadows, ensuring the image remains cinematic and inviting.\n- **Atmosphere:** The atmosphere is charged with anticipation, as if the court is ready for a pivotal moment in a game. However, the focus is solely on the businessman, emphasizing his solitary figure against the backdrop of the empty court.\n\n### The Businessman\n- **Attire:** He wears a tailored suit that exudes professionalism and success. The suit is perfectly fitted, accentuating his confident posture. A crisp, white shirt and a tie that complements the suit\'s color add to his polished appearance.\n- **Expression:** His facial expression is one of determination and confidence. His eyes are focused, looking directly at the camera or perhaps slightly above it, conveying a sense of vision and ambition.\n- **Pose:** Standing with his feet shoulder-width apart, he embodies stability and strength. One hand grips the basketball firmly, a symbol of control and mastery over his domain. The other hand might be in his pocket or resting on his hip, completing a pose that is both relaxed and assertive.\n- **Lighting on the Businessman:** The dramatic lighting highlights his features, creating a slight glow around him. This separates him from the background, emphasizing his central role in the scene. The lighting also accentuates the textures of his suit and the basketball, adding depth to the image.\n\n### Symbolism and Message\n- **The Basketball:** The basketball in his hand serves as a metaphor for the challenges and opportunities in business. Holding it signifies his readiness to take on these challenges, to lead, and to score—whether that means closing deals, leading his company to success, or achieving personal goals.\n- **Success Mindset:** The overall composition and the businessman\'s demeanor convey a success mindset. He is prepared, confident, and focused, embodying the qualities necessary for achieving success in both the business world and personal life.\n\n### Cinematic Style\n- **High-Resolution:** The image is captured in high resolution, allowing for intricate details to be visible. From the weave of the suit to the texture of the basketball, every element is sharply defined.\n- **Dramatic Lighting:** The use of dramatic lighting adds a cinematic quality, elevating the scene from a simple portrait to a narrative moment. It suggests a story, a turning point, or a moment of triumph.\n- **Color Palette:** The color palette is likely muted, with the suit, court, and background providing a monochromatic base. The basketball might introduce a pop of color, drawing the viewer\'s eye to the central symbol of the scene.\n\nThis scene is not just a portrait of a businessman; it\'s a statement about ambition, leadership, and the pursuit of success. It invites the viewer to consider the intersection of different fields and the qualities that lead to achievement in any endeavor.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 17:47:00', '2026-05-24 17:47:26', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-24 17:47:26', '2026-05-24 17:47:26'),
(3456, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:49', 'Wooden crafts are a popular and creative way to work with wood, resulting in beautiful and functional pieces. Here are some ideas and techniques to get you started:\n\n**Types of Wooden Crafts:**\n\n1. **Wood Carving**: Carving wooden figures, ornaments, or decorative items using hand tools or power tools.\n2. **Woodworking**: Creating furniture, cabinets, or other wooden items using various techniques like joinery, sanding, and finishing.\n3. **Wood Burning**: Using a pyrography pen to burn designs or patterns onto wooden surfaces.\n4. **Wood Turning**: Creating symmetrical objects like bowls, cups, or vases using a lathe.\n5. **Intarsia**: Creating intricate designs by combining small pieces of wood to form a larger image or pattern.\n\n**Wooden Craft Ideas:**\n\n1. **Coat Racks**: Create a functional coat rack with hooks and a shelf.\n2. **Picture Frames**: Design and build custom picture frames using different types of wood.\n3. **Wooden Signs**: Create personalized signs with names, quotes, or messages.\n4. **Birdhouses**: Build a birdhouse or bird feeder using wood and hang it in your backyard.\n5. **Custom Furniture**: Create custom furniture pieces like tables, chairs, or shelves.\n\n**Basic Tools and Materials:**\n\n1. **Hand Tools**: Chisels, gouges, mallets, and hand saws.\n2. **Power Tools**: Table saws, drill presses, sanders, and lathes.\n3. **Wood**: Various types of wood like oak, pine, maple, or cherry.\n4. **Adhesives**: Glue, nails, or screws to assemble and join wood pieces.\n5. **Finishing Materials**: Stains, varnishes, or polyurethane to protect and enhance the wood.\n\n**Tips and Safety Precautions:**\n\n1. **Wear Protective Gear**: Safety glasses, ear protection, and a dust mask when working with power tools.\n2. **Use Proper Techniques**: Follow proper techniques for cutting, joining, and finishing wood.\n3. **Measure Twice**: Double-check measurements to avoid errors and waste.\n4. **Work in a Well-Ventilated Area**: Avoid inhaling dust and fumes when working with wood.\n5. **Practice and Be Patient**: Wooden crafts require time and practice to develop skills and achieve desired results.\n\nRemember to always follow safety guidelines and use proper techniques when working with wood. With practice and patience, you can create beautiful and functional wooden crafts that will last for years to come.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 17:49:00', '2026-05-24 17:49:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/wood_spoon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2026-05-24 17:49:23', '2026-05-24 17:49:23'),
(3457, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of ceramic, plastic, or terracotta materials. Flower pots come in a wide range of shapes, sizes, and designs, from simple and functional to decorative and ornate.\n\nSome common features of flower pots include:\n\n1. **Drainage holes**: Small holes in the bottom of the pot to allow excess water to escape, preventing waterlogged soil.\n2. **Handles or grips**: Making it easier to lift and move the pot.\n3. **Saucer or tray**: A separate container to catch excess water that drains out of the pot.\n\nFlower pots can be used for a variety of plants, including:\n\n1. **Houseplants**: Indoor plants like succulents, herbs, and flowering plants.\n2. **Garden plants**: Outdoor plants like flowers, vegetables, and shrubs.\n3. **Ornamental plants**: Plants used for decorative purposes, like bonsai trees or topiaries.\n\nWhen choosing a flower pot, consider factors like:\n\n1. **Material**: Ceramic, plastic, or terracotta, each with its own advantages and disadvantages.\n2. **Size**: Choose a pot that is large enough to hold the plant\'s roots and soil.\n3. **Style**: Select a pot that fits your home or garden decor.\n4. **Drainage**: Ensure the pot has adequate drainage holes to prevent waterlogged soil.\n\nBy selecting the right flower pot, you can create a beautiful and thriving environment for your plants to grow and flourish.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-24 18:07:00', '2026-05-24 18:07:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-05-24 18:07:23', '2026-05-24 18:07:23'),
