(3470, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:55', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a mythical creature, I\'ve learned a thing or two about resilience, adaptability, and passion. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Be fearless**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and face challenges head-on.\n* **Stay agile**: Be prepared to pivot and adjust to changing circumstances.\n* **Follow your passion**: Pursue your interests and desires with unwavering dedication.\n* **Protect your treasure**: Safeguard your values, goals, and loved ones with fierce determination.\n* **Soar to new heights**: Continuously strive for growth, improvement, and self-discovery.\n\n#Trending #MotivationMonday #DragonInspiration #Resilience #Passion #Fearless #Agile #GoalOriented #PersonalGrowth #SelfDiscovery #MythicalCreatures #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalDevelopment #BusinessTips #EntrepreneurMindset', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-25 13:55:00', '2026-05-25 13:55:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 4, '2026-05-25 13:55:24', '2026-05-25 13:55:24'),
(3471, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about resilience, adaptability, and passion. Here are some key takeaways that can be applied to your personal and professional life:\n\n* **Set boundaries and prioritize self-care**: Just like a dragon protects its treasure, you should protect your time and energy.\n* **Be open to new experiences and challenges**: Don\'t be afraid to spread your wings and try new things - you never know what opportunities may arise.\n* **Surround yourself with a supportive community**: A dragon\'s lair is only as strong as the community that surrounds it - build a network of people who uplift and support you.\n* **Stay true to your values and passions**: A dragon\'s fire burns brightest when it\'s fueled by purpose and passion - stay authentic and committed to your goals.\n\n#MotivationMonday #DragonEnergy #Resilience #SelfCare #NewExperiences #CommunityFirst #AuthenticityMatters #PassionDriven #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-25 14:00:00', '2026-05-25 14:00:30', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-05-25 14:00:30', '2026-05-25 14:00:30'),
(3472, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:07', '**Unlocking the Power of Dragons in Business**\n\nAs a dragon entrepreneur, I\'d like to share some relatable points about our journey to success:\n\n* **Passion drives us**: We\'re fueled by a passion for innovation and growth, just like a dragon\'s fire burns bright.\n* **Resilience is key**: We\'ve faced many challenges, but like a dragon\'s scales, we\'re tough and can withstand the heat.\n* **Community matters**: We believe in building strong relationships with our customers and partners, just like a dragon protects its treasure.\n* **Continuous learning**: We stay ahead of the curve by learning from our mistakes and adapting to new situations, just like a dragon evolves to dominate its environment.\n\nJoin the conversation and let\'s soar to new heights together! #DragonEntrepreneur #BusinessTips #Innovation #Resilience #CommunityFirst #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #SmallBusinessOwner #EntrepreneurLife #MotivationMonday #BusinessInspiration #SuccessStory', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-25 14:07:00', '2026-05-25 14:07:28', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 5, '2026-05-25 14:07:29', '2026-05-25 14:07:29'),
(3473, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:18', '**Unlocking the Power of Dragon\'s Business**\n\nAs a professional dragon, I understand the importance of staying relevant in today\'s fast-paced business world. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Innovative Thinking**: Stay ahead of the curve by embracing new ideas and technologies that can help your business thrive.\n* **Strategic Planning**: Develop a clear plan of action to achieve your goals and objectives, and be prepared to adapt to changing circumstances.\n* **Effective Communication**: Build strong relationships with your customers, partners, and team members by communicating clearly and transparently.\n* **Continuous Learning**: Stay up-to-date with the latest trends and best practices in your industry, and be willing to learn from your mistakes.\n\nBy following these principles, you can unlock the full potential of your business and achieve success. #DragonBusiness #Innovation #Strategy #Communication #Learning #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #SuccessStory #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-25 14:18:00', '2026-05-25 14:18:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 6, '2026-05-25 14:18:23', '2026-05-25 14:18:23'),
(3474, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Dragon\'s Den: Empowering Entrepreneurs**\n\nAs a seasoned business dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Stay adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change\n* **Network strategically**: Build relationships that can help you grow\n* **Innovate constantly**: Stay ahead of the curve with new ideas and solutions\n* **Lead with passion**: Inspire your team and drive results with enthusiasm\n* **Learn from failure**: Use setbacks as opportunities to grow and improve\n\nJoin the conversation and share your own business tips and experiences! #Entrepreneurship #BusinessGrowth #InnovationNation #LeadershipMatters #StartupSuccess #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #MotivationMonday #FacebookForBusiness', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-25 14:37:00', '2026-05-25 14:37:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-25 14:37:20', '2026-05-25 14:37:20'),
