(3507, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:34', 'A ball can refer to many things, such as:\n\n1. A round or spherical object, often used in sports like basketball, soccer, or tennis.\n2. A formal dance, like a ballroom dance.\n3. A unit of measurement, as in a ball of yarn or twine.\n\nWhich type of ball are you thinking of, or would you like to know more about a specific type?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 12:34:00', '2026-05-26 12:34:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 20, '2026-05-26 12:34:16', '2026-05-26 12:34:16'),
(3508, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Men\'s Party Wear: A Guide to Dressing to Impress**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, the options are endless. From formal suits to stylish casual wear, there\'s a wide range of choices to suit every taste and occasion. Here are some popular men\'s party wear options:\n\n### Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-tailored suit is a classic choice for formal parties. You can opt for a black, navy, or gray suit, paired with a crisp white shirt and a tie.\n2. **Tuxedos**: For a more luxurious look, consider a tuxedo. A black tuxedo with a white shirt and a bow tie is a timeless choice.\n3. **Dinner Jackets**: A dinner jacket is a great alternative to a suit. You can pair it with a dress shirt and trousers for a stylish look.\n\n### Semi-Formal Party Wear\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer is a versatile option that can be dressed up or down. Pair it with a dress shirt and trousers for a smart look.\n2. **Dress Shirts**: A dress shirt with a pair of dark-washed jeans or trousers is a great option for a semi-formal party.\n3. **Chinos**: Chinos are a stylish alternative to jeans. You can pair them with a dress shirt and a blazer for a smart look.\n\n### Casual Party Wear\n\n1. **T-Shirts**: A plain or graphic T-shirt is a great option for a casual party. Pair it with jeans or shorts for a relaxed look.\n2. **Polo Shirts**: A polo shirt is a great choice for a casual party. You can pair it with jeans or shorts for a stylish look.\n3. **Hoodies**: A hoodie is a great option for a casual party. You can pair it with jeans or shorts for a relaxed look.\n\n### Accessories\n\n1. **Watches**: A watch is a great accessory that can add a touch of sophistication to your outfit.\n2. **Cufflinks**: Cufflinks are a great way to add a personal touch to your outfit.\n3. **Shoes**: Shoes can make or break an outfit. Opt for dress shoes, boots, or loafers for a stylish look.\n\n### Tips\n\n1. **Dress according to the occasion**: Make sure to dress according to the occasion. A formal party requires a suit or tuxedo, while a casual party requires a more relaxed outfit.\n2. **Pay attention to fit**: Make sure your clothes fit well. A well-fitted outfit can make you look stylish and confident.\n3. **Accessories matter**: Accessories can add a touch of personality to your outfit. Choose accessories that complement your outfit and add a personal touch.\n\nBy following these tips and options, you\'ll be sure to dress to impress at your next party. Remember to have fun and express your personal style!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 12:40:00', '2026-05-26 12:40:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-05-26 12:40:23', '2026-05-26 12:40:23'),
(3509, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:45', 'Shoes are a type of footwear that people wear to protect and comfort their feet. They come in a wide variety of styles, designs, and materials, and can be used for different purposes such as walking, running, hiking, dancing, and more.\n\nSome popular types of shoes include:\n\n1. Sneakers: Also known as athletic shoes, these are designed for sports and physical activity.\n2. Boots: These are high-cut shoes that cover the ankle and often extend up the leg.\n3. Sandals: These are open-toed shoes that expose the foot and are often worn in warm weather.\n4. Loafers: These are slip-on shoes that are often worn for formal or business-casual occasions.\n5. High heels: These are shoes with a raised heel, often worn by women for formal or dressy events.\n6. Flats: These are shoes with a low or no heel, often worn for casual or everyday occasions.\n7. Dress shoes: These are formal shoes worn for special occasions such as weddings, job interviews, or formal events.\n\nShoes can be made from a variety of materials, including:\n\n1. Leather: A popular choice for shoes, leather is durable and can be dressed up or down.\n2. Synthetic materials: Such as polyester or nylon, these are often used for athletic shoes or casual footwear.\n3. Rubber: Used for the soles of shoes, rubber provides traction and durability.\n4. Fabric: Such as cotton or mesh, fabric is often used for casual or athletic shoes.\n\nWhen choosing shoes, it\'s essential to consider factors such as:\n\n1. Comfort: Make sure the shoes fit well and are comfortable to wear.\n2. Purpose: Choose shoes that are suitable for the activity or occasion.\n3. Style: Select shoes that fit your personal style and preferences.\n4. Quality: Look for shoes that are well-made and durable.\n\nDo you have a specific type of shoe in mind or a particular question about shoes?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 12:45:00', '2026-05-26 12:45:30', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Shoes?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 21, '2026-05-26 12:45:30', '2026-05-26 12:45:30'),
(3510, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is typically worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic style with a pointed collar, French cuffs, and a fitted silhouette.\n2. **Button-Down Shirt:** A style with a button-down collar, often worn for business casual events.\n3. **Wing-Tip Shirt:** A style with a wing-tip collar, often worn for formal events such as weddings and black-tie events.\n4. **Cutaway Shirt:** A style with a cutaway collar, often worn for formal events such as job interviews and business meetings.\n\n**Features of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Collar Style:** Pointed, spread, or cutaway collars are common in formal shirts.\n2. **Cuff Style:** French cuffs or button cuffs are common in formal shirts.\n3. **Fabric:** Formal shirts are often made from high-quality cotton, linen, or silk fabrics.\n4. **Fit:** Formal shirts are typically fitted, with a slim silhouette and a tailored fit.\n5. **Buttons:** Formal shirts often feature mother-of-pearl or plastic buttons.\n\n**Popular Brands for Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink:** Known for their high-quality, stylish formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet:** A French brand that offers luxurious, bespoke formal shirts.\n3. **Brooks Brothers:** An American brand that offers classic, traditional formal shirts.\n4. **Armani:** An Italian brand that offers stylish, modern formal shirts.\n5. **Hugo Boss:** A German brand that offers high-quality, fashionable formal shirts.\n\n**Tips for Wearing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Pair with a suit:** Formal shirts are often worn with a suit and tie for a complete, polished look.\n2. **Choose the right collar:** Choose a collar style that complements your face shape and personal style.\n3. **Pay attention to fit:** Make sure the shirt fits well, with a slim silhouette and a tailored fit.\n4. **Accessories:** Add a tie, pocket square, and cufflinks to complete the look.\n5. **Shoe game:** Pair with dress shoes, such as oxfords or loafers, to complete the outfit.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 12:56:00', '2026-05-26 12:56:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-05-26 12:56:22', '2026-05-26 12:56:22'),
