(3523, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:06', 'I\'m a large language model, I don\'t have the capability to physically create images. But I can describe a high-quality image of a man hanging out with friends, and you can use your imagination to visualize it.\n\n**Image Description:**\n\nThe image is a high-resolution, vibrant photograph of a group of friends having a great time together. The main subject, a man in his mid-30s, is standing in the center of the frame, surrounded by his friends. They are all smiling and laughing, enjoying each other\'s company.\n\nThe man is wearing a casual outfit, consisting of a light-blue shirt, dark jeans, and a pair of brown boots. He has a friendly and approachable expression on his face, with a slight smile and a twinkle in his eyes.\n\nTo his left is a woman with long, curly brown hair and a bright yellow sundress. She is leaning in, chatting with the man, and her eyes are shining with amusement. On his right is a tall, lanky guy with a messy beard and a baseball cap. He is holding a beer and grinning from ear to ear.\n\nIn the background, there is a blurred view of a park or a backyard, with trees, flowers, and a few people walking in the distance. The sun is shining, casting a warm glow over the entire scene.\n\nThe image is taken from a slightly low angle, looking up at the group, which gives the viewer a sense of being part of the conversation. The photographer has used a wide aperture, which creates a shallow depth of field, blurring the background and emphasizing the subjects.\n\n**Image Specifications:**\n\n* Resolution: 4000 x 3000 pixels\n* Aspect Ratio: 4:3\n* File Format: JPEG\n* Color Mode: RGB\n* Compression: Low\n\n**Mood and Atmosphere:**\n\nThe image exudes a sense of friendship, camaraderie, and joy. The warm colors, the relaxed poses, and the happy expressions all contribute to a feeling of warmth and togetherness. The image invites the viewer to join in, to be part of the group, and to share in the fun.\n\nI hope this description helps you visualize the image!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 16:06:00', '2026-05-26 16:06:20', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/They_should_be_american%2C_african%2C_indian%2C_and_sikh?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 46, '2026-05-26 16:06:20', '2026-05-26 16:06:20'),
(3524, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:11', 'The scene you\'ve described is a quintessential blend of modern aesthetic photography and cinematic flair, capturing a moment that is both serene and dynamically engaging. Let\'s break down the elements that make this image so captivating:\n\n1. **Girl Walking with a Transparent Umbrella in Light Rain**: The subject of the photograph, a girl walking under a transparent umbrella, is an elegant touch. The transparency of the umbrella allows the viewer to see her face and outfit clearly, while the light rain adds a layer of mystique to the scene. This element introduces a sense of movement and narrative to the image.\n\n2. **Neon Reflections on Wet Street**: Neon lights reflecting off the wet pavement is a classic trope in both photography and cinema for creating a vibrant, urban nightscape. These reflections add color, depth, and a sense of place to the image, grounding it in a contemporary, possibly Asian (given the prevalence of neon in cities like Tokyo, Seoul, or Hong Kong), urban environment.\n\n3. **Aesthetic Photography**: The term \"aesthetic photography\" refers to the creation of images that emphasize the beauty of the subject and the scene. In this context, it suggests a careful consideration of composition, lighting, and the overall mood of the photograph to create a visually appealing and emotionally engaging image.\n\n4. **Soft Bokeh Lights**: \"Bokeh\" refers to the aesthetic quality of the blur produced in the out-of-focus parts of an image produced by a lens. Soft bokeh lights, in this case, likely refer to the blurred neon lights or other light sources in the background, which add to the image\'s depth and dreamy quality. This effect can make the lights appear more like orbs or soft, glowing masses, enhancing the photograph\'s artistic and ethereal qualities.\n\n5. **Fashionable Outfit**: The fact that the girl is wearing a fashionable outfit suggests that the image also has a component of fashion photography. This element adds a layer of sophistication and style to the scene, potentially making the image appealing to those interested in fashion, besides its aesthetic and cinematic qualities.\n\n6. **Cinematic Mood**: The description of a \"cinematic mood\" implies that the photograph has a quality reminiscent of film or cinema. This could be due to the use of lighting, the dramatic effect of the neon reflections, the narrative implication of the girl walking alone in the rain, or the overall composition, which might evoke the feeling of a scene from a movie.\n\n7. **High-Detail**: The mention of \"high-detail\" suggests that the image is of high resolution and clarity, allowing viewers to appreciate the textures, colors, and minute details of the scene, from the raindrops on the umbrella and the street to the intricate details of the girl\'s outfit.\n\nIn summary, this photograph encapsulates a blend of contemporary urban life, fashion, and the timeless allure of a rainy night, all captured with a high level of detail and aesthetic sensibility. It\'s an image that could appeal to a wide range of viewers, from those who appreciate urban landscapes and neon lights to fans of fashion and cinematic photography.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 16:11:00', '2026-05-26 16:11:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C_girl_walking_with_a_transparent_umbrella_in_light_rain%2C_neon_reflections_on_wet_street%2C_aesthetic_photography%2C_soft_bokeh_lights%2C_fashionable_outfit%2C_cinematic_mood%2C_high-detail%2C?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 43, '2026-05-26 16:11:21', '2026-05-26 16:11:21'),
(3525, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'It looks like you\'re testing something. Is there anything specific you\'d like to talk about or ask? I\'m here to help.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 16:33:00', '2026-05-26 16:33:22', 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Tester?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 48, '2026-05-26 16:33:22', '2026-05-26 16:33:22'),
(3526, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as American football in some countries, is a contact team sport played between two teams of eleven players using an oval-shaped ball with pointed ends. It is a popular sport in the United States, with the National Football League (NFL) being one of the most watched and followed sports leagues in the world.\n\n**Objective:**\nThe objective of football is to score more points than the opposing team by carrying or throwing the ball into the end zone of the opponent\'s field. Points can be scored in several ways, including:\n\n1. **Touchdowns**: carrying or throwing the ball into the end zone (6 points)\n2. **Field Goals**: kicking the ball through the opponent\'s goalposts (3 points)\n3. **Extra Points**: kicking the ball through the opponent\'s goalposts after a touchdown (1 or 2 points)\n4. **Safety**: tackling an opponent in their own end zone or when a player carries the ball out of the end zone (2 points)\n\n**Gameplay:**\nA standard football game consists of four quarters, each lasting 15 minutes. The team with possession of the ball is called the offense, and they try to score by advancing the ball down the field. The team without the ball is called the defense, and they try to stop the offense from scoring.\n\n**Positions:**\nThere are several positions in football, including:\n\n1. **Quarterback (QB)**: the player who usually throws the ball and leads the offense\n2. **Running Back (RB)**: the player who carries the ball and runs with it\n3. **Wide Receiver (WR)**: the player who catches passes from the quarterback\n4. **Tight End (TE)**: the player who blocks and catches passes\n5. **Linemen**: the players who line up on the line of scrimmage and try to block or tackle the opponent\n6. **Defensive Back (DB)**: the player who covers the wide receiver and defends against passes\n7. **Linebacker (LB)**: the player who supports the linemen and defends against runs\n\n**Tactics:**\nFootball teams use various tactics to outmaneuver their opponents, including:\n\n1. **Passing**: throwing the ball to a teammate\n2. **Rushing**: running with the ball\n3. **Blocking**: using players to block opponents and clear a path\n4. **Blitzing**: sending extra players to rush the quarterback\n5. **Covering**: defending against passes by covering the wide receiver\n\n**Leagues:**\nThere are several professional and amateur football leagues around the world, including:\n\n1. **National Football League (NFL)**: the top professional league in the United States\n2. **College Football**: the top amateur league in the United States\n3. **Canadian Football League (CFL)**: the top professional league in Canada\n4. **Arena Football League (AFL)**: a professional indoor football league\n5. **International Football**: football is played in many countries, with the sport being popular in Europe, Australia, and South America.\n\nI hope this gives you a good overview of football! Do you have any specific questions or topics you\'d like to discuss?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 16:33:00', '2026-05-26 16:33:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-26 16:33:24', '2026-05-26 16:33:24'),
(3527, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The Yamaha YZF-R1 is a high-performance sport bike produced by Yamaha Motor Company. It was first introduced in 1998 and has since become one of the most iconic and sought-after motorcycles in the world.\n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha R1:\n\n* **Engine:** 998cc, liquid-cooled, 16-valve, DOHC, inline-four cylinder engine\n* **Power:** 200 horsepower (147.9 kW) at 13,500 rpm\n* **Torque:** 82.6 lb-ft (112 Nm) at 11,500 rpm\n* **Transmission:** 6-speed, constant mesh\n* **Brakes:** Dual 320mm discs with 4-piston calipers (front), 220mm disc with 2-piston caliper (rear)\n* **Suspension:** 43mm inverted fork (front), monoshock with piggyback reservoir (rear)\n* **Weight:** 439 pounds (199 kg) wet\n* **Seat Height:** 32.7 inches (831 mm)\n\nThe Yamaha R1 is known for its exceptional handling, braking, and acceleration, making it a popular choice among track enthusiasts and street riders alike. Its advanced electronics, including traction control, anti-lock braking, and ride-by-wire throttle, also contribute to its impressive performance and safety features.\n\nOver the years, the R1 has undergone several updates and revisions, including the introduction of new engine management systems, chassis improvements, and styling updates. Despite the rise of newer models, the R1 remains a highly respected and sought-after motorcycle in the sport bike community.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 16:42:00', '2026-05-26 16:42:28', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-26 16:42:28', '2026-05-26 16:42:28'),
(3528, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:15', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about passion, perseverance, and strategy. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define what you want to achieve and create a plan to get there.\n* **Stay focused**: Avoid distractions and stay committed to your objectives.\n* **Be adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change.\n* **Surround yourself with support**: Build a strong network of allies who can help you grow.\n* **Continuously learn and improve**: Stay ahead of the curve by acquiring new skills and knowledge.\n\nBy following these principles, you can unlock your full potential and achieve greatness. Remember to stay hungry, stay humble, and always keep moving forward.\n\n#DragonMindset #SuccessTips #MotivationMonday #BusinessInspiration #PersonalGrowth #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalDevelopment #GoalSetting #Focus #Adaptability #SupportSystem #LifelongLearning', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 17:15:00', '2026-05-26 17:15:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 6, '2026-05-26 17:15:21', '2026-05-26 17:15:21'),
(3529, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. He is one of the most popular and iconic characters in the Marvel Universe.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nIron Man\'s secret identity is Tony Stark, a billionaire inventor and businessman who is the CEO of Stark Industries, a cutting-edge technology company. After being kidnapped and held captive by a terrorist group, Tony Stark was forced to build a powerful suit of armor to save his life. Using his intelligence and resourcefulness, he created the first Iron Man suit, which he used to escape and later refined to become a superhero.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit is a advanced exoskeleton that provides him with superhuman strength, speed, and agility. The suit is also equipped with a range of advanced technologies, including:\n\n* Repulsor technology, which allows him to fly and project energy beams\n* Advanced sensors and scanning technology, which enable him to detect and analyze his surroundings\n* Super-durable armor, which protects him from physical attacks\n* Artificial intelligence, which assists him in controlling the suit and making strategic decisions\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark is a brilliant and charismatic individual who is also arrogant and self-centered. As Iron Man, he is a confident and fearless hero who is willing to take risks to protect the people he cares about. He is also a founding member of the Avengers and has played a key role in many of their adventures.\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been featured in a successful movie franchise, with Robert Downey Jr. playing the role of Tony Stark/Iron Man in:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* The Avengers (2012)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\nThe movies have grossed billions of dollars worldwide and have helped to establish Iron Man as one of the most popular superheroes of all time.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has had a significant impact on popular culture, inspiring countless fans around the world with his courage, intelligence, and wit. He has also spawned numerous spin-offs, including comic books, video games, and animated TV shows.\n\nWhat do you think about Iron Man? Do you have a favorite Iron Man movie or comic book storyline?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 17:30:00', '2026-05-26 17:30:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-26 17:30:17', '2026-05-26 17:30:17'),
(3530, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is one of power, confidence, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**The Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a tailored suit, stands tall and proud on the basketball court. His attire is immaculate, with a crisp white shirt, a slim tie, and a fitted blazer that accentuates his broad shoulders. His hair is styled perfectly, and his eyes gleam with a fierce competitive spirit.\n\n**The Setting:**\nThe basketball court is dimly lit, with the only light coming from the stadium lights behind the subject. This creates a dramatic effect, with deep shadows and highlights that accentuate the subject\'s features. The court itself is empty, with no other players or obstacles to distract from the subject\'s dominance.\n\n**The Props:**\nThe basketball in the subject\'s hand is a symbol of his control and mastery. He holds it firmly, with a confident grip that suggests he\'s ready to take on any challenge. The ball is a deep, rich brown, with a subtle sheen that catches the light.\n\n**The Lighting:**\nThe stadium lights behind the subject create a dramatic, cinematic effect. The light is intense and focused, with a narrow beam that highlights the subject\'s features and creates deep shadows around him. This creates a sense of depth and dimensionality, drawing the viewer\'s eye into the image.\n\n**The Mood:**\nThe overall mood of the image is one of success and determination. The subject exudes confidence and self-assurance, as if he\'s already won the game before it\'s even started. His posture is relaxed yet powerful, with a subtle swagger that suggests he\'s unstoppable.\n\n**The Style:**\nThe image is shot in a high-resolution, cinematic style, with a shallow depth of field that blurs the background and emphasizes the subject. The colors are rich and vivid, with a warm, golden tone that suggests success and achievement. The overall effect is one of luxury and sophistication, as if the image is from a high-end advertising campaign or a Hollywood movie.\n\n**The Message:**\nThe image conveys a powerful message about the subject\'s mindset and approach to life. He\'s a winner, a champion who dominates every arena he enters. He\'s confident, determined, and unstoppable, with a success mindset that drives him to achieve greatness. The image is an inspiration to anyone who sees it, a reminder that with hard work, determination, and a winning attitude, anything is possible.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-26 17:45:00', '2026-05-26 17:45:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-26 17:45:17', '2026-05-26 17:45:17'),
