(3560, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nHere are some key aspects of football:\n\n1. **Objective**: The primary objective is to score more goals than the opposing team within the 90-minute game duration.\n2. **Gameplay**: Players can use any part of their body except their hands and arms to control and move the ball. Only the goalkeeper is allowed to use their hands and arms to touch the ball.\n3. **Positions**: Each team has 11 players with different positions, including:\n	* Goalkeeper (GK)\n	* Defenders (DF)\n	* Midfielders (MF)\n	* Forwards (FW)\n4. **Rules**: The game is governed by a set of rules, including:\n	* Offside rule: A player is considered offside if they are closer to the opponent\'s goal line than both the ball and the second-to-last opponent when the ball is played forward.\n	* Fouls: Physical contact between players can result in free kicks or penalties.\n	* Yellow and red cards: Players can be given yellow or red cards for misconduct, with yellow cards serving as a warning and red cards resulting in ejection from the game.\n5. **Competitions**: Football is played at various levels, including:\n	* Professional leagues (e.g., English Premier League, La Liga, Bundesliga)\n	* International tournaments (e.g., FIFA World Cup, UEFA European Championship)\n	* Club competitions (e.g., UEFA Champions League, Copa Libertadores)\n\nSome popular football-related topics include:\n\n* **Transfers**: The movement of players between teams, often involving significant transfer fees.\n* **Tactics**: The strategic decisions made by coaches and players during a game, such as formations and player positions.\n* **Rivalries**: The intense competitions between teams with a history of conflict or geographic proximity.\n* **FIFA rankings**: The official rankings of national teams based on their performance in international competitions.\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-27 16:33:00', '2026-05-27 16:33:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-27 16:33:15', '2026-05-27 16:33:15'),
(3561, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike, also known as the Yamaha YZF-R1, is a high-performance sport bike manufactured by Yamaha. It was first introduced in 1998 and has since become a popular choice among motorcycle enthusiasts.\n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha R1 bike:\n\n1. **Engine**: The R1 is powered by a 998cc, liquid-cooled, inline-four cylinder engine that produces around 200 horsepower.\n2. **Transmission**: The bike features a 6-speed transmission with a multi-plate clutch and a chain drive.\n3. **Chassis**: The R1 has a lightweight aluminum frame with a swingarm and a rear shock absorber.\n4. **Brakes**: The bike is equipped with dual 320mm front disc brakes and a 220mm rear disc brake.\n5. **Suspension**: The R1 features a 43mm inverted front fork and a rear shock absorber with adjustable preload, compression, and rebound damping.\n6. **Electronics**: The bike comes with advanced electronics, including traction control, ABS, and a quick shifter.\n7. **Design**: The R1 has a sleek and aerodynamic design, with a distinctive fairing and a compact tail section.\n\nThe Yamaha R1 is known for its exceptional handling, braking, and acceleration, making it a favorite among track riders and street riders alike. It has also been used in various racing series, including the Superbike World Championship and the MotoAmerica series.\n\nSome of the key specifications of the Yamaha R1 bike include:\n\n* **Top speed**: Over 186 mph (300 km/h)\n* **0-60 mph**: Around 3 seconds\n* **Weight**: Around 439 pounds (200 kg)\n* **Seat height**: 32.7 inches (830 mm)\n* **Fuel capacity**: 4.5 gallons (17 liters)\n\nOverall, the Yamaha R1 is a high-performance sport bike that is designed for experienced riders who demand exceptional handling, power, and technology.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-27 16:42:00', '2026-05-27 16:42:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-27 16:42:20', '2026-05-27 16:42:20'),
(3562, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. Created by writer and editor Stan Lee, playwright and scripter Larry Lieber, and artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby, the character first appeared in Tales of Suspense #39 (March 1963).\n\n**Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a brilliant inventor and billionaire, is the founder and CEO of Stark Industries, a cutting-edge technology company. While demonstrating his company\'s latest missile technology in Afghanistan, Tony is kidnapped by a terrorist organization called the Ten Rings. They demand that he build a missile system for them, but Tony, with the help of fellow captive Yinsen, a engineer, creates a powered exoskeleton suit instead. The suit, which later becomes the Iron Man armor, allows Tony to escape and return to the United States.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s powers come from his advanced suit of armor, which provides:\n\n1. **Superhuman Strength**: The armor\'s powerful motors and hydraulic systems grant Tony enhanced strength.\n2. **Flight**: The armor\'s repulsor technology allows Tony to fly.\n3. **Energy Projection**: The armor can project energy blasts from its hands.\n4. **Advanced Sensors**: The armor\'s advanced sensors and computer systems provide Tony with real-time data and threat analysis.\n5. **Durability**: The armor is highly resistant to damage and can withstand extreme temperatures and conditions.\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a complex character with a mix of traits:\n\n1. **Intelligence**: Tony is a genius inventor and engineer.\n2. **Confidence**: He is charismatic and confident, often bordering on arrogance.\n3. **Sarcasm**: Tony has a witty sense of humor and often uses sarcasm to deflect or annoy others.\n4. **Vulnerability**: Despite his tough exterior, Tony has a vulnerable side, particularly when it comes to his personal relationships and the weight of his responsibilities as a superhero.\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man movie franchise, which began in 2008, stars Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man. The franchise includes:\n\n1. Iron Man (2008)\n2. Iron Man 2 (2010)\n3. Iron Man 3 (2013)\n4. Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n5. Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n6. Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n7. Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n8. Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\nThe movies have been incredibly successful, grossing billions of dollars worldwide and cementing Iron Man\'s status as one of the most iconic superheroes of all time.\n\nWhat aspect of Iron Man would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-27 17:30:00', '2026-05-27 17:30:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-27 17:30:21', '2026-05-27 17:30:21'),
(3563, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is one of contrasts and powerful symbolism, blending the worlds of business and sports to convey a message of success, confidence, and versatility. Let\'s break down the elements of this scene to understand its deeper implications and how it might be captured in a high-resolution, cinematic style:\n\n### Setting: The Basketball Court\n- **Transformation and Adaptability**: A basketball court, typically associated with athletic competition, becomes an unconventional backdrop for a businessman. This setting suggests the individual\'s ability to adapt and succeed in diverse environments, not just the boardroom.\n- **Challenge and Competition**: Basketball courts are arenas of competition, echoing the competitive nature of the business world. The businessman standing confidently here implies he is ready for any challenge, whether in sports or business.\n\n### The Businessman\n- **Professionalism and Authority**: Wearing a suit, the businessman exudes professionalism and authority. This attire, in the context of a basketball court, underscores his ability to bring a level of sophistication and strategy to any endeavor.\n- **Confidence and Success Mindset**: Standing confidently with a ball in his hand, he embodies a success mindset. This pose suggests control, capability, and a readiness to take on new challenges.\n\n### The Ball in His Hand\n- **Control and Initiative**: Holding the ball signifies control and the initiative to make the next move. In business, this could translate to making strategic decisions or driving innovation.\n- **Preparedness for Action**: The ball also represents the potential for action, underscoring the businessman\'s preparedness to engage, to compete, and to lead.\n\n### Dramatic Lighting and Stadium Lights\n- **Highlighting Achievement**: The dramatic lighting, possibly with shadows accentuating the businessman\'s determined expression, highlights his achievements and aspirations. Stadium lights, typically used to illuminate large events, add a sense of grandeur and importance to the scene.\n- **Emphasis on Ambition**: The use of dramatic lighting can also emphasize the businessman\'s ambition, painting him not just as a figure of success but as someone striving for greatness.\n\n### High-Resolution Cinematic Style\n- **Detail and Clarity**: Capturing this image in high resolution with a cinematic style would provide immense detail and clarity. Every aspect, from the texture of the suit to the shine on the basketball, would be crisp and vivid.\n- **Emotional Impact**: The cinematic approach would also amplify the emotional impact of the image. The depth of field, color grading, and composition would all contribute to creating a powerful, motivational visual statement.\n\n### Conclusion\nThis image is a potent symbol of modern success, where adaptability, confidence, and a strategic mindset are key. It challenges traditional boundaries between different fields of endeavor, suggesting that the skills and attitudes that lead to success in one area can be applied broadly. The high-resolution, cinematic capture of this scene would not only make for a compelling visual but also serve as a motivational reminder of the potential for achievement in multiple arenas of life.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-27 17:45:00', '2026-05-27 17:45:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-27 17:45:22', '2026-05-27 17:45:22'),
