(3596, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nSome key aspects of football include:\n\n1. **The Field**: The game is played on a rectangular field with goals at each end, typically measuring 100-130 yards (90-120 meters) in length and 50-100 yards (45-90 meters) in width.\n2. **The Ball**: The official ball is made of leather or synthetic materials and has a circumference of 27-28 inches (68-70 cm).\n3. **Gameplay**: Players can use any part of their body except their hands and arms to control and move the ball. Only the goalkeeper is allowed to use their hands and arms to touch the ball, and only within their own penalty area.\n4. **Scoring**: A goal is scored when the ball passes completely over the goal line between the goal posts and under the crossbar. The team with the most goals at the end of the game wins.\n5. **Positions**: Each team has 11 players, including:\n	* **Goalkeeper** (GK): The player responsible for preventing the ball from entering the goal.\n	* **Defenders** (DF): Players who help the goalkeeper by defending the goal and blocking opponents\' attacks.\n	* **Midfielders** (MF): Players who support both the defense and the offense by maintaining possession and creating scoring opportunities.\n	* **Forwards** (FW): Players who score goals by shooting, heading, or passing the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nSome popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most widely viewed and followed sporting event in the world, held every four years.\n2. **UEFA Champions League**: An annual club competition featuring top teams from Europe.\n3. **English Premier League**: A professional league in England, considered one of the most competitive and popular leagues in the world.\n\nFootball has a massive global following, with millions of fans attending matches, watching on TV, and playing the game at various levels, from amateur to professional.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-28 16:33:00', '2026-05-28 16:33:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-28 16:33:19', '2026-05-28 16:33:19');
