(3597, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The R1 bike you\'re referring to is likely the Yamaha YZF-R1, a high-performance sport bike manufactured by Yamaha. \n\nHere are some key features of the Yamaha YZF-R1:\n1. **Engine**: 998cc, liquid-cooled, 4-stroke, DOHC, 16-valve, in-line four-cylinder engine.\n2. **Power and Torque**: Produces around 200 horsepower and 82.9 lb-ft of torque.\n3. **Transmission**: 6-speed manual transmission with a multi-plate slipper clutch.\n4. **Brakes**: Dual 320mm disc brakes at the front and a single 220mm disc brake at the rear.\n5. **Suspension**: 43mm inverted fork at the front and a monoshock at the rear.\n6. **Weight**: Around 439 pounds (200 kg) wet weight.\n7. **Electronics**: Features advanced electronic rider aids, including traction control, slide control, and a quickshifter.\n\nThe Yamaha YZF-R1 is known for its exceptional handling, braking, and acceleration, making it a popular choice among sport bike enthusiasts and track riders. However, please note that specifications may vary depending on the model year and region.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-28 16:42:00', '2026-05-28 16:42:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-28 16:42:17', '2026-05-28 16:42:17'),
(3598, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. He is one of the most popular and iconic characters in the Marvel Universe.\n\n**Origin Story:**\nIron Man\'s secret identity is Tony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist. After being kidnapped and held captive, Tony Stark was forced to create a powerful suit of armor to escape. He later refined the design and used it to fight crime and protect the world as the superhero Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s powers come from his advanced suit of armor, which provides:\n\n1. **Superhuman Strength**: The suit amplifies Tony\'s physical strength, allowing him to lift and throw heavy objects.\n2. **Flight**: The suit has repulsor technology, enabling Iron Man to fly and maneuver through the air.\n3. **Energy Projection**: The suit can project energy blasts from its hands, which can be used to blast enemies or propel Iron Man through space.\n4. **Advanced Sensors**: The suit has advanced sensors and scanners, allowing Iron Man to detect and track targets.\n5. **Artificial Intelligence**: The suit has an AI system, known as JARVIS (later replaced by FRIDAY), which assists Iron Man in battle and provides strategic support.\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a complex and charismatic character. He is:\n\n1. **Intelligent**: A genius inventor and engineer, Tony is one of the smartest people in the Marvel Universe.\n2. **Confident**: Tony is self-assured and confident in his abilities, often bordering on arrogance.\n3. **Witty**: Iron Man is known for his quick wit and sarcasm, often using humor to defuse tense situations.\n4. **Flawed**: Tony has a troubled past and struggles with personal demons, including addiction and ego issues.\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man movie franchise, starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man, has been incredibly successful, with:\n\n1. **Iron Man (2008)**: The first film in the franchise, which launched the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU).\n2. **Iron Man 2 (2010)**: The sequel, which introduced Black Widow and set the stage for The Avengers.\n3. **Iron Man 3 (2013)**: The third film, which explored Tony\'s personal struggles and introduced the Mandarin.\n4. **The Avengers (2012)**: Iron Man joined the Avengers team, fighting alongside other iconic heroes like Captain America, Thor, and the Hulk.\n5. **Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)**: Iron Man played a key role in the sequel, which introduced the artificial intelligence Ultron.\n6. **Captain America: Civil War (2016)**: Iron Man clashed with Captain America over the Sokovia Accords, leading to a rift in the Avengers team.\n7. **Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)**: Iron Man mentored Spider-Man, aka Peter Parker, in his solo film.\n8. **Avengers: Infinity War (2018)**: Iron Man played a key role in the battle against Thanos, ultimately sacrificing himself to save the world.\n9. **Avengers: Endgame (2019)**: Iron Man\'s legacy lived on, as the surviving Avengers used time travel to undo the damage caused by Thanos.\n\nIron Man\'s impact on popular culture is undeniable, inspiring countless fans around the world with his intelligence, courage, and wit.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-28 17:30:00', '2026-05-28 17:30:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-28 17:30:22', '2026-05-28 17:30:22'),
(3599, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, success, and determination. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**The Subject:**\nThe professional businessman, dressed in a tailored suit, stands tall and confident on the basketball court. His attire is immaculate, with a crisp white shirt, a slim tie, and a pair of polished dress shoes that seem out of place on the court. Yet, he wears them with an air of authority, as if to say that he can conquer any environment.\n\n**The Basketball:**\nThe ball in his hand is a symbol of his ability to adapt and thrive in new situations. He holds it with a firm grip, his fingers wrapped around it with a sense of purpose. The ball seems to be an extension of himself, a tool that he can wield to achieve his goals.\n\n**The Basketball Court:**\nThe court itself is a backdrop for the businessman\'s success. The polished wooden floor reflects the stadium lights, creating a sense of depth and dimension. The court\'s lines and markings seem to fade into the background, as if to emphasize the businessman\'s dominance over the environment.\n\n**The Stadium Lights:**\nThe dramatic lighting is a key element in the scene. The stadium lights cast a golden glow over the court, creating long shadows that stretch out behind the businessman. The light is intense, with a sense of drama and urgency that underscores the businessman\'s confident demeanor.\n\n**The Success Mindset:**\nThe overall mood of the image is one of success and determination. The businessman exudes an air of self-assurance, as if he knows that he can overcome any obstacle. His confidence is infectious, drawing the viewer into the scene and making them feel like they can achieve greatness too.\n\n**The High-Resolution Cinematic Style:**\nThe image is rendered in a high-resolution, cinematic style that adds to the sense of drama and sophistication. The level of detail is exquisite, with every aspect of the scene meticulously crafted to create a sense of realism. The image seems to leap off the screen, drawing the viewer into the world of the businessman and his basketball court domain.\n\nOverall, the image is a powerful representation of success and confidence. The businessman\'s presence on the court is a statement of his ability to thrive in any environment, and the dramatic lighting and cinematic style only add to the sense of drama and urgency. The image is a testament to the idea that with hard work and determination, anyone can achieve greatness.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-28 17:45:00', '2026-05-28 17:45:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-28 17:45:18', '2026-05-28 17:45:18'),
(3600, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:46', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and evocative one, conveying a sense of confidence, determination, and success. Here\'s a more detailed breakdown of the scene:\n\n**The Businessman**: The subject is a well-dressed professional, wearing a tailored suit that exudes confidence and authority. His attire is immaculate, with a crisp white shirt, a slim tie, and a pair of polished dress shoes. He stands tall, with his shoulders back and his head held high, radiating an air of self-assurance.\n\n**The Basketball Court**: The setting is a basketball court, with the gleaming wooden floor and the hoop in the background. The court is empty, except for the businessman, who stands alone, basking in the spotlight. The absence of other players or spectators adds to the sense of isolation and focus, emphasizing the individual\'s dedication to his craft.\n\n**The Ball**: The businessman holds a basketball in his hand, a symbol of his ability to navigate different environments and adapt to new challenges. The ball represents a metaphor for the ups and downs of business, where one must be prepared to pivot and adjust to changing circumstances.\n\n**The Stadium Lights**: The stadium lights behind the businessman cast a dramatic glow, illuminating the scene and creating an atmosphere of excitement and energy. The lights also serve to highlight the subject\'s features, accentuating his confident expression and emphasizing his sense of purpose.\n\n**Dramatic Lighting**: The lighting in the scene is dramatic and cinematic, with deep shadows and highlights that add depth and dimension to the image. The light sources are positioned to create a sense of tension and drama, with the businessman standing at the center of the spotlight.\n\n**Success Mindset**: The overall mood of the image is one of success and achievement, as if the businessman has just scored a major victory or overcome a significant obstacle. His confident stance and determined expression convey a sense of triumph, as if he is ready to take on the next challenge that comes his way.\n\n**High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The image is rendered in a high-resolution, cinematic style, with crisp lines, vivid colors, and a sense of depth and texture. The level of detail is exceptional, with every aspect of the scene meticulously crafted to create a visually stunning and thought-provoking image.\n\nOverall, the image you\'ve described is a powerful representation of confidence, determination, and success, with the businessman standing tall and proud, ready to take on the world.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-28 17:46:00', '2026-05-28 17:46:31', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-28 17:46:31', '2026-05-28 17:46:31'),
(3601, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:47', 'The image you\'ve described is a powerful and captivating visual representation that combines elements of business, sports, and personal achievement. Here\'s a breakdown of the key components and the emotions they evoke:\n\n1. **Professional Businessman**: The fact that the subject is a businessman wearing a suit immediately conveys a sense of professionalism, authority, and success. This attire is typically associated with corporate environments, finance, and leadership.\n\n2. **Standing Confidently on a Basketball Court**: The shift from a traditional business setting to a basketball court introduces an element of unexpectedness and versatility. It suggests that the individual is not limited to one domain and can adapt and thrive in different environments. The confidence exuded by the stance implies a sense of capability and readiness to take on challenges.\n\n3. **With a Ball in His Hand**: Holding a basketball adds a dynamic element to the scene, symbolizing control, potential action, and possibly a readiness to make a move—whether in business or on the court. It can represent the subject\'s ability to handle multiple facets of life with ease.\n\n4. **Stadium Lights Behind Him**: The dramatic lighting provided by the stadium lights creates a heroic backdrop, elevating the subject to a stature of importance and glory. It\'s reminiscent of major achievements and the spotlight, emphasizing the subject\'s prominence.\n\n5. **Dramatic Lighting**: The use of dramatic lighting enhances the cinematic quality of the image, adding depth and emotional impact. It can create shadows that add complexity to the subject\'s features, suggesting a multifaceted personality.\n\n6. **Success Mindset**: The overall composition of the image—combining elements of business success with the competitive, achievement-oriented world of sports—conveys a strong message of ambition, resilience, and a mindset geared towards success.\n\n7. **High-Resolution Cinematic Style**: The high-resolution cinematic style gives the image a premium, almost surreal quality, fitting for a hero or a highly successful individual. It amplifies the dramatic effect, making the scene feel like a pivotal moment in a movie or a defining photograph in a magazine.\n\nThis image would likely be used in contexts where the themes of success, versatility, and a proactive approach to challenges are to be highlighted. It could serve as a powerful visual for advertising, editorial content, or personal branding, aiming to inspire and evoke a sense of aspiration in its viewers.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-28 17:47:00', '2026-05-28 17:47:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-28 17:47:22', '2026-05-28 17:47:22'),
(3602, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:49', 'Wooden crafts are a popular and creative way to work with wood, resulting in beautiful and functional pieces. Here are some ideas and techniques to get you started:\n\n**Types of Wooden Crafts:**\n\n1. **Wood Carving**: Carving designs or patterns into wood using hand tools or power tools.\n2. **Wood Turning**: Creating symmetrical objects, such as bowls or vases, using a lathe.\n3. **Wood Burning**: Using a pyrography pen to burn designs or patterns into wood.\n4. **Wood Inlay**: Creating intricate designs by inlaying small pieces of wood into a larger piece.\n5. **Wood Assembly**: Building objects, such as furniture or decorative boxes, using various joinery techniques.\n\n**Wooden Craft Projects:**\n\n1. **Coat Rack**: A simple and functional project that involves assembling a frame and adding hooks.\n2. **Picture Frame**: A great way to practice joinery techniques and create a beautiful frame for your favorite photo.\n3. **Wooden Jewelry Box**: A small and intricate project that involves creating a box with a lid and adding decorative details.\n4. **Custom Sign**: A fun project that involves designing and building a custom sign using wood and various techniques, such as carving or burning.\n5. **Furniture Making**: Creating functional pieces, such as tables, chairs, or shelves, using various woodworking techniques.\n\n**Techniques and Tips:**\n\n1. **Safety First**: Always wear protective gear, such as safety glasses and a dust mask, when working with power tools.\n2. **Measure Twice, Cut Once**: Double-check your measurements to avoid errors and ensure accurate cuts.\n3. **Use the Right Tools**: Invest in high-quality tools that are suitable for your project and skill level.\n4. **Practice Patience**: Wooden crafts can be time-consuming and require patience, so don\'t rush through the process.\n5. **Experiment and Try New Things**: Don\'t be afraid to try new techniques or experiment with different materials and designs.\n\n**Materials and Tools:**\n\n1. **Wood**: Various types of wood, such as oak, pine, or maple, can be used for wooden crafts.\n2. **Hand Tools**: Chisels, gouges, and hand saws are essential for wood carving and other techniques.\n3. **Power Tools**: Table saws, miter saws, and drill presses are commonly used for woodworking projects.\n4. **Sandpaper and Finishing Supplies**: Sandpaper, stain, and polyurethane are necessary for smoothing and finishing your projects.\n5. **Clamps and Jigs**: Clamps and jigs help to hold your workpiece in place and ensure accurate assembly and joinery.\n\nRemember, wooden crafts are a fun and rewarding hobby that requires patience, practice, and creativity. Start with simple projects and gradually move on to more complex ones as you gain experience and confidence.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-28 17:49:00', '2026-05-28 17:49:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/wood_spoon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 10, '2026-05-28 17:49:16', '2026-05-28 17:49:16'),
(3603, 'Auto Post for facebook at 18:07', 'A flower pot is a container used to hold soil and plants, typically made of materials such as ceramic, clay, plastic, or wood. Flower pots come in a wide range of shapes, sizes, and designs, and can be used for both indoor and outdoor plants.\n\nSome common features of flower pots include:\n\n1. **Drainage holes**: These allow excess water to escape, preventing waterlogged soil and root rot.\n2. **Handles or grips**: These make it easier to lift and move the pot.\n3. **Decorative designs**: Many flower pots are adorned with patterns, colors, and textures, adding a touch of style to gardens and indoor spaces.\n\nFlower pots can be used for various types of plants, including:\n\n1. **Herbs**: Basil, rosemary, and thyme are popular herbs that thrive in flower pots.\n2. **Flowers**: Petunias, geraniums, and begonias are just a few examples of colorful flowers that can be grown in flower pots.\n3. **Succulents**: These low-maintenance plants are perfect for indoor flower pots, and come in a variety of shapes and sizes.\n\nWhen choosing a flower pot, consider the following factors:\n\n1. **Size**: Select a pot that is large enough to accommodate the plant\'s roots and provide sufficient soil volume.\n2. **Material**: Choose a material that is durable, water-resistant, and suitable for the plant\'s needs.\n3. **Style**: Pick a pot that fits your personal taste and complements the surrounding decor.\n\nOverall, flower pots are a great way to add some greenery to your life, whether you\'re a seasoned gardener or a beginner.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-28 18:07:00', '2026-05-28 18:07:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Flower_pot?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 33, '2026-05-28 18:07:19', '2026-05-28 18:07:19'),
