(3607, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', 'Here\'s a relatable caption for a Facebook post as a dragon business/creator:\n\n\"As a dragon, I understand the importance of embracing our true selves and unleashing our inner fire. Here are a few things I\'ve learned on my journey:\n\n* Be fearless and take risks - they often lead to the greatest rewards\n* Don\'t be afraid to show your true colors - authenticity is key to building strong relationships\n* Protect and nurture your treasure - whether it\'s your passions, your loved ones, or your community\n* Never stop learning and growing - there\'s always room for improvement and expansion\n\n#DragonWisdom #EmbracingYourTrueSelf #FearlessAndFierce #AuthenticityMatters #TreasureYourPassions #GrowthMindset #TrendingNow #DragonNation #FireBreathingInspiration #MythicalMotivation\"', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 10:35:00', '2026-05-29 10:35:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-05-29 10:35:21', '2026-05-29 10:35:21'),
(3608, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, crime boss, and founder of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and feared organized crime groups in history. Here\'s a brief overview of his life and legacy:\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to a poor farming family. He grew up in a rough neighborhood in Medellín, where he became involved in crime at a young age. Escobar dropped out of school in the seventh grade and began working as a car thief and smuggler.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was then a relatively new and lucrative market. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, becoming a key player in the organization. Escobar\'s success was due in part to his cunning, ruthlessness, and ability to build relationships with other powerful crime lords.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organized crime groups in the world. The cartel controlled a significant portion of the global cocaine trade, and Escobar\'s network of smugglers, distributors, and hitmen operated in numerous countries, including the United States, Mexico, and Colombia.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s reign was marked by extreme violence and terror. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including politicians, police officers, judges, and rival gang members. Escobar\'s hitmen, known as \"sicarios,\" carried out assassinations and bombings, often targeting innocent civilians.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a luxurious private prison, which he had built himself. However, he escaped in 1992 and went into hiding. A massive manhunt ensued, involving Colombian and American law enforcement agencies. On December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police on a rooftop in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He was a ruthless and brutal crime lord who brought terror and violence to many people. However, he was also a charismatic figure who was seen as a folk hero by some in Colombia, particularly in the poor neighborhoods where he grew up. Escobar\'s story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included owning a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a sprawling estate called Hacienda Napoles.\n* He was a skilled manipulator who used his charm and wealth to build relationships with powerful politicians and business leaders.\n* Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power, making him one of the richest people in the world.\n* Despite his notoriety, Escobar was a devoted family man who was known to be fiercely loyal to his wife and children.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and legacy serve as a cautionary tale about the dangers of organized crime and the corrupting influence of power and wealth.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 10:45:00', '2026-05-29 10:45:30', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-29 10:45:30', '2026-05-29 10:45:30'),
(3609, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious drug trafficking organizations in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful criminals of the 20th century.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Escobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, on December 1, 1949. He grew up in a poor family and was the third of seven children. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he dropped out of school in the seventh grade to work on the streets.\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar began his career in crime, smuggling cigarettes and other goods. He eventually turned to cocaine trafficking, which became his main source of income. Escobar\'s success in the cocaine trade was rapid, and he quickly rose to become one of the most powerful drug lords in Colombia.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nIn the 1980s, Escobar founded the Medellín cartel, which became one of the most powerful and feared drug trafficking organizations in the world. The cartel\'s success was due in part to Escobar\'s innovative tactics, including the use of airplanes to transport cocaine and the creation of a network of distributors and smugglers.\n\nAt the height of its power, the Medellín cartel was responsible for smuggling an estimated 80% of the world\'s cocaine, with revenues of over $20 billion per year. Escobar\'s personal wealth was estimated to be over $30 billion, making him one of the richest men in the world.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power was marked by violence and terror. He was known for his ruthless tactics, including murder, intimidation, and bribery. Escobar\'s cartel was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including rival drug dealers, police officers, and innocent civilians.\n\nIn 1989, Escobar\'s cartel was responsible for the bombing of an Avianca airliner, which killed 110 people. The bombing was intended to intimidate the Colombian government and prevent the extradition of Escobar to the United States.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn 1991, Escobar surrendered to the Colombian authorities and was imprisoned in a specially built prison, known as La Catedral. However, Escobar continued to run his cartel from behind bars, and in 1992, he escaped from prison.\n\nA massive manhunt was launched, and Escobar was eventually tracked down by Colombian police on December 1, 1993. He was shot and killed in a rooftop shootout in Medellín, Colombia.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people. However, he is also remembered as a charismatic and cunning leader who was able to build a massive and powerful organization.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s life has been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His story continues to fascinate and horrify people around the world, and his legacy serves as a reminder of the dangers and consequences of the drug trade.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his love of luxury and extravagance. He owned a private zoo, a collection of exotic cars, and a massive mansion in Medellín.\n* Escobar was a skilled politician and was able to build alliances with other powerful figures in Colombia, including politicians and business leaders.\n* Escobar\'s cartel was responsible for the murder of over 4,000 people, including police officers, judges, and politicians.\n* Escobar\'s personal wealth was estimated to be over $30 billion, making him one of the richest men in the world at the time of his death.\n* Escobar\'s legacy continues to be felt in Colombia, where he is still remembered as a folk hero by some people. However, his violent and ruthless tactics have also had a lasting impact on the country, contributing to a culture of violence and corruption.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 10:50:00', '2026-05-29 10:50:38', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-29 10:50:38', '2026-05-29 10:50:38'),
(3610, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious criminal organizations in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most successful and feared drug traffickers of all time.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to a poor farming family. He grew up in a rough neighborhood in Medellín, where he was exposed to crime and violence from a young age. Escobar dropped out of school in the seventh grade and began working in the streets, selling fruit and other goods to support his family.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was rapidly expanding in Colombia. He started as a small-time smuggler, but his ambition, intelligence, and ruthlessness quickly propelled him to the top of the Medellín cartel. Escobar\'s organization became known for its efficiency, brutality, and innovative tactics, such as using small planes to transport cocaine and bribing officials to turn a blind eye.\n\n**Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel dominated the global cocaine trade, earning an estimated $420 million per week. The cartel\'s operations were highly organized, with a complex network of producers, smugglers, and distributors. Escobar\'s organization was also notorious for its violence, using murder, intimidation, and terrorism to eliminate competitors and maintain control.\n\n**Personal Life**\n\nEscobar was known for his flamboyant lifestyle, which included luxury homes, exotic cars, and lavish parties. He was married to María Victoria Henao, and the couple had two children, Juan Pablo and Manuela. Despite his brutal reputation, Escobar was also known for his charitable work, building homes, schools, and hospitals in poor neighborhoods and earning the admiration of many Colombians.\n\n**Law Enforcement and Death**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, international law enforcement agencies, including the US DEA and the Colombian police, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. In 1991, Escobar surrendered to Colombian authorities and was imprisoned, but he escaped in 1992. A massive manhunt ensued, and on December 1, 1993, Escobar was shot and killed by Colombian police in a rooftop shootout in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning criminal who brought terror and violence to Colombia and beyond. However, he is also seen as a symbol of resistance against the Colombian government and the US, which many Colombians view as corrupt and oppressive. Escobar\'s story has inspired numerous books, films, and TV shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power.\n* He was known for his love of animals and had a private zoo, which included exotic species such as elephants, lions, and giraffes.\n* Escobar was a skilled soccer player and even built a soccer field in his hometown of Rionegro.\n* He was known for his generosity and built many infrastructure projects, including roads, bridges, and hospitals, in poor neighborhoods.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and legacy are a fascinating and disturbing example of the power and corruption that can result from the intersection of crime, politics, and wealth.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 10:53:00', '2026-05-29 10:53:30', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-29 10:53:30', '2026-05-29 10:53:30'),
(3611, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned that success is not just about breathing fire, but about passion, dedication, and perseverance. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Set clear goals**: Define what you want to achieve and create a plan to get there.\n* **Stay focused**: Avoid distractions and stay committed to your objectives.\n* **Be adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change.\n* **Learn from failure**: Use setbacks as opportunities to grow and improve.\n* **Surround yourself with support**: Build a network of people who believe in you and your vision.\n\nBy following these principles, you can unlock your full potential and achieve greatness. Remember to stay fierce, stay focused, and always keep your eyes on the prize.\n\n#DragonMindset #SuccessTips #Motivation #Inspiration #ProductivityHacks #GoalSetting #Focus #Adaptability #Resilience #SupportSystem #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 11:18:00', '2026-05-29 11:18:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-05-29 11:18:19', '2026-05-29 11:18:19'),
(3612, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: 5 Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and drive. Here are some relatable points to help you unleash your inner strength:\n\n* **Set goals and chase them fiercely**: Just like a dragon guarding its treasure, you should be relentless in pursuing your objectives.\n* **Stay adaptable and open to change**: Like a dragon navigating through uncharted territories, be prepared to adjust your approach as circumstances evolve.\n* **Cultivate resilience and determination**: When faced with obstacles, draw upon your inner fire to fuel your momentum and keep moving forward.\n* **Foster meaningful connections and collaborations**: Just as dragons often form alliances with other creatures, nurture your relationships and work together to achieve common goals.\n* **Continuously learn and grow**: Stay curious and committed to self-improvement, just like a dragon refining its skills and wisdom over time.\n\n#MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #DragonInspiration #GoalOriented #ResilienceMatters #CollaborationOverCompetition #LearnAndGrow #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalDevelopment #InnerStrength #FireWithin', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 11:39:00', '2026-05-29 11:39:31', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 35, '2026-05-29 11:39:31', '2026-05-29 11:39:31'),
(3613, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Men\'s Party Wear: A Guide to Dressing to Impress**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, the key is to look stylish, sophisticated, and confident. Here are some tips and ideas to help you dress to impress:\n\n**Formal Party Wear**\n\n1. **Suits**: A well-fitted suit in a neutral color like black, navy, or gray is a timeless choice. Pair it with a crisp white shirt, a slim tie, and dress shoes.\n2. **Tuxedos**: For a black-tie event, a tuxedo is the way to go. Opt for a classic black tuxedo with a white shirt, black bow tie, and patent leather shoes.\n3. **Dress Shirts**: Choose a dress shirt that complements your suit. Consider a slim-fit shirt with a subtle pattern or texture.\n\n**Semi-Formal Party Wear**\n\n1. **Blazers**: A blazer can add a touch of sophistication to a casual outfit. Pair it with a dress shirt, dark jeans, and dress shoes.\n2. **Dress Pants**: Dress pants in a neutral color can be paired with a button-down shirt and a blazer for a stylish look.\n3. **Pocket Squares**: Add a pop of color with a pocket square. Choose a pattern or color that complements your outfit.\n\n**Casual Party Wear**\n\n1. **Graphic T-Shirts**: A graphic t-shirt can be a great option for a casual party. Pair it with dark jeans and sneakers.\n2. **Hoodies**: A hoodie can be a stylish and comfortable option for a casual party. Choose a neutral color and pair it with dark jeans.\n3. **Accessories**: Add a touch of personality with accessories like a watch, a hat, or a statement necklace.\n\n**Trends to Watch**\n\n1. **Bold Colors**: Don\'t be afraid to experiment with bold colors like red, blue, or green.\n2. **Patterns**: Mix and match patterns like stripes, polka dots, or checks to add visual interest to your outfit.\n3. **Statement Pieces**: Invest in statement pieces like a bold watch or a patterned blazer to elevate your outfit.\n\n**Grooming Tips**\n\n1. **Hair**: Style your hair with a bit of texture and volume to add a touch of sophistication.\n2. **Beard**: Keep your beard well-groomed and trimmed to add a touch of elegance.\n3. **Fragrance**: Wear a subtle fragrance that complements your outfit and personality.\n\n**Conclusion**\n\nMen\'s party wear is all about confidence, style, and attention to detail. Whether you\'re dressing for a formal or casual party, remember to choose an outfit that makes you feel good and expresses your personality. Don\'t be afraid to experiment with new trends and styles, and always pay attention to grooming and accessories. With these tips, you\'ll be sure to make a statement at your next party.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 12:40:00', '2026-05-29 12:40:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-05-29 12:40:23', '2026-05-29 12:40:23'),
(3614, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of shirt that is designed to be worn on formal occasions, such as business meetings, job interviews, weddings, and other special events. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n1. **Collar style**: Formal shirts typically have a point collar, spread collar, or wingtip collar.\n2. **Cuff style**: Formal shirts often have French cuffs or button cuffs.\n3. **Fabric**: Formal shirts are usually made from high-quality fabrics such as cotton, linen, or silk.\n4. **Fit**: Formal shirts are designed to fit closely to the body, with a slim fit through the torso and sleeves.\n5. **Button-front**: Formal shirts typically have a button-front closure.\n\n**Styles:**\n\n1. **Classic fit**: A traditional formal shirt with a relaxed fit through the torso and sleeves.\n2. **Slim fit**: A modern formal shirt with a slim fit through the torso and sleeves.\n3. **Tailored fit**: A formal shirt with a tailored fit, designed to skim the body closely.\n4. **Dress shirt**: A formal shirt with a more relaxed fit, often worn with a suit and tie.\n5. **Business casual**: A formal shirt with a slightly more relaxed fit, often worn in business casual settings.\n\n**Colors and Patterns:**\n\n1. **White**: A classic color for formal shirts, suitable for most formal occasions.\n2. **Light blue**: A popular color for formal shirts, suitable for business meetings and interviews.\n3. **Pastel colors**: Soft pastel colors such as pale pink, baby blue, and mint green are suitable for spring and summer formal events.\n4. **Stripes**: Thin stripes are a classic pattern for formal shirts, while thicker stripes can add a touch of personality.\n5. **Checks**: Small checks are suitable for formal shirts, while larger checks can add a touch of rustic charm.\n\n**Brands:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink**: A luxury brand known for its high-quality formal shirts.\n2. **Charvet**: A French brand that offers exquisite formal shirts with a focus on craftsmanship and attention to detail.\n3. **Brooks Brothers**: An American brand that offers classic formal shirts with a preppy twist.\n4. **Ted Baker**: A British brand that offers stylish formal shirts with a focus on bold colors and patterns.\n5. **Calvin Klein**: An American brand that offers modern formal shirts with a focus on sleek designs and slim fits.\n\n**Tips:**\n\n1. **Choose a shirt that fits well**: A well-fitting shirt is essential for a formal look.\n2. **Consider the occasion**: Choose a shirt that is suitable for the occasion, taking into account the dress code and the level of formality.\n3. **Pay attention to details**: Look for shirts with high-quality fabrics, stitching, and attention to detail.\n4. **Accessories matter**: Pair your formal shirt with a tie, pocket square, and cufflinks to complete the look.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 12:56:00', '2026-05-29 12:56:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-05-29 12:56:22', '2026-05-29 12:56:22'),
(3615, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about passion, perseverance, and success. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Set goals and chase them fiercely**: Just like I pursue my prey, you should pursue your dreams with unwavering dedication.\n* **Protect and nurture your inner flame**: Take care of your physical and mental well-being, and never let your passion fade.\n* **Roar with confidence**: Believe in yourself and your abilities, and don\'t be afraid to show the world what you\'re capable of.\n* **Soar to new heights**: Continuously challenge yourself and strive for improvement, just like I soar through the skies.\n\n#DragonsDen #MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #GoalSetting #MentalHealthMatters #ConfidenceIsKey #TrendingNow #BusinessInspiration #ProfessionalGrowth #FacebookMotivation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 13:03:00', '2026-05-29 13:03:16', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-05-29 13:03:16', '2026-05-29 13:03:16'),
