(3617, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned valuable lessons that can be applied to our personal and professional lives. Here are a few key takeaways:\n\n* **Resilience is key**: As a creature often misunderstood and faced with adversity, I\'ve learned to adapt and thrive in challenging environments.\n* **Passion drives success**: My love for treasure and hoarding is unmatched, and it\'s this passion that motivates me to keep pushing forward.\n* **Community matters**: Despite my fearsome reputation, I value the connections I make with others and recognize the importance of building strong relationships.\n* **Continuous learning is essential**: Whether it\'s mastering the art of fire-breathing or navigating the complexities of human interaction, I\'m always looking for ways to improve and grow.\n\nBy embracing these principles, we can unlock our full potential and achieve greatness. #DragonWisdom #ResilienceMatters #PassionDriven #CommunityFirst #LifelongLearning #TrendingNow #MotivationMonday #InspirationalQuotes #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #FacebookCommunity', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 14:00:00', '2026-05-29 14:00:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-05-29 14:00:24', '2026-05-29 14:00:24'),
(3618, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated humans. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s world that can inspire and motivate you:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearless attitude, reminding us to stand up for what we believe in and face challenges head-on.\n* **Protection and loyalty**: Dragons are often depicted as guardians of treasure and fiercely loyal to their kin, teaching us the importance of safeguarding our values and loved ones.\n* **Transformation and growth**: From egg to mighty dragon, this creature\'s life cycle shows us that change is a natural part of life, and we must be open to evolving and improving.\n* **Passion and drive**: The fiery spirit of the dragon can ignite our own passions and motivate us to pursue our goals with enthusiasm and dedication.\n\nLet\'s embody the qualities of the dragon and unleash our inner fire! #DragonsDen #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #Inspiration #PersonalGrowth #CourageOverFear #LoyaltyMatters #TransformYourLife #PassionDriven #FireWithin #ProfessionalGrowth #FacebookMotivation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 14:37:00', '2026-05-29 14:37:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-29 14:37:17', '2026-05-29 14:37:17'),
(3619, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated humans. Here are some key takeaways from the dragon\'s approach to life:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like a dragon sets its sights on a treasure hoard, you should strive for greatness in your pursuits.\n* **Protect your passions**: A dragon fiercely guards its treasure; similarly, you should prioritize and safeguard your interests.\n* **Adapt to challenges**: Dragons are known for their ability to thrive in various environments; be prepared to pivot and adjust to overcome obstacles.\n* **Embody confidence**: A dragon\'s roar is unmistakable; own your space and exude self-assurance in all that you do.\n\n#DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #GoalSetting #Resilience #ConfidenceIsKey #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #BusinessLessons #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #InspirationalQuotes #MotivationalMonday', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 14:38:00', '2026-05-29 14:38:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-29 14:38:18', '2026-05-29 14:38:18');
