(3620, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Unleashing the Power of Dragons in Business**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to succeed. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Embracing risk**: Just like a dragon soaring through the skies, we must be willing to take calculated risks to reach new heights.\n* **Adapting to change**: In a rapidly evolving business landscape, being agile and adaptable is crucial for survival.\n* **Fierce determination**: A dragon\'s unwavering dedication to its goals is a quality that we can all learn from.\n* **Protecting our treasure**: Whether it\'s our customers, employees, or intellectual property, we must fiercely guard what\'s valuable to us.\n* **Breathing fire**: Sometimes, it\'s necessary to think outside the box and bring innovative ideas to the table to stay ahead of the competition.\n\n#DragonsInBusiness #Entrepreneurship #Innovation #RiskManagement #Adaptability #Determination #Protection #Creativity #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #SuccessStories #MotivationMonday #FacebookBusiness #DragonPower', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 14:39:00', '2026-05-29 14:39:15', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-29 14:39:15', '2026-05-29 14:39:15'),
(3621, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Exciting News from Dragon Enterprises**\n\nAs we continue to soar to new heights, we want to take a moment to appreciate what makes us unique. Here are a few key points that set us apart:\n\n* **Innovative Solutions**: Our team is dedicated to providing cutting-edge solutions that meet the evolving needs of our customers.\n* **Customer-Centric Approach**: We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients, listening to their feedback, and tailoring our services to exceed their expectations.\n* **Commitment to Excellence**: We strive for perfection in everything we do, from product development to customer support.\n* **Sustainable Practices**: We\'re passionate about reducing our environmental footprint and promoting eco-friendly practices throughout our operations.\n\nJoin us on this journey and stay up-to-date on our latest developments! #DragonEnterprises #Innovation #CustomerFirst #Sustainability #BusinessExcellence #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #ProfessionalServices #RelatableContent', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 15:10:00', '2026-05-29 15:10:33', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-05-29 15:10:33', '2026-05-29 15:10:33'),
(3622, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:14', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of power, strength, and resilience, dragons have long fascinated humans. Here are some key takeaways from the dragon\'s world that can inspire and motivate you:\n\n* **Courage in the face of adversity**: Dragons are known for their fearlessness, reminding us to stand up for what we believe in and face challenges head-on.\n* **Adaptability and resilience**: With their ability to thrive in various environments, dragons teach us to be flexible and adjust to changing circumstances.\n* **Passion and drive**: The fierce determination of dragons can inspire us to pursue our passions and strive for excellence.\n* **Loyalty and protection**: Dragons are often depicted as guardians, highlighting the importance of loyalty, trust, and safeguarding what matters most.\n* **Growth and transformation**: As dragons shed their skin and grow, they remind us that change is a natural part of life and that we too can evolve and transform.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #TrendingNow #BusinessLessons #PersonalGrowth #Resilience #Courage #Adaptability #Passion #Loyalty #Transformation #FacebookCommunity #Inspiration #Motivation #SuccessTips #BusinessTips #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 15:14:00', '2026-05-29 15:14:30', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 23, '2026-05-29 15:14:30', '2026-05-29 15:14:30'),
(3623, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:24', '**Unlock the Fire Within: 5 Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about embracing my inner strength and passion. Here are some key points to consider:\n\n* **Believe in yourself**: Just like a dragon\'s fiery breath, your confidence can ignite a spark that sets your goals ablaze.\n* **Be fearless**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and face challenges head-on, just like a dragon soaring through the skies.\n* **Stay focused**: Keep your eyes on the prize and stay committed to your objectives, just like a dragon guarding its treasure.\n* **Embrace your uniqueness**: Celebrate what sets you apart and makes you special, just like a dragon\'s distinctive scales.\n* **Keep learning**: Continuously seek out new knowledge and experiences to fuel your growth and success, just like a dragon\'s constant evolution.\n\n#MotivationMonday #SuccessTips #DragonInspiration #FireWithin #TrendingNow #BusinessTips #PersonalGrowth #ConfidenceIsKey #FearlessLeadership #FocusOnYourGoals #BeUnique #LifelongLearning #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-29 15:24:00', '2026-05-29 15:24:25', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 22, '2026-05-29 15:24:25', '2026-05-29 15:24:25'),
