(3661, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:33', 'Football, also known as soccer in some countries, is a popular team sport played between two teams of 11 players using a round ball with the objective of scoring more goals than the opposing team by kicking or heading the ball into the opponent\'s goal.\n\nThere are several types of football, including:\n\n1. **Association Football** (Soccer): The most widely played version, popular in the UK, Europe, South America, and many other parts of the world.\n2. **American Football**: A contact team sport played with an oval-shaped ball, popular in the United States and Canada.\n3. **Rugby Football**: A full-contact team sport that originated in the UK, popular in the UK, Australia, New Zealand, and South Africa.\n4. **Australian Rules Football**: A contact team sport played with an oval-shaped ball, popular in Australia.\n5. **Gaelic Football**: A contact team sport played with a round ball, popular in Ireland.\n\nSome of the most popular football competitions include:\n\n1. **FIFA World Cup**: The most widely viewed and followed sporting event in the world, held every four years.\n2. **UEFA Champions League**: An annual club competition featuring top European teams.\n3. **English Premier League**: A professional league in England, one of the most popular and competitive leagues in the world.\n4. **La Liga**: A professional league in Spain, home to top teams like Barcelona and Real Madrid.\n5. **NFL (National Football League)**: A professional American football league in the United States.\n\nFootball has a massive global following, with millions of fans attending matches, watching on TV, and playing the sport at various levels.\n\nWhat aspect of football would you like to know more about?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-30 16:33:00', '2026-05-30 16:33:29', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/bicycle_kick_hitting_the_top_right_corner?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 53, '2026-05-30 16:33:29', '2026-05-30 16:33:29'),
(3662, 'Auto Post for facebook at 16:42', 'The Yamaha R1 is a popular sport bike produced by Yamaha. Here are some key features and specs:\n\n**Overview**\nThe Yamaha R1 is a high-performance sport bike that was first introduced in 1998. It is known for its powerful engine, agile handling, and sleek design. The R1 has undergone several updates and revisions over the years, with the latest model featuring advanced technology and improved performance.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n* **Engine**: 998cc inline-four cylinder engine, producing 200 horsepower and 82.9 lb-ft of torque\n* **Transmission**: 6-speed manual transmission with a slipper clutch\n* **Brakes**: Dual 320mm disc brakes with ABS, and a 220mm rear disc brake\n* **Suspension**: 43mm inverted fork with adjustable compression and rebound damping, and a monoshock rear suspension with adjustable compression and rebound damping\n* **Electronics**: Yamaha\'s advanced electronics package, including traction control, slide control, and launch control\n\n**Specifications**\n\n* **Seat Height**: 32.7 inches (831mm)\n* **Wheelbase**: 55.3 inches (1405mm)\n* **Dry Weight**: 439 pounds (199kg)\n* **Fuel Capacity**: 4.5 gallons (17 liters)\n* **Top Speed**: electronically limited to 186 mph (300 km/h)\n\n**Riding Experience**\nThe Yamaha R1 is known for its exceptional handling and braking performance, making it a favorite among track riders and enthusiasts. The bike\'s powerful engine and advanced electronics package provide a thrilling riding experience, while the comfortable ergonomics and adjustable suspension make it suitable for long rides and daily commuting.\n\nOverall, the Yamaha R1 is a high-performance sport bike that is designed for experienced riders who demand exceptional power, handling, and technology.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-30 16:42:00', '2026-05-30 16:42:27', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/r1_bike?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 54, '2026-05-30 16:42:27', '2026-05-30 16:42:27'),
(3663, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. Created by writer and editor Stan Lee, with the help of artists Don Heck and Jack Kirby, the character first appeared in the comic book \"Tales of Suspense #39\" in March 1963.\n\n**The Origin Story:**\nTony Stark, a billionaire inventor and industrialist, is kidnapped by a group of terrorists who demand that he build a powerful missile system for them. Instead, Stark uses his intelligence and resources to create a suit of armor, which he uses to escape and later becomes the superhero known as Iron Man.\n\n**Powers and Abilities:**\nIron Man\'s suit is a technologically advanced exoskeleton that provides him with superhuman strength, speed, and agility. The suit is also equipped with a range of advanced technologies, including:\n\n* Repulsor technology, which allows Iron Man to fly and project energy blasts\n* A sophisticated computer system, which provides Iron Man with real-time data and strategic analysis\n* A range of advanced sensors and scanners, which allow Iron Man to detect and track targets\n\n**Personality:**\nTony Stark, aka Iron Man, is a confident and charismatic character who is known for his wit, intelligence, and sense of humor. He is also a complex and flawed character, struggling with issues such as ego, arrogance, and a sense of responsibility.\n\n**Movie Franchise:**\nThe Iron Man character has been featured in a number of successful movies, including:\n\n* Iron Man (2008)\n* Iron Man 2 (2010)\n* Iron Man 3 (2013)\n* Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015)\n* Captain America: Civil War (2016)\n* Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017)\n* Avengers: Infinity War (2018)\n* Avengers: Endgame (2019)\n\nThe movies have been critically acclaimed and have grossed billions of dollars at the box office, cementing Iron Man\'s status as one of the most popular and iconic superheroes of all time.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has had a significant impact on popular culture, inspiring countless fans around the world with his intelligence, courage, and determination. The character has also spawned a range of merchandise, including toys, video games, and clothing, and has become a cultural icon of the 21st century.\n\nWhat would you like to know about Iron Man?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-30 17:30:00', '2026-05-30 17:30:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-30 17:30:24', '2026-05-30 17:30:24'),
