(3672, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:35', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about resilience, passion, and perseverance. Here are some key takeaways that can inspire you to unleash your inner fire:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Just like I set my sights on soaring to new heights, you can aim high and strive for excellence in your own pursuits.\n* **Stay adaptable**: As a dragon, I\'ve learned to navigate through changing environments and unexpected challenges. You can do the same by being open to new experiences and learning from your mistakes.\n* **Protect your passions**: Just as I fiercely guard my treasure, you should prioritize and nurture your passions and interests.\n* **Embrace your uniqueness**: As a dragon, I celebrate my individuality and the unique strengths that set me apart. You can do the same by embracing your quirks and talents.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #FireWithin #Resilience #Passion #Perseverance #Ambition #Adaptability #SelfCare #UnleashYourPotential #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #MondayMotivation', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 10:35:00', '2026-05-31 10:35:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 50, '2026-05-31 10:35:21', '2026-05-31 10:35:21'),
(3673, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:45', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord and the founder of the Medellín Cartel, one of the most powerful and feared organized crime groups in the world. He is widely regarded as one of the most notorious and influential figures in the history of organized crime.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia. He grew up in a poor household and was raised by his mother, Hermilda, after his father abandoned the family. Escobar began his criminal career as a teenager, selling stolen cars and cigarettes on the black market.\n\nIn the 1970s, Escobar became involved in the cocaine trade, which was then a relatively new and rapidly growing industry. He quickly rose to prominence as a key player in the Medellín Cartel, which was founded by him and his partners, including Carlos Lehder and Gustavo Gaviria.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín Cartel became one of the most powerful and feared organized crime groups in the world. The cartel controlled a significant portion of the global cocaine trade, and its operations spanned across multiple countries, including Colombia, the United States, and Mexico.\n\nEscobar\'s success was due in part to his innovative and ruthless business tactics. He invested heavily in infrastructure, including roads, airports, and warehouses, to facilitate the transportation and storage of cocaine. He also used violence and intimidation to eliminate competitors and maintain control over the market.\n\n**Notorious Crimes and Escapades**\n\nEscobar was responsible for numerous notorious crimes and escapades, including:\n\n1. **The Assassination of Luis Carlos Galán**: In 1989, Escobar ordered the assassination of Luis Carlos Galán, a Colombian presidential candidate who had vowed to crack down on the Medellín Cartel.\n2. **The Bombing of Avianca Flight 203**: In 1989, Escobar ordered the bombing of Avianca Flight 203, which killed 110 people and injured many more.\n3. **The Siege of the Colombian Supreme Court**: In 1985, Escobar\'s henchmen stormed the Colombian Supreme Court, killing over 100 people and destroying much of the building.\n\n**Manhunt and Death**\n\nIn the early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a massive manhunt for Escobar. He was finally tracked down and killed on December 1, 1993, in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered by some as a ruthless and brutal crime lord, responsible for thousands of deaths and countless suffering. Others view him as a folk hero, who rose from poverty to become one of the most powerful men in the world.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s life and legacy have been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His story continues to fascinate and captivate audiences around the world.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n1. **Wealth**: At the height of his power, Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be over $30 billion, making him one of the richest men in the world.\n2. **Hacienda Nápoles**: Escobar\'s lavish estate, Hacienda Nápoles, was a symbol of his wealth and power. The estate featured a private zoo, a lake, and a collection of exotic cars.\n3. **Family**: Escobar was married to María Victoria Henao, and the couple had two children, Juan Pablo and Manuela.\n4. **Philanthropy**: Despite his notorious crimes, Escobar was known to be a generous philanthropist, particularly in his hometown of Medellín, where he built roads, schools, and hospitals.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and legacy are a testament to the complexities and contradictions of human nature. His story serves as a reminder of the dangers of organized crime and the importance of law enforcement and justice.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 10:45:00', '2026-05-31 10:45:34', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-31 10:45:34', '2026-05-31 10:45:34'),
(3674, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:50', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, crime boss, and founder of the Medellín cartel. He is widely considered one of the most notorious and successful drug traffickers in history.\n\n**Early Life**\n\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria was born on December 1, 1949, in Rionegro, Colombia, to a family of modest means. His father was a farmer, and his mother was a schoolteacher. Escobar grew up in a poor neighborhood in Medellín, where he became involved in street crime at a young age.\n\n**Rise to Power**\n\nEscobar began his career in crime by selling contraband cigarettes and stolen cars. In the 1970s, he became involved in the cocaine trade, which was then a relatively small and disorganized industry. Escobar saw an opportunity to capitalize on the growing demand for cocaine in the United States and began to build a network of smugglers, distributors, and dealers.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nIn the early 1980s, Escobar formed the Medellín cartel, which would become one of the most powerful and ruthless drug cartels in the world. The cartel\'s success was based on Escobar\'s ability to negotiate with other crime groups, bribe officials, and use violence to eliminate competitors.\n\nAt the height of its power, the Medellín cartel controlled up to 80% of the global cocaine market, with revenues estimated to be over $20 billion per year. Escobar became one of the richest men in the world, with an estimated net worth of over $30 billion.\n\n**Violence and Terror**\n\nEscobar\'s rise to power was marked by violence and terror. He was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including politicians, police officers, judges, and rival gang members. The Medellín cartel was known for its brutal tactics, including bombings, assassinations, and kidnappings.\n\n**The Hunt for Escobar**\n\nIn the late 1980s and early 1990s, the Colombian government, with the help of the United States, launched a series of operations to capture or kill Escobar. The hunt for Escobar became a national obsession in Colombia, with the government offering large rewards for information leading to his capture.\n\n**Death**\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Escobar was killed in a shootout with Colombian police in Medellín. He was 44 years old. The circumstances of his death are still disputed, with some claiming that he was shot by police, while others believe that he took his own life.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered by some as a ruthless and brutal crime lord, responsible for the deaths of thousands of people. Others see him as a folk hero, who rose from poverty to become one of the most powerful men in the world.\n\nIn recent years, Escobar\'s life has been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\" His story continues to fascinate and horrify people around the world, serving as a reminder of the dangers of organized crime and the corrupting influence of power.\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a mansion with a private airport.\n* He was a skilled politician and was able to build a network of alliances with other crime groups and corrupt officials.\n* Escobar was a fan of soccer and was known to have sponsored several Colombian soccer teams.\n* He was married to María Victoria Henao, with whom he had two children, Juan Pablo and Manuela.\n* Escobar\'s brother, Roberto Escobar, was also involved in the Medellín cartel and was known for his role in the cartel\'s financial operations.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 10:50:00', '2026-05-31 10:50:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-31 10:50:21', '2026-05-31 10:50:21'),
(3675, 'Auto Post for facebook at 10:53', 'Pablo Escobar (1949-1993) was a Colombian drug lord, smuggler, and leader of the Medellín cartel, one of the most powerful and notorious drug cartels in history. He is widely regarded as one of the most infamous and successful drug traffickers of all time.\n\n**Early Life and Rise to Power**\n\nPablo Escobar was born in Rionegro, Colombia, on December 1, 1949. He grew up in a poor family and was raised by his mother, Hermilda Gaviria, after his father abandoned the family. Escobar\'s early life was marked by poverty and violence, and he quickly turned to crime to support himself and his family.\n\nEscobar began his career in crime by selling stolen cars and later moved on to smuggling cigarettes and other contraband. In the 1970s, he became involved in the cocaine trade, which was rapidly expanding in Colombia at the time. He quickly rose through the ranks of the Medellín cartel, becoming a key player in the organization and eventually taking over as its leader.\n\n**The Medellín Cartel**\n\nUnder Escobar\'s leadership, the Medellín cartel became one of the most powerful and feared drug cartels in the world. The cartel\'s main business was smuggling cocaine into the United States, where it was sold to distributors and eventually to consumers. The cartel\'s operations were highly organized and sophisticated, with a network of smugglers, distributors, and money launderers.\n\nEscobar\'s success was due in part to his ability to bribe and intimidate officials, as well as his willingness to use violence to eliminate competitors and enemies. He was known for his ruthless tactics, including assassinations, bombings, and kidnappings.\n\n**The War on Drugs**\n\nIn the 1980s, the United States government launched a \"war on drugs\" aimed at reducing the flow of cocaine into the country. The effort was led by the Drug Enforcement Administration (DEA) and included cooperation with Colombian authorities.\n\nEscobar and the Medellín cartel were a primary target of the war on drugs. The Colombian government, with the support of the United States, launched a series of raids and operations aimed at capturing or killing Escobar and dismantling the cartel.\n\n**The Death of Pablo Escobar**\n\nOn December 1, 1993, Colombian police, with the support of the DEA, launched a final operation to capture or kill Escobar. The operation, known as \"Operation Peregrine,\" involved a team of Colombian police and American agents who had been tracking Escobar for months.\n\nEscobar was killed in a shootout with police on the rooftop of a safe house in Medellín. He was 44 years old at the time of his death.\n\n**Legacy**\n\nPablo Escobar\'s legacy is complex and multifaceted. He is remembered as a ruthless and cunning drug lord who was responsible for the deaths of thousands of people, including law enforcement officials, competitors, and innocent civilians.\n\nAt the same time, Escobar is also remembered as a charismatic and cunning leader who was able to build a vast and powerful organization from scratch. His story has been the subject of numerous books, films, and television shows, including the popular Netflix series \"Narcos.\"\n\n**Interesting Facts**\n\n* Escobar\'s net worth was estimated to be around $30 billion at the height of his power.\n* He was known for his extravagant lifestyle, which included a private zoo, a collection of luxury cars, and a network of safe houses and hideouts.\n* Escobar was a skilled politician and was able to build alliances with other cartels and organized crime groups.\n* He was also a skilled manipulator of the media, and was able to use his charm and charisma to influence public opinion and shape his public image.\n\nOverall, Pablo Escobar\'s life and legacy are a testament to the power and danger of the drug trade, as well as the complexities and challenges of combating organized crime.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 10:53:00', '2026-05-31 10:53:23', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/pablo_escobar?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 52, '2026-05-31 10:53:23', '2026-05-31 10:53:23'),
(3676, 'Auto Post for facebook at 11:18', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about resilience, passion, and perseverance. Here are some key takeaways that can help you ignite your inner fire:\n\n* **Set bold goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s soaring to new heights or conquering uncharted territories, remember that your aspirations are within reach.\n* **Stay adaptable**: Life is full of unexpected twists and turns. Learn to navigate through challenges and pivot when necessary, just like a dragon adjusts its flight path to ride the wind.\n* **Cultivate inner strength**: Develop a strong sense of self and tap into your inner reserves of courage and determination. This will help you overcome obstacles and stay focused on your objectives.\n* **Embrace your unique identity**: Celebrate what sets you apart and makes you unique. Just as a dragon\'s scales shimmer in the sunlight, your individuality is what makes you shine.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #FireWithin #Resilience #Passion #Perseverance #GoalSetting #Adaptability #InnerStrength #SelfDiscovery #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #BusinessMotivation #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 11:18:00', '2026-05-31 11:18:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 42, '2026-05-31 11:18:21', '2026-05-31 11:18:21'),
(3677, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:40', '**Party Wear for Men: Styling Tips and Outfit Ideas**\n\nWhen it comes to party wear for men, the goal is to look stylish, confident, and put-together. Here are some tips and outfit ideas to help you make a statement at your next party:\n\n**Essential Party Wear Items for Men:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirts:** A classic white or light-colored dress shirt is a versatile option that can be paired with a variety of pants and jackets.\n2. **Suit Jackets:** A well-fitted suit jacket can instantly elevate your party look. Consider a navy, black, or gray jacket that can be paired with dress pants or jeans.\n3. **Dress Pants:** Dark-washed dress pants are a staple in any man\'s wardrobe. Look for slim-fit or tailored pants that fit well and are comfortable.\n4. **Jeans:** Dark-washed jeans are a great alternative to dress pants and can be dressed up or down.\n5. **Shoes:** Dress shoes, such as oxfords or loafers, are a must-have for party wear. Consider a pair of black or brown shoes that can be paired with a variety of outfits.\n6. **Accessories:** Add a touch of personality to your outfit with accessories like a watch, cufflinks, or a pocket square.\n\n**Party Wear Outfit Ideas for Men:**\n\n1. **Classic Tuxedo:** A black tuxedo with a white dress shirt, black bow tie, and black dress shoes is a timeless and elegant option.\n2. **Suit and Tie:** A navy or gray suit with a white dress shirt and a patterned tie is a versatile and stylish option.\n3. **Dress Shirt and Jeans:** A dress shirt with dark-washed jeans and dress shoes is a great option for a more casual party.\n4. **Blazer and Dress Pants:** A navy or gray blazer with dress pants and a dress shirt is a stylish and sophisticated option.\n5. **Leather Jacket and Jeans:** A leather jacket with dark-washed jeans and a dress shirt is a great option for a more edgy party look.\n\n**Styling Tips:**\n\n1. **Fit is key:** Make sure your clothes fit well and are comfortable.\n2. **Pay attention to details:** Accessories like cufflinks, a watch, and a pocket square can add a touch of personality to your outfit.\n3. **Keep it simple:** Avoid over-accessorizing and keep your outfit simple and elegant.\n4. **Be confident:** Own your look and have fun with it!\n\n**Party Wear Trends for Men:**\n\n1. **Sustainable fashion:** Consider investing in sustainable and eco-friendly clothing options.\n2. **Bold colors:** Don\'t be afraid to experiment with bold colors and patterns.\n3. **Mix and match:** Mix and match different patterns and textures to create a unique and stylish outfit.\n4. **Grooming:** Pay attention to your grooming and make sure you look polished and put-together.\n\nBy following these tips and outfit ideas, you\'ll be sure to make a statement at your next party. Remember to have fun and express your personal style!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 12:40:00', '2026-05-31 12:40:28', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Party_Wear_for_Mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 38, '2026-05-31 12:40:28', '2026-05-31 12:40:28'),
(3678, 'Auto Post for facebook at 12:56', 'A formal shirt for men is a type of dress shirt that is designed to be worn for business, formal events, and special occasions. Here are some key features and styles of formal shirts for men:\n\n**Types of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Dress Shirt:** A classic dress shirt with a point collar, button cuffs, and a slim fit.\n2. **Wingtip Collar Shirt:** A shirt with a wingtip collar, often worn with a bow tie.\n3. **Cutaway Collar Shirt:** A shirt with a cutaway collar, often worn with a four-in-hand tie.\n4. **Mandarin Collar Shirt:** A shirt with a mandarin collar, often worn with a suit and tie.\n\n**Features of Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Collar Style:** Point collar, wingtip collar, cutaway collar, or mandarin collar.\n2. **Cuff Style:** Button cuffs, French cuffs, or barrel cuffs.\n3. **Sleeve Length:** Long sleeves or short sleeves.\n4. **Fabric:** Cotton, linen, or silk.\n5. **Fit:** Slim fit, regular fit, or relaxed fit.\n6. **Buttons:** Mother-of-pearl buttons or plastic buttons.\n7. **Pockets:** No pockets or a single breast pocket.\n\n**Popular Fabrics for Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Cotton:** A classic choice for formal shirts, cotton is breathable and durable.\n2. **Linen:** A natural fiber that is perfect for warm weather, linen is lightweight and breathable.\n3. **Silk:** A luxurious fabric that is often used for high-end formal shirts, silk is smooth and lustrous.\n\n**Tips for Choosing a Formal Shirt:**\n\n1. **Consider the occasion:** Choose a shirt that is suitable for the occasion, such as a wedding or a job interview.\n2. **Think about the color:** White, light blue, and pastel colors are classic choices for formal shirts.\n3. **Pay attention to fit:** Make sure the shirt fits well and is not too tight or too loose.\n4. **Accessories:** Consider the type of tie, cufflinks, and watch you will wear with the shirt.\n\n**Some Popular Brands for Formal Shirts:**\n\n1. **Thomas Pink:** A British brand known for its high-quality dress shirts.\n2. **Charvet:** A French brand that offers luxurious and elegant formal shirts.\n3. **Brooks Brothers:** An American brand that is famous for its classic dress shirts.\n4. **Armani:** An Italian brand that offers stylish and sophisticated formal shirts.\n\nI hope this helps you find the perfect formal shirt for your needs!', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 12:56:00', '2026-05-31 12:56:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Formal_shirt_for_mens?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 39, '2026-05-31 12:56:20', '2026-05-31 12:56:20'),
(3679, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:03', '**Embracing Our Inner Strength: Lessons from the Dragon**\n\nAs we navigate the complexities of our personal and professional lives, it\'s essential to draw inspiration from majestic creatures like the dragon. Here are a few key takeaways:\n\n* **Resilience**: Dragons are known for their ability to thrive in challenging environments, reminding us to stay strong and adapt to adversity.\n* **Courage**: With their fearless attitude, dragons inspire us to face our fears and push beyond our comfort zones.\n* **Loyalty**: Dragons are often depicted as loyal companions, teaching us the value of commitment and dedication to our loved ones and passions.\n* **Growth**: As dragons evolve and grow, they shed their skin, symbolizing the importance of transformation and self-improvement.\n\nLet\'s embody these qualities and unleash our inner strength! \n\n#DragonInspiration #InnerStrength #Resilience #Courage #Loyalty #GrowthMindset #Motivation #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #TrendingNow #FacebookMotivation #InspirationalQuotes #MajesticCreatures #LessonsFromNature', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 13:03:00', '2026-05-31 13:03:17', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Women_Sandel?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 3, '2026-05-31 13:03:17', '2026-05-31 13:03:17'),
