(3681, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:00', '**Empowering Your Day with Dragon\'s Wisdom**\n\nAs a symbol of strength and resilience, we\'d like to share some relatable points to help you tackle your day:\n\n* Believe in yourself, just as a dragon believes in its fire-breathing abilities\n* Set goals and chase them with passion, just as a dragon guards its treasure\n* Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things, just as a dragon explores new skies\n* Surround yourself with positive influences, just as a dragon is often accompanied by loyal companions\n* Remember that rest and self-care are essential, just as a dragon needs to rest in its cave to recharge\n\n#DragonMotivation #PositiveVibesOnly #EmpowermentThroughMythology #TrendingNow #MotivationMonday #FacebookInspiration #DragonSquad #ResilienceMatters #BelieveInYourself', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 14:00:00', '2026-05-31 14:00:24', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 51, '2026-05-31 14:00:24', '2026-05-31 14:00:24'),
(3682, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:37', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned a thing or two about perseverance, passion, and staying true to oneself. Here are some key takeaways:\n\n* **Believe in your inner strength**: Just like my fiery breath, you have the power to overcome any obstacle.\n* **Never stop learning**: Continuously update your skills and knowledge to stay ahead of the curve.\n* **Be fearless**: Don\'t be afraid to take risks and try new things – it\'s often the best way to grow.\n* **Stay true to yourself**: Authenticity is key to building strong relationships and achieving success.\n* **Protect your passions**: Just as I guard my treasure, prioritize and nurture your passions to keep them alive.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #FireUpYourPassion #BelieveInYourself #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #ProfessionalGrowth #LessonsFromADragon #InnerStrength #FearlessLeadership #AuthenticityMatters #PassionProtection', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 14:37:00', '2026-05-31 14:37:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-31 14:37:20', '2026-05-31 14:37:20'),
(3683, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:38', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a symbol of strength, courage, and resilience, the dragon represents the untamed power that lies within us all. Here are a few key takeaways from the dragon\'s journey:\n\n* **Perseverance is key**: Just like the dragon\'s ability to withstand intense heat and flames, we too can learn to navigate life\'s challenges with determination and grit.\n* **Protection and guardianship**: The dragon\'s instinct to safeguard its treasure and loved ones teaches us the importance of prioritizing what truly matters in our lives.\n* **Transformation and growth**: As the dragon sheds its skin and emerges anew, we can learn to embrace change and evolve into the best version of ourselves.\n\nJoin the conversation and share your thoughts on what it means to embody the spirit of the dragon!\n\n#DragonEnergy #MotivationMonday #PersonalGrowth #MentalToughness #Resilience #Courage #Determination #TrendingNow #FacebookInspiration #MondayMotivation #EmpowermentThroughStorytelling', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 14:38:00', '2026-05-31 14:38:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-31 14:38:19', '2026-05-31 14:38:19'),
(3684, 'Auto Post for facebook at 14:39', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Key Takeaways for Success**\n\nAs a dragon in the business world, I\'ve learned a thing or two about what it takes to thrive. Here are some relatable points to consider:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and strive for excellence.\n* **Stay adaptable**: Be prepared to pivot when circumstances change, just like a dragon navigating through treacherous terrain.\n* **Develop a strong sense of self**: Know your strengths and weaknesses, and use them to your advantage.\n* **Build a supportive network**: Surround yourself with people who believe in you and your abilities.\n* **Keep learning**: Continuously update your skills and knowledge to stay ahead of the curve.\n\n#DragonSlayingTips #BusinessSuccess #MotivationMonday #ProfessionalGrowth #TrendingNow #FacebookBusiness #EntrepreneurMindset #LeadershipGoals #Inspiration', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 14:39:00', '2026-05-31 14:39:18', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/Pikachu_with_multiple_pokemon?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 9, '2026-05-31 14:39:18', '2026-05-31 14:39:18'),
(3685, 'Auto Post for facebook at 15:10', '**Embracing the Fire Within: Lessons from a Dragon\'s Perspective**\n\nAs a dragon, I\'ve learned valuable lessons that can be applied to our personal and professional lives. Here are a few key takeaways:\n\n* **Resilience is key**: Just like how I can withstand intense heat and flames, we too can develop the strength to overcome obstacles and challenges.\n* **Adaptability is crucial**: As a dragon, I\'ve had to adapt to changing environments and situations, and this ability to pivot has helped me thrive.\n* **Passion drives success**: My fiery passion for what I do is what sets me apart, and it\'s essential to find what drives you to achieve greatness.\n* **Loyalty and protection**: As a dragon, I fiercely protect and defend what\'s mine, and this sense of loyalty and responsibility can be applied to our relationships and work.\n\n#DragonInspiration #MotivationMonday #Resilience #Adaptability #Passion #Loyalty #Protection #Trending #BusinessLessons #PersonalGrowth #ProfessionalDevelopment #Facebook #DragonSays #FireWithin #LessonsFromADragon', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 15:10:00', '2026-05-31 15:10:21', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 24, '2026-05-31 15:10:21', '2026-05-31 15:10:21'),
