(3695, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:30', 'Iron Man is a iconic superhero from the Marvel Comics universe. Created by Stan Lee, Larry Lieber, and Don Heck, Iron Man first appeared in comic book form in 1963.\n\n**The Character:**\nIron Man, also known as Tony Stark, is a billionaire inventor, industrialist, and philanthropist. After being kidnapped and forced to build a powerful suit of armor, Tony Stark used his intelligence and resources to create a advanced suit that allows him to fly, shoot energy beams, and has superhuman strength.\n\n**The Suits:**\nOver the years, Tony Stark has created numerous versions of the Iron Man suit, each with its own unique features and upgrades. Some notable suits include:\n\n1. Mark I: The first Iron Man suit, built by Tony Stark while he was being held captive.\n2. Mark III: A more advanced suit with repulsor technology and flight capabilities.\n3. Mark VII: A suit with a more streamlined design and advanced AI capabilities.\n4. Mark XLV: A suit with advanced propulsion systems and a more agile design.\n5. Mark LXXXV: A suit with advanced nanotechnology and a more powerful propulsion system.\n\n**The Movies:**\nIron Man has been featured in numerous movies, including:\n\n1. Iron Man (2008) - The first movie in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), starring Robert Downey Jr. as Tony Stark/Iron Man.\n2. Iron Man 2 (2010) - The sequel to the first movie, with Tony Stark facing new challenges and villains.\n3. The Avengers (2012) - A team-up movie featuring Iron Man, Captain America, Thor, and other Marvel heroes.\n4. Iron Man 3 (2013) - A movie that explores Tony Stark\'s personal struggles and his battle against the Mandarin.\n5. Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015) - A team-up movie that features Iron Man and the Avengers facing a powerful artificial intelligence threat.\n6. Captain America: Civil War (2016) - A movie that features Iron Man and Captain America on opposite sides of a conflict over government regulation of superheroes.\n7. Spider-Man: Homecoming (2017) - A movie that features Iron Man as a mentor to Spider-Man.\n8. Avengers: Infinity War (2018) - A team-up movie that features Iron Man and the Avengers facing a powerful threat from Thanos.\n9. Avengers: Endgame (2019) - A movie that concludes the Infinity Saga and features Iron Man\'s final appearance in the MCU.\n\n**Legacy:**\nIron Man has become an iconic character in popular culture, inspiring numerous adaptations, spin-offs, and merchandise. The character\'s legacy continues to be felt in the MCU, with Tony Stark\'s technology and legacy playing a significant role in the Marvel universe.\n\nWhat would you like to know more about Iron Man? The comics, the movies, or something else?', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 17:30:00', '2026-05-31 17:30:20', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/iron_man?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 55, '2026-05-31 17:30:20', '2026-05-31 17:30:20'),
(3696, 'Auto Post for facebook at 17:45', 'The image is set in a large, dimly lit basketball stadium, with rows of empty seats stretching up into the darkness. The only sound is the soft echo of footsteps on the polished wooden floor. The businessman, dressed in a tailored suit, stands confidently on the court, the ball held firmly in his hand. \n\nThe stadium lights cast a dramatic glow over the scene, with deep shadows accentuating the lines and contours of the businessman\'s face. His eyes gleam with a fierce determination, a sense of unyielding ambition that seems to drive him forward. His jaw is set, his lips pressed together in a resolute line.\n\nAs he stands there, the ball seems to be an extension of himself, a symbol of his unwavering focus and unrelenting drive. His suit is immaculately tailored, the fabric seeming to shimmer and glow in the light. The tie is perfectly knotted, the shirt starched and crisp. Every detail of his attire speaks to a sense of precision and control.\n\nThe background of the image is a blur of color and light, the stadium seats and walls fading into a soft, indistinct haze. The only thing that\'s truly in focus is the businessman, standing tall and proud, the ball held aloft like a trophy. The overall effect is one of intense drama and cinematic flair, as if the scene has been plucked straight from a high-stakes movie or television show.\n\nThe high-resolution cinematic style of the image adds to the sense of realism and immediacy, drawing the viewer in and refusing to let go. Every detail, from the texture of the ball to the weave of the suit, seems to leap out of the screen, creating a sense of depth and dimensionality that\'s almost palpable.\n\nAs the eye moves around the image, it becomes clear that this is a man who is used to getting what he wants. He exudes an aura of confidence and self-assurance, a sense of being utterly in control. The ball, the court, the stadium itself – all seem to be mere accessories to his larger-than-life personality.\n\nAnd yet, despite the sense of swagger and bravado, there\'s something undeniably compelling about the image. A sense of vulnerability, perhaps, or a glimmer of uncertainty lurking just beneath the surface. It\'s as if the businessman is daring himself to take the next step, to push beyond the boundaries of what\'s possible and see just how far he can go.\n\nThe overall effect is one of mesmerizing intensity, a sense of being drawn into a world of high-stakes drama and unrelenting ambition. The image seems to pulse with energy, as if it\'s alive, breathing, and waiting to see what happens next.', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-05-31 17:45:00', '2026-05-31 17:45:22', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/%E2%80%9CPlan_your_business_like_a_play_%E2%80%94_strategy_first%2C_execution_next.%E2%80%9D?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 27, '2026-05-31 17:45:22', '2026-05-31 17:45:22'),
