(3713, 'Auto Post for facebook at 13:55', '**\"Breathing Fire into Your Business: Lessons from a Dragon\"**\n\nAs a mythical creature, I\'ve learned a thing or two about success and perseverance. Here are some key takeaways to help you grow your business:\n\n* **Set ambitious goals**: Don\'t be afraid to dream big and aim high. Whether it\'s expanding your customer base or launching a new product, set your sights on the stars.\n* **Be fiercely loyal**: Protect and nurture your team, just as I would my treasure hoard. A strong, supportive team is the key to achieving greatness.\n* **Innovate and adapt**: Stay ahead of the curve by embracing new technologies and trends. Just as I\'ve evolved over time, your business must also be willing to change and adapt.\n* **Guard your reputation**: Your brand is your treasure, and it\'s up to you to protect it. Focus on building trust and credibility with your customers and partners.\n\n#TrendingNow #BusinessTips #Entrepreneurship #DragonInspiration #SuccessStories #FacebookForBusiness #MarketingMastery #BrandBuilding #InnovationNation #LeadershipLessons', '[\"facebook\"]', 'published', 1, NULL, '2026-06-01 13:55:00', '2026-06-01 13:55:19', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/A_highly_detailed_fantasy_dragon_flying_over_a_medieval_castle_during_sunset_with_cinematic_lighting_and_dramatic_clouds?width=1024&height=1024&nologo=true', NULL, 'pending', 4, '2026-06-01 13:55:19', '2026-06-01 13:55:19'),
